  <name> BC Hydro - Lillooet Seton Dam Campground</name>
  <desc>Seton Lake Camping run by BC Hydro Camping. Amazing free campground with clean toilet. There is a fire pit and a camping table. There are several spots for big RVs and all other camping vehicels. It is near a beautiful lake. Still open as of 16-09. Easy access for all vehicles and for every wether.  On the edge of cell with 1 bar, nice large open area for large rigs &amp; sun lovers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 17:07:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1048 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
