  <desc>Cute sleeping place right on the river. Has some black flies and near road, but hardly any traffic. Beautiful sunset, relaxing water rapids sounds makes you feel alone..&#xA;Phone service not so good, but ok. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
