  <name>Marten River - OK</name>
  <desc>Sleeping place a bit off the road in the bush. Had hell of a lot of mosquitoes, otherwise ok as an alternative to the super expensive Provincial Park Camping ($ 38!). Only few 100m from here is the car park to splash down to the canoe in the Wickstead Lake or Marten River Lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
