  <name>Saskatoon - OK</name>
  <desc>Roosting site at a viewing point near right off the highway Saskatoon West. Was surprisingly quiet at night as there is little traffic. 1 train but woke 1x us., Has no sweepings, not very clean, but more than OK to stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1106 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
