 <wpt lat="49.684240" lon="-54.806650">
  <ele>8.4</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sleepy Cove RV &amp; Tenting Park (Abandoned)</name>
  <desc>Appears to be an abandoned campground. Sign at entrance to access lane says “Sleepy Cove”.  Entrance just minutes from Long point lighthouse parking lot. &#xA;&#xA;Beautiful views and hiking trails. &#xA;&#xA;The nearby Crow&#39;s Nest Cafe is also really great! Super friendly people, great food/treats &amp; coffee! The owner has a lot of knowledge of the area and seems to enjoy giving out tips of where to go and what to do if you need it. 10/10 would recommend this spot and spending some time wandering about on the cliffs.&#xA;&#xA;Great cell reception too. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1115 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
