  <desc>Extremely nice lodge with open field for RV&#39;s and tents.  Full hookups, hot showers, no wifi, a bit pricey at $23.  Was essential a man camp for highway work crew while we were there.  Price: 23&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
