  <name>Beaumont Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;Typical campground set on a lake.  Half the campground was already closed for the season.  dump station. Standard bathrooms, no showers, $22 for tent and RV sites.  Canada takes extreme pride in their park system, they are always spotless!  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/1145 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
