  <ele>681.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Buckhorn Lake Forest Rec Site</name>
  <desc>A BC Forest Recreation Site on the shore of Buckhorn Lake. Multiple campsites (about 5, all of which are free), but no services. Easy access with any vehicle and a pretty spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3373 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
