 <wpt lat="53.123860" lon="-119.837560">
  <ele>821.2</ele>
  <time>2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dunster General Store</name>
  <desc>The Dunster General Store, a fabulous little store that has been running for nearly a century is quietly tucked away on the Dunster Station Rd. It is an operating general store and has various essentials. Across the street is the now restored Dunster Train Station. Driving there is easy off of Hwy 16 or the more adventurous can come from the Old Tete Jaune Cache Rd accessed just a little ways off of Hwy 5.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3396 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
