 <wpt lat="53.746960" lon="-122.279330">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Opatcho Lake Forest Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>A small forest recreation site with six campsites, an outhouse and a gravel boat launch for small boats. It is a stocked lake with excellent fishing. I&#39;ve made it in there with a 17 foot trailer, but it was tight. Big RVs and trailers will not be able to make the turns to get in or be able to turn around to get back out. Trucks with campers, cars, vans, etc. will have no problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
