  <ele>628.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside Campground/Sanidump</name>
  <desc>Open May through September, this a nicely cared for municipal campground. &#xA;&#xA;Of note for the passing-through traveler:  the sanidump - $2 to use (honour system to put payment in the metal mailbox on the dump). I&#39;ve never actually stayed in the campground, but it looks lovely.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3424 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
