 <wpt lat="53.726120" lon="-121.143160">
  <ele>730.5</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 15:46:11 UTC</time>
  <name>Hwy 16 Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>This is is a well maintained rest stop across from the YRB maintenance yard (YRB is the contractor who maintains HWY 16 throughout this area). It is open year round with heated flush toilets. The signs say that the water is not potable, but there is a large creek next to the stop. This location also has a large paved pull through parking section that is designed to accommodate multiple big rigs - plenty of space for the largest RV. There is also a small playground for kids.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 15:46:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
