  <ele>790.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Purden Lake (Provincial Campground)</name>
  <desc>Open May to mid September this is a great provincial campground. Reservations can be made through www.discovercamping.ca.It is big RV and trailer friendly and has a sani-dump. The beach and playground areas are very nice. The GPS coordinates are for the entrance off of Hwy 16 - the actual campground is located on the north side of Purden Lake just a little ways in.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3445 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
