  <ele>689.0226862961426</ele>
  <time>2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paarens Beach Provincial Campground</name>
  <desc>Open May to the end of August, this campground has multiple campsites all set right next to a fabulous beach. Reservations can be made through the BC Parks website. Highly recommend this location in late July or early August.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3460 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
