 <wpt lat="53.922840" lon="-122.732390">
  <ele>593.3917934303521</ele>
  <time>2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood Park</name>
  <desc>This is a really nice park with multiple parking areas and a boat launch. No amenities to speak of, but it is adjacent to the Railway Museum which is worth checking out. The park is on the banks of where the Nechako and Fraser Rivers meet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3523 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
