 <wpt lat="53.728860" lon="-122.315340">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-03-23 15:11:49 UTC</time>
  <name>Ste Marie East Forest Rec Site</name>
  <desc>This BC Forest Recreation Site is better forested (and therefore not as big rig friendly as its counterpart on Ste. Marie West due to the tighter turns). It has better privacy though and is very picturesque. As with all BC Forest Rec sites, no amenities except out houses, but they are free which is awesome.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-23 15:11:49 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3525 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
