 <wpt lat="54.516000" lon="-122.732660">
  <ele>691.77880859375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Davie Lake South </name>
  <desc>This site is enjoyed by many recreational enthusiasts and the local community for swimming, camping and fishing. It is situated in close proximity to the Bear Lake Community which provides an ideal location for the family to enjoy. This site has 12 campsites in an open environment. The site is easily accessible by 2 wheel drive vehicles and offers the basic amenities of tables, fire rings and 2 pit toilets.&#xA;&#xA;The site is 3.3 km off the highway on Davie Lake Rd.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3546 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
