 <wpt lat="54.505930" lon="-122.823800">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fisher Lake</name>
  <desc>This site is nestled along the lake, just off the main road and offers camping and access to the lake. The site is easily accessible by 2 wheel drive vehicles and has a gravel boat launch. As with all BC Forest Recreation Sites, free, but only outhouses as amenities. Bring a saw or a chain saw for firewood.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3547 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
