 <wpt lat="52.388090" lon="-114.939570">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside </name>
  <desc>Moderator Note: Please see more recent review stating that this might not be a good place to park for the night.&#xA;.....&#xA;Depending on river level, you can pull off Hwy 11A here and take the path down to the river to setup camp. As much free firewood as you want (No driftwood - don&#39;t take or burn driftwood, never! please! it&#39;s really bad for the river ecosystem).  I wasn&#39;t bothered by anyone (other than curious people checking out my roof top tent) for three days here.  2 minute drive into town for supplies if needed.  Nice view and right on the river. A bit of noise from the town being right beside the river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/3906 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
