 <wpt lat="52.744312" lon="-119.102147">
  <ele>758.652587890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shore Of Kinbasket Lake (near northern tip)</name>
  <desc>Very pretty spot on the shore of the lake. Big rig to tent friendly as it looks like it is an abandoned mill site (only the foundations left). Creek next to the site for easy water, though do boil water during the spring run off to be safe. Great views of Canoe Mountain.&#xA;&#xA;if you don&#39;t like the noise of generators, or ATV&#39;s, then don&#39;t come here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/5415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
