 <wpt lat="44.250010" lon="-66.393300">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brier Island, Nova Scotia</name>
  <desc>There does not appear to be an official camp site on the delightful Brier Island at the tip of Digby Neck, however the lighthouse at the western end of the island has lots of parking and is remote.&#xA;&#xA;Do not park too near the lighthouse as the fog horn can sound all night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/5841 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
