  <name>Walmart Grand Falls</name>
  <desc>Walmart overnight parking, toilets, free wifi, close to the Grand Falls&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/7942 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
