 <wpt lat="48.773025" lon="-123.896616">
  <ele>101.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cowichan River</name>
  <desc>Very nice campground in the privincial park. table, seats and fireplace at each place. you can buy wood when the park rangers are coming to collect the 18 cad. toilets available and drinking water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8042 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
