 <wpt lat="48.882862" lon="-124.362861">
  <ele>174.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Caycuse Campsite.</name>
  <desc>Ex-Forest Service site, now administered by forest company Mosaic Forest Management. Sites $24 except &#34;premium&#34; (waterfront) sites $28. Quiet family-oriented, no facilities except clean pit toilets, picnic tables. Host on site during open season approx April - October. Good swimming, fishing, small-boating. 11 km good gravel forest road suitable for all vehicles. About 24 - 26&#39; max RV size can be accommodated.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
