 <wpt lat="45.692100" lon="-64.707130">
  <ele>5.3</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 09:52:50 UTC</time>
  <name>The Shire </name>
  <desc>Informal camping set up next to the Bay of Fundy. Run by owner Don and his dog Sally.&#xA;&#xA;Just park up anywhere on Bay of Fundy side - Don is at the house over the road - definitely go and say hi, he&#39;s a great guy. has set this place up in his retirement and just loves seeing all the travellers come through.&#xA;&#xA;He has access to fresh water, there&#39;s a fire pit, portaloo, pizza oven and lots of tables to sit round. Fire wood sold opposite the road. Good mobile reception.&#xA;&#xA;Donations accepted.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 09:52:50 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8056 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
