 <wpt lat="45.648862" lon="-60.864939">
  <ele>47.25091552734375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Battery Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Basic campground with varying levels of privacy for spaces. Water near spaces. Hot showers. Flush and pit toilets. Nice trails. Great views of the bay. Price around $26ca. Space 25 is the highest spot in camp! Wifi at registration office.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8057 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
