 <wpt lat="43.086246" lon="-79.081264">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot - Niagara Falls</name>
  <desc>Very large parking lot in the center of Niagara Falls. Just some minutes per feet to the falls. Very quiet during the night. With 20 CAD/24 hours might be the cheapest option. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8059 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
