  <ele>230.2</ele>
  <time>2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Supercenter</name>
  <desc>Very friendly staff when we asked if it is ok to stay. Very quiet and zero dollars. Great and very fast WiFi if you are parking a little bit closer to the building - we used to work on our blog. Great place!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8062 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
