  <ele>13.407135009765625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Broad Cove Campground</name>
  <desc>$25ca space without fire ring, $27ca with. More for hookups. Walk to the beach where stream meets sea.  May get crowded in high season, but some sites have privacy with trees. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8082 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
