 <wpt lat="46.501696" lon="-63.407322">
  <ele>12.246246337890625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 18:37:46 UTC</time>
  <name>Cavendish Campground Prince Edward Island National Park</name>
  <desc>This is a basic, national park campground with the Canadian touch. Newly remodeled restrooms. Nice playgrounds. Huge fire rings at some sites. Various levels of service from full hook ups to no hook ups. We paid $27ca for no hook ups, beachfront, ocean breezes=fewer mosquitoes.  Some sites are trees and private, some are wide open. Nearby town offers groceries, gas, Anne of Green Gables and more. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 18:37:46 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
