 <wpt lat="49.801600" lon="-114.148570">
  <ele>1262.1171875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Maycroft near Pincher Creek Alberta</name>
  <desc>Southern Alberta. 12 spots in Provincial campground located on the side of the river next to the bridge. Good fly fishing and very clean. Rolling hill landscape with view of mountains. Name is Maycroft PRA. Located at intersection of Hw 22 and twp road 10-1A. $16.00 per night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8159 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
