 <wpt lat="46.896931" lon="-71.178449">
  <ele>130.51536560058594</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Municipal de Beauport</name>
  <desc>Overnight parking at the entrance for 25$ taxes included.&#xA;&#xA;Huge campground with small sites. Hot showers, fresh water, WiFi only at the reception available, laundry, dryer, pool, restaurant. Electricity would cost extra. $39 CAD, full serviced sites $49 CAD.&#xA;There is a dumping station in the camping site.&#xA;Washer and dryers 1$ each, but even works without coins. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8173 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
