 <wpt lat="55.333132" lon="-119.559089">
  <ele>750.7830810546875</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hythe Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>$15 (updated) tent $20 electric ??? Free showers. Drinking water. Fire rings. Picnic tables. Some shade. No privacy. Right on the road for easy on/off. Restrooms are in a restored train car. We loved it because there was only one other person.  I doubt it fills, but if it were it would not be so nice.   Close to mini mart, gas station, restaurants. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8815 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
