  <name>Tahini Hot Springs Campground And Springs </name>
  <desc>Hostel and campground and hot springs. Paid $20 for tent site with 20% discount at pools. Campground charges a fee for showers so shower after the soak. Nice place. Good sites. Clean hostel. Pools were terrific. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
