  <ele>1373.1</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Saskatchewan Crossing</name>
  <desc>Found an amazing  place just off the Icefield Parkway and 15min from Saskatchewan Crossing and Banff NP overlooking Cline River and beautiful mountain ridge. It&#39;s a user-maintained recreation site only accessible by driving down bumpy dirt road. 4x4 recommended.&#xA;Camping permit required, 14 days limit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/8998 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
