  <name>Little Slocan Lake</name>
  <desc>Beautiful Free campground on the little Slocan lake. Close to Valhalla trails. Went up with our Mercedes Vario 4x4, camper under an Apple tree.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 10:24:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9000 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
