  <ele>58.6</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sproat lake-OK</name>
  <desc>Nice boondocking site next to the River. Instead of going all the way to the campsite we decided to stop earlier and just camped next to the gravelroad, in a pull out (with traces of former campers). from the other Side of the River you can still hear the mainroad but it is quiet enough.&#xA;TIP: If you like free wifi and toilets, drive to the Taylor River Rest Area 2 minutes away ;)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9003 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
