  <ele>872.18408203125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Midnight Dome </name>
  <desc>*Respect no camping signs.&#xA;&#xA;100m before Midnight Dome viewpoint, on the right-hand side there are two pull-outs. Both have fireplaces with stones around it. Very quiet at night, busy in the evening because it is a lookout over Yukon and Klondike River, with some nice northern lights. Beautiful spot, no one cared. At the viewpoint, there is a sign that says short-term parking only and &#34;no camping allowed&#34; so please respect it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9007 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
