  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nakusp Boondock</name>
  <desc>This is just up a forest road from Nakusp Hot Springs. Why pay those camping prices?  The road is passable with a bit of clearance. We got here in a VW. The turn off from pavement has wide turn and signs. The right turn to here has two medium sized rocks on each side. Flat  parking. Fire ring. Forest sounds. Waterfall in distance. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/9172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
