  <desc>Big RV Park (and tents) in North Vancouver. 10 minutes bus ride to downtown.&#xA;&#xA;Prices in 2022:&#xA;Full hook-up: 77 CAD (30 Amp) / 67 CAD (15 Amp)&#xA;Unserviced: 54 CAD&#xA;&#xA;Dump station for all vehicles available. Propane available &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-02 20:59:23 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/14325 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
