  <ele>23.964599609375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tynehead RV Camp, Surrey</name>
  <desc>We were here a Friday night during a long weekend in high season, the camping was full but still quiet. Welcoming staff. Washrooms were nice and very very clean, but other amenities were very simple. We paid 47,25$CAD for 3 persons (you can pay by card). Free bathrooms with paper and water taps but hot showers were 1$CAD for 10mn. A bit expensive for what it is, but still ok place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/14326 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
