  <desc>There are two separate camping areas here: a big gravel lot close to the street and a loop with several spots a little bit further in the forest. &#xA;$17/night with a 14 night maximum&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/14328 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
