  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Honeymoon Campground</name>
  <desc>Very beautiful campground, can be crowded at times. Great place to take photos. Extremely cold in late season if you are tenting. The amenities include pit toilet, drinking water, wood stove community shack and food lockers. $15.70 per night another $8.80 for a fire permit. Not suitable for large RV&#39;s, sign shows 25&#39; length limit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/14333 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
