 <wpt lat="62.231190" lon="-133.354800">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>John Connolly Campground and RV Park</name>
  <desc>Faro is a very friendly town.  The RV Park / Municipal Campground is situated near the centre of the town and offers washrooms, showers and laundry facilities.&#xA;&#xA;Check-in is at the Interpretive Centre across the road. The campsites have full hook-ups, fire pits and free firewood. Showers are available and included with a stay. A coin-op laundry is on site, and an RV dump station is available. Wifi is provided across the road at the Interpretive Centre.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/16102 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
