  <name>Klein Lake Camping</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet campground. 23 sites in the forest around Klein Lake. Close to the ferry and the amazing Skookumchuk Rapids. Only pit toilets. The camphost comes to your site to collect the fee. CAD 12,- per family. (I Paid 15$ sept) 2018&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/16809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
