  <name>Gun Creek CG</name>
  <desc>This is a site run by BC Hydro; you’ll find them all over BC it’s totally free. Nice level land, classic picnic tables. Swimming depends on the water levels and how swiftly it’s moving.&#xA;&#xA;Walk to nearby reservoir and views of mountains. Nice outhouses and garbage service May 1 - Oct 31. Lots of bears around so practice good food storage safety.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/16810 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
