  <desc>Pretty campground on the river, next to a bridge. $25 dollars per vehicle. The new owner Pat has been restoring this camping area over the past years. The showers and toilets are very clean. Very good hot shower.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/16811 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
