  <ele>42.56011962890625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Perfect Spot at Old Cedar Trail</name>
  <desc>Its a wonderful spot just at the end of Old Cedar trail. You can park your truck 2 meters from 400 year old cedar trees. Kennedy river is just 10 meters away.  If you drive towards Tofino then the small forest road turns off to your right in about 200 meters after pullout for the Old Cedar trail. That small road leads to the opening just next to the river&#xA;&#xA;NOTE Recent report - &#34;this site is near Giant Cedar trail. it&#39;s a great spot. the entrance road is narrow and rough dirt, and it has very limited turn around. only room for 1, 2 if you are friends. we are 20ft long and would not recommend for longer&#34;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/17044 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
