  <desc>21,- dollar for a tent/car. They also have good cabins. Very clean place. Good showers (dollar) and toilets. The owner is very friendly and helpful. Internet is to be renewed shortly. &#xA;&#xA;Price for a tent site: $31cad, showers extra for $2/minutes (but I may have misunderstood the price), no wifi access, no network, toilets with accessible tap, possibility of eating on place only for cabins and moter or bicycle, quite expensive but very very good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 18:46:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/17057 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
