  <ele>715.051513671875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Tutshi Boatramp</name>
  <desc>Lake Tutshi Boatramp with wide turnaround. One big spot under trees with table and firering. Three or four possible spots at the beach for tents or cars. Great view and it&#39;s free, there is no sign that camping or over night parking is not allowed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/17971 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
