  <time>2024-07-25 12:44:36 UTC</time>
  <name>Quebec Cycle-way</name>
  <desc>200 m to the west of the marina. 5 km from the Citadel. Angle cote Gilmour and bd Champlin. Picnic area, tables, drinking water fountain. Noise from the road. &#xA;&#xA;A 200 m a l&#39;ouest de la marina. 5 km de la Citadelle. Angle cote Gilmour et bd Champlin. Aire de pique nique, tables, fontaine a eau potable. Bruit de la route. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 12:44:36 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/17986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
