  <name>Liard River</name>
  <desc>Riverside spot with a fire pit and firewood. if the spot beside this one is busy then come on further up the river. beautiful! This is a bigger place on the Liard River it can fit up to four rigs. The first place was occupied so we came here. There was plenty of firewood and a pit toilet (open air) on the right side as you enter. Lots of wild strawberries.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/18201 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
