 <wpt lat="52.297052" lon="-122.050181">
  <ele>930.0706547032551</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest Lake</name>
  <desc>Great little free spot, only a handful of spots. Beautiful little fishing lake. This is a fisherman and hunters paradise and it is very busy during hunting season! We came midweek and lucked out to find a spot since we arrived early in the day. But the other 10 campers that showed up after us turned around since&#xA;There were no spots. Lots of bears in the area, it’s extremely important to be prepared and also bear conscious with regards to food.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/18610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
