  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 07:03:06 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverview Campsite</name>
  <desc>Established campground although overnight parking is possible at boat launch area. Public showers with hot water. Right along the Trans-Canada Highway, easy access to town. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 07:03:06 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/18680 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
