 <wpt lat="47.058090" lon="-84.762100">
  <ele>193.91375379475988</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pancake Bay - Lake Superior </name>
  <desc>A hidden place next to the street with 4 or 5 options to find a nice view directly to Lake Superior. The street you can hear a little bit. Despite we had a rainy day we had enjoyed the view and a great lazy day at this place. If the weather is well, you can go swimming in the lake. Few great spots to go fishing too. There is a loop at the end of the road for turning around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/18862 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
