  <ele>144.20193672180176</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Qualicum Falls Campground </name>
  <desc>Very nice campground in a thick redwood grove with a stunning waterfall. Sites are well-staffed and maintained. Some sites are first-come first-serve basis. Lots of nice hiking trails from campground. Water available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/18965 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
