 <wpt lat="52.392489" lon="-126.556257">
  <ele>50.621721542864464</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rip Rap Campground</name>
  <desc>A delightful and luxurious campground in the Bella Coola Valley. Prices posted in pics. Nice and sheltered tent sites in the back and full service sites up front. Friendly owners. Well maintained. Great bathrooms, showers, laundry, freezer for fish if youbcatch any and other thoughtful touches. Firewood available. Good wifi too. 5 minute walk to health food store and 2 minute walk to grocery store. If you need some amenities, this is the place to stay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19071 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
