 <wpt lat="47.165220" lon="-84.692840">
  <ele>205.36119079589844</ele>
  <time>2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alona Bay - (Lake Superior)</name>
  <desc>Small flat place in the wood above the lake at Alona bay. Take the paved road near the senic outlook to Alona bay, there is space for bigger RVs or drive some meters down a dirt road to a small flat pace, good for one car, maybe 4WD good to drive  down to the place. Steep path down to the pebbled beach and great view over the lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19335 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
