  <ele>43.4246940612793</ele>
  <time>2023-10-26 07:34:08 UTC</time>
  <name>Montebello Camping Municipal</name>
  <desc>Campground like a big parkinglot at the lake. Don&#39;t know the prices, because as we asked for dry camping, they showed us a big parking lot (grassy area) oppsite the camping. This does not belong to the camping, we could stay there for free, but were allowed to use the clean restrooms of the camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-26 07:34:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19336 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
