  <ele>124.27992248535156</ele>
  <time>2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Municipal St Fabien</name>
  <desc>Camping Municipal St. Fabien on Hwy 132. 35CAD/night, dry camping, showers included. Laundry: 1CAD per load! Grassy places with tables and fire rings, one shelter for tent campers. All clean and nice, not crowded, some places are near to the street. Complete kitchen in the meeting room, also a washing machine and dryer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19337 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
