  <ele>393.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Klondike River</name>
  <desc>Nice place. Slots with fire rings and tables. Toilets, but no showers. cost now $20.&#xA;$18 if permit is bought online.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19580 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
