 <wpt lat="62.824796" lon="-136.579451">
  <ele>473.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pelly River Crossing</name>
  <desc>Nice free campground just on the river in Pelly Crossing. Electricity plugs were not working. There is a bbq and a table in each spot so should be perfect for summer :) We were the only ones staying there that night so really quiet. Great spot&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19581 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
