  <ele>19.35479938064642</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Point Amour Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Perfect place to camp. We saw a humpback breaching 20 times right in front of us.&#xA;The tour of the lighthouse is very informative, just avoid it when a tour bus comes. many more nice spots right along the shore.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19604 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
