  <ele>476.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crooks lake</name>
  <desc>Maintenance post along the Labrador 510. It is flat and you can drive away from the road. plenty of flies but free fast Internet&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19605 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
