  <ele>483.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pins river</name>
  <desc>Just of rt 500 between Happy Valley and Churchill Falls a nice spot right on a fast streaming river.&#xA;many mosquitos and flies. several fire pits and a memorial in the bush.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19606 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
