 <wpt lat="51.919050" lon="-119.316410">
  <ele>715.940185546875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest Service Road</name>
  <desc>Leave highway and follow FSR past the &#34;chain stop&#34; and keep right and up the hill past levelled service area about 1 lm. The site is on a bend and about 50m x 50m level and cleared gravel. We found a couple of fire pits so used one and made use of the abundant dead wood in the area. There is a power line overhead but you dont have to park under it if this bothers you.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19611 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
