 <wpt lat="61.182467" lon="-138.615715">
  <ele>800.902706450666</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kluane Lake - Hide a way - Top</name>
  <desc>Great Spot a few meter from the stony beach with a small picnic table. Also you can find a few other place to stay on the beach. &#xA;The bumpy 2km road down with great view is narrow, steep and need high clearance and after rain 4x4 recomendet to go back uphill to the Highway.&#xA;We had a black bear around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19663 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
