  <ele>860.9033203125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Westside Road</name>
  <desc>Dispersed camping. Take a small dirt track lakeside into the woods and there are several places suitable to pitch up. Looks like it gets used a bit as there are old fire pits and old tracks. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19676 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
