  <ele>998.69384765625</ele>
  <time>2023-04-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alaska Highway  Sikanni Chief Road</name>
  <desc>2 km from the Alaska Highway along the Sikanni Chief Road, a small forest way - quiet despite you can hear some trucks from the Highway&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19764 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
