 <wpt lat="54.062760" lon="-124.847750">
  <ele>658.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Swan Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Free beautiful campground as previously mentioned. But beware, it’s by the train tracks and it can be VERY loud at night! There’s also a weird industrial smell that arises once it rains.. that can’t be good for you over a long period of time. The campground is basically in town, it fills up quickly in the evenings. It’s got a nice playground and docks to walk to. And bonus, it’s for gym equipment along the waterfront. It’s overall a great waterfront spot and even better because it’s free (donation box). Washrooms have water-filled toilets, and they are apparently cleaned once daily based on the signs outside! There is cell phone coverage throughout the area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19766 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
