  <ele>30.868133544921875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 02:00:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Trois-Pistoles Wharf </name>
  <desc>Trois-Pistoles Wharf .&#xA;Popular spot for small motorized in summer.  Lot of actions before  9 PM.  Quiet after with a beautiful view of the St Laurent. Good cellular reception.&#xA;4 places,25$ for the night and no reservation.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 02:00:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19774 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
