 <wpt lat="45.264710" lon="-66.088190">
  <ele>24.48177719116211</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rapid Falls - View Parking</name>
  <desc>Parking at the Rapid Falls View, with good view on the river. No sign, that overnight parking is not allowed. There are clean toilets with running water, soap... Toilets were closed from 9.00pm to 7.30am. Parkinglots are not fitting for big RVs, mobilehomes are ok. BUT: on the other side of the river is a noisy papermill, but we slept well. Try to find out the time for the high tide/low tide and be there at least one hour before, it is interesting to watch the rapids developing!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19924 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
