  <ele>307.9166259765625</ele>
  <time>2022-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>On Dirtroad To Cape North</name>
  <desc>Big area next to the road with great view above St. Lawrence Bay. Road in not so good condition, big holes, may be muddy/slippery when raining. If you walk up the hill a little further you can get cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19925 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
