  <desc>Small spot with a nice view above the lake. Pit-Toilets 2km away at the wildlife viewingpoint&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 03:31:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/19984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
