  <name>Picard Creek Forest Recreation Area</name>
  <desc>Next to the main road but very quiet. Has a nice river, picnic tables and fire rings. There are two different areas: a day use for Free and a camping area for $15 a day or $7.50 for retired people with ID.&#xA;We camped the for the night and no one came to charge us (it was Monday), and there is no pay station. You just have to wait for them to come and charge the fee.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/20213 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
