  <name>Chase Lions Campground </name>
  <desc>Realy nice campground, close to the water with firepits, tables, Foodtruck on the Weekend and super cleen showers and toilets. Good for swimming in the River, witch is directly beside the camping. the wifi is very fast. &#xA;dryside with firepits and picnictables are 25 dollars, full hook-up are 40 dollars. we realy recommend this place. the hosts are super helpfull  and friendly. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/20356 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
