  <name>King Edward Lake North Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Very nice and quiet rec site compared to the nearby Oyama lake rec site. Nice lake with rainbow trout. You have to have a 4x4 vehicle to drive on these backcountry roads. A lot of other rec sites in the area. Just ask for the map of the backcountry routes at Visitor centres of the region. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/20501 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
