  <ele>690.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River (Old Bridge) Camp</name>
  <desc>Wild camp by nice river with fire rings. Take the track all the way to the end and then take left fork to nicest camp area. At the fork there is old equipment from 50 years ago when they tried to build a bridge here. Very quiet. Bears about so careful with your rubbish. High clearance needed for some of the track and low branches in places. We were in Toyota Landcruiser with rooftent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/20503 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
