  <ele>500.96405029296875</ele>
  <time>2023-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Revelstoke Campground </name>
  <desc>28 for a tenting site. Unlimited hot shower included, clean bathrooms. Sheltered picnic tables and free wifi at that area- bit slow though. Small grocery store. &#xA;area to wash your dishes between showers&#xA;&#xA;This campsite is very expensive Can$65.20 for a minimum service. No electricity no WiFi, water at the entrance and toilets at 300m. For emptying, it must be done in town. In addition, the train passes 100m away and the road above completes the atmosphere. Without the fatigue of the kms of the day I would have asked for a refund.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/21962 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
