  <desc>Great place right at the Similkameen river. Many places for all kind of vehicles or tents.&#xA;Use the forest road right outside east gate of EC Manning Provincial Park for less than 50m to the south, a parallel way brings you down to the river bed. &#xA;&#xA;Fire pits at many places, you won&#39;t need a 4x4 but high clearance gives you more opportunities.&#xA;&#xA;Cellular ok for some. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/23603 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
