  <ele>219.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pine Lake</name>
  <desc>Beautiful rec site at Pine lake. Just 4 sites (2 at eastside and 2 on another, probably west :-) ) pittoilets, picknicktables, firepits. Places between trees directly at the lake. Good for tents as well. The places are not that big, but enough for those who did the road up here. You have to take a rough forestroad for 11km. Not recomended for big RVs and/or trailers. Best for pickup-campers, vans, cars. The road is getting muddy when it rains. But should be ok with 2wd. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/24638 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
