 <wpt lat="50.708691" lon="-121.912179">
  <ele>198.77069091796875</ele>
  <time>2022-11-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fraser Cove Campground </name>
  <desc>Great campground close to the center of the town. The sites are very close to the river and the beach. Amazing views over the river. Picknick table and fire pit, drinking water, hot shower, clean toilet. Very nice Owner. &#xA;&#xA;Prices in 2022:&#xA;35$ for tent site&#xA;40$ for 15 Amp/Water&#xA;50$ for 30 Amp/Water&#xA;&#xA;Shower 1$ for few minutes&#xA;A Box of Fire Wood 10$ (or bring your own) &#xA;Ice cubes 4$&#xA;&#xA;If you&#39;re into fishing (sturgeon) you can rent a rod, and fish from the campground. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-11-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/24818 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
