 <wpt lat="51.244791" lon="-116.925865">
  <ele>790.1043701171875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 10:58:07 UTC</time>
  <name>Golden Eco Adventure Ranch</name>
  <desc>CAD$40 for site without hookup.&#xA;CAD$58 if you want to make a fire. &#xA;&#xA;This campground is on a massive expanse of open meadows with a beautiful view of the mountains. It’s right next to the Columbia river. There are walk in tent sites, drive in tent sites and powered sites for RV’s. The wash house is huge with nice showers and flush toilets and laundry facilities. Keep in mind dogs are welcome here so there can be a lot of barking depending on who’s visiting.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 10:58:07 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/25582 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
