 <wpt lat="52.220630" lon="-117.229320">
  <ele>1945.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Icefield RV Parking</name>
  <desc>RV camping self-registration $17.50 unserviced.  Huge parking lot, not leveled. Park ranger came by around 8:30pm to check self-registration and for national park passes. &#xA;&#xA;It&#39;s one of the highest points in the park, so it can be cold. But very nice view to the glacier.&#xA;&#xA;At the visitor center is fast internet. &#xA;&#xA;Great cell service signal too (only in summer!). &#xA;&#xA;Next dumping station in Jasper. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/29205 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
