  <name>Bear Creek Campsite</name>
  <desc>Must be reserved in advance if you want a regular campsite. However RVs can camp overnight on the parking lot which is a rather nice location right near the water. $35/night, free showers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/33012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
