  <ele>343.4405517578125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River View Park Chapple</name>
  <desc>small campground for free! at least for 3 days. view at the river. 5 sites for RVs, electricity included (30Amps, 15Amps at the pavilion)! don&#39;t know about tents but there is enough space for some. 1 water tap (not in off season), 1 pit toilet, pic nic tables, 1 fire pit. train few hundred meters away could annoy somebody but was ok for us. wonderful place!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/33165 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
