  <ele>320.62125701375464</ele>
  <time>2023-10-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Juniper Beach Provincial Park Campground</name>
  <desc>Provincial Park campground: the gate is open in off season and you can stay for free w/o any services. This year (2017) until 28. April. The host Jack is a very friendly guy. A lot of train traffic on both sides of the river! We did not hear anything at night. Desert, so no bears arround. From May to September you can have electricity and water but for a fee, of course.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/33602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
