 <wpt lat="48.645140" lon="-69.092260">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Portneuf-sur-Mer</name>
  <desc>Portneuf-sur-Mer camping is still very young. It celebrated it&#39;s 10 years of foundation just a few years ago. Born of a mobilization of people from Portneuf-sur-Mer, this enchanting accommodation site offers 82 seasonal or traveler sites.&#xA;&#xA;Located at the junction of the Portneuf River and the St. Lawrence River, it offers an unusual panorama to its occupants. The long and beautiful sandy beaches that characterize the Portneuf-sur-Mer area are available to you from morning to night a few steps from your location.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35155 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
