  <ele>1164.5162353515625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Epic place above Wapta Falls!</name>
  <desc>Amazing views of the waterfall with picnic tables, fire pits and a pit toilet. BC recreational area offering 2 main camping spots and checked with rangers, it is free and you are allowed here. Best place we have camped so far!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35269 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
