 <wpt lat="49.293470" lon="-123.133318">
  <ele>45.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>501-Denman Street</name>
  <desc>Visit Vancouver Downtown and Harbour with your Camper. This is the best place to park during the day or even stay at night!&#xA;501 Denman Street - a privately-owned parking lot that has no limitation for overnight.&#xA;Parking fees: $27.30 cad for up to 12hrs (up the next 6am or 6pm)&#xA;&#xA;Downtown in walking distance: Marinas in 1 - 10 min., Canada Place in 20 min., Stanley Park in 10 min., Shopping Downtown in 20 - 30 min.&#xA;Parking lot is noisy during the day and quiet at night.&#xA;We have been here twice and had no problems!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35279 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
