  <desc>huge campground, clean with showers, internet, laundry, ...&#xA;walk-in tent site well situated, ok in may but must be crowded in summer.&#xA;a little bit expensive, 40$ + tax for tent, and you have to pay the showers extra (1$ = 6 minutes) showers currently free (winter 2019/20). Spotless bathrooms. &#xA;We visited just after COVID and paid $72/nt. Staff helpful&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35490 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
