  <ele>1129.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Salmon Glacier</name>
  <desc>Via a 26km rough road you arrive at a fantastic view to the huge Salmon Glacier. There is a parking where you can stay overnight. &#xA;&#xA;On your way to there you pass a platform where you can spot bears, fishing for salmon (in the right time of year).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35545 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
