  <name>Hwy 40</name>
  <desc>User-Maintained Campsites 10 km north of Grande Cache.&#xA;&#xA;To both sides of the HWY 40. It&#39;s a busy HWY during the day but quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;Public Lands Camping Pass required! https://www.alberta.ca/public-lands-camping-pass.aspx&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35557 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
