  <ele>14.517332077026367</ele>
  <time>2022-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brookdale Country Inn RV Park</name>
  <desc>Great place to stay overnight in a room or at the campground!!!&#xA;&#xA;All the facilities you are looking for, fairly priced, just perfect for a stop while on the road!!!&#xA;&#xA;Ask for Phil, he is absolutely awesome!!!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/35611 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
