  <ele>335.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Picnic Lake beach road</name>
  <desc>very nice tent or little van campsite.&#xA;&#xA;2 pit toilets,&#xA;2 picnic tables&#xA;clear lake for swimming or refresh&#xA;garbage container at the junction &#xA;shower available in town at the husky gas station&#xA;food market and liquor store near by&#xA;&#xA;pleas keep it clean!!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/36645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
