  <desc>Parking lot and picnic area at the start of the Loyalist Trail. It&#39;s next to the highway 316 but has barely any traffic. Trail leads to country harbor, also a nice spot for a picnic or a swim (2km one way).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/36649 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
