  <desc>Great place lakeside, 81 km north of Watson Lake on Campbell Hwy. 10 sites, 12 Dollar, firewood included. Firepit, outhouse, picknicktable, boat launch and - best of all - beautiful panoramic view of the lake!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/36730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
