  <ele>647.9800204401836</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot</name>
  <desc>Big paved Parkinglot abov a beautiful Lake. No&#39; no Camping&#39; Signal. Good option for one Night. 1km down at the lake is a nice Recreation Campsite (20.-) Offer also Hot Showers (4.-)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38022 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
