  <ele>365.94593320414424</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Secret Lake Wild Camp</name>
  <desc>Nice and peaceful place on your private Lake! Just follow a very old unmainted Road in to the Forest, then torn right and drive over the Rocks to the lake...! not easy to level the Car. Just possible with small 4x4 Cars/Campers and high clearance!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
