  <ele>533.8</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Prophet River Wild Camping</name>
  <desc>This is about 7 km off the road on the old portion of the Alaska Highway. Remote quiet and nice. You can actually go up the road to the river about 19 km where they took out the old bridge. Nice to get off the beaten path. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38215 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
