 <wpt lat="53.245769" lon="-117.783368">
  <ele>1133.3743896484375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brule Lake public land use zone</name>
  <desc>A few possibilities to camp close to highway 16, some with fireplace. Quiet, only a little noise from the street. Don&#39;t take the dirt road west (left) to go further away, even if maps.me says ist is a street! It&#39;s a bad dirt road, even for 4wd! Badly washed out from rain and snow and there is NO exit to the highway!!! If you drive it you have to go all the way back. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38347 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
