  <time>2022-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Radio Road </name>
  <desc>This is a pretty cool spot with views over the whole valley. Keep driving the radio road until you reach the top. Needs 4x4 and high clearance. We did it in a Toyota Landcruiser, bigger vehicles not recommended. There is no noise from the antenna. A red light is flashing during night, though. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38447 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
