 <wpt lat="56.087572" lon="-129.305876">
  <ele>252.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Meziadin Lake Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;Nice Prov. Park on the bank of Meziadin Lake. Some spots right on the lake and others stack up the hillside away from the lake so most sites still have a good view over the lake. Almost all the sites are gravel pads, but a couple are grass. Campground is kept up well. Large firewood bundles can be bought for $8 and dropped off at your site. Pit toilets are scattered around the campgrounds. nice picnic tables and firepits at all sites. $22 dollars per site. We had two motorcycles and two tents and stayed on one site, campground host didn&#39;t have any issue with it. idk if there is a max # of ppl per site. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38625 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
