  <desc>Stay right ahead to the wharf about 1.2 kms in.  Looks like a locals hangout cause there&#39;s a fire pit and picnic tables. We stayed here in a 30ft class a and a toad. Room for more.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38937 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
