  <desc>$25/night campground with about 10 sites, firepits, pit toilet, firewood, picnic tables. Close to a river, lots of mosquitoes! We were told there is a grizzly and some moose in the area, so be bear-aware!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/38938 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
