  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Congdon Creek - Yukon Territorial Park </name>
  <desc>Great place with sites on the water, electrified fence enclosure for tents (frequent grizzly bear territory). Lots of firewood, picnic tables and fire rings. Pit toilets. Small playground for kids. Pull through as well as back-in sites. $20 CAD per night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39091 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
