  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Silver Trail: Lookout Devil&#39;s Elbow</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot of the Devil&#39;s Elbow lookout, pit toilet, garbage bins. Hidden from the Silver Trail and okay to spend a night. We saw two bear cups 200 m from here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39109 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
