  <ele>53.7366943359375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ovens Camping</name>
  <desc>Great sites, pan for gold on the beach - we found gold at low tide, hike the nature trail and see the caves, follow all the trails and stairs and go into all the caves, good at high tide.  Nicer sites for tents and overland rigs don&#39;t have power, and water not on site, but big open area for trailers does. &#xA;&#xA;Rates 2017:&#xA;Day-Fee: 10.- plus tax per adult&#xA;Unserviced Campground: 35.- plus tax (Day-Fee included)&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39170 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
