 <wpt lat="49.955090" lon="-115.762910">
  <ele>812.9930139842236</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Johnson Lake Rec Site </name>
  <desc>If you don&#39;t want to drive too far into the backroads, this is a nice spot. (Take the right road that takes you to the other side of the lake.)&#xA;&#xA;A lovely little spot, it&#39;s got plenty of shade from the trees and benches/fire pits with a few toilets. It has a nice little beach spot with clean water and a little turtle platform in the water where a bunch of turtles sunbathe during the day! There&#39;s also similar spots across the water. And it&#39;s all free, just keep it tidy!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
