  <time>2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marshall Lake Rec Site </name>
  <desc>Nice and quiet spot overlooking the lake. There is a private road leading to the lake that is closed. When driving on Phoenix road from Grand Forks, take the right turn before the private road. It is not on maps.me, the private one is though. There are several sites, however, not all are levelled. No cellphone service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39575 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
