  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alma Trails - 4x4 access</name>
  <desc>Follow the 4x4 trails behind Alma to a small flat clearing at the side of the trail.  Trail is large round rocks in places, drive slow. 4X4 with good tires, clearance and low range strongly recommended.  Some low hanging trees over the trail.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39605 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
