 <wpt lat="45.190694" lon="-64.159450">
  <ele>11.9163818359375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mutton Cove Beach </name>
  <desc>Superb spot by the beach. Too perfect for words. We just spent a whole day and night. Quiet, private, paved way up to the beach, so no 4x4 needed. Just be mindful of the tidal variation and do not lit up any fire before 19:00. No infrastructure, just the most beautiful scenery. Enjoy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39952 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
