  <ele>73.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bayfront Park</name>
  <desc>Public Parking. No signs no overnight. We had a good night here. Lovely park by the water. Nice for a run, bike or kayak early in the morning. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39954 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
