 <wpt lat="49.890118" lon="-97.134732">
  <ele>237.99139219928972</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 16:56:31 UTC</time>
  <name>VIA Rail Canada Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Paid ($5 for all weekend) parking lot for&#xA; small rigs (&gt;20ft) by the main attractions of Winnipeg. The nearest Walmart is 6km away, ad as we wanted to have a quick look at what the city has to offer this was a good spot for us. Noisy, train station nearby, but it was ok. Nice burger joint (VJ) across the street and a number of other restaurants around. Good bathrooms at the Forks National Historical Site. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 16:56:31 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39980 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
