  <ele>799.77978515625</ele>
  <time>2023-10-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kikomun FS Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Follow dirt road off Kikoman Newgate Road to big Parking Lot near Kikoman Creek. Camp sites on both sides of creek. For more solitude and a great mountain view there is wild camping next to a hay field. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/39987 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
