  <ele>1131.187255859375</ele>
  <time>2023-10-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Palmer Bar Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free. Two official sites but space for more. Crown land so keep it clean. Quiet. Pit toilet. LTE cell service reaches here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40010 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
