  <ele>183.38132095336914</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mission Island boat launch</name>
  <desc>A grass parking for boat lover with wild goose and deer. &#xA;No sign of &#39;no overnight&#39; parking.&#xA;This is a public place for people to put their boat in water.&#xA;We passed one night here without any disturbance except mosquitos outside of the camper.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40026 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
