  <ele>186.6856689453125</ele>
  <time>2023-05-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake of the woods rest area</name>
  <desc>This is a Nice rest area by the lake. Large RV’s and Buses are prohibited, so it stays quiet. There is an 8 hour limit posted, so it can be considered overnight friendly as long as you are brief. &#xA;&#xA;Pit toilets, picnic tables, garbage cans and a gorgeous lake that is difficult to get down to but a great temperature to swim in. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40036 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
