  <desc>Good place off the road for overnight stop. Many bugs - like everywhere else in the interior. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40038 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
