 <wpt lat="51.649998" lon="-119.968805">
  <ele>634.68994140625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>By the cliff high clearance vehicule only</name>
  <desc>Go up &#34;raft river forest service road&#34;. After a curve you will see a quad track going to the right. Dont take this one, take the following entrance so that your vehicle faces the trail rather than turning right. Follow the trail, this site is to your right a little further. I recommend you get there when it&#39;s still clear outside. If you have young kids, stay vigilant as this cliff will not give second chances.. koodo network 2/5&#xA;Short before it there&#39;s a place for some more cars better accessible if your car is a little lower. The original spot easy for suv and more. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40050 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
