  <ele>1141.7965087890625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>mason creek</name>
  <desc>Nice area next to HW40, we had our  lunch  here. But stay overnight should not be a problem. There are a few firepits. It&#39;s next to the river. Wild camping with an 14 day limit&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40061 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
