  <ele>461.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 08:23:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paynton Ferry</name>
  <desc>3km from transcanada highway. Some places on grassy area just before the ferry, mainly on the left. We ask to the operator and he say ok for for as long as we want. He told us there is black bears, coyotes and mooses in the area. Nice and close to the river. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 08:23:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40092 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
