  <ele>30.7</ele>
  <time>2022-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot in Central Quebec </name>
  <desc>Large parking lot near lots of the main sites in Quebec that allows overnight parking, but NOT camping. STEALTH ONLY.&#xA;&#xA;$20 for 24 hours, less if you just wanted to stay overnight. Wasn&#39;t officially encouraging campervans and we were the only ones, but great if you want to go out in the city and have a drink. &#xA;&#xA;Was quite noisy (and it was a Sunday).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40105 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
