  <ele>650.6396484375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot, gas station, motel and restaurant. There is a big sign saying &#34;truck stop&#34;. Place was empty, we ask to personal to stop here for the night and we parked behind the building to avoid running engine noise from eventual trucks.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40276 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
