 <wpt lat="55.938851" lon="-129.999670">
  <ele>14.538959534753296</ele>
  <time>2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rainey Creek Communal Campground</name>
  <desc>Big RV and tent campground. They have sheltered tables for bad weather. FREE Hot Showers - in Canada! Wifi works, but very slow. Potable water with hose. There are fire rings with grills for cooking. Tent camping cost 19 C$, RV dry is 23 C$ per site, RV - 15 amp electrical 32 C$, RV - 30 amp electrical 38 C$. There&#39;s a lot of shade from the big pine trees. Walkable distance to the shops and cafes in Stewart. This place is MUCH more cozy than the RV park in Hyder.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40455 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
