  <ele>486.47906494140625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Montreal River Campground </name>
  <desc>More or less 7/8 sites in the forest. Access to the river. Pit fires, pit toilets beautiful and peaceful place. &#xA;Direct on hyway2 signed as a picnic area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40552 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
