  <ele>34.0</ele>
  <time>2022-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot - Splash and Putt</name>
  <desc>Near the west entrance of Terra Nova N.P in the parking near the aquatic park. It is not the main parking but down on the right when you face splash and put. Many other cars and RV&#39;s : almost like a campground, but free. Near highway but quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40594 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
