  <time>2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halfway River Hot Springs</name>
  <desc>Nice Campsite, acess to hotsprings down at the river. road is pretty rough. some vw canpers made it up here tough. $15&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40648 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
