 <wpt lat="56.726570" lon="-129.779680">
  <ele>589.7</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area by Lake</name>
  <desc>Nice rest area by the lake. It&#39;s on two levels, first is by hwy, second is bellow with pick nick tables, views of mountains and small lake. Steep but short trail leads to lake. Noise level wasn&#39;t bad at night as you are shielded by little hill and there wasn&#39;t much traffic anyway. &#xA;BTW, we had a 200# Black bear come out of the bushes about 10 feet from where we were making dinner so be prepared...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
