 <wpt lat="58.846453" lon="-125.230490">
  <ele>713.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Toad River Lodge and RV Park</name>
  <desc>This place is awesome!   Wildlife is abundant.  At our campsite we watched the beavers feed and add to their dam; across the river we watched an adult bull moose and elk feed on grass and plants.  All sites are $35 plus tax, this includes water, power and firewood.  The tent sites have a kitchen sink.  Most sites are on the river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40676 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
