  <ele>713.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 09:59:40 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Creek Yukon Park</name>
  <desc>Wooded campground with about 20 sites.  Each has a picnic table.  The kitchen shelter has a wood stove and free firewood.  It was great on a rainy, cold night.  $12 Canadian a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 09:59:40 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40683 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
