 <wpt lat="60.650144" lon="-135.020230">
  <ele>744.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pioneer RV Park</name>
  <desc>Lots of road noise and in airport path, but no 4-wheel drive and it was 10pm and we needed a hot shower.  $18 for tent site.  $2.50 for 8 minute shower.  Fee for wifi, so we didn&#39;t use it.  $5 fee to use oil-changing pad.  They will change it for you for $25 plus supplies. Closes for winter. Coin-operated dog wash and car/RV wash. Gravel parking lot style full hook-ups. Spaces very close. There are a few wooded spots up on the hill as mentioned below. Place has potential, but lacks maintenance and investment. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40685 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
