  <ele>801.113037109375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside - Stewart-Cassiar Highway</name>
  <desc>Rest area with pit toilets, fire pits &amp; picnic tables. About 500 meters from the road, right by the river. Nice private spots, almost like a campsite. Sign says you are not allowed to stay for more than 8 hours and no tents. Perfect spot for the night! With a curious porcupine :) &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
