  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Atlin Lake on the shore</name>
  <desc>Small place for a small camper on the lake shore of beautiful little Atlin lake. It has a fire pit and shady trees. Although this place is close to the street it is very quiet. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40818 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
