 <wpt lat="59.290847" lon="-129.298290">
  <ele>755.889892578125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Good Hope Lake </name>
  <desc>Two beautiful spots at Good Hope Lake: one close to the water, the other a little higher in a hairpin. Each has a picnic table and a fire ring.  Two small campers can fit next to the lake, one or two more a bit higher (but have to leave room for visitors to turn around). Clear turquoise water perfect for swimming.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40819 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
