  <ele>1235.501953125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Latremouille Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Camp site by a nice lake. Firepits. The road down is rebuilt and smooth, but fairly steep, though has a gentle curve now. $15/night, $7.50 for seniors and/or disabled folks.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40887 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
