  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 18:22:13 UTC</time>
  <name>Pinegrove RV Park</name>
  <desc>Campsite in tall trees with a mix of gravelly and grassy surface, table and firepit, ablutions somewhat worn - unstable toilet and pop music, coin-operated shower (not tried), water standpipe at site and power (not used). Field with horses behind, railway line not far away. CAD 44.10 + 10.00 for firewood. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 18:22:13 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40976 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
