  <ele>30.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Port Hawkesbury - Laundromat</name>
  <desc>JK laundromat is located on 2 MacIntosh Ave, Port Hawkesbury, NS B9A 3K5. The guy is very polite! The charge per load is $2.00. Drying charge depends on the amount of the your clothes take to dry. We paid $8.00 for two loads half hour each. you will need to bring your own detergent and softener. otherwise, good place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40982 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
