  <ele>924.3</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yahk river site</name>
  <desc>Great level spot on the south side of the river about 5k east of Yahk, BC. Fire ring, short trail to river. Directly on the left, right before the bridge crossing.&#xA;&#xA;Space for 2 cars/1 van at first pull out, 1 van/car at the second pullout and 3 vehicles at the last pull out.&#xA;&#xA;Further on are additional spots.  #3 has lots of room for multiple rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/40986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
