  <desc>Narrow dirt road leads right to the beautiful Emerald Lake. Unfortunately quite close to the highway but in the evening there&#39;s not much traffic. Only space for one car (no turning, need to drive out backwards!)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/41001 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
