  <desc>They let us use their showers for free! No private stalls, just a small (5 showers) room inside locker rooms. Asked if it was ok to shower naked as children/families were in the women&#39;s locker room... was told it was fine. Had no problems doing it, I&#39;m assuming people do it all the time.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/41558 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
