  <ele>506.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dr. Bicum Site Rest area</name>
  <desc>Nice treed rest area good for a peaceful night&#39;s sleep right off Hwy 16 Eastbound.  There is ample room, 2 outhouses sanidump &amp; garbages.  Train track in the field behind, but only 1 train came through around 9pm last night. ***I see google maps takes you into the park, when coming from the west, down a road that&#39;s no longer in use. To get into the park now take the road, off highway 16, just to the east of the park, then quick right and through the gate.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/42731 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
