  <desc>Unfortunately we didn&#39;t see the St-Lawrence River from the parking area. There is a picnic table and a beach. Nice view of the Mont-Anne on the other side of the river. 25$/night&#xA;In the parking lot of the marina. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/42776 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
