  <time>2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hay River territorial campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice campground more than 100 very spacious and shady sites. Very calm and quiet. A lot of sites close to the lake. Good for hiking and canoeing. Very nice and helpful people. Modern ablutions showers included. Good phone reception Wi-Fi at the reception. Laundromats and Dryer C$ 3 each C$ 29.40.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/42844 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
