  <name>Ontario Street / Queen Elizabeth Park</name>
  <desc>*Moderator Note: Overnight camping/parking is NOT available at this location.&#xA;......&#xA;We stayed here several days/nights. Very good site in Vancouver. Both sides of the road have a park, so no houses nearby. Quiet at night and good location to go sightseeing by bike + Nice park nearby.&#xA;Some other campers park there as well overnight. NO SIGNS!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/43571 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
