  <name>Wedgemount </name>
  <desc>Multiple vans parked overnight, great river to take a shower and meet new people, there are picnic tables too and a little fire spot. One of the best places in Whistler to park! The view is great. Parking lot with access to Garibaldi park trailheads.&#xA;Just a heads up: &#xA;- No toilets/porta potty&#xA;- No garbage bins&#xA;-The roads past the bridge become very steep and aren&#39;t recommended for anything over 20ft. Heavier rigs should park at the entrance area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/43875 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
