  <ele>653.1689172168934</ele>
  <time>2022-10-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wildlife road</name>
  <desc>Place near Wildlife road. It&#39;s a gravel road climbing. One or two places for one night il you don&#39;t fond another place. 4x4 is better. Very quiet. We station here Fromont 8pm to 9 am and no car pass. No noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44065 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
