  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kin Beach Foreshore Chemainus</name>
  <desc>Moderators Note:  Overnight camping is NOT suggested due to posted regulations.&#xA;&#xA;Parking near water and garden for children. Tables and restrooms. Water bottle refil station. Very quiet for a night. &#xA;Half the parking lot has signs which say: Parking for vehicle with trailer boat only. Other spaces have no posted signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44067 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
