  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Manitoba Visitor Centre </name>
  <desc>Large parking area in gravel lot behind centre (be careful of large potholes as you drive in). Toilets on the side of the building are open 24/7 over summer.&#xA;&#xA;Free showers are available 36km west at the Coop gas station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44197 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
