 <wpt lat="48.428670" lon="-71.059440">
  <ele>101.61410522460938</ele>
  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Downtown parking</name>
  <desc>Big parking for RV close to the boulevard du saguenay, downtown. &#xA;There is coffee&#39;s, bars, restaurants and other services at a walking distance. &#xA;On the other side of the boulevard there is a park with water games and the saguenay river. &#xA;There is a free wi-fi close to the parking, but the signal is low. You can go up the multi-floor parking to &#34;café cambio&#34; for a nice meal and get wi-fi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44252 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
