  <ele>177.0457763671875</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Mackenzie trail</name>
  <desc>Very nice place, near the river. No facilitys. Very quite.&#xA;&#xA;It&#39;s no the parking to the Trail, it&#39;s on the other side of the river. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44412 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
