  <ele>218.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Community campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice place well maintened by the support of locals and our donations, many tables and ring fire next to the river, but also next to the road.&#xA;&#xA;roads to campsites are pretty rutted out but doable. big rigs can fit ok but probably no longer then 20 feet trailers&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
