  <desc>Nice place near the beach with fire pit. Not far from the highway but no traffic.&#xA;Not for big rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-30 08:54:43 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44689 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
