 <wpt lat="46.934883" lon="-70.732617">
  <ele>27.90819855278133</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marina at Berthier-sur-Mer</name>
  <desc>Parking slot with a sign &#34;Camper 20 CAD per 24 hours&#34;. We were here mid of September and it seems to be no season anymore, so we didn&#39;t have to pay. Very quiet place beside the St. Lorenz River, but unfortunately no view on the River from the parking slot, there are trees between the river and the parking slot. Nice Picnic Area beside the river with a very nice view. Restaurant was closed at this time of the year. Restroom with running was open. WiFi was not available at this time of the year. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44709 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
