 <wpt lat="48.413834" lon="-89.239209">
  <ele>180.59809964018314</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 07:46:55 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Supercentre Thunder Bay</name>
  <desc>Typical walmart. Open from 7-11. Good wifi. A little bit noisy during the morning. Clean, safe and secure location for overnight short term stays. Park south of the Auto Service centre. No shade, no bushes for after hours washroom runs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 07:46:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/44890 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
