  <ele>163.1</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Minnow lake - Crown Land</name>
  <desc>Crow Land camping spot on side of a Small lake stock with lake trout.&#xA;Must have 4x4 vehicle&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/45230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
