 <wpt lat="45.498800" lon="-65.190250">
  <ele>15.769522495567799</ele>
  <time>2022-10-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goose Creek - Crown Land</name>
  <desc>Located in the Bay of Fundy just our side the national park territory this is one of my most memorable campsites. Once you leave the main road it&#39;s about 28km of rough gravel roads and a steep long descent for the last 7km. ( expect 1h of travel once you leave the main road )&#xA;&#xA;4x4 / offroad vehicle is a MUST&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/45231 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
