 <wpt lat="46.577540" lon="-60.983450">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chéticamp - Cell Tower</name>
  <desc>This is on top of the mountain. There is a long steep drive to get there but with a very nice view of the region. There is a private spot near the tower or other trails.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/45233 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
