  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Redding Creek Bridge</name>
  <desc>Great spots on either side of bridge facing the river.  One side is right above the water the other has two huge clearings with fire pits.  We have camped with groups of overlanders here.  During the week there is active logging near by and they start early.  This is the FSR to Gray creek pass which takes you from Kimberly to the Kootenays easily done in a pick up or car with ground clearance. No cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/46677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
