  <desc>Moderator Note: A recent check-in suggest that camping is possible. Please confirm.&#xA;&#xA;ADMIN NOTE: No overnight camping allowed, please respect the wishes of the locals. access is blocked to all vehicles.&#xA;&#xA;This place was a campground a long time ago.  Indicated by the visitor center. There&#39;s no water available but you can dump at each site. Very quiet. Free.&#xA;&#xA;Please update if you come here and share your own points for all travelers. Thanks. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 09:07:39 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/48481 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
