  <desc>I asked the security to stay overnight.  No problem.  Many playgrounds for kids. Toilets.  Water. Wifi. Very quiet night and day.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/51754 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
