 <wpt lat="52.376510" lon="-107.144620">
  <ele>447.065673828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Borden Bridge Campground</name>
  <desc>This is a full-service campground. $25/night (unserviced) or 35$ for electrical and water, dump station for sewer.&#xA;&#xA;Tree-filled area overlooking the North Saskatchewan River. &#xA;&#xA;Showers are now available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/52732 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
