 <wpt lat="52.068028" lon="-107.988230">
  <ele>641.2682762145996</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Biggar &amp; District Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Electric site $25.00, Non Electric $20.00, Day Pass $5.00. Just across the highway from town where gas station, restaurants and cell tower are. Campsite has no toilets in Winter, camping and picnic spots are few in number in a low lying valley with trees. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/52746 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
