 <wpt lat="49.661520" lon="-125.163580">
  <ele>708.607421875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forbidden Plateau</name>
  <desc>There is a large parking lot at the base of an abandoned ski area.  No facilities, but the road is often plowed in winter.  On weekends this place can be busy with locals drinking around bonfires and such.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/53104 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
