 <wpt lat="49.278460" lon="-123.088990">
  <ele>21.96905517578125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McLean Park</name>
  <desc>Residential area surrounds the park. The streets closest to the park have some available spots for overnight stays, just check the signs. There is a small café/market called “The Wilder Snail”, which is absolutely lovely, friendly and they have wifi. Within the park there is also toilets, which are closed during the night but otherwise decently clean. Neighbourhood is quiet and there are families and dogs all around. We stayed here for two nights.&#xA;Free hot showers at the Strathcona community centre.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/53489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
