 <wpt lat="42.988810" lon="-82.349310">
  <ele>185.54217529296875</ele>
  <time>2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart - Sarnia</name>
  <desc>Nice spot for overnight.  We parked at the auto service side because we could back onto some grass.  Saw another camper in the main lot but it&#39;s pretty vast and nowhere to tuck into.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/56021 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
