 <wpt lat="49.532267" lon="-115.748677">
  <ele>875.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 21:20:38 UTC</time>
  <name>Cranbrook B.C.. Home Hardware RV Parking</name>
  <desc>We did not stay at Home Hardware in Cranbrook yet, but I called today and asked customer service if people could stay there one night in their rv.  He said YES.  I asked if the sign saying people could overnight there for 1 night is still there, and he said yes it was.&#xA;&#xA;I also called Home Depot, and the manager said no, they do not allow it anymore.&#xA;&#xA;So, Home Hardware it is!    Happy Travels All!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 21:20:38 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/57231 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
