 <wpt lat="53.918468" lon="-122.722449">
  <ele>548.9761389285964</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood Park Camp 2</name>
  <desc>Parking on the other side of the park. Nice view over the river. No road traffic noise. Easy access for all rigs. Bit of a distant wood industry hum at night. Dark, no lampposts. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/57468 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
