  <ele>151.9832420349121</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burlington Walmart</name>
  <desc>Called and they said it is OK to stay overnight (Walmart is open until 11pm), it is next to a major road, but pretty quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/57890 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
