  <ele>25.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Lake </name>
  <desc>Level parking pad right next to a small lake just off the highway. Small campers only. Visible from highway.&#xA;&#xA;Not sure how things look during summer (high season), but there are currently no signs prohibiting camping. Free.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58000 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
