  <ele>257.4046630859375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Lakes Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Beautiful user maintained rec site. Gravel road access, we were in a truck camper but a big Class A rig here also. Pit toilet, benches and firepits. Two sites either side of the bridge, about room for 5 campers in each&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58115 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
