  <ele>20.162089022807777</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nimpkish Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Large free rec site with about 15 spots next to the lake, fire pits, benches and pit toilets. Good access on a gravel road, we have a large truck campers but saw some trailers here too&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58116 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
