  <ele>302.5697021484375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lower Klaklakama Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>5 unit free rec site with pit toilets and firepits. Directly next to the lake, can wade straight in or launch kayaks. Roads are gravel and pretty good, should be able to take all size motor homes but the biggest ones might struggle if it’s full&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58117 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
