  <ele>467.9582670807642</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest station </name>
  <desc>Rest station. Pull off area right along HWY 17. Includes toilets (but currently closed for renovations Sept 13, 2022), garbage disposal, and picnic tables. Great place to stay for one night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58197 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
