  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>Typical Walmart parking lot. We asked for permission and were allowed to stay there. We spent 3 nights there. There is a MC Donalds as well with 24 hour business hours.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58320 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
