  <ele>1146.3998384475708</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>Parking lot walmart, tim Horton etc...24h Max. Perfect for one night &#xA;Open until 22h &#xA;--&#xA;Grand parking Walmart, Tim Horton etc...&#xA;Durée maximum 24h &#xA;Parfait pour une nuit avant Calgary &#xA;Ouvert jusqu’à 22h &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58340 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
