 <wpt lat="51.064477" lon="-114.152078">
  <ele>1060.2304344177246</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Edworthy Park. North Parking</name>
  <desc>What a perfect place. Lot of space (lot of people during the day) and quiet night. Restrooms and pit toilet when restrooms are closed (i think city closes pit toilet when it begins to snow). Beautiful park and nice café. Slept 3 nights with no issue, even Saturday night. Please respect this spot, it&#39;s so rare, And don’t park under the ONLY sign saying « P 4hr » (RV did it, even though parking was empty)&#xA;&#xA;No wifi and bathrooms open 7.30am-9pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58426 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
