 <wpt lat="54.067638" lon="-119.012777">
  <ele>889.1889353951944</ele>
  <time>2023-05-29 17:11:52 UTC</time>
  <name>Big Horn Highway Sheep Creek </name>
  <desc>Between the entrance track and the creek random camping is allowed for max 14 days. Easy access for all rigs. No amenities. Free.&#xA;Public Lands Camping Pass required! https://www.alberta.ca/public-lands-camping-pass.aspx&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-29 17:11:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58435 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
