 <wpt lat="49.374513" lon="-120.134359">
  <ele>684.2019625524755</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lower Stemwinder</name>
  <desc>Small meadow appx 1km up Stemwinder fsr. Several flat areas for overnight stay. Partial shade in some places. 2wd access to some spots, 4wd to others. Stemwinder fsr is directly across from Stemwinder Provincial Park. Watch out for cactus. Great views of the Similkameen Valley. Please respect the area and leave it better than you found it. And please no fires in the summer months.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/58876 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
