  <desc>Small campground. With 2 walk-in tent sites and 4 parking sites. Reasonable outhouse. Free camping. Pack your garbage out. Smaller vehicles only. No big RVs. rough roads to get in. before the little bridge if you come from Port Alberni, there is a steep gravel road down.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/59490 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
