  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>BRCC Aire de service du Point-du-Jour</name>
  <desc>Rest station in the middle of the highway, toilets, seating area with wall plugs. 2 aides to park on. Because there is a highway on either side it is noisy and there are allot of big rigs parking over night. But it’s got toilets and was a safe place to sleep the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/60354 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
