 <wpt lat="47.776454" lon="-59.244069">
  <ele>13.6</ele>
  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old Bridge</name>
  <desc>I think, here was an old bridge for the highway 1. So you have here two roads, that ends on the river were you can stay. The road to South is asphalt, the road to north is gravel. &#xA;be careful with big vehicle- both roads are dead end roads, so you can&#39;t turn around with big vehicles. &#xA;The place is a bit noisy because it is 15m away from the highway. But it is behind the bushes, so nobody can see you an distrub you.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/60423 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
