  <desc>A rest stop on highway 1 which allows camping overnight. Picnic tables, fire pits, drop toilets. Big trash containers good for one night. Paved and level spots. May be closed in winter. &#xA; &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/60444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
