 <wpt lat="49.334915" lon="-119.725270">
  <ele>829.9999389648438</ele>
  <time>2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Lakes Golf &amp; RCV Resort</name>
  <desc>On Hwy 3A 15 minutes south west of Penticton. Small, clean campground with 30 amp full service, with both back in and shorter pull throughs. The length of the pull through did not allow us to remain connected to our 30 ft RV. Washroom and showers were very clean. Park hosts were exceptionally friendly and could not do enough to look after all of our needs. &#xA;We would return again. $18 per night with PA. May 8&amp;9, 2018&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/60495 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
