  <desc>Great gravel parking lot with no amenities. &#xA;&#xA;Signs say no camping within 66ft of water and no camping (*not overnight parking)&#xA;&#xA;Moose, frogs and mosquitoes!&#xA;&#xA;Leave space for boat trailers to turn around!!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/60525 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
