  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burnell Park Atikokan, Ontario Canada </name>
  <desc>Nice campground in the town of Atikokan. Electricity at some sites. Hot showers and flush toilets. The camp host comes around to collect the fee. Thirty dollars Canadian. If you don&#39;t have Canadian dollars they try to charge you $30 US. or there is box on washrooms as well as online bookings.&#xA;Quiet and wasn&#39;t busy July 7. has electricity at some sites. Dump Station as you leave/enter, does not appear to have fees for non campers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61062 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
