 <wpt lat="49.318580" lon="-67.384540">
  <ele>66.90343962050974</ele>
  <time>2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pointe des Monts</name>
  <desc>Not an informal campsite but an established official camping. They also offer simple log cabin for rent (3 nights minimum stay). There 12 sites, 4 of them reserved for RVs. No RV services. No electricity but there is a warm shower, 2 toilets and a sink for dishes. Post COVID the restaurant is closed but you can order in advance for pizzas or other to-go bites. Coffee, some pastries and beer sold at the camping reception.&#xA;5 places right on the ocean. Very basic. Picnic table and a make shift fire pit. Great view and quiet. Check in with the restaurant around the corner to pay. $25 cash per night. Flush toilet across the road in the &#39;Cabine Sanitaire&#39; (wash house) Not clean but season hadn&#39;t really started when we stayed. English spoken. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61122 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
