  <name>Elkhorn Campground</name>
  <desc>Small campground provided by the village of Elkhorn, close to TCH 1. Clean washrooms, free showers, large sites. See pictures for more details. Unserviced 15 CAD, serviced 25 CAD - 30 amp electric. First come, first served.&#xA;Note, water posted as being untreated. Next to train tracks so quite loud.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 12:58:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61157 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
