  <time>2022-09-27 09:43:56 UTC</time>
  <name>Ripple rock rv/camping </name>
  <desc>I absolutely rate this place 100/10 stayed here twice over two years I wish I could just permeability reside here! Great fishing and views, beautiful hikes around the area. The rv Park is fully equipped with everything you need, they even have a hot tub with the most beautiful view over the ocean! What more could you want!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-27 09:43:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61679 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
