  <ele>188.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Labelle Infotourist</name>
  <desc>Just next to the infotourism you have a nice parking with (un)covered picnic tables, wifi point, toilets open H24, water inside and outside ! Very nice place near the road ! &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61776 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
