 <wpt lat="44.263471" lon="-76.572046">
  <ele>126.53460693359375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart. Kingston. Supercentre</name>
  <desc>Big parking area with quiet area at the bottom backing onto Lowes supermarket. We got good WiFi from Lowes. Away from the 401 and the travel plaza up the street where the big rigs stay. There is a beer store next door, and about a mile away on Princess Avenue - a Starbucks (early morning coffee and WiFi); Planet Fitness (workout and shower) and across the street, a Farm Boy grocery (fresh vegetables and other groceries). Be kind to Walmart. This is a good overnight spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61784 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
