 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="63.942714" lon="-135.216775">
  <ele>1669.84619140625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Keno Hill,Signpost</name>
  <desc>Highest point in the Yukon which is reachable by car, great 360view if the weather is good, take the 10,5km long,most well maintained small road from Keno City but watch for very sharp stones beside the shoulder-we got a flat tire, at normal conditions the road is practical by 2WD but at this early time I recommend 4WD because the last km was very muddy, soft and with rest of snow patches,; 12years ago we did it with a 24ft RV but it was Aug; we had a very calm night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61791 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
