  <ele>251.24782988979436</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Matheson </name>
  <desc>Small lakeside boat launch with picnic area. No signs indicating that overnight camping is not allowed. Another camper in a tent was setup on the grass. Near the main road so a little noises but not bad. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Please be respectful This site is a memorial to the hundreds of people who perished in The Great Fire of 1916&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/61793 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
