  <ele>18.11782455444336</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>John Cabot Municipal Park</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: WARNING! Vandalism reported in this location. Please use caution.&#xA;Nice view of ocean with picnic tables and toilet.  Busy during the day but very quiet at night. We were too high for the entry to the Municipal park, so stayed in the paved parking area below the lighthouse. The park attendant in the lighthouse, told us that there was a 3 night maximum stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62084 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
