 <wpt lat="50.890110" lon="-55.891376">
  <ele>45.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>French Shore Interpretation Centre</name>
  <desc>Conche, French Shore Interpretation Centre parking lot. Spend some time viewing the amazing tapestry at the centre and stay in the parking lot. Picnic tables close, great ocean view.&#xA;Parking overnight allowed by the centre.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62136 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
