  <ele>12.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bear Cove Point</name>
  <desc>On the point at the hamlet of Deadman&#39;s Cove. Right on the cliffs about 900m off the highway. Spectacular view of the ocean. The parking surface is solid rocky shale. We have a 4x4 but I think a car could easily make it. We could pick up the Internet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62139 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
