  <ele>8014.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dino’s RV Park</name>
  <desc>Camping for RV, and cars. Camping table and BBQ available. 42$ a night for the van but toilets (free) and showers (1$ for 4min and 2$ for 9 min) available in the campground even if you don’t stay for the night. &#xA;Possibility to refill water as well.&#xA;&#xA;Van and trailer cost us $63 dollars with tax.&#xA;Firewood was $11 dollars for 400 dm³ or $30 for three bundles.&#xA;&#xA;There is a shuttle to the Royal Tyrrell Museum for $5 dollars per person round trip and shuttle to passion play for $10 dollars per person round trip&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
