  <desc>A full-service campground with showers electrical hook ups if you want them, laundry services etc. The bonus is that you are outside of the town of Brandon Manitoba but in a quiet campground. There is tent sites along the Assiniboine River. Close from the Trans Canada Hiway and accomodation. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62332 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
