  <ele>48.18056869506836</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sprout Lake Prov Park</name>
  <desc>There is an established provincial campground here and the cost is $25 for the night. showers are free and bathrooms are clean. Also overflow camping can be had in the parking lot area for a small fee. There is upper and lower sites, with the upper sites larger on the sites on the water smaller. There is no Sani Dump here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
