  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free hot shower! </name>
  <desc>Free unlimited hot shower!&#xA;From the road, turn to Rissers beach campground and continue to the beach parking.&#xA;Then you have to walk into a tunnel and continue straight. You will see a place with toilets and showers.&#xA;And surprise, the water is hot! &#xA;The parking is open from 9.30 am to 8 pm.&#xA;&#xA;Outside there is also another shower but the water is cold.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62579 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
