  <time>2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hank Snow Home Town Museum RV Park Liverpool. </name>
  <desc>There are seven spots in the Hank Snow Park for RV parking, up to 24 hours. It is free but you can give a donation if you want to. There is also a free sani dump station (when you leave the park it is to your right). There are no toilets. Gazebo, picnic tables, trash bins on site. Hank Snow Museum and a walking trail to a pond nearby, grocery store etc. just across the street. Self contained RVs only, no tents.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/62620 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
