 <wpt lat="59.362566" lon="-129.143998">
  <ele>753.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to Boya Lake PP</name>
  <desc>A little quiet spot in the trees right next to Boya Lake PP.&#xA;Take the same entrance as if you are driving down to Boys Lake and take the sharp right onto a dirt road. Not far down the road on the left is a little pullout on a little ridge. Big enough for one party with two cars or one camper (no big rigs). Great for bicyclists or motorcyclists with tents. Close to road, but quiet. Out of sight from the road.&#xA;Water is available at the park.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63039 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
