  <ele>449.38723391993483</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rustic Camping Keremeos</name>
  <desc>A large lawn area, it feels like to camp in a extensive garden area. Some traffic noise from the road nearby. Lovingly set up and spaciously laid out. As the name suggests it&#39;s a simple campground but with water, tables, fire pits and toilets and... nice owner and host. $ 25.00/ night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63162 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
