  <desc>Canadian Tire RV Services (as copied off the sign in the parking lot)&#xA;- RV DUMP&#xA;- FRESH WATER&#xA;- FREE OVERNIGHT PARKING&#xA;- SPECIAL RV PARKING&#xA;- RV SERVICE BAY HOIST&#xA;- FULL LINE OF TRAILER/RG ACCESSORIES&#xA;&#xA;There’s also garbage cans and electrical plugins in front of the parking spots around the left side of the building.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
