 <wpt lat="49.727610" lon="-123.131170">
  <ele>19.20239938552322</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 19:32:34 UTC</time>
  <name>Mamquam River Campground </name>
  <desc>“Mamquam River Campground is provided by the Mamquam River Access Society (MRAS), a not-for-profit organization dedicated to facilitating outdoor recreation access and affordable camping for adventure enthusiasts.” &#xA;&#xA;$10 for walk-in and $20 for drive-in sites. The sites are very close to one another but are clean and great for the price. &#xA;&#xA;No running water or RV services, just pit toilets. Rigs must be under 20’ long. &#xA;&#xA;Biggest downside is the noise from a nearby gun range. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 19:32:34 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63423 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
