  <desc>Blue creek surrounded by mountains and dry pines. Great view and few spots along the river. &#xA;Bumpy and dusty road, require 4W when wet. We can hear cars on highway, but traffic isn’t intense.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63471 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
