 <wpt lat="45.068500" lon="-65.014695">
  <ele>1.0</ele>
  <time>2023-11-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oceanside </name>
  <desc>To be reached by a long gravel road with partly bad conditions, but reachable with a 4x2 nevertheless. Spot directly at the ocean surrounded by small cliffs, caves and a little river. perfect place for a campfire. &#xA;maybe some locals show up on weekends &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63541 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
