 <wpt lat="47.186110" lon="-52.843246">
  <ele>32.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Celtic Rendezvous by the Sea RV park</name>
  <desc>We only use established campgrounds when we need a shower or laundry. Showers not included in price (5$ per person!)...one night at the campground is 35$ excl tax. Only 1 washroom available for the whole campground.&#xA;&#xA;But the view is awesome! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63546 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
