  <desc>$2 wash&#xA;$3 dry&#xA;&#xA;coins accepted: 25¢ $1 $2&#xA;no change machine, no attendant&#xA;cold water only&#xA;12 or so washers, 3 working dryers (LG gas dryers)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63564 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
