  <ele>603.826416015625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Showers</name>
  <desc>Great hot unmetered showers for 7$cad each. Includes towel and shampoo/body wash. Open after 10am, but ask for availability if you can&#39;t wait that long.&#xA;Very clean and you get your own private bathroom with shower, toilet, and sink.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63579 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
