  <desc>Fantastic community sports center with swimming pool, sauna, hot tub, showers, WiFi, playground, gym.... we payed 18$ for the hole family/ 1 day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
