  <desc>Laundry and Showers just down the hill from the community camp site. Less than 3 minute walk&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63617 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
