  <ele>286.5889892578125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 18:08:36 UTC</time>
  <name>Mt Carleton Provincial Park </name>
  <desc>Nice campground inside the park. $28 for unpowered site. Hot showers, Picknick tables and fire pits&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 18:08:36 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63634 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
