  <ele>590.0731201171875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hyland River Bridge</name>
  <desc>At the western end of the bridge there are pullouts on both sides of the highway and also beneath the bridge. Tracks also lead away from the cleared areas and there are open spaces in the forest that will take big rigs such as the one marked here which is far enough away that traffic noise is insignificant. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63657 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
