  <desc>Returning from the salmon glacier if you need a quiet stay for one night, here is a loop out of the road.  Quiet and flat.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-11-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63666 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
