 <wpt lat="50.177884" lon="-61.269229">
  <ele>3.397054705595549</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>shipwreck point</name>
  <desc>Tiny spot right at the sea. Short hike to a shipwreck and picnic tables. Fantastic coastal scenery. Access via a very narrow dirt track. Wind protected tent camping possible in nearby quarry, but only accessible on foot. Unfortunately there is a rotting whale nearby, very bad smells in 2018.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
