  <time>2023-07-29 19:18:33 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping de la Pointe à la Perche</name>
  <desc>Municipal Camping. Very wild and beautiful.&#xA;23$ tax included per night per equipment. &#xA;Have to register at the touristic office.&#xA;Some protection from northerly winds. Nice and quiet spot. Bring firewood as there is no drift wood. Possibilities to buy some wood at the grocery store.&#xA;Possibility to potable water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 19:18:33 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63737 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
