  <name>Digby Walmart </name>
  <desc>Walmart parking lot right off the main road. Lots of amenities nearby like gas, Tim Hortons, bathrooms in stores during business hours. Lots of other campers. Traffic noise and some kids meeting up with their cars to do burnouts but they weren’t causing trouble. It was nice and quiet after midnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63767 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
