  <ele>51.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shawinigan</name>
  <desc>Very good location along the lake. Bike path. WC and trash cans available. sign allowing to stay 24h. Nice park next door. &#xA;It&#39;s right next to the Saint-Maurice park with water games and a lot of games for the kids, Also an outdoor pool.&#xA;---&#xA;Très bon emplacement le long du lac. Piste cyclable. WC et poubelles disponible. panneau autorisant de rester 24h. Joli parc juste à côté. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63786 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
