 <wpt lat="49.593765" lon="-119.558526">
  <ele>729.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Arawana </name>
  <desc>Free campspot on Arawana Road on the Crownland after the cattleguard a bit further on the left. Fire rings and leveled parking in the woods with some nice views. Maybee 1km or two on the dirt road so for most cars or rigs.Too tight for any trailer. Always lots of pikers. **Watch out for bears don&#39;t leave food outside at night they come sometimes.*&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63796 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
