 <wpt lat="49.621995" lon="-119.605793">
  <ele>402.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>SunRock</name>
  <desc>Nice rocky parking/camping spot. On the side of North Naramata Road so pretty quiet at night. You can venture further on the edge with a high clearance car to have a wonderfull view or stay a bit further and still be good. A bit windy for campfire and a little bit of glass on the ground so watch your tires. But overall pretty descent spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
