  <name>Canmore</name>
  <desc>This place is *not* within the city limits of Canmore and therefore bylaws and ordnances cannot apply here. Maps attached for information - you’ll see the point that the railway becomes parallel with the road on the east side is where the spot is, but city limits end some distance west.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63800 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
