  <ele>9.143999707392009</ele>
  <time>2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Complex Recreatif et Culturel</name>
  <desc>Free showers in the complexe récréatif et culturel. Enter the door under the red roof, head 3x right for the showers which belong to the indoor swimming pool. If you can&#39;t start the waterflow, ask the person at the reception, she will activate the sensors in the showers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/63982 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
