  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Icefield Tent Camping Area</name>
  <desc>Beautiful Campground only for tents. At some sites, it should be possible to sleep in a car. $26.75 (includes fire permit) per day. The start of the hike on the Wilcox Pass starts just 1km away and the Icefield Center with free wifi is also just 1km away.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64095 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
