  <ele>755.8262168392539</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 17:16:52 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinbasket (Recreation Site) </name>
  <desc>Primitive campground. 10 private camp sites only. Come with fire bin and picnic table. 2 pit toilets. Close to the Kinbasket Lake. Very quiet in July. Only one other camper. 14$ supposed to be collected by Park Ranger. No-one came to pick it up though.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 17:16:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64119 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
