  <desc>RV Service &amp; Parts shop in Victoria.&#xA;We’ve been preparing our rig for the journey and the staff has been nothing but supportive.&#xA;If you’re in need of advice and/or service this is a honest place in Victoria.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-02-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64121 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
