  <ele>846.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>next to the gravel road</name>
  <desc>Small gravel/grass place you can pull off the road. Nothing fancy but will do for a quiet night. Gravel road to get there is not too bumpy. &#xA;Place enough for one to two rv’s depending on size.  Only 1 car used the road in the morning.&#xA;Mosquitos present&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64127 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
