  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Scuzzy Creek</name>
  <desc>Very nice place by a small creek in the middle of the woods. There is an existing fire pit. Follow the forest service road until the bridge (load limit 68 ton gvw). &#xA;&#xA;Please pack up your garbage. Bring a garbage bag and latex gloves if you’re feeling generous. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64128 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
