  <name>Texas Creek Campground in Gladstone Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>nice campground along the lake. fine sandy and gravel beaches. Spotless ablutions with warm showers.&#xA;boat launches and tons of trails. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64741 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
