 <wpt lat="52.485721" lon="-119.124497">
  <ele>715.0</ele>
  <time>2022-10-09 14:50:04 UTC</time>
  <name>Albreda Riverside camping</name>
  <desc>We stopped here for lunch but there&#39;s no signs forbidding overnight camping. You&#39;re out of sight of the highway but can still hear it. Nice view of the Albareda river. Not enough space for a big rig to turn around, so decide if you&#39;re comfortable with that.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-09 14:50:04 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64925 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
