  <name>Grosses Roches </name>
  <desc>Public boat launch with small parking area.    Steep road off the Main Street, with gravel right at the top that may create traction issues for some larger vehicles.    &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/64969 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
