 <wpt lat="48.686032" lon="-53.100142">
  <ele>24.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bonavista, Cape Shore Road</name>
  <desc>Just down the road from the restaurant Little Dairy King you can see tracks leading towards the shore. You can park between the road and the walking path. The odd local walks by, passes on a greeting and keeps going. Stunning view and we were lucky and spotted a few whales. The road is close but it is quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65038 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
