 <wpt lat="51.761224" lon="-112.786695">
  <ele>806.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rowley Green</name>
  <desc>Not exactly a ghost town but close. Very interesting and welcoming though.&#xA;you can camp on a large grass field in the middle of town with shady places (in case it&#39;s hot!) and there are supposed to be public restrooms.&#xA;We were told you can donate, but haven&#39;t found out where yet. Very peaceful and a hidden gem off the beaten track!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65110 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
