 <wpt lat="46.184750" lon="-82.435300">
  <ele>143.94987691049178</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spanish wild beach</name>
  <desc>Serpent Rivery Territory, permission from tribal elders needed to stay here. Beach very hard to find and inaccessible, just for 4x4, the track is vegetated closed, but we do it with a Sprinter. Lonely, quiet, small, gravel and sand beach, water not very cold in the edge, the best of which we have known&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65120 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
