  <desc>Cheap place to have a shower and do laundry (Stryker marine &amp; electronics) pay for shower at the desk...coin laundry &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65127 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
