 <wpt lat="50.477890" lon="-126.427000">
  <ele>40.7166748046875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 07:51:04 UTC</time>
  <name>Naka Creek Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Nice Campground next to the sea. There are about 4 to 5 sites under trees with a beautiful view of the sea, picnic tables and fire pits. And an open area for more campers but without tables and fire pits. There is a house where you can get fresh water. We think it is potable but not for sure.&#xA;&#xA;It was free of charge.&#xA;&#xA;Be aware of lots of (deer)-mice!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 07:51:04 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65252 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
