  <desc>nice and quiet campground at a golf course. $20 dry, $30 power &amp; water. picnic tables and firepit on the sites. free wifi, free hot showers. washrooms a bit aged but good for one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
