  <ele>1673.490966796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Waterfowl Lakes Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground in the forest and close to the lake. Picnic tables at the lake. Drinking water and clean flush toilets. CAD 21.50/night and fire permit CAD 8.80. There are 110 sites and we catched the last one at 3pm!&#xA;I think they close usually for the season.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
