 <wpt lat="48.697063" lon="-53.086687">
  <ele>32.23759754027088</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 07:59:07 UTC</time>
  <name>Unused Antenna Site at Cape Bonavista</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at the base of an antenna mast and small transmitter building across the road from John Cabot Municipal Park. Overlooks the eastern side of the cape. Possible grass site just beyond the antenna building. Only a couple of small RVs would fit in lot. Road is busy during the day and cars pull in to look out for whales and birds.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 07:59:07 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65539 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
