  <ele>441.19798588166447</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Out of the National park</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay for one night before or after entering the national park. A small gravel bumpy road that goes away from the parking place lead&#39;s 50m to the places, then you have enough space....&#xA;there are no facilities. It is near on the street, so you can hear the trucks at night. &#xA;I am unsure if it&#39;s ok for bigger RV because the entrance is very narrow....&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65543 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
