  <ele>560.4745388031006</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moose Jaw - Visitor Centre</name>
  <desc>Visitor center parking lot. Close to highway. Maybe a bit noisy but does the job. &#xA;&#xA;Info center open daily. No signs prohibiting overnight parking and Info center worker said overnights are okay. washrooms and small museum inside Info center. Picnic tables on site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65603 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
