  <ele>5.751970948205681</ele>
  <time>2022-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blanche Road Free Camp</name>
  <desc>Unpaved boat ramp parking at the gravel road that connects to the paved Port Latour road (2 km).  You are visible, but bushes give you some privacy feel. Quiet.  No &#39;no overnight parking. signs. Easy access for all rigs. The gravel road is well-maintained and wide. Nice view over the water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/65649 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
