  <name>Brannen Lake RV Park &amp; Campsite</name>
  <desc>Very large Campsite in an old forest. Big sites and very calm. Direct access to the lake. If you take a site near the lake you have to walk a while to get a shower. Most do it by car! C$ 38 full hook up. C$ 30 No service. Extra fee for shower and dump. Internet works on full hookup sites and near the office&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 04:47:21 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66030 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
