  <name>Strawberry Point Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Really nice place near Pemberton. $15 per night and well worth it, lots of area to just pick a spot and camp. The woman at the Visitor Centre told me &#39;its free as long as no one comes around to collect&#39; as she put it.  Only downside is the parking can get a little far from your site if you want more privacy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66294 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
