  <ele>215.4816985214129</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside </name>
  <desc>I kid you not: this is the most epic place to camp you may find on the Island!&#xA;Just off the street, down a gravel road and you will find a quiet spot, an amazing view and a path down to the lake.&#xA;Be here around two hours before sunset, so you may take a swim and enjoy the sunset over the mountains. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66310 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
