  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Emory Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground in the forest at the river. You definitely will find a space with shade. Each site has a picnic table and a fire pit. They had a fire ban when we were there. &#xA;CAD $21.-/night. Trains are passing by and you can hear them.&#xA;&#xA;You can dump at the campground on the other side of the highway at CAD $10&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66331 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
