 <wpt lat="49.509885" lon="-55.449158">
  <ele>21.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 14:39:11 UTC</time>
  <name>Ocean View Park</name>
  <desc>We usually steer very clear around commercial campgrounds in Newfoundland because mostly you do not get much more than a gravel parking lot like site where your neighbor is just inches away from your vehicle. But not here at OCEAN VIEW PARK:&#xA;Get an unpowered site right above the beach (small campers only). Sites 6-10 are nicest and close to the facilities. The view on the tranquil bay and the islands is marvelous. These sites have a fire pit, water, a table and bushes separate the sites. Showers are very clean, common kitchen, more powered sites (unfortunately not half as nice) and walking trail nearby. Good kayaking in the bays. Even more quiet sites are on the eastern beach, ask for those as usually you will be given a site in the western bay.&#xA;Unpowered site / tent site is 20.-&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 14:39:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66349 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
