  <ele>1095.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rail Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>2 sites, one of which was occupied by a family who seemed to be living here. But right on the lake and very quiet. 13k of dirt road to get to it but it&#39;s well-maintained and treated for dust so it wasn&#39;t bad. Picnic tables and pit toilets on site. Great place for dogs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66465 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
