 <wpt lat="45.706750" lon="-62.269401">
  <ele>2.650513033708407</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lismore Beach Free Camp</name>
  <desc>Great grassy area very close to the beach. Locals use this field as parking when they visit the beach. The entrance track is not on navi app. To find the track easier I put this point only 50 meters from the Factory Road. Entrance is on your right, and left of the last white house before you get to the harbour. Length of the track to the meadow is 150 m. Easy access for all rigs. If you prefer gravel parking, you will find one opposite the entrance on the other side of the Factory Road in the harbour.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66466 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
