  <name>Angrignon Park Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>PAID Parking Lot next to the Angrignon Park in Montréal. There is a barrier at the entrance but it was open all the time. We didn’t see any “no overnight parking” signs. Stayed there for two nights. During the day there are some cars, quiet during night. There are two portable toilets next to the parking lot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66480 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
