  <name>Blue river and beach</name>
  <desc>Nice spot with a parking lot for 3/4 regular cars and a sandy beach. The water is cooooold but beautifully blue and the spot is really amazing. Logging road pretty rough but many spots along the road. Beau spot de course ces debile.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66555 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
