  <ele>75.12837161308244</ele>
  <time>2023-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rosemont </name>
  <desc>A few minutes away from Rosemont metro station. Free parking, with others trucks / RVs parked here. Rather quiet for a city place , not extremely nice (parking around) but well located next to Mile End and Petite Italie with lot of restaurants around. There is a small place for kids to play and bike road. &#xA;A boulangerie and laverie not far.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
