  <ele>610.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Liard River waterfront</name>
  <desc>View on the river. Few places to stay along the way. Highway not that far but don’t hear too much of it. Great spot. Full bar cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66578 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
