 <wpt lat="46.311840" lon="-72.569470">
  <ele>13.929359554260495</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trois Rivières </name>
  <desc>The GPS location noted on the place is difficult to find. Go first to these place : 46.31184 -72.56947. Then pass under the bridge.&#xA;&#xA;A nice place to spend a night near a river and at 3 km from Walmart. No sign of no parking. Some fishermen. Wind &#xA;&#xA;Make sure to drive behind the Hôtel les Suites de Laviolette all the way to the end, turn left at the stop sign, and keep going even with the construction site. There&#39;s a small gravel road which leads to the location.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66619 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
