  <ele>312.6405029296875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pine Grove Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Rest area on Hwy 1. Accessible from both directions. Toilets and picnic tables. Bit noisy as it’s right next to the road but no signs that camping is not allowed. Quite a few other cars, campers &amp; trucks that stayed.&#xA;A big trash dump to get rid of trash. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66643 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
