 <wpt lat="48.388426" lon="-70.588675">
  <ele>15.069102866964933</ele>
  <time>2023-10-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>ste rose du nord : Camping la descente des femmes</name>
  <desc>Campground with services for $40 and without services for $32. Payment in cash only. &#xA; The town is lovely and right on the fjord. The owner of the campground only speaks French so Google Translate was great to have. Electricity is regular household; no 30 or 50 Amp. Water and sewage at the $40 (cash only) rate. We&#39;d definitely stay here again&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
