  <name>Large clearing with Glacier view </name>
  <desc>Large gravel clearing with Glacier view. 2nd road after the creek. You will see the clearing from the road.&#xA;You have different options, the cleaning, another small by a creek in the sw, but no view. For those with an adventurous spirit, you can take a bad road after crossing the creek and camp by a small lake with great view.&#xA;Enjoy the quiet and the marmots &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
