 <wpt lat="50.060968" lon="-123.097838">
  <ele>447.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>outside the main Cal Cheak campground</name>
  <desc>We wanted to camp in Cal Cheak campground but it was full. We met two Park Rangers and they told us that we could park here. it looks like an open parking gavel lot with no tables or anything. They told us we could stay there paying half fee, we paid 6,5$ per vehicle and you can use all the amenities of the campground (bathroom and garbage cans). There were a lot of other vehicles near doing the same. We were here with our 23&#39; class C motorhome.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
