  <desc>Nice privately run campground at a beautiful lake. Most sites are seasonal but they offer regular sites. Nice and clean toillets and showers. We spent a night here, enjoyed swimming in the lake and can only recomend this place. We payed 25 $ for an unserviced site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66812 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
