  <name>Criple Cove</name>
  <desc>Just before the Lighthouse is Criple Cove Road. You can find a spot at the end of the road right on the ocean. We had a foggy night so the fog horn was going but not overly loud. Could sleep fine. Very quiet except for the waves pounding on the shore. Just kidding! It was a great spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/66829 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
