 <wpt lat="51.637272" lon="-103.537666">
  <ele>557.8064994812012</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 19:42:24 UTC</time>
  <name>Foam Lake Rest Area and Campground</name>
  <desc>I just visited this information centre. Very nice. Wifi on site. Displays inside, free coffee and cookies. Tables for kids to colour at. Clean bathrooms. Driving range here as well (closed at the moment) and a campground which I did not stay at however just wanted to share. Inside the info centre it said pets welcomed and it had camping games (ladder ball, horseshoes Etc) for borrow. Free books on site as well and burger place down the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 19:42:24 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67134 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
