  <name>Wreck Cove Hydro Reservoir</name>
  <desc>Quiet place in the highlands of Cape Breton directly next to the road with direct view to the water (on the opposite side of the road). Bring bug repellent!&#xA;&#xA;Access over a rough and sometimes steep gravel road (about 6-7 km from Cabot trail). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
