 <wpt lat="50.624640" lon="-116.054201">
  <ele>1012.50439453125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Redstreak Campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice campground in an open pine forest. Five sections with more than 200 sites. some full service and some without service. All sections form like a circle around the spotless washrooms. perfect.  2.7km to the hot Radium pools. These are open till 11pm. Starting at the campground you have a number of hiking possibilities and even viewpoints down to the city.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
