 <wpt lat="49.628067" lon="-125.086233">
  <ele>166.3</ele>
  <time>2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>cumberland lake park campground</name>
  <desc>Campground on lake comox next to a public beach. Extremely noisy.  Beachers do not hesitate to cross your campsite to get to their car or go to the beach. Campsites are not level, no grass and our site was not cleanup after the previous camper. Showers not free. Bathrooms are for campers and are public : cleaned only once a day, no handsoap, garbage full, paper on the floor, people doing their dishes in sinks. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67160 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
