  <desc>it&#39;s a nice camping 31$ without service for RV, 1$ for the shower. nice view in the St Laurent. &#xA;just ten minutes from Neptune company who own boats and offered services 60$ dollars for adultes, 40 for children in à huge zodiac with glasses so perfect for young children. WE Saw Manu whales !! 2hours of boats.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67250 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
