  <name>Lundbreck Falls Provincial Park </name>
  <desc>Campsites next to river. Some sites have power, some without. Fire pits, pit toilets. Recommend sites 30 &amp; 31 (unserviced, private next to river) Some hwy 3 noise during day. $28/ night without power. Alcohol prohibited. Reservable only (internet or phone).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67256 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
