 <wpt lat="60.841617" lon="-115.876757">
  <ele>131.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach in Hay River</name>
  <desc>On a sandy beach on Great Slave Lake.  There was someone else here in a tent.  Lots of driftwood for a fire.  In Hay River, follow Tamarack Drive all the way to the beach.  Met a local and he said it is federal land and people camp here all the time.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67500 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
