 <wpt lat="48.569832" lon="-53.332420">
  <ele>30.8028564453125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>King&#39;s Cove - Lighthouse Trail Head</name>
  <desc>By the church. Magnificient view. Nice trail. Yummy berries all around. &#xA;Picnic tables and garbage can. Pit toilet farther on the trail. &#xA;Stayed one night by the church. &#xA;Please comment when you try. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67504 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
