 <wpt lat="48.536388" lon="-53.037300">
  <ele>8.02016830444336</ele>
  <time>2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Catalina - End of the road - Trail head</name>
  <desc>Big turning point at the end of the road on the other side of the bay. By the water. Windy. Picnic tables and garbage cans only. Trail head to the 17km trail between Little Catalina and Maberly. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
