 <wpt lat="45.161185" lon="-66.811202">
  <ele>22.976558083954366</ele>
  <time>2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spot by the lake</name>
  <desc>There is a nice turn around at the end of the road, no signs for no overnight camping/parking. Beautiful view by the lake with portable toilets. We would have stayed here the night before if we had found it! Stayed up the road for $30 ( two of us and our dog) at Maxwell Campground which was more of a long term campsite for trailers but didn’t have a problem with us and the rooftop tent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67515 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
