  <ele>93.31781005859375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 21:44:56 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Tadoussac</name>
  <desc>Regular campground, entrance gates open until 23:00. $35.80 including taxes,full service (mid Septembre)&#xA;&#xA;View of fleuve. Next to somewhat busy road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 21:44:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67529 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
