  <ele>178.72537231445312</ele>
  <time>2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rawdon</name>
  <desc>&#xA;Self service laundormat. If you need change to buy soap or pay the machines, there is a store 2 houses just south with ice bags aswell.  Super practical location!  Washing machines needs 2 loonies.  Dryers were free today.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67535 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
