 <wpt lat="46.739835" lon="-64.376834">
  <ele>13.571437161908024</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kildare Seafood Product Wharf</name>
  <desc>On Wharf Road just before the wharf there is a road to the right to a level spot overlooking the fisherman &amp; boats. Small road crescent off a dirty road that surrounds a large rock that may be a monument and there is a small working automated lighthouse nearby. Grass and a fabulous view of the ocean (ok ok Golfe of St-Lawrence). This is near the most western portion of PEI. &#xA;&#xA;No cell signal for Rogers or Fido. But cell signal available for Telus&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
