 <wpt lat="51.312487" lon="-116.970810">
  <ele>800.0130567550659</ele>
  <time>2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Huskey Fuel Station Overflow</name>
  <desc>Husky allows you to stay at their parking lot. Most of the vehicles are RVs, but also smaller vans . Toilets 24 hrs available, just like the fuel station shop. Very nice staff. Quiet, some light and noise from traffic, but good enough for 1 night. It’s for free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67613 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
