  <ele>11.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Playground gravel clearing</name>
  <desc>Gravel clearing very close to Inuvik. Playground very good for the children. Not flat. No sign of &#39;no overnight&#39;. Cell reception. Bins and toilets available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67614 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
