  <ele>21.15856431349893</ele>
  <time>2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miracle Beach</name>
  <desc>Nice and quiet BC parks campground (201 sites) with free hot showers, flush toilets and pit toilets. Just a 5min walk to miracle beach with a beautiful wide sandy beach at low tide. $33 per night. In summer it&#39;s very busy and the 10 first come first serve sites get full quickly.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67634 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
