  <ele>810.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest area. very large parking next to a quary</name>
  <desc>Very large parking next to a quary (yellow gate) near the road.&#xA;&#xA;Highway noise  but what was worse is RV who came at midnight and put on the generator all night. &#xA;&#xA;7 cars altogether here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67649 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
