  <ele>11.581987064826363</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 21:08:19 UTC</time>
  <name>Indigo car park</name>
  <desc>Medium size car park, we stayed there with our 36 foot rig. not too expensive, night is 6$, 24 hours 16$. excellent location, we enjoyed the waterfront in the evening. Google says covered car park - but its not covered.&#xA;Large RVs may be required to pay for two spots.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 21:08:19 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
