 <wpt lat="50.653946" lon="-120.387765">
  <ele>660.460205078125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Costco</name>
  <desc>We stayed here for one night. Quiet and free.  Didn&#39;t see any signs of no overnight parking. There were others RVs. We sleep on a rooftop tent. Close by to a lot of things. As well close to Abardeen mall and Starbucks which are two other sleep spots. Close to Cora breakfast and lunch which opens at 6, for the early washroom break. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67686 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
