 <wpt lat="47.710542" lon="-65.698684">
  <ele>6.085107790034453</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beresford beach</name>
  <desc>Small parking in front of the beach.&#xA;No sign of no overnight.&#xA;Not for the big RV as you need to fit in the parking lot.&#xA;Washrooms close around 10pm. Picnic table.&#xA;A lot of people come here for a walk near the evening but very quiet after 10pm.&#xA;Other option is to park at the boat ramp (500m away , no running water though and a pit toilet, but big RV can fit.)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67724 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
