 <wpt lat="56.171361" lon="-130.051307">
  <ele>1105.8548583984375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Salmon Glacier Road</name>
  <desc>Several places beside the Salmon Glacier Road or at the lookout, beautiful views at the Glacier, nice area for a hike, some places have fire rings.&#xA;At the lookout are two pit toilets and tables.&#xA;We had a wonderful calm night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
