  <name>Round Lake Hall</name>
  <desc>Head down Round Lake Road. Keep to the left. There is a Round Lake Community Hall across from the boat launch. Picnic tables and fire pits with pit toilets. Sign on the hall says to pay $15 to the farm next door as it is maintained by volunteers! We drove next door to the farm and paid the man who owned the farm. Nice guy!! Round lake is a stocked river for sport fishing. Also, firewood on site. Assuming it’s for use!!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
