 <wpt lat="49.109929" lon="-58.061137">
  <ele>43.98950004577637</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cox’s Cove Falls</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot with view at the falls, at the end of a 3 K gravel road. Really inviting to take a dip in the pool of the falls. The water is nice, clear and warm. Short hike to the top of the falls. Not for big RV’s, truckcampers are ok.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/67968 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
