  <name>City parking</name>
  <desc>City parking very quite free from 18:00 to 8:00 am. Walkable distance from Fort Chambly a Canada National Park  walkable distance from a lot of very good restaurant  and also Chambly Canal &#xA;--&#xA;Stationnement de la ville de Chambly super tranquille à distance de marche du Fort Chambly,  de très bon restaurant ,ainsi que du canal Chambly&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68013 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
