  <desc>Established campground with caretaker on the grounds. 28$/night which includes firewood, access to clean pit toilets. &#xA;The information provided in the first checkin is incorrect. The free area (which does exist, about 5 mins down the road) is actually Public land use and not Thompson creek campground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68019 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
