  <name>Dieppe Irving gas station rear parking</name>
  <desc>Large dirt parking lot behind Irving gas station. Bike path and bush at far end. Lots of different véhicules here. Gas station has auto propane and a R.V. dump (free if you gas up) ... the dump is a covered grate besides the station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68265 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
