 <wpt lat="68.374023" lon="-133.747794">
  <ele>-1.005839967813121</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Midnight Mechanical</name>
  <desc>Tim is the owner of Midnight Mechanical. He is a crazy guy but competent and good in problem-solving. We had a differential problem and he found with his connections a spare part. He is open from 11 am to the end of the day. He was the only mechanic in town who wanted to help us. Northwind or driving force, other mechanics in town, had no time for tourists and were not interested in our problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68267 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
