 <wpt lat="45.087503" lon="-67.055166">
  <ele>16.35805655631063</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Playing field parking lot</name>
  <desc>This parking lot borders a playing field on one side and a forest on the other side. There are beautiful trails just behind the parking lot with lots of deer and wild life. A lady from a near by camp site told me that people often camp here without any problems. I stayed here for one night and it was great. There are toilet facilities near by as well. Please keep in mind this is a function playing field so you may see families and kids in the afternoon &#xA;&#xA;**** both bathrooms are locked up while I was there night / day&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68278 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
