  <ele>1392.26904296875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Belly River</name>
  <desc> seasonal closures &#xA;Self-registration and first come, first serve system. Lovely, quiet, and well-dispersed sites near the river and open grassland with views to surrounding mountains. CND 16 per night. 24 sites with BBQ pit, picnic table, and food lockers. There is a kitchen shelter and flush toilets but no potable water available. Firewood and fire permits are sold at an additional fee. Educational talks on Saturdays. Fox, bear, and deer apparently are a common sight, therefore you are asked to follow the guidelines of the „Bare Campsite Program“. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68508 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
