  <ele>44.767857024815555</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goldstream BC Campground (Provincial Park)</name>
  <desc>Nice and quiet BC campground in the forest. pretty private sites. $35 per night. many sites, most of them are reservable, a few first come first serve sites. pretty busy in summer. free showers, sometimes warm, but they are mostly cold (had no issues with cold or warm showers on Sept19 - changed status to hot) just 16 km from Victoria.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
