  <desc>pretty nice campground in the forest, $20 per night, ranger comes at night to collect the fee. most sites reservable, a few first come first serve sites. 1 km walk to a beautiful sandy beach. 35 km before Port Renfrew. no cell phone service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68599 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
