  <desc>Small and nice established Campground 20$/night, self registration.&#xA;A little bit noisy during the day because of the road not very far.&#xA;Pic nic tables, free showers, toilets, drinking water, shadow under trees.&#xA;We didn’t sleep there but just stayed to pic nic.&#xA;price has now increased to $20 a night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 17:48:07 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/68861 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
