  <name>Parking Lot of Fort Gibraltar</name>
  <desc>Good spot to stay in the city, close to the center. Mostly quiet, but noisy trains passing by every now and then. Toilets and picnic tables. Few other people in the parking lot overnight. Safe neighborhood.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 10:59:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69265 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
