  <ele>521.3093339198483</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Prolly Crossing Rest Area</name>
  <desc>On North side of river, one could stop at rest area but there is quite a slope.  However tent campers can park here, and near the top of the parking area is an opening that is flat and overlooks the river and town. Very nice views &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69289 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
