  <ele>732.267333984375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frances Lake</name>
  <desc>Beautiful $20 CAD campground on the lake. Has firewood and picnic tables. we just stopped for a picnic here, but it looks like a great spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69339 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
