  <ele>332.42919921875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot chute à Philomène</name>
  <desc>Big parking lot near to Philomene waterfall. The waterfall is beautiful and the parking lot is quiet. tables à picnic, abri pour cuisiner, poubelles, réservoir à eau potable.&#xA;&#xA;No signs for no camping&#xA;No cell phone service&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69359 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
