  <ele>29.4</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fairy lake BC recreation site</name>
  <desc>Little campground just beside the Lake where you can fish if you want. I saw 4 pit toilets. Lot of places available even in August. It&#39;s not free and an attendant supposed to come for collecting the fare but we didn&#39;t see him and so stay one night for free. Picnic table at each campsites, and pit fire.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69364 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
