  <ele>344.3610230907759</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Eagle Bay </name>
  <desc>A very nice spot directly at the beach. It is a parking lot next to the road with very low traffic. No signs at all and the beach is just perfect. We spent two nights here with our Truck Camper. Fits one big rig or three Truck Campers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69371 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
