  <time>2024-05-22 11:31:42 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Pointe-aux-Oies</name>
  <desc>Big camp ground. Very crowded at weekend. But tidy and nice located at St. Lawrence River. &#xA;Outside few gravel parking lots, which might be fine for free staying. Swimmingpool for 2 Dollar and Restaurant acessible for everyone. So there are toilettes and showers whithout paying for camping!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 11:31:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69435 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
