  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Outskirts of Longlake</name>
  <desc>A small turn off from the highway, mostly a rock cap with room to set up camp. Three trails seem to lead off into the bush from here, we weren’t bothered at all during our stay. Some noise from the highway, nothing exceptional, but a good spot to spend the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69511 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
