  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whitehorse</name>
  <desc>A parking place with view over Whitehorse. You hear a little bit of the traffic but not that much. From this spot on the road up to the mountain there are a few places to camp, overnight parking also with RV. Very close to the city, good view, good places to stay. No signs &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69725 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
