  <time>2023-08-29 21:38:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake creek</name>
  <desc>After the bridge on  the left coming from the Canadian border.&#xA;The huge parking lot mentioned before the bridge is now closed by a brand new iron gate !&#xA;The parking space is near to the highway with room for 3 or 4 campers .&#xA;One spot is very nice close to the river and good for only one small camper. &#xA;You can hear the traffic from the highway . Good for one night...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 21:38:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/69730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
