  <time>2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pebble beach camp</name>
  <desc>Quiet camp below a cul-de-sac gravel road. Protected from southerly winds, large area and plenty of space. Not recommended for huge RVs (they can stay a bit further on on a pullout of the gravel road or along the way out here). View of the bay, swimming and fire making at the beach possible (bring your own wood).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
