  <ele>143.58157769775855</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Basketball, Soccer Ground</name>
  <desc>I parked besides the basketball ground and slept inside of my van. Just a few passing vehicles because of the National Historic Site and the fantastic view on the lights of the city at night. In the morning some local people walk their dogs there. But all in all very quiet place. I saw a pit toilet but didn&#39;t check if it is available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
