 <wpt lat="49.759374" lon="-119.434099">
  <ele>1150.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boulderfields recreational site</name>
  <desc>A few gravel sites with picnic tables +big gravel parking area. The bigger your vehicle, the more you might want 4x4 to get up here. it&#39;s about 11km up a forest service road. Lots of climbing/bouldering here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
