 <wpt lat="64.040552" lon="-139.406163">
  <ele>345.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dawson City RV Park &amp; Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground close to town, hook-ups available, store, gas and diesel, pressure washer, showers and laundry. $25 Canadian (with tax) for a site without hookups. $40 full hookups. Showers are decent, 5 minutes for a 2 CAD. Wifi available for free. Tire shop too, but cheap quality tires at high prices.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70241 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
