  <ele>702.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Warm Spring</name>
  <desc>camping spot in the meadow next to warm spring, there is also a spot right next to warm spring. very quiet. picnic table and trash bin.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70243 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
