 <wpt lat="60.094667" lon="-129.464103">
  <ele>781.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alaska Highway next to pond</name>
  <desc>secluded spot right next to the Alaska Highway, not visible from the highway behind a small hill. some highway noise but not bad. next to a small beaver pond, so bring your mosquito spray! okay for a night, plenty of room for bigger rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70244 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
