 <wpt lat="55.961073" lon="-120.562390">
  <ele>572.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kiskatinaw Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Off the highway along the old Alaska Highway just down the road from historic Kiskatinaw River bridge. Nice campground on the river. Picnic tables and fire rings at each site. Pit toilets and water pump (non-potable) available. $20 a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70245 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
