 <wpt lat="53.195575" lon="-117.908916">
  <ele>1105.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miette Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground on the east side of Jasper NP up the road from Miette hot springs. $21.50 for campsite, $8.80 for campfire permit fee (required unless campfire ban, but free wood). picnic tables and tiny fire pit at each site, firewood everywhere.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70246 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
