 <wpt lat="51.408928" lon="-116.169714">
  <ele>1533.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Louise Campground</name>
  <desc>Got a site in the rv section of this busy campground for $32, which includes electric hook up. 27 for unserviced. Fire permit is 8 dollars. No tents at this time of the year. not the most quiet campground, as it is near the freeway and right next to the train tracks. of course the train goes by every few hours and the conductor blows his horn real loud when he passes the campground. clean bathrooms have flush toilets and there are also showers here. also a dump station and potable water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70247 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
