  <desc>Veterans Landing Park along Confederation Trail. &#xA;Free hot shower in the washroom. &#xA;Please don&#39;t abuse and keep it clean. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
