  <desc>Gravel space on Keane Lake. Place for any kinds of vehicles. No facilities- but 1,5km north is an rest area with Pit-toilets and bins.&#xA;It&#39;s close to the street, but quiet at night because less traffic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70372 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
