  <ele>91.0106823686786</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small island</name>
  <desc>There is a large unofficial park here. Spots of previous bonfires and trees to sleep under. It is semiclose to the road but dwpwnding on where you camp, you shouldnt hear much (i didnt).&#xA;&#xA;It is also home to gorgeous sunrises.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70453 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
