  <ele>731.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>Not big rig friendly.  &#xA;Large area made up of river stone and sand.  Turn right off the highway heading towards Haines before the bridge. Incredible views of the mountains and easy river access. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70465 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
