  <ele>1031.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Snaring River Campground</name>
  <desc>Self-registration. Very calm and quiet. Every camp spot has its own fire pit and picnic table. Pit toilets. They also offer cook shelter, firewood, food storage and drinking water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70482 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
