  <ele>651.1585932138465</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out</name>
  <desc>Beautiful place close to the road but hidden. Perfect spot with fire pit and small trees. You feel like you are in a garden! We saw the Aurora here and was a perfect spot! Please keep it clean for other overlanders!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70491 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
