  <ele>871.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wildwood campsite</name>
  <desc>Nice campsite, close to highway. Perfect for a night on the way north or south. RV hookups, laundry and very good showers. 34 dollars. Run by a very nice couple!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
