  <ele>1223.7684405756872</ele>
  <time>2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Loon lake rest stop</name>
  <desc>Awesome rest stop with accessible washrooms. Free wifi available. Truck pull through parking as well as car parking available. Also has electric charging stations. You don&#39;t hear the traffic from the highway so it&#39;s pretty quiet despite the trucks coming in. Washrooms open 24hours.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70522 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
