  <ele>34.15539073944092</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near L’Anse aux Meadows</name>
  <desc>Huge lot, easily accessible for all types of campers with a beautiful view of the meadows and close to Viking Settlement.&#xA;Cellular phone is available. We’re 3 rigs on 2022-08-30.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70543 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
