  <desc>Nice place at Nisutlin River. Some fire pits, picknick tables, boat launch, pit toilet, firewood. Very quiet. FREE! There is no sign &#34;No overnight camping&#34;. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70559 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
