 <wpt lat="54.460176" lon="-111.544459">
  <ele>581.044150411494</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 18:21:51 UTC</time>
  <name>Eastern beach of Fork Lake</name>
  <desc>Nice spot at the eastern beach of Fork Lake. Sand and meadows on the beach two picnic tables, litter bin, fire ring. No sign &#34;No overnight camping&#34; or &#34;Day use area&#34;. Not for big rigs or RV&#39;s.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 18:21:51 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70561 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
