  <ele>716.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolf Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Classic Yukon government campground. 20$, pit toilets, wood included, water pump (but have to boil it). Nice sites in the trees, some close to the river. Multiple trails start from the campground.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70660 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
