  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gateway-OLG Casino</name>
  <desc>The Casino allows overnight RV parking in their lot. They just asked that we park at the back near the Travelodge. The location is a short walk to the docks if that&#39;s what you&#39;re in town to see.&#xA;You can ask about free WiFi in the tourist center. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70680 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
