 <wpt lat="48.591989" lon="-85.276213">
  <ele>377.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White River Tourist Information Centre</name>
  <desc>You can park in their lot overnight. There are washrooms inside the centre. There is also a hose with water in the garden between the lots and a dump station that costs a small fee (free in the winter!).&#xA;&#xA;Dump hours: Open Monday to Friday 9 to 5. Need to get key from municipal office after Sept 1.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70681 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
