  <ele>23.0655517578125</ele>
  <time>2022-11-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Snow Creek Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Nice Rec.Site in the forest on the lake. We stayed here for a night and it was free. But there is written sign, somebody collects the fee, but nothing about exact price. So, I think during high season you&#39;ve to pay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-11-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70689 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
