  <desc>Great place to sleep and get water. Water by the back of the info centre and near the dog park&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70724 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
