 <wpt lat="59.425100" lon="-126.106106">
  <ele>683.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Liard Hotsprings Lodge - RV Park</name>
  <desc>$36.75 CAD/night with electricity and water (no dump). They have hot and clean showers, toilets, laundry and a decent wifi at the lodge. No Bell/Lucky reception. Hot springs are free if you go in before 8am or after 8pm (they are across the street). Great option if it&#39;s cold and snowing in the area like when we came :-)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70841 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
