  <ele>239.4</ele>
  <time>2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart </name>
  <desc>Classical Walmart. Clean with lot of space.&#xA;I bought some items to encourage their business.&#xA; &#xA;Very noisy during the night with trains and kids with their modified vehicles doing donuts in the parking lot. Not ideal for a good night’s sleep. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70850 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
