  <ele>303.22018241882324</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forestry Road</name>
  <desc>Many clean spots up an old forestry road with an ocean view and early sun. Road is rough, four wheel drive needed, good height clearance and many good turnaround locations. Had two bars of 5G on Rogers - enough for streaming and FaceTime. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70867 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
