  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Village of Hillsborough RV Overnight Parking Area</name>
  <desc>This quaint village offers free RV parking, whether to stop and walk to nearby amenities or for an overnight stop.&#xA;&#xA;Groceries, gas, post office, pharmacy, restaurants, nature trails, artisan village, museums - all within easy walking distance of this parking area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/70993 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
