  <ele>921.9</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Helen Lake Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>Nice recreation site on a busy FSR. From the highway you have to drive 4 km on a gravel road , with livestock around (cattle). Then you come to a small recreation area with  5 sites on the lake. One pit-toilet. Newer dock.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71008 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
