  <ele>309.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>A safe stop that is far enough off the side of the road to feel OK to sleep. Great dark skies by night - looking forward to a sweet view to wake up to.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71091 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
