  <ele>350.2527067712579</ele>
  <time>2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Midway Lake </name>
  <desc>Huge flat gravel space in the end of the village. All place is empty once they come for the festival only in August. Its interesting like a ghost town. We made fire and had a calm night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71122 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
