 <wpt lat="47.522920" lon="-52.624280">
  <ele>51.496903291912524</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cape Spear Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>The parking lot by the lighthouse is a fantastic spot to stay for a night. View to Signal Hill and the Atlantic Ocean and also sunrise at the most eastern part. Some visitors for the sunrise and late evening. Washrooms and restaurant open June 1.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71142 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
