  <name>Relais Gabriel</name>
  <desc>Nice spot on the water just off the main road. You have to go down a gravel road with some loose rocks, but we were fine with our 2WD T3 and T5 VW campers. Plenty of room for a few rigs. Spot was recommended to us by a local.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71206 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
