  <desc>Just off route 130. Road side spot next to stream with path down to water. No hook ups. It’s on route 103 North. 5 minutes from Hartland NB  where the longest covered bridge in the world is located. Bit of highway noise.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71208 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
