  <desc>Quiet place with a nice view. Parking lot + space for tent&#xA;You can make a fire along the coast, there&#39;s a little beach down the hill, and the forest host a nice curious fox.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/71252 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
