  <desc>Simple but nice First Nations campground. Price for a site with no services at the ocean front is 47$ per night. Slight noise from the highway in the distance. There are also sites with water and electricity available. We were alone in the section with no services. Wifi available but not free. Hot showers are free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/72462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
