 <wpt lat="45.628640" lon="-73.824070">
  <ele>31.844227612018585</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wallmart </name>
  <desc>We parked at the Walmart parking lot right next to Canadian Tire and were able to enjoy a conventional parking space with decent WiFi! There were no streetlights in this area, so we had a good and restful night without much noise from the highway. In the evening, we took advantage of the location to do some shopping at Walmart and bought wine and beers for the aperitif at IGA (200 meters away). The next day, we had breakfast at Tim Horton&#39;s, which is right next to IGA and a gas station. Nothing extraordinary, but a beautiful and relaxing parking spot.&#34;&#xA;.....&#xA;Nous nous sommes garés sur le parking du Wallamrt juste à côté de Canadian tires et avons pu profiter d’un emplacement de parking conventionnel mais avec la Wifi très correcte! Pas de lampadaire sur cet espace donc une bonne nuit reposante assez éloignée de la voie rapide pour ne pas l’entendre. Le soir nous avons pu profiter du site pour faire des courses au Wallmart et acheter du vin et des bieres pour l’aperitif chez IGA (a 200Metres). Le lendemain nous avons pris le petit dejeuner chez Tim Horton. (Juste à côté d’IGA et d’une station service)&#xA;Rien de transcendant mais un beau parking reposant...&#xA;&#xA;----------------------------------&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/73732 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="48.333250" lon="-89.211766">
  <ele>153.58355712890625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chippewa Park</name>
  <desc>Moderator Note: This place has seasonal closures.&#xA;......&#xA;Small park close to the lake with tables, baseball court, kids playground.&#xA;There are big parking lots and no signs that say &#34;no overnight parking&#34;.&#xA;Plus: cheap gas on the way.&#xA;&#xA;June 10, 2023 : 54$ for 1 night with services &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/73756 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
