 <wpt lat="49.776960" lon="-119.172550">
  <ele>1264.2861328125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hydraulic Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Very nice freed campground after a small distance (5km) on a forest road. The camping is well established with tables, firepits and pit toilets. It says it requieres a permit for day use but no one looks to check for that. Overnight camping is free for one night (or maybe more). Very easy to reach (the forest road is in very great conditions) and only 30 minutes from Kelowna. Next to a nice lake for sunset or stars observations. Highly recommanded.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/73845 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
