 <wpt lat="54.415710" lon="-126.632790">
  <ele>628.0098999036833</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shady Rest RV Park</name>
  <desc>This is a very nice Campground that is situated halfway between Prince George and Terrace.  Super clean bathrooms and an amazing Laundromat for guests. All the sites are level with dry camping, 15A or 30A sites. They are very dog friendly , but you still need to keep the Dog on a leach. If needed, you can take your dog to the backfield in the Park for an offleash playtime. They just ask that you clean up after your dog. The owner speaks German so we had a nice chat, and as we had a problem with our rental he helped us out and fixed the problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/73891 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
