  <name>Tempo Tags. Food, 24h gas and RV Park</name>
  <desc>Right beside the Sign Post Forest. $41.95 CAD/night full hookups. Showers cost 1 CAD for five minutes. No wifi. Coin operated laundry. When we stayed here they were about to close for the season (they will be open until the first big snows), but it seems like a good and convinient spot to stay when open. Quiet and calm. Diesel price was 1.419/l.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/74428 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
