  <time>2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to river</name>
  <desc>Great spot just off the road by the river with a fire pit. Some noise from traffic but mostly you hear the river.  Good for one night. &#xA;Even has some reception on Roger&#39;s.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/74650 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
