 <wpt lat="43.066695" lon="-79.071806">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dufferin Island Park</name>
  <desc>*Overnight parking/camping is NOT permitted at this location.&#xA;.....&#xA;Nice spot on a small parking lot next to the park. Restrooms available. Quiet place with very few cars during the night. 15mn walking to the falls... and Free !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/74693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
