 <wpt lat="48.513750" lon="-124.293475">
  <ele>195.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sombrio Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Very new rest stop with pit toilets, picnic tables, and trash.&#xA;&#xA;No overnight parking sign. &#xA;&#xA;Only a few spots big enough for large RVs.  Smaller campers would be fine in any parking spot.&#xA;&#xA;I managed to pull in some usable but slow Verizon 3g signal with our booster.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/74712 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
