  <ele>492.72216796875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dinosaur Lake</name>
  <desc>Nice Campground on a man made lake used as reservoir for a hydro electric dam.&#xA;Free during the winter but not maintained.&#xA;Has about 25 sites a large day use area and a boat launch.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
