 <wpt lat="50.315690" lon="-126.235200">
  <ele>300.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Eve River Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Highway rest area that has 5 or 6 RV paved pull-ins equipped with picnic tables. New toilets as of 2018. Short walk through the forest to the Eve River. Lovely spot in a deep valley surrounded by mountains. Far enough from the highway to be quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75832 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
