  <ele>19.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tanya Lake Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Parking lot for Tanya Lake that has a short hiking trail around the lake. Just on the outskirts of a subdivision, close to the highway so some noise. Nothing fancy but we stayed one night without problems. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75833 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
