 <wpt lat="53.540877" lon="-60.147468">
  <ele>49.13717269897461</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunday Hill Lookout</name>
  <desc>Beautiful view of lake Melville and the Mealy Mountains right before the lookout. Picnic table, garbage can and pit toilet beside. Down a bumpy gravel road but 4x4 probably not required&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75834 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
