  <ele>3.315790369685528</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quidi Vidi</name>
  <desc>Large open gravel lot next to Quidi Vidi. One other large RV here. To get here you go out of town and turn right over the river.&#xA;&#xA;You can walk to the Quidi Vidi brewery, so it’s a perfect place to camp on a Friday night, go to the kitchen party and stumble home!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75836 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
