  <ele>4.152889251708984</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cabot Trail towards Ingonish</name>
  <desc>This is a nice spot right by the water just outside of Baddeck at the start of the Cabot Trail. There’s spots right off the highway but if you go a little deeper down the gravel road, there’s a nice spot to pull out. A little noisy due to highway traffic but a good spot for the night &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75837 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
