  <ele>179.0</ele>
  <time>2023-01-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Homesite Creek Falls</name>
  <desc>Campground in a forest next to a creek. Thirty sites (some of them group sites). Free in the winter when only 5 sites are open.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/75839 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
