  <desc>Great place for an overnight stay. Access to the Tatachapica river. Some highway noise.  Quiet spots further down the logging road on the right at entrance &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76033 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
