  <ele>336.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Duke lake</name>
  <desc>Good road, about 5mins off Hwy. large site with lots of room for campers. Great site for overnight or a couple of nights. Right on the water. 10 mins from the watershed restaurant and esso gas station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76035 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
