  <ele>30.109963659197092</ele>
  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>A brand new Walmart. Very friendly staff. You have to ask permission but it&#39;s O.K.&#xA;---&#xA;Un nouveau Walmart tout neuf. Personnel très sympathique. Faut demander la permission mais c&#39;est O.K.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76306 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
