 <wpt lat="50.578721" lon="-111.900856">
  <ele>751.4</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brooks’ Walmart</name>
  <desc>We asked inside and as long as you park near the back of the parking lot. it’s fine to stay overnight. You can faintly hear the traffic and a train. Good for a night if you’re just passing through. Washrooms are at the entrance of the Walmart and there are restaurants nearby. The wifi is free but only works if you&#39;re closer to the front of the parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76385 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
