 <wpt lat="49.248441" lon="-122.911222">
  <ele>17.984480033628643</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burnaby Cariboo RV Park</name>
  <desc>This is a perfect place if you rent a motorhome.  You have all services,  incl. car-washing. Pool and sundeck. It is expensive -  75 C$ per night. be aware of the train noises throughout the night&#xA;&#xA;Wifi free with limited bandwith and time limits. otherwise paid (CAD $5)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76397 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
