  <name>Boulder Mountain Resort</name>
  <desc>The only year around open campground in Revelstoke. Nice facilities, nice owners. &#xA;Cabins, Full Service RV Sites, Walk-in Tenting, Dome Yurts, Power only RV Sites, Hot Tub, Laundry, Hot Showers, Dog Park, a Canteen and close to sled rentals plus hills. &#xA;Restaurants in town 4 km distance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/76662 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
