  <desc>Dead end of a small paved (Tickle Rd) road. Enough space for regular people to still turn around if a camper is parked there. 15 feet from the water. Super quiet. Had zero visitors. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/77064 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
