  <ele>45.53329883466584</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Car Park </name>
  <desc>We wanted to stay at the marina but a lady came and said it was private but that we could move on to the city car park (here). She said though, that if we stayed more than a day or 2 they would come and ask us to leave so we stayed 1 night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/77432 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
