  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Johnson lake provincial park</name>
  <desc>Camping at Johnson Lake East in Kamloops is a folksy camping site.it is on the eastern shore of Johnson Lake. The water is very clear in Johnson Lake allowing boaters (boating) to see quite far down. Fishing, canoeing and kayaking on the lake are folksy activities with campers (camping) and during the hot summer months many people like to swim in the water therefore who like swimming something cheers about it.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/77638 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
