  <desc>Easy access right off the Trans Canada Highway.  Overnight parking allowed in rear, behind casino. Need a overnight parking permit and member card of the casino. All free at reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/77822 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
