  <desc>It&#39;s a trailer park. Lot&#39;s of old units, WiFi only at the office and all sites pretty close to each other. The highway isn&#39;t as noisy as I thought it would be but still. You will hear it. All night long.&#xA;Reasonable rates in the off season though.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/78117 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
