 <wpt lat="60.781417" lon="-135.156283">
  <ele>729.4</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hippie Mechanic!</name>
  <desc>Stop. Is your van running good (or so ya think?}. Good. Stop here anyway, Dave and Jeremy can make it run better, and if they can&#39;t, then you will just have had a great time! A bit tricky to find, not on maps, google and doesn&#39;t have a name. Take the unpaved rd off the highway, first left, then right and the garage is right in front of you (at the right hand side corner of the premise). The garage door is white painted, there is a high fence running on the right hand side with lots of trucks and buses parked along it. The dog will play fetch with you until you can&#39;t anymore lol &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/82274 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
  <extensions>
