  <name>Queensland Beach Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Large gravel parking lot by the ocean. We stayed here in the off season without issue. Cars come and go, especially on weekends. Saw a police cruiser in the night doing a vehicle check but otherwise very quiet except for the sound of the crashing waves.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 13:16:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/82406 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
