  <name>Racing River II</name>
  <desc>Nice spot along the river with fire pits, rubbish bins (on the main parking) and fishing spots.&#xA;At KM 641 of the AK Highway on the northeast side of the bridge go on the parking place and ride further into the woods for some nice spots.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/83662 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
