  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc National d&#39;Oka</name>
  <desc>Camping with or without services, to choose. Also ready-to-camp.Park with beach, hiking trails, bike trails, cross-country skiing, snowshoeing. Historic site, Calvary of Oka. Summer sports and winter sports, kayaking, sailing, beach.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/85011 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
