  <ele>588.2466697692871</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canyon Creek Community Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice little campground with fire pits, picnic tables and a shelter with wood stove. &#xA;The sites are not for big RVs and look a bit uneven but not bad. The place is really beautiful, you can easily access the lake and have a nice view! &#xA;When we stayed there, a train past 2 times during the night on the really close train tracks and it was loud! Bring earplugs&#xA;It’s 20$ for RV and 10$ for tent. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/85657 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
