  <ele>254.5</ele>
  <time>2024-04-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peter Hope Lake rec. site </name>
  <desc>Really nice campground by a lake just up a forest road. There is a sign on highway 5A. &#xA;Firepits, picnic tables, pit toilets. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/85662 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
