  <ele>209.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin One Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>Absolutely stunning campground at Lillooet Lake. Pretty small, a few (maybe 5) sites are big enough for an RV. Nice beach at the campground with a boat ramp. Stunning view! Free in winter! &#xA;In season it‘s 13$ per night. &#xA;Firepits, picnic tables. &#xA;The road there is pretty rough but if you drive slow it’s ok. There are hotsprings an hour or so further. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/85673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
