  <time>2022-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking</name>
  <desc>40$ for 24 hrs. Parking lot very good situated to visit Toronto or the islands. It costs 25 cad for the day until 6AM the day after. We stayed for the night. It was relatively quiet for the situation. Length ok till 6 meters. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/87761 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
