 <wpt lat="45.850422" lon="-66.561337">
  <ele>24.54752207753672</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 19:21:57 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving 24 Truck Stop, Nevers Rd, Frederickton, NB</name>
  <desc>Very active gas station/truck stop/liquor store (beer, wine and spirits). Restaurant is open 6 am - 11 pm. We asked where to park and were directed to the employee parking lot (just passed the truck entrance sign). Large, flat lot. Suitable for any size rig. Despite all the trucks coming and going, this lot is quiet.  There is a sign for free Wi-Fi in the store but we did not try it.  The bathrooms are surprisingly nice. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 19:21:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/88060 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
