  <ele>4.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mira Gut Beach</name>
  <desc>Nice spot by open ocean. beach and toilets. picnic tables. fresh water river to wash up. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/88871 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
