 <wpt lat="49.678962" lon="-57.958379">
  <ele>4.881639052629603</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Green Point CG </name>
  <desc>Beautiful campground that&#39;s open year round. We were afraid that we might not be able to access it this time of year but we were lucky, after a tiny patch of snow several campsites were snow free. There was even an open pit toilet. Amazing views, quiet, trail nearby and beach access.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/89351 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
