 <wpt lat="51.004187" lon="-118.224429">
  <ele>517.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Revelstoke Rest Area</name>
  <desc>It’s a pullover on the righthand side before you cross the bridge on Hwy 1 into Revelstoke. There are pit toilets, dark, truckers stay there and can be loud with the trains at night. Limit your stay to only stay there at night and leave early (8hrs max for parking).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/89693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
