  <ele>44.0</ele>
  <time>2023-03-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tim Hortons</name>
  <desc>stayed for 2 nights. Some noise from the cars using drive through. wifi if you park close enough to the store. Be careful if you use the parking lot next to the furniture outlet as we saw a car get towed from there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-03-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/89697 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
