  <ele>21.45228385925293</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Montreal public swimming pool</name>
  <desc>Piscine Pierre-Lorange is a public swimming pool for FREE!  has a bit unusual opening hours (winter hours were once or twice a day for  1-1/2 hours), best check the website or call.&#xA;Great for those traveling in a van/car without shower...and you can get some exercise too.&#xA;bring your own lock.&#xA;library next door with free Wifi, street parking also available in case of need.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/89864 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
