  <time>2023-05-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Saint-Jean-sur-Richelieu (St-Luc)</name>
  <desc>Walmart parking. Other stores and parking near the Walmart with &#34;No overnight parking&#34; sign, but if you stay on the Walmart side it&#39;s okay. Quiet during the night. Toilet, water, restaurant: before the store close at 9pm.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/89920 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
