  <ele>253.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte Orford</name>
  <desc>Rest area with view on the mountains. Campers are welcome, trucks and cars too. 4 restaurants (Tim Hortons, Subway, Valentine and A&amp;W), gas station, toilet. A little bit noisy when trucks arrive or leave, but that&#39;s a really good spot to stay for the night or a power nap in the middle of the day.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/90026 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
