  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rec Center</name>
  <desc>This is open all year round! Rec center with a pool and showers. Shower is $2.50 CAD and pool is $9.50 CAD. Also has showers with private curtain (at least for the male side) Has a good drinking fountain at front desk to fill bottles. Parking is free, you get a token to get out of the parking lot after you pay to use the facility.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/90510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
