 <wpt lat="49.037616" lon="-123.902710">
  <ele>73.08277702331543</ele>
  <time>2022-12-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet Spot with Easy Access next to a frequented logging gate</name>
  <desc>There are a couple of spots on the side of the road where you can park for the night. Trucks drive by every now and then, but other than that it’s super quiet. There’s a gate in the road, it was closed when we arrived (7pm), but is open this morning. You can drive or hike to the suspended bridge &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-12-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/90871 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
