  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-01-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverview Rd</name>
  <desc>*Note negative User report.&#xA;.....&#xA;Very hard to see from the road, looks like a little spot to pull off the road. But if you drive further in , there is a secluded spot 50m of the road. Nothing special but free &amp; no one around you. If you&#39;re coming from Radium Hot Springs direction, it’s a few minutes just before Fairmount Springs on your right-hand side. &#xA;&#xA;Hope you find it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/91299 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
