 <wpt lat="50.447140" lon="-104.445540">
  <ele>580.3993878211247</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 11:28:34 UTC</time>
  <name>Buffalo Lookout Campground</name>
  <desc>This place is right next to the highway. It is $25 for tents. It has full washrooms with running water, WiFi(slow), fire pits (you can&#39;t bring outside wood, they sell it for $10), Coin laundry machines. There are free hot showers. &#xA;Call ahead to check if operational.  Phone: 306-525-1448&#xA;buffalolookout@gmail.com&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 11:28:34 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/91474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
