  <ele>24.09796142578125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Strongwater camping and cabins</name>
  <desc>20 pits, Some with electricity. Toilets and hot showers. Nice view over bay. Close to village Egmont and trail to Skookumchuck Narrows.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/91544 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
