  <ele>691.8514331759725</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Down Town RV</name>
  <desc>Gravel lot.  Very cramped space. Could hear next-door trailer&#39;s heater very clearly.  Full hookups.  Cost $47 per night which is steep but it is the Yukon.  Close to the signpost forest.  Toilets and showers nice and clean.  Also has laundry facilities. Internet 2x1h code free, you can buy more.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/91639 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
