  <ele>153.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Duck Lake </name>
  <desc>Campsite directly next to the Duck Lake. Nice view and not too far from town. Keep it clean. Firepit and Pit Toilet available but door is missing on toilet. Just off the gravel road; some deep and large potholes; small car with not enough clearance won’t be able to drive in there. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/92596 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
