  <ele>399.944091797</ele>
  <time>2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Thompson River Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Nice sites directly located next to the river. No hookups but a dumping station. Water not drinkable at the moment. Firepits and benches at every site. Pit toilets available. 23 CAD a night. Picknick dayuse area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/92727 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
