  <desc>Free tap water provided by the city. Used it to fill up our water jugs. Awesome facility, thanks Campbell River!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/92731 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
