  <desc>2hr free parking only. No overnight&#xA;&#xA;I&#39;m not sure if this place gets busy in tourist season, but we were the only ones here from 5pm all night in mid May. Very quiet, no signs saying you can&#39;t park, bins nearby. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/92894 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
