  <name>Yellowhead Campground &amp; RV Park</name>
  <desc>Great camping right next to Valemount. Wonderful sites, most of them with electricity and water. Around 25 CAD for tentsite. 30-35 CAD for RV sites. Hot water showers, sinks, running water toilets, ice, little kiosk and even laundry available. Bathroom very modern. Next to little lake.&#xA;Wifi available but speed depends on site you&#39;re on. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/92992 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
