  <desc>Highway 23 about 10km north of Revelstoke there is a dam with a boat launch about a kilometre beyond that. Not very flat, but pretty.  Enough room for my 19ft trailer to turn around. There are no &#39;no overnight&#39; parking signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93142 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
