  <name>Trout River Bridge</name>
  <desc>Nice place for an overnight stay. Directly at the river. Space for one RV, small additional space above, single car/van friendly. Road down is a little narrow and bumpy. Entrance from the highway is 300 meters south of the bridge.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93245 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
