  <time>2023-10-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Truro</name>
  <desc>There are signs saying No Overnight Parking but we just asked the customer service manager and they it is no problem and that we can ignore the signs so long as we don’t want to stay for a week or something. Must park out of the way by the garden centre. Lots of reviews in the AllStays app saying the same thing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93347 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
