  <ele>153.0189208984375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to MacKenzi River</name>
  <desc>Big place at MacKenzi River. Take the HWY Exit to the TerretorialPark/ Day use area and then immediatly take the small gravel road into the forest. The road itself is ok, but for the acces you probably need higher clearance. &#xA;Looks like it’s sometimes used for hunting. &#xA;&#xA;Pit toilets are availible at the day use area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93397 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
