  <name>Connors Bros</name>
  <desc>Quiet place with shelter!  The square is big enough to accommodate several cars.  There is a small trail behind that will allow you to go by the sea and make a loop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
