  <desc>Large lot beside old CP track. Looks like local youth meets here too.&#xA;&#xA;Near a gas station with restaurant and store, maybe toilets, didn&#39;t go there. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93509 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
