  <name>Rosebery Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Self registration campground in the middle of the forest next to river. Beautiful spots, especially close to the river. We paid $20 per night. Fire permit + wood available for $7. Stayed one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93605 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
