  <desc>Typical Provincial Park at Ottawa River, including dumping station. Showers were only slightly warm, maybe it&#39;s better at another building. The outlets for electricity are sometimes pretty far away from the sites, so a 10 m extension cord may be not enough.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93825 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
