  <ele>923.1195301745698</ele>
  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Alaska Highway</name>
  <desc>Great view, asphalted pull over. Close to road but traffic is at a minimum. View outweighs any noise distractions. &#xA;Great cell service from Bell, 4 bars!&#xA;If you want toilets you can have them along Alaska Highway toward west (another pull over). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93835 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
