  <ele>356.0006885415794</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside </name>
  <desc>look on satellite to have a better idea of how to get there&#xA;it look like a old road unused there&#39;s still pavement...  I think they use it to access the pipeline upper... &#xA;there&#39;s a pond near&#xA;there&#39;s grass so probably ok for a tent&#xA;good stop for a night &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93845 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
