 <wpt lat="49.805410" lon="-86.303760">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>logging road with lake</name>
  <desc>farther on the logging road on the middle of a bucherie..… there is place to park car or van or little RV or a tent or whatever you are traveling with!!! there is lake quite close with clear blue water and beaver... perfect for kayak and beaver tail degustation! wonderful place to admire the devastation of wood cutting!!! &#xA;&#xA;there&#39;s &#34;thé du Labrador&#34; to.... &#xA;&#xA;pass the sand pit... &#xA;keep left at the fork...&#xA;continue for couple min...&#xA;there you are!!!&#xA;check satellite for more info &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93846 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
