  <desc>Husky truck stop with great showers. Good pressure, toilet in the same room, clean. Restaurant and gas. 7,35$ for the shower, but free with the points of the loyalty card Husky (each fill of $100 gives me 2 showers). Bring your own towel because the price is double if a towel is needed..&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/93909 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
