 <wpt lat="50.068760" lon="-115.508676">
  <ele>1225.877659744043</ele>
  <time>2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Creekside - Forest Service Road</name>
  <desc>Right off the road, spaces for a couple of vehicles beside the bridge crossing the river. A few fire pits, amazing views. Bigger rigs could park here but it&#39;s a rough road up.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94010 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
