 <wpt lat="49.695994" lon="-116.919529">
  <ele>631.1794090270996</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Balfour-Kaslo-Galena Bay Hwy </name>
  <desc>As you come around the corner there is a flat area right next to a roaring river, this area is close to the road but the sound of the river overrides any road noise. We did check out Fletcher falls for a boon dock but decided the road was to close for traffic, we did however have a delicious burger at Fletcher Fries opposite the pin for Fletcher falls, and then came back here and enjoyed the view and beautiful sound of a river.  There is cell service but it is hit and miss. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
