  <ele>359.02390851123494</ele>
  <time>2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild goose campground </name>
  <desc>Nice camping near a lake. Very quiet and not expensive for : fire pit, wifi,camping table,hot shower and the view. We payed 25+ Tx ( no services).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94022 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
