  <name>Moon beam information center</name>
  <desc>Information center &#xA;Drinking Water available &#xA;Pic nic table &#xA;Electricity &#xA;No « no overnight sign »&#xA;WiFi available around the center &#xA;Toilet inside, not available out of working hours &#xA;Free bicycle renting &#xA;36 km walking trail around&#xA;&#xA;We didn’t spend the night there&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
