  <desc>Established campground by the lake with fire rings, free firewood, pit toilet. There&#39;s a day use/picnic area next to it that&#39;s on the lake as well. Has phone signal.&#xA;$20 night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94234 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
