  <ele>595.7256736755371</ele>
  <time>2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Box lake campground</name>
  <desc>Down a beautiful forest lane, right next to the lake. We stayed in #9 and had a small private beach next to a babbling brook. Fire pits and picnic tables at campsites and cedar logs (self split) avail for small fee. $12 CAD per night. None of the sites seem big enough for a huge rig, but our 4Runner and small trailer fit great. Near Nakusp for supplies. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94277 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
