 <wpt lat="49.345518" lon="-121.706078">
  <ele>228.70463562</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hicks Lake</name>
  <desc>Camping area right next to Hicks Lake. Day use area, pit toilets, water available but needs to be boiled at the moment, fire pits and benches. Over 50 sites available. Price 23 CAD per night and gets collected by BC Park Operators, which come by multiple times a day. They also sell firewood and ice. Credit cards accepted. Hikes around lake possible. Pets need to be on a leash. Road gets bumpy at some point but no need for 4x4. Mature forest. Lots of shade available in summer.  Hosts are not usually present.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94392 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
