  <desc>Big, public parking lot in Yellowknife Old Town.  Not very pretty, and noisy, but you can stay for 72h for free. It’s also a parking lot for boat trailers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94402 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
