  <name>Martin Riverside Camp</name>
  <desc>Aug 2019 - washed out by heavy rains, and I couldn’t go down with my ClassB 4x4 &#xA;&#xA;Beautiful place next to Martin River. Near the highway, but very quiet. Some old firepits. Narrow access, but big place. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94403 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
