 <wpt lat="49.574790" lon="-125.609810">
  <ele>363.5041160583496</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot for nearby hikes</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot by the start of several hiking trails. We parked here the night before an 8 hour hike up the Phillips Ridge Trail. The road to it goes through a mine and you have to check in with security at the entrance. They ask roughly when you’re planning to leave and take your licence plate so they know to call search and rescue if you haven’t returned, which is really great to know as there are a lot of hiking trails in the area. Security had no problem with us staying overnight here and I’m assuming wouldn’t have if we wanted to stay a few days. The mine has free WiFi which you can connect to at the edge of the parking lot, an unexpected bonus as we had no cell signal anywhere in Strathcona Park. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94502 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="42.848470" lon="-80.287140">
  <ele>725.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>WalMart</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: Permission to camp here seems to vary: see check-ins and ask permission. Please report when refused.&#xA;&#xA;Parked as far from the store as possible, near a RV. Quiet night, but there is some road noise from Route 3. Not a 24/7 WalMart.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94578 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
