 <wpt lat="49.253060" lon="-53.493125">
  <ele>22.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Along the beach</name>
  <desc>Beautiful strip of land with water on either side. several places to park mixed in with locals who have left their old RVs in some spots. Nice sandy beach on one side and walking trails/4 wheeler trails to explore. Reached by a gravel road past the cemetery. Go slow due to pot holes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94582 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
