  <ele>21.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beachside</name>
  <desc>A picnic area next to the road with great views and a rock beach. 25 ft. or smaller rvs as the parking lot is small. next to the road but very little traffic. beautiful view of surrounding islands. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94676 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
