 <wpt lat="49.939448" lon="-121.466516">
  <ele>199.0951805114746</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Large turnout off highway</name>
  <desc>Huge gravel turnout off highway. Stayed one night, as did another truck. Could hear road noise periodically, but not bad at all. Beautiful views!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/94822 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
