 <wpt lat="46.478678" lon="-62.140154">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Campbells Cove</name>
  <desc>Campground at road #16, in the east. Perfect location, directly boarding sea and beach. 2way sites, 3way sites, unserviced sites, cabins. Open from end of May. CAD 30,50 incl tax for 2way.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95071 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
