  <ele>160.11501067504287</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc Pierre Brochu</name>
  <desc>nice place to stop for a sleep. quiet at night. On the side of the Matapedia lake. clean and roomy&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95150 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
