  <desc>There is a water fountain, outdoor showers and toilets near the beach.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95168 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
