 <wpt lat="50.230873" lon="-112.925099">
  <ele>850.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Bow Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice, big campground in Provincial Park. Has serviced, unserviced and group sites. There&#39;s a little beach and a playground.&#xA;We were the only ones here, besides a group of deer. At the moment there is no water available, so no showers either.&#xA;In high season I think you have to make a reservation, but now it&#39;s self registration.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95182 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
