  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Writing-On-Stone Campground</name>
  <desc>Pretty private campsites. Self-register until somewhere in May. Showers were still closed for the season, not all toilets were open.&#xA;Nice location, you walk straight onto the campground from the hoodoos.&#xA;Winter season unserviced $29.00&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95183 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
