 <wpt lat="49.827371" lon="-96.977305">
  <ele>233.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Town and Country Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice place if you want to stay near the city and not in a Walmart parking lot. Sites are not very private, but all have a table and a fire pit. It&#39;s mostly RVs and trailers and I think a lot of them are here very longer periods of time.&#xA;Non serviced site $33.60.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95186 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
