 <wpt lat="46.015411" lon="-81.402602">
  <ele>129.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>George Lake Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice campground on the lake. Several walking trails from the campground. In the middle of Killarney Provincial Park. Some sites are very private others less. We stayed at site 42 and had access to a big, flat rock overlooking the lake.&#xA;In summer season reservations are highly recommended, but there are about 10 non-reservable sites. Price for a van was about $37.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
