 <wpt lat="45.144884" lon="-71.799275">
  <ele>207.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-25 07:40:56 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc De La Gorge De Coaticook </name>
  <desc>Nice big campground. It looks very nice for families and kids. There&#39;s a lot of hiking trails from the campground.&#xA;&#xA;TIP: if you plan to do the suspension bridge and camping here. Register first, because the admission for the bridge is included in the price (Bridge is $8).&#xA;&#xA;The campground is a bit expensive, $40 for an unpowered site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-25 07:40:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95189 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
