  <desc>Haven&#39;t used them myself, but they are working and looked very clean. $1 for 5 min.&#xA;There&#39;s toilets and picnic tables too.&#xA;The parking in front is unfortunately requiring payment as well. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95190 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
