  <ele>2.7456241970271655</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lighthouse Road</name>
  <desc>There is no overnight parking at the Lighthouse, but there are spots along the road (on the side) for vehicles to park for the night by the shore... sunset and sunrise on the water, beautiful. We spent the night with no problems. **Keep an eye on the wind forecast, the bridge to get here is tall and gets cross winds. Big rigs could get here, but be cautious as the roads are narrow and old (I think the Lighthouse at the end of the road is the only good turn around spot.)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
