 <wpt lat="48.700660" lon="-89.517838">
  <ele>425.1609764099121</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dog Lake </name>
  <desc>A free site on public land on the beach at Dog Lake. Much nicer than the Silver Falls campground located nearby and it is free instead of $31.50CDN. May be soft sand. We backed in off the road with our large truck camper on a 4x4 dually. Water is clear and clean.  Good beach for swimming. Some cottages nearby and are used to having people camp here. A nice breeze today so no bugs. We needed to use our cell phone booster to get cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95570 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
