  <desc>Large yet secluded camping park along the river.  Non powered sites on the “island” are great with fire ring and picnic tables.  Lots of grass for the kids and a playground too.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 21:20:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95785 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
