  <ele>12.539639863855633</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cabot Beach Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Nice, large campground close to cliff and sea. We checked in on their first day of season and they weren&#39;t quite fully prepared (no wifi pw at hand, some washrooms closed, etc). But it&#39;s a nice place, with huge lawns and meadows. Province should provide some funds for renovation of washrooms. Used Starlink so no opinion on site WiFi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
