  <ele>2.996343955397606</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chez les Maury</name>
  <desc>Camping à la ferme. Camping at the farm. Simple, nice, clean place. Wifi works only outside close to the house. They grow grapes here, and blueberrys. Has own small beach. Degustation of farm products possible. RV friendly. Price usually include tasting&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
