 <wpt lat="49.041897" lon="-122.816870">
  <ele>134.1024627685547</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>South Surry </name>
  <desc>We stayed here for one night without any problems. It&#39;s a big parking area for the park and sport center. No one will notice you. Parked at the very left side next to a tree. You can also go for a walk in the park. There are toilets, drinking water station and showers inside of the art center building as also in the ice hockey arena. In both building there is wifi, but it doesn&#39;t reach out to the parking area. Can recommend it. Not many cars passing by. Small kiosk on the side. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/95990 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
