 <wpt lat="48.150533" lon="-65.846392">
  <ele>4.851205009801355</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping de la Pointe Taylor</name>
  <desc>Belongs to the provincial park. Large campground, nice and freshly done. Washrooms all new, nice and clean. Wifi works only in open spaces. 2way sites in wooded terrain, others in the open. Access to a wild beautiful beach and a nice municipal park (playground). Small shopping with daily needs nearby. Camping has small playground, too. Very nice place, a bit pricey but it&#39;s worth. 2way site CAD 45.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
