  <time>2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Anderson Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Quiet, secluded sites down by the river.  Full hook up available, clean bathrooms, friendly staff.  You’ll hear the trains, but that’s true of anywhere near the main highway in this canyon.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
