  <time>2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>Walmart parking lot in Marystown&#xA;Lot is pretty level, quite at night. Store open from 8:00 am to 10:00 pm for use of toilets. &#xA;We asked at customer service if it was ok to park for the night. &#xA;There is a No Frills grocery store close by.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96175 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
