 <wpt lat="66.914470" lon="-136.348230">
  <ele>472.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rock River - Dempster Highway</name>
  <desc>Nice big area by the Rock River. We camped literally 10 feet from the water. 3 other vehicles that we met on the road previously ended up camping with us. Tons of room, so we all had our private areas separated by scrubby trees. You can be seen from the road, but there are trees that give you decent privacy. Sheltered from the wind, which is rare for this area of the Dempster. Lots of moose droppings, so keep an eye out.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
