 <wpt lat="50.798447" lon="-121.611371">
  <ele>863.1202764130958</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild Camping </name>
  <desc>For a cyclist, brave motorbike or 4x4. From the gravel road climb up the hill by a steep &#34;abandoned&#34; trail. At the first corner I found a flat spot on the left. Up the hill there is more light at sunset. Plenty of wood to make a  fire.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96213 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
