  <name>Trout Lake road</name>
  <desc>Big open space under some power lines 2km from hwy 101. Easily accessible. &#xA;It looks like a place some locals would use for drinking and partying. Watch for nails and glass. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96319 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
