  <ele>342.67088003108415</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Duck lake</name>
  <desc>A little spot for van or little camper close to boat landing near the lake. Good for one night to break a long day driving. Pit toilet old. Don’t park in the middle of the way! There is plenty of wild camping spot along thé road 101.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
