  <ele>911.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off the road by the river</name>
  <desc>Nice space to camp for a night or 2. One manmade fire ring and no facilities.&#xA;Pack out what you bring in. No Bins available!&#xA;Next to the river and far enough from the highway that noise is no issue.&#xA;Not big rig friendly but vans, trucks and smaller vehicles would be fine.&#xA;It is very rocky so not very tent friendly.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96466 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
