 <wpt lat="47.763829" lon="-59.313490">
  <ele>3.383603096008301</ele>
  <time>2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shoal Point Beach Camping </name>
  <desc>Quiet and beautiful spot in the beach just outside a small community. Very friendly locals who told us is was fine to go off-road the beach and camp. They also showed us where high tide was so we’d be safe (either in grass or next to it) and shared some beer. We went through some soft sand and had to lower tire pressure. 4x4 required. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96528 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
