  <ele>138.2</ele>
  <time>2023-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Campsite - Azelus</name>
  <desc>Free campsite at Azelus&#39;s place. He&#39;ll host you close to the river inside the woods. No amenities but peacful place with good vibes!1&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96560 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
