  <ele>1059.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jasper Fitness &amp; Aquatic CenterMunicipality - culture and recreation centre (with showers)</name>
  <desc>Hot unlimited showers clean. 4.54pp. it’s next to fitness centre. Walk up to counter and pay. They open doors to showers for you  which are on one floor lower Level . They were empty when we visited on Saturday afternoon after couple of days roughing in np and wapiti was full. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
