 <wpt lat="61.703358" lon="-135.938860">
  <ele>644.9854736328125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Lakes Government Campground </name>
  <desc>By a beautiful lake. There are 6-8 campsites facing lake, the last of which we got. We were here early. The rest of the place is normal government campground stuff. Pit toilets were clean, hand water pumps were not working, cooking shelter and plenty of firewood. Sites have trees around so decent privacy. Self registration CD 12$.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
