  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moose Creek Yukon Campground</name>
  <desc>Yukon government campground with big sites, good privacy, fireplace, picnic table. Few trails from campground to and around Moose Creek. 20$ Cdn/night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96574 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
