  <ele>933.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Recreation Site. Surprise Lake</name>
  <desc>One spot on the hill, easy to come there, and four spots down at the lake, but only for smaller and 4x4 RV&#39;s. Picnic tables, Pit toilets, fire places. Very quiet and beautiful. No fee.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96580 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
