  <ele>460.7</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>riverbed camp </name>
  <desc>Beautiful place at the river. Close to the Highway, but not much traffic at night. Easy access, but a little bit narrow. With our van it was no problem. Should be ok for pick-up campers and SUVs. Many mosquitos. Lots of firewood. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96585 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
