  <desc>Basic campground, 23$ per night (+11$ for a second vehicle, 2 vehicles allowed per pitch). Pitches are private with a lot of trees. The campground is right next to the lake and there are several hiking trails starting from the campground. Some washrooms are pit toilets (smells really bad) and some are flushing toilets (way better!)&#xA;There are no showers and no cell coverage either. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/96954 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
