 <wpt lat="48.674509" lon="-53.083920">
  <ele>11.348943017733141</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dungeon Provincial Park lookout </name>
  <desc>Amazing views on the pull offs of Lance Cove road. We picked one of the farthest out spots. Incredible spot that you wouldn’t be able to stay in other countries. Multiple small RVs were parked along the road. Suitable for small rigs. Kids will have to stay inside because the cliffs are dangerous. We used rocks on the wheels for extra caution. ATT has LTE signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97092 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
