  <ele>352.61962890625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Naramata Center Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground in the town of Naramata. some serviced and non-serviced sites spread around a nice treed block. Half are pet friendly. Portapotties around the grounds with a full bathroom with showers and laundry at the center. It&#39;s a nice location for being right in Naramata.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
