  <time>2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bear Lake Crooked River Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Large campground with mixed sizes of sites. About half are reservable and half first come. On a small peaceful lake. No service at site but drinking water and a $5 dump station available. Hot shower for $1.  Cost is $ 22.00 a night. 9 km of hiking trails in the area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
