 <wpt lat="49.438519" lon="-123.606421">
  <ele>278.7086181640625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Elphinstone Parking</name>
  <desc>Super nice spot in the forest. Hiking and MTB (mountain bike) parking. Be considerate to other users and keep it clean and wild! Must be creative to be fully level, but totally doable. Nice creek running by, informal campfire with a bench. Access is on a well graded gravel road. Spotty cell signal. Totally 5 stars!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97289 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
