  <ele>285.18804931640625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sechelt Overlook / Coast Gravity Park</name>
  <desc>Large pullout off the &#34;dusty road&#34;, accessing the Sechelt landfill and the Coast Gravity MTB (mountain bike) park. Good views of the ocean and the inlet. Looks like a place that local use for fire &amp; beers. Hence, it has a bit of trash. The next pullout, 100ft further up, is cleaner, but smaller. Both of them have fire pits. No toilets or water, but strong LTE signal. 8pm and it&#39;s already quiet!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97290 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
