  <name>Lake Embarras</name>
  <desc>Stayed July 21 and the bugs were out pretty heavy. The sites are just off a nice beach with clear water. We were bothered by loud fisherman late into the night with lots of large RVs with expensive boats that are parked on that same beach. Nice place otherwise and has outhouse &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
