  <name>Gleneagles Community Center </name>
  <desc>Community center with free showers!&#xA;Super clean showers with hot water! Location is on the second floor of the community center to the right. free parking &#xA;&#xA;Cost for gym is $6.&#xA;&#xA;VERY clean!! It’s like NEW!&#xA;Hours are: &#xA;Mon-Thurs 6am-9pm&#xA;Fri until 8pm and on weekend until 6pm&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97460 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
