  <ele>672.96875</ele>
  <time>2023-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Latch Hills FSR w/ View - Above Town of Canoe</name>
  <desc>Using the Larch Hills FSR I found this spot with a pretty nice view. Good for a night. It’s a pull out on the road so I wouldn’t stay longer, there is a fire ring like many spots along the road. I kept driving in hopes to get a sliver of a view and maybe a wider bit of road for more safety, found it here. Got to take is a lovely sunset. Sadly there is some trash, seems common here, ugh. the ground isn’t level but was okay for a night of car camping. Thought I’d submit this so people know about the view. Not sure what’s higher up. Full bars Rogers 3G.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97621 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
