 <wpt lat="63.019518" lon="-136.468057">
  <ele>661.808099401</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peninsula at NN Lake</name>
  <desc>Easy accessible space for small and big riggs with the lake around you. Some walking area to the Peninsula&#39;s peak. Transparent birch wood around the quiet and sunny place. Some fire rings and wood (yellow burning birch!) available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97624 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
