  <ele>625.4809657580096</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Outdoor pool by Kingsman sports center</name>
  <desc>Pool with showers during the summer. Free parking. During the rest of the year you can go to the sports center and pay a daily fee of $9 to use the whole facility.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97638 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
