  <ele>23.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Esquimalt Recreation Centre</name>
  <desc>You can use the shared pool showers for #$ CAD. The facility only costs 2$ if you use it after 9 p.m. (and probably early in the morning). There are private showers!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97655 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
