  <ele>53.11426161558732</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Car pool spot</name>
  <desc>Quiet car pool spot with a box for books Library. Stay a night. &#xA;You can Boondock on the other side of the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
