 <wpt lat="47.540447" lon="-77.140039">
  <ele>375.69091796875</ele>
  <time>2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rivière-des Outaouais</name>
  <desc>Small, beautiful place close to an established campground. This place is very close to the river and sadly also very close to the road. &#xA;Lot of fishermen use this place to launch their boat during the summer months.&#xA;There is one picnic table and no one is going to bother you if you spend the night there.&#xA;None or very poor cellular connection. Easy way in and out.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97761 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
