 <wpt lat="44.016140" lon="-66.157840">
  <ele>6.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach-Site </name>
  <desc>Very nice location directly at the sea-shore. And on the side is a freshwater river with a small sandy beach. Existing firering in an sheltered spot at the river. It is a windy spot but this is Nova Scotia.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97872 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
