 <wpt lat="45.774653" lon="-80.506024">
  <ele>86.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River Haven Resort</name>
  <desc>This seems to be part trailer park, part seasonal campers. Accepts overnighters, too. Great quiet spot on a beautiful river, where you may swim. Pretty well kept, good wifi, washrooms rustic but clean and functioning. If you are short of something to read there&#39;s quite a library to chose from. Open grounds, little moskitos. Unexpensive, we payed 36 $ for a serviced site.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97899 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
