 <wpt lat="50.631260" lon="-96.995750">
  <ele>218.71299934387207</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sobey’s</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot at Soney’s, asked the manager for a night stay and said their was no problem. Parking authorized as far as possible in the front parking. Large cut grass piece of land form pets. &#xA;Train track about 33 metres, 100 feet from parking. &#xA;Next to husky and circle K, Rona, beer store. &#xA;Lot’s of business downtown Gimli, easily accessible by bicycle or walk. Beautiful charming town. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97908 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
