  <ele>588.8959972515376</ele>
  <time>2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> By-Mac Park</name>
  <desc>The most beautiful riverside camping. Great kayak launch. Pit toilets. Good cellular reception. Easy access road but watch for logging trucks!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97991 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
