  <ele>1404.36669921875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Meadow near river</name>
  <desc>This is a beautiful meadow far away from the trunk road but near the river. Several fire pits and room for a big crowd but you will need a high clearance vehicle to get in. Worth it! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/97995 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
