  <ele>1285.7104999398393</ele>
  <time>2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Willow Rock</name>
  <desc>Cute campground, a little noisy because of the highway. Cooking shelter, clean flush toilets, showers (tokens for $3 per 5min can be bought). Powered and non-powered sites. For tents and RVs. Fire pits and picnic tables. $31 for an unserviced site, $39 for power.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98019 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
