  <ele>14.15636338059801</ele>
  <time>2022-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping de la Mer</name>
  <desc>Nice Campground right at the beach of the St. Lawrence, all amenities, fast WiFi.&#xA;Homemade bread at the counter available.&#xA;Cheaper than Camp Boreal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98028 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
