  <ele>175.8453369140625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Earl Rowe Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Provincial park with camping, ~$42 for a non-electrical site. Not as quiet as some parks, can hear the road from the campsites but also next to a river so the sound of that is really nice. Definitely not as well maintained as some parks either, dog excrement was along the sides of some of the sites. Firefly show made for an awesome evening!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
