  <ele>19.917437582610308</ele>
  <time>2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rocky Pond Park</name>
  <desc>It was way to windy to camp by the beach so we backtracked to this small park with a playground. No signs about parking or hours. A little creek runs along side the playground. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98084 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
