 <wpt lat="50.229734" lon="-99.455179">
  <ele>351.8070141448975</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lions riverbend campground</name>
  <desc>Town operated campground &#xA;Reasonable rates, daily or weekly. Full service for 28$. Next to city park, beautiful landscape and trees, river.  18 hole golf and swimming pool nearby. Fishing?... maybe. Playground for kids. Firewood at front office. &#xA;We spent one night, very calm and peaceful. &#xA;(204)476-7676&#xA;Hot free showers, incredibly clean!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98100 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
