 <wpt lat="50.678650" lon="-120.323370">
  <ele>316.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 16:11:54 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping by Pioneer Park</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: WARNING! Thefts and vandalism reported in this location. Please use caution.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;There are 2 parking lots. 1 belongs to Pioneer Park. We didnt stay there because its gated and a sign says closed by 11pm. There is another parking lot right beside (no gate, no signs about no overnight parking, but there is a bylaw sign saying boat trailers only). We stayed in our camper van for 1 night. Nobody bothered us. There is a railways very close but 1 train passed by 11pm another sometime in the morning which didnt make much noise. Close by there is a small brewery walking distance 14 mins. Washrooms and potable water in the pioneer park right beside this spot.&#xA;&#xA;Parking possible on Front Street right beside Tennis Building and Old Cemetery that is a park! Use caution here as there’s been stolen property off vans here. Lock everything up. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 16:11:54 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98110 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
