  <ele>492.76263427734375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ossokmanuan Reservior</name>
  <desc>A large gravel pit, currently not active, but right on a small part in of the Ossokmanuan Reservoir. Drive to the very back of the site to be near the water and away from the highway.  A natural water source is close by but it is very steep from the site to the water. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
