  <name>Superior St, Victoria</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s free from 5pm to 8 am! I stayed here for one night without any problems. Sign says from 8 am to 5 pm residential parking only. But you don&#39;t need a permit for that and no one is really checking it. I asked around. But own risk! ;). You can stay for the night for sure just day parking is on own risk. It&#39;s close to downtown and quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98157 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
