  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="68.333284" lon="-133.655313">
  <ele>39.765869140625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jàk Territorial Park Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground with RV and tent campsite.&#xA;Nice and clean showers. Electricity is available.&#xA;Price is 23.65$ for basic site.&#xA;$25 firewood.&#xA;No Wifi.&#xA;Drinking water available. To refill your RV, you need to go to the other campground in town (Free).&#xA;We shared the site with our friend, so 2 camper vans per site seems to be ok.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98454 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
