  <ele>29.263080596923828</ele>
  <time>2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Rest area by the side of the road. Flushing toilets and garbage cans available. Near a train track as well as the road so can be a little loud running up to midnight but didn’t hear much after that. NOT OPEN IN WINTER. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98456 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
