  <ele>470.9914649403408</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lodge Lake Park (before was:Highway 17 Rest Stop with Beautiful Lake</name>
  <desc>As the title says there is a beautiful Lake with lily pads and a rest stop beside. Picnic tables, toilets, lots of room for cars and a separate area for big rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98494 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
