  <ele>855.0417586317975</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Side of north Klondike river</name>
  <desc>Small site for one van or one tent between the road and the river. In the trees. Ok for one night possibility of fishing. Moose tracks. There is a other site further 100m if you don’t mind going to branches.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98496 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
