  <ele>753.24531489512</ele>
  <time>2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>On lake shore with great view</name>
  <desc>Instead of going left to the campground go straight down to the lake/river. Lots of spaces for free and beautiful. &#xA;We are here with a 23ft RV, no problems for us. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98514 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
