  <time>2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>&#39;Ksan Campground</name>
  <desc>Spacious Campground, some shady places, clean ablutions, close to a picturesque river and near a historical village with totems.&#xA;Fire Ring and benches available.&#xA;25C$ pn for40 full hookups. Showers 1 loony. Free wifi. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98515 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
