  <desc>This platform for 1-3 small cars is located centrally opposite the Salmon Glacier and is less crowded than the &#34;official&#34; viewing point. No facilities. Spectacular view.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98621 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
