  <time>2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brigus Head Path Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Parking of the East Coast Trail, at the south trailhead of the Brigus Head Path. Gravel. On the side of Harveys Gulch. Located on the community of Admiral&#39;s Cove, so few houses nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
