  <ele>137.05434109102515</ele>
  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parry Sound</name>
  <desc>At the Harbour. Gravel parking lot of the Island Queen Cruise. Overnight is permitted by this company, costs 10 $. Night between 11 p.m and 6 a.m was very quiet. There were noisy freight trains at 11 p.m and 6 a.m. It&#39;s a nice place. There is a sign about the overnight parking rule - photo enclosed.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98764 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
