  <desc>Nice beach with room for many RV 8 KM south of town. 2 bench park and a picnic table. Garbage dumpster available. Lake is many miles long. Take Duchesneau street from Fermont drive south 7.5km on a gravel road passing some gravel pits. A few white signs on the way. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98766 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
