  <desc>Swimming pool, shower for $5.75CAD. Clean place. Climbing wall available for extra. Fast internet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98773 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
