 <wpt lat="50.675181" lon="-120.312153">
  <ele>347.3696517944336</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Exhibition Park. Baseball Fields Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Large, open parking lot in Exhibition Park, next to the baseball fields. In a seemingly decent neighborhood. Railroad close by might cause some restlessness. Restroom located across the street. Got here at about 8:30pm and no one was around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98782 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
