 <wpt lat="54.229256" lon="-130.289319">
  <ele>26.04486083984375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 12:11:53 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinickinick Campground</name>
  <desc>About 25 sites with electricity at site with various space for drive through and small camper. Showers in the office building. The campground is well known to boaters because there is a lot of facilities to clean the boat and the cooling system.&#xA;Atmosphere reminds a little bit of wild west. Everything works and is clean but a little bit run down.&#xA;Very nice and helpful people.&#xA;In 2019the place was to be sold.&#xA;26C$ pn with electricity 28C$ pn.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 12:11:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98786 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
