 <wpt lat="50.653856" lon="-120.366041">
  <ele>622.1461410522461</ele>
  <time>2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dollarama, Starbucks, Rexal etc, Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Stayed here for a couple of nights while we waited to see a mechanic. No signs saying you can’t park overnight. A back section of the parking lot does not allow parking for more than 2hrs. You will get some highway noise. 1 other rig here &amp; some cars. Anytime fitness, if you’re a member. Bathrooms &amp; Wifi at Starbucks. &#xA;There’s an office here so if you’re staying overnight on a week day, you’ll likely get some odd looks in the morning. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98798 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
