  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gatheralls Hill Parking</name>
  <desc>A gravel parking on the side of North Side Road in Calvert. Viewpoint on Calvert Bay and Gut Pond.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98822 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
