 <wpt lat="49.732357" lon="-114.886572">
  <ele>1141.4087991714478</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Prestige Cleaners</name>
  <desc>Tired run down laundry in down town Sparwood. Half of the machines don’t work (the other half do) wash C$2.50,  dryers take quarters. &#xA;Open 8 till 8. Dry Clean Tues to Fri 11 till 4. There’s not much in the way of seating and no electricity sockets to charge phones. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98840 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
