 <wpt lat="46.691412" lon="-53.401285">
  <ele>42.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Powles Head Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Just before you reach the lighthouse there is a fairly well wind-protected site behind a high earth wall on the left. Existing fire ring (bring your wood) otherwise no infrastructure. Nice view of the sea and the lighthouse. There are several more sites with nice views but some with less wind protection on the way to the lighthouse. Gravel parking adjacent to the Powles Head Lighthouse. Viewpoint for Trepassey Bay.  4 bars connection TELUS.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98897 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
