  <ele>4.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area </name>
  <desc>Small picnic area on the edge of the fjord. Two tables and gravel parking below the road. we stayed there several nights intermittently without being disturbed. very nice view. No signs of forbidden camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98934 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
