  <desc>Parking lot right off main road, near Graymont Quarry entrance. Toilets in Gap Lake day area a couple of minutes drive from here. Nothing much else other than parking place. Reception not the best. Dump and water outside the campgrounds east around 20 mins.  You could have a pretty view of the mountains.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/98978 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
