 <wpt lat="51.629510" lon="-56.703430">
  <ele>2.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pinware River Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>The park lies on a narrow strip of land between the river and the sea and has a nice campground and a day-use/picnic  area. 9 pull-through sites, separated by trees and bushes, along the road to the day-use area on the seaside with a long sandy beach. The campground with about 20 additional sites was still closed due to snow. No hookups but a dumping station. Sanitary block with flush toilets and hot showers as well as a laundry room with washer and dryer (75 cents each) next to park entrance. Free WiFi in the same area. Campsites are a few hundred meters away and have several pit toilets. Not much to do except relaxing and fishing. As in many other places, black flies were a nuisance. $27.15/night incl.  taxes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99220 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="51.182861" lon="-115.578532">
  <ele>1457.260313551354</ele>
  <time>2024-04-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Showers</name>
  <desc>5$ Shower at the fenland recreation center, been there a multiple times,&#xA;Showers are available in certain time windows, sat+sun 8-14 pm eg, mon-fri 10 am Till 8 pm. On weekends it closes at 2pm&#xA;Go to the reception and just ask for showers&#xA;Payable cash and credit card, towels available too but you have to pay for them.&#xA;Then you get a Private room with a key for it, electricity on site and potable water.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99265 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
