  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Tim Horton &amp; McDonald&#39;s truck yard. Friendly overnight parking for overlander&#39;s with rest room @ the Tim Horton &amp; 24/7 food service @ both restaurant. Quiet if you can stand truck refer sound.&#xA;make sure you understand that all service&#39;s are provided by both restaurant.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99270 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
