  <ele>311.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-13 02:27:39 UTC</time>
  <name>Falcon Lakeshore Campground</name>
  <desc>This campground belongs to Whiteshell Prov. Park. It&#39;s one of 3 campgrounds in the park. Nice place on the lake. Busy in summer. Grass, trees, beach, lake. Some noise from Hwy 1, but not too bad. Showers 1$. Electrical site 20$ + park fee.&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-13 02:27:39 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99389 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
