  <ele>1118.3111642140427</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 09:01:03 UTC</time>
  <name>Sparwood Recreation Centre with showers</name>
  <desc>Some great rec facilities including outside aqua park for kids, skateboard, mountain biking and trails system. Inside there is a pool, squash courts and weights room. I went for a shower - C$2.75, a real bargain. If you’re lucky you’ll get the private shower room.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 09:01:03 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99412 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
