 <wpt lat="45.069327" lon="-67.038492">
  <ele>9.432868678083096</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oceanfront Campsite</name>
  <desc>Campsite directly on the beach (at the end of the lovely town). There is a quiet road between. WiFi not free - extra charge even at fully serviced sites! Nice showers. Not cheap (first beach line CAD 54) - there are sites back for CAD 40. The sites are close together - okay for 1 night. No washroom access except for tenters or if requested in person.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99456 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
