  <name>Peanut Hill</name>
  <desc>Fully serviced good sized sites. Strong wifi throughout. Late night self check in available. $40 for the night. Laundry &amp; clean bathrooms with showers also available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
