 <wpt lat="51.041695" lon="-118.217278">
  <ele>439.43922424316406</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside -  Colombia River</name>
  <desc>*Overnight parking/camping is NOT permitted at this location.&#xA;.....&#xA;Great FREE spot on the river next to the overflow area by the dam. Sign says.... &#39;no swimming&#39; but does not say &#39;no camping&#39;. This is outside the  National Park.&#xA;This one spot on the river is on a narrow road with a fire pit. Above the road is a turning area with fire pits, plenty of space for several vehicles, large enough for a 24ft to turn around. &#xA;2 bars on Roger&#39;s service. Data 4G reception&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99536 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
