 <wpt lat="47.105041" lon="-55.082985">
  <ele>7.523255900479853</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tide Cove Pebble Beach</name>
  <desc>Some locals recomended this two spots for camping. 1st is a very nice spot directly at the sea in a very secluded and protected bay. Existing firering - bring some wood, as there is few around. Little freshwater stream too. 2nd is when you continue for another half mile until the end of the road, directly at the lighthouse with an incredible view! Unfortunately without any windprotection. We stayed at the bay and had a wonderful night.  Recommended.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99577 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
