  <ele>3.047999902464003</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brighton Municipal Bldg / Cobbler&#39;s Trail</name>
  <desc>No facilities. Free. No prohibitive signs. Next to Municipal Bldg/Fire Station, easily visible from main rd. Sm lot, maybe room for 1or 2 rigs, don&#39;t block fire station doors. Several trails with several lookouts with beautiful views of rock formations and bays, boardwalk/bridge to picnic area on small island, potential for iceberg viewing in season. Public WiFi if you get password from office. Very friendly municipal employees. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99647 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
