  <name>St Ferdinand d’Halifax </name>
  <desc>St-Ferdinand Marina on lake William. Picnic tables and boat launch... Fast food restaurant in tourist season with flush toilets. No problem to sleep overnight, free wifi.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Marina du village table à pic nic et dessente pour bateau  ...... cantine en saison touristique toilettes propre. Pas d’interdiction de coucher.. wifi gratuit&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99749 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
