  <ele>561.8</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tatchun Lake Campground </name>
  <desc>Typical government campground. $12 CAD the night. Firewood and pit toilets. 20 sites. 8 km from the Klondike loop connecting with the Campbell highway after 43 km. Very quiet. Only one other camper. The lake is beside the campground allowing for fishing. Firewood available.You have to boil the water. Community area to use during bad weather. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99772 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
