  <name>Info Touristique Bécancour</name>
  <desc>Very quiet spot even if beside the highway. There is water fountain, pic-nic tables, a gazebo and a few other things. There is also a dumping station.&#xA;Daytime: The info-tourisme provide you with a toillet service and interresting information about where to visit.&#xA;Funfact: The site provides us a very little garden, open to everyone, to pick up a veggie to eat on the spot.&#xA;No &#34;no overnight parking&#34; sign.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 18:07:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99788 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
