  <ele>12.458546796257876</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking of Fort Amherst</name>
  <desc>A big tar parking lot a few hundred meters before Fort Amherst. Nice view of the harbor and signal hill. Wind shelter, Trash bin, mobile signal but otherwise no infrastructure. Seems to bee a harbour sightseeing place for locals as we had a few &#34;visitors&#34; until 11pm but nobody bothered us. OK for a night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99823 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
