  <time>2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gull Harbour Campground </name>
  <desc>Part of the Hecla Provincial Park. Large Campground close to beaches and little Gull harbour. Sites not big but with some privacy. The way to the showers can be a long one, depending where are you camping. Restrooms clean, showers as well. Forrested terrain.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99833 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
