  <desc>they have Diesel and regular unleaded gasoline here but they close around 10 p.m. everyday sometimes they close at 11 always good to call ahead. you have to leave your credit card with a hotel then you go back you pump and then they charge your credit card they also take cash. FYI the hotel is very motorcycle friendly&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99844 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
