  <desc>Picnic table, very quiet. It‘s supposed to be 20$ per night, use the drop box to pay. Close to boat ramp and bike trails. Beautiful view. Nice place to stay for one night.&#xA;&#xA;On Tuesdays and Thursdays, In season, Les Régates Are authorized … the noise is therefore infernal in pm and at dinner time. We went to eat in town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/99986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
