 <wpt lat="51.178604" lon="-115.571360">
  <ele>1388.6584129333496</ele>
  <time>2023-11-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cascade coin laundry </name>
  <desc>Funny place for a laundry! It’s on the lower floor in a corner near the washrooms. I’m told it’s the only laundry in downtown Banff and it gets so busy you can spend the whole day here (it’s the cheapest day you’ll spend in Banff! ) Top loaders are C$5, Triple loaders(!) are$14 (save a dollar! ), dryers 25 cents for 3 min. Staff are on hand to help and there are a couple of electrical sockets for phone charging. &#xA;There are several cafes adjacent and the whole of downtown to explore once you’ve donned your newly sweet smelling attire!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100001 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
