 <wpt lat="51.269268" lon="-115.918962">
  <ele>1440.548095703125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 10:51:09 UTC</time>
  <name>Gas, Convenience Store, Chalets. Castle Mountain </name>
  <desc>Gas and small convenience store with Chalets. There’s enough in the store to keep a cyclist going to get to Banff or Lake Louise. Not much in the way of fresh produce but plenty of snacks and canned goods. Open all year. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 10:51:09 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100002 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Shopping</type>
