 <wpt lat="50.432541" lon="-122.257089">
  <ele>1072.6830492019653</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Huge pullout next to river</name>
  <desc>Very large pullout next to the river and right off the highway. Lots of room for big rigs. Lots of small fire rings and a great view of the mountain &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100059 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
