  <ele>27.7</ele>
  <time>2024-03-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trout Lake Community Center</name>
  <desc>Community center with parking lot next to Trout Lake Park.&#xA;Free washrooms, showers and water.&#xA;No overnight parking.&#xA;Open Mon-Fr from 9am-10pm and Sat-Sun from 8am-5pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100063 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
