 <wpt lat="50.677916" lon="-120.336467">
  <ele>341.22934009454224</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside Waterpark</name>
  <desc>Riverside Waterpark (inside of Riverside Park) offers the opportunity to take a quick free (cold) shower or just a bath in Thomson River.&#xA;Free parking after 5pm and Sundays are completely free. (No overnight parking tho!)&#xA;Washrooms open from 10am-8pm, free portable water available there.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100064 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
