 <wpt lat="60.740860" lon="-135.081916">
  <ele>637.3774194024368</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Certified Auto Service</name>
  <desc>We had problems with the starter of our 82‘ VW Vanagon and had to stop here. Turns out Tony (the owner) is a very friendly guy and really knows how to deal with old cars. Problem was solved in 2 hours. I can recommend 100%! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100068 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
