  <ele>493.3502197265625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flat area at start of the Dempster Highway</name>
  <desc>Flat area with firerings and it is a huge place. Small 20m road from Dempster. Trees around the place for a litle shadow.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100070 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
