 <wpt lat="49.650176" lon="-95.795396">
  <ele>278.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Truck stop</name>
  <desc>We were sent away from Lyons lake and were told we could stay here. Because it was late and dark and we just wanted to go back to sleep, we parked between the trucks. We didn&#39;t know if there&#39;s a special place for cars. Its well lit and the trucks can be a bit noisy, the highway noise isn&#39;t too bad.&#xA;It&#39;s not a great place, but if you&#39;re desperate it&#39;s fine. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100079 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
