  <ele>954.2356990433038</ele>
  <time>2023-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rocky Mountains House Historical Site</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s a small cute new campground. $25.50 per night with a national pass. Had fire pit, room for a tent and car, free showers and sink for washing the dishes. It&#39;s very lovely. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100081 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
