  <ele>1448.0</ele>
  <time>2024-03-23 19:27:19 UTC</time>
  <name>Ghost Valley Road</name>
  <desc>Along the street there are a lot of places for overnight. On the weekends there are a lot of locals here. Nice view over the Ghost River and the Rocky Mountains. Sometimes something loud because of the motocross trails.&#xA;The access runs through a gravel road with lots of pumps.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-23 19:27:19 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
