  <ele>604.9978904724121</ele>
  <time>2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rockcreek riverside campground</name>
  <desc>30$/night no service, fire rings, picnic tables, by the river. Cheap spot to relax and swim, close to other sites, but everyone is polite. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100170 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
