  <ele>7.7701283316158225</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brier Island Wharf</name>
  <desc>This is a picnic site on the Bay of Fundy at the end of the road. Fully paved road and parking area. Can accommodate 3-4 vehicles. Beautiful views of the Atlantic Ocean. Sea birds are noisy. There is a functioning lighthouse across the bay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
