  <name>Cape Norman Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking close to Cape Norman Lighthouse. Viewpoint of Belle Isle Strait and Labrador/Basse-Côte-Nord shores. Remote location, very flat and can be very windy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 16:04:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100176 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
