 <wpt lat="46.439740" lon="-62.065999">
  <ele>36.67739295959473</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Elmira Train Station Museum</name>
  <desc>It is the start of the Confederation Trail. Flat gravel parking lot with plenty of room for 5 or 6 RVs. Asked permission and was told to make myself at home. RVs parked for days while cycling the trail. Washroom during museum hours.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100208 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
