 <wpt lat="50.995931" lon="-118.645896">
  <ele>407.6044406890869</ele>
  <time>2024-04-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crazy creek resort and campground </name>
  <desc>Renovated campground with large sites serviced and non serviced. Fire pit, dumping station. Trail that leads to supended bridge over creek must pay$. &#xA;Cool thing is the hot springs, heated thermal pools, must pay$. &#xA;A bit noisy, depends how far you are from the highway and from train tracks. We enjoyed our stay and slept well. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100279 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
