 <wpt lat="57.050040" lon="-117.568353">
  <ele>426.55078125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hotchkiss Community Campground </name>
  <desc>Small municipal campground and baseball field. No signs on the highway so watch for the road. This is NOT the nearby Condy Meadows campground. &#xA;&#xA;About 20 sites with electricity, fire rings, tables, firewood. There is supposed to be non-power sites but they were not marked so we don&#39;t know which they were. Self-registration, $20 with power, $10 without.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Note this is a community park so they nave have events scheduled such as the car show which was held earlier in the day we arrived. But we showed up early evening and had the park entirety to ourselves. It was very quiet and peaceful. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100292 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
