  <ele>817.824462890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dease Lake RV Park</name>
  <desc>An even gravel place with small grass spots. More than 30 slots without shade, close to each other. Every thing is clean. Hot shower 1 loony. Full hook up on all places. Hot Dog stand and grocery nearby. C$ 37.50 pn&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100487 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
