  <ele>35.380201674066484</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Western Head Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Overnight parking spot near to Western Head Lighthouse. The pathway is a little bit shaky and stony, but 4x4 / AWD isn&#39;t necessarily needed, just drive slowly. The location is public property, quiet and completely private. We had a quiet night, but on fog the lighthouse honks every minute for a few second from 7am on. We managed to ignore it until 9am :) The next toilet is the nature.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100519 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
