  <ele>826.8251953125</ele>
  <time>2023-06-12 19:07:57 UTC</time>
  <name>Fish Lake North Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>A wonderful Recreation Site of BC. With table and firepit located at a nice lake. For a few vans/rvs. Turn off Hwy 27 (54.22653, -124.22959) on the Fish Lake North Forest Service Road, drive 3.5 km to site on gravel road. Free of charge.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 19:07:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100578 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
