  <ele>356.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Odanah RV Park and Campground </name>
  <desc>Situated directly at # 1 hwy. It has its own exit, but this is not an official one. Look out for the billboard and follow. Nice place, with extra clean washrooms. Has a good and clean laundromat, too. Very friendly reception. Not too much noise from hwy. Playground. Official rate for hook up 35 + tx. We paid only 22, don&#39;t know why. Recommended! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100579 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
