  <ele>422.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Asessippi Beach Camping</name>
  <desc>Wonderful spot at the Assiniboine River. There&#39;s a natural pool where you can swim, and a small sandy beach. Quiet, close to hwy 83, near Inglis. There&#39;s in summer even a small kiosk selling ice cream, burgers, chips.. Clean washrooms. We payed 35 $ for a serviced site.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100580 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
