  <ele>816.2</ele>
  <time>2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Robson River Campground </name>
  <desc>Beautiful BC Parks campground. It’s across the Road from Robson Meadows which is also tagged. We didn’t stay, but wanted to post this to show the location of the campground. Reservations taken, so sadly it was full. Very nice environment. Some sites have electricity. Others not.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
