  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Truck stop that allows for overnight parking along the side of the road. Close to the highway, pretty busy. Good for a pit stop. Pretty sure this has an RV water fill up station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100606 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
