 <wpt lat="46.785352" lon="-53.626840">
  <ele>4.200847546339716</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 11:43:49 UTC</time>
  <name>Holyrood Interpretive Center </name>
  <desc>Just a gravel carpark next to the Holyrood Interpretive Center. Overnight parking is on the beach side only. There are a few houses around but you are allowed to stay here. About 6 other RVs around, closely parked. Opposite St Vincent’s beach with spectacular whale watching right on the beach!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 11:43:49 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100654 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
