 <wpt lat="47.422761" lon="-70.335775">
  <ele>18.069753646850586</ele>
  <time>2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Du Ruisseau Rouge</name>
  <desc>Nice and charming campground. Owners are very friendly and helpfull. Facilities are very clean. Unserviced spot 35,00 CND. Washingmachine and dryer available for 2,00 CND each. And... a small swimming pool. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100703 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
