 <wpt lat="60.598333" lon="-134.852879">
  <ele>757.7838134765625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Caribou RV Park &amp; Campground</name>
  <desc>This is a good campground and RV park, a short distance outside of Whitehorse. I spent two pleasant weeks here in May 2021. The hosts, Sandra &amp; Steve, are helpful, friendly and competent. Their small grocery store is well stocked. The onsite laundromat has several machines. The drinking water is very good quality. There are numerous trails nearby. I’m pleased to recommend this place. The sites are large enough but very close together. The sites in the forest are not very even. Restaurant not far away. Swiss and Western Food.&#xA;C$ 23 dry pn.&#xA;10$ to dump and fill in water (06-2024&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100722 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
