   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="43.930573" lon="-80.096557">
  <ele>378.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Orangeville</name>
  <desc>Large common parking lot of Walmart Orangeville. Didn&#39;t see any signs porhibiting overnight parking.&#xA;Stayed here for a couple of nights without a problem. Can pick up the Canadian Tire wifi from quite far away.&#xA;We parked near 24 hour gym so no one bothered with us.&#xA;Parking lot quite well lit during the night..&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100725 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
