 <wpt lat="49.678499" lon="-96.600412">
  <ele>265.1428298453061</ele>
  <time>2023-10-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lilac Resort</name>
  <desc>Amazing water slide and campground.  Live bands on Fridays. Movie nights. Lots to do. Sites for everything from tents to big RVs.  Full service $45 (for 2) includes the water park and hot showers.  $19 per person for extras into the water park.  Call ahead for reservations.  Everything beside the campground was closed ?for the season?- so no restaurant or store. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100733 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
