 <wpt lat="51.425690" lon="-57.126870">
  <ele>2.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Park Goodchild, Blanc Sablon</name>
  <desc>It is a public campground (free!) and picnic area of the community, located at the eastern edge of the village at the foot of the hill, only minutes from the ferry terminal. About 7 grass sites along a paved road, generously spaced, with picnic tables, some with fire rings;  plenty of garbage cans, 1 outhouse toilet, 1 water faucet (potable) and an RV dump next to the entry sign. Turnaround space at end of road might be tight for very big rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100813 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
