  <desc>Nelson District Community Centre. Day pass for $7.62, gets you access to all the facilities. Men’s, women’s, and universal change rooms. Private showers in the universal change room. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-02-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100840 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
