 <wpt lat="53.749798" lon="-122.872349">
  <ele>753.2666893005371</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>West Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>Private campground across the road from road to West Lake.  We took a private dry site for $20/Canadian per night.  Some electric sites available.  Dogs permitted on leash.  Playground and pit toilets.  No showers.  Running water throughout campground.  Has ATV and hiking trails attached to campgrounds. Saw a mother &amp; baby moose.  GATES CLOSE AT 9PM!!   For West Lake day use, pets permitted on boat launch side only.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100852 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
