  <ele>38.298459541398174</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet Place to sleep with oceanview</name>
  <desc>The Place is out of town, no houses around and with a wonderful view at the ocean. Very quiet. We got here with a 4x4 - it is necessary! Not for trailers! Its in the middle of nowhere :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100909 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
