  <ele>9.656219482421875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 10:45:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Thornlea / Colliers Bay</name>
  <desc>A fantastic gravel lot at the end of the bay. Picnic tables, trash bin and, best of all, a raised fire pit that the locals provide firewood for. Two different folks even checked to make sure there was enough wood for me! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 10:45:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100920 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
