  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Manitowaning Welcome Center</name>
  <desc>Nice place. Close to the road but ok for 1 night. Some grass, 2 pit toilets (really clean!) and even a sink to wash your hands and free wifi ! &#xA;The Center and the book store are open from 10am to 4pm from Tuesday to Saturday.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/100957 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
