  <name>Eastlink Centre </name>
  <desc>Rec centre. aquatic centre with sauna, pools and fantastic slides; plus weight room, running lanes, basketball, racquetball, sport lessons like yoga, boot camp etc. plus hot showers; free wifi; everything included for $11.00&#xA;&#xA;Shower only: $1.75 per person for private stall showers with curtains. They also have lockers so you can lock up your stuff. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101115 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
