  <ele>1716.64111328125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Silver Horn Creek Campground </name>
  <desc>Need a reservation in ADVANCE!!!&#xA;New campground on the Icefield Parkway. Even the toilets smell sweet! There’s about 40 sites with picnic tables and fire pits. Some sites are pull-through. Not much in the way of shade, it’s all open and exposed. No hookups and NO POTABLE WATER, so bring your own or go to Waterfowl campground. The creek goes right past the campground for the desperate. Fees are C$15.70 plus fire permit $8.90. Max RV length is 35feet, 10.7m. Bear proof lockers for food storage are near the pay station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101128 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
