  <name>Gravel road - Dezadeash Lake area</name>
  <desc>Not many listed free spots on this stretch of highway. Pullouts have « No camping or overnight parking » signs. &#xA;&#xA;We took this gravel road that leads we don’t know where. 100m down, there’s a big opening (I would say two large sites) with some fire pits.&#xA;&#xA;Ok for overnight. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101302 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
