  <name>Churchill Falls</name>
  <desc>FREE Pool, Sauna, Shower (nice and hot), Library with WiFi and free books. and a gym to use too.&#xA;Opening/use of pool is a bit odd (current swim schedule attached-  as an adult without kids you can not use the pool during family swim hours).&#xA;there is also a Grocery store, post office, gift shop which are closed on Sundays.&#xA;Also available is a hotel and restaurant&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101428 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
