  <ele>762.0636412112243</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Huge level area just south of the Braeburn lake. </name>
  <desc>Informal campsite near the R2 Klondyke Highway between Whitehorse and Dawson City. &#xA;Huge level area, actually several levels - a bit gravelly, many trees and bushes. Have obviously been used as a informal campsite for a while as there are several firepits and a littlebit of trash. The area is huge and would fit all kinds of vehicles, tentcampers etc. No amenities and near the road so a bit of roadnoise. According to a local perfectly legal to camp here. Good place for a night!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101454 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
