 <wpt lat="63.255090" lon="-136.559176">
  <ele>592.0783957840035</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Disused aggregate pit</name>
  <desc>Large open area that appears to have been used for road aggregate mining at some point. Rock isn’t overgrown or too soft, but not well suited to full size RVs except close to entrance. Enough flat spaces for a dozen vans though. Not far from highway, maybe 200m, but not loud. No signage, no gates. 2 bars Telus and Bell LTE&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
