  <ele>1031.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mountainview Campground</name>
  <desc>At TransCanadaHighway, hwy #1, east of Calgary. Rather big place, no privacy, little shadow. Tidy. Washrooms old, but ok, clean. Showers $. OK for a night or two. Paid $50 for 20amp+water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101704 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
