 <wpt lat="49.472701" lon="-57.919278">
  <ele>9.469470960339262</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 07:20:47 UTC</time>
  <name>Showers at the Water Edge RV Park</name>
  <desc>For $5 you can take a really hot and long shower (no time restriction) Two separate showers and toilets, clean, very friendly staff. And if you want to stay (place itself is very bare and not so charming) $18 unserviced site, 25 for serviced. &#xA;&#xA;The showers are only available for guests staying in the serviced or overflow camping areas. Overflow sites are just $20 though so still great deal&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 07:20:47 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
