  <ele>920.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Area at Taiga Range</name>
  <desc>Big gravel area ca at Dempster Highway km 130 before entering the Taiga Range. Great view, 300 yards away from the road, but there is no traffic in the night, quiet, few mosquitos. Many flowers at our visit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101828 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
