  <name>Five Mile Lake</name>
  <desc>Big level gravel area at Five Mile Lakes 0,5 km after the turnoff to the Day Use Area. Directly at the lake, nice view. Cell phone service from Mayo available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101830 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
