  <ele>551.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tatchun Lake, Frenchman Lake Road</name>
  <desc>Nice little camping spot at Tatchun Lake. Great view, easy access to the lake, not for big rigs. 14 km dirtroad from North Klondike Highway. All three campgrounds along Frenchman Lake Road were terrible overcrowded.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101833 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
