  <ele>353.3128662109375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free Store</name>
  <desc>A place to find interesting stuff.  Keep it clean and you can even help sorting. &#xA;Follow sign for dump station from the highway. &#xA;&#xA;See picture to know where there are other free stores in Yukon.  There are donation drop -off boxes on the side. Opens 11 to 6.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101889 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
