  <ele>673.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yukon River Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Rest area with nice view to Yukon River and the bridge. Clean pit toilets. No mosquitoes when we stayed there. A little noise from the highway. There were motorhomes and trailers too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101901 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
