  <ele>99.65893672909482</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Viewpoint</name>
  <desc>Great place to spend the night if it is not to windy - beautiful view of the bay of Saint Paul and the whole surrounding. Picknick table, trash bin and a million stars at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101970 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
