  <ele>26.84722900390625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 20:43:11 UTC</time>
  <name>macintyre lake</name>
  <desc>Nice site on lake, paved and level. Road in is short but overgrown and very narrow. Only suitable for camper vans or truck campers. Room for 2 or 3 rigs. The train tracks next to the site are not in use anymore.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 20:43:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101994 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
