  <ele>365.8440670930902</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull off next to the lake Shuswap Lake</name>
  <desc>Small roadside pull off next to the road overlooking the lake. Minimal traffic noise at night but can be busy during the day. Only room for maybe two small campers or one larger camper. Don’t block the driveway/access road off of the pullout. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/101997 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
