  <ele>315.23871755297967</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riviere Louvicourt</name>
  <desc>First road across the bridge.&#xA;There is room for a few campers.&#xA;There are no facilities but a picnic table is available.&#xA;Close to the main road but since it is a 50 km zone, there is little noise.&#xA;Good cellular phone coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102020 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
