  <ele>711.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ymir campground</name>
  <desc>campground with pit toilets, garbage, recycling, drinking water, covered picnic tables. decent Verizon coverage. interesting hotel bar across the street.  pay at the town grocery store ($10). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102109 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
