 <wpt lat="52.230010" lon="-116.449460">
  <ele>1315.2221336364746</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Abraham Slabs</name>
  <desc>A number of great campsites on road into this site. We’re parked on the beach with an incredible view up and down the lake. Big rig friendly. &#xA;&#xA;Easy to miss side track off Highway 11, unmaintained recreation area in beautiful setting. Lots of level sites, suitable for all rigs, portable toilets and fire rings. Quiet and scenic, can stay up to 14 days, no charge - however, you will need the Public Lands Pass to use. $30/person for the year.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102113 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
