  <name>Takakkaw Falls Campground </name>
  <desc>It&#39;s has like 50 spots for tents. 18.75 CAD self registration. No cars are able to get to the camp sites. About 500 meter walk from the parking lot to camping (there are barrow provided). Has potable water and you can hear the falls at night. Beautiful spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102153 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
