  <desc>Get it all clean here! Laundry, Showers and Car wash. Do it all at once. Showers are coin in the slot, if you soap up first you might manage it for a dollar. Laundry is $3, $5 or $7 depending on machine size. Dry is 25 cents for 5 mins. There’s also a reverse osmosis water filter at a dollar a gallon with your own bottles.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102288 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
