  <ele>0.7922370394143143</ele>
  <time>2022-10-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lighthouse - Cape Ray</name>
  <desc>Update Oct 2022: gravel road is washed out post-hurricane Fiona. I have added updated photos of the current gravel road conditions. You could still walk down and tent it but I can&#39;t see anything other than an ATV making it around the washed-out area. &#xA;.....&#xA;Drive down the gravel road at the lighthouse, lovely flat spot close by the beach. Check the road before driving down, it is steep and has big potholes from other 4x2 trying to come back up.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102491 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
