  <ele>4.838161468505859</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>Right on the white sand beach. Very beautiful.  New entrance building with showers, restrooms, restaurant. Can pay at site or online (start at www.lumsdennl.com).&#xA;&#xA;They are working on this, may be fixed by July 1 - &#xA;Water taps at each site were not connected when we visited (May 2024). Washrooms installed at cafe next door, closed in June. Town has a comfort station just on the highway that has showers ($3/15min) and laundry ($2 each wash/dry). &#xA;dump station is open at comfort station for  $17.50 with filtered drinking water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
