  <ele>427.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 10:39:01 UTC</time>
  <name>Derrick Lake Rec site </name>
  <desc>Nice rec site at a small lake. Take the forestroad at N 55°37.0617&#39; W 128°38.9002&#39; east of the HWY. It’s a 6km dirtroad. Should be ok for 2wd. But not for big rigs. Best for vans,pick-up campers or tents. There are 4 seperated places. 2 at the entrance, two 200 further. 2 pit Toilette. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 10:39:01 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102727 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
