  <ele>570.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 20:35:59 UTC</time>
  <name>Rock Creek Husky Municiplal Park</name>
  <desc>South side of Hwy 3 West, behind Husky station or either side of brook. Park with space for several campers and maybe a couple large rigs. Only ones here this night. Noise road &lt;9pm but fairly quiet after.  Welcoming, fire pits and liquor 5 minute walk at Petrocan. Cool brook to bathe  and wash clothes. Cool spot for night or two. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 20:35:59 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102745 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
