  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gray Bay Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Eighteen large, private, user maintained sites (pack out your trash) with picnic tables, fire rings and pit toilets on a beautiful sandy beach. The first three sites have covered picnic tables. You’re off the grid and unplugged from the internet here. FREE. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102746 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
