  <desc>There is a water tap on the building just near the blue accessible parking spots. No hose, you need your own. Free. Washrooms and giftshop onsite, tourism office staff are bilingual French and English.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/102802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
