  <desc>3.2 Km from Route de la Baie-James.&#xA;4 campsites next to the river.&#xA;Level sites with fire ring.&#xA;Cellphone is not available here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103167 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
