 <wpt lat="49.877186" lon="-116.904792">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mirror Lake Campgrounds</name>
  <desc>Beautiful campsite on the shore of a small lake with a mirror surface. The lake is warm and great to swim in with a floating wooden platform you can jump off. $25 for a tent site, maybe slightly more for a RV but I&#39;m not sure. Showers cost $1. We also saw ducklings and a TURTLE in the lake. Also it&#39;s not far from Ainsworth hot springs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103189 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
