  <ele>432.2868723977088</ele>
  <time>2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Teeter Creek</name>
  <desc>Four campsites near Teeter Creek trailhead. Very close to the highway. Easy access to the creek. Good for one night. Very close to the Liard Hotsprings. there&#39;s also a trail that leads to a small waterfall. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103190 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
