  <ele>68.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moulin à Baude</name>
  <desc>Nice little spit for small vehicles, quiet. Direction: take the old road on the right when coming from Tadoussac on highway 138, and then keep an eye on the right.&#xA;&#xA;One big rig might fit, but turning would be a tight challenge and better just head to the other gravel parking nearby and leave this small spot to this smaller cars.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103220 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
