  <ele>1686.6</ele>
  <time>2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Interlakes Campground, Peter Loughheed Prov. Park</name>
  <desc>This entire campground is FCFS! (First come first served!) yay!&#xA;&#xA;Located on the lower Kananaskis Lake, most campsites are lakeside or at least have a good view. Pit toilets and no potable water. Picnic tables and fire pits.&#xA;Firewood can be purchased for $9 plus tax.&#xA;$31 per site per night. Payable with cash or card.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103293 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
