  <ele>496.1449794769287</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>$1 showers and sani-dump - King Gething Park</name>
  <desc>Coin operated showers. $1 for 6 to 8 minutes. Loonies only. &#xA;There’s also a sani-dump and potable water on site. &#xA;&#xA;It’s one of the 4 municipal campgrounds of Hudson’s Hope. &#xA;This one is closer to town, on the highway with facilities (flush toilets , showers, sani-dump). The other three are by the river or a lake. $20/night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
