  <desc>Easy in, easy out. With rinse and potable water in separate locations. &#xA;&#xA;$1 showers (6-8 minutes) in the building next to it. &#xA;&#xA;Part of the municipal campground (no need to stay to use the facilities). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103296 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
