  <ele>150.18316699629463</ele>
  <time>2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chippawa </name>
  <desc>Small area with grass and gravel. No &#34;no overnight&#34; sign. Close to the river. no shadow. it is close to the road but quiet. it is very close to the Chippawa boat ramp where you can not camp overnight. there is toilet over there. 200m walking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103360 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
