  <ele>17.009765625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 13:02:50 UTC</time>
  <name>Dungeon Provincial Park Ocean Side Rd</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s located inside the provincial park. Not sure the rules of staying there overnight but we had no issues at all.&#xA;&#xA;Drove down this side road beside the ocean just off the main road that goes through the park.&#xA;&#xA;Pulled just off the side of the side road.&#xA;&#xA;Beautiful views of the ocean. Nice wind and sounds. Quiet at night. Great cell phone reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 13:02:50 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103400 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
