  <ele>128.5743408203125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside. Hwy 401</name>
  <desc>Right beside the highway by the lake. Seems like a parking spot to launch a boat or swim. 2 campfire spots already here.&#xA;&#xA;Traffic going by in the evening. But quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;No cell phone reception (Fido/Rogers).&#xA;&#xA;Pickup truck with small camper. 33ft in total. Plenty of room to maneuver &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103401 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
