  <desc>Nice beach with both indoor and outdoor showers...FREE ! Indoor showers are hot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 11:22:20 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103407 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
