  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;Excellent camp choice for the Grande Prairie area. Water, showers, electric hookups, quiet, great birdwatching, nature trails. $27 to $34.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103430 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
