 <wpt lat="49.102574" lon="-116.070601">
  <ele>854.7090721130371</ele>
  <time>2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hay U Campground and RV </name>
  <desc>Nice park. Good for large RVs to tents. River at the back of the park. Shallow but refreshing.&#xA;All amenities here.  We decided to just park with a 40 ft bus with no amenities as we are fully self-sufficient, cost was $20.00.  It’s more of you want electricity, water, sewer etc.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103448 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
