 <wpt lat="58.707660" lon="-124.902420">
  <ele>923.4937744140625</ele>
  <time>2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McDonald&#39;s Creek</name>
  <desc>Was looking for other spot here on ioverlander and it was already taken so we drove the opposite way back toward the road and found this perfect little spot.  Built a nice campfire and enjoyed until the rain came. Very quiet even though close to the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103450 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
