  <ele>1542.357265472412</ele>
  <time>2024-04-28 14:13:12 UTC</time>
  <name>Porcupine Hills</name>
  <desc>Porcupine Hills PLUZ. Random/wild camping allowed, no services. Fire ring, please check for fire bans. 4X4 recommended. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-28 14:13:12 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103461 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
