 <wpt lat="49.017285" lon="-88.257293">
  <ele>223.33033787831664</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nipigon Panorama Lookout </name>
  <desc>This wasn&#39;t exactly on the co-ordinates or I mis-read but in any case it was close....the co-ords told me it was across the street but obviusly the water side of the highway is what you want.&#xA;Area is a little dirty and the water is shallow so no fishing.&#xA;The day we arrived it was foggy and raining, as you can see in the picture but it was very attractive and although quite open...very private.&#xA;We enjoyed out stay here.&#xA;Just a note that further along the shore, as seen in the picture, there is a sandy beach which might allo0w swimming when it&#39;s warm.&#xA;Lots of room for several big RV&#39;s&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
