 <wpt lat="53.239298" lon="-117.794260">
  <ele>1113.98779296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>folding mountain west - rest area</name>
  <desc>A rest area next to the highway with pit toiletts. Close to Jasper National Park, free and almost no mosquitos. ;)&#xA;Trucks, big and small cars fit.&#xA;Tent should be possible.&#xA;You can hear the cars on the highway, but it&#39;s not very noisy and we don&#39;t mind the cars driving by.&#xA;Picnic tables are there as well, but it&#39;s not a nice place to have a picnic here.&#xA;Bear safe trash bins are here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103478 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
