  <ele>626.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Griffith Creek Trailhead Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot, mountain bike and hiking trail head. Several vans parked overnight, not crowded, pit toilet, quiet spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103485 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
