  <ele>153.75768443465222</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 09:01:49 UTC</time>
  <name>Hartland Learning Center</name>
  <desc>Asked the security guard from the Leaning Center if I could sleep in the parking lot for the park, he told me that he has never seen anybody come by, so it’s pretty much a free go. Had a good night of sleep with no problems.&#xA;RV wasn&#39;t a problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 09:01:49 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103490 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
