 <wpt lat="44.937792" lon="-78.713200">
  <ele>274.6039695739746</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rotary Park</name>
  <desc>Parking lot. Toilets, picnic tables, a gentle river to swim in. Busy during the day, quiet at night. No “no overnight parking/camping” signs. A local also said it’s pretty relaxed around here so people likely won’t mind. &#xA;I wouldn’t tent camp and I think a camper van is going to be fine.  &#xA;Got full bars of LTE internet on Telus. &#xA;&#xA;You can hear car traffic in the distance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103534 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
