  <ele>541.5300469360351</ele>
  <time>2022-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Outlook Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Traditional camping with lot of space and widely distributed. 30$/ night + 8$ day use which is expensive for what you get. Shower is free, but washroom needs renewal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103536 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
