 <wpt lat="47.594134" lon="-59.185033">
  <ele>-11.32867431640625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grand Bay road turnout </name>
  <desc>Turn out at the side of the road. Big enough for my pickup truck and small trailer. Scenic view. Great sunset.&#xA;&#xA;Road traffic earlier in the evening, especially when the ferry arrived. But after 10pm it was pretty quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Mosquitoes were out.&#xA;&#xA;Great cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;Perfect for waiting for the ferry.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
