 <wpt lat="48.575225" lon="-123.368015">
  <ele>4.984282175297167</ele>
  <time>2023-11-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Island View Beach Regional Park Campground </name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;Really nice place for your motorhome. You can still park here at night in the parking lot in low season, December January February March or in your tent.&#xA;You’re on the beach with a lovely view.&#xA;Most of the places require a reservation but there are 4 places which are &#39;&#34;first come first serve&#34;.  Some places are free for one or two nights between reservations. So try your luck.&#xA;We stayed 3 days here and we tried the paddle and kayak and it was great.&#xA;The price is 25$ for the night.&#xA;Common pitfire with wood. Restroom. &#xA;Potable water but only to fill little tank, not the RV tank.&#xA;The nights are so quiet and the landscape wonderful.&#xA;Enjoy this place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103557 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
