  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tetsa River Regional Campground</name>
  <desc>Tetsa River Regional Campground: 1(250)775-1116. Dry Camping: $20.00. Firewood Included. 25 Campsites (No pull through sites, Easy loop drive-around).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103583 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
