 <wpt lat="50.895690" lon="-118.482550">
  <ele>558.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Frog Falls</name>
  <desc>Tried to grab a spot at Frog Falls but got there too late. This place was a perfect find! It is right by Frog Falls recreation site. There are a few places with fire rings nearby. This specific place is secluded, right on the river, has a fire pit and two tree stumps for seats. Just a 5 minute walk for a view of the waterfall. Good spot for small rigs and tents. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103606 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
