  <ele>14.55019553116021</ele>
  <time>2022-11-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Shell gas station</name>
  <desc>Good place to stay at if you want to be close to the thetis lake a must see!!  Here you can wash your van, also taller RV. There is laundry in the back that is open till 10pm every night. Not the most quiet place but good if you want to do laundry and at the same time give a good wax to your ride. Pub across the street and a liquor store.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-11-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103607 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
