  <ele>809.806640625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Picnique near Hwy 37</name>
  <desc>Blue Lakes. Nice place with table and fire ring. No &#34;no camping&#34; sign. No toilette. Very close to the Hwy. Wonderful view of an untouched forest after wildfire. Very scenic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103903 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
