 <wpt lat="45.210423" lon="-65.899527">
  <ele>110.24242217505495</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cape Spencer Hilltop</name>
  <desc>Nice place on top of the hill, overlooking a lake, the Port in St. John and the sea.&#xA;&#xA;Road from the St. John side is muddy, when wet. I don’t know about the other direction. Space for one Vehicle, maybe two.&#xA;&#xA;There are easy and challenging routes into camp. Keep an eye out for brush and ledge hazards.&#xA;&#xA;I had Verizon cell signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/103914 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
