  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart - Ottawa</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at Walmart. Good for the night. A little bit noisy but OK to sleep. There are more shops in the area. Many RVs here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104014 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
