  <name>Enviro Lube / Oil-Change</name>
  <desc>Super mechanic specialised on oil-change. All done in 15 minutes without appointment. Very nice people. I made also tire-rotation (DIY) and was allowed to use their equipment.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 13:34:06 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104030 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
