 <wpt lat="50.712814" lon="-127.490678">
  <ele>4.249810218811035</ele>
  <time>2023-09-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quarterdeck Marina </name>
  <desc>Behind Quarterdeck Inn at the marina check-in and convenience store. 5 washers and a dozen driers. Washing is $3.25-$4.25 for a run - bring your own detergent. Driers pay by the quarter. 4mins per quarter. Can also grab a hot shower here for $3.75.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104046 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
