  <ele>1298.6596652858582</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 15:21:01 UTC</time>
  <name>Crooked Creek Campground </name>
  <desc>Approx 5.5 km from Waterton National Park. Fully serviced, tenting, &amp; unserviced sites.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 15:21:01 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104072 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
