 <wpt lat="44.296190" lon="-78.301850">
  <ele>164.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beavermead Park</name>
  <desc>City park by Little Lake. We slept in our van in the parking for one night with no problem. It was quiet until 7h30 am. There is a free beach nearby, and the park is overall really pretty. There is a campground next to the park where you could ask for a shower.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104073 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
