  <desc>Very nice interior pool with spa, sauna, toilets, individual changing rooms and showers. 5,25$ no limit of time.&#xA;3$ for shower only&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104090 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
