 <wpt lat="51.129530" lon="-114.002860">
  <ele>1080.1</ele>
  <time>2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Balzac Campground and RV storage</name>
  <desc>Close to Calgary&#39;s airport. Daily shopping in close distance. Noisy due to hwy. Almost no level sites. Muddy after heavy rains. Simple, but clean washrooms. OK laundromat. Wifi only around office. The place needs attention and probably some investing. OK for a night or two. Prices: unserviced $25, water+power $37,50, full hookup $4x,xx.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
