  <ele>55.99957289056903</ele>
  <time>2024-04-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking for big rigs</name>
  <desc>17$ per 14h until 5am only, you have to pay twice if your RV is on 2 places.&#xA;$5 on PH and weekends.&#xA;Very close to the city center, 15min walk with kids.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104107 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
