 <wpt lat="48.864327" lon="-64.210969">
  <ele>3.3416748046875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overflow parking</name>
  <desc>Overflow parking behind community center.&#xA;&#xA;Entrance is right between the fire hall and the community centre - there is a separate gravel road that goes back.  Do not pull into the post office (dead end) or the community centre as it is very tight and there is a gravel berm you’ll need to go over, many RV’s wont fit or will get stuck!&#xA;&#xA;Pull up the dirt ramp towards the back and park where you like!   Recommend arriving before dark so you can see where you’re going to get situated, there are ruts and rocks in some spots.   &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104149 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
