 <wpt lat="54.302088" lon="-129.988982">
  <ele>39.92983998809137</ele>
  <time>2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fjord camping</name>
  <desc>A number of small pullouts at the end of a forest road that dead ends at the end of a fjord (about a 20 min drive). Some have informal fire rings. A lot of full size trucks bring boats down here to fish. Very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104151 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
