  <ele>307.7610352806316</ele>
  <time>2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sioux Narrows P. P. </name>
  <desc>Beautiful quiet campground. Well kept. At beautiful Lake of the Woods. In my view nicest camping in the area. Canoe rental. Power at some sites. Spacious showers. --- Beau site de camping, bien entretenu, douches spacieuses, vue sur le lac, prix raisonnables.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104177 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
