  <ele>230.70562744140625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stardust Drive-In Theater</name>
  <desc>Drive-in theater we pass by accident. Went in and asked if we could stay overnight. Manager said it&#39;s all right. A lot of people fall asleep and leave the next morning. So we watched a movie and stayed over night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104181 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
