  <desc>Another nice one. Well kept. Smaller shallower lake, relatively warm. Canoe, kayak, sub rental. Nice beach. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104200 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
