 <wpt lat="46.229144" lon="-64.310504">
  <ele>20.8</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Plage de l’Aboiteau - Hot showers</name>
  <desc>This is a beautiful beach to visit in the summer with reasonably priced daytime parking ($5/10 depending on which lot you choose), warm water to swim in, and best of all, hot showers! I counted 6 stalls in the ladies room, all with curtains. Changing stalls are across the room. Water pressure is strong! The people running the place are top notch. So friendly, and facilities are clean. Highly recommend spending a day (or two...!) here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104229 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
