  <desc>There&#39;s a gas station, RV campground (with 15 amp hookups) and a helicopter sightseeing tour company here. We filled our potable water at the Bell 2 lodge. Pricey internet available,  but very slow as it&#39;s satellite.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104242 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
