 <wpt lat="51.546365" lon="-120.170748">
  <ele>391.9733486175537</ele>
  <time>2023-09-27 19:15:21 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull off with river access</name>
  <desc>(not the exact GPS location) We didn’t find a lot of options around Kamloops to pitch a tent so we stopped at this grassy pull off. You can park and pitch tent behind bushes near the trees to be hidden from the road but the cars’ noise from the road is still very loud all night long. There are many fire pits and access to the river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-27 19:15:21 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104335 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
