  <name>the giant firepit</name>
  <desc>Nice wild camp at the lake, not for big rigs. Huge Firepit, shady, nice view over the lake&#xA;&#xA;Fyi, the name is overselling. There&#39;s just a regular size fire pit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
