  <ele>15.129836349526627</ele>
  <time>2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bear Cove</name>
  <desc>With 4wd you can go right down and park in the cove. Super chill quiet amazing spot with a great sunset view. Just be sure to park above where high tide gets! Without 4wd you could still park at the top and walk down to the cove.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104470 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
