  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>End of Wharf road near beach</name>
  <desc>Room for a few camper vans. Beach access possible with vehicle but beach rocky. We were the only ones there during the night. Quiet. Some fishermen and bathers during the day. Beautiful view of the Minas Bassin.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104540 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
