  <ele>238.21529184051897</ele>
  <time>2023-09-16 18:46:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Soccer Field</name>
  <desc>Flat parking lot next to soccer field.&#xA;Quiet and a nice place to sleep.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 18:46:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104593 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
