  <ele>235.33435339567637</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Scenic wildcamping near a lake</name>
  <desc>Small area with lake view on a gravel road. flat. place for one van or two if you are friends. right under electric cables. nice view and quiet. fire pit. no toilet&#xA;Horse fly seasons a little rough&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104638 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
