  <time>2024-03-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Klahanie Campground </name>
  <desc>Nothing fancy, but a place to stay for a night. On the expensive side, 57$ for a site with water and power. Noise from the road, one or two trains at night. &#xA;no dump station, wifi operated via satellite, free but limited to 200mb/day&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104655 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
