 <wpt lat="54.903683" lon="-122.939871">
  <ele>666.6189275798406</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whiskers Lake Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful campground with decent privacy at camp spots. The beach to the lake is gorgeous and quiet. There are toilets and paved roads and 20$ a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104698 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
