  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chapman Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>People maintained recreation site with tables, fire pits and space for 12 RV&#39;s. Very nice spot beside the Chapman lake where you can swim or kayak. Place is for free up to 14 days. To reach the place you have to turn on the babine lake from the hyw 16. There are signs for the site. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
