  <ele>212.9873809814453</ele>
  <time>2024-05-07 10:24:17 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping @ Newton Street Art Barn </name>
  <desc>A beautiful country property that has been opened to all types of overlanders (including  big rigs). We came here initially to visit the Art Barn. There is a 15-20 minute walk through the forest to a creek. There are dogs living here who are very friendly. Please call prior to arrival to arrange camping! Clean bathroom and shower as well as potable water available. Accepting donations for camping fee. Highly recommend! &#xA;Debbie (705) 427-2119&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 10:24:17 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104948 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
