 <wpt lat="49.757930" lon="-94.472120">
  <ele>298.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>WalMart Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Walmart parking lot just off Hwy 17 (The TransCanada) in a relatively new shopping area. There&#39;s a Canadian Tire right next to it.&#xA;&#xA;The parking lot is owned by the municipality and there are No Overnight Parking signs. I asked in the Walmart &amp; was told police could come and ask you to move but that it hasn&#39;t happened in the 2 1/2 yrs she has worked in the store. A clerk in a different store told me she often sees RVs in the lot in the morning when she&#39;s going to work.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104970 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
