 <wpt lat="48.952130" lon="-57.821985">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Steadybrook Ski Field</name>
  <desc>Huge carpark, empty in summer obviously.&#xA;No size limit.&#xA;Huge access.&#xA;Short walk to Tim Horton&#39;s and a beautiful waterfall.&#xA;Right on the side of the highway for access but not too close to keep you awake. &#xA;Great scenery and moose prints on the floor outside our rig. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104996 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
