 <wpt lat="52.405923" lon="-56.096689">
  <ele>16.027869420528994</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Island Camp Ground</name>
  <desc>Large pull in beside main road. &#xA;Plenty of space for big rigs.&#xA;Beautiful scenery but obviously its right on the side of the highway so its not perfect.  Still, its a quiet road right now anyway.&#xA;No signage saying you cant sleep. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/104998 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
