 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.671530" lon="-103.844704">
  <ele>578.4622993121432</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Weyburn Car Park</name>
  <desc>Quiet car park, away from the road. &#xA;Lots of space for any size of rig.&#xA;People came and went in the early evening but no one bothered us. &#xA;Our 2yr old enjoyed the park and we had a nice bike ride into town. &#xA;&#xA;We have a 38ft fifth wheel&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105008 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
