  <name>Cabela’s / Mall Parking Lot. </name>
  <desc>mall carpark.&#xA;wide open.&#xA;reasonably quiet.&#xA;great spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105013 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
