 <wpt lat="43.737075" lon="-81.433540">
  <ele>308.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blyth fairgrounds</name>
  <desc>Hundreds of sites, some shaded, at the fairgrounds in Blyth.  We were told by other campers to set up and that someone would come around in the morning to collect $30.  Walking distance to the Blyth theatre (award winning plays) and the Cowbell Brewery.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105058 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
