 <wpt lat="64.040853" lon="-139.403708">
  <ele>354.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bonanza Gold Motel &amp; RV Park</name>
  <desc>Right next to the Dawson City Park. We stayed at both but preferred this one. $40 for full service (this one has bigger sites), cheaper car wash $1 for 3 minutes, showers about the same $1 for 2 minutes but the wifi actually worked for us here. WiFi is a bit slow. Laundry $4 for wash and $3 for dry.&#xA;they have 43 channels of TV.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105066 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
