 <wpt lat="62.089771" lon="-136.283399">
  <ele>530.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Carmacks Hotel and RV Park</name>
  <desc>Stopped at Coalmine needing some power and WiFi. Their WiFi was &#34;temporarily&#34; down. Heard that too often from campgrounds so moved down here.&#xA;&#xA;Very nice spot between the gas station/general store and the river. The store is surprisingly well stocked. Smaller campsites with power water and sewer. $2 pay showers. We paid $42 for the night. Restaurant was quite decent but lacked some items on the menu because supplies had been delayed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105080 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
