 <wpt lat="49.898780" lon="-119.500160">
  <ele>336.67193603515625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>900 Guy Street - Jack Brow Park</name>
  <desc>900 Guy Street parking - Jack Brow Park. Not too far from city centre. Quiet neighborhood. Park on the side of the road. Enough space for 2 or 3 RV&#39;s if you stay close. There&#39;s an industry on the other side that makes a lot of lights, not running during weekends. Don&#39;t know about the noise during the week. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105082 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
