  <ele>311.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 18:23:33 UTC</time>
  <name>Bonus Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Small lake recreation site with free space for three or four campers. Close to the highway but there&#39;s not much nighttime traffic here. Free to use, pack out your rubbish. Fine for 4x4s this time of year only - 10/21&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 18:23:33 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105118 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
