  <ele>243.30036334319897</ele>
  <time>2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>Boat ramp next to the river. Big space. In the middle of the prairies. No &#34;no overnight camping&#34;. Just &#34;don&#39;t park next to the boat ramp&#34;. No toilet. Very quiet. Good for a night. From Road 50, turn at Road 567. 8-10 km gravel road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
