  <ele>30.781412256199655</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Co-op Store</name>
  <desc>$1.59cdn for gas and $1.65cdn for diesel. Restaurant, Shop and fuel sales. Co-op store next door. Closes at 10pm except on Monday (closes at 9). &#xA;Note: the sign on the door saying it closes at 6pm on weekends is for the shop, not the fuel station.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
