 <wpt lat="47.353130" lon="-53.926082">
  <ele>12.49224853515625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Atlantic Charter Monument</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at the end of a 2.3km gravel road. There&#39;s a monument to the secret meeting in 1941 in this harbour, between Roosevelt and Churchill. There are picnic tables here and the scenery is stunning. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105136 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
