 <wpt lat="49.652745" lon="-54.761666">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Iceberg Quest Ocean Tours</name>
  <desc>This is the parking of the Iceberg Quest Ocean Tours // Canvas Bistro. The owner is the same for the boat and the restaurant.&#xA;&#xA;After doing the tour and eating at the restaurant, I asked him if it was okay to stay there. It&#39;s fine, nobody will bother you. Sometimes, locals leave their car and trailers there when they go fishing too.&#xA;&#xA;Get close to the restaurant and you may get wifi (ask them for the PW).&#xA;&#xA;Fairly level. Some picnic tables too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105234 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
