 <wpt lat="44.637080" lon="-63.566642">
  <ele>69.5</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halifax Seaport Parking Lot </name>
  <desc>Haifax Seaport Parking Lot across from Farmer&#39;s Market/managed by Indigo. Stayed two nights with no restrictions. This is the best of the three Halifax Seaport parking lots and one CN Long Term Parking lot, all in this area and managed by Indigo. The sign clearly spells out that there is no charge and no prohibition against parking overnight on any night, as well as free day parking during the weekend. There is a porta-pottie but locked at night. Indigo parking car does stop around rarely but no hassles; mostly security. If you are here on Saturday morning, the Farmer&#39;s Market across the street is a great place to visit (with clean toilet). There are CN tracks behind this lot with some train noise but it is minimal in the evening and on the weekends. During the days, big rigs are moving containers to the container port. There are also cruise boats moving in and out of the cruise port in season. Good downtown location for one or a few nights. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
