  <name>Kiche Manitou campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground in the Spruce Woods Provincial Park. Private sites and with firepits. Beach area.&#xA;No-service sites $13.65 &#xA;Provincial park pass required ($16.50 for a 3 day pass)&#xA;&#xA;Showers $1 for 3 minutes and takes loonies/toonies&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105277 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
