  <desc>Beatiful, lonely spot 2 km off Highway 1, above Juniper Beach campground.&#xA;If train traffic at Juniper bothers you, and you want no neighboroghs, then this off-the-beaten track campground will enthuse you, like it did for us!&#xA;Fire ring and some wood abailable, but no facilities. Beautiful highland desert area in splendid isolation!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 01:59:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105280 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
