  <name>Devon Lions Campground</name>
  <desc>The campground is only open from May 1 until September 30. It is closes for the winter.&#xA;Big campground near little town of Devon right on river.  Edmonton International Airport is close (~20min) but not too loud.  Cheapest camping I found near Edmonton, $30 CAD for tenting, $35 w electric.  Beautiful grounds, nice hiking trail nearby, and right next to golf course.  Lots of amenities&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105461 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
