  <name>Squamish Walmart</name>
  <desc>Stayed there for 3 night with no problem but a lot of other campers!&#xA;Some people said that when there are too many campers after 9 am they give a warning but if you move before 9 am no problem&#xA;&#xA;Quiet for a Walmart parking. Really popular spot.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;LEAVE BEFORE 8H30am. That&#39;s the Walmart rule! &#xA;&#xA;There is better internet across the street at Home Depot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105509 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
