  <name>Kathleen Lake (Parks Canada)</name>
  <desc>The Kathleen Lake campsite is associated with Kluane National Park. Run by Parks Canada. $27.00 per night (max 2 vehicles per site) and firewood is $8.80. Pit toilets, drinking water, fire rings, picnic tables, garbage cans. extra bonus: they have nightly presentations about the National Park and easy access to the King&#39;s Throne Trail and Cottonwood Trail. No cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
