  <name>Gooseberry Cove Provencial Park</name>
  <desc>Goseberry cove is an old provincial park that closed and is now open to the public. Spent the night there with another camper who told us the place is safe to camp. Magnificient site right on the beach, perfect for a swim and watching the sunset. the gravel road down is a bit rough and steep, not fitted for big campers&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
