  <ele>167.9693603515625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-28 19:26:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Fred Henne Territorial Park</name>
  <desc>Huge Campground more than 100 shady sites in a forest, only a few pit toilettes and one shower with flushing toilettes. There are sites close to the lake and some sites on the top of the hill, best for Polarlight watching, most of them with electricity no dump at site. Dump station near the exit.&#xA;No laundry&#xA;&#xA;Good phone reception.&#xA;C$ 32 per car&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 19:26:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105741 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
