  <name>The Spot Laundromat </name>
  <desc>New nice and clean laundry (coin) in Squamish. they have 3 small (5$), 3 big (8$) washers and 4 dryers  (5$ for 10 minutes). 25 min wash 15-20 min dry time.&#xA;&#xA;friendly staff, has wifi and super tasty organic espresso &#xA;mon-fri 10am-5pm.&#xA;sat 11am-6pm.&#xA;sun 11-6&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
