  <name>Cadomin Riverside</name>
  <desc>Large open area near the hamlet of Cadomin. big rigs can get in and easily if ground is dry. Otherwise bumpy and puddles but beautiful setting.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105782 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
