  <ele>83.39788319915533</ele>
  <time>2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roberts Creek Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Typical BC Provincial park with 21 vehicle accessible campsite. All sites are in a forestry area. Sites are $20/party per night which fees are collected daily. Limited space for extra vehicles. Pit toilets, and a sani-dump station for $5, drinking water taps, and campfires. Firewood can be purchased from the park. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105891 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
