  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ontario Park, Free hot showers</name>
  <desc>Privative Free hot showers at the Lake Ontario Park. Not the cleanest but after a long trip it’s just perfect ! &#xA;it take time to be warm but definitely warm shower!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105912 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
