  <name>Ginger Route Trailhead </name>
  <desc>Parking lot at the trailhead with a picnic table and trash bin. It&#39;s less than one kilometre from the RV dump at the local visitor info centre. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/105947 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
