  <ele>977.7858146972279</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frenchman River</name>
  <desc>Very nice place for wildcamping. On top of the frenchriver valley. beautiful sunset. scenic views. two locals came for a nice conversation and says they don&#39;t care if we sleep here. Very windy the night we slept there&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106050 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
