  <ele>526.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nelson airport</name>
  <desc>We have stayed one night on the side of the Lakeside Dr. juste beside Nelson airport.&#xA;it was very quiet at night. Not many cars and no airplanes.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106079 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
