  <desc>Laundromat in walking distance of the wild camping in Charlottetown. Good machines. &#xA;Small load $3.&#xA;Big load $6. &#xA;Coin machine available quarters only.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 14:44:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106142 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
