  <ele>546.2982766310547</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Garland Bay Recreational Park</name>
  <desc>Great campsite on the lake (especially spots 23 and 24). This site is part of www.sightsandtrailsbc.ca. These sites are remote, no services but pit toilet, maintained by BC. Mostly beautiful locations. $15/night all sites. Last 10 km is dirt road, doable also by 2wd. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106185 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
