 <wpt lat="48.255483" lon="-70.417227">
  <ele>197.29503190389494</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc des Artistes</name>
  <desc>Municipal park. Rivière éternité. Parc des artistes. &#xA;Toilet open all day. There were no places left at the provincial park. They suggested we spend the night here. Central fireplace and picnic tables. Fridge available&#xA;Grocery store and food truck right next to campsite.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106202 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
