  <name>Besides Motel Super 8</name>
  <desc>566 Lakeshore Drive. Just on the north side of Super 8 Motel. &#xA;No more home on that lot. Access to the lake on the other side of the road&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106204 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
