 <wpt lat="44.578982" lon="-63.912215">
  <ele>15.374719374622853</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wayside Campground </name>
  <desc>Everything you need in RV sites with 30 &amp; 50 amp service, fresh water and sewer hookups.Open group tenting sites as well as private cozy sites nestled in the forest.Many varied RV sites available. Back-ins, Pull-throughs, secluded or open.&#xA;&#xA;30 AMP 2 WAY SITES&#xA;$45&#xA;&#xA;30 AMP 3 WAY SITES&#xA;$45&#xA;&#xA;50 AMP 3 WAY SITES&#xA;$50&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;SEASONAL SITES&#xA;Inquire with office for rates &amp; availability&#xA;&#xA;TENT SITES&#xA;From open group tenting areas to secluded, private, forested tent sites we have something for all tenters&#xA;&#xA;TENT SITES UNSERVICED&#xA;$40&#xA;Rustic unserviced sites (with water taps nearby)&#xA;&#xA;AMENITIES &amp; ADDONS&#xA;No matter how you camp, we have you covered.&#xA;&#xA;FULL SERVICE WASHROOM BUILDING&#xA;Washroom building with flush toilets, sinks and hot coin operated showers&#xA;&#xA;PLAYGROUND EQUIPMENT FOR THE KIDS&#xA;DUMP STATION ON SITE&#xA;LAUNDROMAT&#xA;Coin laundry on site&#xA;&#xA;HIKING TRAILS NEARBY&#xA;Firewood available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106263 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
