  <ele>-19.447113037109375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pokemouche Camping</name>
  <desc>Nice camping with good sites with waterview. Public restrooms are clean, laundry room ($), pool, canteen ($), little marina, nice kid playgroung and a kid waterpark($). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106271 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
