  <ele>472.880090713501</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lookout over Kamloops</name>
  <desc>Great little pull out on the way up to the start of Battle Bluffs trail head. Amazing views. Dirt road but not bad. Big enough to fit 2 or 3 cars.&#xA;&#xA;Quiet road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106301 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
