 <wpt lat="50.603491" lon="-127.091448">
  <ele>34.40159107575129</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside Pullout</name>
  <desc>At the end of an unnamed road is a simple flat pullout area 20mins from Port McNeill harbour on the headland. In the middle of the forest, there is a little fire pit from previous campers. Little beach access not far to walk. We were the only ones here, seems like not many ppl come this way. Slow cell data. Starlink compatible. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106336 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
