  <ele>21.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 09:59:02 UTC</time>
  <name>Ucluelet Campground</name>
  <desc>They have an overflow, suitable for 8 RVs and several tents. It&#39;s almost opposite the Campground entrance. No services, 35 per night with 2 adults, and you can use the washrooms at campground. OK for 1 night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 09:59:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106345 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
