  <ele>21.000181198120117</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ucluelet campground </name>
  <desc>Large place, nicely situated. Pretty rustic: very few sites only with services. Only one building for showers and washrooms. The latter are ok, the showers are not very good ones. Wifi near office. Overpriced, we paid $50, RV, 2 adults, unserviced site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106346 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
