  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bear Trap Lake</name>
  <desc>Small campsite at edge of lake suitable for van or truck camper. Has a fire pit and very small beach. There is a larger campsite before you get to this one and also three at the end of the road. Good cell service with Bell and Rogers. Trash can available. There’s one spot at  the end that could fit a big rig.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106443 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
