  <name>Walmart Greenwood</name>
  <desc>Small Walmart store, in a mall. The parking lot is large. They asked me to park in the corner, by the road. Fairly quiet, with no other cars or campers the night I stayed. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106445 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
