  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dry Gulch Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Self registration provincial park campsite&#xA;When you first go through the gates, you have to stop and pick up an envelope at the stands to the right.&#xA;A lady came to pick up the envelope with the fee ($25 for one night). &#xA;Each site has a picnic table and pit. Pretty good sized lots. &#xA;Big rig friendly. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106490 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
