  <ele>16.096147537231445</ele>
  <time>2022-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc Ken Duguay </name>
  <desc>Rest area with toilets, shower, barbecue and games for children.  the site is at the edge of the road but has a large area of ​​grass&#xA;.....&#xA;L’air de repos a des sanitaires, douches froides, un barbecue et des jeux pour enfants. Le site est au bord de la route mais bénéficie d’un grand surface en herbe&#xA;&#xA;Restrooms closed for the season on September 16, 2019&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106568 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
