 <wpt lat="47.532665" lon="-79.674036">
  <ele>202.53451525717057</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Temiskaming Shores - Walmart</name>
  <desc>Typical Walmart. Close to the highway but wasn’t overly noisy. Some big rigs and a couple other RVs while we were here. Walmart hours were 7am-10pm. As it’s a smaller town, the lot is a bit smaller than the ones you’d find in a larger city. Toilets inside during opening hours and some fast food places nearby that may have wifi. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106571 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
