  <name>Petro Pass</name>
  <desc>Nice showers at Petro Pass, open 24h. Paid $5.75 for 2 people (shared one cabin). Very clean with hot water, but a little bit cold because of AC. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106589 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
