  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Emerald Lake</name>
  <desc>Small campground at Emerald Lake with a beach. Free. Five established sites with fire pits, picnic tables and tent pads. One outhouse. No camping is allowed at neighboring Crystal Lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106604 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
