 <wpt lat="60.705757" lon="-135.208947">
  <ele>1024.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Parking Fish Lake Road</name>
  <desc>Good sized gravel parking spot halfway up Fish Lake Road. Cool view of downtown at night. No signs. Could get a big rig turned around in here. Slight slope not totally level. Very quiet. Apparently could stay at Fish Lake trailhead too but this place was fine for one night for me. August 2022: We got a reasonable phone signal which for the Yukon was a miracle!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106613 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
