  <desc>Wasn’t on the app so I thought I should add it as an alternative to the one posted for the lot down the road. Arrived apx 8pm and already 5 other campers were set up at rear near open grass area, looks nice for a picnic. Basic Walmart otherwise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106643 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
