  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving Service Centre</name>
  <desc>Friendly staff. Good place to fill up with diesel or gas. Also has propane and can fill motorhomes! As if that weren&#39;t enough, the owner tells me they have potable water out back along the side. Only thing missing is a dump station ; )&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106742 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
