 <wpt lat="59.569668" lon="-133.704046">
  <ele>676.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 08:32:50 UTC</time>
  <name>Norseman RV Park &amp; Marine</name>
  <desc>Visual do lago e das montanhas com um pôr do sol espetacular. Beira do lago. CAD 35 para site completo e 25 sem&#xA; eletricidade e água. Água potável na entrada do camping.  &#xA;Look of the Lake and mountains with a spectacular sunsets. Edge of the Lake. CAD 25 with electricity and water.   Small quimical bathroom. No shower. Drinking water at the entrance of camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 08:32:50 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106758 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
