 <wpt lat="49.462225" lon="-120.474897">
  <ele>625.9557762145996</ele>
  <time>2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Princeton Campground </name>
  <desc>Just a little past Riversedge RV Park, the Princeton Campground is located between the Crowsnest Hwy and the river. Potable water throughout, showers and flush toilets, grass tent sites and gravel rv sites with electric.  Road noise and some sort of factory in the distance. Nice little campground and close enough to town so you can get things. Tent sites $26.50. Not sure about rv sites, but it will be more. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106851 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
