 <wpt lat="49.492461" lon="-117.301591">
  <ele>532.9598117954398</ele>
  <time>2023-12-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Roadside</name>
  <desc>Just the side of a road along the landing track of a very small airport (no planes at night). For RV higher than 7ft use the exact location, for lower ones you can take whatever place along the fence (lot of space). Nothing special but since there is not a lot of place to boondock in Nelson, it does the job.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
