  <ele>-10.3</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cedar Dunes Provincial Park </name>
  <desc>Quiet campground directly at the beach. A few 100 meters to little harbor where you can get lobsters literally directly off the boat. Clean services. Recommended.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106890 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
