 <wpt lat="50.184135" lon="-98.344003">
  <ele>245.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 21:25:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Delta Beach Campground</name>
  <desc>Wide open, right on the lake with a large beach. Clean flush toilets, clean hot showers $1 (loonies only) for a few minutes. Lots of quiet groups while we were there but it was quite windy which made it a little loud. Sites 14 and 15 have spots to get out of the wind, 11 and 12 will be blasted. We checked in and paid online ($17.50 for unserviced) when we arrived since the office was closed (late season). Serviced and unserviced sites available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 21:25:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
