  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cimetière d&#39;Oignon Point</name>
  <desc>Very beautiful place. We were two campers and no one bothered us. There is a v-and-day in the day but the evening is calm.&#xA;---&#xA;Très belle place. Nous étions deux campeurs et personnes ne nous a dérangé. Il y a un v -et-vient le jour mais le soir, c&#39;est le calme.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106910 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
