 <wpt lat="47.237130" lon="-53.974730">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>broadwalk</name>
  <desc>At the end of the footbridge which runs along the beach. It is frequented in the evening by walkers but it is quiet at nightfall.&#xA;----&#xA;Au bout de la passerelle qui longe la plage. C&#39;est fréquenté le soir par les marcheur mais c&#39;est tranquille à la nuit tombée.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106921 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
