 <wpt lat="45.972539" lon="-67.241599">
  <ele>50.71487045288086</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Big Axe Brewery</name>
  <desc>Overnight across from Big Axe Brewery. This craft brewery located just 3kms before the small town of Nackawic is very unique! The town boasts to have the largest Axe in the world. The brewery is beautiful - log building, with a great selection and excellent staff. We were welcome to park and stay directly across the road from the brewery. It is a park-like setting by the Saint John River. The area we parked in was beside the volleyball court. Ask the bartender if you are unsure. Love this place, will definitely drop in again when driving thru NB. Not far off the hwy at all. There is also a B&amp;B next door run by same family. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106922 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
