 <wpt lat="49.389309" lon="-57.710640">
  <ele>1.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Route 431</name>
  <desc> Pin isn’t in the right place! But it’s a really cool spot on the beach with mountains surrounding. Couple fire pits, a broken down bus. Leave no trace.  Wonderful spot by the lake. Down a gravel road far enough from the main road and well hidden. Plenty of room for a few campers, and bigger area just before the lake.  Big vehicles and big RVs can turn but be prepared for many pot holes. No service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/106951 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
