  <time>2024-01-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lois Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free Campground at Lois Lake. Nice forest campsites and a few near to the beach. Pit toilets. No drinking water. Very bad gravel road. Please follow the canoe route, if you take the “wrong” way, you also get to the Campground, but the road is in a really bad condition. The bottom of our car touched the ground twice. The canoe route is rough too though. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107058 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
