 <wpt lat="61.152426" lon="-119.739447">
  <ele>266.10213736957814</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small lake along MacKensie Highway</name>
  <desc>This is ons of many spots along the highway. Short gravel side roads (10 to 50m) lead to small lakes, used by road maintenance trucks to refill their road sprinkler tanks. Just don’t pick a spot where a water pump is installed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107185 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
