  <ele>34.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Brockville</name>
  <desc>Hello&#xA;One more Walmart for night. &#xA;Lot of places, lot of Wi-Fi, lot of shops, and also, lot of noise..!!! :)&#xA;Not more noisy than other Walmart or some RV park...&#xA;Have a sweet night &#xA;Thank to Walmart for this place. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107263 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
