 <wpt lat="45.762156" lon="-64.708863">
  <ele>2.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Broadleaf ranch</name>
  <desc>Ranch with camping and rv sites fully serviced. Wifi, playground, free washing machine and 1$ dryer. Restaurant. Well-maintained, dog friendly and very nice staff. Short drive to national park, cap enragé and Hopewell rocks. Offers horseback riding, some trails, swimming pond, cabins and glamping units.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107400 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
