  <name>End of Fisherman’s Harbor Lake</name>
  <desc>Small gravel driveway leads to an opening by the lakeshore. Not recommended for big rigs but fine for a 24’ sprinter. Beautiful view by the lake. Quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 20:35:21 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107527 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
