  <ele>22.376690552569926</ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pubnico Point Trail</name>
  <desc>Parking lot for access point to Pubnico Point Trail.  No facilities, but very private and short walk to beach.  No signs prohibiting overnight camping.  Noise from nearby windmills.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
