  <ele>89.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Le Grand Sault Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Parking lot for trail.  Really nice spot with outhouse and picnic table.  Even has two tent sites. Tons of grassy space for tents besides that. Probably only suitable for vans and truck campers.  If coming from East, be advised that Route Madigan is little more than an ATV trail - better to come in from the West.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107534 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
