  <time>2022-08-26 09:42:08 UTC</time>
  <name>Sombrio beach</name>
  <desc>Beautiful beach for surfing and tent camping. Self registration, 10$/night per adult. Hike to bring your things to the beach is about .5 km from the parking lot. Fire pits, toilets and food cache available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-26 09:42:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107568 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
