  <name>Bay de Verde</name>
  <desc>A parking lot (under development) next to the road (little traffic) with a nice view over the bay - great for whale watching ... if they happen to be here. There is another parking area with overnight possibilities and picnic tables further down the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
