  <ele>430.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Revelstoke riverside</name>
  <desc>Close to the Columbia River, directly at the slippery area. There are no sign &#34;No overnight parking&#34;. If you drive further south the street, there are a lot of them. Quiet and beautiful views to river &amp; mountains. &#xA;&#xA;***Law Enforcement of the City come this morning and say no overnight anywhere in the City, no boondocking here. they take our licence plate and quite.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
