  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Southview Campground </name>
  <desc>Free municipal (Greenview District) campground. Spacious, well maintained and&#xA;in a lovely spot. It’s big enough for a 30ft rig to get in and out of for sure. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107592 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
