  <ele>1197.4</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Hinton</name>
  <desc>Big place with a lot of place to camp for free. 30 km before Hinton on the right side of the highway. Pull out 200m from the highway. &#xA;Quiet and good to stay for as many days you need. Sometimes the train passes nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107600 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
