  <ele>810.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free Camping at Kootenay River</name>
  <desc>Pull out from the highway just at the right side of the bridge. &#xA;Enter 100 meters on a dirty road and turn right. Big grassy area junt beside the river. &#xA;When the sun goes down many mosquitoes. Nice place to stay. Beautifull view from the mountains.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107601 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
