  <ele>295.3734327458759</ele>
  <time>2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pipeline service area</name>
  <desc>Big, open and level space in the forest. The space was built to access the gas pipeline, not sure if the pipeline is still in use. The area is overgrown with grass. Good access road, suitable for any vehicle, also for big rigs or trailers. No services, no cell coverage, but lots of wildlife. Not sure how bad it is with mosquitoes in summer, now in September there aren’t any. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107862 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
