  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>East Park Campground</name>
  <desc>A really nice quiet and peaceful campground. Currently there are no electrical sites but in the near future there will be. There is a store onsite where you can buy some emergency items.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/107954 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
