  <name>Walmart .Sussex</name>
  <desc>Walmart is always a backup if needed. Next to a highway so not super quiet. Store open until 9pm. Groceries, fast food nearby. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108033 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
