 <wpt lat="54.767419" lon="-127.438918">
  <ele>845.6330223083496</ele>
  <time>2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dennis Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Absolutely beautiful lakefront campsites available at Dennis Lake. 4 large picnic tables with their respective fire rings. Small dock to launch small water-crafts. Wood cut and stacked ready for you. Lake water is crystal clear for being rather shallow. Good vantage point of the mountain. Area more welcoming to small vehicles and ground tents. Road coming to site deactivated but be cautious of possible traffic. Utilize the pullouts. Site is reached under an hour from Smithers, BC.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108035 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
