  <ele>654.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Estacionamento Eagle Plains</name>
  <desc>Overnight in the Restaurant Parking. The place is safe and quiet at night. If you are a customer, you are allowed to use the restrooms and get water to drink ... Very good Wi-Fi for $ 5 ...&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Pernoitamos no Estacionamento do Restaurante. O local é seguro e quieto durante a noite. Se Você for cliente, é permitido usar os banheiros e pegar água para beber... Wi-Fi muito bom por U$5...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108074 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
