  <ele>660.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tahltan Territory - Stikine Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful places for overnight camping, on both of the banks of the Stikine river. (This was where the ferry landed until 1973.) Noisy because of the iron bridge. The northern bank has two large sites and has a pit toilet. The southern bank has one site close to the water and two more higher up in the trees.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108076 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
