  <name>Rock River Government Campground</name>
  <desc>A very good basic campground of the Yukon Government. 17 wind-protected sites in the boreal forest, level ground, picnic tables, fire ring and free firewood, clean pit toilets with paper, waste bins, bear-proof lockers, and a big shelter at the river. Self registration, $20 per night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108149 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
