  <name>Southcenter Mall</name>
  <desc>Five designated spots in the mall parking lot near the CIBC bank. Must contact the mall ahead of time to reserve a spot and get a overnight parking permit. https://southcentremall.com/rv-parking-reservation/ Parking lot patrolled by security and permit must be visible in windshield. Lot was quiet at night and we slept soundly. We stayed two consecutive nights which is the maximum.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108570 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
