  <name>Brenda Mines Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>BC sites and trails maintained site - free camping. Off forestry service roads that are rough at times. About 6 spots here with a pit toilet, 3 or 4 picnic tables and fire pits. Lake side with a trail down to the waters edge. Sign posted at entrance with rules. ~1600m&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
