 <wpt lat="51.164588" lon="-118.205107">
  <ele>574.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>lakeside boondock</name>
  <desc>Just north of the park there&#39;s a tiny track that slots left towards the lake. Its tight with low branches and narrow. But if you don&#39;t mind a few light scratches you could probably fit a sprinter down here. We&#39;re in a Westy which was no problem.&#xA;&#xA;At the end is a flat clearing and an abandoned old caravan, but another 100m you can get right to the lake side. Big rocks needed to level, or plenty of tent options in the trees. Super view, lovely lake. Small amount of road noise. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108714 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
