 <wpt lat="55.232854" lon="-118.256895">
  <ele>983.5</ele>
  <time>2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moody’s Crossing Camground</name>
  <desc>$25 per night&#xA;&#xA;Campground with 16 large campsites which include a picnic table and fire pit. Porta-potties and pit toilets scattered around the grounds and free firewood is offered. Seems like they cut new stuff almost daily. Easy for big rigs to get in and out, no restrictions &#xA;&#xA;Short walk to the riverfront which has amazing views of the northern lights. Great spot! &#xA;&#xA;It’s an amazing campground but with no reservations for the spot and they do fill quickly, especially on weekends, so get in early! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/108928 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
