  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping du Quai, Riviere du Loups</name>
  <desc>This campground has good rates as they offer a sites with only 15 amp electricity or no service if you like.&#xA;Typical commercial campground sites somewhat crowded, but most have grass which is nice.&#xA; Washer and dryer are cheap. Showers cramped, but hot water good. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109155 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
