  <ele>42.74966255710018</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shubie Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground within Dartmouth, next to a park with large pond &amp; residential neighborhood. There is highway some city traffic noise, 10 minutes to Halifax Ferry. 44$ small 15 amp electric site. Some trees, tenting sites next to wall of trees, some larger pull through with 3 services near entrance(30 &amp; 50s). Clean washrooms, coin operated showers. If coming in &amp; out at night you will need a keycard to open gate, 20$ deposit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109233 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
