  <desc>Different tables with trees and nice green (tenting and fire is not allowed). Very fast wifi in the whole area. Sign: “Please Limit your stay to 8 hours“. No shelter and firepits. Heated Water-Bathrooms and a playground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109237 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
