  <time>2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ross Creek Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Rest stop on both sides of highway, pit toilets, separate truck to car lane. Pretty open and no ‘no camping’ signs. 2km towards Edmonton on weekends there’s a cute Flea Market which was nice to stop in also.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109384 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
