 <wpt lat="45.345698" lon="-75.715315">
  <ele>84.59663064526903</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nepean Creek East</name>
  <desc>Quiet municipal parking lot surrounded by green space in a business park. Formally called Nepean Creek East Parking. Large gravel lot for Nepean Creek Park. Surrounded by large sports fields and some trees in all directions. Easy access to main routes via Colonnade Road. &#xA;&#xA;Features a clean composting toilet and 5 bar LTE service. Lot is also connected to a small dog park. Plenty of room for larger rigs. No parking restrictions overnight, had a very peaceful night here. &#xA;&#xA;Please keep this area beautiful and use the provided garbage cans to dispose of your waste. Further parking information can be obtained by calling the City of Ottawa at 611.&#xA;&#xA;There is a potable water fountain at the playground behind the soccer fields in the east.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109390 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
