  <desc>Pay $7.35 for an individual shower room. Passably clean, good pressure, warm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
