 <wpt lat="45.382182" lon="-64.270058">
  <ele>22.34444550967585</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Glooscap Park Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground with ocean views and beach access. Really nice view. Site for small rv with power and water was 35$. Some pull through sites and some seasonal campers, dump station. They sell good firewood for reasonable price and their ice is the usual size bag but really large chunks that lasted longer in the cooler than the smaller cubes.  Clean pit toilets and coin showers, $1 for 5 minutes. Near Parrsboro, a town with a good bakery and brewery, a few restaurants, antique store,  grocery store and a theatre company. This is a well known fossil and gem area, great fossil museum in the town. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
