  <ele>802.987493642</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mineral Licks Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Gravel lot, out of sight from the road. Suitable for all kinds of vehicles. Nice 1.5 km walking trail with wildlife viewing possibilities (bison, stone sheep). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109590 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
