  <ele>385.4067840576172</ele>
  <time>2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest stop</name>
  <desc>Observation area next highway. Ok to stay one night. Has picnic tables and a nice view on mountains. No sign “no over-night”, but noisy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109701 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
