  <ele>735.3022011909416</ele>
  <time>2022-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Granisle Lions Beach Park</name>
  <desc>A very pretty lakeside campground run by local volunteers. Grassy lakeside picnic tables, children’s play area and a small jetty. $20 for powered site. $10 for dry camping. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
