  <ele>71.01587080141384</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ferry Island Campground </name>
  <desc>Municipal campground in Terrace. Surrounded by tall trees, the gravel sites are large and have tables and a fire ring. Some with power. Dry camping is  $22, other 30$. Dump in town, 5 minutes drive from the park across the bridge at the  visitor centre. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109714 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
