 <wpt lat="53.192283" lon="-121.383432">
  <ele>987.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Atlan Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free Rec Site with 3 tables, firepits and one pit toilet. Close to Barkerville. Turn bevor Barkerville on Borrown lake road and drive a few kilometers then turn right on 2900rd. It&#39;s a rough gravel road but 2wd should be fine. Wouldn&#39;t recommend it for big rigs. Just follow a few km till the Recreation Site Sign. Very nice spot close to the lake. Stayed here one night for my own. Lots of firewood too. Perfect if you want to visit Barkerville or go Gold panning &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109716 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
