  <ele>526.0089381037304</ele>
  <time>2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lion&#39;s Club Campground</name>
  <desc>Free campground in a little village. Flat and grassy area with trees, shelter, picnic table, firepit and pit toilet. Very quiet !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109734 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
