  <ele>167.13259574712168</ele>
  <time>2023-09-08 09:41:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fairview Park</name>
  <desc>Nice little campground with tent sites, full hookup, flush toilets, showers... Not busy at this time so lot of space but might be busy in summer with not lot of privacy. Lovely river in the middle. 33$ for a tent site without water and electricity.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 09:41:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
