  <ele>17.10993480682373</ele>
  <time>2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>MacLeod’s  Beach &amp; Campsite</name>
  <desc>Beautiful property! I didn’t stay the night but a road sign said they had showers. He initially said $5 for a shower because he thought I was part of a group, but didn’t charge me when he realized it was just one person. Showers were clean and hot! Definitely worth $5 in my opinion :)&#xA;&#xA; 902-258-2433&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109739 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
