  <desc>Community center with free Wifi. Access to the pool with hot tub, steam shower, sauna and small waterslide for 6.50$ CAN. Was really nice to hang there and take a shower after a couple days of rain and cold.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109756 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
