 <wpt lat="48.474129" lon="-81.394135">
  <ele>246.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 18:15:47 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Supercentre</name>
  <desc>It is allowed to stay overnight with a motorhome. You can use the washrooms during the opening hours (7 am - 11 pm).&#xA;There is free wifi in the store.&#xA;Bright at night with a lot of headlights. People played frisbee there at night. Was not so quiet...we couldn&#39;t sleep well !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 18:15:47 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109877 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
