 <wpt lat="48.168357" lon="-53.964896">
  <ele>69.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 12:46:17 UTC</time>
  <name>Sheppard&#39;s Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Self serviced laundry opened 7 days a week from 8am to 8pm. Plenty of washing machines and dryers. 3$ for each (1$ coins accepted only - no exchanger at the site). Nice washroom, two tables and couple of chairs available. They provide the books for reading as well.&#xA;&#xA;We used only dryer, which finished &#34;Normal&#34; cycle in about 45mins, drying our laundry well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 12:46:17 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109903 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
