  <ele>218.43708582812178</ele>
  <time>2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clint Beek Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>A wonderful recreation site directly on the lake. You can swim in the lake. In September we were alone there for two days. it&#39;s a top place. just 20 minutes from Port McNeill. &#xA;&#xA;Free in the off season, in 2020 it&#39;s $15 in the on season:&#xA;Fees:$15.00 Camping&#xA;Fee Applies:Jun 26, 2020 - Sep 6, 2020&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/109985 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
