  <ele>470.03927471931104</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stewart Crossing Bridge</name>
  <desc>Small spot close to the boat launch and bridge over the Stewart River. Firepit and river view and access. Can hear the traffic on the bridge but quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110001 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
