 <wpt lat="44.516941" lon="-63.936017">
  <ele>14.345053802244365</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 18:50:16 UTC</time>
  <name>King Neptune Campground</name>
  <desc>A small privately owned campground right on the water. Approximately 50 sites, many with water and 30 Amp electrical. Unserviced sites are $40/night, serviced are $45. Located 5 minutes from Peggy&#39;s Cove, perfect location for watching the sun set. Picnic tables available at each site, fires in designated areas only. Little to no privacy and very little space between neighbors.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 18:50:16 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110055 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
