  <ele>88.5</ele>
  <time>2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ivy Lea Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice campground. Some grass campsites some more into the woods. Washrooms and showers available.  Short drive off the 401. Main road nearby. Some road noise depending on the site you get &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110083 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
