  <name>Corney Brook Campsite</name>
  <desc>Corney Brook / Rivière à Lazare&#xA;Small self-registration campsite next to a nice beach. Basic facilities -Washrooms, shelter, dishwashing sinks, potable water, picnic tables, and fire pits but no showers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110092 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
