  <name>Rest Stop at 614 turn off</name>
  <desc>[cyclist]A small rest stop at the junction with pit toilet and picnic tables. It would be hard to park an RV there, but one arrived during the night and stayed. It is at the junction so very loud at night, specially as there is a truck stop on the other side of the hwy 17. Not a quiet place, but goes as an emergency.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
