  <ele>261.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Waswanipi</name>
  <desc>An 8 km gravel road from Highway 113 brings you to this beautiful place. There is a sandy beach with a boat launch, pit toilets, firepits and picnictables.&#xA;It&#39;s 5$ for a night.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
