  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadsde pullout</name>
  <desc>Tried to find the lake site nearby but couldn&#39;t find the turnoff, instead camped here. Very quiet roadsde pullout although did hear maybe a few hunting gunshots in the early evening? Probably similar quality to &#34;okay for sleep&#34; further west on the road but I didn&#39;t check that one out.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110183 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
