  <ele>13.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-31 12:22:26 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte municipale Paspébiac</name>
  <desc>On this municipal halte you can find a tap with drinking water at the back of the restroom.&#xA;With the autorisation of the women who work here we have refill our bottles and the tank of our motorhome. &#xA;You need 15 meters hoose.&#xA;And of course you have clean restroom and a nice place for pic-nic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 12:22:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110222 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
