  <ele>1039.7928829193115</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blackfoot Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Truck Stop with diner and gas station. &#xA;We asked the cashier of the gas station if parking overnight was okay. He did not have a problem with it and told us where to park. &#xA;Not very nice place, it‘s loud and there are a lot of street lamps. But good enough for one night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110226 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
