  <desc>Very nice clean new machines. $4 for a double load. Comfortable couch to sit on, power outlets to charge all your devices and very fast WiFi. Large parking lot out back with space for even the biggest camper. Best laundry ever&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110311 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
