 <wpt lat="54.060288" lon="-124.685520">
  <ele>715.445556640625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 08:16:42 UTC</time>
  <name>Drywilliam Lake Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Large rest stop with 2 parking areas, pit toilets, picnic tables, &amp; trash bins on a very pretty scenic lake. It is right off the road, and you can see and hear traffic go by, but it&#39;s free and there are not any signs saying &#34;no camping or overnight parking&#34; like many rest areas in BC. Easy turn around for the biggest of big rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 08:16:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110429 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
