  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 13:17:05 UTC</time>
  <name>Silent Witness memorial</name>
  <desc>Follow signs for Memorial. Gravel road leads down to memorial and a bit past it to waters edge. Flat spot to park, picnic table. Porta potty at Memorial site. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 13:17:05 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/110984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
