  <ele>229.81692222785205</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Penn Lake Park and Campground </name>
  <desc>Very clean and well-maintained campsite, seems always open. We arrived at 10:30pm.&#xA;&#xA;Larger bathrooms, coin-operates laundry machines and 3 showers, including one accessible/family friendly.&#xA;&#xA;Don’t need to camp here to use the facility - please leave the place better than you found it! They really deserve our gratitude and love.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111091 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
