 <wpt lat="46.879040" lon="-64.231618">
  <ele>2.0328025817871094</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miminegash Harbor</name>
  <desc>Very large, very active lobstering Harbor parking lot-50 large new lobster boats tied up when we arrived(4PM), all gone by 6AM the following morning! Very friendly and helpful fisherman, just find a spot where you’ll be out of the way(many options). A small gas station and convenience store are a few hundred yards away. The coastal portion of Rt. 14 is a beautiful drive. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111113 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
