  <desc>Very good rest area. &#xA;Big parking lot.&#xA;Real toilets.&#xA;Picnic tables.&#xA;Dump Station (seasonal).&#xA;Fresh water fill (seasonal)&#xA;Large grassy areas for pets&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111116 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
