  <ele>203.3</ele>
  <time>2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nicolston Dam RV Park</name>
  <desc> RV Park in Ontario nestled on the Nottawasaga River Wind by the Nicol Family. Quiet and friendly, sides with 15 or 30 Amp and drinking water as well as no service sites. Laundry, showers, dump station, recycling, garbage, firewood ( 10CAD) &amp; WiFi on sites&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111291 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
