  <ele>784.9267578125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to the lake</name>
  <desc>Next to the highway, but a little lower than highway. Park on the lake, quiet at night, big enough for several small rvs or 1 large rv. We had a good rest and no one bothered us.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111341 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
