 <wpt lat="46.753968" lon="-72.806503">
  <ele>126.0</ele>
  <time>2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rivère à la pèche</name>
  <desc>The best campground we have seen travelling across Canada + Alaska. Perfect sanitary ammenities: private showers perfectly clean at no extra cost.  An additional kitchen shelter - ideal for tent travellers with wood fireplace, sink with warm water. The cost for RV with no electricity $25,50.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111357 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
