  <desc>Landromat, 2 choice wash 4$ or 6$. Dryer 3 minutes for a quarter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 09:58:09 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111378 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
