 <wpt lat="45.641697" lon="-60.479494">
  <ele>8.336519586253864</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach / lake camp</name>
  <desc>Flat open grassy hill on the beach. Overlooking a lake. Few fire pits. Room for big rigs.  Gravel road in for about 2 km. Wide and easy going. No 4wd required.   &#xA;&#xA;Gate near end. Was open when I came.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111446 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
