 <wpt lat="45.691812" lon="-60.344069">
  <ele>24.8</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cliff top camping</name>
  <desc>Camping spot upon the cliff, overlooking the ocean. Nice elevated view. Room for 1 - 2 vehicles.  No fire pits / facilities.  &#xA;&#xA;Follow gravel road towards coast. The final section is a loop road which goes to the site. One section of the loop road is quite overgrown, but you don’t need to use that section (go back the way you came).&#xA;&#xA;No 4wd required. We managed with a 2wd van, high clearance. Biggest issue is mud.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111447 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
