  <ele>15.723297119140625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gull Cove Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Parking at trailhead.  Suitable for one night. Next to cemetery. A trash can for the hike is available, no other amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111448 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
