  <ele>72.57928848266602</ele>
  <time>2024-04-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Backroad camp spot</name>
  <desc>Pull in off a corner. Room for one vehicle. Fire pit. No facilities. Nearby river, but no access.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111450 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
