 <wpt lat="49.036170" lon="-122.271400">
  <ele>-0.8</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Abbotsford</name>
  <desc>Signs saying no overnight parking, but we checked with customer services and they said it&#39;s fine for short stays at the far end of lot. We stayed 1 night in a small van with no issues, except for a bit of noise from lorries and trains in the night. Walmart is open 7am-11pm. Walmart has water fountains and WiFi inside, but Home Depot WiFi reaches the car park nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
