 <wpt lat="46.089930" lon="-60.854057">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baddeck Cabot Trail campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground with reasonable prices. They have unserviced and 15 amp sites which are in pretty treed location by the river. 30 amp sites not so nice. Campers lounge is heated and has a TV and pool table. laundry facilities. Clean bathrooms. Dishwashing station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111508 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
