 <wpt lat="54.643643" lon="-127.229706">
  <ele>603.8997658554938</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Telkwa River Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Nice recreation site on the Telkwa River - free. Several spots with picnic tables and enough space to park your camper van etc.  Outhouses provided.&#xA;You leave Telkwa to the west and follow a forestry road. The drive is bumpy and muddy, but no AWD required.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111567 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
