 <wpt lat="50.586006" lon="-127.091314">
  <ele>3.523676034063101</ele>
  <time>2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brougthon Strait Campground</name>
  <desc>Quiet Campground very close to PortMcNeill, we stayed here before taking the ferry to Alert Bay (recommended!) the next morning.&#xA;&#xA;Campground is a little rustic, but friendly hosts and all amenities available, even free laundry machine and drier. - as of May 23 no longer free.&#xA;&#xA;Hot showers, dumping station, powered sites and free fast WiFi everywhere on the campground. - as of may&#39;23 don&#39;t think WiFi is still available.&#xA;&#xA;20$ for a tent site, 30$ for an RV. We were a bit off season and got the tent price for our small camper van.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111688 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
