 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="59.121464" lon="-129.818208">
  <ele>786.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>South Rest Area </name>
  <desc>South Rest Area on the side of river. Four picnic tables and a very clean pit toilet. &#34;Please limit your stay to 8 hours&#34; sign. No tents or campfires. Very nice view of the mountains and the river. Easy access and hidden from the highway.&#xA;&#xA;There is another Rest Area on the other side of the River next to the one already in iOverlander. I guess there was a bridge connecting both (dead ends on both Rest Areas). This one is signed if you come from the south (Dease Lake).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
