 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.183428" lon="-119.345052">
  <ele>430.6995218070224</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 17:31:11 UTC</time>
  <name>Kekuli Bay Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Nice Provincial Park just outside of Vernon.&#xA;Close to the highway- but because it’s lower and there are lots of trees- it’s not too loud.&#xA;Beautiful lots and amazing landscapes.&#xA;4 lots with power- but there you don’t have either privacy or a good view.&#xA;Unserviced is 33 $ until the end of October- after that day it’s free until the first snow- then they close the park.&#xA;&#xA;there is a free sani dump in Vermon. this site is totally unserviced&#xA;&#xA;sites are in terraces up the hill&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 17:31:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
