  <ele>699.7001218224834</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sumas Mountain Upper Lot</name>
  <desc>Upper parking lot/viewpoint at the Sumas Mountain Regional Park. There is a gate at the bottom of the hill which is locked between 6pm and 7am in winter, 9pm and 7am in summer, which keeps night traffic quiet. Outhouses and garbage bins on site. Nice hiking and MTB trails for pre-dinner activity.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
