  <ele>1341.603230759471</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Abraham Lake  </name>
  <desc>4X4 experience required &#xA;&#xA;this is a really nice place for 4x4 vehicles with good ground clearance... the road down here is quite an adventure! space for 3 or 4 vehicles. several fire rings directly on the water. perfect for fishing, kayaking or other watersports. awesome snow covered mountain view. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111731 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
