  <ele>91.43938944395632</ele>
  <time>2023-08-18 17:04:26 UTC</time>
  <name>Rideau Canal Lock 43,44 - Upper Brewers</name>
  <desc>Parking associated with Upper Brewers lockstation on the Rideau Canal.  Parking lot is at the end of Canal road.  If the canal is open, there is a $5 per person charge for camping at the lockstation.  Far enough from the highway that there is minimal noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 17:04:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111843 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
