 <wpt lat="47.604120" lon="-53.287470">
  <ele>11.2</ele>
  <time>2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ryan’s Brook</name>
  <desc>Small area to camp right on the water, provided by the Municipality of Spaniards Bay. Freshwater brook running into the ocean. Picnic table and benches. The main road is close by, so some noise. No toilets, a little trashy (2021, there is a garbage can by the sign.) Please keep the area clean!). Nice spot for the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111900 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
