  <ele>19.88552474975586</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 07:05:18 UTC</time>
  <name>Ferryland Lighthouse Road. Upper Parking</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking area off the road to the lighthouse. Single lane gravel road suitable for cars and 2WD trucks. B-class not recommended. Great views and just enough wind to keep the nippers down. Still requires a further hike up to the lighthouse.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 07:05:18 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111909 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
