  <name>Stephenville Aquatic Center</name>
  <desc>Aquatic center with lap pool, hot showers and bathroom facilities. $6.00 per adult. Expect timetable to change - when we arrived the hours were 8 - 9, 11-12 &amp; 6-9. Closed Sundays. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111931 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
