 <wpt lat="52.362381" lon="-107.136626">
  <ele>498.13175271451473</ele>
  <time>2023-10-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Decomissioned Road</name>
  <desc>This decomissioned road is part of the original road that crossed the original single lane Borden Bridge. The road is double wide and is effectively a dead end, however it is still a public road with no signage indicating that parking is not allowed. The shoulder of the road is the width of a full standard vehicle. Not much privacy but at least its far enough from the highway and the city that it remains dark and quiet enough to sleep.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/111964 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
