 <wpt lat="46.964538" lon="-79.793086">
  <ele>269.10565185546875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wilson Lake Road</name>
  <desc>Large campsite right off the main dirt road. Close to highway. Full cell reception. Lots of room for tents or RVs/Trailers. Small boat launch and access to the lake. A few stone fire pits. Although high voltage powerlines are nearby, the nnEMF readings are reasonably low and significantly lower than most people&#39;s bedrooms. Maximum RF measured 7.40 microWatts/Sq Meter (using Safe and Sound Pro II Broadband RF Meter). Maximum AC Magnetic Frequency measured 16 nT. Maximum AC Electrical Frequency measured 2 V/m (using GIGAHERTZ SOLUTIONS ME3830B meter).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112018 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
