  <desc>The usual. Fairly quiet. Slow Internet. Pets OK.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112042 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
