 <wpt lat="45.479690" lon="-73.574150">
  <ele>11.667134520808299</ele>
  <time>2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Residential street</name>
  <desc>Relatively quiet residential street. There&#39;s a park and river on one side and a very popular market and grocery stores within walking distance. &#xA;Only restriction on this particular street is no a parking on Wednesday mornings but there&#39;s a few other streets around that have different restrictions. &#xA;Spots seem to fill up around 5pm with people coming home from work but if you can get here earlier, there&#39;s no time restrictions on parking and it&#39;s a great location. &#xA;There are toilets near the ice cream shop at atwater markets. No services.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
