  <ele>36.12203009784101</ele>
  <time>2024-01-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>BAINESVILLE-ON route-Rest stop</name>
  <desc>Rest stop with big parking lot, picnic area, Burger King, Tim Hortons, toilets, tourist info and tap at side of building for water. Can easily refill portable tanks. Also free (very slow) internet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112044 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
