 <wpt lat="45.514660" lon="-63.947090">
  <ele>182.8799941478402</ele>
  <time>2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Simpson Lake</name>
  <desc>Located in Collingwood, NS, approx. 1.2 km off Wyvern road (snowmobile trail) you will find two sites right on the water on Simpson Lake. The first is very open, the second more secluded (we chose the second). This is on a major atv / snowmobile trail and we did have some atv traffic during the evening. It is not accessible by vehicle in the winter. There is a large firepit at the water&#39;s edge and you can easily launch a kayak / canoe here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112047 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
