 <wpt lat="49.318175" lon="-122.472332">
  <ele>174.77121591045557</ele>
  <time>2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Golden Ears Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Nice provincial park. Co-ordinates are for the Sani dump, proceed along the main for for a few hundred meters to the entrance. Paid $35/night, no hook ups. We stayed in October and it wast very busy. Easily fit our rig at 31’ + 11’ utility trailer. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112128 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
