  <ele>0.6865491688416299</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nitinat river provincial park </name>
  <desc>Spots by the river in a provincial park. There are sites on both sides of the river but without a 4x4 would recommend only this spot. No amenities so pack it out to keep it clean please. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112148 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
