 <wpt lat="60.727314" lon="-135.059826">
  <ele>632.1585693359375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jiffy Lube</name>
  <desc>A first-come-first-serve oil change garage. They also check some key points of your car (tire-pressure, levels, windshield wipers,...) and offer some replacements. &#xA;They don&#39;t lift the car so they won&#39;t check other things or problems, it&#39;s really only for an oil change (but a very quick one!) &#xA;We did an oil change here, we also filled up the RV with water, while getting the oil changed....which was fantastic since most of the taps outside are frozen!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
