  <desc>Drinking Fontain to fill up bottles or canisters. Right next to a public washroom. Our 20 litres canister fitted very well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-11-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112627 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
