 <wpt lat="50.883350" lon="-119.892390">
  <ele>1249.6</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sun Peaks Parking lot</name>
  <desc>Overnight RV camping available in one of the large Sun peaks parking areas. $25 nightly fee. Great access to the lifts for mountain biking and a 5-10 minute walk to the village. It rained the day we arrived and the parking lot was very muddy, be sure not to track mud into your rig :)&#xA;&#xA;RV camping tickets are available from the guest services.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
