 <wpt lat="53.516180" lon="-63.982840">
  <ele>107.30908203125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Churchill Falls Generating Station</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at end of road, next to Churchill River. Beautiful view of river, and short trail to view of tail races. No signs prohibiting overnight parking or camping. Nice grassy picnic area with small  screened gazebo, 3 outside picnic tables, 2 benches. Looks like a larger gazebo is being built.  Boat ramp, as well as wooden staircase down to river and dock. 2-3 bars 4G reception! As usual, lots of black flies and mosquitos, unless there is a breeze.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112803 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
