  <ele>64.18550486024469</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Road entrance to a few camping spots</name>
  <desc>Three very nice and quiet wild camping spots, all within 850 meters from the entrance.&#xA;The nearest one is large enough for big rigs.&#xA;There are two other spots down the road that are on the river side, you should walk to take a look before you go in there with a trailer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112902 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
