  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Viking Mall Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>We had dinner at Pizza Delight, and asked if we could park our motorhome in the parking lot for the night. They said it wouldn’t be a problem, and that RV’s park there overnight all the time. There was definitely lots of room for our 30 ft motorhome at the back of the lot near the Tim Hortons. There’s a Foodland and several other retail stores there as well.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;25 Goose Cove Rd, St. Anthony, NL A0K 4S0&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/112965 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
