  <ele>315.58247551144945</ele>
  <time>2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hutch Lake Campground &amp; Day Use Park</name>
  <desc>Just north of High level near Watt Mountain lies the man-made Hutch Lake. &#xA;-Day use area&#xA;- Shelter &#xA;- 21 non-service camp sites&#xA;- Sanitary dump station &#xA;- Firewood and fire pits available&#xA;- Outhouse&#xA;- Playground&#xA;- Walking trails &#xA;- Volleyball &amp; horseshoe pits&#xA;- Beach &amp; Swimming&#xA;- Fishing &#xA;- Dock &amp; boat launch&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/113693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
