 <wpt lat="58.282330" lon="-119.291560">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rainbow Lake Provincial Campground</name>
  <desc>Rainbow Lake Provincial Campground is located 38 kilometres southwest of town. The campground is run by a committee of volunteers and is solely funded by donations and a small seasonal or nightly fee. It boasts a beautiful sandy beach with an enclosed swimming dock. Our boat launch and dock are easily accessible and available for public use. Our children’s park and horseshoe pit is ideally located in the center of the campground. The tranquility of the lake and superb fishing make this an ideal getaway spot for locals and travellers alike. Call to reserve site as facility is extremely popular.&#xA;&#xA;Amenities:&#xA;-Day Use Area&#xA;-Shelter&#xA;-7 Tenting Designated Spots&#xA;-23 Campsites Non Serviced Sites&#xA;-Sanitary Dump Available in the Town of Rainbow Lake&#xA;-Space for Large RV’s&#xA;-Firewood &amp; Fire Pits Available&#xA;-Outhouse, No Running Water&#xA;-Limited Cell Reception, no Wifi&#xA;-Dining in the Town of Rainbow Lake&#xA;-Playground&#xA;-9 Hole Golf Course in the Town of Rainbow Lake&#xA;-Walking Trails&#xA;-Beach &amp; Swimming&#xA;-Fishing&#xA;-Dock &amp; Boat Launch&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/113694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
