  <ele>-14.29315185546875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>dirt road leading to grassy area (high clearance recommended)</name>
  <desc>dirt road leading to a grassy area next to a beach(not the nicest beach as lots of seaweed when we were there), quiet and good for the night. looks like it&#39;s used by locals judging by the fire ring marks on the grass.  &#xA;Data is available but not wifi&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/113814 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
