 <wpt lat="45.625232" lon="-66.072413">
  <ele>-6.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>old ferry departure site</name>
  <desc>This is a dead end street. Its the site of an old ferry to a local island. So it has a large flat parking area. No houses near by. It would be hard to turn a big trailer around but a class b or c  would be fine.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/113944 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
