 <wpt lat="50.284440" lon="-117.827640">
  <ele>447.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Upper Arrow Lake, Nakusp</name>
  <desc>Top campsite at the shore of Upper Arrow Lake with a great view over the lake and the Monashee Mountains . There is space for two camper. Access is on a narrow dirtroad without problem for our 12 ft high Camper. The place is not visible from the street but quite close, so you can hear the very few cars passing by.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114072 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
