 <wpt lat="47.507378" lon="-52.816669">
  <ele>175.20526401500553</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Summit Centre</name>
  <desc>Showers!! It&#39;s a centre that has a gym, swimming pool, warm showers and sauna(in the changing room). If you ask nicely, they&#39;ll let you use the showers in the locker room for free. The lady at the counter told us that there are also a lot of truckers passing by taking showers there because there are none available elsewhere. I asked if I could let fellow travellers know and she said you&#39;re welcome. For us this was a huge gift since we&#39;re here off-season and really everything is closed, we hadn&#39;t showered in a while. Really great place and very friendly people! 8$ per person &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114076 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
