 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="45.154625" lon="-66.228103">
  <ele>8.102400416508317</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Black Beach</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: WARNING! Thefts and vandalism reported in this location. Please use caution.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Beach parking lot down a gravel road. No signs. Remains of fire pits and some trash from visitors. Also a trailhead so cars in the day. Nice black sand beach. Great for van or small RV. Great scenery and lighthouse if you walk the trail (about 1 km) from the fence just before arriving to the beach. Bring your camera!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114117 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
