  <ele>29.380787062450498</ele>
  <time>2023-11-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shower</name>
  <desc>Needham pool &amp; recreation centre (shower). Hot showers for 2$ per person. Showers are in the changing room, there was soap available to. A gift from heaven if you&#39;re travelling off season and everything else everywhere is closed ;-)&#xA;You can of course also use the pool during it&#39;s opening hours, we just showered here so I don&#39;t know about opening hours and rates. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114502 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
