 <wpt lat="50.089751" lon="-120.607521">
  <ele>1094.3663330078125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lundbom Recreation Area </name>
  <desc>There are over 100 campsites spread across two lakes along a good quality gravel road. I&#39;ve seen sedans drive by. The signage says it costs $15/night but right now there&#39;s no one around to collect the fee. Very quiet with only a few other campers at the moment. &#xA;&#xA;Picnic table and fire ring at each site. Also, a strong Telus/Bell signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114908 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
