  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crystal Clean Laudromat</name>
  <desc>Laudromat with free wifi.  Lots of new machines.  $4 for a double, $5 for a triple.  Dryer 0.25 for 3 minutes. ok with an 27feet RV.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/114925 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
