 <wpt lat="48.946633" lon="-125.549432">
  <ele>7.026433942839503</ele>
  <time>2022-10-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Island West Resort</name>
  <desc>We are here out of season, bathrooms closed on October 1.&#xA;We are camped right down on the water for $ 25.00 a night - we have 15 amp electric and water - dump station included beside the pub.&#xA;if you want sites with a dump you&#39;ll be at the ones a little further away from the water.&#xA;We think in season it is $ 45.00 a night.&#xA;Great place for kayaking and you are close enough to walk to town.&#xA;Good food at pub right next to campsite.&#xA;Internet at office and in pub, didn&#39;t try it - so don&#39;t know how good it is.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/115233 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
