  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Swallow’s Service Centre</name>
  <desc>Honest local garage. Recommended by a local we knew in the area. Our brakes were shot, and they fit us in to do the work within 2 days. This was in the midst of winter tyre change, so they were flat out already. On top of that, a great, honest price. Wish I could call them my local garage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/115341 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
