  <name>Chandos Lake </name>
  <desc>*Winter closure.&#xA;.....&#xA;Chandos Lake - established beach by the side of the road. &#xA;- Portable toilet &#xA;- Picnic tables &#xA;- Swimming, shallow water but clean and refreshing&#xA;- busy during the day but clears out before dark&#xA;- close to the road but not much traffic at night&#xA;- the parking area is suitable for vans and C Class for sure, A Class and trailers can fit easily but not in parking spots so not sure how that would look. Not sure about tents. &#xA;- posted signs, no smoking or dogs within 20 meters&#xA;- cell service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-03-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/116659 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
