  <desc>Yukon government campground. $12 a night during summer season, free firewood, outhouses, tables. Boat launch at the lake, good for fishing or just going about in your canoe. 4km easy drive from Atlin Road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/117147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
