 <wpt lat="53.251203" lon="-117.359350">
  <ele>1225.8852899036456</ele>
  <time>2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gregg River Bridge</name>
  <desc>About 10/15mins off of hwy 40. You will pass Gregg River Cabin rec site on your right. Keep following gravel, at crossing keep left along the river. On the left hand side there are some spots on the river (but were taken when we came) if you drive a bit further, just before the bridge, there are some spots on your right. One super large one for big rigs. Due to the water, lots of mozzies in August! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/117394 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
