 <wpt lat="49.257194" lon="-124.809448">
  <ele>9.937645016238093</ele>
  <time>2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>West Coast Cleaners</name>
  <desc>It’s a laundromat.  There is a little office (not always open) for change but no change machine. After hours or when the office is closed you can go next door to Panago for change. &#xA;$2.75 per wash in the single washers (2 loonies &amp; 3 quarters) there is also double load machines that only except loonies and I believe they are 3$.&#xA;There does not seem to be as many dryers but most of them are .25$ per 5 mins. A normal load typically is about 6 quarters. There is also dryers that take a loonie and that will get you 20 mins per loonie. &#xA;Every time I have been here it is not very busy and everyone I have seen are all just there to do the same thing-wash laundry. &#xA;&#xA;The office hours for coin change are Monday - Saturday 10:00-14:00&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/119204 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
