 <wpt lat="45.927249" lon="-83.113386">
  <ele>287.9</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Meldrum Bay Campsite</name>
  <desc>Big open sites right on the water. Amazing views!&#xA;&#xA;The pin is for the camping area. It’s connected to the marina, I believe you have to check in with the harbourmaster to pay the site fees. &#xA;&#xA;As far I can remember the sites are fully serviced and there is a washroom with showers available. &#xA;&#xA;These are the current fees (for two people) according to their website:&#xA;&#xA;Campsite with electricity: $40.00 per night.  &#xA;Campsite without electricity: $30.00 per night.&#xA;$5.00 per day for extra campers. &#xA;Children under 16 are free.&#xA;Laundry facilities available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/119897 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
