  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goose Lake Forest Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Just off Highway 24. (Traffic is audible.) picnic tables, boat launch for small boats, toilet,fire pits on a small lake.  Puddles knee deep are cutting off the last couple of sites. I wouldn’t come in here with a motorhome or long trailer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/120829 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
