 <wpt lat="51.507027" lon="-117.227928">
  <ele>719.7481689453125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blue Water Creek Recreation Site</name>
  <desc> A perfect and free place to camp by the river. Just past the Waitabit Creek Recreation site, the road is not well maintained and bumpy, but a 4x4 is not necessary to get here. Bigger/longer RVs may have a little trouble navigating the path. &#xA;&#xA;There are approximately 8 spaces with picnic tables for each space. And only one other spot was occupied, whereas the Waitabit Rex site was full.&#xA;&#xA;Highly recommend. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/122295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
