  <ele>11.542039444670081</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fundy Tidal Interpretive Center</name>
  <desc>We have stayed here after hours and in the off season without a problem. Nice views of the river and tidal bore if you are here at the right time. Quiet and well lit. When centre is open there are bathrooms and tourist info available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/123207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
