  <name>Green Park Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Established provincial campground- very full when we visited. We made use of the hot showers in the day use area near the beach. The day use area is open 9-9 in summer. Free to enter. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/123315 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
