  <name>Candian tire shopping mall. </name>
  <desc>Large parking lot for a Canadian Tire, Tim Hortons (not a 24hr one) and gas station and several other stores (CAA, rogers, lcbo, quiznos). Several big rigs and other vehicles stayed overnight. Wifi from timmy’s, canadian tire, and others. I did not see a water hose hookup. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/123316 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
