  <ele>1133.1267901253584</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart.Pincher Creek</name>
  <desc>Walmart Superstore right next to HWY 6 just before Waterton NP. There are no signs indicating &#39;no overnight parking&#39;. A few other RVs are here too. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/125359 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
