 <wpt lat="49.093531" lon="-122.478820">
  <ele>73.458740234375</ele>
  <time>2023-12-26 18:23:02 UTC</time>
  <name>Eagle Wind RV Park</name>
  <desc>Very nice RV (only RVs) park in Aldergrove. Mgmt/staff are very friendly and helpful. Some sites can accommodate large 5th wheels. Several long-term guests. The grounds are very nicely maintained. The facility is gated at night for security &amp; guests have a code to come &amp; go as they please. All sites have a picnic table.&#xA;&#xA;Sites are 3-way (15/30). There is also cable TV available. WiFi is weak. Sites are tightly packed. There are rows of cedars between sites for some privacy. It is close to the TransCanada Hwy, so there is some highway noise.&#xA;&#xA;The town of Aldergrove is less than a 10 min drive. It&#39;s about 20 min to either Langley or Abbotsford &amp; ~45 min to Vancouver.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-26 18:23:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/125717 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="57.072575" lon="-122.874015">
  <ele>1784.726740149793</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pink Mountain Tower road</name>
  <desc>Great panoramic view of the mountains on one side and rolling hills out the other. Natural water sources at the bottom. Bring firewood up. There is lots on the switchbacks on the way up. Can be very windy up top. Dry Road!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/125728 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
