  <ele>791.9808006286621</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 23:22:43 UTC</time>
  <name>Bassano Campground </name>
  <desc>Several campsites w/ picnic tables in the centre of town. Run by Town of Bassano. $20/25 per site. Honour system. Close to train. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 23:22:43 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/125730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
