 <wpt lat="49.041943" lon="-123.903638">
  <ele>28.435791015625</ele>
  <time>2023-12-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rondalyn RV Park - by Parkridge</name>
  <desc>Older RV park about 20 min south of Nanaimo. Off the highway. Sites are small &amp; tightly packed. No privacy btwn sites. &#xA;&#xA;Several site types available from 3-way (20/30/50 amp) to power only to unserviced. Some also have cable TV hookups.&#xA;&#xA;Family friendly so kids &amp; associated noise. Also some noisy adult campers. Long term &amp; transients.&#xA;&#xA;A fair amount of ATV noise in the surrounding area. More than a fair amount, actually. It&#39;s quite annoying.&#xA;&#xA;WiFi is inconsistent. Sometimes decent, sometimes very slow.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/126018 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
