  <ele>1032.2405340308324</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Centennial Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Established campground with power and water. Next to park. No wood fires. Winter camping $26 with power. &#xA;&#xA;The peaceful campsite is quite far way from the highway which cuts down on the noise. There is a splash pad for children. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/126100 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
