  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Houston&#39;s Beach</name>
  <desc>At the end of Stuart Mountain Road there is a small parking area and a beautiful beach.  There were not any &#39;no overnight parking&#39; signs anywhere.  There were a couple other vans that stayed overnight as well.  The sunset was beautiful!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/127898 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
