  <ele>62.0</ele>
  <time>2023-11-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Upper Nicholsons lockstation</name>
  <desc>parking lot next to lockstation. the lockmaster gave us permission to stay for the night. address is 121 Andrewsville road, there are 2 Otentiks right next to parking lot. Rideau canal next to parking lot Very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/128666 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
