  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.174910" lon="-96.821720">
  <ele>281.8</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 22:11:48 UTC</time>
  <name>Roseau River Park</name>
  <desc>Park located off the 59 highway in Roseau.&#xA;There are occasionally events when you will not be able to camp. Other it is an old campground, trails, pits and picnic tables still there. Park recently got a few additions. There are bathrooms and a winter ice ring. &#xA;If you are equipped and here during the winter it would be perfect!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 22:11:48 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/129001 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
