 <wpt lat="48.820700" lon="-88.531500">
  <ele>235.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolf River Camp Area</name>
  <desc>An amazing area to overland with a fair amount of space with room for a nice campfire. Since it’s right by the river, it’s also an amazing place to fish too. The entrance is messy. if you have a very large over-landing vehicle I don’t think you’d be able to make it through the trees. If you can’t fit, I’d recommend parking at the entrance. The entrance is a bit hidden so the best way to enter is heading west and it is on the left just before the Wolf River Bridge. If you can visit this place you definitely should because it is probably the best place to camp for hundreds of kilometers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/129642 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
