  <ele>741.19091796875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Watson River View </name>
  <desc>Scenic spot above the Watson River and the old, unused narrow width railway tracks. Not too level. Fire pit. Wonderful views towards south and north, rocky outcrops to the west.&#xA;Take the sandy, very narrow road leading west then north just about opposite the Spirit Lake Lodge on the South Klondike Highway. No 4x4 required, but RVs and big campers won&#39;t fit the narrow road, cars, trucks and vans will do just fine.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
