  <desc>Turn off the highway near the bridge, drive down a dirt road alongside the river.  We found about 5-6 different clearings with firepits, some riverside and some not. Beautiful spot, but people have left a lot of garbage and broken glass. Pack out what you can and leave it better for the next people!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130362 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
