  <desc>We were tired of provincial parks being so full of trailers that they may have been trailer parks so we explored. Found a small dirt road off a road that leads to multiple small clearings in the forest. Room for many! &#xA;&#xA;4wd recommended, but we didnt use it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
