  <name>Hilltop with telecom equipment</name>
  <desc>Wild camp at the top of a hill with some small telecom towers and dishes nearby. Accessible with 2wd. People from the telecom company came to do some work in the morning and were friendly. Make sure to not block the road for their big trucks. Otherwise very quiet with minimal background noise from the highway and factories in town. Lots of wild berries when we were there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
