 <wpt lat="45.229279" lon="-65.957215">
  <ele>29.534254098051488</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grandpa&#39;s Nose</name>
  <desc>Sand pit area, room for a few vehicles, maybe a couple trailers. Great spot for campfires, hidden from the road.&#xA;Adventure sports paradise, Surfing at the beach, climbing on the cliff, and white water kayaking or canoeing on the river.&#xA;&#xA;Pro tips:&#xA;-Go take a hike up that cliff in the back! You will have an insane view of the entire region and ocean.&#xA;-Go take a walk down the little atv trail, then follow the sounds of the river through the woods. Great little spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130585 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
