  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crescent Beach</name>
  <desc>This is a wide pull out on the causeway next to the dunes on the only road leading into Lockeport village so there is light traffic. Good place for spending a night and a day on the beach. There is a stairway leading out of the pull out, over the dunes and onto the beach. There is a school playing field across the street and another boondocking opportunity in the parking lot. Everything is clean so please leave it that way.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
