  <desc>This swimming pool offers free entry the Tuesdays between 15:30 to 17:30&#xA;So --&gt; Free shower during those time.&#xA;(it&#39;s public shower, but in the handicapted change room, there are closed private showers.)&#xA;&#xA;You can check online for the other pools of Winnipeg, they all have different days and times for free entry.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130746 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
