  <name>Menet lake</name>
  <desc>Great site, lakeshore is approximately 30 feet from camp site.  Final approach requires decent clearance, I was fine in a stock xterra.  There is space to leave a car before the turn into the site, and then carry your tent/gear to the site, which is approximately 50 feet away.  I’ve tried to show the rocks and pull out space in the photos.  Lots of mosquitos.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
