 <wpt lat="49.272681" lon="-121.229569">
  <ele>610.9589866638183</ele>
  <time>2022-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunshine Valley RV Resort &amp; Cabins. Hope, B.C.  </name>
  <desc>This was one of the site used as a Japanese Internment Camp from 1942-1946.&#xA;On the camp ground site was 347 tar paper shacks housing 2966 people. (See pics.)&#xA;Up Thursday-Saturday &#xA;&#xA;Friday. Up with friends. 2 bear sighting this morning on the Quad. &#xA;1 black bear in campground Saturday morning wanting to dig thru garbage bins but the park guys wouldn’t hear of it.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA; (604) 869-0066&#xA;14850 Alpine Blvd.&#xA;&#xA;CHECK IN TIME: 12:00 Noon&#xA;CHECK OUT TIME: 11:00am&#xA;&#xA;Wifi available for $3/day&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/130961 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
