 <wpt lat="44.589611" lon="-76.497464">
  <ele>146.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land</name>
  <desc>Off Devil Lake Road, Crown Land that leads to Faye and Bruce Young&#39;s place (you&#39;ll see their name where you turn off the road). But they&#39;re just on the other side of the crown land. People use it in the winter for hunting. Not far from the side entrance to Frontenac Park. No amenities, just beauty and nice local folks.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131003 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
