  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Water tap at Husky Fuel Station</name>
  <desc>In winter it&#39;s hard to find a water tap in this part of Canada that isn&#39;t frozen. We asked at the tourist info office where we could fill-up our tank. She kindly rang around town and eventually found this Husky (the one on the south side of the road) with a flowing outside water tap available all year round. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131028 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
