  <desc>Trailer park with large grassy open area in the back for tents. Hot showers, laundry, Wi-Fi. 5 min walk to the beach. Grocery store nearby. Everything else around full but there was lots of room here. Friendly reception &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131151 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
