  <name>Descanso Bay Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Small regional campground and picnic area. Pit toilets, fire rings and picnic tables. About 35 sites only 2 available first come first served. Tents $20 nt, Trailers/Motorhomes &amp;23 nt. plus $6 nt booking fee +5% gst. Nice little park. Very weak cellular internet (1 bar -LTE/3G&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131256 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
