  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ontario Border Park Rest Stop </name>
  <desc>Big rest stop. Toilets, Garbage bins and picnic tables on site. Lots of room to park- large parking lot for trucks and RVs in the back, smaller parking lot for cars at the front. Lots of trucks coming and going so some noise throughout the night.&#xA;No signs anywhere prohibiting overnight.&#xA;Tourist info center has closed, moved to Kenora.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131276 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
