  <ele>158.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside</name>
  <desc>This place is close to a lake where it is very calm in the morning. You can drive through a small entrance with a grassy path to the lake. We parked backwards so we woke up with a Lakeview! It is dark, you&#39;re hidden and it&#39;s quiet. Definitely a must! It is after the bridge, you see an &#39;old&#39; gravel parking lot. People must use this to bring canoes in the water. There are some potholes, but we have low clearance and managed to drive around it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131287 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
