  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Rivière Ouelle</name>
  <desc>Nice established campground right by the Saint Laurence River. This camping has an overflow, and many sites for tents, 2 and 3 services as well. There is a swimming pool on first level by the office. On second level there is playground for children.&#xA;The site has a very performing free wifi at all locations. A small convenience store is in the office building at the entrance. FQCC membership is accepted. Lots are well spaced and many have plenty of shade! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131442 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
