  <desc>Municipal library + pool offers free wifi, $2 showers and a pool if you want to swim! Plenty of parking and skate / bike park out back. Great little spot in town. Leave it better than you find it- this is a great resource and we don&#39;t want to lose it up by being disrespectful.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131563 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
