  <time>2022-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mountain Trout Camp</name>
  <desc>Located 25 minutes from Tobermory, the MTC is at the edge of the Gillies Lake deepest cleanest inland lake in the Northern Bruce Peninsula. People are friendly even keeping social distance due the pandemic. Sites have electricity and clean water. Bathrooms are very clean and try he showers amazing! MTC offers a splendid sunset and there are many places to visit in a distance of 30 minutes from the camping. There are boats for rental and space for children ride bikes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
