 <wpt lat="46.224380" lon="-71.381720">
  <ele>279.734827041626</ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 08:43:35 UTC</time>
  <name>Osgood river parking </name>
  <desc>Free Municipal City large parking for cars and huge RV Very quiet during night, also day time. Very nice with park for play and lunch. Along a very nice river and safe swimming in river close to the established camping nearby. With a charming 4 kms foot path. With free municipal wi-fi from 8h to 17h. Gravel for parking cars and grass for pick-nick. Tables available. Toilets available near and in the municipal office. Manège toys for kid&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 08:43:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131702 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
