  <name>Nelson City campground </name>
  <desc>Nice small campground in the heart of the city. 5 min walking Distance to Baker Street and shore. Laundromat (2$ in quarters for one load) and dryer for 1$ in quarters, washing machines don&#39;t work. They do not have change for you if you wanna do laundry, so bring your own quarters. &#xA;Hot showers and flush toilets. &#xA;$38 including taxes per night for site with power only.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131747 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
