  <desc>This is a pretty great location. We parked just off the road but you can drive down into the quarry where there are a vast number of places, and all pretty flat too. Bonus is that there is a bit of 4g signal on public Mobile. And the other bonus is that there aren&#39;t many bugs. Nice place!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131853 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
