  <desc>Narrow pullout at canoe put-in suitable for small camper van or classB&#xA;Beautiful view of mountains and river across below and very quiet no traffic but bumpy gravel road to get here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131977 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
