  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Washateria</name>
  <desc>Good laundry with lots of washers and dryers. All frontloaders which we definitely prefer. &#xA;$4 CAD a load, dryer uses quarters. 8 quarter minimum for 30 minutes. &#xA;Within 1 hour everything was clean and dry.&#xA;Nice owner as well so we definitely recommend this place. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/131978 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
