  <ele>348.367919921875</ele>
  <time>2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cypress River Millennium Park </name>
  <desc>Rest/picnic area. On the Trans Canada Trail. Wetlands interpretive signs and a short boardwalk into one of the two swamps. Well-maintained. Fairly clean pit toilets. No signs saying No Camping. You can camp at the back away from the highway. Free.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 97.9.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132009 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
