  <ele>360.90478515625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Holland Agricultural Campground &amp; Racetrack </name>
  <desc>Big, well maintained, volunteer run, place. Self check in. $25 for 15 amp. $30 for 30 amp. $0 for solar? Maybe. One other camper here. If you like your flower baskets hanging, you&#39;ll want the 30 amp section.&#xA;&#xA;They are grading the racetrack. It&#39;s for horses, not cars.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132010 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
