  <desc>A gravel road near Tadoussac. Surrounded by trees and near a small river. May be a little noisy due to the Fjord road nearby, but a lot of places to park your small RV or RTT.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132014 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
