  <desc>Beautiful camping spot. Spotted a few trailers when I was passing through and thought I would check it out. Beautiful spot surrounded by mountains. Big enough spot for any vehicle and gravel road not too bad.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 04:44:15 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
