  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Les Cenelles</name>
  <desc>Small opening in a small trail.  It&#39;s large enough for 2-3 SUV.  No cell service.  A fire ring already existed in that spot. The main access trail is part of a off-road spot. Can be busy during the day but very quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132028 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
