  <ele>232.89111328125</ele>
  <time>2023-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>Nearby camping was full, but this place was ok for a night. The road is very quiet after 11pm and the bugs were far less than other places too. Amazing sunset. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132051 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
