  <ele>669.6905517578125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>large gravel pull-off</name>
  <desc>large gravel lot right next to the highway, no signage. it’s directly after a bridge. there’s tons of room for any type of vehicle. you can hear the road, but you can get out of sight of it. you’ll definitely be in bear country, so beware of leaving food out. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132064 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
