  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood Campground </name>
  <desc>Big campground surrounding the baseball diamonds and the aquatic centre. Full services, partial services, unserviced  sites. All bookings at trehernecamping.com.&#xA;Nice play structure.  &#xA;CBC at 97.9.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132077 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
