  <ele>278.171875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St. Claude Town Campground </name>
  <desc>Small campground next to a playground and football pitch. 12 sites that I think are walk-in tent sites. 6 drive-in sites. All with electricity. Wild turkeys wandering around. &#xA;Museums nearby. Nice new toilet/shower building. Fire ring and picnic table at each site.&#xA;CBC at 98.3.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132078 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
