  <ele>11.0</ele>
  <time>2022-09-25 12:37:55 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Panoramique</name>
  <desc>Classic RV campground with all services exept privacy. Many regulars. Almost no trees. Located within the city limits of Portneuf. Showers C$0.75 for 5 minutes.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-25 12:37:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132115 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
