  <ele>1023.937190933153</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clearing off Kicking Horse Rd</name>
  <desc>Spot by the river was full of rocks, spot with the burnt camper a bit further down the road looked super muddy since it’s been raining all day. There’s a good small clearing right off of the road here. Two other vans are here, could maybe fit one or two more at max.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
