  <ele>191.4754638671875</ele>
  <time>2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakefront near Balaton beach</name>
  <desc>End of the road has some parking right by the lake. No houses nearby, enough space to turn around. There were a few cars joining us during the day but all we heard at night was the waves lapping the shore.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132152 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
