  <ele>10.689554214477539</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 03:40:51 UTC</time>
  <name>Site de la Consol </name>
  <desc>Nice overnight parking, overlooking the bay on the Saguenay river. There is a kite park and a beach access. A little close to the main road so it is a bit noisy up to 23:00 but pretty quiet after that. Safe place. Dump station nearby&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 03:40:51 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132156 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
