 <wpt lat="49.671289" lon="-121.425064">
  <ele>285.0</ele>
  <time>2023-02-08 08:04:46 UTC</time>
  <name>Pylon Lookout </name>
  <desc>Awesome spot up by some high voltage pylons. Flat area at the end of a dead end trail with great views and total peace and quiet. Not even fire rings here right now.&#xA;Turn off the highway onto a forest service road. After a while take the steep road up to the right. Follow this for a while.&#xA;It&#39;s steep, narrow, low, tricky. We did it in a 2wd Westfalia but it was a little challenging. Anything much bigger might struggle.&#xA;Eventually you come out of the trees, then just follow to the end and enjoy! Once you&#39;re up here there is room for a few vehicles. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-02-08 08:04:46 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132157 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
