  <name>Lake Minnewasta Campground &amp; Colert Beach</name>
  <desc>Big municipally owned operation surrounding the SW bay of the lake. Beach with a huge inflatable water play thing. All of that and the big serviced sites are quite far away from these quite nice unserviced tent sites across from the office. Not bad wifi here too, coming from the office/store. The whole place - excepting the tent sres - busy today. &#xA;&#xA;$22 for a tent site. &#xA;&#xA;CBC at 89.3.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132174 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
