 <wpt lat="51.042255" lon="-112.679967">
  <ele>878.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hussar Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground Hussar with self check in&#xA;&#xA;Small campground, no facilities at the moment due to COVID&#xA;&#xA;&#34;The Village Campground has 13 available sites, 7 of which are powered. There is a RV Sani Dump available at the entrance and several water taps located around the campground. There is a playground for smaller children, a large field for sports and two baseball diamonds. There is also a camp shelter available for use upon request. The Hussar Campground is available for weekend reservations which include the use of the sports fields, the camp kitchen and all sites.&#xA;&#xA;Contact Village Office to reserve a site or for more information.&#xA;403-787-3766&#xA;&#xA;Rates:&#xA;Tent - $10.00/night&#xA;RV No Power - $15.00/night&#xA;Power - $25.00/night&#xA;Weekend Rental - $200.00/weekend or $300.00/ long weekend with a $100.00 prepaid deposit to be made at time of booking.&#xA;Special Long Term Rates - $200.00/week flat rate&#34;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132256 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
