  <name>Rock Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Parks Canada campground in the East Block of the Grassland National Park. Unserviced and powered sites, as well as comfort camping oTENTik. Potable water, dump station, free WiFi, day use area and visitor information service. Beautiful location and perfekt base for exploring the park. The best trail in this part of the park &#34;1000 devils&#34; starts also from here (try to go early in the morning!), as well as the scenic badlands parkway is just around the corner. Tipp: watch the sunset from the lookout nr. 3 or 6 the badlands parkway, so worth it!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132350 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
