 <wpt lat="59.758586" lon="-133.775769">
  <ele>724.2126418510452</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside </name>
  <desc>Perfect wildcamp. Very pretty spot, right by the shore of a small lake, with lots of birds and ducks. We also saw a beaver around. Space for 1 vehicle on the waterside, but room for others behind if you are in a group. Not many mossies. Fire ring by the waterside, otherwise no facilities. Free. Just about in sight of the road, but far enough away to hardly hear the few vehicles passing. Loved it here. Please leave it clean. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/132686 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
