  <desc>We stayed overnight, great hot shower(13$) laundromat (3$ per load) Washrooms. Subway restaurant. Staff are very friendly.  It is a busy truck stop so expect some noise. We have parked on the right of the building as you are facing it on the truck pump side. It is out of the way of the truckers and we had a great night sleep. Ho and they have great cinnamon buns to go with your morning coffee.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-02 18:14:29 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133003 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
