  <desc>Free 12 sites right on water, picnic tables, fire rings, boat launch and pit toilets on a medium size fishing lake. Lake is ok for swimming, little cool today at 20’C but refreshing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 15:50:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133056 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
