 <wpt lat="49.006060" lon="-118.780176">
  <ele>564.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frank Carpenter Memorial Campground + Park</name>
  <desc>Quiet municipal campground on the Kettle River. Half of the campground are individual sites (with power) and the other half is a group area (overflow). $20/night. Flush toilets and showers ($2). Fire rings. Close to grocery store and bike trails. The sani dump is on Cleghorn Street.&#xA; Nice Public park down stream of campground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133086 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
