  <ele>721.00437692786</ele>
  <time>2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boat Launch Indoor Shower</name>
  <desc>Free! One shower stall in washrooms a bit off the lake near the boat launch. No temperature control, just a button but it was hot and had good pressure! Thanks Parks Canada!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
