  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chapel Island </name>
  <desc>Large open area on Bras d&#39;Or Lake. located at Potletek Mi&#39;kmaw first nation land. overlooking chapel Island. Great view! &#xA;free camping and has a dump station. No bathrooms or water. Good cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
