  <ele>448.1065673828125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Preston Lake &amp; Campground </name>
  <desc>The lake looks manmade. Should be ok - it&#39;s getting lots of use today. There is also a splash park. And a golf course, which is where you register for camping. 22 sites, a few with shade. $30 full service. $15 tent.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 97,9.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133163 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
