 <wpt lat="52.666311" lon="-106.883743">
  <ele>485.9320068359375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Lake</name>
  <desc>There is loads of space here and it&#39;s mostly flat. Very peaceful and quiet, no road noise. There is also a fresh water Spring just back on the 12 towards Saskatoon about .5km so we filled up there and camped here. Good signal on PublicMobile. Perfect. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
