  <desc>We filled out tasks and bottles here. Many locals come here to drink and fill up. There is a sign saying you should boil but people told us is ok. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133173 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
