 <wpt lat="49.958930" lon="-124.731320">
  <ele>23.507742322981358</ele>
  <time>2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dinner Rock Campground</name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures&#xA;.....&#xA;A BC Forestry campground, on the left as you are driving to Lund. The sign comes up quick and it might be easy to miss. Really fun windy road down into the campground, and about 10 - 15 sites with fire pits and picnic tables. The loop around the campsite gets a little bumpy but I was fine and my car is a Mitsubishi Mirage, just go slow through the potholes. Has outhouses, and some firewood laying around between the trees. Free! Also in cell range&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133177 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
