 <wpt lat="49.325233" lon="-122.948643">
  <ele>7.484474957739321</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Deep Cove public parking</name>
  <desc>Deep Cove public park, parking lot. Free, no time restrictions. Confirmed with Village of Deep Cove that 72 hours is permitted. No signage, no pay station. I parked here overnight when I visited a friend on the water, but I am sure that you could park here and sleep overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133212 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
