  <ele>5.483242511749268</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Terrain vague sentier VTT</name>
  <desc>Beginning of a mountain bike trail overlooking a vacant lot. Small hill to descend before arriving on the ground, but doable with our honda fit. Very quiet, little traffic and away from the road. You can pitch your tent next to your car away from the path&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133252 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
