 <wpt lat="50.267012" lon="-64.839301">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Secluded beach spot</name>
  <desc>Away from the crowd of Halte Plage. A little bit after the Halte Plage point towards Rivière-au-tonnerre. We were alone, and slept to the sound of the waves. Drift wood around for a nice fire. Highly recommend!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133266 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
