 <wpt lat="44.299046" lon="-78.305074">
  <ele>152.23066311702132</ele>
  <time>2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot next to waterway lock</name>
  <desc>Parking lot that is not visible from the road, next to Lick 20 on the Trent Severn Waterway. suitable for vehicles up to 27&#39; long. View of the lake, adjacent to (but not visible from) splash pad and playground. Fishing from shore permitted in season and with a permit. Entry is from Maia St on the south side just west of the Maria St. bridge.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133282 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
