  <ele>5.3058714950457215</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>oceanside rock beach</name>
  <desc>Stayed here one night in my tent, you need a decent air mattress as its all small rocks, would be ideal for vans and small campers. Lots of fire pits, locals come here on weekends.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133306 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
