  <ele>3300.0</ele>
  <time>2023-12-29 09:06:57 UTC</time>
  <name>Fernie RV Resort</name>
  <desc>This resort is nestled between the Elk River, the Fernie Golf Club, and Maiden Lake. It offers modern facilities and services with pull-through and back-in RV sites that accommodate the largest RV’s plus an area for tent camping. If glamping is your style, the five heated yurts are perfect for a family or two couples. Open All Year.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-29 09:06:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133316 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
