  <ele>346.8</ele>
  <time>2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Millennium Park - Bancroft Ontario</name>
  <desc>Good fresh water. &#xA;Municipal water tap, fill jugs but no hose attachment. &#xA;Millennium Park, at the end of the parking lot in front of the Seniors Club. &#xA;Busy spot with local cottages, there could be a line up. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133348 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
