  <desc>Small nice and quiet park with great view on St-Laurent river. &#xA;&#xA;Overnight Parking for véhicules below 23 feets. 24 hours maximum.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133354 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
