 <wpt lat="46.283392" lon="-74.733809">
  <ele>218.4021873474121</ele>
  <time>2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gare de Labelle</name>
  <desc>Perfect spot for camping ! &#xA;You have picnic tables, tap water, washrooms and paid shower (but not open during 24h, it was closed at 06:30PM when we were there). &#xA;You can park easily a RV or put your tent.&#xA;The spot is beside the CAP 360 trail start parking. &#xA;Just one point : there is a market every Sunday ! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133356 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
