  <desc>Free shower very clean. Bistro, laundromat , friendly staff&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133359 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
