 <wpt lat="44.899481" lon="-76.240119">
  <ele>117.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Last Duel park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful park by the canal, docks, boat ramp, picnic tables. No sign prohibiting overnight parking. Next to a closed (Covid) campground. Complete washrooms with free hot showers open during the summer and shoulder-season but closed in winter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133375 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
