 <wpt lat="44.744332" lon="-81.141930">
  <ele>212.78087319101206</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overnight parking </name>
  <desc>There is an overnight parking next to a dental office parking lot and there is also a carwash. We slept there with no problem and no police checks.  It is indicated overnight parking. the place is noisy until around 9:30 pm / 10 pm because there is traffic but night is very quiet until around 7:30 am.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133383 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
