  <ele>190.6456595973891</ele>
  <time>2022-08-25 07:24:07 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Joncquière</name>
  <desc>Super 4 stars&#xA;Lac Kénogami, beach, wharf&#xA;Undergrowth, neighborhood not too close but well hidden&#xA;Toilet and shower, sanitary areas with very clean laundry room&#xA;&#xA;Super 4 étoiles &#xA;Lac Kénogami, plage , quai &#xA;Sous bois , voisinage pas trop proche mais bien dissimulé&#xA;Toilettes et douche , coins sanitaire avec buanderie très propre&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-25 07:24:07 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133405 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
