  <ele>681.2293628826737</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mud Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Small quiet spot by the water, great view! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133408 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
