 <wpt lat="49.243864" lon="-119.521108">
  <ele>323.29510495328384</ele>
  <time>2022-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gallagher Lake, A Parkbridge Camping &amp; RV Resort Oliver BC </name>
  <desc>Well-established campground has a little lake where there is ‘wooden tents’ , a separate tenting area with common bathrooms and wash areas. Then RVs &amp; year round residents. Well kept, quiet. Has this massive rock Cliff with a wonderful Canadian flag perched on the very top. Apparently is a memorial to a Dad by his 2 sons~ this was their favorite climbing rock&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133418 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
