 <wpt lat="49.120810" lon="-66.491754">
  <ele>18.471340253473343</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Aréna J. Robert Lévesque</name>
  <desc>The police sent us to sleep here, so it&#39;s allowed. Place without charm but ok for one night. Dump station on site.&#xA;&#xA;Les policiers nous ont envoyé dormir ici, donc c&#39;est permis. Endroit sans charme mais ok pour une nuit. Station de vidange sur place. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
