 <wpt lat="49.204172" lon="-99.110751">
  <ele>414.428955078125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rock Lake at boat launch</name>
  <desc>At the bottom of Rock Lake a nice secluded camping spot next to a quite boat launch, as long you don’t block the launch you have several spots to camp. At the beginning of the turn-off to the lake you have even more camping spots.&#xA;Beautiful sunsets and quite nights.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133432 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
