 <wpt lat="51.386249" lon="-113.529210">
  <ele>913.9783248901367</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beiseker Municipal Campgrounds</name>
  <desc>A municipal campground next to North Road. Beiseker is a small town located at highway 9, with a couple of nice restaurants.&#xA;The campground is very well maintained with full-service and non-service sites, all with picnic tables and fire pits. Shaded and sunny sites to choose from.&#xA;One toilet and shower building, somewhat outdated but very clean and all works well, shower use included in the already low fees. We paid $20 for an unserviced site.&#xA;Lynda, the camp host, is very nice and will do everything to help you.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133434 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
