 <wpt lat="49.436100" lon="-117.261514">
  <ele>855.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Giveout Creek Logging Road</name>
  <desc>Take this logging road for free overnight camping. Town was not very forgiving to overnights this is 10 mins out of Nelson. The beginning of the road has a lot of pot holes at the beginning of the road but levels out. It doesn&#39;t require 4x4. We did it in our old 20 foot class B. The 1st parking is busy with mountain bikers until dark then very quiet until around 6.30am when a tree planting crew came by. Further up the road there are much quieter pull outs. &#xA;No amenities just a place to park that is good for one night and better than the airport. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133542 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
