  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac Doreen</name>
  <desc>About 100m from the road on a narrow way down to the lake. A high roof van will pass slowly, but probably not a C class or anything wider than a van. Nice quit spot with enough place for 2 van or tent. Access to the lake, fire pit. Ground is level. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133671 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
