  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area - Dixie Lake - Willard Lake</name>
  <desc>Space for parking, picnic tables, lake good for swimming. Lots of space for RVs and a few decent spots for tents. Pit toilets and gorgeous views. Just off the highway so a bit noisy in daytime but it quietens down at night.  Good cell service from Telus.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133699 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
