  <ele>502.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Three Valley Lake rest stop</name>
  <desc>it&#39;s a rest stop by the lake with a little beach. we only spent one night here with no problems. not really level and it has one pit toilet. very loud because its beside highway 1 and at the bottom of the hill so trucks are really loud.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133711 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
