  <ele>4.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Point Deroche Beach</name>
  <desc>Huge grassy parking lot on the right side before you cross the bridge and get to the end of the road, there is also parking at end of the road right before beach but more privacy in grass lot. Easy access to a beautiful white sand dune beach with great swimming. Nice road in. No facilities. Good cell reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133747 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
