 <wpt lat="60.694261" lon="-135.037915">
  <ele>666.9780020453461</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whitehorse Rapids</name>
  <desc>Big turnaround close to the dam and fish ladder.  There is a no parking sign for the dam entry side, but nothing for the other (one night we get visited by the police and it was fine).Had to stay for a couple nights, because our van needs a mechanic. Busy at the evening, but quite at night. Nice view over Swatka Lake. Pit toilets close at fish ladder. Nothing for long, but if you need a place for the night.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133812 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
