 <wpt lat="52.420790" lon="-122.295080">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cariboo 97 Farm</name>
  <desc>Right off the Highway and next door to the lake, the general store, and a Pub and Cafe are across the street, this property offers a couple of level spots set aside for modest-sized campers &amp; vans for explorers passing through the Cariboo region. All we ask is to clean up after yourselves and leave it better than you found it. We are in the process of turning the land into a permaculture food garden, so extra hands are always welcome if you are interested in some garden therapy. No running water on the property itself, but the host is also manager of the campground across the street, and you can use the shower facilities there for the $5 day use fee.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133825 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
