  <name>Stephenfield Provicial Park</name>
  <desc>Located on Highway 245 in between Carman and Roseisle. Provincial Park. established sites, beach, boating. Electrical sites and group areas. walking Trails. Although it allows pets, they cannot go on beach and some walking paths.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/133982 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
