  <ele>370.3703227306267</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot at Montagne Grise</name>
  <desc>This spot is the departure of severals hiking trails. Very few people are passing by in the morning or the evening. Very quiet at Night. There is a CCTV on the site but no sign forbiding overnight stay. There are picnic tables. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134014 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
