 <wpt lat="50.485196" lon="-117.850532">
  <ele>618.1008418250908</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halfway Hot Springs </name>
  <desc>Off-road trail halfway to a campsite where you can find natural hot springs for free. Campsite is $20 or $10 for seniors, a night, or you can venture off to this private spot for free. You can walk down to the river for a nice view. I was able to get through the trail with a Jeep Wrangler. Trimmed a few trees but was easy to get to. Harder for a big truck to turn around in the camping spot but it’s manageable :)&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134019 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
