  <time>2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Museum and Community Centre</name>
  <desc>We asked the really nice staff of the museum if we could stay a night on the large car park and they said  &#39;no problem&#39;. We made a donation to the museum. There is a dump station and water fill also here. There is WiFi from the museum. Also, it was very hot when we were there and there was a splash park at the back, there were toilets and showers open because of this. Not sure if they will always be open. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134072 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
