  <ele>302.4541015625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>View Point place </name>
  <desc>View Point up to the main road. Several places. Quiet at night. Follow the sign &#34;View Point Entrance&#34; or on maps.me ‘Tantalus range lookout’. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
