 <wpt lat="45.431600" lon="-73.674220">
  <ele>22.605679512023926</ele>
  <time>2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Commerce de la Fourrure de Lachine</name>
  <desc>This is a pay parking by the water in Lachine. Pay times are 9am to 9pm, otherwise free. Close to a walking and cycling path. There are a lot of cars and pedestrian going by. We slept there one night with no trouble. We saw many police cars and not a single one came to meet and greet us. There are even 2 dedicated bus parkings on site&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134108 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
