  <ele>48.78500149852624</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>KM 1244</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot overlooking Route 138. Unobstructed view of the bog. Perfect to spend a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134110 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
