 <wpt lat="54.243551" lon="-129.518521">
  <ele>5.170479774475098</ele>
  <time>2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Skeena View near Highway </name>
  <desc>Three grassy sites on a gravel circle of the river side of the Yellowhead about halfway from Terrace to Prince Rupert. &#xA;&#xA;All three had fire rings and river views, but you’re at most 20 meters from the highway so it can be loud at times. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134121 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
