 <wpt lat="43.222086" lon="-81.865606">
  <ele>150.87896728515625</ele>
  <time>2024-02-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ausable River Cut Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Level parking lot on the side of highway 21. Pretty noisy even at night but really close to Pinery Provincial Park entrance (3mn). Lot of space and no &#34;no overnight parking&#34; signs. Located at the beginning of a little trail and 200m from a canoe launch into the river. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
