  <desc>Fresh potable city water. includes washrooms.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 14:52:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134177 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
