 <wpt lat="45.256213" lon="-77.191565">
  <ele>255.40654140803963</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Griffith Uplands Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Gravel/grass parking lot for the Griffith Uplands Trail. Lot is approx 30&#39;x40&#39;. Perfect for our 28&#39; Class C, we backed in. On a rural cottage road with little traffic. Lovely hiking trail through the woods, rated challenging, loop takes approx four hours. No amenities. This is the only ioverlander spot along this road that is appropriate for anything bigger than a small Class B.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134197 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
