 <wpt lat="49.688548" lon="-83.651215">
  <ele>239.13744784053415</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gilles Gagnon Tourism Information Center </name>
  <desc>Perfect little parc to stop by , plenty of space for big RVs ( even possible with a 40’ RV +18’Escalade !!) &#xA;Power outlet, Pic-nic tables, Playground, fake Moose and wolves : perfect for children who need to move after 500 km of road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134203 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
