  <ele>265.75750732421875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>ESSO fuel station / Koa campground </name>
  <desc>You can take a shower for 5$ even if you buy something at the fuel station.&#xA;Free wifi.&#xA;Cheap fuel.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
