 <wpt lat="48.529340" lon="-64.216900">
  <ele>13.33440462127328</ele>
  <time>2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bistro Sac à vin</name>
  <desc>Plenty of tent spots and a few RVs for rent. Nice spot just behind the restaurant, the owner is super welcoming. There is the main road next to the restaurant, so it is pretty loud in the morning and evening. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
