 <wpt lat="49.169447" lon="-124.828887">
  <ele>4.997539520263672</ele>
  <time>2023-04-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alberni Inlet Overlook </name>
  <desc>Narrow spot right on the water, with a great fire pit with beautiful views. Enough room for 2-3 smaller vehicles parked in a row, plus a couple tents. Full cell service with Rogers, and a great spot if Arden Creek Rec site is full (we think this spot is nicer than the rec site!) &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134271 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
