 <wpt lat="50.826083" lon="-116.343117">
  <ele>1043.9704465929458</ele>
  <time>2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Path</name>
  <desc>Nice dusty patch with fire pit next to a path that leads down to falls. Enough room for a few groups. Next to logging road which gets busy early. Nice place. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134287 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
