  <ele>79.2942179189995</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nice place at the marina - 30$</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot near the marina, they charged us 30$ for the night and access to toilets, showers, wifi, water and electricity. Everything is very clean and the place is quiet at night. Arrive before 8pm and ask if you can stay at the restaurant. They had never done it before but were happy to let us stay in the parking for the night. Mosquitos are vicious though. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
