  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pinecrest Trailer Park</name>
  <desc>A trailer park right off highway 17 that has 4 tent sites right off the beach. It&#39;s $31 dollars for the non service site, they also have showers during covid.  Great place and would come back. They have a store at the office that sells junk food including ice cream!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
