  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wapiti Municipal Campsite - Canmore</name>
  <desc>This is a campsite on the west side of town. Water next door at the information centre. Electricity, fire pits available. Close to highway. For tents and campers, picnic tables available. There are showers , but you need to buy tokens from the office. Clean.&#xA;$35 no electricity- $42 with electricity. COVID ruling applies for facilities. Close to town. The negative is that it is between the rail line and Hwy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134913 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
