 <wpt lat="45.012700" lon="-79.613500">
  <ele>191.0987548828125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bala</name>
  <desc>No &#34;no overnight&#34; parking signs, there&#39;s a public washroom just up the street open all night. Off the main road.&#xA;OPP came by at night to check on us - he said he was making sure we weren&#39;t &#34;the kids that come here to drink&#34;. He even saw our empty beer from dinner and said nothing. Wished us a good stay. No worries at all, and OPP confirms there&#39;s no bylaw at night anyways.&#xA;Beautiful view to wake up to. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134968 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
