 <wpt lat="45.011438" lon="-79.614723">
  <ele>204.0758056640625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>parking lot right off highway </name>
  <desc>This is a large parking lot w signs that say not parking over 72 hours. So you&#39;re good for a few days, but likely noisy due to highway. Check out the other two spots we marked in Bala.&#xA;Train passes at 11pm and 2am, can be noisy also. But easy spot to pull into for the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134970 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
