  <desc>Amazing spot, close to the 138 Road, a large parking area and rocks with view of the St Laurent River.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/134981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
