  <ele>105.33348216868846</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pointe-Taillon National Park</name>
  <desc>Showers are in washrooms at the beach. Free and hot. &#xA;&#xA;There are day use fees for the park but booth was unmanned at 5pm when I arrived. Had a nice swim followed by a long shower. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135000 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
