  <ele>241.4</ele>
  <time>2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out</name>
  <desc>Once you pull in, off the main drag, to your left will be a little dead end perfect for a fire. Little downslope driveway. Hardly any bugs, yay! Quiet and cozy. Perfect for Judy our minivan. But you could definitely have the space for a small trailer. :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135035 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
