 <wpt lat="49.308658" lon="-121.264000">
  <ele>680.6138572692871</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old  highway 3</name>
  <desc>Pull off the truck brake check. Drive up to hope slide viewpoint. Enjoy the stunning view and the pit toilets. &#xA;I’d recommend staying here if you have a big rig or a low clearance. For this spot. Follow the old highway three. It’s quiet narrow and not really high. We made it with a Land Rover defender and bag on the roof. There’s a more or less steep step just before the spot. &#xA;Once your there it’s a super nice quiet place. Firepit and Space for 5 rigs. It’s mostly level. No service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135039 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
