  <ele>27.359493255615234</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ruckle Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Picnic tables, fire rings, beach, picnic area, 78 tent sites and 8 RV sites. Drinking water, pit toilets. $20 night 2023 rate. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135077 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
