 <wpt lat="47.462440" lon="-55.835933">
  <ele>29.365027660503983</ele>
  <time>2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Deadman’s Cove RV Park</name>
  <desc>Relax on one of four sandy beaches at Deadman’s Cove.  Loved the sound of waves agains the shore and amazing views. Park has washrooms and showers.  Laundry only 75 cents per load.  Large covered barbecue kitchen for gatherings.  30 amp and water hook ups plus unserviced sites.  Water and electrical sites only $25 per night Canadian.  Sites are very level, no blocks required under my 32 foot Class C, perfectly level upon parking.  Sites very large..  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135084 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
