  <ele>9.756248474121094</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Hwy 330</name>
  <desc>A pull-off onto a weathered granite pad. Great view of the open ocean. Huge beach cobble to scramble on. The road noise was barely noticeable. Can be Windy, many locals leave trailers for the season.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135113 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
