  <ele>1202.1898193359375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Monashee-Kettle Recreation Site BC</name>
  <desc>Free recreation site by the Kettle river. 2 sites. one picnic table, fire rings and pit toilets. very quiet! I believe there are 3 accesses to get there. We used the western access, it was a little rocky and bumpy, but still alright for our 22 ft long truck camper. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
