  <ele>408.9419962901209</ele>
  <time>2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop with EV Charging</name>
  <desc>Roadside rest stop. Has some info signs, 2 pit toilets, EV Charging. Lots of overhead lighting and one security camera. Parked overnight no issues, sign says “Please limit your stay to 8 hours”.&#xA;Moderate traffic noise, could hear other vehicles pulling in, could hear semis passing on highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135246 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
