  <ele>1016.9441721066833</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside </name>
  <desc> Pretty spot right next to the river. Level with space for several vehicles. Totally out of sight of the road behind trees. There is a bit of road noise during the day but it was quiet enough at night and the river running makes nice background sound. Several fire-rings but otherwise no facilities. Free. No mobile phone signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135258 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
