  <name>Marché du village</name>
  <desc>24h Gaz station, food market with very large choice of kraft beer, SAQ agency, showers and laundromat. &#xA;&#xA;Very large parking lot with an unpaved section at the back where one could perhaps spend a night if they agree. Haven’t tried it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 10:52:28 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135270 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
