 <wpt lat="47.956947" lon="-84.855481">
  <ele>150.521240234375</ele>
  <time>2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wawa Sandy Beach 2</name>
  <desc>With the new&#39; no overnighting&#39; signs right at the main Sandy Beach parking lot, we found this roadside parking 100m away. You&#39;re parked by the road so you hear the occasional car in the evening but it&#39;s quiet at night. From here you see the lake and hear it too. You can back in with a large rig, just don&#39;t hog the whole carpark or they&#39;ll put &#39;no overnighting&#39; signs here too. Use the main toilets. There&#39;s a path to the beach from here. We slept as good here as at the other spot before the signs went up.&#xA;No internet connection. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135308 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
