  <desc>Pull out 300m past the Avatar Grove trailhead to Canada&#39;s Gnarliest Tree.  There were a couple of rock fire pits but nothing else.  There is a small grassy patch too.  Little traffic and none after sunset.  Super quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-04 18:21:12 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135330 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
