  <ele>28.72702985815704</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chemin Saint-Thomas Nord</name>
  <desc>Several possible spots along this road, close to the National Park Sentier des chutes/Montagne blanche trailhead. A local drove by and was OK with us spending the night. She only warned us we would probably hear cowbells during the night, as there is a farm nearby. She also asked we (obviously) left the spot clean. Town is nearby for facilities. Very quiet place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135628 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
