  <ele>1337.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Nordegg</name>
  <desc>Large open area with fire pits. Close to road so it is noisy during the day but quiet at night. We ended up here since Abraham Lake was completely full with weekend campers. There are many places along this road to camp. Decent Rogers cell signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135708 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
