  <ele>245.7718283016368</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 20:20:13 UTC</time>
  <name>Steep Rock Campground</name>
  <desc>$6 for day facilities. Showers, water, picnic areas, toilets, laundry. Restaurant and kayak rental. Beautiful spot, camping is $12/night I believe. Campaign ground is mediocre at best, toilets are a bit &#39;how ya goin’...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 20:20:13 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
