  <desc>Outdoor shower located at Pipers Lagoon. Shaped like a two headed snake at the edge of the parking lot, just before the trail starts along the beach. Water fountain available in front of the 2 headed snake shower.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 17:25:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135795 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
