  <ele>222.85746958479285</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cabela’s Winnipeg</name>
  <desc>Paved parking lot, very quiet, lots of room. We went inside and requested permission. Not sure if they allow everyone, but we were granted permission to spend the night. Stated to park to the left of the building so as to not be right out front. Washrooms inside with water, available while store is open. Can get busy, children’s biking group gathers here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135818 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
