  <ele>45.182747388258576</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Top of Crow Head</name>
  <desc>Gravel road leads to high stone platform with a breathtaking view of Sleepy Cove Gull Island. No signage. Appears to be abandoned quarry. A few cars came by for a look, but no problems.  Full LTE.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135831 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
