  <ele>1457.259033203125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Creekside</name>
  <desc>great staging ground for hike to the airplane crash site. approx 8 km from this spot. super quiet public land. busy on summer weekends. empty on weekdays.no wind. no cell signal&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135864 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
