 <wpt lat="50.775966" lon="-103.798084">
  <ele>483.75860435236245</ele>
  <time>2022-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fort Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground by Echo Lake. We paid $20.10 for an unserviced site (services is $30 something), washroom with free showers with a code for campers only. Very spacious, some garbage but otherwise well maintained. Was a but windy at night. Fire pits and benches at each site. Lots of seasonal campers and big day-use area with a splash park, beach volleyball court and playground. Host come around to collect fee. Lovely sunset behind the hills over the lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135892 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
