  <ele>36.07208075214848</ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Les Escoumins</name>
  <desc>A free campground just by the river. it has a lot of space for RVs (self-contained only). Toilets, a playground and a dog park.  No tents and campfires.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135894 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
