 <wpt lat="45.983476" lon="-81.928425">
  <ele>132.3</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 09:03:20 UTC</time>
  <name>Shower in public washroom at marina</name>
  <desc>There&#39;s a little pavilion by the water with public washrooms (says so on the door) with a shower inside! Maybe not the cleanest, but water is hot and it&#39;s free. Not sure if it&#39;s open year-round since I&#39;m guessing boaters use this when they dock from a trip - definitely open in the summer.&#xA;&#xA;There&#39;s a small parking lot for ~3 vehicles (probably not for big rigs, our cargo van was fine but maybe not a full-size RV) directly to the right if facing the water, so you don&#39;t have to walk far. No overnight parking there though, as the signs say.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 09:03:20 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
