 <wpt lat="44.991370" lon="-66.999965">
  <ele>4.28331995010376</ele>
  <time>2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Waterfront gravel parking</name>
  <desc>Open parking area right on the water. Perfect for sunsets. Super windy the day we were here. Lots of room for many vehicles, we had one more car overnight with us. There is a house further along though. They have a yellow gate and didn’t seem to mind we were here. Few people drove by in the morning.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
