 <wpt lat="49.348260" lon="-123.197600">
  <ele>180.55538239889236</ele>
  <time>2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pullout</name>
  <desc>Very small spot half hidden in trees on the side of a pull up. Very tight, enough for a car and a tent or a long van but not tall. It’s just next to a big electric box so if you aren’t comfortable with sleeping close to it, don’t stay here. It’s hidden from almost any city light and the road isn’t busy. Good enough for an emergency but really not the dream spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/135974 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
