  <name>Kerrs Lake</name>
  <desc>Free campground by a nice lake. quiet and peaceful. grass seems solid enough to park on.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136007 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
