  <ele>9.537756961678847</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mispec Beach </name>
  <desc>No “no overnight parking” signs. Parking lot overlooks the absolutely breathtaking view of the beach. We had no problem, except one car came late in the night and had some music playing.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136029 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
