  <ele>10.15627670288086</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>“The Guzzle”</name>
  <desc>Small public parking lot where people are welcome to enjoy the views of the area. Level enough, no “no”’signs. It’s also a research area for migrating birds and has info about the dikes. Water views surrounded by farm land,at the end of a short dirt road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136105 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
