  <time>2024-05-05 07:53:18 UTC</time>
  <name>Revelstoke - west</name>
  <desc>Flat and level site less than 1km from the Trans Canada. Quite wide open and you can hear the highway a bit. Good for a night.&#xA;I have 3/4 bars on Telus. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-05 07:53:18 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136119 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
