  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking with 24h zone</name>
  <desc>Parking in Sydney allowing free 24h parking on a small section of the parking lot (look at the signs carefully). More than half of this parking is reserved for vehicles with boat trailer with a valid parking pass for the Tulista Park Boat Ramp.&#xA;&#xA;2 spots available inside the parking lot, 5 others outside with additional spot for EV charging.&#xA;&#xA;Quiet residential neighbourhood.&#xA;&#xA;PLS DONT FORGET TO READ THE SIGN WHERE YOU WILL PARK. THERE ARE DIFFERENT KINDS OF THEM.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136136 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
