 <wpt lat="51.528333" lon="-117.434983">
  <ele>775.2</ele>
  <time>2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land - Forest Service Road</name>
  <desc>Crown land camping. Just to the right over the bridge, beyond the campground. Absolutely stunning views of the mountains and right next to the lake. Several sites in the trees with pit toilet, one with picnic table.  Muddy and bad road on the left to launch boat, 4W required. Not so rough road coming from the highway, only 5km with funny signs.&#xA;&#xA;The forest road seemed to go quite a way up (we turned around after a few km) but I&#39;m sure there are a few sites along the lake further up.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136259 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
