 <wpt lat="45.048854" lon="-72.825978">
  <ele>108.96564872843882</ele>
  <time>2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc municipal de Frelighsburg</name>
  <desc>Park just for one night. Really quiet but twice we had a border police car that went with light. Beautiful path along the pike river that starts at this parking lot.&#xA;WC, picnic tables and public bins available. &#xA;No water &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
