  <ele>468.6220365986228</ele>
  <time>2023-07-30 22:22:03 UTC</time>
  <name>Christina Pines Campground</name>
  <desc>Great place and owners. Clean and quiet. Has all facilities plus a pool. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 22:22:03 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136499 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
