  <ele>203.497802734375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>End of gravel road above the river outside of the nearby provincial park. many fire pits, many spots. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136503 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
