 <wpt lat="50.588888" lon="-127.089081">
  <ele>9.530517578125</ele>
  <time>2023-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Has $3 washers and $1 for 9 minutes dryers (we needed two times in the dryer but had no towels or the like that might have needed a third round).  No money changing machine but there is a soap machine.  (You need quarters or loonies.) Hours are 8 to 8 in summer, 8-4.30 in winter. No washrooms but there is free fast Telus WiFi!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136504 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
