 <wpt lat="53.431782" lon="-63.235432">
  <ele>343.1837158203125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Metchin River</name>
  <desc>There is a small road just to the west of the Metchin River Bridge. It leads to a closed work camp and huge gravel pits. There is plenty of room for any size rig. There are no amenities but it’s not bad for a night. It’s quiet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136519 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
