 <wpt lat="50.590713" lon="-127.086859">
  <ele>5.400993378832936</ele>
  <time>2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach Street parking</name>
  <desc>During the day this is pay parking but after 5, free.  Big rigs may need more than one spot but probably fine at night, not sure. We moved here after doing laundry and no one bothered us.  We saw an RCMP car go past once.  Free ShawGo Wifi.  There are toilets and showers by the ferry terminal down the block but currently closed due to COVID.  During the day washrooms at Visitor&#39;s Centre were open.  4G+ cell reception.  Restaurants near by as well as IGA supermarket.  Quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136546 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
