  <ele>51.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Woodbine Beach. $15 All Day. </name>
  <desc>Ok for overnight parking. Lots of lights and police came by at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136567 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
