 <wpt lat="49.052361" lon="-64.491206">
  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Avant le lac Moulin</name>
  <desc>Just before you arrive at the lake Moulin, turn to the right. You will see a place with à firepit. We asked to a guy parked in front of the lake and he suggested us to go there for the night, as there is no &#34;camping forbidden&#34; sign.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136570 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
