  <ele>4.940818223004015</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Saint Anne de Monts</name>
  <desc>Small parking area next to a picnic area and Crevier. We spent two nights here. A rest area is available close to Cantine Cartier restaurant with cold shower outside and clean toilets. I think the water is drinkable (otherwise there is drinkable water in front of the Arena, with dump station).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136583 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
