 <wpt lat="46.084309" lon="-73.164976">
  <ele>9.400992853567004</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 06:48:05 UTC</time>
  <name>randonnée pédestre Berthier</name>
  <desc>Nice place for overnight parking. Nice hiking trail. Garbage cans, recycling bin, pick-nick tables and one under a roof. Large parking lot at a trail head. Room for all size vehicles and rigs. VERY busy during the day but quiet at night, only small noise from the road.&#xA;--&#xA;Très bel endroit pour passer la nuit. Très belles pistes de randonnée. Bac de vidanges, bac de recyclage, pas de toilettes, tables de pique-nique. Grand stationnement.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 06:48:05 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136605 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
