 <wpt lat="48.536267" lon="-85.172067">
  <ele>412.0895868131332</ele>
  <time>2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Depew River</name>
  <desc>Right off the Trans Canada highway, picnic tables bathrooms, no running water. Right on the depew River, quiet overnight except for a train that runs past twice.stayed overnight no issues, someone else there in a tent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136626 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
