 <wpt lat="49.996260" lon="-119.316960">
  <ele>985.5843162536621</ele>
  <time>2023-06-25 17:59:42 UTC</time>
  <name>Postill Lake Rd</name>
  <desc>This place is on the road that leads to Postill Lake Rec. Site. This is the only good place on this road. It is a big opening in between some trees. Very low traffic during day and very quite during night. The only downside is that there is some garbage around. The road is well maintained, no potholes and there is a 3 bars of (LTE) coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-25 17:59:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136680 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
