 <wpt lat="49.955512" lon="-119.250393">
  <ele>988.8016483583473</ele>
  <time>2024-04-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>James Lake Recreational Site</name>
  <desc>This is a free camping. It has about 7-8 campsites. It is really nice an quite. There are also pit toilets, camping tables and fire rings. The road is well maintained except for the last 2-3km’s (it is a bit bumpy with some potholes, but manageable), only downside is that there is no coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136681 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
