 <wpt lat="50.261920" lon="-119.154567">
  <ele>1208.1052413406323</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Becker Lake Recreational Site</name>
  <desc>This is a FREE camping site, it has about 7-8 spots just by the lake. The road is well maintained 70% of it, the other 30% is a bumpy and has pot holes. I don’t think big trailers can make it up to here, because at some spots it is going uphill in a 180deg turn. We made it without problems with out RWD 170” WB sprinter. Place is beautiful, only downside is that there is no cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136682 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
