  <ele>960.9515380859375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pinto Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Quite a nice little rec site with clean pit toilets. The lake itself isn&#39;t as nice as Tatla or Pyper for swimming but it&#39;s more accessible as you only have about 300m to travel from the road. Great for a night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136892 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
