  <ele>301.1812744140625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>riviere Whisky</name>
  <desc>Small place just before the bridge. At the edge of the water, sandy bottom. Fire pit on site. Adjacent trail, perfect for Ebike. Boat descent on the other side of the bridge, very busy. Near a dump site and water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
