  <name>Whiskey Creek Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>Free camping, no toilets or facilities. Quiet area with ATV &amp; dirt bike trails which were a little noisy in the AM (Sunday morning). Multiple spots with fire pits. Big rig friendly. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136896 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
