  <ele>35.28518272735331</ele>
  <time>2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bere Point Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>Beautiful campground right on the water/beach. Book online &#xA;No power or sewer but nice Outhouses. Bring your own water&#xA;Whales come right up to the beach to rub their bellies. Plus lots of birds, seals, sea lions. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136900 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
