 <wpt lat="59.814723" lon="-136.559628">
  <ele>874.5157470703125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kelsall Lake</name>
  <desc>Small spot at Kelsall Lake, a clear creek flowing in and the outflow is close by. Gorgeous views in all directions. Can be windy or buggy. 4x4 and good clearance recommended! Take the access road north of the yellow gate to the gravel pit. Several spots along the way if you don&#39;t want to go all the way... No cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136912 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
