 <wpt lat="49.723320" lon="-125.161900">
  <ele>430.160400390625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Logging road</name>
  <desc>It was too windy up at My Washington, so we came down looking for a spot.  This is down a short logging road with a gate blocking off the rest of the access. We pulled in in front of gate but off to one side. Quiet, hardly visible from the road. Bonus: we got 2-3 bars of LTE!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136985 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
