  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Church Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>This is a large parking lot by the St. Thomas More Catholic Church and an elementary school, situated in a friendly neighbourhood. There is a big grassy area with a few shrubs and trees. There were a few locals who came by - all very friendly and offered their help should we need it. Quite a few cars arrived in the morning to drop kids off for school, but very quiet otherwise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/136986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
