 <wpt lat="48.719300" lon="-85.700200">
  <ele>232.3</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Private Boat Launch </name>
  <desc>We found a driveway leading to an old fishing boat launch with a pull off tucked behind the trees, across the highway from the abandoned Gloria’s Motel. Beautiful lakeside spot on a lake called “Dunc Lake” with a miniature beach and fire pit. We arrived at 12am. Used some deadfall to have a quick fire and watch the stars, before sleeping in the van and heading out early in the morning. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137031 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
