 <wpt lat="51.081040" lon="-114.000330">
  <ele>1077.8421630859375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Husky/Esso station</name>
  <desc>You can get free shower here if you have the Husky reward card which you can apply for free and get 500 points, each shower costs 50 points. They have nice clean private showers and hot water, like the one in Golden, BC. The only down side is that they don&#39;t have hair dryer but at this time during Covid, having a shower like this is like gold for van dweller, so I&#39;m not gonna complain about the hair dryer lol. Definitely worth checking it out if you need a shower in town. Access is only 7am-11pm, unless you are a class 1 truck driver, then any time.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137046 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
