  <name>Maytag Coin Laundry</name>
  <desc>$2.00 per load, takes quarters only. The Needs next door will make change for you. Last load can go in at 8:30pm as doors lock at 9pm. Very convenient!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137057 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
