  <ele>195.75344467163086</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Nice rest spot off the highway, it’s back in the trees. There is a sign which says “Please limit stay to 8 hours”. Would be a great spot for a night. There is room for 6 vehicles, each spot has a picnic table. There are pit toilets. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137088 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
