  <ele>613.642822265625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kluane Park Inn &amp; RV</name>
  <desc>Hotel with RV sites in the back, gravel lot with good water, sewer and 30amp hookups. New coin-operated car/RV wash, laundry and showers. The showers are very dirty and you need to pay extra for them. Beautiful view of the mountains when you leave the place, right in town, great spot to tour the area from. But the place itself is in terrible shape and feels dirty.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137119 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
