  <desc>Disused rec site. 1 proper campsite and a large pull in area on the water’s edge however steep rocky access. Several fire pits and a rough outhouse. I got one bar of cell service here.  Fits any size vehicle. It may be busy on the weekend. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
