  <name>Belvédère et halte routière de Saint-Narcisse</name>
  <desc>One of the most beautiful road pullout in the «Bas-Saint-Laurent». Washrooms and picnic tables (at least 5 or 6, placed on different levels and far away from each other) are accessible all year long. Astonishing sunsets make this place a must when travelling to Gaspesie!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-31 05:00:10 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137140 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
