  <name>McQueen Slough</name>
  <desc>Parking ground for McQueen Slough. This is a flat grassy area that can accommodate cars, camper vans, and maybe some medium rigs. Stayed there for one night. It’s far enough from the main road, so it’s pretty quiet. &#xA;No sign prohibiting overnight parking. &#xA;Can get a bit muddy if it’s rainy. No amenities. Full cell service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137151 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
