  <name>Georgian Inn Parking</name>
  <desc>We stayed 1 night and stay parked all day. The owner charge only 20$. It&#39;s 100 ft from the beach, stores and restaurants. With our 30ft class A we had magnificient view on the lake and a great sunset view. Georgan Inn office is accros the street.&#xA;Street address is : 21 Spruce St, Wasaga Beach, ON&#xA;Clean public bathroom at the left 100ft away&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137154 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
