  <name>Charlottenburg Park </name>
  <desc>The campground is an Ontario Provincial park in Summerstown. It&#39;s a beautiful cozy green space on shores of the St. Lawrence sea way. it&#39;s children and pet friendly. price is reasonable. very quiet. seasonal only.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 19:46:10 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137248 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
