 <wpt lat="44.352748" lon="-76.050766">
  <ele>72.8662109375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cosmo Camping </name>
  <desc>The 1000 Islands Camping Resort (now Cosmo Camping) is located in the heart of the 1000 islands on the 1000 Islands Parkway, midway between Gananoque and the 1000 Islands Bridge. North America&#39;s scenic playland is a cluster of more than 1,800 islands nestled in a fifty mile area of the St. Lawrence River between Ontario, Canada and New York State, USA. Personally, I was not impressed with this site or any of the other sites in that area,  but you are welcome to try it.  you may have a different experience. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137271 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
