 <wpt lat="49.536117" lon="-92.136480">
  <ele>413.68142318725586</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Revell River Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Good-sized rest area protected from the highway by a grove of trees. Pit toilets and several picnic tables adjacent to flat spots where you can park a van or RV for the night. Some highway noise but calms down at night. Rogers at 5 bars. Telus at 5 bars also.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137290 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
