 <wpt lat="54.835256" lon="-120.569963">
  <ele>1102.2057628631592</ele>
  <time>2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stony Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Beautiful free campground by the lake with 6 sites with fire pits (half of them are lakefront) and pit toilets. Quiet when we were there in mid September.&#xA;&#xA;Access 2km off the highway (well signed) on a rough but easily 2wd accessible road&#xA;&#xA;Had very weak signal with Telus in some places/sometimes&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137317 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
