 <wpt lat="45.424753" lon="-71.256538">
  <ele>393.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 08:35:58 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte municipale La Patrie - 5 espaces de camping gratuit / 5 free camping space</name>
  <desc>Rest area with 5 free camping spot for 2 tents and 3  for RV up to 50 feet.  picnic tables, dry toilet, trash can and firepits. Beautiful place, with the forest one side (you can hear some wild animals) and the road on the other (close to it unfortunately).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 08:35:58 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137327 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
