  <ele>725.56103515625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Swift Current Living Sky Casino</name>
  <desc>Free RV parking - asked at front desk and no need to register. Quiet parking lot. Casino is mostly empty. Well lit parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
