  <ele>440.27471923828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>English River</name>
  <desc>Access road to pipeline; big open area down a grassy road. Close enough to English River (3 min walk), you can see it from the best spot to park. There&#39;s a little fire pit, shade and a few trails nearby. Big rig friendly if you don&#39;t mind a few pinstripes on the way in. Full reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137395 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
