  <ele>171.25918197631836</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Richard’s Landing Marina</name>
  <desc>Spigot on the side of the public washroom building (on the southwest side of the parking lot across from the park/statue). There are also public showers and laundry at the marina office. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137440 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
