 <wpt lat="49.714150" lon="-123.067710">
  <ele>383.7</ele>
  <time>2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mac Blo Logging Road</name>
  <desc>Pretty much a pullout on the side of the road but was alright for one night. A little bit of trash but a great view. Lots of traffic, seemingly party goers but not sure where this road really leads as there was much more traffic than I’m sued to on FSR’s. Road to get there is doable in pretty much any vehicle but is rough! I would not want to do this for multiple days because it’s quite a ways drive that will take a toll on your vehicle. I recommend camping behind quest university but if your dearest on this area than it works.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
