  <ele>873.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kicking Horse Trail Parking</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot leading to an old rock crusher close to the road but not very busy. Cellular signal is okay. Can continue down the dirt road for more secluded pull offs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
