  <ele>347.1085205078125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 06:32:13 UTC</time>
  <name>Husky Esso</name>
  <desc>Truck stop with showers. Go to the counter and sign up for Husky Rewards (free membership). You will get points, which you can then use for a free shower (takes 24h for points to hit your card). Otherwise it&#39;s $8. The showers are fine, nothing special. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 06:32:13 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137515 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
