  <ele>330.0</ele>
  <time>2023-12-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside </name>
  <desc>Trails to crown land. On the way to another location down Troutspawn road (dirt road). this is the large area by the road right off the highway. no signs or anything. highway has some traffic. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137530 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
