 <wpt lat="58.665185" lon="-124.450963">
  <ele>984.893798828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near highway</name>
  <desc>Very private spot in the bush but also very close to the highway. Follow logging road from the highway for about 100 meters until you come to the small nook on your right hand side. Nice and flat with fire ring. Do not follow the logging road further, it ends suddenly and there is no room to turn around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137532 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
