 <wpt lat="49.311870" lon="-117.232614">
  <ele>755.8487548828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stewart Creek Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Little rest area with a single pit toilet and garbage bins, just 20 minutes south of Nelson, next to a babbling little stream which is great to sleep by. Not much traffic at night, nice and quiet. Arrived after dark in the rain, shared with one van overnight. No visible &#34;no overnight parking&#34; signs that I can see anywhere. Cell reception is a bit dodgy but mostly works. Great for campers or ppl sleeping in vehicles but ground isn&#39;t great for tents. Would stay here again.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137534 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
