  <ele>334.19403870310634</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nestor Falls Picnic Area</name>
  <desc>This is a rest area suitable for RV overnighting. There are clean pit toilets, picnic shelter and several picnic tables strategically placed next to the lake.&#xA;&#xA;There is room for kids to play or to exercise pets. &#xA;&#xA;The lake is easily accessible.&#xA;&#xA;Very pretty spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137553 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
