  <name>West Beach</name>
  <desc>Nice level ground next to beach. Simple fire pit in the middle of a turn around area. &#xA;&#xA;Beautiful view of Bay of Fundy, very rocky beach (no sand). &#xA;&#xA;Road is a bit rough getting in but still should be accessible with a smaller RV or car with care.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137648 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
