  <ele>495.529615153563</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off the Highway </name>
  <desc>Plenty of space to park off the Hwy less than one Kilometre. Communications type tower. Room to turn around and park. Full bars of cell service. Please respect this site is very clean, trash free and quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137698 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
