  <name>Portage la Prairie Wash Stop Laundry &amp; Car Wash</name>
  <desc>Very close to Walmart&#xA;Huge machines for big loads&#xA;Washing machines from $4 to $8 per load&#xA;Dryers $0.25 for 4 minutes and a big one $0.25/3minutes&#xA;&#xA;Very good customer service from the young lady&#xA;&#xA;There is a car/truck wash next to it&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137704 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
