 <wpt lat="47.471640" lon="-84.788320">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-11-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Coldwater River</name>
  <desc>Running late one evening we saw this from the highway and turned around to check it out.&#xA;Beside and looking under a bridge this is a very private Trout creek ( although called the Coldwater River)&#xA;Found on the Westbound land just before the River you can see in the pictures how close it is.&#xA;Below the level of the road it was very private and quiet with a view of the river from our window.&#xA;Beside is the Coastal hiking trail.&#xA;We saw 2 fishermen and no other campers.&#xA;Room for 3 van campers or 1 26 footer as we had.&#xA;Private and pretty and obviously a spot for the Trout fishermen.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137804 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
