  <ele>478.1</ele>
  <time>2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old church site</name>
  <desc>Old church site. No buildings or anything left except a monument. Quite large grassy area nicely cut. Perfect for an overnight stay, tenting or small camper.  Very quiet. 2 miles off the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137819 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
