 <wpt lat="49.860402" lon="-111.380910">
  <ele>795.3413237045872</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Centennial Park</name>
  <desc>Normally I’m not a fan of paying for camping, since our rig is self-contained. But given the scarcity of any sites, free or paid, in southern Alberta aside from generic RV Parks, this municipal park and campground would be very doable for $15 ($25 serviced). But a solid five stars with the amenities. Full cell service but far enough from the highway that you can barely hear it. Massive modern playground for kids of all ages. Soccer field and volleyball courts. What appears to be about 100 picnic tables, fire pits, multiple covered cooking areas, water and even a bit of shade - a lot but usually there’s none around here. Some google reviews complain about washroom maintenance but they look fine to me, beats squatting in the bush and the site is very clean. Everything you could ask for. And hardly expensive.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137876 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.228616" lon="-62.042148">
  <ele>17.336181640625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte routière </name>
  <desc>Roadside spot, picnic area. No &#39;no camping&#39; signs.&#xA;&#xA;Gazebo en bordure de route avec un sentier menant une table de pique-nique à l’abri de la route. Vue imprenable sur la forêt! &#xA;Pas de signe d’interdiction de camping et se stationnement de nuit. &#xA;&#xA;Gardez les lieux propres !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137918 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
