  <ele>54.5</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 10:17:56 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Ragueneau</name>
  <desc>Wonderful place made by the municipality near the Quai de Ragueneau. There are a toilets cabin and a few spaces for your tent. You’ll wake up in front of the sun the next day :)&#xA;The place is really clean so keep it that way please!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 10:17:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137919 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
