  <ele>530.3147450834513</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camp Ten Lake  </name>
  <desc>Camp Ten Lake. Great little spot by a small lake just north on Hwy 916 off  Saskatchewan Hwy 2. A few fire rings and a little lake. Good place for a pit stop outside of Prince Albert National Park. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/137926 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
