  <ele>977.7334583526425</ele>
  <time>2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hilton Spring water</name>
  <desc>Small gravel road just past the Athabasca River bridge on the north side.  Less than 200 meters in front of a small hut.  A little further away is a natural water source where people come to fill containers regularly.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138049 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
