 <wpt lat="47.841660" lon="-69.874715">
  <ele>13.2</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping municipal de Saint-Siméon</name>
  <desc>Municipal campground right next to Saint-Simeon ferry terminal, along shore of St. Lawrence river with sandy beach. Mostly serviced sites that will fit large RVs with a few small unserviced sites for vans. Washrooms, shower and laundry available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138105 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
