 <wpt lat="50.079837" lon="-120.640748">
  <ele>1117.3798828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marquart Lake</name>
  <desc>There are a few pull-in spots next to the lake here, each with a picnic table and fire pit. Lovely rolling grassy hills, nice and quiet with good cell phone service. There is also a pit toilet. Signs say there&#39;s a camping fee. $15. I believe there are more spots further up the road too (yes a much larger campground). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138128 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
