 <wpt lat="50.243476" lon="-117.809468">
  <ele>452.3641357421875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nakusp Municipal camping</name>
  <desc>A nice little site and 5 mins well put from the town center. The guy who runs the place, Dan, is lovely and helpful. There are hot showers and WiFi although this doesn&#39;t reach everywhere. $25 for non electrified site. &#xA;It is open from May to October. Not sure of exact dates. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138141 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
