 <wpt lat="50.123681" lon="-120.748601">
  <ele>69.20996856689453</ele>
  <time>2022-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Esso/Husky Truck station</name>
  <desc>Hot Unlimited showers for $8.40 or redeem 50 Husky points (new sign up available at the counter and you get 400 free points right away). &#xA;&#xA;6+ showers available, place is not very clean so bring your flip-flops. Soap via dispenser available. Electric plugs also available in the room. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138154 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
