  <ele>785.6999905344154</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kluane 3</name>
  <desc>On a bluff overlooking Destruction Bay. Wide spot in side road leading to abandoned/out-of-business motel/resort. Semi-protected from winds. Fire ring. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138180 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
