  <ele>12.571714624762535</ele>
  <time>2024-05-10 10:55:15 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte de la cote du Ministre - potable water, toilets</name>
  <desc>Small rest area next to the road with shiny clean toilets and a water tap outside (very slow and only a small bottles friendly though). It&#39;s also a nice park with picnic tables and garbage bins. Hours: 7.30-23.00. No camping sign. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 10:55:15 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138182 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
