 <wpt lat="50.029931" lon="-125.579938">
  <ele>206.04822053525547</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Orchard Meadow Rec Site </name>
  <desc>OPEN ONLY IN SEASON&#xA;&#xA;Awesome free rec site along a forestry road, few potholes but nothing major. 14 sites, pit toilets, and each site has a picnic bench and fire pit. We are here on a Wednesday at the end of September and it is half full, so I imagine in the summer time/weekends it probably gets very busy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138183 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
