  <ele>972.6409390548383</ele>
  <time>2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fairmont Hot Springs RV Resort</name>
  <desc>Full service rv park with hot spring pools and 190 places.&#xA;All open now (May 25th, 2022)(Due to COVID-19 laundry and some washrooms and community kitchen areas are closed.) &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
