 <wpt lat="52.870896" lon="-107.537574">
  <ele>673.4201316833496</ele>
  <time>2023-05-20 19:32:56 UTC</time>
  <name>The Crooked Bush</name>
  <desc>Out of the way spot with a pit toilet and picnic table.  No signage of any kind.  The access is a short loop rowd with enough room for a large RV or truck and camper to pull through to turn around.  Crooked trees with a short boardwalk to sight see. tenting possible&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 19:32:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138289 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
