 <wpt lat="55.051010" lon="-98.520341">
  <ele>11.7</ele>
  <time>2022-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Setting Lake Boat Launch</name>
  <desc>Good spot an hour from Thompson, away from any houses or traffic. There’s a flat-ish spot slightly up from the water that did the trick for us. Be respectful, don’t leave your rubbish everywhere. great aurora watching if there&#39;s pitch black skies&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138297 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
