  <ele>224.47495275218</ele>
  <time>2023-04-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolfe Lake Road clearing</name>
  <desc>Simple but effective. Big wide open area on the side of a gravel road that appears to be just used by hunters and ATVs. Tons of space, mostly flat and very quiet. No facilities but modest Telus coverage. Works for us since the other options north of Sault Ste Marie were either right beside the highway and or closed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138345 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
