 <wpt lat="49.874210" lon="-126.163830">
  <ele>234.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Muchalat Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Nice spot on a lake. 40 sites. We had been past in summer and could not get near the place because of crowds. In October it&#39;s pretty near empty. Bit of a rough road up from Gold River but no probs for our 22 ft C Class.  We think it is $15 in season but in October it&#39;s free. Nice free boat launch too.     the lake is full of salmon, jumping all the time.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138351 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
