 <wpt lat="48.367484" lon="-89.307348">
  <ele>177.47910692050726</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Westfort Playfield</name>
  <desc>Spent 2 nights here. Quiet at night. Trash bins are on site. Dog park nearby. Friendly locals. Enjoy and be respectful&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138376 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
