 <wpt lat="50.027406" lon="-125.423347">
  <ele>207.17394325712382</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Big Bay, Campbell Lake</name>
  <desc>Big Bay Recreation site. At least 6 spots with picnic tables and fire pits. Follow signs to Loveland Bay, small sign for Big Bay around km7 sign(I think). Beautiful quiet free spot. Biggest drawback is that it is shady throughout. That can also be a bonus on some days. There is a pit toilet and a place you could launch a small boat and there is a dock(of sorts).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138391 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
