 <wpt lat="51.479599" lon="-112.797245">
  <ele>690.8266056840171</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Large roadside pullout</name>
  <desc>Large flat open area that is relatively level and just off the main road. No signs marked private property. The tiny church is right next to it.  Quiet but may be windy, and will be muddy if it rains. Will get busy in the day as the church is a tourist attraction. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138393 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
