 <wpt lat="49.275009" lon="-125.366767">
  <ele>210.5156777156517</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>“Deactivated” FSR </name>
  <desc>A “deactivated” forestry service road just off the highway. Road is in fine condition, considered deactivated bc the bridges later on are behind closed gates. Close to the highway, but very private. Large gravel pit with a fire pit.  Could fit a couple RVs, or a few vans if they don’t mind parking near each other. Kennedy river nearby. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138456 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
