  <ele>845.4896123274191</ele>
  <time>2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petro Canada</name>
  <desc>There are showers at this rest stop, if you go in the door between the fuel station &amp; the restaurant &amp; follow the hallway there are toilets on the left hand side. The showers are only in the men’s. &#xA;&#xA;No more coin machines!!! Just have a free shower as long as you want!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138471 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
