  <ele>103.71570213259548</ele>
  <time>2023-04-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street parking</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet place on a street, not in front of any house, one side of the street is beside a wooden fence and behind there&#39;s a building with only a small window and the other side of the street there&#39;s a building with no window.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138532 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
