  <ele>272.8595760781318</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Truck stop with clean showers.  Bit on the pricier side, $13 but includes towel and very clean.  Much nicer than Pedro and showers.  Restaurant is decent as well, had the burger. Good pit stop on your way in/out of sleeping giant. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
