  <ele>908.615966796875</ele>
  <time>2023-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Penhold Petro Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Rest are just off the QE2. Beside Petro Canada. Stayed one night. Noise from trucks coming and going, but had a good sleep in my SUV. There&#39;s a Tim Hortons, Burger King and Petro Gas station. park closer to the Tim&#39;s for WiFi. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138535 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
