  <time>2024-07-23 15:48:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Battle River Trestle Lookout</name>
  <desc>Large open parking area over looking the river valley and trestle bridge.  No signs of any kind about overnight parking or camping.  No shade.  You could try to tent here either on the gravel or in the uncut grass around the parking area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 15:48:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138558 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
