  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rte Principale E</name>
  <desc>Wonderful site similar to the one listed close to Marsoui. It&#39;s right by the water and the road. Mountains behind.&#xA;No cell reception.&#xA;There is an old road, blocked off now, that goes behind the rock, looks like nice privacy for tenters with a couple of fire pits.&#xA;&#xA;Gravel parking area is ok for big rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138670 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
