 <wpt lat="48.441446" lon="-124.111723">
  <ele>128.53235132706146</ele>
  <time>2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Mystic Beach</name>
  <desc>This looks like it’s a logging access point. Rough road goes downhill about 400m to a small turn around. Not super level but not bad. Primitive fire pit, a bit of construction dumping mess. Inactive logging work when we were there. Decent place to spend the night. No room to turn around a trailer or anything bigger than a van. Two vehicles possible but tight. Spot at the top of hill also but very close to road. No service&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138813 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
