 <wpt lat="47.921799" lon="-84.807329">
  <ele>190.83938545174897</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Michipicoten canoe route</name>
  <desc>Large turnaround by the river. Follow the narrow road off the turnaround thru to an opening further away from the hwy. Further down the narrow road (keep right) you&#39;ll see a large clearing with a fire pit, as well as access to a sandy beach area. Access on the narrow road would be risky for larger non 4x4 vehicles, but the main turnaround by the hwy is fine for a small trailer and any sort of car. 3G reception (no LTE with Rogers). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138863 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
