 <wpt lat="49.639100" lon="-117.151500">
  <ele>855.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kokanee glacier trailhead</name>
  <desc>Really nice camp spot on the edge of a mountain. Roaring river down a steep path. Lots of room for vans and tents. Could even get a trailer or bigger RV in this spot. Multiple fire pits. No traffic at night but vehicles and dump trucks in the morning due to some work at the 10km mark or so. No cell service. Would camp here any day of the week tho! Really relaxing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138868 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
