 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="46.186570" lon="-82.954910">
  <ele>183.37724674865603</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blind River - Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Just past the Tim Hortons off Hwy 17 on your right, there is a parking lot behind some shops, stayed there for the night, which was a lot nicer than the Community Centre parking lot which was a bit industrial. You are a couple minutes walk from a Tim Hortons where you can use the bathroom. Met some other vanlifers in the parking lot, nice a quiet at night... looking out at a little river and fountain.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/138886 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
