  <ele>25.115588870830834</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 08:04:48 UTC</time>
  <name>Powder Mill Park</name>
  <desc>Pretty swimming spot at a lake alongside a busy road. No signs saying no overnight parking, however signs do say no dogs, and children must be supervised at all times.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 08:04:48 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139070 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
