  <desc>Potable water spout on southeast side of building. Motion activated and non-threaded. (Water bandit and short hose works well). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139140 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
