 <wpt lat="46.250160" lon="-75.736280">
  <ele>318.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac Fiset</name>
  <desc>Can the Jeeps and others that are parking on the site..like near the campfire stop..site is rutted..ground is very soft, lets please keep it nice for all..best spot to park is on the road..that area just off the road leading to the site is a mess...and someone got stuck recently and left with huge ruts..good thing I have a spade..the site is nice, but hilly so very limited place to put tents.. 2-3 man tents only..road is not suitable for anything but a lifted 4x4..I have 9.3 inches of clearance and still hit twice..was going too fast..lots of noise from the ATV&#39;s there is a trail close by and they pass by the site as well frequently..&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139223 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
