 <wpt lat="50.055110" lon="-110.733344">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J Travel Center</name>
  <desc>Truck stop where you can stay for the night. Big RV friendly. There is gas, shop, and you can have a shower (12,6$) and wash your clothes. We had not had a real shower and it was exactly was we needed.  Staff was kind and let us take our shower together. Free wifi and toilet 24H. No tents but you can park with a camper or truck. Park carefully, take just one spot, a lot of huuuge trucks need the place too).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139294 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
