  <desc>Street parking, really quiet, condominiums on one side and business building on the other&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-02-19 20:00:12 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139298 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
