  <ele>69.00624382010571</ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street camping</name>
  <desc>Beautiful quiet place, no sign, beside an advanced bike park i would say with pretty steep hills for mountain bikers in what looks like a forest.&#xA;There&#39;s one trash can at the entry.&#xA;One side of the street is the park and on the other side there&#39;s a house without windows to view where we parked.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139322 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
