 <wpt lat="49.660971" lon="-103.872068">
  <ele>549.0155029296875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 18:09:46 UTC</time>
  <name>Weyburn Walmart </name>
  <desc>It&#39;s a Walmart parking lot &#xA;&#xA;No other overlanders here on this Nov. night. Customer Service OKed parking overnight. We did have a semi for company for most of the night.&#xA;&#xA;We parked on the west side next to the open field. Some highway and train noise, but not intrusive - a quiet, restful night.&#xA;&#xA;The wifi doesn&#39;t reach to this part of the parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 540.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 18:09:46 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
