  <desc>I&#39;m marking this spot to make it easier to find the campground access.  Follow the road to the right of the sign in my photo.  Enjoy... nice little area...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
