  <desc>Parking for up to 4 or 5 cars with a pit toilet.  No picnic tables.  No signage of any kind about overnight parking or camping of any kind.  No water or cell service.  About 9km on forestry roads from Highway 19.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
