  <name>Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Great location. will have to park in the Can Tire parking lot but there&#39;s free Wi-Fi from both Canadian Tire and Tim Hortons. One of the few locations that actually turns out the lights in their parking lot at night  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139509 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
