 <wpt lat="46.364740" lon="-74.816030">
  <ele>236.4</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rivière Rouge</name>
  <desc>Cute place between a small gravel road and Rivière Rouge for 1 or 2 VR. Transcanadienne Highway is across the river, so we can hear traffic but it’s not really disturbing. Access to the river (fishing?) and a small fire place was already there. We stayed one night without any trouble, the gravel road is not busy at all.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139512 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
