  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Fire Pit</name>
  <desc>The &#34;giant fire pit&#34; was taken so I had to drive farther in.  I found a spot that is easily accessible, no 4wd needed.&#xA;&#xA;There was already a fire pit here but looks like it hasn&#39;t been used in a while.&#xA;&#xA;Unfortunately, there is no lake view.&#xA;&#xA;It&#39;s open though, good if you have solar panels.&#xA;&#xA;Site includes some used asphalt shingles and chain link fencing!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139524 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
