  <desc>100 campsites. standard and double site available. &#xA;booked / reservation thru bc prov campground, walk in avail.&#xA;flush toilet. potable water.&#xA;well maintained. no electric. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139531 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
