  <name>Alder bay campground</name>
  <desc>Awesome warm shower !!!&#xA;Trying to find a shower during covid and off season (november). &#xA;Everything is closed (McNeil, Telegraphe cove...).&#xA;It&#39;s the only one and the best !&#xA;2$ for a personal warm shower and unlimited !&#xA;Bonus : owners are very friendly and helpful !&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139570 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
