  <desc>Street parking, a really quiet place a fence with trees on one side of the street and a Church far away on the other side.&#xA;A good place when you&#39;re getting late finding a spot to sleep in Abbotsford.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139579 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
