  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Streetside</name>
  <desc>This spit of road has no parking restrictions, across from a park and away from grudging residents, but a hop jump and a skip away from Jericho beach/Locarno Beach and Spanish Banks. Since their parking is only open from 6am-10pm, it’s a real easy spot to relocate to and then go back to your preferred park to park during the day.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
