  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Esso Truck Stop </name>
  <desc>It&#39;s a truck stop. But, with the campground closed, good for one night.&#xA;&#xA;Big dirt lot. Busy with trucks coming and going. Highway and train noise. All that being said, we had an uneventful and relaxed night with the campervan parked between two semis. No issues. &#xA;&#xA;CBC at 540.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/139624 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
