 <wpt lat="49.901708" lon="-102.089311">
  <ele>672.4449119567871</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 17:44:06 UTC</time>
  <name>Kennett&#39;s Kitchen</name>
  <desc>Very nice spot just 5km west of Wawota.  Quiet highway location on with picnic shelter and pit toilets.  No signs prohibiting parking or camping of any kind.  Very welcoming and very much appreciated by us in late november.  Wawota Co-op keeps long hours 6am to 9pm and has gas and a bit of produce groceries.  There is also a bar/restaurant.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 17:44:06 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140291 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
