  <ele>722.0488263191655</ele>
  <time>2024-05-14 12:13:15 UTC</time>
  <name>Great Canadian Oil Change</name>
  <desc>As there is no water available at the visitor center at this time of the year, we had the idea to check if it was possible to have fresh water here and the employees were very kind and helpful. There is a water valve just outside of the building (on the side of the Home Depot). Please ask before using, as it is not public! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 12:13:15 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140422 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
