  <desc>Great spot just off the road by the creek. Signs of lots of use - 4 or 5 stone campfire rings. Easy approach - we made it in our minivan. No facilities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140430 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
