  <name>Radium Hot Springs</name>
  <desc>Nice view mount xxx, quiet.&#xA;The other points mentioned on Ioverlander being very busy I continued the road to this place facing a summit whose name I do not know.&#xA;&#xA;Les autres points mentionnés sur Ioverlander étant fort occupé j&#39;ai poursuivi la route jusqu&#39;à cet endroit face à un sommet dont j&#39;ignore le nom.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
