  <name>Fort McLeod-Parking</name>
  <desc>Big parking next church Mormon.&#xA;A large parking lot in front of the Mormon Church, quiet and a few trees to provide shade, no prohibitions or restrictions.&#xA;&#xA;Un grand parking face à l&#39;église Mormon, calme et quelques sapins pour faire de l&#39;ombre, pas d&#39;interdictions ni de restrictions.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140475 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
