  <name>Kwaksistah Regional Campground</name>
  <desc>Great little, rustic regional indigenous campground in Winter Harbour, on the shores of the inlet. Appears to be free, at least off season. &#xA;&#xA;Access is through very good forest service roads.&#xA;&#xA;No services but pit toilet, garbage and recycling. 14 day limit. Perfect for this area!&#xA;&#xA;No cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140521 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
