  <desc>Convenient location right off major intersection. Shower facility is clean and well-maintained. $8 for non-Husky members who bring their own towel. The service station also has a convenience store, both petrol and diesel, as well as a restaurant. Good wifi, $5 for laundry (washing and drying ~1hr15min)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/140785 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
