  <ele>353.42885971069336</ele>
  <time>2024-04-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petro pass station free showers </name>
  <desc>Walked in and asked first. The gal behind the counter said they are free as long as you bring all your own supplies/ soap towels etc.  clean showers nice people. Just go straight Into the drivers lounge two lockable rooms on the right to shower in.  We shared one to be courteous to any others that may need one while we were here &#xA;Visiting March 20 2021. Location is valid however it’s closed/locked up during business hours (likely covid related). Card lock fuel pumps are in operation still&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/141725 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
