 <wpt lat="49.257140" lon="-124.813670">
  <ele>4.45210562160962</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Victoria Quay - Whaling Monument</name>
  <desc>Moderator Note: Caution! A recent User report states that drug users are in area.&#xA;.....&#xA;I parked here and a dead battery turned an afternoon stop into an overnight stay. There are no ‘No Overnight Camping’ signs in this small parking lot and I was not bothered by anyone throughout the night. It’s a little noisy in the evening because it’s on a fairly busy street but it quiets down late at night. It’s right in the river so it is actually a beautiful place to stay for a night. No amenities but the site does have strong Shaw WiFi. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/141946 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
