  <ele>21.68899154663086</ele>
  <time>2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking for East Coast Trail</name>
  <desc>A gravel parking lot that looks to be for the East Coast Trail trailhead. The MUN Science Centre is right beside it. Nice &amp; sheltered from the wind. We only spent one night but it was quiet &amp; uninterrupted throughout the night. Also was January so we can’t speak to summer traffic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/142088 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
