  <name>Sage Hill Walmart </name>
  <desc>I asked inside at customer service first.  Manager said it would be fine to park my van for the night.  I was the only camper there.  Very quiet, no traffic or train noises.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/142582 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
