 <wpt lat="50.209026" lon="-66.371082">
  <ele>1.33966064453125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lave-Net</name>
  <desc>Self service laundry with toilet. 1.50$ for a wash and 0.25$/4 minutes to dry. Very efficient machines, even if they are old. There is a toilet inside. Only accept 1$ and 25 cent. You can ask for change at the dry cleaner next door. Search for &#34;nettoyeurs Sept-Iles&#34; on Google maps for direction. Only open during week days. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/143365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
