  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grand Remous - Pont Savoyard</name>
  <desc>Rest stop just west of the covered bridge Le Savoyard.  Clean, quiet, picnic tables with great view of the Gatineau river.  No toilet, no potable water.  Stayed overnight with truck and 15ft camper.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/143746 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
