  <name>Goat River Canyon Recreation Site BC</name>
  <desc>Free established campground. Only a few minutes walk to the gorgeous canyon but extremely cold. Plenty of room, lots of sites along the river with tables fire rings and pit toilets. Excellent spots &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144057 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
