  <name>Old Rte 105</name>
  <desc>Old bypassed highway that leads to a dead end with no houses. There is an old rest stop on the right about 1 km out thats big enough for multiple RVs and easy to turn around. Easily accessed from the east bound exit 333 but requires a u-turn if you are going west bound.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144393 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
