  <name>Belleisle Marsh Wildlife Area</name>
  <desc>Designated parking lot for marsh wildlife area. Trails and farm roads for walking, be mindful of farm equipment that may also be using the main roads. Parking looks like it will be redone this spring with new gravel. Quiet and not far from Highway 1.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144522 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
