  <time>2024-06-30 09:48:04 UTC</time>
  <name>Fairy Vista Parking</name>
  <desc>Nice spot at the start of Fairy Vista trail. You can park here and no issues at night for parking. No &#34;No overnight parking&#34; signs.  Nice spot to wake up to. Close to a water treatment plant, but you just hear vehicles driving on the roadway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 09:48:04 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144559 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
