  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burnell Lake Forest Road</name>
  <desc>Pull off on the side of the forest road up towards Burnell Lake. &#xA;Found it on the way to Burnell Lake to camp but found the road too icy so we turned around and camped here. &#xA;&#xA;There&#39;s an existing firepit and nice view. Can fit an SUV/VAN but nothing too large. &#xA;&#xA;Just a pull-off with a fire pit and a place to park your car or pitch a tent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144601 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
