  <time>2024-04-19 09:50:56 UTC</time>
  <name>Mabel lake campground </name>
  <desc>about 6k further up the road, really pretty spot with dry sites, pits, picknick&#xA;tables, sandy beaches. we came through in off season, but there&#39;s water and what looked like a sani station also a kids playground. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-19 09:50:56 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144766 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
