  <ele>440.13818359375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Smeaton Campground</name>
  <desc>Flat, grassy area on outskirts of town. Two picnic tables and a garbage can are all the ameneties provided. Vault toilets are old and closed. Good for a night since the campground we were aiming for is permanently closed. There is a donation box if you want to contribute.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144769 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
