 <wpt lat="51.184441" lon="-98.351459">
  <ele>235.1900634765625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ashern Sharptail Park</name>
  <desc>Small well-worn campground on the highway in Ashern. Serviced sites have hydro, water and sewer. $22.50. Unserviced $15.50. The bathroom is locked, probably permanently as the doors are screwed shut with angle iron brackets. Some electric outlets don&#39;t work, so try a couple. There is some noise from the highway, but this is an ok stop for the night.  There is a dumpstation here that costs $10.00.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
