  <ele>828.4880595054209</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chute Lake RD</name>
  <desc>Spot on the side of a gravel road. Great view of Lake Okanagan and the city of Kelowna. Didn&#39;t see any places for RVs to turn around but any size SUV is fine. &#xA;&#xA;A few cars are passing by during the night, but after dark it’s really quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/144832 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
