  <desc>Community pool and showers. Clean and friendly. Admission $7/adult. Schedule varies depending on season so best to check website or call ahead. Within walking distance to campground, walking trails, dog park and town centre.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/145236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
