 <wpt lat="49.173386" lon="-123.949981">
  <ele>21.057057259626</ele>
  <time>2023-11-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Caledonia Park</name>
  <desc>Free showers are offered Monday through Friday from 7:00am to 11:45am. Towels, soap and shampoo are also offered. This is a service of a community outreach program and caters  to the homeless as well as nomadic travelers. Please be appreciative of the service and respectful to all patrons. &#xA;&#xA;Shaw WiFi is also available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/145285 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
