  <name>Radium Hot Springs</name>
  <desc>About $7per adult for entry to the hot springs. Includes a shower (soap included) plus you get to relax in the hot pools. &#xA;Showers are not inside a cubical so take that into account if you enjoy your privacy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/145327 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
