 <wpt lat="50.535820" lon="-122.134835">
  <ele>787.3525390625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gott Creek Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Small rec site along Cayoosh Creek. $15/night fee applies Mid May to Mid Oct, free otherwise. There are 7 campsites.&#xA;&#xA;Even though the CG is close to the road the river drowns out road noise. Ranger warned of grizzlies in the area but we didn&#39;t see any.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/145413 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
