 <wpt lat="50.131231" lon="-115.635781">
  <ele>1154.76667878218</ele>
  <time>2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Close to Lussier hotsprings</name>
  <desc>This is a wildcamping place on crownland. &#xA;Can get to these spots by a logging road. Lots of spaces in the woods to camp, several fire rings. And a few fairly flat places for the tents. Looks like a well used place, but clean and empty when we were here. &#xA;Close to the hot springs. It is 2021 April and the hot springs are closed. But nice place to camp, quiet and beautiful. I love these hot springs, will be nice when they open again. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/145948 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
