  <ele>228.4</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mont Ste Marie - parking lots / hill land </name>
  <desc>Camping is permitted in the main parking lot as well as overflow parking lots. Good for tents/Trailers/RVs etc. Limited privacy and can get busy with campers during mountain bike weekends. Campfires are generally permitted and there is drinking water and toilette available on the south east side of the main lodge. Pet friendly area (off leash friendly)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/146403 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
