  <name>Lac Philippe Campground (Gatineau Park)</name>
  <desc>Public campground. Lots of amenities. Cost around $40 a night. Reservations are normally required, I was able to get a « first come first serve » site by calling ahead. (Comfort stations have sinks, laundry, electricity, showers)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/146404 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
