 <wpt lat="48.861792" lon="-124.720808">
  <ele>200.03875732421875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flora Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Small free Rec Site with about 4 spots on the south side of Flora Lake. Beautifully spaced out with moss-covered Hemlocks and Cedars between. Outhouse, tables and fire pits. Our site had a private little beach, great for lake access. Very quiet. &#xA;Google wants you to swim across the lake, but you don&#39;t have to! Just turn south on the eastern end of the lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/146675 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
