  <ele>282.348388671875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gordon River</name>
  <desc>Nice little spot by the super clear Gordon River. Fire pits but no outhouse. Close to the FSR but quiet at night (and mostly during the day too).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/146969 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
