 <wpt lat="54.447833" lon="-122.654071">
  <ele>697.7748986594379</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crooked creek</name>
  <desc>A small space for one vehicle just off a well maintained FSR. Small entrance to the right. very tight trees on the side of the track in but we made it in a 30ft RV as in photos. Needs some good wheel work and some courage but you’ll be ok. Smaller rigs are fine. Few spots in the trees on the way in for small vehicles and a spot across the river just before the bridge. Sign says it’s a fire truck refill spot so use at your own risk. Fire pit and a couple steps from the river. A little bit of road noise from the highway but not enough to disturb the absolute serenity you experience.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/147530 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
