  <ele>228.50567626953125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pretty River Rd</name>
  <desc>This lot is maintained by a snowmobile club and is large enough for RVs. Very quiet but cell coverage isn&#39;t great. No fires permitted. Stayed two nights with no issues.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/147819 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
