 <wpt lat="46.355550" lon="-79.467905">
  <ele>280.3194580078125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bay Truck Stop (Petro Canada)</name>
  <desc>Cost for a shower was $9. Older facilities but very, very clean. Shower is only big enough for one, but shower #4 big enough for two. One towel and bar of soap provided. Shower has a seat, two shelves for toiletries and two handrails. &#xA;&#xA;The showers are located in the first building, (which is south of the cardlock), attached to the restaurant.&#xA;&#xA;I was asked a bunch of questions for covid protocols, one being &#34;are you local&#34;. I&#39;m not sure whether service would have been denied if the answer was no.&#xA;&#xA;I believe showers are also available at the Husky just north and the BVD 10 minutes south. Certain Husky locations only allow showers for truckers during covid.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/147825 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
