  <desc>Provincial recreational site with pit toilets. Creek nearby. Most sites require reservations, but only 1/3 full midweek in late July. On site park staff to collect fee. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/149774 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
