 <wpt lat="49.310708" lon="-119.041403">
  <ele>713.5010976558324</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kettle river hideaway</name>
  <desc>Gravel road turn off just up the hill from the Goat Creek campsite which is no longer accessible due to sinkhole. Turnoff has a small concrete pillar. &#xA;Half a dozen sites with fir pits. Best site next to the Kettle river. There was a guy here long-term when we found the river. Not much road noise. No service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/149848 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
