  <desc>drive up the dirt road with 4x4 to get to a sweet open area with a fire pit. for climbers check Dorion tower on mountain project, 20m tower 5.6 Trad and super close by&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/149853 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
