 <wpt lat="50.683527" lon="-128.240628">
  <ele>39.4247254608199</ele>
  <time>2024-04-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>San Josef Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free rec site near the San Josef beach trail. Maybe 10 sites... very worn down and muddy, but will do for a few nights. Fire pits and picnic tables (some broken) at all sites. Better pit toilets at the parking lot entrance to the trail. Also, a nice cooking shelter near the trailhead for when it’s raining!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/149863 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
