  <name>KBR Campground</name>
  <desc>We went there for the showers but it&#39;s an established campground. Showers are available during Covid for $3 and a quarter for every minute. Extremely clean (!!!) and you get your own proper bathroom with sink, toilet and hot shower. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-27 21:26:22 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
