  <time>2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cecil Thompson Park</name>
  <desc>Free sites with no service. Has cell reception and clean grounds with view to a pond with pleasant bird life. Great for a stop over up to 14 days, and across a field is an RV park if you wish to stay longer or pay for use of amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150189 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
