  <desc>A small dirt road leads up the hillside to a couple of spots with fire rings.  Some train noises but overall very quiet and private. Good LTE service.  There are pit toilets about 5 km south at the Whitehorse Campground. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150199 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
