  <name>Williams Lake Stampede Campground</name>
  <desc>We stayed during covid, so the washrooms and wash machines were closed.  Nice campsite, rigs are kind of close together. Very friendly staff and good location. Reservations recommended.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150266 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
