 <wpt lat="46.888880" lon="-71.075010">
  <ele>87.10593815982384</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 08:51:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Eglise St-Pierre</name>
  <desc>Like all other Churches of the Parish of Ste-Famille, you can sleep overnight. It is well appreciated to make a donation to them (20$ suggested) at &#xA;https://www.fabriquestefamilleio.org &#xA;&#xA;to help them keep the place clean. Close to nice farms like Cassis Mona et filles. Please respect those places for us to enjoy many years.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 08:51:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150330 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
