 <wpt lat="50.635373" lon="-116.232450">
  <ele>1079.0478309393768</ele>
  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dogleg Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Approx 20km on gravel/rocky road from the town of Radium Hot Springs. Approx 5 free Campsites. first come first serve. with picnic benches and fire pits.. Some sites closer together than others. Dirt biking can be heard nearby. Otherwise quiet lake. Stayed one night on weekend. Noted some other “unofficial sites” made and used by others. Would stay again. One bar of cellular service noted as well.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150357 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
