 <wpt lat="50.628277" lon="-116.194263">
  <ele>972.1440230280903</ele>
  <time>2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>Grassy area for wild camping on the left before small bridge. Rock fire pits made by others / locals before us. Mountain peaks can be seen. Private open space with tall trees all around. Next to river. Could fit 2 vans. Small outhouse at entrance of day area sign about 200m away. Close to road. Would stay again. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150379 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
