  <name>Irving Big Stop</name>
  <desc>Large lot behind the Irving Big Stop truck stop. Lots of trucks. Good restaurant inside Irving, Tim Hortons next store, liquor store across the street, wifi… many needs met in one place! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
