  <ele>156.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach</name>
  <desc>This is another place by Lake Superior in the event that the official rest area or the other spot by Lake Superior has already been taken! it is a narrow road down. travelled in a class B campervan. a bit noisy from trucks. but beautiful view! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150574 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
