  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Broadview Lions Campground </name>
  <desc>Established site by the Lions Club.  Great pull throughs, power, clean washrooms.  Money goes back to the community, easy access from TC.  Adjacent playground.  Text the number provided to check in and get washroom codes &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150625 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
