 <wpt lat="49.411330" lon="-68.251220">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Portage à Lila</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot on the Rivière des Anglais (Englishmen&#39;s river), just up the Gadou waterfalls. Seems like an old &#34;portage&#34; spot: a place to take your canoe or kayak off the river. Firepit. Possible to swim. There was space to set our tent and fit our van. No signs saying that its a private property and a local drove by without stopping. Rough dirt road to get there, but we made it with our 2w van. Very quiet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150720 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
