  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc des capitaines</name>
  <desc>Behind the city hall in St Ulric, boat launch. Municipal rest area where camping is permitted. Directly on the river bank. Picnic tables and trash cans.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150723 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
