  <ele>135.0308617134813</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 09:57:42 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving Big Stop</name>
  <desc>Lots of place to park and sleep for the night. Some noise from the big trucks but we were able to block that out with a fan. We went and asked first but they said no problem to plug into their 15amp power as well as fill up our fresh water. They also have a dump station but due to covid it is not available at this time. Great food and amenities inside as well.  Downside - lots of bright lights around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 09:57:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150725 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
