  <ele>324.04552841186523</ele>
  <time>2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Strong Creek </name>
  <desc>Awesome free campground  on the river near Peace River. Free fire wood. Pit toilets. Garbage can on site. Fire pit. Lots of space. Accessible with big rigs.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
