  <ele>268.2863993474222</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Espace Desjardins</name>
  <desc>Lot of space, view of the beach, dog on leash allowed, outdoor workout, near water and water playground. The road is a bit noisy but thanks to covid restrictions, quiet for the night. A building is in construction that looks like a convenience service to be. Miniputt in construction too. Near to an ice cream shop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
