 <wpt lat="44.913914" lon="-75.844311">
  <ele>108.31176060050718</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Merrickville Lions Club Campground </name>
  <desc>Lions Club Campground offers a sani-dump (black and grey) with fresh water fill for $10. See the on-site manager at the office.  Merrickville is a pretty Ontario town and this RV site is right on the Rideau Canal if you want to stay a couple of days at modest cost. RV site is well-maintained with an on-site manager. Site has clean washrooms and hot water showers. Main Street Family Restaurant is good place for meals; Village Bean for coffee and breakfast, Food Market for groceries.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150821 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
