  <ele>232.3586597442627</ele>
  <time>2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chehalis FSR creek spot </name>
  <desc>Nice spot next to a creek in a forest clearing. Lots of wood and clean water! Room for a few cars and suitable for 2wd and big rigs. It has been previously fly tipped but isn’t too noticeable. Let’s keep it clean!&#xA;There are also other pull outs further down the road &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150838 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
