  <desc>Water on the parking lot of Super C. On the south side there is a water tap saying potable water. Easy to access. As much you want. &#xA;.....&#xA;Dans le stationnement du magasin Super C a Mont Tremblant du cote sud il y a un robinet indiqué eau potable. Facile d&#39;acces en VR.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150863 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
