  <desc>This is a nice large sandy camping area on Crownland. Far from this camping area but in the same sand pit is a spot for gun/archery shooting. Dead firewood around and I build camp fire area last year.  Accessible with regular car but I came with a Jeep.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/150952 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
