  <desc>There is no grocery store in this town, but this deli has some produce, meat and dry goods if needed. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151053 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
