 <wpt lat="49.733111" lon="-94.914044">
  <ele>400.50979199823325</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 15:39:37 UTC</time>
  <name>Road Side Bluff</name>
  <desc>A spot just off the gravel road at the top of a rise. &#xA;Suitable for larger units or maybe even two small ones. &#xA;We are an F350 with a truck camper pulling a 16 foot trailer, and we fit. &#xA;&#xA;If you hike to the top of the rock bluff, there are excellent views of the sunset. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 15:39:37 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151062 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
