  <ele>1493.2276611328125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 11:06:14 UTC</time>
  <name>Near stream</name>
  <desc>Secluded camping spot beside the river with a fire pit. Suitable for a truck with bed camper or a vehicle with a very small trailer or someone using a tent. There is cell network signal. 2 bars.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 11:06:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151182 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
