  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pura Vida Lodge &amp; Sup</name>
  <desc>Beautiful, enchanting site with locations directly on the water&#39;s edge. Possibility of having 2 services (water and electricity). Boat descent, dock, sanitary block, swimming pool, volleyball court, children&#39;s park and community hall as well as a beautiful covered terrace for rainy days. Go back to the boat for fans of paddle boarding and other water sports. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151315 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
