  <name>Ship Harbour Suds Laundromat </name>
  <desc>Small laundromat. new machines, fast wifi, washroom and change machine. really clean. great facility. Open at 8h00 and close at 20h00.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151333 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
