  <desc>Nice little laundromat! I’ve been there 2 times and a lot of washing machines and dryers were available!&#xA;Price&#xA;•Double Load Washer: 3.50$&#xA;•Triple Load Washer: 4.75$&#xA;•Dryer : 0.25$ for 4min&#xA;_____&#xA;•Soap: 1.50$&#xA;•Bounce: 0.50$&#xA;•Garbage bag: 0.50$&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
