 <wpt lat="44.017270" lon="-79.811512">
  <ele>238.2161865234375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tottenham Conservation Area</name>
  <desc>Small municipal campground. Book through website. Grassy sites for tents and RV&#39;s.  Water and power at RV sites.  Dump station available.  Firewood for sale.  All sites have table and fire pit.  There are playgrounds and a small beach area on the pond.  Disc golf field.  Rates from $24 to $33 a night. Weekly rates available.    No wifi but strong cell signal.  Short walk to main street with shops and a few restaurants. Access to trails. Access off 4th Line Road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151698 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
