  <desc>Nice simple campground. Unserviced sites at $18night. Attendant comes at night to collect the fee.&#xA;Use sani dump in Gold River by the visitor centre. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 16:05:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151703 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
