  <ele>156.0380859375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wiarton overnight parking</name>
  <desc>Big parking, a lot of space BUT Pay attention to all signs… So you can stay between the two signs « overnight permitted » but it’s very small, and there are always cars parked.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151919 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
