 <wpt lat="53.609942" lon="-115.600584">
  <ele>811.2030029296875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nojack PRA</name>
  <desc>This is a PRA just off the highway. It is $20/night (self-registration), with toilets, garbage/recycling and a fresh water pump. All sites are unserviced. Very clean and tidy with good cell service.&#xA;&#xA;If you don&#39;t mind dealing with the noise from the highway, it&#39;s a bit of a hidden gem and you&#39;ll likely have a huge area to yourself.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/151953 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
