 <wpt lat="50.458230" lon="-119.367470">
  <ele>461.07331873476505</ele>
  <time>2024-03-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tim’s by the River Campsite</name>
  <desc>Privately run campground, no reservations, only first-come first-.served. I’m here on a sunny Saturday in June and no one else is here. Call him to check availability 250 379 2379. $30/night CASH/E-transfer, large, private unserviced sites and a shower on the property. $1. For 7 mins. Mid June and it’s pretty mosquito-y. Bring your citronella candles! No wifi but I have two bars of LTE with Bell network.&#xA;&#xA;Close to the highway but in site 30 the river drowns out the highway (mostly). Tim is super friendly! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152019 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
