 <wpt lat="45.383743" lon="-62.678666">
  <ele>82.3</ele>
  <time>2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Black Lake</name>
  <desc>This is a small site off the dirt road, just before the bridge that crosses the lakes exit stream. It’s big enough for 2 medium sized outlanding vehicles, However it can be accessed and used by SUV, cars, trucks and vans. The little road into the site can be a little bumpy. Enough room for 1 vehicle if planning on using some space for a large tent. It has lake access right to the water and you can easily load a small aluminum boat or kayaks into the lake. This lake contains Pickerel fish species. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152080 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
