 <wpt lat="50.097205" lon="-123.114123">
  <ele>671.9680000345884</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest </name>
  <desc>Very private spot in forest with space for roughly two to three cars. Fire pit and water stream nearby. It&#39;s just off the side of a forest service road which doesn&#39;t have too many pot holes.  Wouldn&#39;t recommend pets as this is an area with lots of bear activity.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152083 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
