 <wpt lat="43.719255" lon="-65.141326">
  <ele>-1.376888739876449</ele>
  <time>2022-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chrurch Road, dead end</name>
  <desc>The end of Chruch Road near Lockeport, NS. Very quiet spot at the end of a single lane road. No houses visible nearby.  Beautiful sheltered saltwater cove. Very nice view. Several islands just off shore. Small turning area would make it difficult for big rigs to turn. High clearance not required. Note: this is a salt water Marsh area and as such mosquitoes could be an issue.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
