 <wpt lat="51.501421" lon="-106.262787">
  <ele>598.370361328125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bonnington Springs </name>
  <desc>A fairly big, town owned and managed, campground. Nicely treed. Spacious sites. A path to the Springs. &#xA;&#xA;But, on this date, the grass isn&#39;t cut, the showers don&#39;t work, and there&#39;s a recent advisory about the potable water.&#xA;&#xA;That could all change but its proximity to the busy highway can not. Also, the &#34;springs&#34; underwhelm - water from a PVC pipe feeding a bog, as far as we can tell.&#xA;&#xA;Still, a quiet night - the traffic noise didn&#39;t bother us.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 540.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
