 <wpt lat="50.776310" lon="-121.587500">
  <ele>958.175919067883</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dirt road</name>
  <desc>Don&#39;t trust google maps with the duration of your drive here, it&#39;s much much faster (same with the other spots for which you have to drive on the Upper Hat Creek Rd).&#xA;&#xA;Super quiet spot with nothing around except for dry grass and some trees so prefect for a hammock. Barely any mosquitos, some bees and birds in the morning. Definitely recommend ground clearance and wouldn&#39;t do it if it just rained. To get to this spot you gotta take the Upper Hat Creek Rd and turn left onto a dirt road at some point. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152233 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
