  <desc>Campground next to the lake dam, at the trailhead for Mont du Lac à l&#39;Empêche. There is no actual designated sites, but you can pitch your tent wherever or sleep in your van.&#xA;&#xA;Access fee to the zec is 10$/vehicule/day and camping is 9$/night &#xA;&#xA;pretty pretty place, quiet&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
