 <wpt lat="50.760230" lon="-119.167250">
  <ele>1110.533203125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>we attempted to make it to the next pin but the roads began getting pretty rough and washed out. the last 500m before reaching this pin weren&#39;t easy. recommend 4x4, even when dry. we made it but our Ford transit worked pretty hard. amazing view at the site but not very level. leveling blocks are definitely a good idea. great cell coverage. plenty of solar (no shade). lots of biking trails.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152639 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
