 <wpt lat="52.621810" lon="-114.039590">
  <ele>901.2320027242724</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gull Lake </name>
  <desc>such a refreshing and quiet (yet wonderfully wild-sounding) spot to camp out and swim/float on the lake with absolutely nobody around. a gem of a hidden nook. just a few muddy potholes to ease around in order to get here, but more than worth it for sure.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152672 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
