  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeshore Drive</name>
  <desc>I&#39;ve stayed here numerous times over the years, without being bothered once. never stay more than a night in a row.  3-5 minute walk to the sandy beach (outdoor showers and toilets available). Parallel parking.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
