  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marina Kitchissipi</name>
  <desc>I&#39;ve been sleeping there for 3 nights and haven&#39;t had any problems. There are no signs that say you can&#39;t. I often see RVs spending the night.&#xA;&#xA;Ça fait 3 nuits que je dors là et je n&#39;ai eu aucun problèmes. Il n&#39;y a pas de pancartes qui dit qu&#39;on ne peut pas. Je vois souvent des VRs passer la nuit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
