  <ele>186.6607666015625</ele>
  <time>2023-12-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mazukama Falls Trailhead </name>
  <desc>Large dirt parking lot across from trailhead. Just a few hundred meters off the highway, parking lot alongside a dirt/logging road. No &#39;no overnight parking&#39; signs, hard to believe anyone would bother you here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152821 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
