  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wawa Boat Launch</name>
  <desc>Great little spot to the right of the boat launch when facing the water. There is a trail the locals use through the bushes so don&#39;t be surprised to see someone walking up. Tried fishing but no luck. Great little town with everything you need in walking distance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152903 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
