  <ele>1291.7662353515625</ele>
  <time>2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Damer Lake Rec Sites</name>
  <desc>small drive in rec sites on a small mountain lake. There are two picnic tables and 3 areas that are rather level for camping. I am here with a 29&#39; Class C motorhome.&#xA;&#xA;road up is narrow and rough but worth the drive. &#xA;&#xA;Rogers cell service is good. Telus doesn&#39;t seem to work for anyone out here. &#xA;&#xA;there are plenty of other spots to walk and set up tents.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152927 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
