 <wpt lat="50.255043" lon="-116.950098">
  <ele>620.6737060546875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Duncan Dam Viewpoint</name>
  <desc>Dam viewpoint, lots of room and some level spots up top. Outhouses. No signs saying you can&#39;t camp. When you reach the first parking lot view point, continue up the smaller road at the end to the next view point. This second road is a bit narrow with low trees for big rigs, but up to the first parking is fine for big rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
