  <ele>849.0921548902988</ele>
  <time>2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near highway</name>
  <desc>Rest stop. Really nice wide spot to pull over and enjoy the river. Some garbage bins, no toilets that we could see. The road is super curvy and a lot of accidents happen on this road. Lots of soft shoulders, and elk in the area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/152976 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
