 <wpt lat="50.443850" lon="-96.575827">
  <ele>194.82574462890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaconia Beach</name>
  <desc>Large grass parking area with a bit of shade on one side. The beach (Lake Winnipeg) is approx 100 yards from the parking area. Be aware it is a nude beach. There are many regulars who come for the day, but they usually walk far down the beach. (Turn left from the parking lot.) FYI, there may be some action going on in the bushes at the far end, mostly a gay hangout. May not be the place for a family outing. Very quiet here right now, just chilling by my van.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153050 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
