  <name>Dry William Lake</name>
  <desc>Grassy area big enough for 2 smaller rigs. Not suitable for an RV due to rough road on the way in. Approx 400 metres off highway right on the water. No services. A little highway noise in the distance. Nice for 1 night and beats the Rest Area on the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153071 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
