 <wpt lat="49.320270" lon="-115.245502">
  <ele>835.6001218669116</ele>
  <time>2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Suzanne Lake Campgrounds</name>
  <desc>Free camping with around 10 spots right on the beautiful Suzanne lake.&#xA;Awesome spot to swim, canoe and fish.&#xA;It was very busy on the weekend that we were here but we returned during the middle of the week and it was deserted.&#xA;Drop toilets at the campsite and a small boat launch and jetty.&#xA;It would be a tight squeeze for some big rigs but most caravans and smaller motor homes will make it in no problem. The dirt road into the lake is in good condition&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153229 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
