  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>B &amp; K Powerlines - Parking</name>
  <desc>Parking for bike trails. It&#39;s gravel/clay. There is room for several tents or vehicles. it&#39;s perfect for troubleshooting. no &#39;no parking&#39; signs &#xA;&#xA;There’s a small river just down a short 10m path, good for rinsing off, not deep enough to swim &#xA;.....&#xA;Stationnement pour les trails de vélo. C&#39;est en gravel / terre battue. Il y a de la place pour plusieurs tentes ou véhicule. c&#39;est parfait pour dépanner. aucune pancartes de non parking &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153264 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
