  <ele>484.22210817039013</ele>
  <time>2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Logging road</name>
  <desc>The logging road to the west is way too rough for my loaded down touring bike and the canoe launch just to the east is not suitable for throwing down my tent, very boggy or too many rocks. I saw this road between those two sites. Much better road and several good level spots for my tent.  Pretty flowers too!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153265 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
