  <ele>711.7080228123814</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte routière Chartierville</name>
  <desc>The place was suggested by local authorities. Up a hill with a view on one of the tallest mountain in the area. Close to the US border. Stayed one night. Not much traffic on the nearby road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
