  <ele>94.77458078946776</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shawinigan Parc des Chutes </name>
  <desc>There are 4 parking lots free for 24 hours. S-159, S-160 and so on. Dogs are not allowed in the park.&#xA;&#xA;This seems to be a noisy place though as sometimes young people come at night and make noisy stuff...&#xA;&#xA;The waterfalls are a nice thing to see.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153523 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
