  <name>Lynx Creek</name>
  <desc>Approximately 300 meters past Lynx Creek bridge going north right hand side of road, gravel road leading down to Peace river there is a wide flat gravel area. We parked 10 meter from Peace river, very quiet, can just hear hwy, deer tracks, two beavers, lots of birds, very nice.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
