  <desc>This is a tree free space just off the road leading up to the paragliding platform. No view from here, but it is a bit more private.&#xA;Fire ring, but be aware of fire restrictions in summer.&#xA;Cell service available. no other facilities. road is in good condition, no 4x4 or high clearance needed. Good 4G coverage on Telus.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
