 <wpt lat="48.069495" lon="-66.367927">
  <ele>4.6</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boat ramp area</name>
  <desc>place for 2 RV on pebbles, facing the water, next to a pier in a small bay. no prohibition sign. campfire area. quiet place but some urban rodeos nearby!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153635 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
