 <wpt lat="45.871993" lon="-70.983542">
  <ele>332.3246483245849</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 17:35:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte routière de Courcelles</name>
  <desc>Nice parking space near a river and a log dam.  Free wifi, very clean toilet with drinking water.  Walking path on the site.  No indication of an overnight parking ban.  We slept there and the location is very quiet.  There is a flour-making museum in this old mill across the street.  Electronic terminal also available. &#xA;&#xA;Bel espace de stationnement aménagé près d’une rivière et d’un barrage en billots. Wifi gratuit, toilette très propre avec eau potable. Sentier de marche à même le site. Aucune indication d’interdiction de stationnement pour la nuit. Nous y avons dormi et l’emplacement est bien calme. Il y a un musé sur la fabrication de la farine dans cet ancien moulin de l’autre côté de la rue. Borne électronique également disponible. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 17:35:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="45.134729" lon="-67.111986">
  <ele>27.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Île-Sainte-Croix</name>
  <desc>Beautiful parking a few minutes away from downtown, no &#34;no parking&#34; signs, we slept there 2 nights and were alone, bathrooms are available during the day. I recommend to take a walk around the site. You can see the ocean !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153658 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
