 <wpt lat="44.892870" lon="-66.958410">
  <ele>4.6</ele>
  <time>2023-06-21 20:00:28 UTC</time>
  <name>Ferry landing area</name>
  <desc>I stayed here a couple of nights, small dirt lot near where ferry lands. The nights I stayed here were nights the ferry wasn’t running so no one even noticed I was there. Once ferry runs daily again, that might be different. Island seems pretty laid back about things, though. Nice to be right on water, looking across to Maine. Great sunsets.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-21 20:00:28 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153663 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
