  <ele>21.000719327976984</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>YMCA</name>
  <desc>Ask front desk.... access to clean showers, water to refill your water bottles, bathrooms, gym, pool (no credit card information was given, just our personal information). &#xA;&#xA;Free.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153690 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
