  <ele>6.693910121917725</ele>
  <time>2023-10-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Traverse Blanc Sablon. </name>
  <desc>Nice spot near the wharf waterfront. Nice view on the ferry. See pics. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
