 <wpt lat="50.684158" lon="-112.172294">
  <ele>782.1183183290434</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trans Canada Hwy Twinning Monument and Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Rest area with washrooms, electricity, no wifi, running water, picnic tables, pet friendly. We stopped here for supper and set up camp afterwards (2 cars, 1 tent, 1 hammock). A few other cars and trucks arrived later in the evening to sleep here too. Relatively quiet spot. Around 8 am it started getting a little busy, some trucks came here to dump water. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153745 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
