  <desc>Classic Walmart overnight parking. lots of road noise and kids meet in the parking lot to show off their cars. No signs in parking lot. Convenient for resupply.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 13:19:22 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153776 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
