 <wpt lat="49.940220" lon="-124.646774">
  <ele>96.77322007511252</ele>
  <time>2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Base of Garibaldi Lookout</name>
  <desc>Just 30 seconds down the spur at the trailhead of Garabaldi Lookout/Sunshine coast trail on Southview road there is a little pull-out loop with a few spaces to pull in. Old campfire from previous campers and a pit toilet meant for hikers. Creek nearby for water. Might get busy in the summer but pretty quiet on a Sunday in April. Be respectful and don’t leave a mess! Lots of bears/cougars in the area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153803 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
