  <ele>734.47021484375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burnell Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Nice camp by a pretty lake with several spots in the trees, with tables and fire rings. If you want open space with clear sky for solar, there is one good spot right by the water. Long-drop toilets. Trail is a bit rough towards the end but no problem for overlanding vehicles. Free.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153813 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
