  <ele>352.3898250358179</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Okanagan Provincial Park South</name>
  <desc>Very nice place. Beautiful mountain views and nice beach. Lake is very rocky, recommend water shoes. Toilets and hot showers. $35 / night summer - $13 / night winter. Quiet place since it’s below the highway - currently non-potable water only (boil advisory)&#xA;Cellular coverage&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/153997 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
