  <ele>552.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>western parking</name>
  <desc>This is a huge gravel parking that spreads behind a motel6 a best western. Trucks use it as well. No signage at all.&#xA;An this little town in SK wouldnt mine for rigs boondocking for a night. Excellent cell signal.&#xA;No services but theres a KFC / pizzahut real close. &#xA;Worked great for us!&#xA;Safe travels &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
