  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canadian Tire parking lot</name>
  <desc>Stayed one night. No “no overnight” signs and no one bothered us as well. Other cars and one trailer were also there for the night. Wi-Fi was working until 11pm. &#xA;Tried to use washroom at Circle K, but even shopping there, staff was rude by saying that there wasn’t a public washroom. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154022 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
