  <desc>Shower at the harbor right next to the ferry terminal. You can get the code at the visitor center for 5.25 dollars. There is no time limit and no users limit. Closed with visitor center which is 5pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154041 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
