  <time>2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>It’s a provincial campground, but you don’t need to camp here to take free and hot shower. I asked at the gatehouse and they gave me the map to find the shower rooms. All staff I talked to were super friendly! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
