 <wpt lat="54.383003" lon="-128.531172">
  <ele>113.93163753673434</ele>
  <time>2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakelse lake campground</name>
  <desc>Paid $28 for a large clean, private site with picnic table. There are pit toilets and potable water taps scattered throughout the campground. Hot showers and flush toilets are in the washrooms, included in the price. The lake next to the campground has a swimming beach, picnic tables, showers and change rooms. It’s a lovely place and better than the RV sites in town. There is a sewage dump for an extra fee.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154084 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
