  <name>Rest area</name>
  <desc>Old rest area along a dead end section of the old trans canada highway. There are no facilities here any longer but quiet and has a partial view of Saint John river. Large enough for any rv to turn around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154114 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
