  <desc>Small free rec site. 5 established sites with picnic tables, fire pits. Pit toilet.  Nice beach on Campbell Lake. Good for swimming. Kayaking.&#xA;The first site on the right is very private.&#xA;The other 4 on your left are next to each other.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154125 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
