  <desc>Off the beaten path, just a few Km from the 138, if you want peace, this is the place. Got there around 5 pm, minimum flies, saw only 1 car pass by in the next 12hrs. We saw more places to stop before this place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154175 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
