  <name>Foremost Wayside Campsite</name>
  <desc>A self registration campsite. $10 per night for no hook up/tenting/parking - up to $30 for full hook up. &#xA;Every site has power, water and waste dump.&#xA;Large sites with picnic tables at each site. &#xA;One female and one male toilet and shower. Clean and freshly painted. &#xA;Stays up to 6 months available - need to organise long stays with someone in town. &#xA;&#xA;Sanidump and drinking water also available here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154200 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
