  <ele>-11.46820068359375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sea Shack - Auberge Festive</name>
  <desc>backpacker hostel by the St-Lawrence River.&#xA;great spot for a 2 days stop (can&#39;t stay more than 2 nights). Free showers, kayaks, SUP, music shows and many more activities.&#xA;Spectacular view. Not the place if you want a quiet stay..&#xA;you can reserve on their website: https://www.aubergefestive.com/&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154277 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
