  <name>Madawaska River </name>
  <desc>Amazing spot on the Madawaska River, a little tricky to get in, high clearance and 4x4 are not a bad idea, the road to get there is extremely bumpy and there were some large puddles along the way. We made it in a 2wd Ford e250 without any issues. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154306 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
