  <desc>A little turnoff of hwy 17 between  Schreiber and Thunder Bay. Safe spot to park your car and lot&#39;s of space to set up your tent along the sandy beach area. An RV or two can fit on the side of the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154325 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
