  <time>2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McLean Campground and Store</name>
  <desc>Perfect place! We have the site A19 and it was a fantastic spot, 2 minutes by walk to the the camp store where you can find shower (3$/5 minutes). Big trees everywhere, site with privacy. We highly recommend this campground.&#xA;5 minutes from the bike trails.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
