  <desc>There is a campground here (paid) but you can park in the day use area for free and use the (supervised) beach and washrooms, and there is one private stall in the washroom building for a shower. Felt great, private, and was totally free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154448 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
