  <ele>1148.3214682526886</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Muskeg river</name>
  <desc>The perfect rest stop along the river. Large enough for any rig - and relatively private. There is designated fire pits along the river. We stayed here for a night, there were a few trailers set up here as well. &#xA;&#xA;No facilities, but minimal road noise. Perfect for a one or two night stay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154455 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
