 <wpt lat="50.641650" lon="-117.542613">
  <ele>710.565673828125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trout Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>On the north end of Trout Lake take Lardeau St off West Side Rd at end of lake. Beach camping, sani dump and toilet. No other facilities. Suggested donation $10 night to Trout Lake Community fund. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154459 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
