 <wpt lat="46.366522" lon="-74.818972">
  <ele>210.69732666015625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>P&#39;tit Train du Nord</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay at night. There is lots of space, tables and a toilet a few meters away when you cross the road. Can be a little noisy at night since it&#39;s just beside the highway but I had no problem sleeping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
