 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.193104" lon="-119.173309">
  <ele>980.624896149151</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Corner camp with views </name>
  <desc>Large, flat lay-by at the side of the track with a couple of fire rings. Very nice views down to the valley below. Room for several vehicles. Peaceful night. Nice place for a quiet weeknight out of season, but would probably be horribly dusty on busy weekends with cars/quads/bikes driving past and kicking up dust clouds as they head up to the hills and lakes. No facilities. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154565 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
