 <wpt lat="49.523590" lon="-115.756079">
  <ele>898.1604899344966</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 11:30:30 UTC</time>
  <name>suds and duds</name>
  <desc>Bit old fashioned but clean and plenty of machines. No cards, cash only. Desk will change notes to quarters and loonies if you need change. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 11:30:30 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154569 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
