 <wpt lat="50.100790" lon="-115.534050">
  <ele>1340.703350149095</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest Service Road</name>
  <desc>A large open flat area at the end of the trail just 400m off the main FSR. Totally hidden from the road, very peaceful, no noise of cars passing down the FSR. Wonderful views of all the surrounding mountain peaks.  Space for several vehicles. Fire ring, otherwise no facilities. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
