  <ele>128.49999809265137</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Le panoramique - vélo de montagne</name>
  <desc>Mountain bike center. Free drinking water filling station.&#xA;&#xA;***************************************&#xA;&#xA;Centre de vélo de montagne. Station de remplissage d’eau potable gratuite &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154615 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
