  <ele>555.699951171875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yellowhead Hwy. Foam Lake</name>
  <desc>As described in the other posts. 4 dry toilets cleaned twice a week. There is toilet paper&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154624 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
