 <wpt lat="49.476225" lon="-120.482941">
  <ele>657.6054498696669</ele>
  <time>2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Princeton Castle Resort</name>
  <desc>Well maintained RV, tent and cabins. Friendly staff. A surprise on our journey on The Great Trial. $30 per tent/RV site with power, water and clean toilets and showers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154632 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
