 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.050676" lon="-117.456028">
  <ele>553.3730869293213</ele>
  <time>2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wragge Beach Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free - approx 20 sites for vehicles and 10 sites for tents only. Picnic tables, fire rings, beach and pit toilets. &#xA;14 day maximum stay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154642 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
