 <wpt lat="45.942970" lon="-74.545100">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc des Stations Montcalm</name>
  <desc>Spent one night here while biking the corridor aerobique. &#xA;I had messaged the town and they said I could park overnight at the Parc des Stations.&#xA;I stayed one night in my RAM Promaster and had no problems. Nice and quiet. &#xA;It will only fit a vehicle that can park in a regular spot, so no big rigs.  There are flush toilets at the rest stop not too far from here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154688 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
