 <wpt lat="46.011190" lon="-74.764270">
  <ele>175.1009521484375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Amherst</name>
  <desc>Spent one night here while biking the corridor aerobique. I had messaged the town previously and they said it is allowed to park at this spot overnight (278 McLaughlin). It was nice and quiet, no problems. At the rest stop down the road there are bathrooms with flush toilets and you can fill up your water as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154692 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
