 <wpt lat="51.037495" lon="-114.010739">
  <ele>1039.041384080425</ele>
  <time>2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dog Park</name>
  <desc>Medium-sized gravelled parking lot near the river. No sign prohibiting overnight parking. We stayed there 2 days during Stampede and no one came bothering us. A bit noisy because of the road nearby but ok for a free spot in Calgary. Downtown is 15min by bike.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
