  <desc>A lot of machines. Not the cleanest that have seen, but it&#39;s not to bad. Machines are out of order and sonetimes w/o even advicing it. 3$ wash 1 $ dry (16 min). There&#39;s a toilet inside.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154885 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
