  <ele>20.451168754138052</ele>
  <time>2022-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quai de Rivière-Pentecóte</name>
  <desc>Possibility to sleep a night or two, at the foot of the church. This is an old name abandon campground near the wharf. Parking without service. The view of the sea, bordered by sand dunes, is absolutely splendid.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154976 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
