  <ele>176.39572656023785</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Turkey Point Provincial Campground</name>
  <desc>Established Provincial Campground that has free day use Monday thru Thursday including showers, laundromat, water (and sani-dump, apparently).  Day use also gives access to the very nice beach for swimming.  We booked ahead for day use (no charge) but walkins maybe OK.  There is a charge for weekend day use and overnight camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/154986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
