  <ele>-7.950340815383317</ele>
  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fit4Less</name>
  <desc>One of the few gyms offering drop-in passes with showers.&#xA;$20 day pass for non-members.&#xA;Purchase your pass from the kiosk at the front which gives you an access card to enter. bathrooms, change rooms and showers are all separate and private. not a lot of space in the shower rooms. the gym is very clean though with tons of equipment.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155006 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
