  <ele>1044.377433902584</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mineral Lake</name>
  <desc>Right beside Mineral Lake towards the end of it. About 8 minutes drive on a dirt road/ single lane off road and you will see a left turn cul-de-sac for people to U turn. I parked to extreme right to not block the road and put a rock on one tire to level it. Locals probably camp here or hang out here during the day. Quiet and perfect for wild camping. Clean lake to swim but mosquitoes at night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155145 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
