  <ele>1698.9709395430982</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Creekside camp</name>
  <desc>Off gravel road on the way to Coleman. Right before #12 forest road. Very quiet and reasonably flat ground that could fit up to 4 RVs. No reception but it’s beautiful view behind it with creek. Great for stargazing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155146 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
