  <time>2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Galeries Mont-Joli</name>
  <desc>Overnight stay accepted for 24h max. Arrive after 12PM, leave before 12PM next day.&#xA;Close to Tim Hortons (24h). Drive-thru only, grocery, gas station. Toilets available at shopping mall (during opening hours) . &#xA;.....&#xA;Stationnement accepté pour la nuit. 24h max. Arriver après midi, partir avant midi. Toilettes disponibles centre commercial (heures d&#39;ouverture). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155155 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
