  <desc>Gravel pull out next to North lake. Occasional cars passing. Shady and right next to North lake. Couple water access spots too. No signs, stayed one night without being bothered. Please take care of this place so it doesn’t get taken away. 2 bars of LTE with Telus. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155190 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
