  <name>Sand pit</name>
  <desc>It’s a open space you can park quiet fiew vans . It’s close to the road but nobody can see you from it . It’s on a quad path so maybe you will see some people passing by , for myself I’ve stayed a Saturday night and nobody came. One bar of service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155292 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
