  <name>South Side Laundry and Dry Cleaning</name>
  <desc>Laundromat in Medicine Hat. Super clean, tons of machines, change machine, washroom, and free and fast wifi. Really nice spot to do laundry and use the internet while you wait! Cost 7$ for the big washing machine and 0.25c for 4 min. dryer machine. Very friendly employee. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
