  <time>2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oceanside RV Park</name>
  <desc>Rv Park operated by the United Towns Lions Club is situated before Port au Choix. The view is nice. &#xA;26 places with electrical hookups, water and dumping station. Fireplace (free wood on the shores :)&#xA;Any kind of RV can park. &#xA;Tent places available with hot shower and toilet. &#xA;With service : 35$ - Without : $20&#xA;&#xA;Wifi available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155303 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
