  <ele>21.846759157423925</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Église de St-Jean</name>
  <desc>As described, large church paved parking lot by the water and grave yard. Sign clearly says you can stay here and suggests donation to help with upkeep. Toilets are across the street at the side of a small building to the left. There is a sign “Toilettes” on the side of the building. They are flush toilets with cold not potable water sinks. Clean with soap TO and paper towels. The box for donations is on the wall by the front door of the church. We stayed one night, very quiet as the road is not busy&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155304 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
