  <name>Tiger Dunlop Road</name>
  <desc>The Tiger Dunlop trail is a stunning trail and path way. Slept overnight. It was quiet and secluded off the road spot to rest camp and picnic. No portable toilet. But you can get privacy. &#xA;&#xA;Great tuck away off hwy 21 it’s called tiger Dunlop road no services but it’s a quite place to park overnight. Beautiful trail with access from here. No one bothered us overnight quite spot to picnic and sleep.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155423 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
