 <wpt lat="49.150583" lon="-122.007003">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Otter Co-Op - Chilliwack</name>
  <desc>Overnight Parking, No Time Limit, Free Showers w Co-Op Cardlock Membership, Flushable Toilets, Convenience Store //&#xA;&#xA;Otter Co-Op is located within Chilliwack, British Columbia at 44046 Progress Way. This site is frequented by long-haul truck drivers (so you might hear diesel engines running throughout the night), and is unfortunately located nearby train tracks. However, you will not be disturbed while crashing here. There is ample space for isolated parking, there’s a variety of friendly truckers nearby, and this site is not monitored by security. An ideal location for car-camping or for parking your travel trailer/rv if you’re needing somewhere to settle down for the night. If you have a Co-Op Cardlock membership you will have 24/7 access to endless free showers, a running sink, a flushable toilet, and a telephone. &#xA;&#xA;If you do not have a Co-Op Cardlock membership you can access the amenities during the convenience store hours (listed on their website) by asking the friendly staff and even grab some goodies for the road while you’re there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
