  <desc>Free camping at Bulk Lake Recreation Site. The camping is about 8km from the highway. It is a dirt road for almost half of the way. The camp site has tables, pit toilets and a boat ramp. Great phone reception, and free wifi at the rest stop. Really beautiful and quiet by the lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155521 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
