  <name>Tete Jaune Spawning Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Quiet private site.   Two camp sites in on single area.  One picnic table and two fire pits. The trail in is a little tight for my rv which is an old ambulance, but doable, if you are not too worried about willows running down the side of your rig. Definitely not suitable for large rvs.  A 20ft trailer could be turned around in here but it would be tight.  Access to the water but it&#39;s not great.  No toilets.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 09:57:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155683 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
