 <wpt lat="49.527965" lon="-54.747186">
  <ele>11.329111897058052</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dildo Run Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>More than 50 places for any kind of RV/tent. Quite busy during summer. Some places are next to the sea. Pit fire and picnic table for every spot. Shower, laundromat (1.5$ cool washing), dump station, potable water, wood shop.&#xA;We paid 21$ for RV under 20Ft w/o service. Can be also booked on internet. Weak cell/data but there is wifi at check-in cabin.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155774 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
