  <ele>616.3957138061523</ele>
  <time>2022-09-02 22:16:59 UTC</time>
  <name>Lashburn Town and Country Golf Club</name>
  <desc>Great little site, super quiet right on golf course. 24 Powered sites, 15 or 30amp. showers and flush toilets. Food served in country club till 8pm. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-02 22:16:59 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155781 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
