  <ele>7.578545329160988</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>First Choice Convenience </name>
  <desc>A small laundromat in a convenience store. $2.00 per wash and $2.00 per dry. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155818 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
