 <wpt lat="45.496524" lon="-65.192971">
  <ele>12.61717811319977</ele>
  <time>2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach campsites</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot on the water. Tents ideal, it’s rocky coming down, 4x4 recommended. Cell service is just okay!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155871 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
