 <wpt lat="44.872380" lon="-63.220720">
  <ele>21.271132132038474</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old Roadway Musquodoboit River</name>
  <desc>Old roadway beside newer bridge on either side of the River. South side has a turnaround, North side not so much. Next to road but pretty quiet. River access, firepit&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155883 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
