 <wpt lat="49.462605" lon="-99.871389">
  <ele>380.8402099609375</ele>
  <time>2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Souris Bend Equestrian Trails</name>
  <desc>This is possibly the best site I&#39;ve visited across Canada. I&#39;m not sure I should even share for fear it gets ruined.&#xA;On Wildlife Management Area land, local volunteers have developed a number of equestrian trails and campsites. &#xA;This is on a ridge overlooking the Souris River. &#xA;No facilities, except what may be a pit toilet, minimal phone service.&#xA;Not suitable for any large vehicles/trailers, small camper or tent only.&#xA;An absolute gem of rural Manitoba. Keep it that way!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155904 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
