 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="46.983954" lon="-70.562540">
  <ele>4.71697998046875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stationnement de l’Aréna</name>
  <desc>The municipality is allowing RVs to park for up to 48hrs in the arena parking lot. There are designated parking spots on the outskirts of the lot and McDonald&#39;s, Tim Hortons, several restaurants and a gas station with laundry are all walking distance. No generators are permitted, dogs must be on leash and picked up after. &#xA;Wifi is accessible at Banque Nationale, 5 minutes walk west on the same street as the arena.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155908 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="48.462589" lon="-67.432934">
  <ele>162.58109959942323</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot at Town Hall</name>
  <desc>There is a place reserved for tents and RVs at the back of the parking lot. 1 place for 1 large RV or several regular places for 20ft and less. It is very important to stand in the designated space so as not to harm parking lot users.&#xA;&#xA;Near a small river and a park with picnic tables.&#xA;&#xA;There are toilets when the building is open. A few street lights.&#xA;&#xA;You can use the generator between 8:00 and 10:00 and 17:00 and 20:00.&#xA;&#xA;Some regulations to follow.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Il y a une place réservée pour les tentes et les vr au fond du stationnement. 1 place pour 1 gros vr ou plusieurs places régulières pour les 20pi et moins. Très important de se placer dans l’espace désignée pour ne pas nuire aux usagés du stationnement. &#xA;&#xA;Près d’une petite rivière et d’un parc avec des tables à pique-nique.  &#xA;&#xA;Il y des toilettes quand le bâtiment est ouvert. Quelques lampadaires. &#xA;&#xA;On peut utiliser la génératrice entre 8h et 10h et 17h et20h. &#xA;&#xA;Quelques règlements à suivre. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155909 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
