 <wpt lat="49.182710" lon="-125.396590">
  <ele>67.72520848643035</ele>
  <time>2024-03-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel clearing</name>
  <desc>A nice big gravel clearing nestled in trees. It’s a small tiny pull off to the right (heading east) road widens up 50’ to a large clearing you could fit several cars/vans or a couple RVs. The Hwy is a tad loud but it’s a great spot to call it a night or two especially if your hanging at the river bluffs for a few days. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155929 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
