 <wpt lat="49.279649" lon="-125.149027">
  <ele>60.909201429225504</ele>
  <time>2023-11-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Safe delicious Natural water source </name>
  <desc>Delicious year round safe water to drink. Spoke with an older fella who lives here in the area and has been drinking it for 40 years. Pipe from the ground makes it easy to fill containers and jugs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
