 <wpt lat="45.512120" lon="-79.303932">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-02-11 13:18:14 UTC</time>
  <name>Almaguin Highlands Information Centre</name>
  <desc>Can stop here for 8 hours at a time to prevent highway fatigue, any of the 365 days a year. Closed right now due to Covid but they have refuse boxes, several portapotties, and a Picnic area (covered) also a path and doggie waste stations.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-11 13:18:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155933 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
