 <wpt lat="49.410824" lon="-105.869029">
  <ele>995.3</ele>
  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St. Victor Petroglyphs Provincial Historic Park</name>
  <desc>Amazing to find this in the Canadian prairies. Gravel/grass parking lot. We stayed at the top close to the glyphs that were a disappointment. What wasn’t disappointing was the views! The bottom parking lot has garbage, recycling and an outhouse. Top parking lot garbage and 2 LTE or 3 3G without booster. We were joined for breakfast by a bull :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
