  <ele>1040.3334225686267</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Range Rd 291 Bridge</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lots on either side of the single lane bridge. There are rock shores you can pull onto 4x4 required. Lots of trout fisherman here fly fishing. No services, 1 bar LTE. If you are a self efficient unit come enjoy the river, birds, and fishing.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155983 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
