 <wpt lat="48.786268" lon="-91.541996">
  <ele>356.4769800277427</ele>
  <time>2023-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rawn Reservoir Open Area</name>
  <desc>The site marked &#39;Rawn Reservoir&#39; is nice but small. This area is nearby doesn&#39;t have water view but is a much bigger, flat open area. Lots of room but it&#39;s a dirt track to reach here. No 4x4 required, it&#39;s an easy drive, OK for normal cars but might be a bit iffy for RVs with very low ground clearance. &#xA;No facilities. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155989 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
