  <ele>254.21918515861034</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wildcamp open area</name>
  <desc>Nothing special but a pleasant peaceful spot for a good night&#39;s sleep. A clearing in the trees at the side of the little-used trail. Flat area good for 2 or 3 vehicles if you are friends. Easy dirt track to get here, but there is a sign saying it&#39;s not maintained, so condition may deteriorate over time. No facilities. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/155990 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
