  <desc>Small rest area at the entry of Gold River Secondary school. 2 tables, 2 pits toilets, garbage bin, flat.&#xA;Small Trail going to the river but unmaintained. The trail the other side of the road is very unmaintained. &#xA;One night with no problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156011 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
