  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St-Marc-du-Lac-Long</name>
  <desc>Very huge and quiet place, back to a school and a church. Using as a special dump for large and no-biological materials. Close to school patinoire for kids. However, very, very clean.&#xA;No services at all., but village services 200 hundreds meters below this apart wild camping place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156022 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
