  <desc>Very large rest area, 50 meters apart the relatively passif zone, not heavy traffic. &#xA;With picnic tables and along a very nice creek. &#xA;No sign indicating “No overnight camping “. &#xA;We passed a very quiet night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
