  <ele>267.14641952529905</ele>
  <time>2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc François-Beaudoin</name>
  <desc>Two places to park and overnight camping: 1, near the road on the parking used for pick Nick. Tables available.&#xA;2- back , there is a large gravel parking . But the gravel road, 50 meters turn left down to branch to get down the isolated very large place to park overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Quite quiet.&#xA;&#xA;The second place down is the best for privacy and no noise. But the 1st is nicest.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156034 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
