  <desc>Rest area/dog park. Limited tables at the front. The road goes around the whole park and is more private in the back. No tables there. Nobody bothered me when I put up my tent in the late afternoon or early evening. Pit toilets available. Noisy right off the highway and trains running all night. Okay for one night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156146 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
