 <wpt lat="45.480588" lon="-65.524424">
  <ele>313.7483444213867</ele>
  <time>2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Theobald </name>
  <desc>Large Gravel parking in the forest giving access to the lake. Really quiet. Just 2 kayakers in early morning. The gravel road going to the site is ok, lots of rock, just go slowly.&#xA;.....&#xA;Grand parking de gravel donnant accès au lac. Tranquille, juste 2 kayak tôt le matin. La route de terre y allant est pas mal rocheuse, faut aller lentement.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156182 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
