  <ele>728.1458773604052</ele>
  <time>2023-09-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Field</name>
  <desc>Big spot between road and field.  Nice stop for one night.  Quiet at night. Looks like there used to be a gas station before but now only the co-op sign is left. Lot of space. Cell signal/data good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156192 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
