 <wpt lat="48.460370" lon="-123.498640">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-03-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>A&amp;W parking lot </name>
  <desc>We parked near the garbage bins for the night with no issues. We arrived just as the sun was setting and left by 7am. There were others staying overnight at the home depot and sleep country parking lots across the street. There is a 24/7 gas station across the street that was fine letting us use the facilities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156195 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
