 <wpt lat="49.032707" lon="-123.094099">
  <ele>7.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tsawwassen RV resort </name>
  <desc>The campground is mainly for RVs. Many sites have electric and water. Be sure to ask. Some sites are available for overnight stays. There is a pool and a playground. Right next to the resort is a water park and across the road is the shopping center. The campground is a 5-minute drive to the ferry. $52 for the one stayover. &#xA;Dogs are not allowed on some spots, so be sure to let them know if you have a dog.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156209 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
