  <ele>322.22652473207563</ele>
  <time>2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Elk River Trail</name>
  <desc>Trailhead of Elk River Trail (BC Parks). 10 km of hiking with two spots to camp along the trail. It’s a very popular multi-day hike. Large parking area, but busy all the time. Ok for one night in the parking area after a day hike&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
