  <ele>2.54213150792531</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>East Bay Sand Bar</name>
  <desc>Great spot for overnight camping otw to Halifax or into Cape Breton. Lots of fresh water from the lake, plenty of available spots with picnic tables, and fire pits. Steady traffic and people during the day but after 11 pm we were the only ones here. Had no issues overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156260 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
