 <wpt lat="48.892684" lon="-123.549060">
  <ele>45.77341783884913</ele>
  <time>2024-03-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St. Mary&#39;s Pull off</name>
  <desc>Drive down Tripp Rd and there are several pull offs where you can park. no trespassing signs at end of the road/turnaround&#xA;We ended up parking 3 rigs right on the road right against the water. People driving by have been slow and respectful. There is a trail to a dock towards the end of the road that people seem to be using to swim.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156274 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
