  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailhead</name>
  <desc>We stayed one night here after arriving on the last ferry to Nanaimo and one night before catching an early ferry home. The area was quiet with only a few vehicles driving by and people walking their dogs early in the morning. Cell reception was not so good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156327 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
