 <wpt lat="49.198236" lon="-119.851723">
  <ele>428.42474365234375</ele>
  <time>2023-11-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River Rd Pullouts</name>
  <desc>Nice and quiet for a 1 night stop over in Keremeos. Couple of smaller pullouts on River road with one larger, slightly more private pullout on south side of rd. Could fit 4-6 vehicles or 2 trailer/RV, depending on size. Largest pullout unfortunately has signs of garbage dumping. Limited cell reception at 1 bar with Telus/Public Mobile. &#xA;&#xA;Large pullout and north side pullout has morning sun. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156338 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
