  <ele>141.6973793994936</ele>
  <time>2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Loss Creek</name>
  <desc>Gravel area separated from road by trees perfect for multiple vans or big rigs. short walk to loss creek where it is possible to swim below the bridge. A nice fire pit down by the creek where it would be possible to set up a small tent under the trees.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156386 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
