  <time>2024-06-19 08:37:14 UTC</time>
  <name>Butts Pond </name>
  <desc>A small camping area 3km off the TCH, at Butts Pond. Camping area has room for several small rigs, and immediately beside the pond. No facilities of any kind. Located on Crown Land. Only about six or seven sites with half of them taken up by unattended &#34;long-termers&#34; so there is a fair chance you will not get a spot.  Cellular is available.  Beautiful spot!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 08:37:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156408 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
