 <wpt lat="49.290337" lon="-56.789544">
  <ele>105.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Birch Lake spring </name>
  <desc>50 m off the TCH, on a side road, a fresh water spring. Water is cold and clear. There is even a stand for placing a container and a shut off valve!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156409 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
