  <desc>$3 showers or $7.15 for a drop-in fee for the pool or gym (which includes showers). Didn’t have to schedule a time. Really friendly reception staff, clean facility &amp; private showers in the change room.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
