 <wpt lat="49.414000" lon="-54.857000">
  <ele>25.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Comfort Cove</name>
  <desc>Located at the end of the main road in the tiny community of Comfort Cove, adjacent to a hiking trail to the top of a lookout. There are pit toilets, picnic tables and ample parking for several small campers. Big rigs would have MUCH difficulty navigating the narrow road, and turning around would be impossible. In addition to the lookout there are stairs leading down to the ocean, where an additional picnic table is located. We met and chatted with some locals having lunch on the beach and felt very welcomed to the community. This is a VERY nice spot that we just stumbled upon it while exploring.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156568 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
