  <desc>Parking on the street is permitted, and there are places in the adjacent forest to put up a tent. I spent a peaceful night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156606 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
