 <wpt lat="52.193468" lon="-126.380194">
  <ele>958.2877987334914</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Purgatory glacier view rec site</name>
  <desc>End of the road , 2 picnic table n beautiful view on glacier. Room for 2 - 3 vehicle. pretty rough road  to get here,high clearance needed, 4x4 make it easier, lots of bushes on the  side if you worried about scratching  your car avoid coming  here. If you longer then 22 ft could b tricky . The last 8 km the worst after the Odegaard view point rec site. Not to many place to turn around or to let others cars pass. some nice lakes on the way up.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156658 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
