 <wpt lat="52.245510" lon="-126.306750">
  <ele>783.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Odegaard falls rec site</name>
  <desc>Parking along the road 2 or3 site, just below picnic table fire rings, 200 mt below one more picnic table on the river and fie ing bit mossy ) Beautiful view of waterfall, lots of blueberries. No reception. Long old logging road to get in . Not particularly bad , good clearance recommended . Take your time. Turn around with over 24 ft tricky. Last picture from end of the short river trail. Water source not on site but you cross lots of creeks driving up&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156659 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
