  <desc>Beautiful lakefront location. Very warm lake with boat launch. 4x4 or lifted SUV access (or very careful with another vehicle, depending on road conditions).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156665 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
