 <wpt lat="47.167983" lon="-52.888833">
  <ele>25.5</ele>
  <time>2022-09-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>La Manche provincial Park</name>
  <desc>As every provincial park: all facilities available. Washroom and showers, dump station, pit fire (in every place - wood can buy 10$), picnic tables, laundry (0.75$ wash and 0,75$ dry). No WiFi and no cellular. &#xA;Easy access to the lake. &#xA;Price : around 26$ with no service for a 19ft camper. 20$ for people over 65 years old for 21ft camper &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156688 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
