  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Raven&#39;s Nest Resort &amp; Campground</name>
  <desc>Beautiful, quiet, privately owned campground with unserviced sites only. Great cell service, showers, outhouses, dishwashing station, amazing views. Perfect for tent camping, large campsites. Good for RVs if you don&#39;t need hookups. Only 25 campsites in secluded area, uncrowded. Also offers off-grid log cabins with flush toilets, showers, kitchenette, BBQ&#39;s.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156756 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
