  <ele>245.543212890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out</name>
  <desc>On the view side of the road. No sign that says this is not allowed. Firepit and amazing sunset over the ocean.&#xA;No lights at night, the perfect spot to watch the stars. &#xA;There are cars passing on the road until maybe 9h PM. After that, no sound. 5G Verizon and 2 bars&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156772 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
