 <wpt lat="48.941992" lon="-54.724357">
  <ele>28.997056298884452</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Harbour</name>
  <desc>Little Habour &amp; boat launch&#xA;&#xA;Great place to swim and stay the night. Mostly rocky beach areas though. Have stayed here a few times over a few months during our stay in Gander. &#xA;&#xA;Don’t overstay your welcome and ruin it for everyone else. Don&#39;t litter, there is plenty of garbage around.  &#xA;&#xA;Far enough from highway that it’s peaceful at night. Sound of water and wind only. Very very windy for tent camping-  bring lots of tie-downs. &#xA;&#xA;2-3 bars of service&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156773 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
