  <ele>292.6094970703125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac 4H</name>
  <desc>small paking beside 4h lac.&#xA;pit toilet is discusting.&#xA;lac is good for swimming. &#xA;acessible by car or small van, not for big rig.&#xA;known place by locals&#xA;was very quiet during our stay, but there is a big fire pit so expect some company.&#xA;to get to this place, I used Google map with satellite view to see the road.&#xA;. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156843 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
