  <ele>77.8</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Queens Quay E/Lower Sherbourne</name>
  <desc>This is an exterior parking lot. 17$ from 6am to 6 pm. 5$ from 6pm to 6am&#xA;Close to highway. A bit noisy but practical because downtown.&#xA;&#xA;Spots are normal sized, but the back row on the lot has a grass area behind it, allowing you fit with larger vehicles as long as you back into the spot. We managed to park there without issues with a 25&#39; RV.&#xA;&#xA;Another guy parked across two parking spots and just bought two parking tickets.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156875 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
