  <desc>A tap with drinking water outside of the visitor center on a wall. I asked inside, the water is potable for sure. &#xA;Not suitable for RV filling unless you got a long hose.&#xA;Apparently the only one place in town right now where you can get free drinking water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
