  <name>King city on route</name>
  <desc>King city on route service area.&#xA;&#xA;Many business on site: Canadian tire gas station Starbucks Timhorton Burger King and so on.&#xA;&#xA;Just follow the picnic table sign, it will lead you to a large picnic area, separate from the truck parking area and business&#xA;&#xA;Many picnic tables and garbage bins on site and large grass area in the middle of the loop parking area&#xA;&#xA;Open from Victoria day weekend until thanks giving weekend &#xA;&#xA;See pictures &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/156904 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
