  <name>Amable du Fond River. D&amp;W stop.</name>
  <desc>Gravely/sandy look-out over Amable du Fond River. Right next to the road, leading to Kiosk Campground in Algonquin Provincial Park, but this spot is outside the park boundaries. Room enough for a few vans or a  large rig. Nice view of river, but no easy access to it, with about 30 feet down a steep slope. Only 1 sign present which says &#34; D&amp;W STOP. PLEASE KEEP CLEAN. THANK YOU&#34;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
