 <wpt lat="47.039935" lon="-84.586692">
  <ele>340.4185791015625</ele>
  <time>2023-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cedar lakes</name>
  <desc>Further up the logging road (carp road) is a nice little site on a lake! A bit of a swampy smell and not very level, but it&#39;s a really beautiful, private/isolated spot. Fire put established. Weak Roger&#39;s signal. The road in is very easy but the site isn&#39;t suitable for big rigs. A little bit steep heading into the site. &#xA;&#xA;I think there are plenty of other spots up ahead, and it&#39;s a great spit to explore considering how well the road is maintained.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157140 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
