 <wpt lat="50.425854" lon="-103.298530">
  <ele>585.80419921875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twilite Drive-in Theater</name>
  <desc>*Only open during movie nights.&#xA;......&#xA;Nice drive-in theater! The owners allow those who watch the movie to sleep on the lot for free, you only pay the movie ticket. We paid 20$ for two people. We slept in our tent on a grassy area (there are a lot of grass all around the lot). The owner let the toilets open for us, which was really nice of him. Not a lot of traffic so almost no noise. Gas station right across the highway. Not sure if they would allow RV, and there are no accommodations except for the toilet, so okay for one night but no more. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
