 <wpt lat="49.714611" lon="-116.907173">
  <ele>607.1142578125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside pullout</name>
  <desc>A large, level gravel pullout on the east side of the road with a beautiful view but no easy lake access as you&#39;re about 100 feet above the lake. Room for a couple RVs. No signage and almost no traffic after dark (but quite busy during the day) Great for an overnighter. Be bear aware and please don&#39;t leave garbage behind. No toilets. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157238 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
