  <desc>Beautiful rock flats beach. Surrender by magical view. Ocean and could see Anticosti Island. You can drive to this point.  There is a sign to keep the place clean. I have talked with a resident nearby and it is permitted to camp overnight. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157240 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
