  <time>2023-09-20 09:52:53 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaver Creek Provincial Park Campground </name>
  <desc>20 gravels sites along the Columbia river in Trail. Some are closer to the river then others. 25$ a night. Boat launch into the river. Small rocky beach. 2 outhouses. Shower and flush toilets at the entrance but was locked. Have to get key from caretakers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 09:52:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157392 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
