 <wpt lat="51.459350" lon="-112.707580">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Freson Bros.</name>
  <desc>Large grocery store parking lot. There were too many noisy people at the Walmart lot so I moved to this location just up the road told to me by a local. Called and was told it was okay to park for the night at the south end of the lot. &#xA;&#xA;Beware of seagulls LOL. They landed on the roof of my van in the morning and startled me! Just check the ground for where they congregate and park a distance away.&#xA;&#xA;Save yourself some cooking and get a freshly cooked meal at their takeout kitchen.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
