 <wpt lat="46.697210" lon="-71.300030">
  <ele>79.71214450336993</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area Chaudière-Appalaches</name>
  <desc>Eastbound Hwy 20 rest area just before Quebec City. Big rig and transport parking. WiFi close to pavilion, washrooms, tourism office, lunchroom with vending machines inside. Can overnight but don&#39;t use slides if they overhang parking slots. Smaller rigs (class C or camper van) could park in car park. Busy during the day and transport trucks frequently pulling in and out, so can be a bit noisy. Potentially only 8 hour stay limit (very busy in daytime).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157424 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
