  <time>2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Along the bicycles road</name>
  <desc>A several parking places along the bicycle roads (5 parking in differents towns. This one is the first when you come from Quebec City). &#xA;Picnic table, pit toilets, garbage. Shops (bakery) near the parking. &#xA;A bit noisy because just next to the main road (2x2)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
