  <desc>RV parking (4 RV maximum) 48h max in front of 138 Riad.&#xA;&#xA;MODERATOR NOTE. &#xA;According to picture uploaded by user, following rues apply:&#xA;&#xA;- 2 nights maximum, &#xA;- No emptying allowed,&#xA;- No Fire allowed,&#xA;- No tents allowed.&#xA;- 4 RVs maximum parked here.&#xA;&#xA;Temporary Site for RVs from June 21st to September 21st.&#xA; &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-06 06:23:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157475 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
