  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>One stop General Store</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot next to the fuel pumps.  Perfect for big rigs.  We had permission to park in the back of the parking lot. We had a chance to run our generator all night for the air conditioning situation.  A good place to rest on the road after a very long day!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157498 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
