  <name>Silver Creek Travel Center</name>
  <desc>Can sleep for 24 hours at the Esso on “Flood Hope road” in Silver Hope Creek. Large parking spots for semis.&#xA;Rickys restaurant. Bathrooms. Propane.&#xA;Electric car charging stations.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157521 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
