  <ele>184.55260351020843</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach spot</name>
  <desc>Down the road from Havilland Beach. Large gravel lot for boat access into the lake, BUT through the trees there is a path just wide enough for van to back into….giving you access to your own private beach!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157566 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
