 <wpt lat="49.690573" lon="-92.526376">
  <ele>389.4610252380371</ele>
  <time>2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Glade Across the Tracks </name>
  <desc>Three or more spots here... I pinned the entry off of hwy 17.&#xA;On the west side before the rail crossing there are two good spots not far from the highway but not too noisy.&#xA;Across the tracks is a dead end public road next to a large pasture.  Lots of flat places to park on the side of the road opposite the pasture.&#xA;The rail crossing is unsignalled and crossing them is a bit bumpy...  I think a light vehicle or RV would have no problem... just go slow...&#xA;No signs or postings if any kind.&#xA;Rogers Cell Signal enough to post this description,&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157571 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
