  <ele>60.91007510958289</ele>
  <time>2022-12-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petro-Canada </name>
  <desc>There’s a big gravel parking lot with a small entrance built over a curb along the side of the Petro-Canada truck parking (medium to high vehicles recommended) away from all trucks but you still kind of hear them, walking distance to the gas bar, Burger King and Tim Hortons. Great spot for overnight sleeps. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-12-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
