  <desc>Far enough off the highway that it&#39;s quiet...  Trail head is the first left on Tower road.  I pinned the GPS location sitting on the rock.  enough cell service to add this  location...&#xA;Light vehicles and vans can get here... small RV&#39;s can turn around...  SUV&#39;s can go further down the trail.&#xA;Check if there&#39;s a local fire ban before making a fire...&#xA;No signage of any kind...&#xA;Please don&#39;t make a mess...  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157658 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
