 <wpt lat="49.485626" lon="-67.231986">
  <ele>6.645701078698039</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping domaine ensoleillé 2000</name>
  <desc>35$/per night . We were in a site just next to the water (no services spot) usually for tents but some places have enough room for a small A-frame or Westfallia type of equipment. There are sites with 1, 2 or 3 services with room for bigger rigs.... nice sunrises, clean restroom,  owner who cares about you, restaurant and confectionery store at the entrance of the campground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157921 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
