  <ele>190.73284912109375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Richmond Hill</name>
  <desc>Signage says no overnight parking without authorization, but we called and they said no problem! no sign in at customer service required. there&#39;s a large area around back where recieving happens but they said campers must park in front of the store (not behind). we stayed one night, unsure whether they have a limit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157922 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
