 <wpt lat="54.516320" lon="-122.734340">
  <ele>689.7928579266285</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 21:34:17 UTC</time>
  <name>Davie Lake South Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Pit Toilets, Picnic Tables &amp; Fire Pits. Cell signal is not bad. With a booster it works. Gorgeous Lake. Big Rig friendly. Eight or more large sites. Reasonably clean but as always bits of trash to clean up. Don’t be afraid to bring a rake and help to keep it clean.  Cool clear water on a natural rocky type beach, small craft launching area.  Crooked River flows in from the south and out at the north. Lots of Loons fishing just off shore.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 21:34:17 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157933 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
