 <wpt lat="49.988870" lon="-124.775650">
  <ele>9.919613908044994</ele>
  <time>2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Diver&#39;s Rock </name>
  <desc>Small pullout on the side of the Road next to a tiny little park on the seafront. Room for 1 or 2 vehicles. We stayed 1 night and weren&#39;t bothered. &#xA;&#xA;It&#39;s a 2 minute walk down to the water where there is a fire ring and a picnic table where you can cook and watch the Sunset. Locals come here to swim and watch the sunset as well, they were friendly but please keep them that way by keeping it clean! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/157961 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
