  <name>South Surrey Art and Recreational Centre</name>
  <desc>Hot shower in a well-maintained modern facility, with shampoo provided as well. There are three shower stalls, two standard and one accessible, with enough hooks that a locker isn’t necessary.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158079 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
