 <wpt lat="44.218585" lon="-76.531062">
  <ele>54.029052734375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Ontario Park </name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot for park users, no signs prohibiting overnight stays. Spent two nights with other cars and class B RV.&#xA;Park employees doing their chores without warning us not to overnight. Quiet at night.&#xA;Hot showers and toilets, closed at night. &#xA;Toilets are closed after Thanksgiving.There was no sign not to park at night, and I stayed for one night, no problem. The surrounding scenery is so beautiful. Toilets are closed after Thanksgiving.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
