 <wpt lat="49.316005" lon="-124.554830">
  <ele>54.1</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Qualicum Falls Provincial Park parking</name>
  <desc>Overflow parking for the Little Qualicum Falls Campground. We presented at the gate of the camping which was full and the really friendly manager told us that we can stay in the parking lot and he came check on us later. The fee is 23$ for the night. There was some other vans there. Also you can refill your water in the camping. The parking is a Cool and quiet place with access to the toilets and some trails for the Qualicum Falls. You can park your van the way you want for more intimacy. Pay attention, there is a gate, it’s closed at dawn. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158140 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
