 <wpt lat="49.291480" lon="-124.926570">
  <ele>20.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Sproat Lake Provincial Park Campsite</name>
  <desc>Parking close to the lower Sproat Lake Provincial Park Campsite. You can stay with you van for 25$. Toilets, drinking water and warm showers. Amenities closed during the night. Quiet and cool place with access to the beach. There are some Petroglyphs to see. There is a gate which closes at 11pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
