  <desc>Perfect little camp spot on the way to Wells Gray park. Flat, level and grassy, surrounded by trees. Protected from the wind. Quiet and private. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158152 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
