  <desc>Beautiful spot along the Red Deer river river bed. Lots of space to pull out and camp away from the highway. A bit of a rough path to get down but we were fine in our promaster 159.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158154 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
