  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boisvert Beach</name>
  <desc>Great spot for beach camping. Overnight parking seems to be permitted in the sand pit off the elbow of rue Boisvert. A trail leads to the beach. If you camp to the northeast of the parking, you&#39;ll be out of site of the street and any cottages.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
