  <name>Tubby&#39;s Car Wash and RV Park</name>
  <desc>$37.80 for full service site ($42 with tax) (water, electricity, sewer). Excellent fast wifi. Clean showers. Clean laundromat. Close to nice walking trail into town. Indoor facilities to wash your rig. Sites are tightly packed. Friendly staff. Note: Visitor Centre closed on Sun and Mon.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158234 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
