 <wpt lat="49.225068" lon="-55.056184">
  <ele>2.0707706101238728</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lewisport Intermediate School</name>
  <desc>Behind Lewisport intermediate school, 359 Main st., in summer the school is closed abviously&#xA;There is a grand gravel space facing the water. &#xA;Access is possible both side of the school.&#xA;Great view. Very quiet. &#xA;No signs. &#xA;Saw few kids on the shore walking by. &#xA;Subway, Tim Hortons, restaurant in Mall.  &#xA;Behind the United church on the , there is the Woolfrey’s Pond Trail and Campground“. The owners let us use the dump site in front of the blue garage. No fee. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158303 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
