  <desc>Gravel parking area. above the hwy next to a creek. Gravel turnoff that ends in a circle. Above the highway and screened by trees. Some noise but private and enough space for 3 or 4 RVs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158305 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
