  <name>Little Savanne Boat Launch</name>
  <desc>Off of HWY 17, there is a boat launch site. Full reception OK for big rigs. There is a another more private spot if you take the road to the left with a fire pit, it’s right next to the train, although I did not hear it. Full reception. No signs whatsoever.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
