 <wpt lat="46.816620" lon="-84.406230">
  <ele>181.8212099747452</ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beach</name>
  <desc>An easily accessible spot on the beach for smaller vehicles right off the highway. Not the most private spot since it can be seen by houses and the highway. Once you get off the highway onto Havilland Shores Road, there is a larger area of sand looking out to the beach where you can find a path. Once on the path, the entrance to the spot will be on your right. Don’t go too far because there is a private property. Please remember to clean up after yourself to keep this spot beautiful. Happy camping!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158421 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
