  <desc>Good place to spend a night. No services but safe and quite. Noticed after walking the grounds the following day that there are 5 or 6 official campsites across the playing fields. There is also a portable toilet behind one of the buildings.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158502 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
