  <ele>781.89892578125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Loon Lake</name>
  <desc>A big gravel turnaround not far from the road but protected from sight and noise by the terrain along the side of a tranquille little lake. Not too level, but very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
