  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sheldon Lake</name>
  <desc>Volunteer maintained camp site on the sandy beach of Sheldon Lake with the towering Mt. Sheldon overlooking the West. Some cabins, outhouses, firepit. Great wide open views to the east.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
