 <wpt lat="63.325910" lon="-129.761230">
  <ele>1255.140869140625</ele>
  <time>2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>End of the Road </name>
  <desc>Wide open skies, mountain panoramas, dancing Aurora. A good flat gravelly spot with access to a clear gurgling creek.&#xA;Any decent 4x4 vehicle with high clearance can get here, through a few deep puddles, creek crossings and some rocks. Further in the trail gets more and more technical and challenging. When you meet 8x8 amphibious vehicles you know you&#39;ve gone quite a ways.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
