 <wpt lat="51.908040" lon="-105.404650">
  <ele>536.5387840270996</ele>
  <time>2023-05-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>On this dead end road it&#39;s wide enough in places to pull over and park.  Treed on both sides with a bit of a rise that keeps the wind and highway noise down... The road hasn&#39;t been brushed back too wide so I wouldn&#39;t expect any large farm machinery to need to pass... at the very end of the road across the train tracks there is a firepit...  light vehicles can get here as well small RV&#39;s but there&#39;s not really anywhere for a large RV or trailer to turn around... &#xA;&#xA;enjoy&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158514 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
