  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Parking lot  </name>
  <desc>It‘s a gravel parkinglot next to the Burrowing Owl winery. There is a lot of place. Sometimes it’s a little bit windy, but you have a nice view over the valley (Oliver/Osoyoos). &#xA;There were some other campers and often people from the area comes to stay there or enjoy the wildlife area (next to it). Nobody bothered us. And please take your garbage :) &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158532 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
