 <wpt lat="48.640630" lon="-53.983730">
  <ele>86.48920309357345</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Large lot next to the TCH, across from the Splash and Put, just outside the west entrance to Terra Nova National Park. &#xA;&#xA;Nothing fancy and just along the highway so noisy as long as there’s traffic (no better-no worse than the spot across the highway) but no tractor-trailers on this side. &#xA;&#xA;Used by several other RVs as well, likely for the longer stays. Will do in a pinch. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158903 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
