  <time>2023-07-31 08:26:09 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>A gravel pull off, level, large enought to feel safe, nice water view, not to busy road (no truck) quiet at night. beach with wooden logs on the other side off the street. no sign. very good internet signal 5g. close to the dump station and water. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 08:26:09 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158924 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
