 <wpt lat="50.307997" lon="-107.887187">
  <ele>828.7269674586132</ele>
  <time>2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Kilton Hill Campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice campground with services.  30 amp, water, sewer, showers and toilets. &#xA;2 km from highway 1. Very quiet, shout out to owner (Nick) who is a total gentleman. Campground is clean and very well kept and looked after. Fits all sizes of rigs. I totally recommend this campground. Price is very reasonable. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
