  <name>Grappling Brook Falls Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Large parking area at the end of the road. &#xA;There is a single parking spot 300meter down the road, just over the bridge next to a beautiful creek and lake. VERY quiet. Some cell phone reception. Arrive late, leave early &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/158990 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
