  <desc>Full service - drop off plus lots of coin washers and dryers. $3.00 per wash and $1.00/ 10mins to dry. Lots of shops, grocery stores and Tim Hortons in the plaza as well. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-23 16:08:29 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159063 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
