 <wpt lat="45.629811" lon="-64.813120">
  <ele>5.843885816633701</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 16:34:16 UTC</time>
  <name>Waterside beach N</name>
  <desc>There is a 100m road to 2 gravel parking spots off the road and leading to the sea. Someone from Moncton confirmed it is crown. &#xA;&#xA;The road is quite bumpy and has some deep holes - lopsided at times too. I would recommend 4x4 because you might bottom out your car. &#xA;&#xA;Past the stream is the second gravel parking spot with east access to the beach. Sand and the change of times is incredible!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 16:34:16 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159136 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
