  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 07:51:03 UTC</time>
  <name>WalMart - St Mary&#39;s Road</name>
  <desc>The parking lot at this WalMart is huge. You can pick your spot. Try to stay away from the noisy roadway. We checked at Customer Services before parking. Wifi OK from St Vital Mall.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 07:51:03 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159154 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
