 <wpt lat="42.028070" lon="-82.824400">
  <ele>176.95900802816547</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cedar Creek Conservation Area</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet parking lot with a picnic table and access to the creek where you can launch canoes or kayaks. Enough space to park 8 cars on each side. Slept in my SUV without any issue. No signs that prohibit overnight parking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159188 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
