  <name>Opeongo River site</name>
  <desc>Crown land/non-operating park on Opeongo river next to highway 60 enough room for mid size RV or a few tents. Has a fire pit and a rope swing great for swimming! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 10:07:44 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159191 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
