 <wpt lat="49.489439" lon="-120.484573">
  <ele>659.8050537109375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 02:22:52 UTC</time>
  <name>Martin&#39;s Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>An established campground with 10 sites  and a day use area. Mostly clean, though the hosts should clean out the fire pits more regularly. Cost of $12 a night can&#39;t be beat. Two pit toilets with TP are available for use. &#xA;&#xA;The whole site is situated around a small sunken pond\lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 02:22:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159208 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
