  <name>KM 536 Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>pull out rest area for truckers.  big enough for RVs/campers.  very clean pit toilets, and garbage bins.  great view, right on the highway but super quiet at night.&#xA;LTE full bars on rogers.  if you&#39;re headed northbound, likely to lose cell coverage so download all you need!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 08:28:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159245 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
