  <name>Triton’s Wharf</name>
  <desc>Parked at the government wharf in Triton West. It is gravelled and levelled. &#xA;We asked a fisherman if it was ok and he answered : Don’t see why not. &#xA;It is near a small convenience store. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159291 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
