 <wpt lat="48.985918" lon="-54.609545">
  <ele>114.4615478515625</ele>
  <time>2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Country Inn Trailer Park</name>
  <desc>66 RV sites, many full service sites. Bathouse, laundry and lobby up front. Communal picnic/BBQ Buildings in back. Sites 1-40 are wooded and semi-private, sites 41-66 sardine style side-by-each. cost us about $26 USD for a full service site. Wifi is fast in many (not all) parts of the campground. Washer and dryers &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159343 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
