  <ele>414.5</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 09:15:42 UTC</time>
  <name>End of Lakeshore Rd</name>
  <desc>on the lakeshore rd you will see 3 spots on the left where you could park for the night, but if you go all the way to the end you will find a nicer spot, a more flat ground and space for more than one car (also an easy spot to turn around). I came with a van and i am not sure I would come with a bigger rig. Cel phone coverage was good too, i managed to work from it without problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 09:15:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159386 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
