  <desc>Nice parking spot betwen miliken high school and a football field. Close to Mc Donald’s. A fews cars came in evening for the kids football game but left early. Restroom the other side of the park &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159388 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
