  <name>Petro Pass Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Petro Pass Truck Stop with restaurant, diesel/petrol, convenience store, laundromat and hot showers. Hot showers are available for 11.00 without a towel or $16.00 with a towel. The showers are large, clean and are hot. Washer is $2.25 for a medium load and $2.00 for the dryer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159416 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
