 <wpt lat="48.647756" lon="-123.404954">
  <ele>11.725112915039062</ele>
  <time>2022-09-22 10:36:35 UTC</time>
  <name>Mary Winspear Community Center</name>
  <desc>Parking lot of the Mary Winspear Community Center.  You must make a reservation sand it costs $22.50 a night with the possibility of electricity.  You must pay (cash or debit) while the box-office is open to obtain your permit.  Multiple nights allowed. Relatively quiet during the night - consider using ear plugs.  Close to grocery, pharmacy and restaurants. &#xA;&#xA;(ethernet and power plug ins in museum room left after front doors - bathrooms a bit further)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 10:36:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159464 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
