 <wpt lat="46.538227" lon="-81.309745">
  <ele>258.18682487495244</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 21:14:25 UTC</time>
  <name>Vermillion River Boat Launch</name>
  <desc>Free parking on the Vermillion River. Tons of space for a big rig. Light traffic in the mornings with boaters coming in, but mostly empty at night. Trash can available. Good for one night — better than a Canadian Tire in Sudbury. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 21:14:25 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
