 <wpt lat="49.810042" lon="-123.114036">
  <ele>261.0</ele>
  <time>2024-02-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out Cat Lake</name>
  <desc>Multiple sites along a dirt road. Quite bumpy but still doable with a class B just be careful and drive slowly. Each sites are small and there&#39;s around 5-6 of them with enough room for one van only. Informal fire places, spots are clean and somewhat leveled. The spots closer to the highway are more inclined. Quiet at night but you still get some people that are driving to Cat Lake. Pit toilets up at the campsite. Cellphone signal at 2 bars.&#xA;&#xA;Keep the area clean and leave the place cleaner than how you found it!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159472 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
