  <name>Off Main Road</name>
  <desc>Nice spot just off the &#34;main road&#34;&#xA;Easy access with a regular 4-door car.&#xA;Black flies and dragon flies central. Watch for turtles all along this road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-19 19:07:38 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159585 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
