 <wpt lat="60.713174" lon="-135.084023">
  <ele>707.1627380466089</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>PetroOne Gas Station Lot</name>
  <desc>Brand new PetroOne gas station with large paved parking area!&#xA;Very well lit, but no convenience store/worker around.  It is an unsupervised station.  I called the number on the sign (867)-633-8820 to ask about overnight parking, and the lady said she was the after-hours help &amp; she wasn’t sure but didn’t see why we could not stay!&#xA;No signs.&#xA;There is a portO potty on the south side of the large fuel tanks.  I didn’t use it, so can’t speak for the cleanliness.&#xA;Close to the airport and road, so there is some noise, but nothing compared to the Canadian Superstore lot.  I slept 9h3m with 86/100 sleep score.&#xA;Near Skyy Hotel &amp; Tony’s Italian Restaurant.&#xA;Stayed here 4 different nights without issue.  There was another 18 wheeler that sat in a corner for over a week.  The station has Regular, Diesel, and DEF.&#xA;Gorgeous views and you can see the airport ATC tower!&#xA;LARGE green space for pups!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159651 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
