 <wpt lat="46.053089" lon="-64.093045">
  <ele>4.876304139383137</ele>
  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>NEEDS Shell gas station</name>
  <desc>Has room in the back and on the sides as well as the front. 3 big rigs were also there &#xA;Store name is NEEDS, it also has a Shell gas station. Store is well stocked and closes at 11:00 pm. Pumps remain open all night I was told. Asked the lady at the cash if I could stay. Said as long as you want. Store also sells liquor and beer&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
