  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bernards Qick Mart &amp; Laundromat</name>
  <desc>very nice, clean place with 10 washers and 10 dryers, they are a little old but clean and operational. nice people, they give change in the attached store. $2 to wash and $2 to dry. I also asked for the wifi password and was graciously given it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159732 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
