 <wpt lat="50.013889" lon="-115.524092">
  <ele>1324.8601837567985</ele>
  <time>2022-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dave’s River Campsite</name>
  <desc>Great spot by the river. Turn left down sandy tracks before you reach the bridge. Dave might be there but there is lots of room. Dave has been camping here for 23 years.  Big rigs will fit but high clearance is recommended. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
