 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.693117" lon="-127.467967">
  <ele>62.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 07:30:32 UTC</time>
  <name>Bear Cove Sign</name>
  <desc>Just along the highway at the turn off to the Bear Cove Ferry. Big town welcome sign with gravel lot. No signs against overnight. Picnic bench avaliable. Got in late and left early, 1 or 2 other cars stopped but didn’t stick around long. Quiet and perfect if you’re waiting on an early ferry!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 07:30:32 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159785 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
