 <wpt lat="48.922080" lon="-123.715350">
  <ele>24.794613011181355</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>RV Parking</name>
  <desc>On Victoria St, follow the signs for RVs parking. Elsewhere in town, there are signs for « no RV parking ». Expect noise from passing trucks at 6am and later. Water and bathrooms at park are within walking distance. Big rig friendly. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159870 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
