 <wpt lat="51.973710" lon="-122.194710">
  <ele>1052.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Desous Mountain Rec Site</name>
  <desc>An established British Columbia Recreational Site campground, with basic amenities, including relatively level campsites, fire pits, picnic tables, and toilets. Accessed off of Desous Rd., an easy dirt road, with some cattle guard crossings.  Prime spot for mountain bike enthusiasts, as you can access trail network right from the campground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159872 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
