 <wpt lat="48.451636" lon="-89.255061">
  <ele>242.65847396850586</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petro Canada </name>
  <desc>Water hydrant in the back of the station. After filling up gas, we kindly asked the clerk if we could take about 30ltrs to top up our water tank and it was ok. &#xA;Try no to take too long as you will probably be blocking the way to the charge station.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
