 <wpt lat="50.532190" lon="-127.431800">
  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marble River Rec Site</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: User(s) report winter closure (in Feb and March of 2024). Reopens Long Weekend May 2024. Please edit this once the closing date is known.&#xA;&#xA;About 20 Gravel camp sites in forrest next to Marble River. Lots of bush between sites, excellent privacy. Some sites too small for big rigs. Free, first come. Very clean. No problem getting in with our 22 ft C Class.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/159934 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
