  <ele>-2.592864990234375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pont d&#39;Aluminium</name>
  <desc>Parking for the Saguenay pathway. Please leave no trace.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160007 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
