 <wpt lat="49.237451" lon="-65.719496">
  <ele>1.0776859279721975</ele>
  <time>2023-05-24 17:33:24 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc et Mer</name>
  <desc>Beautiful campsites on the ocean and also in grassy area.  Serviced and non-serviced sites. Friendly staff. Great little grocery store/cafe nearby in town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 17:33:24 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160053 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
