 <wpt lat="46.601771" lon="-61.034400">
  <ele>0.8965712683275342</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cheticamp causeway pullout</name>
  <desc>There are a couple of pullouts on the ocean side of the causeway between Cheticamp and Cheticamp Island, room for a few small rigs or one larger, but not huge rigs. View and sound of the waves! Very quiet at night, cars go by during the day and into the evening. 3 bars of Telus. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160070 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
