 <wpt lat="50.037980" lon="-123.101020">
  <ele>463.4837646484375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Daisy Lake (Cal-Cheak) FSR</name>
  <desc>Great quiet spot about 200-300m after the bungee parking, the road gets a bit rough but ok at least to get here (unless maybe if you have a big rig..) We were here with our small SUV (no 4W) - the spot is slightly inclined but still really ok to sleep. Do make sure to not leave any trash though - we found some alu foil and plastic from previous campers which we cleaned.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160072 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
