 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="43.110555" lon="-80.245327">
  <ele>193.44370835181326</ele>
  <time>2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cockshutt Bridge River access</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot with river access to the grand river. Portable toilet and picnic tables available. No signs prohibiting parking overnight. A bit of noise from road traffic at night but otherwise quiet. Locals use this spot to launch canoes and kayaks and leave their cars in the lot. A pebble beach next to the river where you can swim or fish. You could probably pitch a tent on the gravel shore. Be respectful and leave space to not block the boat launch and you won’t have a problem staying here. Closed 01 December to 01 April. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160075 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
