 <wpt lat="46.617721" lon="-81.412048">
  <ele>384.96185302734375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clear Lake </name>
  <desc>Small spot near the junction of 144 and route 8&#xA;&#xA;a bit close to the highways but there&#39;a a fire pit and room enough for a van or small trailer.&#xA;&#xA;Bring what you need and remove what you bring&#xA;&#xA;CBC on 99.9fm&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160086 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
