  <ele>676.9334716796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Toad River</name>
  <desc>Free. Fire rings, pit toilet, and picnic benches. Near boat launch and river. Lots of firewood nearby. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160091 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
