 <wpt lat="50.460489" lon="-105.966783">
  <ele>568.12890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Besant Park &amp; Campground </name>
  <desc>Big - 96 sites. But all nicely spaced and treed. Privacy plus neighbours.&#xA;&#xA;Very agreeable hostess with dog. Small store with emergency supplies, natural swimming hole, $2 showers, coin laundry, etc. $30 unserviced; $40 for water and electricity.&#xA;&#xA;The traffic noise from the highway is a distant hum. The tracks are not that distant but trains were infrequent during our stay - didn&#39;t bother us.&#xA;&#xA;My description makes it sound like one of those nasty big operations. It&#39;s not - it&#39;s very nice.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 540.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160094 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
