 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.873514" lon="-114.717673">
  <ele>1431.1663818359375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-31 17:32:36 UTC</time>
  <name>Paddys Flats</name>
  <desc>Big campground - about 100 sites. Four loops - B loop is closest to the river, but none of the sites are water front. All the sites are quite big, well treed and nicely spaced.&#xA;&#xA;On site host. A guy came buy selling firewood. Self registration. 31 CAD per night. Closes for the winter on Sept 20.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 102.1.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 17:32:36 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160095 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
