  <ele>1497.705078125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaver Flat Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice place with beautiful view in front of the river. Clean outhouses . No cell service - Rogers or T-Mobile. Must pay for a Kananaskis Pass to camp here- purchase online or at park office. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
