  <ele>816.53369140625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 09:42:25 UTC</time>
  <name>Cavan Lake Campground </name>
  <desc>Good for a night - maybe better than the Medicine Hat places. Mostly friendly seasonal campers but several tent - $21.00 and serviced - $31.50 sites available,. Looks to be free firewood. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 09:42:25 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160097 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
