 <wpt lat="43.489184" lon="-80.395930">
  <ele>319.30792768998333</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 12:45:35 UTC</time>
  <name>Dead end road</name>
  <desc>Road ends at a small turnaround. I see big rigs parked there overnight all the time. Just don’t block the small construction entrance with the chain/lock across it. Limited turn around area so if you have a trailer you’d be better off backing in. Some walking trails into the field, no amenities but quiet. Construction site close by so maybe some early morning noise, there is washrooms on the construction site within walking distance&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 12:45:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160173 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
