  <desc>Water available at the left side of bathroom....good for drinks &#xA;.....&#xA;Eau disponible côté gauche des toilettes.  L&#39;eau est potable.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160180 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
