 <wpt lat="50.815018" lon="-119.044398">
  <ele>484.73611068725586</ele>
  <time>2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shuswap Lake Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>small rest stop (literally) right off the highway. overlooking the lake. pit toilets available. several picnic tables. nice large grassy area. 2 bars with telus. &#xA;&#xA;less than ideal for camping, quite a bit of highway noise and no privacy, but will do the trick for a night. definitely seems like it would be a good spot for lunch. &#xA;&#xA;big enough for several big rigs, but again no privacy. could tent in the grass but the highway would probably keep you up all night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160199 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
