  <ele>15.026639519147535</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Border Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Roadside rest area at the BC/Yukon border with pit toilets. Stayed one night and no signage prohibiting overnight parking. Highway gets pretty quiet at night. There&#39;s a pull out across the road for northbound travelers to stop and get a photo with the &#34;Welcome to Yukon&#34; sign but I&#39;m sure you could spend a night there with no problem. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160271 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
