  <desc>Turn around spot at end of road close&#xA;&#xA;Picnic table and large open areas close to the oceans edge. &#xA;&#xA;Great place to go for a walk in the morning and see the sunset. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160320 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
