  <desc>Trailhead with parking lot, picnic tables and a little lake. Gorgeous views of Trinity too! Look out for the sneaky foxes around here, but it’s quiet and a bit less windy than closer to the lighthouse. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160361 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
