  <ele>22.8823798680678</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ashby Laundromat Ltd.</name>
  <desc>Amazing! Best laundromat we’ve found in over two years on the road - clean, reasonably priced, machines work and dryers are great, not to mention very friendly!&#xA;&#xA;It doesn’t hurt that the wifi is fast :)&#xA;Closed on Mondays.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160412 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
