  <name>Shell gas station </name>
  <desc>The tap is on the side of the building.  Easy access. Went in and asked if we could fill water for our camper and was told Yes.  We have our own water hose.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160439 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
