  <ele>787.08349609375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Snafu Dispursed Camping</name>
  <desc>On the way into Snafu Lake Gov Campground, there are several wild sites. This site was down a short road. It has a great view of the mountains and currently nice fall color. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160453 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
