 <wpt lat="46.139221" lon="-60.196677">
  <ele>1.5</ele>
  <time>2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Royal Cape Breton Yacht Club </name>
  <desc>There&#39;s a water tap in the back of the building with the washrooms (directly behind Chill Zone Treats). You can back right in from the marina parking lot. Suitable for vans/small rigs or jug refills, and you&#39;ll need a long hose. We filled up once in September and once in October, no problem. Nice washrooms as well, we were able to dump out our cassette toilet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160460 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
