 <wpt lat="49.653010" lon="-54.772221">
  <ele>2.692109599709511</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Shore Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Nice little parking lot with a few garbage bins, picnic tables &amp; a gazebo. Right on the water. Annie’s restaurant on the south end. &#xA;&#xA;No signs limiting time for parking or camping. &#xA;&#xA;It is right off the road, so if you are self contained it should be fine. I’d imagine this gets very busy in the summer time! &#xA;&#xA;Good spot to park and go for a wander. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
