  <ele>196.3843994140625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mont Tremblant</name>
  <desc>Public parking (free) large with 2 entrances. Reasonably private and within walking distance of many reataurants. Professional traffic in the morning. Good for a night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160483 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
