 <wpt lat="46.314655" lon="-74.225847">
  <ele>372.6654052734375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Saint Donat, Parc des Pionniers</name>
  <desc>The police told us to stay overnight here (as opposed to trailhead parking lots). There are currently signs indicating &#39;no camping&#39; but we noticed several other RVs. It must be part of new regulations in St Donat, allowing overnight stays at this designated spot. The details are on the municipal website according to police. The site is quite nice and large, it seems quiet and close to the beach. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160484 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
