  <ele>1137.1009521484375</ele>
  <time>2022-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Packrat Creek Campground </name>
  <desc>In White Swan Provincial Park. 16 sites spread out along the road, which is between the campground and the lake. Two nice clean pit toilets. $5.00 per person per night. (Sep 2022: $22 per night.)&#xA;Across from a boat launch and information kiosk. Some first-light activity - folks heading off to nearby Lussier Hot Springs? &#xA;CBC at radio station 1010.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160540 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
