  <desc>little self-serve campground, only a few sites. all unserviced and the only amenity is an outhouse, very close to the road but the traffic mostly went away in the evening. barely any cell reception, but we have a lovely stay. $18 a night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160668 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
