  <ele>81.93386784061018</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Thunder Brook Falls</name>
  <desc>Parking pad just off highway.&#xA;&#xA;Good for a night&#39;s stay. Relatively level parking lot and highway noise is negligible.&#xA;&#xA;There are a few swimming spots and a waterfall lookout just 5 minutes down the trail.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
