  <ele>945.020751953125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Perrett Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Town owned and operated. Only 16 sites - 8 serviced; 8 unserviced, 3 of which are first come only. All the other sites can be reserved. Also a day use area with small play structure. &#xA;&#xA;Bathrooms / showers not that clean but useable. Big inside area with picnic tables, lights, power outlets - to get out of the wind. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160898 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
