  <time>2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cliff&#39;s Landing</name>
  <desc>Free campsite. Site located on the Marshal Flowage just south of the Liscomb Game Sanctuary. Area is almost a fully serviced provincial rest area complete with pit toilet, fire pit, boat launch and a beautiful view of the fresh water hydro reservoir. Drive way is gravel. Site is gravel and grass covered.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160951 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
