 <wpt lat="47.002650" lon="-60.512310">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Capstick Beach </name>
  <desc>Going to Meat Cove a road leading down to Capstick Beach with enough for a small-medium rig, we had a van. Not suitable for trailers. Bottom area is off-level as well. Can be a tight turnaround at bottom and though the road is short and good it is slightly steeper at the bottom and has the potential to be muddy. I wouldn&#39;t use if really wet and maybe walk down first to see if it works for you. nice view of the rocky Beach and loud waves all night. Leave it cleaner than how you found it please. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160953 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
