  <desc>Multiple sites, with or without services. The tenting area is grassed. The RV area is asphalt.&#xA;.....&#xA;Multiples sites avec et sans services. La zone des tentes est sur gazon, celle pour VR est sur asphalte.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/160968 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
