 <wpt lat="50.582122" lon="-122.090742">
  <ele>662.584716796875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood campground</name>
  <desc>Great little campsite, beautiful surroundings and river. 15 sites. Not very big spots, some river sites (7 is best), others very close to the river. With our RV (21ft) we could fit in most, but not all. Not very big rig friendly. Pit toilets. $15 /$7.50 (seniors), but free today (off season? no camp attendant)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161146 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
