 <wpt lat="51.489892" lon="-117.162972">
  <ele>783.4085693359375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>RV Haven and Tents</name>
  <desc>Friendly owner, nice setting with mountain view. Sites are average in size, but close together. Big firepit. Full hookup available. Also tent spots and cabins available. Some road noise.&#xA;It’s OK for the night, especially if you prefer to have electricity/hookup because of the cold. Showers and toilets available, but we did not use them.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
