 <wpt lat="49.814088" lon="-119.758730">
  <ele>530.803955078125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peachland RV park</name>
  <desc>RV park with 81 sites. All full hook up. $50. Big sites on gravel with nice grass, flowers and boulders in between sites. Surrounded by forest. They are building washroom + showers, but not available yet. At the moment a lot of long stayers, they are all very tidy and quiet. So it is a typical RV park, but it is a nice one! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161148 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
