 <wpt lat="45.565319" lon="-72.005870">
  <ele>82.9291745107621</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dog-walk car park Windsor </name>
  <desc>Large gravel car park for the dog-walk park. Plenty of room for several large rigs. Right next to a train track which looks active but not a single train came past while we were there (could of course be very noisy if they do come past!). A few people came to walk their dogs but no one bothered us and we had a peaceful night. No signs about RV or overnight parking. No facilities. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161192 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
