  <ele>25.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-20 16:37:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Truck Stop Plus (Laundry/Water/Shower)</name>
  <desc>We didnt stop here but they do have a lot to offer RVers and I thought it may be of help to some travelers. &#xA;Showers, Laundry, Wifi, propane, water etc etc.&#xA;&#xA;From their website it states that they offer: &#xA;Business center, free Wi-Fi and automated teller machine. Large parking lot, lounge for truckers, showers and laundry room.&#xA;Truck, bus and RV washing, vacuum cleaners, air for tires, propane station, tank filling and exchange, free drain station and water filling for RVs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 16:37:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161198 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
