  <ele>450.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trewartha Creek, near Thunder Bay, ON</name>
  <desc>Found this flat place to sleep through online Backroad Mapbooks. It was dark when I arrived, and I wasn&#39;t sure how long the road is, so I only drove about 1 km down dirt road. Can hear traffic, but it&#39;s not so loud. Slept well.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
