  <name>Camping Cabano</name>
  <desc>Nice little campground just off the expressway in Quebec just before you enter New Brunswick. Owners were very friendly. English is broken but one can get by. Great Showers, electric sites and water. Would recommend.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 09:35:34 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161211 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
