  <ele>47.64729782100767</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Balancing Rock Trailhead, Tiverton</name>
  <desc>Pretty busy in the day time but if you pulled up in the evening and are early risers, you should be fine. &#xA;&#xA;Beautiful mists in the morning!&#xA;&#xA;Toilets and there’s definitely space for a big rig. &#xA;&#xA;Lovely 1km trail to the coast to see the Balancing Rock. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161241 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
