  <ele>63.39055824279785</ele>
  <time>2022-08-10 08:06:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Muskrat falls camp site</name>
  <desc>Nice large level lot to park multiple campers with $13,000,000,000.00 view!  If you park in the back Western corner, there is a nice view of the large reservoir. It is a short walk to see the hydro dam. We had the place to ourselves while camping here in  mid October. There was a friendly black fox who have us company at the evening fire. &#xA;&#xA; There is LTE cell service too. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-10 08:06:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161447 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
