  <time>2024-06-11 23:24:28 UTC</time>
  <name>Mosquito Lake Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>About a dozen+ sites, some right on the lake edge. Really nice spot, perfect lake for a swim or canoe. No reception. Gravel and pothole filled road to lake, no high clearance or 4WD required. Free. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 23:24:28 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161458 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
