  <desc>New Costco! Cheap gas!&#xA;Liquor store! No problem staying the night!&#xA;I&#39;m not sure who thought this Costco was closed, but it IS open.  Can stay one night. No issues. Very Quiet d/t closing at 8:30pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161723 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
