  <ele>610.74365234375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fas Gas RV Park</name>
  <desc>10/14/21 Haines Junction. &#xA;Clean, close to highway but quiet this time of year. &#xA;Spaces are close together. No fire pits. Water turned off for winter. Electricity and sewage available. Next to gas station and convenience store. Operator friendly.  $36 Canadian for one night with electricity and sewage. &#xA;Great place if just passing through.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
