 <wpt lat="49.621914" lon="-115.624176">
  <ele>813.712363243103</ele>
  <time>2023-06-11 10:47:02 UTC</time>
  <name>Fort Steele Resort and RV Park</name>
  <desc>200 campsites including pull-throughs with 30/50 amp full hookups.  Tenting area.  Heated Swimming pool.  Enclosed area for large groups.  The above is from their brochure.  There is an Esso gas station and basic grocery where the RV office is.  Dump station at gas station.  Attendant was very helpful.  The site is just off the road and quiet.  There were maybe 25 full time resident RVers and only 3 overnighters.   Had electric and sewer but no water.  Water turned off for winter.  Can fill up with water at office.  Nice place with trees.  Individual sites.  $42C&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 10:47:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
