  <time>2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot</name>
  <desc>Huge parking lot. Found in Google maps. looks like a truck stop but trailers don&#39;t park here anymore. Walmart,  24hr Tim&#39;s, Home Depot and 24hr fuel across the street. Small restaurant on site(poutine, hot dogs, burgers etc) Large paved lot. Any vehicle will fit. A little traffic noise but not horrible. Otherwise quiet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161875 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
