 <wpt lat="49.442205" lon="-117.273405">
  <ele>1076.2469482421875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nelson Nelway Highway</name>
  <desc>Nice cleared-out area with big fire pit with enough room for a group of 5-6 vehicles. Open area with nice views and very quiet. Directions are up the FSR called Giveout Cr Rd (just north past the Cottonwood Lake turnoff). &#xA;Drive for 2.3km up and you&#39;ll see the clearing on the right. &#xA;You&#39;ll see a fork at 1.7km, go left/up and into the clearing another 0.6km.&#xA;&#xA;Good cell reception.&#xA;4WD recommended as there is a steep gravel access on the final ascent. FSR before that well-groomed. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/161909 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
