  <name>Industrial park near Canadian Tire</name>
  <desc>24 hour parking along an industrial park road just a couple minutes from the Schwartz Bay ferry near the Canadian Tire. Showed up around 11:30pm and there were about 5 or 6 other campers/vans spread out down the road. Very quite until about 5:30-6:00am when the business start opening. Stayed until around 7:30 and no one bothered us.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-30 08:47:04 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/162117 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
