 <wpt lat="49.913042" lon="-57.795966">
  <ele>4.756907495670021</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cow Head </name>
  <desc>Cow Head Drinking water Dispensing Unit. Open 8 am to 8 pm / 7 days a week. Free fresh water.  In front of veteran parks - on the other side of the street &#xA;&#xA;This system consists of an inlet sand pre-filter, an ozonation system, a multi-media filter, a granular activated carbon filter, a cartridge filter, reverse osmosis membrane filtration system, a 1000 litre water storage tank, a UV disinfection system, and a water dispensing system Including a&#xA;bottle washing unit.&#xA;&#xA;This is very good water! Consider using a 5 gallon jug that can be attached to a hose or use a funnel to add some of this good water to your RV fresh water tank. There are guards on the taps to prevent anyone drinking by mouth or touching it and contaminating the dispensers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/162273 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>amenity_drinking_water</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#0099ff</osmand:color>
