  <ele>28.48944091796875</ele>
  <time>2023-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild rose Campground &amp; R.V. Park</name>
  <desc>At $29.30 for an unserviced site, a pretty good deal for this part of the world - I think. That price may include a low-season 10% discount. &#xA;&#xA;A fairly big operation - 58 sites - with most of the sites full service and occupied long term. Nicely treed, giving some privacy. Good wifi at our site. Clean and warm washrooms and shower rooms. Some traffic noise from the nearby TCH and some train noise from the other direction - neither too bothersome. &#xA;&#xA;CBC at 101.7&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/162350 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
