  <desc>A dirt parking lot for Glebe Park, the sculpture forest and the local museum. There are no &#34;no parking&#34; signs and it is very quiet back here, almost no traffic because the road dead ends at the park. There is an outhouse in the park as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/162361 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
