  <desc>It seems you can park overnight ONLY from Saturday night to Sunday. Good for Cars and Campervans. Pet Friendly. Go all the way to the top. No signage at all about parking on the lookout. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/162656 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
