  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overlooking Kelowna</name>
  <desc>Pullout off a gravel road on a hill overlooking Kelowna. Super pretty. No garbage, no bathrooms. Please clean up after yourselves. Good for 2 or maybe 3 vans. Not recommended for big rigs, you have to go up a long and winding bumpy road and I don’t think the pullout is long enough. AMAZING view of the city. No issues, no signs posted prohibiting overnight camping. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/163020 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
