  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Botsford street</name>
  <desc>This spot is just off the main street near the restaurants and pubs! Overnight street parking is widely available in the area! &#xA;&#xA;Parking is free until 7:45 am. there are also several parking lots that may offer the same. in the winter, overnight street parking is only offered conditionally. Please check the city of monitor&#39;s website. map attached shows overnight parking. it&#39;s extremely quiet sleeping here on a Wednesday, but starts to get noisy around 7 or 8 am. the church immediately beside this particular spot rings their bell pretty loud around 9:30.&#xA;&#xA;for live music che k out the Olde triangle or st. James gate, a few minutes walk from here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/163645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
