  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pritchard River Bridge</name>
  <desc>This is an OK site for RVs to park as it is crown land. it has a bathroom and garbage cans and is beside the river. you can have a campfire here.  About 1km off the Trans Canada Hwy. It&#39;s a nice spot, please clean up after yourself so others can continue to use and enjoy it too. All paved roads, large rigs will have no problem.  It is free. Turn left as soon as you get over the bridge. Great signal&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/163874 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
