  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land Campsite and Boat Launch on Opikinimika River</name>
  <desc>Multiple campsites on both sides of the highway. Some people camp here regularly in season and have kept the land clean.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/164143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
