  <ele>135.0</ele>
  <time>2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land Campsite and Boat Launch at Firth Lake</name>
  <desc>Primarily a boat launch to access the lake. Shouldn&#39;t be a problem to camp overnight. Not ideal for large rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/164144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
