 <wpt lat="50.699267" lon="-127.480257">
  <ele>3.817695491015911</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Port Hardy RV &amp; resort</name>
  <desc>Full hook up RV campground  with space for about 40+ with about 10 cabins. Also has tent spaces. Right by the estuary trail. Has laundry, ($2 for washing $3 for drying) hot showers ($4 for 5 minutes), about $25 a night. Provides wifi + wood. Has a recycling spot as well. Nice staff and well maintained &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/164836 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
