 <wpt lat="45.751432" lon="-73.120087">
  <ele>31.111158192157745</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area - Route 137</name>
  <desc>Small rest area close to a road but very quiet. There is also a dry toilet and few picnic tables. &#xA;&#xA;Slept one night here and it was perfect&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/164967 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
