 <wpt lat="49.146274" lon="-122.008152">
  <ele>13.569319820031524</ele>
  <time>2023-05-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paved Lot</name>
  <desc>Paved lot connected to the Tim Hortons and shopping plaza. Stayed multiple nights, no problems. Sometimes busy from locals hanging out and truck repair shop backing lot. Wifi and bathrooms inside Timmies&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/165179 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
