 <wpt lat="49.365380" lon="-121.482610">
  <ele>43.48759460449219</ele>
  <time>2023-04-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J Travel Center</name>
  <desc>Great place for hot showers. $12.60 gets you a shower; towel; washcloth &amp; shower mat. One of the best laid out truck stop showers that I have ever used. Great value! Hot water; good pressure and the privacy of a personal unit that offers shower, sink &amp; toilet. You could probably ONP in the large parking lot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/165279 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
