 <wpt lat="49.619642" lon="-95.964536">
  <ele>288.2320556640625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Theresa&#39;s Spot</name>
  <desc>As my wife picked it I called it after  her. Nice spot situated on Crown Land. (BLM for our US friends) Nothing special but a great little site for boondocking and is far enough from the highway to be very quiet. Very sandy, I would be careful if you don&#39;t have a 4x4. Look first. Very strong cell coverage. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/165738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
