 <wpt lat="43.247176" lon="-80.028624">
  <ele>128.01599590348812</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>old Hwy 99 trail</name>
  <desc>MODERATORS NOTICE:We could not confirm if overnight parking is allowed in this place.&#xA;&#xA;Nice parking spot next to a biking trail. I think you can sleep in your vehicle if you had to.   Secluded spot.  Lcbo and variety store not far of a walk.  Lots of trails south east.  Steps from steel city but still small village feel.  &#xA;4G coverage&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/166100 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
