 <wpt lat="50.949396" lon="-113.979404">
  <ele>1038.8308676735596</ele>
  <time>2023-04-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J Travel Center</name>
  <desc>The showers at this Flying J are exceptional. For $12.60, you get a towel, washcloth and bathmat. The shower rooms are spacious, private and clean. Each shower room has a shower, toilet &amp; sink. The water is hot and the water pressure is perfect. I am an above the knee amputee so I used the available handicap accessible shower. The best equipped shower that I have used in the 2 1/2 years since I lost my leg. This will be my go-to shower whenever I am in the Calgary area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/166213 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
