  <ele>11.997968061827123</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 10:04:55 UTC</time>
  <name>Across from Crofton ferry terminal</name>
  <desc>Upper and lower lots. &#xA;Lower is for boat launch parking . Upper has no signs. Nice view of ocean and ferry terminal. &#xA;Three bars of cell service …Sasktel.&#xA;There are flush bathrooms in park across street under school house museum.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 10:04:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/166886 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
