  <ele>862.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Up hill gravel camp</name>
  <desc>This spot was the first road to the right I had seen in a long ways cycling since bucking horse. It is not very far up, and it ends at a lot where pitched up my camp.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/167187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
