  <ele>891.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overlook - Alaska Highway</name>
  <desc>A beautiful overlook campsite with mountain views and setting sun. The spot is up as far as the road goes just before a pullout lot going north. There is a seasonal creek that is dry, except if you hike up a little ways there is water in the canyon.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/167189 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
