  <name>Parc Régional de la rivière Gentilly</name>
  <desc>Middle of the woods, non-paved road for a bit close to park.  30 amps at site.  Nothing else in winter.  Community centre has showers, toilets, laundry and kitchen available with good WIFI but only at community centre.&#xA;&#xA;En plein milieu des bois, route non-pavée vers la fin, courant 30 amps aux sites, toilettes douches, WIFI, buanderie et cuisine disponible au centre communautaire.  Beaucoup de pistes pour la raquette ou le &#39;fat-bike&#39;.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 15:18:22 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/167894 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
