  <ele>680.6</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 13:15:14 UTC</time>
  <name>4 seasons camp ground</name>
  <desc>The campsite is on the North West corner of town (Swan Hills). It has showers and nice washrooms, powered sites, both large and small sites, and several sites (25+). Nice town with all services available. Quading, snowmobiling, dirt biking, .... friendly area (lots of trails). Depending on powered site, or if you want to use the showers and washrooms,  depends on the price you pay ($$). Free sanitation dump station located south side of town, near gas station. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 13:15:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/168175 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
