  <ele>85.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Middle Cove Beach parking</name>
  <desc>Parking lot for Middle Cove Beach. Used by a lot of locals, so it can get a bit busy, especially around sunset time/evening. It&#39;s sloped towards the sea, but good enough for a night or two. Great view and ocean sounds, there&#39;s also a little river next to the parking lot. Large bins, but no other amenities. There&#39;s also grassy areas further up top, which would be good for tents. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/168735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
