 <wpt lat="49.898174" lon="-97.129523">
  <ele>230.1626641470939</ele>
  <time>2023-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Face downtown by the river </name>
  <desc>Not sure this spot is legal but we spend one night here and in the middle of the night the police did look around our vehicle. Nothing happens, they don’t wake us, after looking inside with their moi they gone away and that it! &#xA;The spot are at the end of a street a few step from the river, nice view on downtown. Besides to a cycle path. Very quiet.&#xA;There is no sign said that we cannot stay for the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/168860 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
