  <time>2023-08-07 20:06:54 UTC</time>
  <name>Boitanio Park Street Parking</name>
  <desc>Free RV overnight parking Recommended by the Willians Lake Tourist Information Desk.&#xA;&#xA;Although it is street parking, it is designated as RV only parking.&#xA;&#xA;It is a perfect location to start the Williams Lake Mural tour.&#xA;&#xA;Stayed here one night. Near grocery, cafe, and restaurants.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 20:06:54 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/169456 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
