  <desc>Pleasant campground at a golf course. We camped in the overflow area for $20 which has power and picnic tables. Has water and dump station. We didn’t peek at the bathrooms. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/169498 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
