  <ele>-9.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bella Coola</name>
  <desc>medium size flat parking area beside the road. right on the water. great view of eagles, seals, occasional whales and dolphins. Enough room for RV or trailer. cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/171040 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
