  <ele>271.99273681640625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest Road - Squamish</name>
  <desc>Beautiful scenic spot. Can see the town, the mountains, and hear a stream. Very quiet. The road into this spot requires 4x4 and ground clearance, but worth the drive. It is off the forestry road. If you can&#39;t get in here, there are lots of other places on the way to park or camp. Excellent cell service at this location.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/171042 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
