  <name>Ground next to Wash the Works</name>
  <desc>empty ground between A&amp;W and Wash the Works. A lot of trucks stop here for the night. Very safe. You can still use the Laundry Wi-Fi witch reaches the car. We spent 4 nights, worked in the public library, used the showers at wash the works (10 cad each) and slept here! :) very nice city &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/171662 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
