  <desc>Small parking lot, quite level, good for a night or two. Almost walking distance to Golden. There was one other car there overnight, very little traffic on the road and the tracks. There is some sort of factory on the other side of the tracks that is a little noisy during the night, but not too bad. Enough room for our 26ft motorhome.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/171922 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
