  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Big Valley campground </name>
  <desc>Owners are really laidback, community is friendly. 1/2 salt 1/2 chlorine pool, laundry ($3 wash, $2.25 dry) showers ($1). Seasonal, monthly, weekly and overnight sites. Also a few rustic cabins. Well water and advised not to drink but good for everything else. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172702 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
