  <time>2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>We-Wai-Kai Camp Site</name>
  <desc>Great campground with sites right on the water. We are here off season so there are lots of sites to choose from for $25 including power. Water is turned off during winter. I understand that during the summer and late Spring it can be booked solid here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172767 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
