  <name>Ball&#39;s Falls Trail </name>
  <desc>A medium-sized pullout along a fairly quiet road. There aren&#39;t any parking restrictions posted. It&#39;s on a bit of a slope, but not bad for a night. Gets busy during the day with Bruce Trail hikers, so be respectful to not take up too much space. The hiking trails along the river valley are gorgeous. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 21:25:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172781 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
