  <time>2024-06-24 10:36:06 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood River </name>
  <desc>Just outside the Provincial Park is this campsite on a little plateau above the river. Lots of room, fire rings and a beautiful beach with lots of driftwood. Easy 2WD access, no traffic on the road (maybe due to it being closed south of here). No cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 10:36:06 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172788 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
