  <name>Lilooet &amp; District Recreation Center</name>
  <desc>Unlimited warm showers, 5.50$ in Sep 2022. (3$ in April)! Also there’s a library, weight room and great place to picnic&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172799 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
