 <wpt lat="49.727490" lon="-124.896990">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kin Beach Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Categorized as “C” grade provincial park, this little campground is great. $20 night for single site, pit toilets and fresh water, no showers. Access to the beach, kids play area, outdoor covered area with amazing hearth. Dogs allowed but Onleash. Airforce beach campground is a 20min walk with an open dog-friendly beach.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172835 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
