  <ele>293.0026512145996</ele>
  <time>2022-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>PineHurst Conservation Area</name>
  <desc>Beautiful natural campground and lake. It does cost $15 for a day pass. There is overnight camping available. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172905 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
