 <wpt lat="44.182877" lon="-77.381905">
  <ele>91.92220692243427</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Municipal parking </name>
  <desc>Municipal Parking lot next to the Moria river and along the walking trail. &#xA;Overnight camping allowed. &#xA;No services other than a garbage can. &#xA;&#xA;Will fit larger RVs, but you will hog the lot, which may not be appreciated by locals. Bigger rigs should go to the soccer field parking listed in this app…. A pit stop for fishing is probably ok 😉&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172906 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
