 <wpt lat="44.190785" lon="-77.392209">
  <ele>104.67457722034305</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Municipal Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Exit 543A of the 401&#xA;&#xA;Riverside Park parking lot. Entrance road is opposite 254 North Park St, Belleville ON. Entry road goes past city Parks Dept yard into parking lot that overlooks river. Walking/biking path follows river past children’s playground, frisbee golf course and skateboard park. Lots of room to park and maneuver. Mall, restaurants are 5 minutes away. No signs posted against over night parking.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/172907 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
