 <wpt lat="49.814811" lon="-119.319159">
  <ele>1077.0</ele>
  <time>2022-10-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Myra Forest service road</name>
  <desc>Large dirt area beside the road. Place for at least 3 big RV or 5 or 6 ClassB or C&#xA;A bit before the other one more up the mountain. The one up the mountain has a better view but they dig a ditch for water on the side of the road. Not deep enough for small rig like class B but too prononced for a travel trailer.&#xA;Cell 1 bar outside and 2 bars inside with booster.&#xA;About 4 km or dirt road quite uphill.&#xA;If rainy an pulling a heavy trailer 4x4 is better. I put 4Low on my F150 pulling 7500 lbs trailer. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/173191 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
