  <ele>900.7573299203068</ele>
  <time>2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>On the way to kelsall lake</name>
  <desc>Take the road up north to the yellow gate of the gravel pit. Beginning of the road clear for normal véhicules and great spots available. To reach the lake need a 4x4 especially after rain, can’t see how deep it is. View on the mountains around incredible&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/173207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
