  <desc>Place for 2 véhicules with a fire pit next to the river , good for tent and small rv… because place limited to turn… really enjoyable, access to the cold cold river and hike in the toundra just close &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/173209 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
