 <wpt lat="53.302459" lon="-120.142287">
  <ele>697.270751953125</ele>
  <time>2023-04-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gaglardi Park</name>
  <desc>Right on the west bank of the Fraser River on the east end of McBride. Large parking lot, ample space for any sized vehicle. 3 Pit toilets, gazebo with picnic tables, grassy area for leashed pets. Some highway noise, but due to the reduced speed limit entering town the noise isn&#39;t significant. Lots of signs with information about the area. I looked far and wide and could not see any signs indicating no overnight parking/camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175068 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
