 <wpt lat="45.525278" lon="-74.208333">
  <ele>100.4</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside</name>
  <desc>This spot has no signage of overnights being banned. Toilets are locked at night and you use a buzzer to unlock. Benches, fire pit, and a nice lookout spot. I had my Jetta with my teardrop and was able to use two spaces. I wouldn’t park here with anything bigger. Park at the top of the hill for best view! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175114 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
