  <desc>literally in the middle of the woods, crown lands, but it says designated camping area with lots of little spots with a fire ring. rough road but we made it with our gmc Van, but you should have a high clearance&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
