 <wpt lat="52.443839" lon="-122.401668">
  <ele>465.31207275390625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fraser River</name>
  <desc> Nice spot with room for at least  2, hidden behind the trees from Soda Creek Road. View over Fraser River and its banks and islands. A bit closer to the 97 than the other spot along Soda Creek Road. Very tent friendly. Drive slow, the entrance is very easy to miss. There&#39;s a second entry but it&#39;s currently blocked by a fallen tree. Good cell service. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
