  <ele>677.775146484375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside with amazing views </name>
  <desc>Right off the parking lot to Monarch trailhead beside the highway. Take the dirt road down to a secluded but small area with amazing views of the mountains and Atlin lake. Only room for 1 vehicle, preferably a van or truck.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175199 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
