  <ele>792.2439366361676</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>gravel dump</name>
  <desc>one of several gravel dumps with a largish semilevel gravel parking area along hwy 18 between the west and east blocks of Grasslands NP. Small hedgerow offers a bit of privacy but doesn&#39;t do much to stop the relentless wind. Good for one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175203 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
