  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Eriksdale Park and Campground</name>
  <desc>North of Eriksdale. Access road still had some snow and the place was deserted in early May.  No toilets that I could find though there were several bldgs in the day-use area. Gorgeous prairie sunset. Good for smaller self-contained units. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175204 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
