  <desc>Located at 5783 County Road 41, on the southwest corner of Beaver Lake in Erinsville.  Includes: waterfront parkland, swimming, picnic tables, picnic shelter, dock, playground equipment, toilets, boat launch and two parking spots.  Maintained by the Tamworth and Area Lions Club.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 12:02:10 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/175229 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
