  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac Leamy</name>
  <desc>Free parking and open at night for RV. Beautiful location, quiet in front of the lake. Lac Leamy Parc (Leamy Lake Park) is well-maintained and there are friendly park personnel around. Washrooms at one end of the parking lot along with park offices and a small tavern. Good place to walk or bike around the lake.&#xA;.....&#xA;Stationnement gratuit et ouvert la nuit pour VR. Bel emplacement, tranquille en face du Lac.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176020 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
