  <desc>Brewers district street parking.&#xA;Mix use area, condos, commercial &amp; 9 craft breweries and a cidery within 1-6 min walk. No hassles. Traffic and people until 11+/-. There&#39;s another street option next block. Police station 1 block away.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176026 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
