  <desc>An excellent municipal park with room for tents, RVs and hook ups if you want them. There’s also an overflow area if there isn’t enough room.&#xA;35$ Electric, 20$ for Tent, Online Reservation only, all sites are reservable, no first come first serve anymore.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176038 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
