  <desc>Tap with potable water on the outside of the building (next to exit door). Also has the cheapest gas around, and a nice little grocery store for your basics. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176240 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
