  <ele>34.6</ele>
  <time>2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ravensong Aquatic Centre</name>
  <desc>Ravensong Aquatic Centre is a public pool that offers a hot showers as well as a big pool for lane swimming, hot tub, steam room and infra-red sauna. &#xA;Admission is $6.39 for an Adult.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176244 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
