  <ele>285.3857421875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>La plage Municipale de Lac Sauguay </name>
  <desc>Nice quiet place with a view of the lake. A couple of picnic tables, bathrooms and a shelter. The parking lot is flat and there are not many cars passing by.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176272 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
