  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Information Centre Parking</name>
  <desc>NO Parking between 2am and 7am between December 1 and March 31.&#xA;&#xA;Outside of this ok. Noisy with traffic, but lot was well lit, safe and lots of room.&#xA;&#xA;Opens at 10am daily.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
