 <wpt lat="51.379799" lon="-112.658812">
  <ele>675.3525390625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wayne Community Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice, grassy campground about 200m past the Last Chance Saloon. Picnic tables, firepits, cooking pavilion, pit toilets and a water tap (although it wasn&#39;t turned on while we were here). It costs $20/night so is a better value than camping at the saloon which is $25 for a tent and $35 for an RV. No cellphone coverage but there is free WiFi at the saloon. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176314 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
