  <ele>677.5758056640625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 11:27:09 UTC</time>
  <name>Wayne - </name>
  <desc>lovely spot with a great playground nextdoor&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 11:27:09 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176315 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
