 <wpt lat="50.659310" lon="-121.805440">
  <ele>901.729233792983</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kwotlenemo Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Very nice quiet location away from the main road. Idyll pure, we are all alone. From Fountain Valley we drove directly at the beginning of the lake with our truck camper to one of the five possible places. Very windy. But only a few meters from the lake. Two pit toilets available. Otherwise no infrastructure. Rather not suitable for RVs (narrow, slippery in rain).&#xA;The main campground is at the end of the lake with various well-maintained sites with table and fire pit, restrooms.&#xA;Cost: $15/night, seems to be collected by someone.&#xA;PS: Locals point out the leeches in the lake; no mobile reception.&#xA;&#xA;(My review / view is compared to other places in BC).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176344 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="53.536073" lon="-109.469904">
  <ele>543.3212932219003</ele>
  <time>2022-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paradise Hill Campground</name>
  <desc>Six powered bays. Lots of unpowered space. $15 a night power, $10 a night no power. Toilets and a covered day use area. Some raised BBQ / fire pits.  Beautiful quiet town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176445 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
