 <wpt lat="51.104081" lon="-114.126906">
  <ele>1125.8055419921875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Many Owls Valley Parking lot</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s the parking for the park, the sign says the park itself is closed at night but nothing about the parking or overnight stays. It&#39;s calm, the sound of the car from the Blvd isn&#39;t too loud and you have the hill at the back. As peaceful as you can find in the city. Could be tight for big rig. Running water is seasonal, porta potty present off season.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176461 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
