 <wpt lat="49.019204" lon="-119.403865">
  <ele>605.2335205078125</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Turn-around</name>
  <desc>Nice spot over the city to turn around and go back. Good space for different sizes rigs. Quiet and no real neighbours around to bother you, no sign that says &#39;no parking&#39; and far enough to not hear car noises (maybe except a big truck from time to time but very quiet).&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
