  <ele>197.00494384765625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Town park</name>
  <desc>A nice big field just outside town with plenty of parking space for any size rig, multiple rigs, in a quiet spot close to the road but no traffic and you can park further from it. Good wifi at the parking. No tents allowed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176463 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
