 <wpt lat="53.711230" lon="-114.175017">
  <ele>688.2127685546875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ruth Cust City Park Onoway AB</name>
  <desc>Initially found with the IOverlander GPS. City website listed as a place for travel trailers and or tents for weekend stays. It is a large grassy mowed parcel. Attached is a small City dog park. Spots for over 50 small sites. this park has no amenities, no electricity, no water, no garbage containers, pack in and pack out. no restroom facilities. though a gravel circular drive around the park is available, grassy areas could be soft for larger vehicles and motorhomes during wet conditions.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
