  <name>Stettler Lion&#39;s Campground</name>
  <desc>All stalls are by reservation only.  You must call and book your stall before parking. Payment by Visa &amp; Mastercard or Visa &amp; Mastercard debit only. Stalls must be paid for in full when booking. Check-in is 2pm and check-out is 11am. If you are staying for an extended period of time, you still must pay AHEAD of your stay and reserve or you may lose your stall.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
