  <name>Dairycase Coin Laundromat </name>
  <desc>Now under new ownership. &#xA;7/12 dryers NOT working. Washing machines have grit in them. One change machine not working, the other is empty. The whole place needs a good cleaning. I&#39;ve been here many times and it used to be much better. It appears the new owners are not doing any upkeep.&#xA;Triple load $6&#xA;Dryers 25/4 min. Not all dryers are hot.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-25 14:00:12 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176599 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
