  <ele>736.126308507286</ele>
  <time>2024-02-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pullout with nice view of the lake</name>
  <desc>Spacious pullout right on the side of Monck Park Rd. Quiet spot day and night, very light traffic. Beautiful view of the lake and mountains around. It’s right after a cattle guard, on the right side of the road if heading east. Rogers LTE 4bars. 15-20min drive from town proper. No “no overnight camping” sign. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/176893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
