  <name>Street Parking </name>
  <desc>We were looking for Wifi and found out you can have it while parking in front of the  Ross Memorial Public Library on King Street. The street is quiet with only the occasional car. There are street lights but relatively few near the corner of King and Montague. The Wifi is good . Good for 1 night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177291 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
