  <name>Halls harbor lobster pound parking lot.</name>
  <desc>We came to Halls lobster pound for dinner and asked them if we can park in the parking lot overnight and was approved. I think if you keep a low profile and quiet, it will be OK for one night, customer or not.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177293 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
