 <wpt lat="47.848310" lon="-59.247904">
  <ele>6.76898193359375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Codroy  Valley public library</name>
  <desc>Codroy Valley public library parking lot. You can access the Wifi when you park in front of the library. No password needed. Check for permission to park overnight, and the man who works there said it&#39;s OK. Spend 1 night here. Very quiet, the library has washroom and close at 8 :30 .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177294 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
