  <ele>808.78662109375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Castor Lions Campground </name>
  <desc>Small campground just west of town. Self-registration for $10/night.&#xA;It&#39;s right beside the highway which has a lot of truck traffic but it was quite quiet at night.&#xA;There are clean pit toilets and there is also a cooking shelter. &#xA;Sign says there&#39;s a sani-dump 1 km away.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177308 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
