 <wpt lat="46.148830" lon="-67.578270">
  <ele>37.64279879543044</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Woodstock - Riverside </name>
  <desc>Large gravel parking lot by the river. Quiet place with the added bonus of a superb sunset. Too bad there is a bit of waste. No sign prohibiting staying the night. We stayed 24 hours with no problems. Don&#39;t forget to leave the place clean with no trace of your passage, some people left trash on the ground and there is trash everywhere.  &#xA;.....&#xA;Grand stationnement de gravier au bord de la rivière. Endroit tranquille avec en prime, un superbe coucher de soleil. Dommage qu&#39;il y ait un peu de déchets. Aucune pancarte interdisant de passer la nuit. Nous sommes restés 24 heures sans aucun problème. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177323 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
