  <desc>A launch I stopped at for the night to get some rest. park off to the side to allow use of the boat launch. Not a long term spot, but definitely a nice quiet one!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177335 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
