  <name>Shopping center in Halifax NS</name>
  <desc>This spot is near the CBC Radio Canada location and also near the shopping mall.  It is flat, whereas the Walmart parking lot nearby is sloped.  We had no problems and it was very quiet.  We had 4 bars on T-mobile.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177348 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
