  <name>Irving Oil</name>
  <desc>Irving Oil gas station, restaurant and convenience store with a large parking lot and a large grassy area with picnic tables behind the building. Big rig friendly and I’m sure you could pitch a tent there. Tasty treats at the convenience store! The store staff offered us their bathrooms! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
