  <desc>Campground with pit toilets, potable water, garbage bins. Unserviced sites ($20) and sites with electricity ($35) 15 A. pretty near train line and some road noise but the train doesn&#39;t seem to &#39;honk&#39; here.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177508 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
