  <desc>pool, small hottub and gender sauna for $8, shower is $2. Facility is fairly old, but not bad. the pool is small compare to many other places I&#39;ve been to. Hot tub didn&#39;t seem hot enough, the sauna is very small but it&#39;s gender specific, so not too bad. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177516 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
