  <ele>183.81606674194336</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Naiscoot river Boat launch area</name>
  <desc>As you cross  the bridge over the Naiscoot River on Hwy 69 South. A sharp right  turn, boat launch close to Hwy. We arrived in a long weekend and parked away from the launch area . We are Class B. 2 bars cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
