  <time>2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brûlé campground</name>
  <desc>Large primitive campground.&#xA;Lots of pines and shade.&#xA;Several fire pits.&#xA;Access by a dirt track. &#xA;4WD not required if dry.&#xA;High ground clearance is best.&#xA;4 bars LTE.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177603 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
