 <wpt lat="62.179466" lon="-136.375815">
  <ele>509.62721725925803</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside</name>
  <desc>On our way to another wild camping spot we found this nearly-flat pullout with a perfect view over two lakes. It’s perfect for one car or three cars if you belong together. Although it’s close to the small road, it’s totally quiet. We haven’t seen any other car during the evening. It takes us around 20 minutes from Carmacks. We are happy that we didn’t take one of those gravel spots close to the Highway south’s from Carmacks and found this beautiful spot! We got cellular signal (one bar; Telus). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177606 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
