  <time>2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dead end Northgate </name>
  <desc>This is right outside the riding Mountain national park. It’s a dead end near a big parking lot of the Ukranian heritage village. You have trails at this place as well. Very quite. Don’t know in the summer when the village is open though. &#xA;No sign of no camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177625 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
