  <ele>10.5</ele>
  <time>2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside </name>
  <desc>Room for 4-5 vehicles, some spots are very flat and nicely hidden from the road. Road is not noisy, this spot is a gem and fills up quickly. There are many other little sites along this road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177718 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
