  <ele>101.1</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mont Rigaud Ski Resort</name>
  <desc>The Mont Rigaud ski hill offers 32 vanlife spots during they mountain bike season (May to end of October). Price is cheap, they give access to a shared fire pit, drinking water and toilets. The mountain offers hiking, mountain biking and rock climbing, as well as an obstacle course.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177760 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
