  <ele>10.260573213919997</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Microbrasserie le Garage</name>
  <desc>(excuse my poor english) Nice and cool place to Stay ,we eat well the food is really good and nice présentation and we drink the most good beer in the area .The owner are so kind.They accept any RV behind the restaurant really quiet ,lot of space. Buy good beer or eat and ask the owner or employe and they are happy to welcome you  free,they even plan to instal à dumping station soon. Claude and Maryse Duquette&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177769 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
