  <name>Free Water Filling Station</name>
  <desc>Excellent spot for free potable water! Only for small water jugs, cannot fill camper directly. We used a 20L jug to fill the camper, worked beautifully. &#xA;&#xA;Open all year round. Please check the Napanee website for hours.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/177796 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
