  <ele>646.545654296875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yellow Bridge</name>
  <desc>Smallish clearing underneath the yellow suspension bridge right beside the Red Deer River. Only signage is to take your garbage with you. This is a fishing spot so there were a few people coming and going on weekends. Could fit 3-4 vehicles easily. Dorothy rest stop is a 2 min drive across the highway with outhouses, free wifi &amp; day use fire pits &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178065 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
