  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gooseberry Cove</name>
  <desc>Beach/cliff side primitive camping. &#xA;&#xA;Turn off the paved road and follow signs for “Gooseberry Cove Trail”. Access road is narrow and rough. Accessible by SUVs and vans, anything larger is not advised. &#xA;&#xA;Cellular coverage is available but weak. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178117 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
