  <desc>Bike wash station by the aquatic center / dirt jumps / volleyball courts / hockey rink. &#xA;&#xA;Confirmed it’s town water, just disconnect the garden hose and reconnect when done. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
