 <wpt lat="48.992680" lon="-125.590080">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Westcoast Camp</name>
  <desc>Tent + RV &amp; Car Camping in a parking lot + some forested tent sites. Poke bowls + food truck. Surf shop + rentals. Bathrooms available. Drop in only. No reservations at this time. About 45$ per night for RV but seems there&#39;s nothing official about cost listing.&#xA;&#xA;Website is the surfboard store where the campground is located.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
