 <wpt lat="43.878090" lon="-66.094880">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baileys Bakery</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet spot to spend a night.  Park in the back lot behind restaurant after checking in with the staff.  Great food at very reasonable prices, no reason not to eat something there.  Being Nice to the staff will help a lot.  Very quiet at night, just a bit of road noise. Although maybe not big rig friendly, it certainly is good for C Class rigs and even larger after they are closed for the day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
