 <wpt lat="44.762280" lon="-66.769240">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stanley Beach </name>
  <desc>Parking just next to Stanley Beach, at the end of Stanley Road. No sign indicating camping is not permitted. We asked someone at the Rotary Isle Estate, just next to the parking and she said she did not know about any restriction and that a lot of people had already stayed for the night without any troubles.&#xA;The place is quiet with only a little noise from the road and the harbour. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178517 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
