 <wpt lat="55.177468" lon="-118.825448">
  <ele>676.3101806640625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Great Northern Casino</name>
  <desc>Overnight RV parking welcome in Grande Prairie. Check in with casino with rig details (type, license plate, length of stay).  Arrived today for one night, but saw others on register staying longer. Close to Costco. Best access to parking lot is off 110th street. Easy parking for 40’ MH pulling toad. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
