  <desc>Potable water tap for fill-up at rear of gas station. Just ask the attendant. Open from 6am-10pm. Enter through 48 Ave and turn into Anderson Way. Coordinates will send you across the train tracks.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178553 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
