  <ele>723.3326920330784</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Erie Lake Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Small rest area on the eastbound side of the highway. Room for 3-4 cars, vans or small rigs. No signage limiting duration of stay or prohibiting overnight camping/parking. Traffic was light on the highway after dark so spent a quiet night here. Cellphone signal was OK. Site has vault toilets and trash bins. Will stay here again. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
