  <time>2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parry Camp ground </name>
  <desc>Small pic nic site off highway 6 about 1 hour south of Regina in Saskatchewan. Referred to as a Parry Camp Ground on google maps. Parry, SK S0H 3L0&#xA;Space for 5-6 camper vans , one very clean pit toilet , pick nick table and fire pit   Trees mostly shelter you from the highway .  Poor cell signal&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178813 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
