  <ele>6.587686366401613</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bubbling Sands Beach Lookout </name>
  <desc>Nice open space with some spots overlooking a large sandy beach. Great spot to seat up on a calm night. There is a hiking trail as well as a short walk to the bubbling sands. The spot is in close proximity to graveyard but they kept pretty quiet. Weak 3G cell signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178814 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
