 <wpt lat="44.013483" lon="-80.498263">
  <ele>494.44508669525385</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 09:15:35 UTC</time>
  <name>Picnic area</name>
  <desc>There are no “no overnight parking” signs. I didn’t stay overnight but stopped for lunch. There are 2 porta-potties on site which were very clean and well stocked with toilet paper and hand sanitizer. A couple of trash cans and several picnic tables. It’s right on highway 89 but traffic is usually light, this is not usually a heavily travelled Hwy. Very pleasant spot to stop. I got 2 bars of cell service (Fido (Rogers)).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 09:15:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178889 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
