  <ele>172.26507568359375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 17:49:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White River</name>
  <desc>Gass stop with some camp sites and a general store.&#xA;Slip for boat launch.&#xA;site is on the Indian Reserve, so Gas is generally cheaper.&#xA;We paid 10cents less than in Marthon a few miles back.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 17:49:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178901 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
