 <wpt lat="50.044045" lon="-125.290648">
  <ele>66.74690067116171</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Second quiet layby</name>
  <desc>As the first layby was muddy with the rain we drove further and found this good spot on a gravel parking. Very quiet at night. No « no parking sign » at all. 10 minutes from Campbell River. The price is free! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178905 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
