  <ele>20.4</ele>
  <time>2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Caraquet, big parking lot close to tourism office</name>
  <desc>This space is at the back of a commercial area (Rossy shop is one of them).&#xA;At the entry of Pointe à Brideau Range Rear Lighthouse there is an small sand plaine where you stay at night. nothing to confirm that this a regulated place but no interdiction to stay at night. views are stunning and not many noises from the road  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178926 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
