  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Coal river camp spot </name>
  <desc>This is right off the Alaska Canada highway. You can choice right or left. Great view of the river and sunset. We are in dual sport motorcycles and made it no problem &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178939 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
