  <ele>846.7</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 03:27:32 UTC</time>
  <name>Haines junction camping</name>
  <desc>Just off highway one. Beautiful view of the mountain. About 1/2 km up a dirt road. Plenty of spots. We ride motorcycles and made it with no problem. Bell signal coverage. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 03:27:32 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178940 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
