  <desc>Laundromat with 11 front loader washers, 11 dryers and 11 toploaders. A machine costs $3.00 with $1 coins. Coins are available at the Quincaillerie next door. Parking along the street. Washing quality is good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178965 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
