  <ele>-9.824920654296875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St. Peter&#39;s Catholic Church</name>
  <desc>Beautiful large parking in front of the church. No sign indicating that it is forbidden to spend the night. The road is close by, but there is very little traffic. We slept well.&#xA;.....&#xA;Beau grand parking devant l&#39;église. Aucun panneau indiquant qu&#39;il est interdit de passer la nuit. La route est proche, mais très peu passante. Nous avons bien dormi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178991 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
