  <ele>150.98370361328125</ele>
  <time>2024-04-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Belanger Lake</name>
  <desc>Very busy place during the weekend with locals fishing or swimming and teenagers camping and drinking. &#xA;Beautiful spot during the weekday when it is quiet.&#xA;There is one easy spot for a camper van near the road and water, &#xA;There are 2 more spots great for 4x4 overland rig near the pin (past a big mud hole ).&#xA;&#xA;Keep it cleaner than when you arrived&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/178993 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
