  <desc>Rest area, Washrooms, water, pets allowed, off Highway 20E between km markers 341-342, posted sign 4 hours parking. Stayed overnight with lots of truckers in the lanes provided. Can accommodate large rigs. Woke up to a whole bunch of cars and trucks. Highway quiets down around 9 pm. Slept very good. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
