 <wpt lat="48.605646" lon="-53.067878">
  <ele>69.00004406645894</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>spring water hose</name>
  <desc>We recognized this while driving and noticed locals filling up water jugs. They said it’s good water and everyone uses it. It’s a platform on the side of the road with a garden hose running from a fresh water spring. Suitable to fill water jugs only. We tested the water with our Zero Water tester and it measures at 015 (our city tap water at home measures at 168). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179335 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
