  <ele>3.3302001953125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Municipal de Saint-Simeon</name>
  <desc>Brand new site, on the hill above the municipal campground, beside the lighthouse. Quite close to the highway. Seems to be affiliated with the municipal campground, but it is designated &#34;only for vans or other small camping units maximum 25&#39; - no tents), is for short stays only, and you pay online to go-van.club (detailed signage at site entrance explains things). When we visited, the toilet building was locked but you can use the showers etc. at the municipal camp. Easy walk to restaurant, beach etc, good place to overnight before or after a ferry trip.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179378 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
