 <wpt lat="60.101804" lon="-130.353286">
  <ele>879.597864751479</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lookout with a view </name>
  <desc>This is a lookout area with a trash bin.  There were 5 RVs parked here with us with room for more.  Beautiful view of snowy mountains and a lake surrounded by trees.  On the Alaskan Highway with light road nose overnight.  There were a couple of mosquitoes and flies but not bad, especially since the two spots we stopped at prior to this one and considered staying at had swarms of mosquitoes.  Free&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
