  <ele>446.77781865373254</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest area Fauquier </name>
  <desc>Nice parking in front of the Lake on a rest area. Picnic table, access to lake for boat or paddle. No « No Parking » sign for the night. Not flat everywhere but sure you can do it. Beautiful place, Keep it clean! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
