  <ele>663.4709690032645</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop </name>
  <desc>Road side rest stop, this spot is just adjacent to the northbound lane. It has clean pit toilets, rubbish bins and is a great spot to pull up for the night. As with all roads in these parts the traffic is minimal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179537 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
