  <ele>43.5</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Elephants Head RV park</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay, even with pick-up Trucks. longer rigs may find it difficult because the drive is a bit steep. Special for Bikers when the weather is bad, you can use a cooking shelter with water heater, stove. Firewood available. 25$per night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179557 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
