  <ele>52.873212411545616</ele>
  <time>2023-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petite place boisée </name>
  <desc>From the 132 and you take a small road (not well maintened but ok in a Grand Caravan) for about 300 m and you turn left to this site. &#xA;&#xA;If you continued on the main road, you will see private property, but stay behind that sign and fence. &#xA;&#xA;You can hear the highway (it’s not that bad) but you cannot see it. We weren’t disturbed by anyone. &#xA;&#xA;*They were no trash so keep it that way* &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
