  <ele>737.352783203125</ele>
  <time>2023-10-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>Wild camping on a scenic river.  Take a paved old highway from the newer highway and look for an easy dirt lane to a 2-camper site.  walk the dirt road. it&#39;s 100 meters to the river.  Medium clearance.  Bring fishing gear and firewood.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179717 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
