  <time>2024-04-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area + Truck Park</name>
  <desc>Large rest area, trucks are comming around 10-11pm, which is noisy, but if you park on the very end of the lot, you are reasonably away from the Highway. Most annoying part is that the parking lot is flooded by light from streetlights. But it is new, safe and clean spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179775 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
