  <name>Suds n Duds laundry mat </name>
  <desc>At least some of the machines aren&#39;t working right now, we weren&#39;t able to do our laundry. Open 7 days  9am-9pm. The owners are very sweet.&#xA;Nice place.&#xA;5$ or 6$ Wash&#xA;0.25$/5min dryer&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179780 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
