 <wpt lat="49.942970" lon="-110.043338">
  <ele>750.5216627175329</ele>
  <time>2024-04-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walsh - Save on Gas</name>
  <desc>Walsh gas station. It’s a cheap option to fuel up. It was 30 cents cheaper than any in the area. (Regular was 1,79 CAD when the others were at 2,10 CAD (in 06/2022))&#xA;Its vision is to help travellers to get around cheaper. &#xA;Please support them by also buying something else like a coffee or ice cream. &#xA;Super nice staff. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179781 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
