 <wpt lat="49.205639" lon="-123.132930">
  <ele>12.116661874577403</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ebisu Park</name>
  <desc>Parking on street around the park. It was easy to find a spot for the van. Could fit a bigger rig if space is available.&#xA;Relatively quiet apart from a group of people setting off fireworks in the park. The police came to shut them down and didn&#39;t bother us at all.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
