  <ele>304.09625244140625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Teapot Lake Pull Through </name>
  <desc>Big spot that can fit large trailers. There are two fire pits, a big one and a small one. Right on the lake and there is also an outhouse. The site is a little muddy because people usually ride ATVs around here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179811 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
