  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jaffray Baynes Lake Rd</name>
  <desc>3 to 5 places with firepit near a Creek right next to the street. More for smaller vehicles or RV&#39;s. There is an unshiny little narrow and unpaved road down. You will hear just the (little loud) creek. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179850 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
