  <ele>23.32166511565447</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 23:11:14 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunny Shores Resort, Marina, &amp; Campground</name>
  <desc>RV, Camper, and Tent friendly campground with a few motel rooms as well. Fire pits and picnic tables. Right next to the marina, also has a boat launch and there is fishing supplies shop in the office. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 23:11:14 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179936 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
