 <wpt lat="46.508274" lon="-79.481493">
  <ele>358.8295323876664</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sanddam Road</name>
  <desc>Crown land. Been here for 3 nights and no one’s bothered me. I’m close to the road that leads to the dump (it’s far enough away so you don’t smell it.). Weekdays you do hear the dump trucks going by but it’s quiet by about 4 pm. There are several spots to camp, some nicer then this but I get 1-2 bars of cell here and none further up the road. &#xA;A few ATV trails lead off this area but it’s been quiet, just the occasional one. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179942 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
