 <wpt lat="50.868863" lon="-113.052058">
  <ele>908.8678249424443</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gleichen Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice free campground. Each spot has a fire pit &amp; camping table. There are pit toilets and rubbish bins. A little hard to maneuver a trailer but doable. It’s a clean place. &#xA;It’s right next to the water tower and a police station, so should be very safe. The small town seems pretty quiet. &#xA;Would totally recommend going there!&#xA;Super big rigs might have a problem finding a spot but camper vans and mid-size should both fit easily. Not too far off the highway so minimal noise there. The train runs by every so often.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179951 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="44.687740" lon="-63.242110">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Waterside Area to stop overnight</name>
  <desc>Cute place to stop for the night. Multiple spots available in the area. 4x4 not required, but the gravel/dirt roads were bumpy. Good for any sized vehicle. Not sure if okay for pitching a tent.&#xA;&#xA;No &#34;no camping&#34; or &#34;no parking&#34; signs. No toilets or garbage bins. Great view of the sunset, the moon, and the sunrise!&#xA;Peaceful area, just a couple people walking with their dogs along the beach in the morning.&#xA;&#xA;stay on the main trails, I got stuck trying to back up, I had to call a tow truck which also got stuck&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179952 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
