 <wpt lat="47.279530" lon="-52.831900">
  <ele>4.5</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Laundromat (no name) behind store</name>
  <desc>Nice clean laundromat in the basement and back of the building of the convenience store.  Parking in back. &#xA;The washers are $3 loonies each. The newer looking dryers are $3 (did not use so not sure what amount of drying time that gives ). The older dryers are $1 (4 quarters) for 18 minutes. &#xA;The convenience store made change for quarters and loonies. The washers and dryers worked great. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179957 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
