 <wpt lat="48.602529" lon="-124.228987">
  <ele>49.81488037109375</ele>
  <time>2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lizard dead end</name>
  <desc>Small quiet hidden open and --&gt; DRY &lt;-- room on a dead end of the (not active?) lizard logging road.&#xA;We can hear the road a little bit during the day but very quiet at night.&#xA; I felt good and safe and I slept sooo well here. &#xA;Enjoy, keep clean... et tout le tralala =)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/179971 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
