  <desc>Thank you Wawa for fresh drinking water, filled three of our water jugs!  40C Broadway Avenue, Wawa, Ontario&#xA;&#xA;Water Station inside the community center, in the entrance hall &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
