  <ele>804.88525390625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spruce Grove RV Park and CG</name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;Part of Fairmont Springs Resort.  Cheaper than the main CG at the resort (which has full hookups, but does not allow fires).  No hookups, but decent showers, good WiFi.  A little road noise, but slept fine in my van.  $44 (Canadian) includes entrance to the springs up at the resort.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180033 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
