  <ele>415.0661926269531</ele>
  <time>2024-01-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Johnson Bentley Memorial Aquatic Centre </name>
  <desc>Recreation centre in West Kelowna with pool and showers in the change rooms. $5.10 per person for access to showers, pool, hot tub and sauna. Family change room leads into men’s and woman’s change rooms. Water is luke warm at best and change rooms aren’t the cleanest but works if you can’t drive 20 minutes to the next shower.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180085 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
