  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gaff Point Trail - Camping platform</name>
  <desc>Approximately 2 km into the Gaff Point Trail from the Hirtle Beach parking lot, there is a single camping platform built on an eastern facing cliff. Absolutely stunning ocean views, great open yet sheltered space around the platform.&#xA;Highly recommend for anyone who is willing to hike in with their gear and food.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180161 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
