  <ele>22.4</ele>
  <time>2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lunenburg County Lifestyle Centre</name>
  <desc>$7 for pool and hot-tub, no sauna. Shower is free, just need to sign in at front desk. It&#39;s communal shower, only 1 shower stall is private. It&#39;s not too busy during week day, I don&#39;t know about weekend. Shower doesn&#39;t have a place to put soap though, it&#39;s the only downside. Facility is fairly clean and new. There&#39;s a hook to hang a bag in the shower for your clothes so bring one to change in the stall!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180170 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
