  <name>Marten River CG, Lesser Slave Lake Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful, green, wooded CG. 114 private sites, some with 30a service.  $31 + $8 for electrical.  Vault toilets, trails, playground.  Beach, lakeshore trails.  Moderate mosquitos in June.  Wide open without reservations on a Saturday in June.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180249 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
