 <wpt lat="45.309601" lon="-73.979827">
  <ele>9.5159912109375</ele>
  <time>2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte des Iroquois</name>
  <desc>This rest stop has several picnic tables, two very clean portapotties, garbage and recycling bins. There’s a view of the water on one side and highway 201 on the other. ( it’s only 2 lanes and not very busy at all )There’s some noise from the road but we expect that to calm down as night falls. We have looked around and do not see any signs saying we can’t camp here overnight. It’s a lovely little spot for a night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180370 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
