  <name>Indian brook</name>
  <desc>Small place near the Indian brook. Only accessible by small RV/van (around 6m long, 2,2m large and 2,5m high). This is a nice and quiet place not too far from TCH. This place is only accessible by the south since only ATV can cross the bridge. The place is on the left around 50m before the bridge.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180492 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
