  <desc>Overnight spot in the back of the mall near the park.  Quiet at night but some trucks around 7:00AM.  Slept here one night and there was 2-3 other RVs.  it was quiet during the day as well and we had an afternoon nap at 1530.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180639 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
