  <ele>7.260164986364543</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Anderson Cove</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot on the water! We got this tip from a bartender at Dildo Brewing Co. The road is a bit rough getting in, but perfectly doable with care. Lots of open space to park at this rocky beach. Locals seem to like this place as an evening hangout - so be prepared for some ATV and pickup truck traffic before sunset. Otherwise gorgeous free beachfront boondocking.&#xA;&#xA;Three bars of Bell cellular.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180858 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
