  <desc>A nice place to see the sunrise.  We were all alone and no one came by.  Is a forest road.  Space for max. 2 cars.  you need a 4x4.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/180866 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
