  <ele>10.48448277078569</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Murray Head</name>
  <desc>This is right at the end of the road. Enough place for 1-2 vans but probably nothing bigger. &#xA;&#xA;Quiet but plenty of mosquitos.  Lots of fishing boats roaming around.  Good 4G service on Rogers. &#xA;&#xA;According to the  Public Land Atlas this place is part of a Provincial Forest. &#xA;http://www.gov.pe.ca/photos/original/gis_pubatlas32.pdf&#xA;&#xA;Please clean after yourself and keep this place cleaner than you found it. Let&#39;s preserve such beautiful places. &#xA;&#xA;Stones now present for a firepit and appears to have been used.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181005 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
