  <name>Ontario tourist information in Fort Frances</name>
  <desc>Since Point Park was closed and there&#39;s no other campground close to Fort Frances, we camped with our RV in the parking lot of the recently closed Ontario tourist information in Fort  Frances near the bridge to go across to the USA.  the area is a bit busy but we had a good night of sleep&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 08:28:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181091 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
