 <wpt lat="49.922050" lon="-123.153628">
  <ele>589.6276799207553</ele>
  <time>2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mountain View Pulloff</name>
  <desc>A nice pull off, with fire pit, on logging road. Beautiful views, sunset was very pretty. Not very private as it is right on the road but it is quite a ways up, so we only had a few people drive by on a beautiful Saturday night. Large enough for a van but nothing bigger. It’s a little hard to get level but can be done. Roads up here were not too bad but high clearance is probably best. There are many other pullouts on the way up here, but we felt this one had the best view. LTE and 3 bars of service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
