  <desc>Drive-through station with two sanidumps and both potable and non-potable water. All faucets have a standard 1/2 inch thread so you can use your own hose for the potable water (non-potable water faucets have hoses already).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181159 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
