 <wpt lat="52.950456" lon="-66.918476">
  <ele>552.889111421071</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Water Hose at Labrador City Information Center</name>
  <desc>On the back left side of the building is a hose to fill water. The info center was closed when we arrived (Sunday).  It’s not marked if it’s potable but we tested it with our Zero Water tester and it read 053 (our home tap water reads 168). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181161 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
