  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunset View Campground</name>
  <desc>Cell phone signal isn&#39;t great, but the wifi is great! 30-amp back-in and pull-thru sites available. Great pool! Located on the banks of the Saint John River with an awesome dock for fishing or launching your canoe or kayak from.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181184 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
