 <wpt lat="51.325521" lon="-68.122727">
  <ele>386.2846160409972</ele>
  <time>2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to gas station/restaurant </name>
  <desc>A large truck stop/rest area with gas pumps and diner about half way between Lab City and Baie Comeau. We parked within the falling down fence area across from the gas pumps with two others. Several tractor trailers and a van stayed in other spots in the lot. Looks like you can park anywhere as long as you’re not in the way of the tractor trailers coming in for the evening. Good for an overnight pit stop but there are more scenic places up and down the road. No cell signal at all. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181290 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
