  <desc>Small pull off next to beautiful lake.  Suitable for small travel trailer or vans. The spot is next to a well-maintained logging/quarry road. There is a fire pit that has been used by locals. There are several camping spots in this area. &#xA;Good cell phone signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181364 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
