  <name>Portneuf Natural Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Established campground with only non-serviced sites. $30/night. We stayed in our campervan for 1 night. Quiet and private. Very clean toilet facilities. Sites can only be booked online. See http://parcportneuf.com for details.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181388 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
