 <wpt lat="53.296326" lon="-60.327878">
  <ele>-4.863677978515625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Northern Labrador Chamber of Commerce</name>
  <desc>Parking lot beside the Northern Labrador Chamber of Commerce building.  Follow the information signs to the building off Hamilton River Rd in Happy Valley.&#xA;&#xA;Spoke with the receptionist on the information desk and she advised that they welcome people to stay the night and they also allow the use of their 15amp electrical connections if needed. Nice quiet place for an overnight.  She also advised that Birch Island is also allowed for overnight.  It&#39;s much prettier bur probably busier with people walking dogs and using the walking trails/boardwalks&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181534 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
