  <ele>7.125410028109687</ele>
  <time>2022-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>1st Pond municipal park</name>
  <desc>1km down 2wd dirt road. Gravel parking area by lake with a couple of picnic tables and garbage can. Several pull-ins just big enough for a van or truck camper with brush to offer some privacy just up from lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181542 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
