  <ele>714.172119140625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Lakes Provincial Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice Provincial Campground. Spots in the forest or more sunny and open. Good privacy. Fire pits and tables at each site, free fire wood. Pit toilets. 1 Km from the Hwy 35. Can$ 20.--. Self registration. A short walk to the lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181593 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
