  <ele>184.59737093467265</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bruce Mines Community Campground</name>
  <desc>The Campground has a separate entry but I thought it would be helpful to have a separate point of interest noted for showers as you can pay $5 to use the showers only without camping. Single stall shower in each of the male or female washrooms. Moderate cleanliness. Decent warmth. No time limit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181609 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
