  <ele>198.6</ele>
  <time>2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>path by the river</name>
  <desc>use caution making the turn left off veterans, just south of the bridge by River rd. small turn off, I believe people use the trail for fishing. &#xA;loud with veterans traffic, and occasionally another person, but no one bothered me .  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181622 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
