 <wpt lat="47.611252" lon="-59.200843">
  <ele>23.4010009765625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Service Road</name>
  <desc>Just as you are leaving Port Aux Basques past Grand Bay Road there is a turn off to the Service Road. Trucks park before/after ferry for rest. Two paved, mostly flat spots. Best for Vans, Trailers &amp; RV&#39;s. No signs other than don&#39;t litter. Beautiful views. Great spot for the night before or after the ferry. LTE data here, strong cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181668 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
