  <desc>Day use area with picnic tables, vault toilets, and a water spigot. This day-use area is right after crossing the covered bridge BUT before entering the camping. &#xA;&#xA;You can get fresh water from here. Easier for smaller vehicles as you will need to park on the grass area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181717 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
