  <ele>34.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cornwall Aquatic Centre in Lamoureux Park.</name>
  <desc>We parked in a 21 ft Pleasure Way overnight.  Asked at the Marina and they said people park in another lot behind the Aquatic Centre but it was crowded with cars and had steep slopes.  We parked on the east side of the Aquatic Centre overnight.   No problem.   Used the washroom at the pool.  Could pay to use the pool and showers. Picnic tables on the lawn, lots of trees. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181798 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
