  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cold Lake Provincial Park Campground</name>
  <desc>Wooded, private sites at provincial Park, pit toilets as well as flush toilets, free hot showers. Hiking/biking trails, public beach and  boat launch. Most sites have power...loop E and F are great for big rigs...$40/night with power. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181806 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
