  <desc>There&#39;s a water faucet on the side of the building next to the air-filling station and the washroom. Ask the cashier to use water, they&#39;re easy about it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181807 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
