  <name>Edmundston Truck Stop </name>
  <desc>Check out the website for all of the details. RVs welcome.  WIFI,  Showers ($11.50), laundry,  pet wash/ car wash (a small RV may fit) all types of fuels, business centre, fast food. Walking distance to a grocery store and the casino across the street (which has a restaurant). Easy off the highway. Great place with many amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181817 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
