  <name>Laudromat in Ramada Hotel</name>
  <desc>A laundromat in the building of the Ramada hotel.  Access is through a door on the left side.  There is a parking.  There are about 10 washing machines and 10 dryers.  It&#39;s clean.  You need a card which can be picked up at the hotel reception.  Count $3 for a machine and $2.75 for the dryer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181923 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
