  <desc>$30 per night for unserviced site plus a $3 one off booking fee. &#xA;Stay in designated spots in the carparks of silverstar resort. Nothing flash but don&#39;t forget your mountain bike the tracks are insanely good!&#xA;Showers are free with a $30 key deposit via reception. Male showers are open gym showers. Female showers are private cubical. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/181953 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
