  <desc>Spring water close to the entry of the dock, behind an old trailer.&#xA;The water comes out of a hose and it is collected in a water tank. Pull the hose out, fill your jugs and put the hose back.&#xA;The locals get their water there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182167 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
