  <name>Kasiks Lodge &amp; Campground </name>
  <desc>Lodge and campground. The campground is situated in the trees in 1 loop with 24 nice, large sites with fire ring and table.  No services available yet, but planned according to staff. Hot shower available.&#xA;The campground is on HWY 16 60 km from Terrace to Prince Rupert and close to the train.&#xA;We were the only RV in June 22 on a weekday&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182169 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
