  <desc>Large mostly flat lot at the Margaree Harbour. No signs indicating no overnight parking. Be smart and don&#39;t park blocking any of the docks/wharf. Clean up after yourself &amp; be respectful of the fisher folks.&#xA;Data/cell are reasonable here. Telus or Bell: one bar.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182182 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
