  <desc>Crowsnest Crossing- it’s a huge parking lot with a SHELL GAS, (24/7) CIRCLE K, and TIM HORTONS (5am-10pm). see photo. There is more than enough room for big rigs.  And a bit further east on north side of the road there is a large free parking area  49.61279, -114.44221&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182250 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
