 <wpt lat="49.403245" lon="-57.652612">
  <ele>284.68857701309025</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>South Gros Morne</name>
  <desc>Go west on 431 off 430 and the dirt road will be off to the right. You will pass a small quarry on the right and drive for quite a bit up a dirt path of a road. The road can handle a 4WD vehicle with maybe a small trailer. The site is a fairly large opening in the road to a flat area surrounded by trees and a lot of birds. Did see some Bear scat and Moose poop about 200m down the hill. You are pretty much on top of the hill but no views down but very nice and away from everything. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182282 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
