  <name>Parc Carillon</name>
  <desc>Beautiful place in a Canada&#39;s Park along the riverside. Pit toilet, water and tables are available. Super quiet place and really windy.&#xA;&#xA;Très bel endroit le long de la rive. Toilettes, eau et tables disponibles sur place.  &#xA;Très tranquille et venteux.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182369 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
