  <desc>Very nice informal spot by a lake, tall grass and some trees. No &#34;no parking&#34; signs observed. We parked by the entrance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182370 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
