  <ele>19.001185776665807</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>West Main Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Nice laundromat with 24 washers and 24 dryers.  Machine for change.  Parking not friendly for big rv. Open 6AM to 10PM 7 days a week.  Washer: $2.50 Dryer: $2.00 for 32 minutes.  Each additional quarter adds 4 minutes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
