 <wpt lat="43.648628" lon="-79.895745">
  <ele>223.10607216184744</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Supercentre Georgetown </name>
  <desc>There is a big crowded parking directly in front of Walmart and other Stores, beside Walmart (not sure if it is still from Walmart or a public parking) it&#39;s nearly empty. And it&#39;s quiet. WiFi of Walmart still works and there a no signs, that overnight is not allowed. KFC, Kelsley and other places to grab a nice dinner just around the corner. This Walmart also has a Propane Gas exchange &amp; purchase.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182482 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
