 <wpt lat="46.289921" lon="-78.775611">
  <ele>195.45854674758522</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 09:20:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Lazy Rock Campground</name>
  <desc>Established campground. Very well setup. Nicest bathrooms and showers I&#39;ve seen for a campground. Right on a lake with Wi-Fi, boats to rent, 2 docks (fishing and swimming). Sites are close together, but not bad. We stopped for 2 nights and we&#39;re enjoying it very much.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 09:20:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182485 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
