 <wpt lat="45.660765" lon="-60.874867">
  <ele>3.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lions Club Marina </name>
  <desc>There are 5 shower rooms, 1 big one that has handicap handle and electric outlet. The other 4 rooms do not have electric outlet. The cost for a shower is $5.75. There doesn&#39;t seem to be full time staff or they&#39;re busy. The shower is decently clean but a bit old, very hot water though. You have to go through the office to use the shower and laundry, so if you visit, ask them for the shower. People here seem nice and friendly. &#xA;&#xA;There are 5 washers and 6 dryers. They are 8 quarters each. The wash takes 26 mins and the dry 48 mins.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182493 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
