 <wpt lat="61.035000" lon="-138.496254">
  <ele>797.7906196741387</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kluane Lake Through Road</name>
  <desc>Dirt road right off the highway that goes along the lake. Not too far past Destruction Bay if coming from the north. It can be accessed from north or southbound traffic. Not too far off the highway. Some sections you can see road traffic. Few places along the road to camp for the night along the lake. No facilities. Nice spot to stop for lunch as well. Tent at own risk with past reports of bears in the area. Can be windy as well. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182499 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
