 <wpt lat="45.404894" lon="-78.865321">
  <ele>394.8596496582031</ele>
  <time>2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Abandoned logging Truck</name>
  <desc>The giant fire pit was taken and the other one was to close to the road so we came here. No one seems to be bothered by us. There’s bullet shells and old tires lying around, so not the most picturesque place and lots of mozzies, but very close to the park. There’s space for any type of vehicle here. No amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182538 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
