  <desc>Gravel parking lot next to disc golf course. No &#34;no overnight camping&#34; sign(s). Referred to this spot by a local. Stayed one night with no issues. Full cell service. Very quiet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182562 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
