  <ele>45.31362533569336</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halifax Laundry Co</name>
  <desc>Great clean newer laundromat. ATM and change machine on site. 5 front washers and 4 top load washers, as well as 8 driers. $3 each wash/dry load. Machines accept loonies or quarters only. &#xA;&#xA;Parking is a bit tricky. Might have to pay for street parking, but not very expensive. Coffee shop right beside it!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182615 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
