  <name>Karma Farming</name>
  <desc>Very basic and not cheap. Staff not helpful. Bathrooms are terrible, no mens shower available. Bathroom dirty and wet and small and poorly lit. Grounds are cool. Picked cherries. Stay if needed but won’t be back. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 07:40:31 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182627 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
