  <desc>Tenting, water and power, full service sites. A nice camp shelter with a couple of picnic tables. &#xA;There is also a dump station. &#xA;Bathrooms/showers  are new. &#xA;There is a swimming right next door. You have to pay at the town office. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182628 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
