  <time>2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Au Jardin de Mon Père</name>
  <desc>Campsite rated 5 stars.  They offer all the services.&#xA; Swimming pool 25 people maximum.&#xA; Watch out for theft because I had a BBQ propane gas hose stolen.&#xA;&#xA; Friendly staff.  Clean website.  Free activities for children.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
