  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Shoal Harbour Lookout Trail</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot at the entrance to the Shoal Harbour Lookout trail. Enough space to fit my 24’ RV. Probably the max length. Room for 4 vehicles total. Level ground. Quiet. Few dog walkers in the evening but no traffic through the night.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182667 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
