  <desc>Non-guests can use the laundry here. Change and tokens are available in the office. &#xA;&#xA;Eight washing machines and six dryers. &#xA;&#xA;8am to 9pm, according to the sign on the door. Last load at 7pm&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182720 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
