  <ele>1295.8</ele>
  <time>2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>cell-tower</name>
  <desc>Not a bad spot at the end of the road. No services but a great view to the mountains and over the &#xA;city. The road up here is not maintained and a little bit bumpy but doable with 2wd, take it slow. Not&#xA; recommend for big rigs with low&#xA; clearance. The antenna-station make a&#xA; little sound but not really bad. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182728 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
