  <ele>1029.6209716796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riley Park outdoor Pool</name>
  <desc>*Seasonal.&#xA;....&#xA;Went there on a hot summer day when the pool was open. Open to public from 9am-9pm. only during summer&#xA;It&#39;s a small pool for children. The showers are outside of the building around the corner, so no privacy -&gt; but they are FREE. &#xA;There are also changing rooms and washrooms. You can park for free in front of the entrance for 3h. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182733 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
