 <wpt lat="48.448233" lon="-124.140820">
  <ele>126.10065659918223</ele>
  <time>2024-03-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Skyterrace </name>
  <desc>Gravel place down a gravel road, looks like it can get busy in summer. There are a few fire pits. &#xA;It was the nicest place I have slept in the last 2 months. &#xA;No amenities and bins, so take what you brought. &#xA;&#xA;Not suitable for big rigs. Not sure if there are good places for tents. Normal cars however do fit perfectly and can find a relatively level spot. &#xA;No Canadian phone service it’s from the USA. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
