  <name>Yukon Community Services </name>
  <desc>Fresh water available near the garage door for free (compliments of the Yukon Community). The water is potable, but not treated in the same way as commercial dispensers: it tastes differently (probably because there is no reverse osmosis filter used).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
