 <wpt lat="49.472630" lon="-57.920160">
  <ele>1.8</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Water&#39;s Edge</name>
  <desc>Campground, suites and tiny cabins right next to a lighthouse and overlooking Bonne Bay. Super friendly campground owners and best place we have stayed yet.  They have regular serviced sites for cheapest rates we have seen, but owner has made an overflow area for overlanders for just $20. They have a small shop there for supplies and you can rent kayaks or go on boat tours from there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
