 <wpt lat="45.294020" lon="-66.072110">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Witness Wellness and Massage Clinic</name>
  <desc>I&#39;m offering parking by our home and business, Witness Wellness and Massage Clinic.  &#xA;&#xA;Our place is open for nomads, travellers, van lifers, and anyone with a permanent address but we&#39;re unable to host homeless people living out of a sedan.&#xA;&#xA;We prefer non-smokers but everyone has vices.  Don&#39;t leave litter, cigarette butts, or dog poop on the property.  Also, no drugs or pot.&#xA;&#xA;*** You MUST call, text, signal and have confirmation before parking for the night at 506-688-6110.  We also host on other platforms like, Harvest Hosts and need to ensure we have space.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182763 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
