  <desc>* Seasonal Closures.&#xA;&#xA;Established campground in Glacier National Park. 20 sites. Self register — $23 CAD and $9 more for fire permit. Flush toilets and sinks for dish washing. Beautiful views of the surrounding mountains. Got here in the afternoon on July 9 and most spots were open. Good number of mosquitos but not horrible. Bear country - so be prepared. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/182846 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
