  <time>2024-04-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old road above river</name>
  <desc>A beautiful spot surrounded by trees and river sounds. Very quiet off of highway 1, near hells gate. Right after the tunnel there’s a pull out and the road starts there. It’s full off grass and daisies but pretty tight, we backed in with our Chevy and made it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183034 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
