  <name>Camping St Félicien </name>
  <desc>4 star campsite. Average wifi, very clean campsite. Activities, swimming pool, canteen, volleyball, baseball, basketball, tennis. Very large plot. All the services. Next to St Félicien Zoo&#xA;---&#xA;Camping 4 étoiles. Wifi moyen, camping très propre. Activités, piscine, cantine, volley-ball, baseball, basketball, tennis. Terrain très grand. Tous les services. À côté du Zoo de St Félicien &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183071 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
