  <name>PEKA - RV/Trailer parts and service</name>
  <desc>Trailer parts and service centers are rare in the province - this place is tiny but has hundreds of parts and supplies for travel trailers and RV&#39;s. Propane fittings, latches, seals, gate valves, toilets, springs etc. &#xA;&#xA;If something broke on the road and you need to fix it, this is a good place to try.&#xA;&#xA;245 Main Highway, Dyer Building, Bay Roberts&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183248 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
