  <name>Northern Adventure Ferry - Haida Gwaii</name>
  <desc>Showers on the ferry that links Prince Rupert with Haida Gwaii. $2 for 10 minutes (although I think it ran longer- I turned it off myself rather than it cutting off). Coin machine takes loonies. Private shower, toilet, changing area&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183303 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
