 <wpt lat="46.231437" lon="-60.346977">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Groves Point Park</name>
  <desc>*Overnight parking/camping is NOT permitted at this location.&#xA;&#xA;*Not open for camping/tent. Parks Canada.&#xA;&#xA;Very beautiful park by the Bras D&#39;or lake. It&#39;s super quiet here at night, very peaceful falling asleep with the waves. It&#39;s not too busy in the morning but it picks up in the afternoon. There are pit toilets and change room. No sign for no overnight parking or camping. Gates didn&#39;t close at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183306 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
