 <wpt lat="45.954547" lon="-66.647486">
  <ele>92.5</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>“Norge”- Laundromat, dry cleaning, seamstress</name>
  <desc>Great service and long hours. They have large and small washers and large dryers. Small washers are only $2, their large washers can do extra wash loads and dryers are pretty quick. The seamstress is great! You can drop off everything or do it yourself, there is free wifi and a washroom. It is across from the YMCA if you need to grab a shower ($11.50 day pass). There is a pizza place in the same building as the laundromat as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183442 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
