 <wpt lat="51.096208" lon="-114.144074">
  <ele>1462.0036332158838</ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart, Varsity</name>
  <desc>We stayed here for 4 nights with no issues.&#xA;Toilets at the rear of the store but no water fountain in there.&#xA;We visited the Nose Hill Library nearby where they let us fill with water from the spigot outside their entrance.&#xA;We also used the showers nearby at the Winston Churchill Aquatic &amp; Recreation Centre where swimming pool, hot tub, showers &amp; all day entry was CAD$8.30&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
