  <ele>-6.541107177734375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pullout</name>
  <desc>Number of pullouts along highway, this is large paved one with open views of mountains and access to river. Good cell service. No signs, spent one night alone no issues. No services but pit toilet and trash right down road at rest area. Minimal road noise at night, train passes a couple times.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183539 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
