  <ele>7.818216565065086</ele>
  <time>2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wildlife viewing on Cemetary rd</name>
  <desc>small parking lot with garbage can and pit toilet. 1 min walk to wildlife viewing platform. Another trail that goes through the woods for about 15 mins. A few ppl come to walk their dogs. Other than that pretty quiet. Better cell and data service than down by the cemetary. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
