 <wpt lat="46.298205" lon="-83.771686">
  <ele>163.4404296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bruce Mines Trailhead</name>
  <desc>In an area where rest stops seem to be lacking, this worked to pull in at night. Not going to be a long term camp area but if you need a nap in this part of the world this works! No facilities, and a very small gravel patch. If you stop at the picnic table sign (coming from Sault Ste Marie) you could use the toilet before getting here. I&#39;m SO grateful I was able to nap here, very dark and very quiet. I have cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183609 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
