 <wpt lat="46.676346" lon="-64.715216">
  <ele>8.859957396052778</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cap Lumiere </name>
  <desc>At the end of road - be prepared for a big sand pit in the middle! Only suitable for small SUVs (Honda Element for reference) and you can safely back into a  small parking area at a beach. Hidden from all the houses by bush. I&#39;ve seen a couple of tents pitched on the beach even! saw someone had figured out a road further down from here with their vehicle when I walked the beach - so could be other options in the area, but I didn&#39;t see a road on maps. have fun! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
