  <ele>886.9653245466436</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moose View</name>
  <desc>Nice place by the lake with a firepit.&#xA;Only one space but also for big rig.&#xA;Quiet and you can see mooses on the other side of the lake!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/183629 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
