  <desc>open area on beach. Sand a grassy area perfect to fit a few vehicles, could even set up a tent. Lots of garbage here when we arrived but cleaned up the area. We had a nice fire on the beach, and lots of sea glass to be found. Very quiet overnight&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184101 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
