  <ele>10.499383145661701</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Library Parking</name>
  <desc>Legal camping spot downton !&#xA;You can stay here for the night for free until 8 am.&#xA;There are public bathrooms.&#xA;It is near a road so a bit noisy but quiet during the night.&#xA;A policeman came in the morning to say hi but we did not have any trouble. We sleep in our car.&#xA;Maybe not too suitable for RVs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
