  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Phinetta Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Established camping site on a small lake beside Hwy 24. Two lakeside sites well separated from each other. Ours had a fishing dock and picnic table. How awesome is that!? &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184220 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
