  <ele>5.544255110435188</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Visitor Information Center</name>
  <desc>Great Location. We spent 2 nights here and asked permission to stay.  First night, we had another semi with us.  FREE WI-FI and picnic tables.  Quiet spot at night.  Great food at the harbour across from here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184222 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
