  <ele>112.1</ele>
  <time>2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping au bord de la rivière </name>
  <desc>This is a regular camping BUT the owner is just completing the work to adapt his parking lot for boondockers. Spaces are then available just for one night without any service but the wifi at 20$/night. And no need to reserve in advance. The detail infos is given for the parking lot not for the regular camping&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184260 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
