  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailhead to Candle Creek Mountain Bike &amp; Hiking Trails</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet spot at mountain bike/cross country ski trail head.  4 km off of Hwy 5 on Candle Creek Rd.  Road dead ends at the trail head. Part of the Wells Gray Provincial Park.    The visitor center in Clearwater said camping was available here for $15 Canadian but there’s no signage indicating that.  The Wells Gray brochure has a page with map of trails that indicates donations for Wells Gray Outdoors Club are accepted so I think I’ll do that.  Biking/ski trails for all abilities. The area seems well maintained.  There’s a pit toilet.  And one bar of cell service.  I used my Starlink for internet and it rocked!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184354 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
