 <wpt lat="45.851060" lon="-66.478528">
  <ele>16.144198852591217</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Douglas Hazen Centre</name>
  <desc>We were staying for the night at the other lovely place 300 m north in the Sir Douglas Hazen Park (near the baseball field) when the police came at 11 pm to ask us to move because camping is not allowed inside the park and near the marina. They told us that we were allowed to sleep in this parking lot outside of the park. &#xA;So here we are! It’s a very quiet parking lot with no sign. OK for one night on the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184481 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
