  <desc>We did not spend the night here, but it is a free public parking lot next to the river trail and close to the pedestrian bridge that crosses the river to downtown. There are no signs with any parking restrictions. There&#39;s a nice restaurant plaza with public washrooms next door.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184565 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
