 <wpt lat="53.130184" lon="-117.771210">
  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miette Hot Spring Showers </name>
  <desc>To enter the hot springs is $7.75. Once inside they have public showers that you must use before going into the hot springs (soap on the wall). You can also soak in the hot and cold pools, but be aware they look just like regular swimming pools and get CROWDED. There&#39;s also a water fountain inside so bring your bottle :-) &#xA;Overall the price was worth it for me, especially after hiking sulphur skyline!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184706 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
