  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Belly Acres Motorcycle Campground</name>
  <desc>We can be found in Facebook and Google Maps&#xA;A small Campground that welcomes tenting Motorcycles, bicyclists, vans and self-contained camper trailers and Motorhomes.&#xA;BBQ’s up topside and Communal Firepit.&#xA;“Belly Treats”, Hard Ice Cream treats, also the Check-In Office. Ring Doorbell after 8pm. Open 12 noon to 8pm&#xA;&#xA;Facebook group page: Belly Acres Motorcycle Campground&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184778 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
