  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grebe&#39;s Nest</name>
  <desc>A single lane dirt / tilted rock road leads to the cliff edge. In 2022 an area was flattened at the end of the road for a few trailers to park.&#xA;&#xA;A somewhat dangerous walk down to the beach leads to a blasted tunnel that links to another beach. These beaches are made of stones and have rock walls extending out into the ocean.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
