  <name>Town park</name>
  <desc>Little park in town,  i pass the night here, calm at night. I saw only 1 local passing. More sound in the morning because People go to work but still a good place to stay.  Table, garbage and grass.&#xA;&#xA;Petit parc tranquille dans le village. Je n&#39;ai vue qu&#39;un résident passer par ici. Très tranquille durant la nuit, un peu plus de bruit le matin. Il y a du gazon des tables poubelles et des bancs&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-02-19 22:48:04 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184944 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
