  <time>2023-09-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camp Tamarack RV Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Campsites with water and electricity but now sewer service. The property it very well maintained. It is pet friendly and has a tiny dog walk area however I usually leave for a walk down the road. The Bathrooms, Shared Showers, and Laundry are all cleaned daily and again very well maintained. There is a little park to play horse shoes and a swing set for the kids. It&#39;s just off Hwy 40 and early to get to.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184973 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
