  <desc>Park facilities include 15 sites and four tents sites, picnic tables, barbecue pits, kitchen shelter and toilets. Day use area close to Campbell lake with Gravel beach access. Nice location with camping site lake overview. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/184991 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
