  <name>Yukon River, Policeman’s point Road. </name>
  <desc>A nice impromptu camp spot for the night. Just North of Whitehorse (Yukon Territory), just off the Klondike Highway , overlooking the Yukon River, and the Mount Slim, and Mount Laurier. Accessibility would be 4 wheel drive, as the trail deteriorates, and would not be recommended in wet conditions. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185061 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
