  <name>Heart of the Wooden </name>
  <desc>Welcome respectful and weary travelers. &#xA;&#xA;My land is open for tent camping and is a safe place to park. &#xA;&#xA;I am in travel healthcare for half the year and the other half is spent here - slowly developing a yoga retreat center and camping hostel. &#xA;&#xA;If I am here when you visit I can provide a hot outdoor shower. Outhouse is open year round.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;heartofthewoods.ca@gmail.com&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185102 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
