  <name>Neville&#39;s hairstyling and laundramat</name>
  <desc>Nice laundramat with many machines in good shape.  $3 per wash and $3 to dry. &#xA;also huge washer at 6.50 per load. &#xA;Change machine on site. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185120 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
