  <ele>51.59053877927363</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paradise Acres Ranch</name>
  <desc>Ranch offering campsites as well as serviced RV sites. The website is a little deceiving for the tent sites—I was camping right beside the lodge, paddocks, and main driveway. Not private, but fine for a night. Booked online on the day we arrived for $30 CAD. No fire pit. But a nice washroom and shower on site. Nice to be surrounded by horses.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185213 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
