  <ele>737.9207763865352</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:24:29 UTC</time>
  <name>Alaska Highway Rest Stop </name>
  <desc>Alaska Highway Rest Stop near Nugget City. Large rest stop, entrance/exit at both ends, clean pit toilets, big rig friendly. No signs indicating no camping or overnight parking. An RV and two shipping trucks spent the night as well. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:24:29 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185216 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
