  <desc>A private campground in Tuktoyaktuk, $25 per night for vehicle, $15 for tent.  Good alternative if you don&#39;t want to spend the $60 plus tax at municipal campground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185224 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
