  <desc>Today this gas (205.9) was cheaper than Stweart crossing (209.9). It has a 24 hrs card reader and trash cans but no windshield washing. It is the last station before heading to Keno city. Don&#39;t miss Keno hill (if your rig can make it), it is amazing!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185226 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
