  <ele>302.59874685723287</ele>
  <time>2022-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Panorama Park</name>
  <desc>Very small park, with some picnic tables and 2 outhouses. A &#39;lookout point&#39; over the town of Minden, but trees obscure the view. A short but quite steep and curvy road leads to the park, perhaps not suitable for large rig. A few flat spots for parking. PARK ONLY OPEN FROM MAY 15 - OCT 31. May be a hangout spot for local teens on the weekend.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185408 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
