 <wpt lat="48.426824" lon="-124.058183">
  <ele>41.15966796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Ledge Tent Campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice, new campground for tents only, with a very friendly owner. All sites are first-come-first-serve and have picnic tables and fire pit, some also have ocean view. Firewood is included in $30/night fee (must be paid in cash). There&#39;s a construction-site toilet,  drinking water from a hose, and you can buy ice.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
