 <wpt lat="48.565190" lon="-53.338827">
  <ele>5.88653564453125</ele>
  <time>2022-10-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gerald S. Doyle Memorial Museum</name>
  <desc>Museum looks like its currently being renovated/closed but we stayed the night with no issues. Flat spot with running brook beside. A couple locals came down to the spot to fish and let their dogs swim. We set up our tent here, but there is enough space for vans, trailers and RVs. Picnic tables, outlets, and garbage can for use.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185445 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
