  <ele>262.3638120163232</ele>
  <time>2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sandy Falls</name>
  <desc>Quiet spot by the water. Evidence of parties, trash. But I lucked out, you might too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
