 <wpt lat="48.482223" lon="-81.312944">
  <ele>310.7989951726049</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gillies Lake parking lot</name>
  <desc>Not quiet, next to hwy 655 but no signs indicating you can’t park overnight. Lights in parking, felt safe. Great view and walk around the lake, 2.4 km. Another parking on South side of lake with washrooms and chip stand but way busier.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185475 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
