  <ele>1003.1</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cardston Pool</name>
  <desc>Local recreation center with a pool and showers. $6 for using the pool+shower or $3 if you only want to use the shower. Accepts US and Canadian currency. Showers are communal, not private, and you&#39;ll be sharing the space with a lot of families in the summer. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185482 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
