  <ele>1048.1206291311012</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Pullout</name>
  <desc>This is a spot in an industrial area next to some train tracks, it’s well-lit by nearby street lamps.&#xA;Saw a couple other campers while I was there.&#xA;There is great cell phone service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185484 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
