 <wpt lat="49.713005" lon="-123.079487">
  <ele>263.0545654296875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Side of FSR</name>
  <desc>Decent spot on side of the road. A bit of a downward slope.   Nice view of the mountains.  Perfect starlink connection.  I went a bit further up the road before settling on this spot- didn&#39;t find anything I liked that I could access in my 2wd promaster.  Occasional vehicles but almost nothing after dark.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185486 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
