 <wpt lat="43.728243" lon="-81.694364">
  <ele>141.3</ele>
  <time>2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Square Brew Brewery</name>
  <desc>Industrial type area near center of town. The employee was very welcoming. I called in advance. There are tree lined spots behind brewery patio, Trails through the forest are start there. We could hear live music from down the beach area. Very quiet site after 7pm closing of Brewery. We also had a food truck there. This is a beautiful Beach front town. There are free dumping stations at several nearby small town. We dumped in Clinton 15 min away.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185501 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
