 <wpt lat="46.360859" lon="-62.528505">
  <ele>44.19599858572805</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailhead parking lot </name>
  <desc>Had a relaxing night sleeping in my car next to a small pond. This was a small parking lot that intersects a trail and is also a boat launch. Could fit a couple smaller vehicles or tents, wouldn’t recommend anything bigger than a van. Also, if you have time check out the observation platform on the trail. Bad cell service but you get a little bit. Didn’t see anyone the whole night. And don’t drive further than this parking lot, the road gets horrible. Please don’t litter. Enjoy!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185523 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
