  <ele>37.9</ele>
  <time>2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blackhead</name>
  <desc>Parking at the Blackhead path. Sheltered from the wind because it is surrounded by trees. A few places, no signs, close to the ocean with nice view.&#xA;There is a spot for tents down the road on a shoulder that overlooks the bay.&#xA;No toilets.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185530 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
