  <ele>813.6494462320876</ele>
  <time>2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Open field </name>
  <desc>Next to a trail head. There is a port a potty. There is cell phone service. Pretty quiet except for the train passing by from time to time. Excellent stargazing spot (lots of mosquitoes though)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185535 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
