  <ele>259.3299217224121</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fielding Park</name>
  <desc>This is a city green space. Easy to park overnight for any size RV. Beautiful gardens, kids play area, 9km hiking trail along the river. Wasn’t too noisy from the road traffic. We stayed one night no problem. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
