  <desc>Free public parking near the road and railway but very quiet. It’s public parking - 72 hours free - and no « no overnight » signs. Ten minutes from the Elk National Park.  Perfect for one night near the park. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185615 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
