  <desc>Day use park. Free clean hot showers and fresh water at bathroom area. There is also a trailer park on a separate well system with a dumping station. If you ask nicely they will probably let you use but they are separate from provincial park day use area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185630 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
