  <ele>841.4788411334157</ele>
  <time>2022-09-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Logging Road: Near Quarry Lake</name>
  <desc>This is just off the well maintained quarry road on a logging road. Small fire pit, far enough off the quarry road that there is some privacy. High clearance vehicle required. Ample dry firewood available &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
