 <wpt lat="50.215580" lon="-122.889969">
  <ele>538.8765869140625</ele>
  <time>2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>clearing off of FS road</name>
  <desc>Nice clearing on a side road from main FS road.  Flat although not completely level.  Fire rings.  Beautiful views of surrounding mountains.  You can hear the highway but can&#39;t see it.  There is some ATT(Rogers?) signal, and Starlink works with occasional blockages.  There is also another site a bit further down this path, but maybe 4wd needed for that one.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185653 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
