 <wpt lat="60.001000" lon="-116.981300">
  <ele>162.3</ele>
  <time>2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sixtieth Parallel Territorial Park and Visitor&#39;s Centre</name>
  <desc>Really nice visitor center and information offering free coffee. Large parking areas with available washrooms. Will allow overnight parking in their lot. There is also a campground there called 60th parallel camping adjacent to the visitor information centre, the 60th Parallel Territorial Park has a small campground (with 7 campsites) and a scenic picnic area overlooking the beautiful Hay River.&#xA;The campground/ park has 7 non-powered campsites.&#xA;A play area in front of the visitor center and a separate area for the dogs. Super nice people with a wealth of information about the area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185654 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
