  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Centre Des Foires de Sherbrooke</name>
  <desc>Large car park ideal for all sizes of RV.&#xA;Park at the bottom near the wooded area, it&#39;s very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Français&#xA;Grand stationnement ideal pour toutes grandeurs de VR.&#xA;stationner au fond pres du boisé  , c&#39;est tres tranquille.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
