  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>RV Parking Val Des Sources</name>
  <desc>Superb RV  stopover with an incredible view of the mining pit in the Asbestos region&#xA;Maximum 30&#39;, 2 nights maximum with proof of purchase from a Val Des Sources business&#xA;.....&#xA;Français&#xA;Superbe halte Vr avecvue incroyable sur le puits minier de la région d&#39;Asbestos&#xA;maximum 30, 2 nuits maximum avec preuve d&#39;achats d&#39;un commerce de Val Des Sources&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185679 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
