 <wpt lat="45.406342" lon="-64.022246">
  <ele>60.2810382802017</ele>
  <time>2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Picknick area close to Five Island Park</name>
  <desc>Due to the season the park was still closed so we found that little pull out on the road to the park. Maps.me said that it is a picknick area but there is no table. Very quiet because only a few people come here for hiking due to the season. But hikes are very nice. No no-camping signs. Nice place. We saw deers in the dawn.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185681 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
