  <name>ETX Dempster Quarry</name>
  <desc>A pleasant quarry on the left side going north. It’s reasonably flat and as we were tired we camped here in our 6x6 Expedition Truck&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185717 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
