 <wpt lat="49.233370" lon="-124.041530">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marlin Way, Nanaimo BC</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking on the side of Marlin Way in Nanaimo BC, right behind &#34;The Brick&#34; furniture store. You can park inline with all the semi trailers and box trucks. This is great for overnight parking, just a block away from Costco. Do not box in any of the trucks or trailers, or you could get a knock on the door asking you to move. Give these commercial trucks space. There are no services there. Not sure about free WiFi, however. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185719 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
