 <wpt lat="49.196890" lon="-123.982580">
  <ele>93.73065185546875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 06:59:53 UTC</time>
  <name>McCullough Road, Nanaimo BC (Northfield Industrial Park)</name>
  <desc>There is gravel parking parallel to McCullough Road in Nanaimo BC. You can park along side of the big rig semi trucks and cube vans. Truckers sometimes stay the night here. Do not box in any trucks, or you could get a knock on the door asking you to move. Give these commercial trucks space. This area is called &#34;Northfield Industrial Park&#34;. Many of the streets in this industrial area are great for overnight parking. Most of the shops in this industrial park area close at 5:00 PM and open again at 8:00 AM. Keep it clean and neat. Enjoy your stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 06:59:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185729 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
