 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.660563" lon="-54.729149">
  <ele>25.59326171875</ele>
  <time>2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dump Road Pulloff/Pond Access</name>
  <desc>A large gravel pulloff &amp; pond access on the side of Dump Road, which is a dirt road to a trailhead. It is suitable for 2 or 3 campervans or pickup campers doing an overnight stay.  Large RVs or trailers would block access to the pond which would be inappropriate.  This is a nice sheltered spot in what tends to be a very windy area.  No amenities, yet there is weak cellular and all the conveniences of town are right around the corner.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185747 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
