  <name>Side of the road, good view of Confederation Bridge </name>
  <desc>Parking on the side of the road on the way to the lighthouse, a few other rigs here. Space for larger trucks and it’s a nice view&#xA;&#xA;Free parking &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 09:40:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185763 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
