 <wpt lat="48.586437" lon="-71.666765">
  <ele>102.49187807683167</ele>
  <time>2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking en face du camping dam en terre</name>
  <desc>Moderator note: Previous users have noted problems with this site.  Please see comments. Use with caution&#xA;&#xA;Its a parking free near of camping base plein air dam en terre. Access to the campsite beach on foot. We also took advantage of the campsite facilities, took a shower, washed our clothes and had a snack. Then we spent the night in the free parking lot in front of the outdoor base. &#xA;---&#xA;Its a parking free near of camping base plein air dam en terre . Acces a la plage du camping a pied . Nous avons aussi profité des installation du camping , pris une douche , laver nos vêtements et manger a les casse croute.ensuite  on passé la nuit dans le stationnement gratuit en face de la base plein air&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185765 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
