  <desc>Quiet parking , between the church . No indication for the night  Formerly village squirrels. auditorium in the old sapristi of the church. 5a7 on the balcony of the church. Really friendly people, Come in for a coffee to encourage the lovely place&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185766 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
