  <ele>185.8000518195331</ele>
  <time>2023-01-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marineland parking</name>
  <desc>Marineland parking is good place for park your RV. I was in Marineland with my children and stayed overnight in Parking. It is very quiet and very nice for sleeping. Staff are very lovely. Today again we are going ro enjoy in Marineleand. You can use washrooms during a day 10am-8 pm and restaurant also in Marineland. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185773 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
