  <ele>395.3681640625</ele>
  <time>2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sand pit near cedar lake boat launch</name>
  <desc>When taking the cedar lake boat launch road, head to the right and there is a sand pit. Fairly Quiet, it looks like people drive ATV’s in it but we didn’t see any.  You can hear the traffic on hwy 105 but there isn’t much. Recommend 4x4. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185779 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
