  <ele>785.439297772944</ele>
  <time>2022-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Across road overlooking lake </name>
  <desc>Off road but good condition. Not super level but decent.  In minivan.  A little cell signal Verizon.  Overlooks lake from above.  Quiet.  No one else here.  Very pretty and secluded. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185780 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
