  <name>Next to Stream</name>
  <desc>I stayed here one night without any issues.  It was quiet and I felt safe.  There is a sign that allows parking.  It&#39;s across from a school so probably best to avoid school days.  I stayed on a Saturday night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185787 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
