  <desc>Parking lot for Headlands and Economy Trailheads. No &#34;no parking&#34; signs. Approximately 4 km off Rt 2. Trees surround the lot, but the bay is a short walk down the trail. Barely any internet. Few hikers during the day but quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
