 <wpt lat="44.646461" lon="-63.582278">
  <ele>49.308911975473166</ele>
  <time>2024-04-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Indigo Garrison Grounds Lot</name>
  <desc>A paid parking site that is open nights and weekends. We paid $16 for a 24 hour pass for our truck/5th wheel setup! Great spot to explore Halifax from. &#xA;The city offers free parking on the roads on weekends so the parking lot was empty and quiet for our Saturday night stay (the harbour lots were packed and had a lot going on there so we were happy we chose this spot). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185844 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
