 <wpt lat="49.204920" lon="-124.010460">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2022-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shenton Road, Nanaimo BC</name>
  <desc>Overnight parking is available on shenton road. Look for the old &#34;Gold Silver Guy&#34; cube van. It&#39;s been parked there for years and never moves. You can park close to that cube van in that general area. This is a light industrial area. The shops in this industrial area close at 5 00 PM and open again at 8 00 AM. Not too noisy, but it is beside a highway. This is basically a gravel lot beside shenton road. Nothing fancy, but you can get through the night there. Keep it clean and neat. Enjoy your stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185864 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
