  <time>2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nipigon river bridge</name>
  <desc>Very nice spot. Sound of the river all night, a music ! Two bridges , on the road under the bridge, right on the shore of the river. Little gravel road.  : road and railway. No noise. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185867 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
