 <wpt lat="53.103476" lon="-121.565850">
  <ele>1189.5589599609375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old Campground</name>
  <desc>Old abandoned campground right in lower Wells.&#xA;The locals don&#39;t mind people staying there, as long as you&#39;re not too loud or disruptive. &#xA;Right behind police station and ambulance. &#xA;Pretty close to the Barkerville Highway but not too loud. No pit toilets or water but right beside the Jack O Clubs general store. &#xA;Electrical outlets don&#39;t seem to work. &#xA;Facing Slide Mountain and the Meadow this is a beautiful little spot for travelers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185892 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
