 <wpt lat="54.289307" lon="-130.360687">
  <ele>32.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>showers on the ferry</name>
  <desc>On the Prince Rupert - Port Hardy route, the shower costs 5$, with no time limit, and a towel included. On the ferry to Haida Gwaii, it costs 1$/3 min., 2$/10 min, towel additional 2.5$. Don&#39;t know about other routes, but surely there are some as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185902 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
