  <ele>24.9</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St Luke’s Presbyterian church </name>
  <desc>There is a wide grassy area behind this closed/abandoned church, that is hidden from the road. A neighbour confirmed no-one comes around there anymore.&#xA;So I pitched my tent for the night while on a bike trip.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185928 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
