  <ele>104.593994140625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Notre Dame Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Very nice and pretty Provincial Park. Has all the amenities which makes it easy and affordable to refresh and prepare for another round of boondocking. Staff are very helpful and efficient.  Facilities are very clean.    Both cellular and wifi are available.  Laundry is 2 cold water washers and 2 dryers.  Unfortunately the water is not potable.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
