  <ele>155.03757909516816</ele>
  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Few Little spot by the road </name>
  <desc>Small spot on the side of the road, relatively flat. It has 2-3 like that along the road, otherwise it has a big parking lot where it looked like it had some rv, further up the road. I pick up 1 network bar. Please keep clean &#xA;--------&#xA;Petit spot sur le bord de la route, relativement plat.  Il en a 2-3 comme ca le long de la route, sinon il a un gros parking où il semblait avoir quelque vr, plus haut sur la route. Je capte 1barre de reseau. Merci de rester propre &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185931 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
