  <ele>6.011077880859375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parrsboro Town Center </name>
  <desc>After a futile search for a spot to overnight, saw an RV Parking sign near the town bandstand. Another camper was already here. Couldn&#39;t find anyone to ask for permission and couldn&#39;t find any regulations online. Quiet night. Nothing like stealth parking in plain sight. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185933 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
