  <ele>18.55479621887207</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>YMCA</name>
  <desc>This is a new (2021) facility and is beautiful! All the fitness amenities you could ask for and nice clean showers. A day pass was $14C and was well worth it. Super fast free wifi inside the building. This is the only place we’ve found to get a shower in town before we head back out…&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/185973 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
