  <name>Broad Cove</name>
  <desc>Just a few feet off the highway with picnic table and garbage container. Rocky beach with nice view. Room for three small motor homes across from the picnic tables. Road sign says beach road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186056 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
