  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Western Bay Boardwalk NL</name>
  <desc>There is a site with picnic table and flag pole that can fit a small motor home, or you can drive past this to a turn around area where the board walk begins. The wooden boardwalk is in good condition with hand rails, and local residents sponsor replacement deck boards. Many have names and messages on them. At the end is a mechanised light house.&#xA;&#xA;The sign in the photo says &#34;Western Bay Lighthouse 1.4 km, Bradley&#39;s Cove and root cellar -&gt;&#34;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186059 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
