  <name>Heart&#39;s Content Municipal Park</name>
  <desc>In the field alongside the playground, there are several serviced RV lots with connections for city drinking water. Sites are free. Behind the recreation center is a washroom building with running water as well as a pond with well groomed walking trail.&#xA;&#xA;There is a dump station at a sewer lift station near the intersection with the main road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186069 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
