 <wpt lat="49.290116" lon="-124.576844">
  <ele>186.58826333843172</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull off between two bridges</name>
  <desc>Large, level gravel pull off near Cameron Lake between two bridges by a telephone pole. Some drive by traffic in the night. The creek sounded great and the stars were bright! We were parked in a different spot near a swimming area on Cameron Lake but a patrolman stopped at 10:30pm and told us it was a semi pull off and staying overnight wasn’t allowed - he recommended this spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186113 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
