  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near lake </name>
  <desc>A few campsite near the lakes. A few sites not so good for parking but quite a few are, mostly occupied during the weekend with atver&#39;s, quite and most are clean with already established fire pits.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186119 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
