 <wpt lat="48.696894" lon="-53.089138">
  <ele>39.33349609375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 20:58:57 UTC</time>
  <name>Bonavista antennae </name>
  <desc>Parking &#34;lot&#34; of large antennae near lighthouse.  No &#34; no camping signs&#34;.  Great views.  Very windy.  Levelish parking.  Can fit 2 vehicles here.  There are 4 pit toilets about 150 meters away towards the municipal parking which is about 300 meters away.  There is another spot to camp across the street from the antennae, can fit about 3 vehicles.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 20:58:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186150 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
