 <wpt lat="48.046135" lon="-84.622041">
  <ele>319.8932762714103</ele>
  <time>2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small gravel area</name>
  <desc>Few kms at the east of Wawa, Ontario. Just a spot for sleeping. Narrow, hidden, on a gravel path on your left when you go east on the 101 direction Chapleau. There is nothing there. Just a lucky place to sleep. One Rv maximum. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186162 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
