 <wpt lat="52.138029" lon="-128.145359">
  <ele>120.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ferry pull off</name>
  <desc>Seems to be the best spot to camp in Bella Bella. Take a pull off to the left as soon as you leave the ferry, just before the car park that is up the road. it&#39;s a shaded spot. Occasionally locals came by to swim and fish in the creek, but we had no problems camping there. Can use the ferry facilities when the office is open&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186163 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
