  <ele>334.4510765578598</ele>
  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Atlantide</name>
  <desc>Water slides for children and adults, large Zoo, lots of modules for children, mini putt, inflatable games park, wave pool, aerial park, haunted house, fantastic mansion, deck hockey, basketball, beach, lazy river.  There is something for every taste.&#xA;&#xA; Very small campsite.  No privacy.  Gigantic site bring your bikes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186185 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
