 <wpt lat="49.220347" lon="-65.033327">
  <ele>6.267669677734375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping de la Falaise</name>
  <desc>We spent one night there. The unserviced tent sites on the waterfront are wonderful. The serviced sites are away from the water. There are three flush toilets (brand new) and coin operated showers ($1 for 3 min). The owner Joel was super welcoming and accommodating. Unserviced site was $29 per night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186205 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
