  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Close to Culver Park</name>
  <desc>Swastika, just west of Kirklandlake, Ontario. Close to Québec border. On Route 66. Culver park, west of the entrance of Kirkland Lake.&#xA;&#xA;Very large spot. Close to the established Culver park Campground. Close to the baseball field. Large parking for RVs and large grass field for tents.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186211 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
