  <desc>Beautiful overlook!!!  The pulloff is capable of accommodating 4 - 6 campervans or pickup campers overnight in the flat gravel lot. No other facilities except very marginal cellular coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
