  <ele>1131.008239523465</ele>
  <time>2024-03-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roche Lake Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Multiple sites 10km off highway 5A. Gravel road but suitable for 2wd and easy in our 25ft. Horseshoe Bay first stop with a few sites, more sites further along the road at Roche Lake. Not many are level, big rigs might struggle to find a spot. $13/night collected by an attendant, senior discount also. On the lake front with fire pits and picnic tables. Beautiful and quiet place to stay&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186255 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
