  <ele>1174.4869384765625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-10 18:30:57 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>Multiple possibilities to stay directly at the river, close to the road/bridge, but only minimal traffic. some spots also reachable after rain. established fire rings. no mosquitos when we stayed. enjoy but don&#39;t forget to buy the Alberta Camping Pass before your stay! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-10 18:30:57 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186264 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
