 <wpt lat="51.649059" lon="-120.042459">
  <ele>466.99258788954467</ele>
  <time>2023-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dragonfly Splash Park</name>
  <desc>A great spot beside a kids play park &amp; public washrooms.  It is sheltered from the main road noise by a small retail park &amp; is a good distance from the train line so train noise is minimal.&#xA;Mosquitoes are far less than other nearby spots because it is in the small town of Clearwater.&#xA;Newly built washrooms with drinking water fountain.&#xA;Parking here might be required during daytime in summer for play park visitors but it was a little rainy when we were there and no one else was around.&#xA;Good 4G mobile signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186267 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
