  <desc>Just west of km 375 on the north side of Rte 500. There are many such sites along the highway, but this one is really large, with parking spots ranging from on a lake to up on a hill. Many spots to park out of view from the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186351 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
