  <time>2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Figure Eight Lake Provincial Campground</name>
  <desc>Small lake with some sand and docks. Good for swimming or paddling.  Big pull-thru campsites with included firewood. Cute playground structure next to the lake. Quiet with mosquitoes in Aug. Toilets. No water. $29 per night self-registration first come first served&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186354 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
