 <wpt lat="46.899900" lon="-55.617280">
  <ele>81.19871740164103</ele>
  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sandy Cove</name>
  <desc>wonderful spot with a big nice sandy beach !&#xA;you access this Beach by a gravel road.&#xA;the beginning is nice and then the road is rough for 3.5km.&#xA;No recommended for Rv or car smaller than SUV.&#xA;Lots of potholes but worth it !&#xA;please take photos I forgot !&#xA;A river goes in the ocean so you have acces to warmer and unsalted water!&#xA;there is a few seasonal campers along the road so you won&#39;t be alone if something happen !&#xA;parking with nice view at the end or camping spots for tents on the dunes or on the beach ! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186368 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
