  <desc>Place for 4 RVs, authorized. For one night only. Some restrictions listed on the stair railing. Space furnished with picnic tables. Very quiet with a magnificent view of the river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 10:34:25 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186369 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
