  <ele>11.09471964496897</ele>
  <time>2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Point Lance Beach</name>
  <desc>Nice and small parking for Rv and campers.&#xA;in from of the beach at the end of the road so no traffic.&#xA;we spent a night there and no problem.&#xA;no sign.&#xA;please add photos !&#xA;if you don&#39;t want to go to the next ioverland spot at the end of tilt road this one is nice as tilt road is rough ! &#xA;if there is fog there is a horn close to the next spot...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186371 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
