  <desc>Tap on the wall by the back door of the gas station store. We have a sprinter van and a 25’ hose and we were only able to reach if there’s no car parked next to it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186426 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
