 <wpt lat="48.776489" lon="-123.274832">
  <ele>3.0426692962646484</ele>
  <time>2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Port browning Marina resort + pub</name>
  <desc>beautiful place where you can do all kinds of things.. beach, kayak, paddle board ... there is a campsite on the grounds of the marina with a breathtaking view!  there is also an excellent restaurant with terrace. For the showers, they are super big and clean 1$:3 mins they are located under  the restaurant in the bathroom and you do not need to camp to have access to them!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
