 <wpt lat="46.435809" lon="-63.712531">
  <ele>5.009145873598754</ele>
  <time>2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crystal Beach Campground</name>
  <desc>It’s a campground where they offer a 5$ day pass. You can refresh in the small pool before taking a shower. They also have washer &amp; dryer if you need to do laundry. It’s a low end campground but we needed to take a shower. It’s by the sea but there is no beach. They offer fries, poutine and couple other options of fast-food if you’re really hungry.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186466 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
