 <wpt lat="49.348753" lon="-57.236162">
  <ele>62.877197265625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Falls</name>
  <desc>On the Humber River west side before crossing bridge if coming from Deer Lake direction, about a dozen trailers with permanent fixtures. Person we talked with from one trailer said it is crown land. The photo is just off the gravel highway 422 before going down the hill where the trailers are located. We did not go to the end so maybe more spots. FYI - Route 422 from the other direction is a snowmobile track for about 4km and the rest is very rough although Google maps will send you that way.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186479 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
