 <wpt lat="49.322921" lon="-123.102700">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street Parking behind Planet Fitness</name>
  <desc>Quiet street in North Vancouver, no signs prohibiting parking. The 24 hour planet fitness parking lot had signs saying 4 hour limit so we moved to the street and were not bothered. Had to parallel park our 22 ft Skoolie which was fine but a bigger rig would have limited options.We were there on a busy weekend (British Columbia Day and Pride) and it was very quiet with barely any traffic. Near the park where there are public restrooms, maybe a 7 min. walk. Clean, nice area. Keep it low key and you shouldn&#39;t have any problems. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
