  <desc>Laundry, self-service with nice helping staff if you need it.&#xA;The machines take 3$ for one washing (3 loonies) and dryer 2$ for 60min (takes loonies and quarters). &#xA;If you need coins you can change money at the front desk of the Motel (building beside the laundry).&#xA;&#xA;Open daily, 8:00am - 21:00pm&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186549 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
