  <name>Westview Camping Area</name>
  <desc>Free camping area near the forestry trunk road but absolutely quiet and in the nature.&#xA;&#xA;2 single camping stalls, 1 triple and 3 &#34;picnic places&#34; - but seems to be okay, to stay overnight in picnic places.&#xA;Maximum nights permittet: 14&#xA;Pit toilet and firewood available. Great spot! Take care to it!&#xA;Pets must be on leash.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-13 20:06:07 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186550 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
