  <desc>Free campground with:&#xA;- 3 single camping sites&#xA;- 12 picnic sites&#xA;- firewood&#xA;- cook shelter&#xA;- garbage bins&#xA;Maximum nights permitted: 14, hiking trail around the lake.&#xA;Some camping spots directly at the lake, really beautiful! Actually no one around, there is much of place for camper (medium size), vans and tents.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186551 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
