  <name>Springbrook </name>
  <desc>Nice little place to sleep for free near miller zoo. There is a beautiful chapel and an Anglican cemetery. I have a 36 footer and had plenty of room. We hear the animals of the miller zoo, the tiger and the wolves.&#xA;&#xA;Français &#xA;Belle petite place pour dormir gratuitement près du zoo miller. il y a une belle chapelle et un cimetière anglican. j&#39;ai un 36 pieds et de la place en masse. On entend les animaux du zoo miller, le tigre et les loups.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186576 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
