  <name>Kokanee Creek Provincial Park Campsite</name>
  <desc>$32/night un serviced&#xA;$37 with power, looks like 30amp. &#xA;beach, toilets, play areas, dump station, potable water.  &#xA;to be honest it&#39;s over priced and lacks character for us considering it&#39;s a provincial parks but we were put in the &#39;friends area&#39; and there isn&#39;t many options for cheap/free camping on this lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186578 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
