  <name>Commercial Street </name>
  <desc>Empty grassy lot behind Blue Star Traders, dirt driveway across from King St. between Wharf Access road and Irving. No signs posted. Locals using as a meet-up spot. Occasional RVs stopping to wait for ferry boarding time. Mostly quiet after sundown. Internet 35.4/146 Mbps up/down.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 21:29:59 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186580 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
