  <ele>575.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Westside Road</name>
  <desc>Large flat grassed area with space for RVs and tents. Lots of room to turn around for large vehicles and a couple of sections of space to explore and park. There are also rock circle firepits scattered around. Cell network in the area, I had 3 bars.&#xA;Enter on the right side of the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
