 <wpt lat="60.884820" lon="-135.719036">
  <ele>659.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping spot along Takhini river</name>
  <desc>Camping spot for a canoe trip. Accessible meadow along the Takhini River. Access to the shore is muddy but some logs on the ground help. &#xA;You park the canoe along the river, tie it up to a tree and go uphill a little bit where there is a meadow to camp (a lot of place). A lot of firewood available on site, one fire ring and sometimes logs left by others. &#xA;Beautiful view on the river! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186656 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
