  <ele>10.908542341820834</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking behind church. </name>
  <desc>We stayed last night and it was very quiet. We can still hear the highway, but the other site listed was very noisy so we moved here.  Reviews were on Park4Night app.  Trash and recycling bins available.  View of the water and stairs going down to the river.  Beautiful sunset!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186657 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
