  <ele>2.4028701782226562</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot near Ferry</name>
  <desc>Follow the signs for Parking. Pull in and go right for long term parking at $14 a day. Short term lot is to the left and is $22 for 24 hours maximum. Washrooms and WiFi in the waiting hall. Quiet in the night. Perfect when you take the ferry next day.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186661 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
