  <name>Tatla Lake Community Hall.</name>
  <desc>Vice nice quiet spot right beside the lake on the parking of Tatla Lake community hall and Library.  enough space for few big RV. It&#39;s next to highway 20 but almost no car overnight.   The most important we had good strong WiFi. No cellphone services in the area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186821 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
