  <ele>702.0118011357263</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rose lake</name>
  <desc>A little spot beside rose lake and the community centre.  There is a small shelter with a sign that says “tent shelter campers welcome” as well as a spot to launch a kayak or canoe, 2 fire pits, 3 picnic tables and a small swing set.  Also a small donation box that says “enjoy your stay any donations appreciated” there is 2 bars of 5g service.  Outhouse and garbage available as well.  Only downside is it’s beside the highway so noisy but otherwise the sweetest spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186827 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
