 <wpt lat="49.796600" lon="-124.363440">
  <ele>97.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Creekside Crossing Campground</name>
  <desc>Rustic off-grid campground, clean outhouses. 2km up Weldwood Road, nearby lakes and beaches. Close to Sunshine Coast Trail, and Powell River Canoe Route. Non-potable water available for washing. Outdoor kitchen. Dog off leash area. Good cell reception. Playground, horseshoe pit, nature trail adjacent to creek. Large private sites. Limited sites available for trailers and RV. Easy backwoods access. Two stores less than 5 min away. 20 min to Powell River centre. 15 min from Saltery Bay Ferry and 20 min from Comox Ferry. Perfect base camp for backwoods exploring. Overnight parking available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186842 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
