 <wpt lat="45.506652" lon="-76.940695">
  <ele>118.20320134423673</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River bank </name>
  <desc>Spot right on the river. Used during the day by the people living near here to swim. Lots of ATV during the day and very calm and quiet during the night. Spent a night here without problem. There is no bathroom or showers but the river makes up for it. There is a little gravel road to get there easily done with any car or van. &#xA;Lot of mosquitos when night fell. &#xA;LTE and 5G work well .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186894 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
