  <ele>136.9</ele>
  <time>2023-01-08 11:04:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking at Ocean Ave</name>
  <desc>Nice spot to park right near the beach. Across the street there’s a visitor center and an swimming pool that offer washrooms and a shower for $3 during opening hours (6am-9pm). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-08 11:04:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
