 <wpt lat="51.602300" lon="-117.495630">
  <ele>755.6</ele>
  <time>2023-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake view</name>
  <desc>Beautiful place right in front of the lake with view on the moutains around.&#xA;As mentioned at the wild camping place just after the bridge there is other spot along the lake, that one definetly deserve the few extra km on the gravel road.&#xA;&#xA;The path to get there is a little bit rough but I was able to get here with a mazda 5 without any problem.&#xA;The gravel path going to the water is use as a boat launch, don&#39;t park there.&#xA;&#xA;The location of the path where to turn is&#xA;51.59664&#xA;-117.49291&#xA;Or 8,9km from the bridge of Kinbasket Lake Resort&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;The others paths going through the forest toward the lake before this one seemed more rough, but if you have a 4x4 you can try them.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186900 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
