  <ele>-13.863904665229068</ele>
  <time>2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>At junction near the river</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s good enough to spend the night.  Enough room for 3 big rigs. There will be traffic noise as this is a 4 way junction.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/186936 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
