  <ele>162.0415496826172</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grundy Lake Provincial Park </name>
  <desc>Day use permit $15.50 per car.&#xA;Use of hiking trails and beaches.&#xA;Showers, potable water, Sani dump, recycling station from the campground available.&#xA;Quite pricy for just the day use, but if you need to use all amenities, it&#39;s okay.&#xA;Showers are OK, strong water pressure and ok temperature. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187002 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
