  <ele>1127.2313232421875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cypress Hills West Block Campground </name>
  <desc>Campground in Cypress Hills Interprovincial Park. Very nice place in the forest. The gravel road to the campground is not recommended for big RV. Suitable for vans. 18 Dollar for the site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187004 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
