 <wpt lat="54.470445" lon="-118.217557">
  <ele>870.494384765625</ele>
  <time>2022-09-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frying Pan Creek Campground </name>
  <desc>Forest campground at Forestry Trunk Road. No water. Free. Five or six campsites in the forest. We were alone during peak season! No tourist cars on the Forestry Trunk Road - a gravel road used by few logging trucks. Okay for 2WD.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187005 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
