 <wpt lat="55.964119" lon="-120.564487">
  <ele>619.61572265625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kiskatinaw old carven bridge</name>
  <desc>Nice space nearby the small paved road, close to the old bridge. For one or two RV. The bridge is permanently closed, so no traffic. Quiet, apart from the soft sound of the highway. Great view of the valley and the bridge. Perfect place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187006 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
