 <wpt lat="45.131807" lon="-61.977676">
  <ele>1.6962642055004835</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Abandoned Campground. </name>
  <desc>Read comments, I think this is reopening as a campground.&#xA;----------------&#xA;&#xA;An abandoned campground on the side of the road by a lake. It was a pull-through in its day, now it&#39;s all overgrown.  The old picnic tables and office still remain.   Quiet except for the road and bell cell service works OK. Bring fly repellent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187008 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
