 <wpt lat="55.885329" lon="-121.904044">
  <ele>729.6469471728262</ele>
  <time>2023-09-27 08:12:51 UTC</time>
  <name>Free Hudson’s hope camping </name>
  <desc>As a local to the area this spot is known to be free and lake side! 3 fire rings that float around the area geese in the morning and 1 bar of 3G sometimes 1 bar of LTE by the dirt jump. No bathrooms no water spigot but it does have a dock that you can jump off! And a small “hangout” tree platform. raspberries and Saskatoon berry all around &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-27 08:12:51 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187014 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
