 <wpt lat="50.265800" lon="-66.036980">
  <ele>7.348071098327637</ele>
  <time>2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping ZEC de la rivière Moisie</name>
  <desc>Pretty typical RV park, mostly seasonal folks type of place. Was really aiming for the place on the map across the river, but it was too sandy for my tastes and this place worked just fine (especially considering all the other nearby places were full or gross). I think I paid $39 for a site with water and power. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187027 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
