 <wpt lat="50.243370" lon="-66.398000">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Information Touristique - Sept-Îles</name>
  <desc>I see that other contributors have mentioned this info center, but they’ve not mentioned that the info center itself actually offers campsites. And they look really great. There were none available for me unfortunately, but I walked out and took a look and I’d love to stay there. Didn’t catch the prices. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187030 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
