  <time>2023-09-18 07:58:34 UTC</time>
  <name>Salvage Sprucey Hill Trails Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Didn&#39;t see any no parking overnight/camping signs anywhere.  Seems to be very quiet.  Almost level gravel and sand lot.  Room for a c class to maneuver.  view of bay water, rocky mountain, and trees. 3/4 exposed exposed area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 07:58:34 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187122 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
