 <wpt lat="49.316083" lon="-116.368533">
  <ele>265.17599151436826</ele>
  <time>2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goat River Quiet Deep Woods Camping</name>
  <desc>Great site many km down from the recreation site. Just after the 19 k sign and on your right hand side. Picture of entrance with a white ribbon is attached.&#xA;&#xA;Accessible by our 2WD with many spots on the riverside and sheltered by trees &#xA;&#xA;Seems to also have space for trailers to turn around. Loved the stay and very peaceful location. Grandma always loves the riverside!&#xA;&#xA;Evidence of many landslides often, so be wary of which season you are visiting. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
