  <ele>10.239643197506666</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping port St François - 1$ Showers </name>
  <desc>Camping Port St François has showers available for 1$/5m. It’s warm, clean and accessible by external visitors but I think it’s better to ask with the « Accueil » before use.&#xA;&#xA;We’ve been told to use the facility annotated with GVC on the right side after entering the main gate. &#xA;&#xA;There are 3 toilets + 2 shower there!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187153 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
