 <wpt lat="51.228498" lon="-56.784700">
  <ele>2.820469823057461</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off highway parking</name>
  <desc>Plenty of spots along a rocky road paralleling the water. Garmin does not have this road, you need to find on either end where it leaves the highway. Road is quite rocky and potholed, but worth the effort. This spot has a fire ring, open grassy space and ocean view. Very quiet. Stayed two nights. There is room for larger rigs, but road conditions might keep you from coming in.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187155 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
