 <wpt lat="51.575778" lon="-117.477750">
  <ele>330.5251094231965</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 04:45:42 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinbaskin Lake W/ Outhouse</name>
  <desc>We&#39;ve visited this multiple times before discovering this App! This spot fits 3-4 big rigs or numerous vans. Well shaded but perfect access to the lake with lake view. This spot can be busy on long weekends but if you drive further down the forestry road, there are many other spots to go to.The road down to the lake from the forestry road is good here, but in other locations down the road it can be difficult. Our 2wd 1978 campervan still makes it! The outhouse is gross but existing. When the water is low you can drive down the bank with a 4wd and camp on the beach.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 04:45:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187423 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
