  <desc>The only place between Hay River and Fort Liard outside of Fort Simpson to get gas/diesel. It’s open 9am-4pm for locals but open to out-of-towners any time. Call Lucy Simon at 867-695-6508 to get help. Cash/debit/credit all good! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187442 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
