 <wpt lat="60.681817" lon="-135.057295">
  <ele>729.280486763455</ele>
  <time>2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>A rest area on hwy 2 just before the Hi Country RV Park turn off and before the Whitehorse City Center turn off. A little noisy at night as its right beside the road but the only spot we could find with open pit toilets. Whitehorse hotels were all booked and very expensive offering rooms for close to $300/night. This spot has Whitehorse info signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187461 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
