  <ele>405.65063994098455</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fast Gas Plus</name>
  <desc>Potable water tap on the east side of the building with a picnic table and green fence. Asked the shop attendant if it’s potable/we could use it and he said yes and that it’s filtered. He also said we could use the soda machines inside to refill water bottles as needed. :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
