 <wpt lat="48.816330" lon="-87.270750">
  <ele>315.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 07:40:23 UTC</time>
  <name>Stop Along the Way Campground</name>
  <desc>This is their first year operating and they’ve done no advertising. A small family bought a house on what used to be a campground and decided to reopen all the RV hookups (full service spots!) and offer a place to stop while you travel. &#xA;&#xA;They offer spots with electricity and water and have a few with sewage dumps. They have place for RVs, tents and trailers. &#xA;&#xA;They offer longterm and one night stays, are super relaxed and have toilets and showers available. &#xA;&#xA;It’s basically in their backyard. They have at least 20 spots. We drove in without a reservation and they gave us a spot right away. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 07:40:23 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187471 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
