  <desc>A couple miles outside of Radium Hot springs, a bumpy but  doable logging road leads to this open level field.&#xA;Room for many rvs of all lengths.   A few fire pits in the area.&#xA;Very quiet and few bugs in Aug. Just a few random card driving by dirt road. &#xA;Fast Verizon and Att&#xA;Great for a night or a week&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187589 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
