 <wpt lat="44.201572" lon="-76.418142">
  <ele>70.77199801642209</ele>
  <time>2023-10-28 08:17:46 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolfe Island Picnic Area </name>
  <desc>A cute little Picnic Area with two benches at the water. &#xA;I spend one very nice quiet night here. No signs which forbid overnight parking. No 4x4 needed. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-28 08:17:46 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187837 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
