  <name>Green Lake Campsite </name>
  <desc>Crown land campsites on Green Lake not far from Griffith. Not the best ground for tents. Rough access to the water. Two stone fire pits.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187867 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
