  <name>Stavely Lions Clear Lake Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice campground on a reservoir that offers boating, kayaking, sup, etc. Also power boats so be prepared for some noise. A few sweet sites close to the lake - lots more beyond the trees. Toilets, firewood for sale. $20.00 p/night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187870 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
