  <name>Sussex Park</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot at the entrance to a few walking trails and a disc golf circuit. Bit of road noise and not overly scenic, but had cell service (Telus/AT&amp;T) and a portapotty. Please be respectful here as it’s clearly a popular spot for local dog walks, so not a long term stay, but overall great place to spend a night!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187957 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
