 <wpt lat="53.540822" lon="-113.622620">
  <ele>681.1283836364746</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Real Canadian Superstore</name>
  <desc>We asked in the store and they said that it’s no problem to park overnight here. There are signs wich say „only 3 hours parking“. Make sure and ask in the store if it’s ok. &#xA;&#xA;It was really quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;We stayed near the recycling area and we were alone there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/187965 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
