 <wpt lat="48.579653" lon="-53.947516">
  <ele>6.269644569605589</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 12:54:19 UTC</time>
  <name>Visitor Centre</name>
  <desc>it was amazing. took approx. 50 min for washing and 45 min drying, only for 4$ in total for a pretty good size load and more clean and dry than everywhere I went in the past for more expensive normally. I&#39;m really satisfied. note that it&#39;s 2*1$ per machine and there is no way you can have change from a machine or someone. another thing that is awesome is that you can charge your electronic. there is only one set of machine so I recommend you to come when it&#39;s not busy.. the visitor center was close but I was able to come and I passed by yesterday at 6:30 and doors was open (laundry/shower/toilet)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 12:54:19 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188142 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
