  <time>2022-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>François - Behind the church </name>
  <desc>Nice little spot to camp in the community. One firepit on site and a table. Short distance from the ferry and easy access to the trails surrounding! &#xA;&#xA;There&#39;s also an outhouse&#xA;&#xA;It&#39;s right next to the town&#39;s generator - bit noisy but can&#39;t complain beautiful spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188204 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
