 <wpt lat="46.906319" lon="-53.614683">
  <ele>7.910877936519682</ele>
  <time>2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gulch overlook</name>
  <desc>This is NOT the free campground at Gulch which seems to be run by the locals.  The established campground does not offer much in terms of an open view.  For an open view continue driving past on the dirt road till you come to a turnaround.  This spot is located on a trail and is not level.  Not recommended for anything bigger than a van.  We did it in a 4x4 although was not necessary.  Good open views.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188206 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
