 <wpt lat="49.819917" lon="-68.749776">
  <ele>232.037109375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>A wide spot next to a river crossing on this dirt road. not the most level site, but it is workable. some soft sandy spots, beware. nice, fishy river. old fire ring and wood here as well. a little bit of car noise from the main highway but quiet at night. no Verizon service whatsoever.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188210 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
