  <desc>Big bathroom with large hot water shower.&#xA;Go at the reception of the hotel and ask for the truck driver shower.&#xA;$10+tax=$11.50 including towels, shampoo, soap&#xA;Very kindly people &#xA;Large parking lot&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-17 15:18:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188244 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
