  <ele>8.306693880818784</ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lighthouse RV Park</name>
  <desc>RV Park with a grass area for tents, no fixed sites for tents, easy to find a spot. Sites for campers are open (no trees etc..) and quite tight. Showers 1$ for 3 min, tent per night 20$. Gas station has only very basic groceries, but there’s a farm stand close by. &#xA;&#xA;Next door is an oyster factory, the cooling runs 24h and you can hear it on tent area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188304 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
