  <name>Waterfront Park</name>
  <desc>Parking on the west river, there&#39;s a tourist information booth with washrooms open during the day. We didn&#39;t see any signs forbidding overnight parking. There&#39;s a mechanic shop across the street so it&#39;s a bit noisy in the morning. The east side of the river has parallel parking so could fit longer rigs and trailers, but we didn&#39;t check for signs there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188358 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
