  <name>Fernie Rotary Park water spigot and restrooms</name>
  <desc>Threaded water spigot near the stairs of the round shelter at Rotary Park.&#xA;To fill your RV water tank from the street, you will need a 50-foot hose, park your rig backward and run the hose over the alley through the tubing fence (assuming your water inlet is on the driver side). (see photos).&#xA;Also clean restrooms in the basement of the round shelter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188487 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
