  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Supercentre Milton </name>
  <desc>Several RVs, a couple of vans and a couple of big rigs on arrival at 9pm. Asked a neighbouring RV if they stayed here last night and they said they have been here several nights, no problem. South side of the parking lot is very close to the 401. There are overnighters parked on the north side as well. Probably quieter over there in the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188513 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
