  <desc>Asphalt parking lot in front of the visitor center. As the weather is bad today, we asked if we can stay overnight and the rangers agreed. Nothing special, no amenities, simply convenient. The road is quite narrow and our camper is only 20 feet long. I am not sure that you would want to drive here with a big rig.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 11:39:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188559 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
