  <name>MTBM park(ing)</name>
  <desc>If Tiny Trails is closed or full, this guy has VERY generously made a spot for mountain bikers to park AND camp!&#xA;No amenities, grassy, some shade, picnic tables, swings and goats for kids.&#xA;Trails are right there, well signed and FuN.&#xA;What a gem!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 18:29:58 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188644 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
