  <ele>52.0811767578125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>point crewe</name>
  <desc>small park with a circular street, picnic tables, garbage cans, dry toilets and a small path that takes 20-25 minutes round trip. Very clean, can accommodate several RVs of all sizes. Go via the 220 which is very quiet even during the day. Landmark is the Canadian flag because it is not indicated in advance&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188661 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
