  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Millers Creek Park parking lot</name>
  <desc>Aspalt parking lot for the park. &#xA;Stayed one night and had no issues. Tucked in behind a substation so its hidden from the highway. The road is busy but the noise isn&#39;t obtrusive. some spots are very sloping but not an issue for us. no prohibitive signs present for camping or overnight parking. please respect the area and be polite to locals to keep this area free for our use. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188669 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
