  <name>Pullout</name>
  <desc>Pullout to the west, enough space to turn around a large vehicle but space only for a truck camper or van. &#xA;&#xA;It is right by the highway but has a bit of vegetation around. However still visible. Good if you are tired and haven&#39;t found a better place. &#xA;&#xA;No fire pit.  Please take your trash with you.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 17:55:09 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188676 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
