  <desc>Very nice place in a pre-cambrian boreal forest with 145 ha estim 100 sites most of them close to the lake., clean facilities, shower 1 roomy,  only rogers signal and no WIFI&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188702 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
