  <ele>467.85705775179946</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Candle Lake Provincial Park Minokuwa Camping</name>
  <desc>A very large campground with more than 300 sites, clean ablutions, large sites, some in the forest, some very sunny. some close to the beach&#xA;Very poor reception.&#xA; Cafe in the north loop.&#xA;Fire rings and Tabletten on the site. Wood is sold. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188703 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
