 <wpt lat="49.801857" lon="-123.109605">
  <ele>337.10878921251873</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cat Lake Paid Overnight Lot</name>
  <desc>There are two flat dirt parking areas up at Cat Lake. Parking is free during the day and it&#39;s an easy walk to the lake, but the lake isn&#39;t visible from the parking area. If you park here overnight, the camp host will come around after dark to collect the nightly $18 fee. On a Friday, both lots were busy and some campers were blasting music all night. You&#39;re better off just staying at one of the free pullouts above or below this spot, if you can find one available and you&#39;re less than 25ft total. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188704 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
