 <wpt lat="45.498744" lon="-73.588535">
  <ele>96.20944275986331</ele>
  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street Parking </name>
  <desc>Parked overnight near the big park on the street. Spots are metered during the day, but not at night. No signs prohibiting overnight parking. Some traffic noise and light pollution. Cell data available. Okay for a night. No facilities super close, but after a short hike up a hill you&#39;ll be at the park itself and able to use those facilities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188768 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
