  <ele>191.01928576991497</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rte 414 Quarry Camp</name>
  <desc>Beautiful large open area surrounded with wild flowers. Abandoned quarry with room for many rigs. Gorgeous views. As good as it gets for wild camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188772 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
