 <wpt lat="54.216212" lon="-129.719573">
  <ele>12.82769775390625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest stop 53K from Prince Rupert</name>
  <desc>A nice wide rest stop.  Lots of shaded area on the banks of the Skeena river.  Traffic noise but reduces at night.  Rail lines near by across the road however no train signals with the three trains that passed by.  Nice grassy area in the trees.  No &#34;no camping signs&#34;.  lots of room for level parking.  We parked two tvs with towards.  thirst joined us with space.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188779 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
