 <wpt lat="58.588181" lon="-122.662465">
  <ele>449.76330290175974</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dirt Road Pull Off</name>
  <desc>This is an extra wide shoulder on a dirt road. Stayed for one night, great for a nights sleep when driving long days. It’s off the highway a little but there is still decent road noise. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188791 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
