  <desc>Near the end of the building there is a red pole and faded sign reading &#34;Drinking water&#34;. Asked at the restaurant and they said it&#39;s okay to fill a water jug. Ask if you need to pay for lager quantities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188807 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
