  <time>2022-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lone Star</name>
  <desc>Had dinner at the Lone Star (love the fajitas) and asked the manager if we could overnight in the parking lot. He said “no problem”. &#xA;&#xA;A little noisy with planes overhead and a brightly lit lot. No one bothered us. &#xA;&#xA;We were even able to pick up wifi from the Westin next door. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188827 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
