  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: Probably still usable as a Wild Camping site, but note that the trail to the falls is temporarily closed.&#xA;&#xA;Parking for trail head to beautiful waterfalls. Big enough to turn around a camper with a medium sized trailer. Fire pit. No no camping signs. Quiet&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188831 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
