  <ele>335.56174519006163</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Logging dirt n gravel roads - don’t need 4x4.</name>
  <desc>It’s high n dry. Good for star gazing. &#xA;&#xA;Active logging roads so be prepared to stop - but there’s a couple veins off the roads that lead to meadows. &#xA;&#xA;Decent Rogers 3G as I post this. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188840 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
