 <wpt lat="52.003850" lon="-120.149174">
  <ele>626.0773506229743</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wells Gray free camping</name>
  <desc>A small clearing, big enough for 2 rigs, off the main road through Wells Gray. A small track on the right (going North) just before the Redspring Picnic Area leads to a small clearing, and my van was hidden from the road by the tree cover. Can hear the occasional car go by during the day, but NO traffic at night. A good alternative if you want to avoid the major campgrounds or they are full. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188860 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
