  <desc>beautiful little campsite which is in its first year of operation. Sanitaore block, laundry room, animals accepted. the owner Jean and his wife Karine are wonderful!&#xA;---&#xA;beau petit camping qui en est a se première année d&#39;opération. Bloc sanitaore, Buanderie, animaux acceptés. le propiétaire Jean et sa femme Karine sont merveilleux! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 18:29:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188865 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
