  <ele>468.1965104585619</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinsmen Community Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground on a green meadow not far from the road #3. Clean facilities sites with full service. Fire rings and tables. Free Wifi at the Library. Dump fee C$ 10 if you dont dump on your site.&#xA;C$ 31&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188873 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
