 <wpt lat="44.372184" lon="-78.386872">
  <ele>271.7699205558747</ele>
  <time>2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paul J. English Park</name>
  <desc>Big park with big parking area, no sign saying we not allowed to stay overnight, some young people meet there in the evening and a baseball game was played, no disruption at night, beautiful view of the sky, near the main road but not a lot of noise to be honest, stayed one night no problems&#xA;&#xA; Car shows on Monday nights during the summer. No problem staying overnight. Good cell service&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188881 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
