 <wpt lat="52.308769" lon="-55.841824">
  <ele>7.69854736328125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mary Harbour Firehall Site</name>
  <desc>Gravel area we were told is intended for new firehall. We were going to Battle Island and were told it was OK with the town to park and leave our car and trailer here or at the school, which is on the left side of Main St as you head to this spot. That would be a good spot for overnight stop. There is a good grocery/general store nearby. The gas station looked closed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188911 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
