  <ele>357.0474078450352</ele>
  <time>2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grassy area off Station Creek FSR</name>
  <desc>On the way to the parking to a couple of local hikes, there is a large, flat, grassy area that is accessible for campers and small RVs. We stayed for two nights. Nice and quiet, shaded, fairly private. Water is available at the visitor center just down the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188935 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
