 <wpt lat="50.122185" lon="-56.129945">
  <ele>0.544769287109375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fleur de Lys</name>
  <desc>Paved parking lot beside the town office. There is a sign that designates it as a rest stop. there are a couple of benches and a garbage can. No signs that prohibit overnight parking. We were there on a Sunday so no one at the town office to ask if it was ok to stay. Locals smiled and waved at us. Pretty little fishing village. No cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188936 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
