 <wpt lat="50.050283" lon="-56.106997">
  <ele>7.8128662109375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>French Bread Oven</name>
  <desc>Flat parking area suitable for several rigs, large or small. No posting that prohibits staying overnight. Lovely picnic area with pavilion, picnic tables and fire ring. There are water buckets for dousing the fire when you&#39;re done and a fire grate to put over the fire for cooking. There is a garbage can, please don&#39;t throw garbage around or into the firepit! We cleared beer cans and coffee cups out of the firepit.&#xA;Beautiful spot to spend some peaceful time.&#xA; &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188937 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
