  <desc>Back of gas station near air pump has potable water. Asked to fill and attendant said no problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188961 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
