  <ele>267.68588909786195</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dead Horse Creek wild camping </name>
  <desc>Logging roads. Follow the road to the end -  lake - or look for a pull-in along the way. It’s high n dry - great for star gazing and meteor showers. Gravel road with some sharp corners so stay alert for trucks. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188968 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
