 <wpt lat="49.090904" lon="-58.365972">
  <ele>26.3540997505188</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blow Me Down Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Very well named! Probably the nicest prov park in NFL! Amazing view from the beach. It can be windy.&#xA;Lots of trails around. &#xA;28 sites&#xA; 20.15$ for campsites without services.&#xA;Water must be boiled before drinking&#xA;.....&#xA;Douche gratuite et chaude.&#xA;Magnifique petit parc provincial. Le secteur est un incontournable! Le parc porte super bien son nom! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/188969 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
