  <ele>55.17449951171875</ele>
  <time>2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rte Allain turnoff</name>
  <desc>We were headed for Stoney Beach via Rte Allain and this dirt/gravel road was too washed out for our Promaster.  This forest spot is somewhat level.  Walk 15 minutes more for a great bluff overlook. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189004 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
