  <ele>552.7004123252575</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frenchman Butte near Fort Pitt Provincial Historical site</name>
  <desc>Green meadow behind a large church with a gazebo 180° degree beautiful view to the north saskatchevan river. A wonderfull and very remote place.&#xA;Only for fully autark campers. No Tables, no fire Ring no toilette no shower, no fee. Pse give a donation to the church.&#xA;You may get electricity with 20m long cable.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189031 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
