  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lennox passage Yacht Club storage lot</name>
  <desc>Parking lot used to store boats during the winter. The club allows rv parking by donation. Beautiful waterfront location.&#xA;Two electrical outlets avaliable at the red shed. Lot slopes severely towards the water except in front of the shed.&#xA;good cell phone service...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189036 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
