  <ele>420.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rotary Bike Park Free Parking. Free RV/ Camping?</name>
  <desc>End of dirt road that leads to Rotary Bike Park. The river and major paved bike and pedestrian trail that goes to Hamilton,  Paris, Port Dover,.etc. There are lots of trees to sleep in. There are washroom nearby in the daytime and a gazebo picnic tables. Free garbage too. The city bus maintenance is right next door. Also sports fields near too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189048 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
