  <ele>10.353429721668363</ele>
  <time>2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street Parking Near Port Auto Tech 2001</name>
  <desc>My van broke down on a Sunday, so I jad to wait 2 days to get it fix. Slept 2 nights in front parked on the street, with no problem at all.&#xA;The traffic is loud, but gaz station accros the street, and wifi at Granny&#39;s Chicken &amp; Grill (120 meters away) &#xA;Clean Bathroom also available at Granny&#39;s Chicken &amp; Grill.&#xA;Liquor store real near too.&#xA;More a place you crash overnight while driving through. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189128 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
