  <name>Potato World</name>
  <desc>It has a spigot on the right-hand side of the Potato World building. I asked the permission and they let us fill up our tank as long as you have a long hose at least 75 feet to reach the spigot from the parking. Don’t forget to try their French fries from the Capital of French Fries: it’s really good! Good museum.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189136 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
