 <wpt lat="54.111775" lon="-126.758881">
  <ele>741.7906347773969</ele>
  <time>2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Owens Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Well maintained rec site with picnic area and free camping, about 10 camp spots, near the lake. Clean pit toilets with t.p. We were the only ones camped on a weeknight. Logging trucks drive the road at all hours, but the sound is not too bad. Be aware that drive the road here you will have a lot of logging trucks barreling by and there are not many places to move over and let them pass. However the road is in good condition so depending on your rig, you should be able to keep a decent speed.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
