  <ele>282.9379981169477</ele>
  <time>2022-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hill parking Kékéko</name>
  <desc>This is the parking lot of the Kekeko hikes. It is a gravel parking lot on the side of the road (10-15 minutes from downtown Rouyn-Noranda) that leads to many amazing hikes on the mountain. There are no &#34;no overnight parking&#34; signs and there is a chemical toilet in the summer time. The road is quiet at night. You just drive on the Témiscamingue Boulevard (leaving the town) and there will be a sign announcing Les Collines Kékeko&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
