  <name>Bride veil falls</name>
  <desc>Parking of the bridal veil falls. no signs, camp there for a night in a mini van and no knocks. Toilet on site. very nice spot to swim in the river, the waterfall is spectacular. A bit noisy in the morning because of the road nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189232 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
