  <name>Missions To Seafarers Halifax</name>
  <desc>There is a stopping water valve on the back of the building. on the right side of the building.&#xA;I think the office is open until 5:00 p.m.&#xA;I asked the office and she asked me how many liters I needed to refill my tank and then she let me use the faucet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189277 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
