 <wpt lat="48.798211" lon="-86.622294">
  <ele>263.65866710431874</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Pic River</name>
  <desc>So these coordinates are for the rest-stop / view parking of the bridge, the railroad tracks and then Lake Superior on the left. &#xA;&#xA;There are porta-potties and a great view! Also a picnic table. But you could park a truck or camper up here for the night no problem. &#xA;&#xA;I couldn’t stop today (because they’re painting the hwy), but on either side of the bridge’s EAST end, there are gravel tracks. Viewing from a height, I can see prime parking spots under the bridge along the river. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189279 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
