  <desc>Campground with a perfect view over the bay from nearly all sites. 50 $ as full hook up. We paid 25 for a bare place with our 21 ft RV. Friendly staff.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189282 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
