 <wpt lat="56.221955" lon="-130.071266">
  <ele>878.32666015625</ele>
  <time>2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miners turnout</name>
  <desc>A turnout on very quiet Granduc Road, in front of another inactive mine entrance (no entry). Views include the mountains, glaciers, the valley and... the damage miners did and do. More holes across the valley, brown stuff in Summit Lake, &#39;scars&#39; on mountains called roads. See a helicopter service remote, high altitude mines at the beginning and end of the shifts. Good for one night to enjoy majestic Salmon Glacier early next morning (when the light is favorable).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189314 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
