  <name>Michener Park Campground</name>
  <desc>Simple municipal campground with 3 dozen of sites. $32 CAN/night for a site with power (no dry sites). Free hot shower included. Quiet with some okay privacy. We stopped here to wait for our appointment in Red Deer to get our camper serviced at Overland Explorer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189323 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
