  <ele>552.3119736759741</ele>
  <time>2024-03-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hwy 3A rest stop</name>
  <desc>Great, large, free,  rest spot overlooking the lake with water and mountain views.  No ‘NO’ signs. Not much road noise, clean surroundings but the trash bins have not been emptied for awhile so if you arrive with this situation, please pack it out. No place to set up a tent. Spectacular spot for an overnighter. We love Canada!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189390 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
