  <name>4-20 Wycliff Conservation parking lot</name>
  <desc>Small, gravel parking lot in habitat location  maintained by government Wildlife Mgt. Unit. Shady and remote, impeccably clean. Pack it out, please. Some distant road noise. Next to Wycliffe Butte hiking trail and across from Northstar rails to trails path.  One night limit should be enough. Do not overstay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 06:53:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189391 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
