  <name>Acony point Beach</name>
  <desc>Official Aconi Point Beach parking lot alongside Aconi Power Plant. Clean parking, level. Tables. Garage can. Nice view. Take the path to Aconi Power Plant and follow &#39;Beach&#39; sign. In the evening, locals were coming with their dogs for à walk. Perfectly quiet after dawn. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189417 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
