  <ele>244.0905075687915</ele>
  <time>2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>PP Bar &amp; Grill parking</name>
  <desc>Huge parking lot at the back of the restaurant, I asked the owner if we could park overnight at the back and they said no problem we were welcome. Great food at good prices, restaurant closes at 11pm, washrooms inside, closes at 11 pm. Super friendly staff.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189424 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
