  <ele>31.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cove side tree spot</name>
  <desc>Turn off Glengarry County Road 2 and down the track, you will cross the waterfront trail so look out for pedestrians, continue following the track which curves to the right, and the end of the cove there is a grassy clearing. space for 2 or 3 vans. 4x4 is required as its uneven and muddy. Trailers and RVs not recommended. there is a small firepit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189425 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
