  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Guindon Park East Enter</name>
  <desc>The parking lot for hiking or biking in the park. No sign about forbidden overnight. Toilet are available. &#xA;You can ear the sound of the road near, but not so much.&#xA;We don&#39;t sleep here, just stay for a hike.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189428 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
