  <ele>22.73110580444336</ele>
  <time>2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shoreline trail or walk</name>
  <desc>Super cute, quite spot along the ocean. Space for a few campers. Hydro by the washroom. Recommend that you walk the trail first to see if it will work. Great for small trailers and tents. Pick your own blueberries. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189430 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
