  <name>Parking lot behind red building near Walsh save on gas</name>
  <desc>Both businesses were closed at night and I slept in the back lot. A little bit of highway noise but I slept fine, pretty dark. Left at 8 am you can get gas by then.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189432 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
