  <desc>Little natural playground with parking and pique nique tables. In a quiet street. Near a little River. space for 8 cars and for 1 or 2 big rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189437 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
