 <wpt lat="66.530201" lon="-136.487682">
  <ele>696.900146484375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 19:32:41 UTC</time>
  <name>elevated pullout </name>
  <desc>west side of the highway there&#39;s a elevated pullout. large enough for several vehicles, fairly rough rocky terrain though and not enough room for a RV to turn around. near the highway so you still have road noise. 2 rock fire rings beside each other. no pit toilets and the ground is hard rock so no digging a hole either at this spot.&#xA;&#xA;great views.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 19:32:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189447 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
