 <wpt lat="50.373781" lon="-57.527037">
  <ele>19.84027099609375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>great bluff top spot</name>
  <desc>there is a little spur road off the main dirt road...if you&#39;re small and nimble (4runner with a rooftop tent), you can make it all the way down to the beach. we opted to stop at this fairly level spot on top of the bluff overlooking the beach. we are in a 25&#39; truck camper. plenty of driftwood down on that beach for firewood. there is also a stream on one side of the beach that empties into the ocean. saw an eagle perched atop a bluff just south of us. a little highway noise, but quiet at night. slept to the sound of the waves.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189472 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
