 <wpt lat="47.224198" lon="-54.015351">
  <ele>4.665035247802734</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Point Verde</name>
  <desc>This is a large gravel and grassy area just off the highway, between the ocean and Point Verde pond. There is a picnic table with a nice grassy flat spot near it, but we chose to drive up onto the rocks closer to the ocean and further from the road. There are no houses close by, so it feels very private.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
