  <time>2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cochin Beach</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking next to the beach and a sport field. Plenty of space. No signs saying “no overnight”. Beautiful beach and sunset. Very quiet during the night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189501 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
