  <desc>This place is beautiful and not to be missed! Nice swimming hole right on the river. Free camping and lots of flat areas for tents. Clean pit toilet. Fire rings, picnic table. Look for the small gravel road before the bridge on the hwy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189545 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
