  <ele>808.4</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside</name>
  <desc>There is a sign that says this area is an undeveloped campsite, and only to camp at designated sites (I saw two sites). The campsites are level and next to a lake. The road to site is a gravel road and road is rutted but ok condition.&#xA;&#xA;The neighborhood pets (cows) do come to say hi, so be prepared.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189554 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
