 <wpt lat="45.578307" lon="-78.507130">
  <ele>413.0124357827008</ele>
  <time>2022-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Two rivers lake campground </name>
  <desc>Provincial campground. Pine forest campsites packed in with people in the summer.  When we visited in late august, they had a water shortage which meant no safe water fill ups and no showers. Pit toilets reeked. Not ideal for this region. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189565 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
