  <ele>61.1</ele>
  <time>2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Joliette</name>
  <desc>Translation: Walmart Joliette. Can sleep one night. We were 4 (a camper, 2 trailers and 1 small RV). Very noisy because next to the 31 but it&#39;s free.&#xA;&#xA;Walmart Joliette. Peut dormir une nuit.  Nous etions 4 (un camper, 2 roulottes et 1 petit VR). Très bruyant car a côté de la 31 mais c’est gratuit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189568 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
