  <ele>908.6022271093121</ele>
  <time>2023-05-17 17:33:12 UTC</time>
  <name>Secluded Spot on McIntyre Lake </name>
  <desc>Great flat spot with water access and a rock fire pit. Not an official rec site. Good for multiple vehicles with a narrow but glorious view of the lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-17 17:33:12 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189574 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
