  <ele>25.44681554287672</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailhead parking</name>
  <desc>Parking before bridge on left, it is small parking. Only cars / small van. It is parking of trailhead. Only slept here, we had dinner under shelter at visitor center then went here. In Hyder at campsite the woman let us shower, we gave her some dollars and shower needs 3 loonies, goes 8 minutes for 3 loonies. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189581 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
