  <name>Walmart/Circle K/Tim Hortons</name>
  <desc>There was no signage. Circle K and Tim Hortons are both open 24 hours, so there were cars in the lot all hours of the night. we stayed here after having dinner and drinks on the patio at Brewster&#39;s Meadowlark. no issues! there was some noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189637 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
