  <ele>167.95603233762085</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Adam &amp; Eve River</name>
  <desc>Easy access, short jaunt off highway 16. Lots of room for multiple campers. Sites are right on the river with pools for swimming.&#xA;&#xA;Cross the little bridge, then turn left through the woods down to the river - the best spot in the woods and by a river.&#xA;&#xA;Active logging area - may meet big trucks coming in, but not at the camp spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189649 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
