 <wpt lat="49.980719" lon="-109.474348">
  <ele>766.9117431640625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Saskatchewan Visitor Centre in Maple Creek</name>
  <desc>**seasonal closure with gates, no access to parking lot in winter season**&#xA;&#xA;Parking lot of a visitor centre, so paved and flat. Gorgeous views of Saskatchewan fields. Sounds of the highway but we didn&#39;t find it too disturbing, we have had similar in paid campgrounds. Picnic tables. Bathrooms weren&#39;t open at night. There is a gas station nearby so convenient to fuel up. We had ample space for our truck and travel trailer (52 feet total) and there were also 3 other cars in the parking lot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189659 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
