  <name>Macintosh Brook Faucets</name>
  <desc>There&#39;s a shelter at the campsite with picnic tables and a couple sinks where you can fill small jugs of water. Not ideal, but fine in a pinch.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189671 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
