 <wpt lat="53.573941" lon="-120.860728">
  <ele>871.9049005508423</ele>
  <time>2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ptarmigan Creek</name>
  <desc>End of Ptarmigan Creek FSR at the creek side near Erg Mountain Trailhead. The FSR is in good shape with a few steeper creek crossings. Passable by most medium clearance  2wd vehicles. Our Transit 250 Extended length just dragged the overhang behind the rear wheels even though it has a 2” lift and larger than stock tires.&#xA;At the fork near the end of the FSR stay to the right on the more worn road and continue straight at the clearing. The road will end near the creek in a narrow clearing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
