  <ele>2.72503662109375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>brudenell provincial park</name>
  <desc>Just at the entrance to the road leading to the campsite, an asphalted area that can accommodate several RVs and motorized vehicles. no location was available on the campsite and we asked if it was possible to park there, we were confirmed that it was possible. The cellular network is weak. Less than 100m from the secondary road, but very quiet for the night.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189714 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
