  <ele>27.46310043334961</ele>
  <time>2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cupids Pond</name>
  <desc>A gravel road leads to a small park-like area with picnic tables, trash cans, and a small swimming beach at the pond. No signs indicating no parking or camping, so, as with most municipal parks in NL, we assumed it was fine to camp here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189723 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
