  <ele>10.698479657648651</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>St Martins, Coast, side of road</name>
  <desc>Stayed on the side of the road instead of the parking lot behind the restaurant, because of the signs that forbid overnight parking there.&#xA;Stayed with a few others, quiet at night, only a few cars passed by. Toilet at the tourist office opens at 11.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189726 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
