  <desc>Great spot ! Clean showers for $9, freshly baked chocolate chip cookies, easy off easy on. A nice couple runs the place and really take pride in their business. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189798 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
