 <wpt lat="51.643452" lon="-121.298583">
  <ele>930.3081932067871</ele>
  <time>2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>100 Mile Motel and RV park</name>
  <desc>Ok first off, the place is decent. &#xA;Showers are $1 for 4 minutes of hot water, and there is coin laundry. $3 for a wash and $for a dry. &#xA;But the owner is hostile towards Americans and can’t stop making comments like “all Americans like to shoot people with guns”. He also said that he could “tell” I was American. I’m a small girl of Egyptian descent. I don’t know how you could just “tell”. He mentioned MAGA and Trump as well saying if anyone came in with a MAGA hat he’d not let them stay there. Anyways, my jeep broke down here and I had to stay a couple nights in my little camper while it was getting fixed so I just smiled and nodded. &#xA;Other than that, the site I had was good. It was relatively private and I had electricity and water. The only bad thing about the site itself was the thousands of dead bug carcasses everywhere. It was weird and they stuck to your shoes making it into the camper of course. I wonder if he stuck me there because I was American. I don’t know. Anyway, it’s $45 or so per night. &#xA;Also there is WiFi but it didn’t reach my site so it was unusable. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
