  <name>Cornerstone Cider Co.</name>
  <desc>Cidery and apple orchards. We came to taste the wonderful Cider made on site and walked around the orchard. We did not stay over night, but the owner is very friendly and said she may allow over night parking. Well maintained dirt road off the main road. Easy access with our 27ft motorhome. Call Denise (the owner) to ask about over night parking 902-769-2169. Very&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189856 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
