  <name>T-Railway At Cox&#39;s Cove Exit</name>
  <desc>Area that used to have plaques about the NL Railway. Nice flat area with some grass, garbage/recycling bins and a picnic table. No washrooms. No signs indicating no parking/overnight.&#xA;Beautiful mountain view, T-Railway Trail access. Cell service and data are great.&#xA;TransCanada goes by so many not be totally quiet all night. &#xA;If coming from Deer Lake exit is for Cox&#39;s Cove.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189868 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
