  <ele>0.6</ele>
  <time>2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>K&amp;J TRUCK CENTER</name>
  <desc>Great place for trucks and big vehicles.&#xA;We blew out one of the spark plugs for my E450 motorhome.&#xA;The son of the owner was very helpful and honest.&#xA;they retap the thread and installed everything back in 3 hours and I was on my way on the same day.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189876 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
