 <wpt lat="49.666016" lon="-103.270460">
  <ele>587.3782958984375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Storage Area close to Hwy 13 (Red Coat Trail)</name>
  <desc>Spacious gravel storage 200 m off Highway 13.&#xA;We struggled finding natural public land on our drive east to spend the night. It&#39;s either agriculture or oil rig properties all over the place.&#xA;So we chose this gravel storage area.&#xA;No signs on the entrance; farmers who passed by on the gravel road didn&#39;t bother. Had a quiet night.&#xA;Not suited for a longer stay or to set up a lot of camping gear, obviously.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
