  <ele>735.979248046875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>HWY 16 and 5 junction</name>
  <desc>Good size level private spot in a forest, invisible from the roads, with a fire ring, in between the junction of highways 16 and 5. Easy access from the bridge over the Fraser River in HWY 5. Good for one night, but avoid if you are sensitive to traffic noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/189927 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
