 <wpt lat="49.194153" lon="-119.543665">
  <ele>327.1</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rotary Park Shower</name>
  <desc>Rotary Park has an outdoor shower that can be used from April until October. There&#39;s no privacy as its just a shower head attached to the outside of the restrooms.  But it has good water pressure and it&#39;s a nice change from bathing in the lake as it&#39;s potable water and you can use your regular shampoo instead of Dr. Bronners. Also, not heated but cold which, to be honest, is a nice reprieve in 38 degree C weather.  Edit: the park gates are only open from 8am to 8pm but you can park at the top and then just walk down to the shower from there. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190004 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
