  <desc>Conservation area at end of road, quiet parking area, dock, boat launch.&#xA;Porta-potty.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-03 10:47:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190010 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
