  <ele>202.41986083984375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaconia Semi Public Well</name>
  <desc>Constant flow of free, cold drinking water directly from the well-tested as potable. Parking available. Locals come here, to fill up water canisters in all sizes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
