  <ele>790.3448486328125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sheltered Pullout</name>
  <desc>A nice pullout along the road with plenty of trees to block the wind. There is some road noise but not too bad. You can hear running water as well but we didn&#39;t investigate to see how close it is. There are two spots to camp here and we&#39;ve included photos of each. Did not have cell service here with GoogleFi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190034 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
