  <desc>This is a big lot with no signage. Stayed 2 days on a late August weekend. Essentially empty.  Nice little town. Good Verizon coverage &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 10:50:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190039 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
