 <wpt lat="50.008833" lon="-117.307000">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wide pullout on road to Sandon</name>
  <desc>Nice flat area between New Denver and Kaslo without services. Quiet: at night only a few cars pass by. Recommend visiting Sandon for very interesting (free) tour at oldest still working hydroelectric plant. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190047 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
