 <wpt lat="44.183046" lon="-77.381196">
  <ele>82.76125259399414</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking along Moira River</name>
  <desc>This place is posted twice, it’s the same as the informal campsite next to it on the iOverlander map.&#xA;&#xA;Flat parking in urban area in park along the river.&#xA;&#xA;Walking trails and a garbage can are the only amenities. &#xA;&#xA;Locals fish here.&#xA;&#xA;Not sure it’s made for big rigs. Bigger rigs should use the parking at the soccer field also posted in this app. Or Walmart.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190048 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
