 <wpt lat="46.297760" lon="-67.527932">
  <ele>45.5</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 22:24:26 UTC</time>
  <name>Hartland Bridge Parking</name>
  <desc>No signs disallowing overnight parking.&#xA;Beautiful sunset view.&#xA;Picnic tables.&#xA;Grocery and pizza across the street.&#xA;A few noisy dirt bike riders.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 22:24:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190049 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
