 <wpt lat="48.230970" lon="-69.545780">
  <ele>18.44667726720015</ele>
  <time>2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overflow - Les Bergeronnes</name>
  <desc>*Please note restrictions.&#xA;.....&#xA;Overflow of the city’s campground. 25$ paid at the store in the tourist info building (505 rue du Boisé) at the entrance of the city. &#xA;Huge parking on grass. Pit toilet. At 200m from a wonderful view of the sea with pique-nique tables. Next to trails and access to the beach.  The bakery is at the entrance of the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190052 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
