 <wpt lat="49.040552" lon="-90.619581">
  <ele>445.845703125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet gravel roadside spot w/o trees on Lac de Mille access road</name>
  <desc>About 650 m off Highway 17 there&#39;s this spot where the gravel road widens and you can easily park 2-3 cars on the side of the road without disturbing anyone. Trees are cut around here (grass area now), allowing to have long sun and to help the wind keeping away bugs. &#xA;No one bothered us, only one car passed. Perfect for a night of rest. Road noise was minimal with the distance to the highway.&#xA;Good cell service. Road is the public access to a camp site / lodge further in. More potential spots closer to the highway, too, but not as nice.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190094 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="53.265809" lon="-120.287833">
  <ele>872.7490995163098</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dore River FSR</name>
  <desc>At the Y junction of Dore River FSR about 8km from highway there is a nice grassy area with a rock fire pit and some firewood. Looks like people occasionally car camp here, but very clean, so help keep it so! Very quiet at night, only a few pickups during morning and evening associated with logging.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190095 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
