 <wpt lat="45.711315" lon="-81.900176">
  <ele>285.27436453290284</ele>
  <time>2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet Dirt Roadside</name>
  <desc>Just a little flat pullout big enough for a sprinter, accessible with 2wd. Nice and quiet, no bugs today. Road is a bit bumpy but not too bad. Good for a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
