 <wpt lat="47.726089" lon="-53.241000">
  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Purified water at Carbonear Foodland</name>
  <desc>Purified water refill inside the Foodland. When you enter, its inside to the left after you check out. My 6 gal/23L fit fine in the fill up spot. $2.99/18.9L fill up. Also, a button for 4L fill up so could get the full tank filled easily enough (didn&#39;t want to overflow it so just filled the 18.9L)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190118 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
  <extensions>
