 <wpt lat="46.305698" lon="-62.831250">
  <ele>-3.83477783203125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dromore Trail parking lot</name>
  <desc>Nice flat parking lot with a picnic table and mosquitos. the road is quite narrow... one lane... so maybe not the best for big vehicles but perfect for a quiet night in a van! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190124 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
