 <wpt lat="44.835940" lon="-75.316080">
  <ele>33.3</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Iroquois Boat Launch</name>
  <desc>Small gravel car park adjacent to a boat launch. Accessed directly off Carman Road, suitable for most vehicles. No facilities but can park right next to the water. We watched some ships use the lock which is a few mins walk to the east. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190125 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
