 <wpt lat="49.603442" lon="-57.921249">
  <ele>1.1277599639116813</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gros Mourne National Park Swimming Pool</name>
  <desc>Admission to the pool is $3.25, but I only went in for the shower. It&#39;s communal shower, not pleasant but at least you can get cleaned after hiking. Hot water but you can&#39;t adjust temperature. For opening hours, see photo&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190142 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
