 <wpt lat="50.321520" lon="-122.810020">
  <ele>209.7</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pemberton Suds</name>
  <desc>Standard self-service laundromat. They’ve got a few different size washing machines with prices between $5 &amp; $10. Dryers cost $1 for the first 3 minutes and then 25 cents for each 3 minutes thereafter. I paid $4 for 39 mins. They do have a machine to purchase detergent and to get loonies.&#xA;&#xA;Hours of operation: 9am - 8 pm everyday&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190159 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
