 <wpt lat="49.141042" lon="-122.307451">
  <ele>67.375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Leisure Center</name>
  <desc>with pass and that&#39;s $66  and really friendly staff. &#xA;Wasn’t busy at all but I was here during the annual pool closure (mid august to mid september)&#xA;Clean but you can’t adjust water temperature. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
