 <wpt lat="49.121033" lon="-122.303013">
  <ele>13.577062666416168</ele>
  <time>2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mission bridge picnic area</name>
  <desc>Marked as a day use area only, but no sign restricting camping or overnight parking. &#xA;&#xA;A security guard came to lock the gate around 9pm, he told everyone that he was about to lock it. We asked if we could stay, and he said yeah, it’s fine! &#xA;Don’t rubbish, don’t annoy and enjoy this little riverside spot. &#xA;Train is a bit loud, but it’s OK to sleep&#xA;Nice rocky beach and beautiful sunset. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190173 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
