 <wpt lat="46.102525" lon="-77.478338">
  <ele>81.6</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 07:45:54 UTC</time>
  <name>Lamure Beach</name>
  <desc>In the parking area of Lamure Beach, you can stay for the night (this information came from a resident). the beach is beautiful, sundown marvelous and there&#39;s à little playground for the kids. washrooms were not clean, but there was running water (SEASONAL) and drinkable water on site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 07:45:54 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
