 <wpt lat="49.081044" lon="-98.940404">
  <ele>466.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mennonite community centre</name>
  <desc>A chill spot on highway 34 close to the junction going south towards the American customs. Great spot if the wind is coming from the north to hard to bicycle it, or if you come in late by vehicle and need a quiet place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190228 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
