 <wpt lat="47.344196" lon="-53.731844">
  <ele>156.77500240318477</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fitzgerald’s Pond Park</name>
  <desc>We never camped here but went in for showers.  Cost $5.00 per person.  Nice hot water. 2 showers in the building.  About 20 minutes north of Placentia.  20 km SW of the TCH.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190239 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
