 <wpt lat="53.343080" lon="-60.398320">
  <ele>1.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goose Bay Wharf</name>
  <desc>Great place in boatyard/wharf area. Make sure to not park in boat launch area. Will park alongside vehicles with boat trailers and big boats on trailers. Popular with locals to come and park by lake Melville. Quiet at night. Breezy, so no bugs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190247 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
