 <wpt lat="46.749291" lon="-71.400000">
  <ele>17.9</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 22:20:52 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Juneau</name>
  <desc>Established campground in St Augustin des Desmaurais. Very buggy with biting midges. Bathrooms &amp; showers not very clean. Good if you want to camp near Quebec City. Lots of bicycle paths/lanes to ride into Quebec City. 1 mi. walk to bus stop to get bus to Old City Quebec for $3.50.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 22:20:52 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190248 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
