  <ele>9.314279902726412</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 11:21:37 UTC</time>
  <name>St. Anne bus parking</name>
  <desc>This noisy parking lot is adjacent to the municipal parking lots.  The municipal lots are clearly marked &#34;no overnight parking&#34;.  This lot seems to belong to the Cyclorama and tour buses stay here.  A policeman recommended it to us.   He warned that the lot fills quickly in the day so check out early and only stay one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 11:21:37 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190250 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
