 <wpt lat="47.758113" lon="-53.225618">
  <ele>113.20037841796875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Victoria Lookout</name>
  <desc>A viewpoint overlooking the town of Victoria. theres a small gravel lot next to a structure with benches and picnic tables. The lot isn&#39;t super level, but I was able to get oriented in an okay spot for the night. &#xA;&#xA;The views are stunning, for both sunset and sunrise. Overall, a nice quiet night, though it&#39;s next to the main road so during daylight hours you can hear the traffic going by. A couple ATVs showed up at 9pm, probably a smoke spot for locals as lots of cigarette butts on the ground, but they were quiet and didn&#39;t stay long.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190267 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
