  <desc>On Crown land. Super view ! Spot for Several RV&#39;s and tents. Firepit, benches ...See photos. 20 km North on hway 16 from Queen Charlotte City/Daajing Giids. Cellular: Telus 3/5.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190289 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
