 <wpt lat="49.453842" lon="-119.592727">
  <ele>323.29411744733613</ele>
  <time>2022-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oxbow RV Resort</name>
  <desc>Across the main road from the beach. Sites are very small with little to no privacy. Nice shading trees. Some grass around. &#xA;&#xA;PLEASE NOTE: Only Full hookups available for RV&#39;s. &#xA;&#xA;May ONLY connect Sani with &#34;elbow&#34; - no elbow no sani connection. We were not informed about this until we&#39;ve paid and parked. Fraserway RV rentals does not supply elbows with sani dump pipes. No discount.&#xA;&#xA;City potable water &amp; 30Amp connection with picnic table at each site. &#xA;&#xA;C$70 per night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190329 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
