 <wpt lat="45.028283" lon="-75.630183">
  <ele>94.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Superstore - Kemptville</name>
  <desc>Spoke with the manager on duty, they allow overnight parking for RVs and trailers. Overnight Guest are required to park in front of the store at the end of the parking lot as per the MOD. Washrooms are available from opening until closing and there is also a McDonald’s at this location within the store. There’s also a beer store, liquor store, staples, marks, Canadian tire, Dairy Queen, Starbucks and a few different restaurants all within walking distance. &#xA;We have a 30 foot TT and we fit easily.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190330 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
