  <ele>511.89631889183863</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brandywine Forest Service Road</name>
  <desc>Excellent place for big rigs.&#xA;stayed here with my 35&#34; 5-wheeler. There are still many places to park here over night.&#xA;No signs saying there&#39;s no parking. very easy access. There&#39;s even pit toilets near this enormous parking.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190356 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
