  <ele>682.1298828125</ele>
  <time>2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McQuesten Lake Boat Ramp</name>
  <desc>At the end of the road is a small boat ramp area off the lake. It is beautiful out here. Camping is allowed by the First Nation of Nacho  Nyak Dun as long as you pack out your trash. Room for one here but there are other potential spots. Some hunters in the area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190357 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
