 <wpt lat="47.180292" lon="-52.844372">
  <ele>11.29901123046875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bauline East Government Dock</name>
  <desc>Flat, gravel parking area for the government dock on a small cove. There are no signs posted that prohibit parking overnight. There are a few houses around, and a workshop that faces the parking lot.  Two bars of cell service.  After dark a local stopped by to tell us it would get very busy around 4:30 -5:00 am as all the fishermen launch their boats. Could be interesting.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190397 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
