 <wpt lat="53.277743" lon="-109.976555">
  <ele>639.9595813751221</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gold Horse Casino</name>
  <desc>Casino parking lot allows RV parking overnight, Just sign in at reception (they&#39;ll take your contact and trailer details and date you arrive and plan to leave). RV parking signs are at the west end of the lot.  This location is right off Hwy 16, so there is some truck noise at night, and some people coming and going from the casino. We spent 2 nights in our 39 foot trailer, along with 3 other large RVs, without issues. Washrooms and a restaurant in the Casino.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190407 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
