  <ele>211.36517333984375</ele>
  <time>2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Perry&#39;s Creek Bridge </name>
  <desc>A dead end at the bottom of Ojibway Dr South. View of Burleigh Falls lock. Okay for quiet overnighting, but be respectful. This is part of First Nation&#39;s land. Walking access to facilities at Lock 28.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190426 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
