  <ele>173.5611572265625</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Newfoundland Roadside Gravel Lots</name>
  <desc>There are 2 gravel lots at this location separated by trees and dense shrubbery. There are no services but site has 3 bar 4G internet. Sites have some road noise but is quiet after 10pm. Room for several RVs of all sizes. This site is really in the middle of nowhere.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
