  <desc>shut off for winter&#xA;Tap for water fill up at the back of the parking lot (by the soccer field and play ground). We called the rec center and the town to ask if it was okay and they assured us it’s free to use and safe potable drinking water! Just have to bring your own hose :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190432 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
