 <wpt lat="60.784256" lon="-133.064467">
  <ele>743.7175946682692</ele>
  <time>2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hill Before Sidney Creek</name>
  <desc>Excellent boondocking spot.   Room for several rigs. Near the road, you can hear traffic passing, but 1 car every hour or 2. Not busy.  Additional room across the road.  Firewood usually available.  No cell. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
