 <wpt lat="46.519321" lon="-84.346800">
  <ele>147.8602294921875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>V. E. Greco Municipal Pool - FREE showers and pool (seasonal)</name>
  <desc>An public outdoor swimming pool with changing rooms and group showers. The showers are not the nicest but clean enough to get yourself clean. There are no private shower cabins, just a group shower.&#xA;All of this is free of charge. There are even lifeguards if you want to bring the kids for a swim.&#xA;&#xA;Check season and opening hours here:&#xA;http://saultstemarie.ca/City-Hall/City-Departments/Community-Development-Enterprise-Services/Community-Services/Community-Centres/V-E-Greco-Pool.aspx&#xA;&#xA;2022 season ends September 05.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190488 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
