  <desc>regular everyday campground.  30amp, 50amp, tents,  electricity water and dump avail.  pool (heated).  wood $10 for a blue recycling bin full.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190501 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
