 <wpt lat="46.712824" lon="-53.259247">
  <ele>20.263671875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Portugal Cove South</name>
  <desc>Small lakeside park with benches and picnic tables. Not a pull through but people who can back their long rigs will have no trouble fitting. Room for two. Surface is paved. This place was suggested by the people in the interpretation center. Full bars cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190531 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
