  <name>Double Eagle/Pelletier Gas</name>
  <desc>1.47ltrs for gas cheapest place to fuel before heading to Thunder Bay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190537 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
