 <wpt lat="49.478393" lon="-105.651844">
  <ele>651.1361083984375</ele>
  <time>2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Willow Bunch Lake</name>
  <desc>Just beside road 36, small gravel road leading to a turn around. Located closed to Willow  Bunch Lake. The area of the lake was dry when we were there, giving to the landscape a touch of the Bolivian salt flats. The place is good for small van, can be tricky with big rig. Perfect spot for sage picking!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190550 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
