 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.790561" lon="-114.584642">
  <ele>1492.973876953125</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fisher Creek</name>
  <desc>Nice little campsite about 15km down an unsealed gravel road that is in good condition. Many ATV enthusiasts come here to camp near the trails. Plenty of space, large car parking areas but the sites are for tents, you can’t get vehicles up to the tables/fire pits. We got our pitch and then stayed in our vehicle next to the site and that was fine.&#xA;&#xA;$31 can/ night. Cash in the envelope or write down credit card details on back of envelope for them to process later. Ranger came around about 9pm to check on everything.&#xA;&#xA;Park pass required, can purchase easily online or at the information centre on the road here from the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190573 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
