  <ele>1260.3199588818293</ele>
  <time>2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sun Peaks RV water station </name>
  <desc>Potable water available for free right by the Sun Peaks parking lot outside of the washrooms. Bring your own hose.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190575 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
