  <ele>346.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out on Hill 60 FSR</name>
  <desc>Nothing special but good for the night, pretty private, only one car in the morning, able to level our van easily, would fit a smaller RV. Access is 2km gravel road slightly uphill which is nice, as even if it rains in the night you can easily get out. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190580 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
