  <ele>291.8575053617054</ele>
  <time>2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Preissac</name>
  <desc>Best ever spot.  Next to a river with rapid water   A picnic table free   You can even fish. A kilometre from à gas station and grocery. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190587 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
