  <ele>5.187563989311457</ele>
  <time>2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gibson Beach Road</name>
  <desc>Two huge parking lots with beach access and unofficial old boat lunch. Beach has no sand but few cozy fireplaces, parking lot has lots of space right on the beach, can be pretty windy but beautiful free place for overnight stay in the Campervan &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190600 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
