 <wpt lat="43.045662" lon="-81.181101">
  <ele>237.76584235578775</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fanshawe Conservation Area</name>
  <desc>Perfect day use spot. Water available as well as public washrooms. Trails for biking or hiking (all levels) as well as boat launch for small motorized or kayaking/ canoeing. Offers overnight sites but book online ahead of time to ensure availability. Camp area offers pay-per-use laundry, dump station and free showers but seasonal sites are for RVs only, no tent or van conversions. (Nightly or weekly is ok for any camping: tent, van conversion, RV). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190627 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
