 <wpt lat="43.057142" lon="-80.815237">
  <ele>262.7863163249567</ele>
  <time>2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ingersoll ON Route</name>
  <desc>West 401 rest stop.  Lots of parking,  RV and big rig spots.  Fuel and food available.  Indoor bathrooms and a park area.  Pet friendly areas as well.&#xA;We set up in a far corner and we&#39;re able to run out generator to recharge our battery bank  after a rainy day.&#xA;No issues. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190628 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
