  <desc>Used the showers here. Initially quoted at $12something for a “walk in” but when I came back to use the showers and shared that I have a Petro points card (app) I was charged $10.99.   After paying I was offered if I wanted a towel so perhaps this is free but I didn’t need one&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190639 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
