  <ele>25.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Skerwink trailhead</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot at trailhead with picnic tables suitable for regular cars and sprinter sized vans. Would not fit trailers or big rigs well. Not quiet because it’s right beside a road so there’s traffic but good for a night to hike the trail early or late in the day. Pit toilet 50m down the trail. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190681 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
