  <ele>256.1607666015625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 08:37:05 UTC</time>
  <name>Palgrave Forest Area Trailhead Parking (quiet option)</name>
  <desc>A second option for the Palgrave Forest and Wildlife area. This one is on Duffy Lane, much quieter than on Hwy 50. Parking Lot emptied before darkness and filled up again from 8.30 am (public holiday).&#xA;Night was super quiet, no street noise, just the forest and some train horns far away. No toilet as compared to the one on Hwy 50.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 08:37:05 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190687 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
