  <desc>Parking along the road, no « no overnight ». You have beach at two minutes. You also have a park for kids in front the lac. We stayed one night and it was quiet the night. Water and bathrooms at the beach ! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190688 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
