  <desc>Small gravel parking lot located in a park / disc golf course. There are no signs restricting overnight parking. There are trash cans and the area remains lit up at night from nearby lighting. Quiet place for one night. Decent reception as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190695 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
