 <wpt lat="50.085140" lon="-119.447940">
  <ele>370.91021273418295</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Along the road - lake Okanagan </name>
  <desc>We slept here because we passed the journey at the Kopje regional park just after this place. But the park close at 9 PM.&#xA;Here you have a beautiful view on the lake. It’s quiet the night . But in the morning … an highway ! We slept here with our 28 ft skoolie.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
