 <wpt lat="50.887748" lon="-119.845324">
  <ele>1500.6381470724812</ele>
  <time>2022-10-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grassy Pull Out</name>
  <desc>A grassy pull out on Sun Peaks Road FSR. Active Haul Road but this pull out doesn’t appear to be used during normal operations. Signage says the road is closed during the winter. Quite in the evening, vehicle traffic starts around 8am, no logging trucks seem to come through on the weekends. Can easily fit two vehicles. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190931 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
