 <wpt lat="50.391033" lon="-116.330744">
  <ele>1264.0389404296875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Toby Creek Avalanche Path Lookout</name>
  <desc>Awesome pullout ~10km up the FSR on the right side. Great view of Monument Peak and the surrounding areas. Very obvious spot, but it is the last one before you hit private land for the proposed resort at Jumbo. Several pullouts along the way.&#xA;&#xA;Big enough for 2-3 vehicles, especially with RTT or van campers. Decently flat for tent campers. &#xA;&#xA;The local moose approves of this spot, had a visitor first thing!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190935 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
