  <ele>703.0533956158906</ele>
  <time>2023-04-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Williston Lake</name>
  <desc>Very large site with enough room for 100 plus large rigs, with secluded sites as well as large clearings for multiple units.  Resembles and old gravel pit, but tons of room and not as dusty as along the beach 200m away. Good cell coverage as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190938 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
