  <ele>398.75537109375</ele>
  <time>2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Relais Gabriel </name>
  <desc>This is the entrance that leads to numerous possible camping spots. Go down track for 200m. the road is rocky. 2wd no problem for us. No cell service. But lots of spots by the lake,  peaceful as far enough from the road. A fire pit also. Nobody bothered us. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190943 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
