  <desc>rest stop along road. somewhat level, next to small lake. some road noise but quiet at night. no &#34;no parking/camping sign&#34; very chill. trash and recycling bins. avoid boat launch, full bars for cell.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/190986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
