  <ele>194.3704833984375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart in Goderich</name>
  <desc>Typical Walmart next to Canadian Tire, Tim&#39;s, Harvey&#39;s, gas stations, etc, with level parking. Confirmed with store staff and manager that overtime was ok, and they just asked for me to park over closer to the Tim Hortons due to incoming deliveries. Quiet night, I&#39;d certainly stay again. One other RV nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191041 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
