  <desc>Gravel with stone fire rings right by Quill Creek. Close to road but quiet at night. Room for multiple rigs, all sizes. A gravel road leads to a second spot, more private in trees, somewhat less room to turn around. Additional space on the northeast side of the bridge. No amenities. A sign informs about rules for campfires.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191216 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
