  <ele>329.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Husky/Esso truck stop- Showers and Laundry</name>
  <desc>Friendly truck stop, we were served by Carole. Showers $7.50, Laundry $2.50, dryer $2.50. She also allowed us to fill up our 10l drinking water jug for free which was very kind. Showers basic but self contained rooms (with basin toilet and mirror) and clean.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191323 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
