  <ele>2.6732267157585525</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>East Bay</name>
  <desc>Nice spot right on the beach. Known by locals for fishing. Accessible with small car and small camper. Not sure a big RV would make it down the hill. Follow the dirt road right next to the boat ramp. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191337 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
