  <ele>60.048939283937216</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Underground Salmon Pool</name>
  <desc>Only place in the world where salmon travel underground to complete their migration. 2.5km gravel road in with deep potholes but is maintained and 2wd ok. Large parking area, could fit big rigs. Picnic tables and camp spots. Pit toilet and 1.5km walk to river with salmon&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191347 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
