  <ele>-6.2310791015625</ele>
  <time>2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bates Beach Oceanfront Resort</name>
  <desc>36 sites, many on ocean front. Rocky beach. Very quiet, mostly retired residents, but some sites are available for travellers. Call to reserve first since gate needs a code. Very nice spot to enjoy the sea view, passing cruise ship, seals and gulls. Beaches, hiking trails and winery at less than 10 minutes drive. Kayak rental in summer, boat ramp.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191372 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
