  <desc>1 km the intersection before Mary’s Harbour. Provincial rest area with one pic nic table , no trash bin. Parked for the night and was OK&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-13 19:29:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191377 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
