 <wpt lat="51.723010" lon="-120.011360">
  <ele>870.8</ele>
  <time>2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull-out close to Wells Gray</name>
  <desc>Partially hidden pullout only 2km from the park entry. Out of park according to the maps provided in visitor center.&#xA;&#xA;Big rigs will have to back-in or back-out as there is no room to turnaround for rigs more than ~24ft.&#xA;&#xA;Levelness quite fair. Possible to put a tent there as it’s not too rocky.&#xA;&#xA;No private property sign or no camping sign. We were not disturbed here.&#xA;&#xA;Can be seen by northbound trafic, but not southbound. Quite calm a night, some cars passing one in a while.&#xA;&#xA;No amenities.&#xA;Slow cell coverage with Bell.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
