  <name>Trail Head Dryden</name>
  <desc>Trail Head near Dryden, 4km out of the 17. 1.7 good gravel road. Large flat parking on gravel. Many trails. Cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191438 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
