  <desc>&#xA;Camping without service but with compost toilet and propane shower! Intimate land and really nice owner!&#xA;------&#xA;Camping sans service mais avec toilette au composte et douche au propane ! Terrain somme toute intime et proprio vraiment sympa ! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191439 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
