 <wpt lat="45.640510" lon="-77.078022">
  <ele>139.41534755835377</ele>
  <time>2022-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel Turnout off HWY 41</name>
  <desc>Large gravel turnout at intersection of highways 41 and 30. Road noise from 80 km traffic but safe since the entrance is not accessible from the main highway. Mostly unlevel ground. Otherwise good for big rigs. One sign states that the area is monitored for illegal trash dumping. Should be good for a night’s rest.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
