  <name>The Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Pretty standard laundromat located in a mall. $3.50 to wash and I paid $4 for 30 mins to dry. Hours are 9 - 4 everyday. Friendly staff and they’re able to break change for you. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191526 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
