 <wpt lat="51.415008" lon="-112.631005">
  <ele>665.3214550396627</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>11 Bridges Campground</name>
  <desc>nice spot close to a river just 8km before you come to that Last Chance Saloon.  If you go there give Paula, the owner, a big hug from that guy from Bavaria, which is the most southern Province of Canada.&#xA;Here at this campground you will find all what you need from electricity, firewood to a splendid shower. Very clean, well maintained and leveled sites.&#xA;You may hear the HWY but there is not that much traffic. Go for a walk at the river, lovely!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191528 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
