 <wpt lat="50.769197" lon="-114.286813">
  <ele>1153.0006435487476</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Millarville Campground</name>
  <desc>There are two Campgrounds: Island and Creek  campground with sunny and shady places in a forest. The showers and WC are near the stabiles of a horserace track, a way to walk but there are also pit toilets in the forest.&#xA;They sell firewood.&#xA;The sites are huge with enough privacy and absolutely calm.&#xA;Look on their Website. if you are lucky you may participate a horse race or a Bull Riding. On Saturday there is a farmers market.&#xA;The phone reception is good on island loop. &#xA;We paid C$ 33.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191529 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
