  <desc>To the left of the pull out there is a overgrown road, follow that down and it will open up to a great spot that can fit multiple vehicles. you can hear the road but it’s completely private. And the site has service for that added bonus. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 09:32:38 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
