  <name>Tudyah Lake Rec Site </name>
  <desc>Finlay FSR,(not far from the Mackenzie junction) turn off hwy 97,go past Windy Point Rec site,past a log sorting lot,turn off for Tudyah is on the left hand side,road is a little narrow ,steep in some spots as well as overgrown. Very doable in 2wd We navigated a 28 ft class C down. 3 Rec spots with fire pits,tables and theres a small boat launch. Plenty of wood to scavenge here. 1 pit toilet and some walking trails. Quite private.&#xA;Cheers &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191575 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
