  <desc>Al and his Team are amazing, super helpful and really really friendly. We were so glad to end up here. They had no fear to look after our European Fiat Ducatos. And they were also able to fix them, find the problems and even fixed the car without needing new parts. &#xA;If you need a great garage in Sault Ste. Marie, you are here at the right place. &#xA;We could also sleep on the park ground in our Vans, during the three days they were there to get fixed. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191676 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
