 <wpt lat="46.167823" lon="-62.644204">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2022-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Public Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Laundromats are few and far between in eastern Prince Edward Island. &#xA;As part of Lanes Riverhouse Inn &amp; Cottages, there is a “Public Laundry” available (wash CDN$3, dry CDN$3). It is a little hard to find as it is tucked in with similar buildings at 33 Brooks Street, Montague, PEI.&#xA;Facilities are used by the inn for their own laundry. Clean, basic equipment and functional. Open during the day until 10pm, but best to call ahead at 800-268-7532 to verify hours.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191719 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
