  <ele>6.722171672055325</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Harmony Shores Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice camp ground about 4 km from Sointula ferry port. Big sites right to the ocean or in the forest. Free and very clean showers with own washrooms, kitchen, water to refill, power as well. The owner is a very nice Finnish lady who passes by from time to time. For availibility you have to contact her (harmonyshorescamping@gmail.com or tex: 902 77 72.&#xA;We enjoyed site no. 6 at the beach) for 35$&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191905 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
