  <ele>37.16748046875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Margaret Bowater Park</name>
  <desc>I have parked here for 2 nights on the row.  Beautiful park with many nice trails. There&#39;s also a public washroom nearby. On the first night, a police car drove in and out, didn&#39;t say anything. It&#39;s quite chill here. I haven&#39;t got to finished all the trails. There&#39;s another small car park on the other side of the street. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191919 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
