  <ele>96.31245577055961</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Primitive camping</name>
  <desc>There are plenty of pull offs along this road for primitive camping. This specific place is wooded and has a fire pit plus an addition spot in the woods for a tent. The pull off for some of these spots are tight as my ram promaster 1500 got scratched a few times by branches (just an fyi). I had 1 bar (sometimes 2 depending on location) of Verizon cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191927 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
