  <ele>767.349365234375</ele>
  <time>2022-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>public laundry (inside RV park!)</name>
  <desc>laundry is available to the public from September-April only (low season). parking for two vehicles directly outside the laundry room, extra parking available by the office.&#xA;&#xA;4 x medium sized washers ($3.50/load)&#xA;4 x medium sized dryers ($4 for 50 mins)&#xA;&#xA;very clean! much better than the laundromat in town.&#xA;&#xA;bonus: they also have a bunch of sorted recycling bins by the door! not just beverage containers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
