 <wpt lat="49.391525" lon="-105.127790">
  <ele>671.634033203125</ele>
  <time>2022-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bengough Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Big campground adjacent to the sports fields and the golf course. Very well treed, private sites, all with a table and fire ring. They all look out onto the central playground and the clean washrooms/showers. Picnic shelter. The wifi router is at the picnic shelter - the wifi seems to work pretty good throughout the campground. &#xA;&#xA;20 CAD for unserviced - 15 CAD if you have a yearly Regional Parks Pass.&#xA;&#xA;Swimming pool and all amenities a short walk away.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191942 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
