 <wpt lat="57.913479" lon="-131.179769">
  <ele>365.0</ele>
  <time>2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sawmill Lake Park</name>
  <desc>nice spot next to a lake. swim area with little waterslide and playground. there also couple picnic tables and fire pits and little shelter. perfect if you visit Telegraph Creek. only 1 or 2 flat spots. not for big rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191943 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
