 <wpt lat="50.076490" lon="-110.794062">
  <ele>736.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Redcliff Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>The campsite is self-service on an honor system, but the waste dump, potable water tap, toilet and shower facilities are not locked so it appears as though these are free to use on a visit. The potable water tap is next to the two trees opposite the entrance, at the end of the middle row of pitches.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/191944 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
