 <wpt lat="51.082970" lon="-121.590500">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clinton Pines RV Campground</name>
  <desc>30 amp sites,  pull-thru and back-in, picnic tables at each site, restrooms and showers, no laundry or TV hookups, cell signal spotty, have wifi, but connection limited, no campfires at individual sites, has central outdoor fireplace, outdoor games area. Pet friendly, must be on leash. Fish n chips shack for guests evening meal Su-Sa (order at office by 5pm) open to public F-Su, noon to 7. Sites are fairly level, though this camp ground is on side of hill so various elevations for some sites. Sites are gravel, dirt or grass.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192009 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
