 <wpt lat="50.288891" lon="-117.720539">
  <ele>685.2005752817572</ele>
  <time>2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nakusp Creek near hot pools </name>
  <desc>Charming little side road, 2 campsites with fire pits for tents or carping and 1 site for small trailer. You can hear the creek running below and can even dip in the cold water on warmer days! You will hear the road until they close the hot pools at 8pm, after, it&#39;s total silence! Stayed there 2 nights with my dog running free and nobody bothered us! Walking distance from the hot pools and hiking trails. No cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192028 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
