 <wpt lat="52.055954" lon="-120.159300">
  <ele>800.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ray‘s Farm Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Rather large parking lot at Ray Farm/Alice Lake trailhead, hidden from the main road by surrounding trees. No signs prohibiting overnight parking. Was very quiet. &#xA;&#xA;We stayed here because Ray‘s Farm is said to be home to many animals. Did the trail at dusk and watched the meadow at dawn but no signs of wildlife. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192031 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
