 <wpt lat="48.826860" lon="-64.224050">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Des-Rosiers Campground, Forillon National Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful park, very well-maintained and what looks like very new facilities.&#xA;Short walk down to huge smoothed stone beach, where I saw grey seals a couple of times, and cormorants fishing by diving from very high heights into the water.&#xA;Wifi at park office.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192045 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
