  <ele>-23.01519775390625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street parking near park</name>
  <desc>A really quiet street parking spot, apartment blocs on the other side of the street, no sign, stayed here 2 nights, nobody bothered.&#xA;Pit toilet right on fence close to the street, water fountain 50 feet from the fence.&#xA;Nice park with picnic tables and benches to eat or rest.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192078 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
