  <ele>226.96710205078125</ele>
  <time>2022-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>2 gravel pits</name>
  <desc>on both sides of the road their are 2 gravel lots, the north side seems like it might be more in use, the south is decommissioned.&#xA;&#xA;large lot, no service, near enough to the road on the north side to hear but not see cars, south side you can hear and see cars. easy spot to camp if you can&#39;t make it to wood buffalo or better spots before night.&#xA;&#xA;decent amount of dead wood by the forested area by the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192115 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
