  <name>Cheaper Diesel</name>
  <desc>For those who need Diesel e. g. expeditiontrucks, here you can get cheaper fuel. We got it for approx. 15% less. We learned, that in Canada you get cheaper Diesel in Truck Stops. In US it is the opposite. We guess this is a really important information, these times …&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192127 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
