  <name>Valentine Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>A free campground (a BC rec site) about 20 kms down forestry roads (that are in relatively good condition) with some signage indicating you are going the right way.  Some of the sites are right on the lake.&#xA;Seems like a local hot spot as even on a Wednesday it was pretty busy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192132 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
