 <wpt lat="49.210210" lon="-124.039250">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boban Drive, Nanaimo BC</name>
  <desc>This is strictly street RV parking,  or van life parking. This is an industrial area. Lots of cube vans park in this area overnight. I have stayed here many times in my truck and camper, and also in my cube van. No one bothers you. It&#39;s quieter near the Windsor Plywood end of Boban Drive, because that&#39;s where the dead end is. Most of the shops in this area close at 5:00 PM. There&#39;s also a BC ambulance station on this street. But they don&#39;t turn on their sirens until they get onto Mostar Drive, so you never hear them. Keep it clean and neat. Enjoy your stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
