  <ele>735.0</ele>
  <time>2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ponteix Saskatchewan</name>
  <desc>A small municipal campground with 17 sites. All have water and electricity. They have picnic tables and fire rings. Very quiet and immediately adjacent to a small well kept golf course. we just stopped for lunch but have overnighted here in the past. Current cost is unknown but will be inexpensive.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192427 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
