 <wpt lat="47.989312" lon="-84.782047">
  <ele>290.6158269653097</ele>
  <time>2022-09-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wawa street parking</name>
  <desc>Read Wawa BY-LAW NO. 2513-11 (easy to find on google) first for clarity as there are rules, but there are places and seasons when street parking over night is permissible. &#xA;&#xA;This particular location was nice and flat, btwn 2 street lights, and with a school sports field on the right side so I could open the passenger side door to get the dogs out to potty relatively unseen. &#xA;&#xA;There were other vehicles parked on the road and a travel trailer as well, presumably the property owners or their guest as it wasn’t hitched to a vehicle. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192474 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
