  <name>Morrisey Lake East Rec Site</name>
  <desc>The nicer of the two Morrisey Lake Rec Sites. 3 spots with picnic tables and fire pits. More space for camping if necessary. One pit toilet. Open view of sky for satellite internet. No cell signal. Free.&#xA;&#xA;Road is somewhat rough coming in, but should be okay for most vehicles. Gets a bit narrow at the end.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192515 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
