  <name>Morrisey Lake West Rec Site</name>
  <desc>The lesser of the two Morrisey Lake sites. 2 sites, only one with a fire pit and picnic table.&#xA;&#xA;I didn&#39;t notice a pit toilet, but the rec site website says there is one.&#xA;&#xA;Very tight and cozy space.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192517 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
