 <wpt lat="45.414428" lon="-80.248666">
  <ele>146.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Raby Lake </name>
  <desc>On the 559 road to Killbear. Just a picnic site right on the side of a wonderful lake with a very fine view. Directly beside the road but there are only a few cars coming by and it feels very quiet at night . There is room for a few camper vans of all sizes on the gravel parking or even a small tent on the grassy ends.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192519 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
