  <ele>256.35824044886976</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac de la Rouche</name>
  <desc>Pull off on side of highway. Access to Lac de la Rouche with little walking trail. Lac Rouge is across the street with easy access to both lakes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
