 <wpt lat="49.404829" lon="-91.665731">
  <ele>417.0662841796875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lilypad Lake Trails trailhead</name>
  <desc>The town of Ignace maintains a small network of trails around Lilypad Lake.  The trailhead is a sand parking area with no &#34;no camping&#34; signs.  The somewhat soggy surface and the parking area size makes it unsuitable for anything other than cars and vans.  &#xA;Very quiet except for the sound of bugs.&#xA;Across the road is a public beach with picnic tables and porta-potties.  The beach parking is marked &#34;no camping&#34;.  We parked at the beach, and ate dinner then moved to the trailhead after dark so locals would not notice.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192592 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
