  <ele>372.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Glamour Lake Beach</name>
  <desc>Park is a beach and boat launch.&#xA;Camping is allowed 66 feet from the water. You may be asked to move if you are too close to the shore. There are two porta-potties&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192593 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
