  <desc>Walk-in windshield repair.&#xA;Quick and good quality. perfect!&#xA;57,50 CAD for a chip.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192607 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
