 <wpt lat="54.057076" lon="-128.686252">
  <ele>4.963547746650875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 19:57:53 UTC</time>
  <name>Radley Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Really nice community campground with facilities and lots of sites. Most have a covered picnic table and lots are riverfront. We didn&#39;t stay here because we are visiting family in town but it looks quiet, private and picturesque. Rates are reasonable but it looks like it&#39;s closed this winter season (I think for construction) Also there is free firewood and a boat launch.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 19:57:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
