  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Meindl Park</name>
  <desc>Parking spot for the Meindl Park Beach. I parked there with my car for a night  without a problem. There aren&#39;t any &#34;no overnight&#34; signs. Nice beach at Lake Manitoba very close to the parking spot. No cell phone signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192644 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
