  <ele>153.6</ele>
  <time>2022-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kirkstone Skate Park</name>
  <desc>There are two parking lots close to each other. Go to the one where the washrooms are. On the side of the building you will see a faucet where you can attach a hose and fill up your water tank or container. You can park close to the building (unless the parking space right there is occupied)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192856 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
