 <wpt lat="53.482787" lon="-102.478736">
  <ele>369.7391357421875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Road</name>
  <desc>This is the way that Google maps told us to go from Edmonton to Thompson. it involves about 100km of dirt road, which starts near here. right here is a big quarry complex for road gravel. you can camp near the road, or drive right up the back around 200m away. it&#39;s quiet wherever you go. No facilities and no phone service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192866 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
