 <wpt lat="47.911190" lon="-70.024232">
  <ele>233.5804105885327</ele>
  <time>2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay overnight. Totally lonely. The track up to the hill needs a bit higher clearance but not necessarily 4x4. It is stony and rough. For overlanders who like nature and silence. It is the beginning of a hunting area. In the beginning of a side track, you can find a good levelled places. We chose a spot which was obviously not in use for a long time. A few meters away down the side track you have a fantastic view over a lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192868 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
