 <wpt lat="45.817214" lon="-77.459029">
  <ele>183.16766357421875</ele>
  <time>2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside</name>
  <desc>Relatively large clearing with ample places to park.  Suitable for any sized vehicle, and tents as well.  There is access to water on one end, and more trails.  Several fire pits already. People come to not only camp, but launch canoes, dirt bike, ATV, etc. The bugs weren&#39;t too bad on the September long weekend, but in the spring, they can be awful. The road was fairly good, however it can be full of potholes, and washboards in spots, depending on what the weather has been- but still manageable with a car and some patience. No service with Koodo.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
