  <desc>15 campsites on St. Mary Reservoir. Picnic tables fire rings and outhouses. Well kept and nice views but can be windy. $20/ night. Not all sites are level. Cell service.&#xA;&#xA; &#xA;&#xA; &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192948 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
