  <name>Wally&#39;s Campground</name>
  <desc>Wallys Campground is a 42 site campground on St. Mary reservoir. A relatively new campground and is neat and tidy. Can be windy and there are few trees. $24.00/ night. Picnic tables fire rings and outhouses. Cell service.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/192949 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
