  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spot on the lake</name>
  <desc>What a beautiful place next to the lake.&#xA;From far away you can hear a bit the highway, but otherwise no one disturbs you.&#xA;We were here with our 30 feet RV, the gravel street to here is sometimes a bit uneven, but  it goes easy.&#xA;&#xA;A lot of space for about 5 RV&#39;s.&#xA;&#xA;Enjoy!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193000 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
