 <wpt lat="45.605775" lon="-73.679896">
  <ele>23.033328687772155</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hidden parking lot next to trail</name>
  <desc>This is Bois Papineau, a large forest with trails. To get here there is a parking lot that is situated behind an old folks home and a police station. The parking lot is big! People come here early to walk on the trails with their dogs, most of them unleashed. Everything is quiet here and no signs of no overnight parking. It’s quite hidden and away from the noise. Laval is clean, you will find stores, restaurants nearby, and clinics if needed. Pharmacy is close too. If you would like to go on the trails, there are different ones. The most common one is the one crossing the train tracks. A lot of people come here during the day so you’ll see. No one bothers. This is a calm area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193035 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
