  <desc>Gravelled boatlaunch with no anti camping signs. Grassy areas around the edges and a dock with small sand beach spots. people seem to camp by the waterfall and the bus parking lot as well. hard to get tent pegs into the ground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193066 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
