  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kiskatinaw old curve bridge</name>
  <desc>Close to the bridge there is a dirt road on the right. There is small place to park your van. This spot is hidden from the road and you will get more privacy that the other spots in the area. You will be also enough far of the highway to not to much hear the traffic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193110 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
