 <wpt lat="49.306980" lon="-124.265850">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-03-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Industrial Way, Parksville, BC</name>
  <desc>The Industrial Way area of Parksville BC is an industrial park area. There&#39;s lots of streets in this industrial park area that are great for overnight parking. Pick a spot and stay the night. Great for trucks and campers, motorhomes and trucks and trailers. It only takes a few minutes of driving around the area to find a good spot for the night. The shops and businesses in this area usually close at 5 00 PM and open again at 8 00 AM. Don&#39;t block any gates or big rig trucks or you could get asked to move. There&#39;s also parking available in this area just near the &#34;Top Bridge Park&#34; access point. Keep it clean and neat and enjoy your stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
