  <name>The Outpost at Winter Harbour </name>
  <desc>This is the only fuel you will find on the north island on the west coast. They have a fuelling dock for boats but also have a pump at road level. Be prepared to pay for it though as it’s the only gas for miles! Summer hours are daily 2pm-6pm. Winter hours Wednesday to Sunday 4pm-6pm&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193244 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
