  <ele>7.0</ele>
  <time>2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Vaudreuil-Dorion</name>
  <desc>There are no &#34;no parking&#34; signs here. We spent a quiet night along with over 30 cars (why are cars always parked at Wal-Mart?), there were 3 semi-trucks and two other campers. One of the semis left around midnight and caused some noise but otherwise super quiet. &#xA;&#xA;There&#39;s wifi signals from Wal-Mart and Reno Depot. Both relatively strong.&#xA;&#xA;Take care and good luck.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193260 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
