  <name>Giant Tiger Parking lot</name>
  <desc>Spent one night in the parking lot here , the road traffic seems to quiet down around 10pm and tends to start early , if you’re a light sleeper this might not be the place for you but it will do in a pinch , possibly a better place to stay at the boat launch just as you enter town .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193328 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
