  <name>Kahnawake Brewery </name>
  <desc>A parking lot good for all size RVs, in front of the brewery. After a couple glasses of beer, we asked if OK to park overnight. The staffs were happy to agree. After more beer, we had a nice sleep there. it is close to highway, a little noisy, but not too much in night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-20 12:22:58 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193385 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
