  <desc>This was where the Marguerite ferry used to cross. (Out of service since 2003) it is now a dead-end gravel road with nobody close and easy access to the Fraser River.&#xA;Excellent Cell Service here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 09:29:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193435 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
