 <wpt lat="50.726817" lon="-121.277405">
  <ele>285.30780029296875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ashcroft Legacy Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Cute, well maintained municipal campground right on the Thompson River. Some full service for $35 a night, power only $20. That includes free showers (a blessing after a few days on the road) super clean washrooms, free WiFi and new coin-operated laundry machines. You also get to explore this adorable little town by foot, and a fantastic restaurant a block away if you don&#39;t want to cook that night. Not very private, but for a nice night in a cool town...totally worth it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
