 <wpt lat="49.185710" lon="-123.987400">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Island Diesel Way, Nanaimo BC.</name>
  <desc>Island Diesel Way is a street just off Boxwood road in Nanaimo. It&#39;s a fairly quiet street in an industrial park area. The road is good for overnight street parking in your RV, camper van, truck and camper. Semi trucks often park here overnight. Don&#39;t park too close to any gates and don&#39;t block any trucks and you should not have any issues. Most of the shops and businesses in this area usually close at 5 00 PM and open again at 8 00 AM. Enjoy your stay!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193751 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
