  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.724022" lon="-99.913580">
  <ele>451.1426225285977</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 10:08:44 UTC</time>
  <name>Brandon Hills recreation area </name>
  <desc>A quiet entrance road leading to the Brandon Hills Recreation Area with plenty of parking on either side of the road .&#xA;I camped here September 27 /22 on a beautiful fall day so the area is well used during daylight hours with mtn bikers , hikers , and joggers , but once the sun went down I had the place to myself .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 10:08:44 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193827 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
