 <wpt lat="49.203400" lon="-124.004400">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hayes Road, Nanaimo BC</name>
  <desc>Hayes Road is a dead end street in a fairly quiet industrial park area. Good for overnight parking in your truck, van, trailer or motorhome. You can park right next to the &#34;Return It Center&#34; or near &#34;Budget Rent A Truck and Storage&#34;.  Don&#39;t block any gates or other trucks in the area and you should have no issues. Most of the shops and businesses in this area close at 5 00 PM and open again at 8 00 AM. Keep it clean and neat and enjoy your stay!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193841 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
