  <ele>745.349609375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 15:21:36 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop at MP 1295.</name>
  <desc>Pulloff about a quarter mile south/east of the Teslin River bridge. A couple of rusted truck bodies are left from the Alcan construction. Lots of space and information about the construction of the river. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 15:21:36 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193847 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
