 <wpt lat="46.433186" lon="-80.916241">
  <ele>233.16806533560157</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mine Mill CAW Campground</name>
  <desc>Right next to Carol’s. $45/night for 30 amp pull through spot. Potable water in sites. Free wifi. &#xA;Gates to site close at 8pm, you will have to ask for a fob key and deposit $20 if you want to go in and out.&#xA;No privacy but okay for one night. Some long term trailers set up.&#xA;Right on Richard Lake. Beach, soccer field, dog beach also.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/193856 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
