  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Back-Up to Lundbreck</name>
  <desc>Directly off the road just passed Lundbreck provincial campground. We arrived after the campground closed for the season, drove up the road and found this huge and pretty level gravel site. Train tracks in behind, but who can complain when there’s nowhere else? Off grid-dry camping. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194041 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
