 <wpt lat="55.063721" lon="-117.813983">
  <ele>642.0458984375</ele>
  <time>2022-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Swan Lake - Municipal District of Greenview</name>
  <desc>Quiet campground about 6 miles off the main highway.  Great dark skies, no gas powered boats, some cell service, free campfire wood, and great Starlink service.  $20 CAD&#xA;&#xA;Fourteen sites, some water front.  We fit our 37&#39; travel trailer in the section near the lake and had great solar at site #9. No hiking trails, but quiet gravel road to walk. Lots of waterfowl on the lake and it is stocked with Rainbow Trout.  Blue Green Algae bloom right now.  &#xA;&#xA;Trash and recycling along with vault toilets.  No water. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194047 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
