 <wpt lat="49.360275" lon="-122.225848">
  <ele>433.69097900390625</ele>
  <time>2022-10-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>the spot with no trash</name>
  <desc>Along these logging roads there were tons of places to camp, but they were all littered with garbage. This area is well-used.&#xA;&#xA;The camp itself is nice a wide. Find the clearing on the right side of the road. &#xA;&#xA;Be warned, sections of this logging road are very rough, with lots of big potholes. The drive is challenging even in dry weather (but doable)&#xA;&#xA;Two bars of cell service. Although the map shows it&#39;s almost directly on the lake, the trees are so thick that we couldn&#39;t find it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194425 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
