  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gull Lake Campground </name>
  <desc>Excellent facility. Just $5 for non-guests. Rinse water with hose. Water itself is potable but you should use your own hose. Garbage dumpster and recycle bins on site. Wifi is open and not too bad. Open seasonally May 15 to October 15. Camping sites are $20 with no services or $35 with water and 30A.&#xA;&#xA;https://gulllakesk.ca/recreation/campground/&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194466 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
