 <wpt lat="52.023771" lon="-124.994948">
  <ele>929.5443548671901</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Terra Nostra Campground</name>
  <desc>A very special site with incredible direct view of the lake and the mountains. If you are lucky, you meet the very friendly horses around your campsite. Many possibilities and activities; canoeing or kajaking, hiking, fishing or even horseback riding.  I spent several days here and enjoyed also a spectacular guided ride with a quad and with a side x side into the Canadian wilderness. The ranch also has several cabins and from May to mid of October you can join the guest ranch for breakfast and an excellent dinner in a very friendly family atmosphere.  Six campsites  with picnic tables, fire place and a shower house.  Free Wifi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194635 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
