  <ele>158.75382646080106</ele>
  <time>2023-11-01 09:09:03 UTC</time>
  <name>Under bridge parking </name>
  <desc>There is an actual parking lot good for daytime and a vast dirt area underneath the bridge that can be good for overnights. No complaints for 3 nights but I would suggest to park in the parking lot during the day. &#xA;&#xA;Lovely park and trails near by. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-01 09:09:03 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194637 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
