  <desc>We took in a show at Centre 200 and we and other overlanders and RVs were permitted to stay overnight in the parking lot for the centre.  No services available and not suitable for ground tents.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
