 <wpt lat="49.803936" lon="-104.168171">
  <ele>582.9855267638341</ele>
  <time>2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yellow Grass Municipal Campground. </name>
  <desc>8 clean well -kept grassy sites, electricity and water at each. Toilets and running water in bathrooms. No shower.  Away from the highway and railway. $20 Canadian for the night. Looks like a little gem&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194691 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
