  <ele>711.499267578125</ele>
  <time>2022-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Thompson River Access</name>
  <desc>Wide gravel river bank with level dirt road and fire ring.  The highway is near but the noise is ok.  Stay up on the paved access road if the clearance makes you nervous. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194796 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
