 <wpt lat="45.048403" lon="-65.064579">
  <ele>45.117104458622634</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Margaretsville picnic ground</name>
  <desc>a level parking area right in the middle of the village with a number of picnic tables and even a porta potty. I parked here overnight in my VW Westy with no problem. I had intended to camp at the Wharf by the water which I have done before but it was under construction. this was a nice fall back solution and aside from the street lights at night it&#39;s a nice spot. you are surrounded by houses or buildings on each side.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194908 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
