 <wpt lat="49.649399" lon="-124.019704">
  <ele>-2.653594970703125</ele>
  <time>2022-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull Out next to Garden Bay Lake</name>
  <desc>This is a Pull Out next to the lake. i saw smaller ones along the road, but this one is relatively spacious.&#xA;&#xA;Only parallel parking, i would guess 4 9m Vehicles could comfortably fit in at this spot. There are no signs prohibiting arking.&#xA;&#xA;I stayed there for one night and nothing happend. Was silent but a little bit of traffic will be there. Toady was Thanksgiving, so dont know how it will be on work days. &#xA;&#xA;There are residential housings close, so keep quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/194918 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
