 <wpt lat="45.331613" lon="-75.870245">
  <ele>78.114501953125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 07:20:54 UTC</time>
  <name>Wesley Clover Parks Campground </name>
  <desc>Great campground under trees. By the highway 417, so we hear trafic. Wifi at the office. Large and private sites.&#xA;Be advised. There was a 50$ refundable security deposit taken on my credit card. It was never refunded and no answers to my email and phone calls. The campground is closed for winter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 07:20:54 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195055 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
