 <wpt lat="49.835464" lon="-119.972869">
  <ele>1257.882716071792</ele>
  <time>2022-10-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peachland Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Beautiful lake about a 30 min drive from town. Large flat open area lakeside with a few picnic tables and fire pits. One pit toilet up the hill. Small gravel boat launch. Free and we had no problem getting in with our 6x12 cargo trailer and the 4 runner, though the last bit was slow going, very bumpy but passable. Many ATV/dirt bike trails around 5 or so close by lakes and tons of random single sites around the lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195104 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
