  <ele>356.71487285755575</ele>
  <time>2022-10-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kelowna Urban Farm and RV Park</name>
  <desc>Kelowna Urban Farm and RV Park offers fully serviced, drive-thru RV stalls, in a landscape setting surrounded by trees, ponds, and vegetable gardens, yet in close proximity to downtown Kelowna.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195120 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
