  <ele>434.8257751464844</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel piles </name>
  <desc>Nice site off highway left turn if heading west on 37A on short road, that leads to concrete barriers then left turn down to a nice flat area with small gravel surface and two piles of gravel. Good view of glaciers and water falls. Enjoy! &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195124 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
