  <ele>94.30511698223626</ele>
  <time>2022-10-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Avonmore Oasis Camping</name>
  <desc>Great open spot surrounded by trees, fire pits, pond, camping benches, portapotty, showers and running water. RV’s/camper vans and tents allowed. Owner super helpful and easy going. No wifi but there is a fine phone signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
