 <wpt lat="55.346455" lon="-118.771528">
  <ele>715.1771421125159</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 16:25:22 UTC</time>
  <name>Sexsmith Heritage Park  </name>
  <desc>Really nice campground right in Sexsmith.  Shower and toilets building, playground and mini golf you can bring your own putters and golf balls also has a little pond that is stocked with fish. There’s walking trails leading to the gas station up the hill and sell amazing fresh sandwiches and the other end of the trail can take you past the elementary and high school and lead you on a nice walk to explore the town of Sexsmith. I’m pretty positive you have to pay $25 a night but not too sure I stayed 2 nights now and haven’t seen anyone to pay and we are packed up and our way out&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 16:25:22 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195150 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
