  <ele>567.40869140625</ele>
  <time>2022-10-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside sandy clearance</name>
  <desc>Open sandy area within the woods next to the river with a few fire pits. Located 70m off the fire road, along a winding track with a few tree stumps, not suitable for big rigs. Track is loose sand so 4x4 and high clearance is needed.   No &#34;no camping&#34; signs. Lots of firewood. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195228 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
