  <desc>$6.85 gives access to all facilities (sauna, pool,  showers.)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195231 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
