  <name>creek</name>
  <desc>Small pullout off the fsr with creek access. Located just before the 6km mark. Few mountain biking trails to the left and right of the road. There&#39;s another pullout 50m above the first pullout where the &#39;Sechelt boys gulch fsr&#39;. The second pullout has a flatter surface  as well&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195335 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
