  <ele>1145.133544921875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lambly Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Provincial park campground with flattened pitches, metal fire pits, compost toilet, amazing views of the lake. 20+ pitches available. no phone signal.&#xA;$15 per night per pitch. A warden is meant to come around to collect payment but no one turned up during our 1 night stay. Lots of coyotes/wolves howling through the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195347 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
