  <ele>312.463520295918</ele>
  <time>2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tuti’s Pond</name>
  <desc>Wonderful flat and quite level sandy site, overlooking Tuti’s pond. Great sunset and sunrise. Quiet and with a bonus of 3-4 bars of cell/internet service. Good phone service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195355 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
