  <ele>57.8302001953125</ele>
  <time>2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>off 431 around Lomond/Bonne Bay are</name>
  <desc>small dirt grass area on the river bend, close to road. looks like a local fishing spot. river access, quiet and pretty scene, except for day traffic on 431. peaceful night, bugs not bad, somewhat wind protected. Great for motorcycle/bicycle camping, small rigs, tight turn around - no big rigs&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195362 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
