 <wpt lat="47.058433" lon="-84.761241">
  <ele>189.56527506187558</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake Superior, Ontario</name>
  <desc>Shore of Lake Superior on west side of highway 17, just south of Agawa Rocks. Near the 1148km marker.&#xA;Camping is actually encouraged here with a sign indicating you must remove all your garbage and look after your own waste in a responsible manner. There are no facilities here at all.&#xA;There are several spots with direct access to the lake and the most amazing view!&#xA;Some road noise but should quiet down at night. &#xA;Look for a gravel road leading off the highway and a white and green sign indicating it’s ok to camp here. &#xA;&#xA;No cell service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195421 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
