 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="46.332539" lon="-72.553796">
  <ele>10.256727760657668</ele>
  <time>2024-04-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Lot of Pavillon St- Arnaud</name>
  <desc>This parking lot is next door the a beautiful park ( Parc Pie Xii) that had two nice water features, beach volleyball courts, basketball hoops and lots of green space and picnic tables to use. &#xA;There’s a red portapotty near the baseball diamond and lots of garbage cans around. The bonus is there are flush toilets in the small white building beside the basketball hoops!  &#xA;These bathrooms get locked up at night but the portapotty is left open. &#xA;We stayed here two nights without any issue at all but I would suggest no more than one or two vehicles could stay here overnight without drawing attention. &#xA;It’s a beautiful park, please keep it that way by taking care of your garbage etc!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195429 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="45.652713" lon="-61.444327">
  <ele>6.468491317129729</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canso causeway fire hall. </name>
  <desc>The fire hall is across the street from Petro Canada and Tim Hortons. &#xA;Please knock on the door and ask permission first if possible. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195433 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
  <extensions>
