 <wpt lat="42.649708" lon="-81.556023">
  <ele>193.52142333984375</ele>
  <time>2024-04-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>ONroute West Lorne</name>
  <desc>Official rest area, with separate parking for trucks / RV&#39;s.&#xA;&#xA;When we arrived late at night, the truck side was overflowing so we parked on the (nearly empty) car side. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195604 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
