  <ele>51.9405517578125</ele>
  <time>2022-10-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>free water</name>
  <desc>tap at the rear of parking lot in front of washrooms, can back up van and fill with hose. also tap in lot in front of icecream shop but there might be cars parked there&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195629 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
