  <name>Horsting&#39;s Farm Market</name>
  <desc>Touristy but worth a stop. They also have a nice seating area outside and a cafe with pasties and sweets.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195636 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
