 <wpt lat="49.989577" lon="-117.892549">
  <ele>432.9400291442871</ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burton beach</name>
  <desc>Access to a huge beach area. No signs for no camping. Would be windy and Arrow Lake is managed by a dam with changing water levels but close to the road in would be fine. You can drive on the beach. Lovely! Access off Lower McCormack Rd or Robazzo Rd. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195642 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
