 <wpt lat="43.700883" lon="-79.735183">
  <ele>175.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brampton 410/ Clark Boulevard</name>
  <desc>it is a carpool parking lot. It&#39;s pretty quiet at night. I&#39;m on my second night here. Well-lit, store or mall across the road, gas station on the east side of the 410, some noise but to be expected. No issues staying here overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195648 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
