 <wpt lat="50.345316" lon="-120.586884">
  <ele>1519.6742471866874</ele>
  <time>2022-10-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bob Lake West Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Decent recreation site, a bit remote, small. Only 3 sites. The access road is very difficult and requires good tires, high clearance and ideally 4x4. Google Maps directions are wrong. First navigate to 50.337942,-120.610300 and take a left. This is where the worst part of the road begins. Some phone service on Bell and Rogers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/195661 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
