  <ele>1300.163301887922</ele>
  <time>2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Backcountry ski area</name>
  <desc>Further up the FSR from the “off highway” stop listed nearby. This spot has great views/sunsets and the FSR is super easy to navigate. Worth driving up even if just for a night. This area also seems to be the kicking off point for some backcountry skiing according to a nearby trail sign. Still no snow as of October 20th so no one is out here. Cell signal outside our van but none inside. Starlink works perfect here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/196293 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
