  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-10-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J Travel Center</name>
  <desc>While mainly for big rigs, there is overnight parking allowed here. We are 20&#39; and could park to the side of the building (on the Subway side) where there are two picnic tables and two garbage bins on a small grassed area next to the parking spots. Very level. We went in and purchased some items and confirmed it was okay to park there overnight. The roads nearby were loud with trucks but none were driving right by our vehicle so it was less of a disturbance. There&#39;s free wifi, average at best by your vehicle where parked but a little better in store.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/196307 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
