  <time>2022-10-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Badger Brook Walking Trail and Gazebo</name>
  <desc>This is a running track, basketball court, BBQ, pavilion, recreation area. There is a brook with unsupervised swimming hole. You can park overnight in the parking lot. You can access it by driving behind the Lion&#39;s community center.&#xA;&#xA;In September, there are lots of partridge berries in the surrounding hills. A road continues past the park to various ponds. Muskrat Gully, Long Pond, Badger Pond, Duck Pond, Round Pond, Rushy Pond, Big Island Pond.&#xA;&#xA;Cellphone service  is ok.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/196670 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
