  <ele>1122.3565902896225</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Duffy Lake boat ramp</name>
  <desc>Nice, flat but relatively small area immediately above the bit ramp than will accommodate several smaller campers/truck house’s like mine. Fabulous views of the lake and surrounding mountains. There are no facilities or cell service whatsoever. Also, it’s a very popular spot for travellers/tourists to stop and stretch their legs and take some pictures, but none ever seem to stick around for long. No signage anywhere I can see prohibiting overnight stays so here I am for the night!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/196866 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
