 <wpt lat="47.111776" lon="-55.092414">
  <ele>4.7308396911248565</ele>
  <time>2022-10-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>4x4 Camp at Duricle Cove/ Little Duricle Pond </name>
  <desc>An off roading/ hiking route that is about 2.5km off the main road. If you’re on All Trail it’s the Fox Cox to Beau avoid OHV trail route. A few differnt spots to pull off but if you make it to Duricle Cove it’s stunning- spots to park right on the pebble beach, have a fire. Stunning sun rise in the morning. Fascinating spot where fresh water runs into the ocean.&#xA;Definitely requires 4x4. &#xA;If you stay on the grab on the cliff above the beach there’s one flat spot for a tent but we rooftop tent on the beach!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197048 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
