 <wpt lat="50.782281" lon="-119.778586">
  <ele>524.5964024206623</ele>
  <time>2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Niskonlith Lake Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Great camp ground. Quiet. Sites are all along the lake. Pretty long gravel road to get up here and slim in some spots but my camper van had no issues. $13 a night! Trucks and medium trailers are up here as well. Apparently this lake is known for good fishing as well! Beautiful spot, very happy we made the drive up the road! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197157 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
