  <ele>9.191259431652725</ele>
  <time>2023-09-08 12:25:20 UTC</time>
  <name>Hubbards Town Wharf</name>
  <desc>$1 (Loonie) gets you a 10-minute long hot and clean shower!! Open 24/7. Look for building #20, which has two restrooms on the end and a washroom and office on the side. The shower is in the washroom.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 12:25:20 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
