 <wpt lat="43.764291" lon="-65.336412">
  <ele>3.9323635874316096</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Islands Provincial Park-Off Season </name>
  <desc>Stayed just outside the park in a decently flat lot. Was suggested to come here from a local lady in Shelburne. Came here in the off season and had no issue staying outside the gates. You can go walk in the park and it’s beautiful. Was here on a Saturday so there were a few people driving around in the evening but overall  very quiet night. Locals use this place to walk around during the day and Kayak. No amenities as everything is closed but it’s a safe spot to stay when traveling in off season! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197159 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
