 <wpt lat="50.454941" lon="-105.818185">
  <ele>567.752685546875</ele>
  <time>2022-10-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>The Beacon/Husky Station</name>
  <desc>Gas, restaurant, convenience store, and washrooms. There is a single shower here for $5, take as long as you like, and bring your own towels. It’s a lot like that old bathroom in your basement, but your guests use it so you know it does the job. It comes complete with a noisy utility room on the other side of the wall. Hey, the shower is hot with good pressure and there are handy shelves inside the stall. While you’re there, plug into the outlets on the left side of the building and charge up the batteries. It’s right on the highway but you could park for the night if the noise doesn’t bother you. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197203 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
