 <wpt lat="56.093404" lon="-129.472492">
  <ele>271.9927101135254</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>At the river by the bridge </name>
  <desc>Right along the river, access by the bridge, the first part is a flat area suitable for small campers. A little further the road narrows but is suitable for a SUV or pick up truck - one spot here no visible from the road. We spent a night here. View of the river and surrounding mountains. We could here the river and a few trucks from the road. This is bear country, and there was evidence of bears around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197340 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
