  <desc>Cameron’s Mobile Mechanic Service.&#xA;The main shop is for commercial and heavy equipment. They fix anything. We had a nail in a tire of our SUV, and they sent us a couple of blocks to a secondary location. Our tire was fixed two hours later. Very helpful.&#xA;www.cmms-mechanic.ca&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197342 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
