  <desc>28&#39; motorhome will fit but no one else. beautiful place right on the shoreline. road to the lighthouse. made a campfire on the rocks at the ocean at night and watched the sunrise on the east coast of the Atlantic in the morning! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
