 <wpt lat="45.947986" lon="-72.447478">
  <ele>44.44963759675809</ele>
  <time>2022-10-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving Drivers Lounge</name>
  <desc>I saw this location was marked previously, however I thought that I would make a new post and add that it is a full driver&#39;s lounge and the parking lot is massive! Safe to say Irving is our favorite Fuel or rest stop in Canada. Very clean , Large showers , Laundry , Wine and Beer store , snacks and all roadside vehicles necessities.  A&amp;W as well ( Closed Sundays ).  We parked at the far outside of the lot to keep our trailer out of sight for the evening but didn&#39;t hear anyone close through the night, just traffic in the distance &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197745 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
