  <ele></ele>
  <time>2022-10-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>122 Avenue, Dawson Creek, BC</name>
  <desc>This is street parking, behind the Days Inn on 122 Avenue. Some other semi trucks were parked there, with the drivers sleeping in their rigs. So I stayed the night parked in-line with them at the roadside. I had a quiet night&#39;s sleep and I was not disturbed by anyone. I was originally going to stay at the Dawson Creek Walmart. But there is a big sign that says overnight parking is prohibited.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/197748 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
