  <name>Sunset Community Centre</name>
  <desc>FREE &amp; HOT Showers!! &#xA;At this pretty new community centre are a gym, showers and washrooms located. &#xA;After a lovely chat at the front desk I found out that the washrooms and the showers are free of charge. The gym prolly not… &#xA;Nevertheless, Men &amp; Women have separate change rooms, showers etc. The showers are private-ish, but clean and everything in excellent condition!! Also water is quite hot, perfect for these colder months, and has a good pressure ;)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/199995 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
