  <desc>There are FREE &amp; HOT showers at this community centre. Not much privacy within the showers, but when I was there basically no one else was there…&#xA;They seem quite modern and are super clean, the washrooms as well. Water has good pressure and a lot of heat as well (adjustable). Very conveniently located in the downtown area and also not far from the downtown overnight spot!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 13:37:42 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/199996 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
