  <name>Shawville, Quebec - Mill Dam Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful park with about six full service sites for $20/night.  Free tent camping for three nights (see photo of sign).  Toilets. Dump station and &#34;spring water&#34; available.  Dump station is $5 by donation. &#xA;&#xA;Lovely splash pad for the kids, on a small creek.  Picnic tables.   Worth the stop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/201556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
