 <wpt lat="49.243340" lon="-123.104350">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riley park on E30th avenue</name>
  <desc>AMAZING spot in Vancouver. It&#39;s a quiet street, there&#39;s a 24hr Breka cafe right down the street, a fantastic community centre with hot-tubs, a sauna, a steam room and a LAZY RIVER, and bathrooms in the park open till around 8pm. We stayed here for a week or so with no issues while we were waiting for a mechanic and it was a life saver because we didn&#39;t need to move much for anything. There was one other van with us so we felt safe. The only caveat was a &#34;no-stopping&#34; sign only on Saturdays from 7:30-3:30pm, so not a big deal. Please take care of this spot and try not to draw any attention from the residents. More and more spots are closing down nowadays so spots like these are few and far in between.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/202198 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
