  <name>Hank Snow museum FREE RV park</name>
  <desc>Please DO NOT change this icon to establish campground. If one is searching for a free spot, they would not check this icon on the filter, thus missing out on this spot. Someone did that to the current 2 on the map. there is no intelligence in that. It is Xmas eve. Only one here.The AC outlets on the buildings not working. The AC outlets on the 2 light poles are working.... a welcome Xmas gift. PLEASE leave filter icon category as &#34;INFORMAL CAMPSITE&#34;. Summer facilities may be different. enjoy!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/202818 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
