  <name>Nickel plate Nordic centre</name>
  <desc>we cane here for cross country skiing on a Friday in December, and stayed Thursday and Friday night without any issue. we tucked in in the corner. the nordic centre closes at 3, so I&#39;d wait to park up until 4 or later, and keep within your camper. there are no garbage bins, but there are toilets once you pass the ticket scanner (day pass required).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-12-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/203463 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
