  <desc>Tent,  sleeping bag, rain jacks, propane canister, &#xA;best available products from the top brands in the Outdoors.&#xA;Patagonia, Arc’teryx, The North Face, Canada Goose, Fjallraven, Smartwool, Icebreaker, Vuori, Kuhl, Prana, Lole, Outdoor Research, Toad &amp; Co, Royal Robbins, Tretorn and Duer. Hiking and walking footwear from Blundstone, Oboz, Salomon, Lowa, Birkenstock, Keen, and Bogs. Winter sports equipment for alpine and nordic ski, and snowshoeing. Camping gear and paddle sports equipment, with all the related accessories fill up the store in the spring and summer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/203543 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
