 <wpt lat="49.341990" lon="-113.144219">
  <ele>1108.2951700378126</ele>
  <time>2022-09-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wally&#39;s Beach Campground</name>
  <desc>This unserviced Provincial campground is accessed by gravel road and situated on the shore of St. Mary Reservoir.  A few campsites have shade trees but most have small, newly planted trees.&#xA;There are picnic tables and fire rings in each campsite.  There is an outhouse, as well as garbage and recycling bins.  A hand pump provides non-potable water.&#xA;There’s a nice, big sandy beach.&#xA;Two bars of LTE cellular signal.&#xA;In 2022, it was $24/night.&#xA;(Two other Provincial campgrounds are located nearby, closer to Highway 505.)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/203871 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
