 <wpt lat="45.482420" lon="-75.532980">
  <ele>109.6</ele>
  <time>2023-01-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bilberry drive</name>
  <desc>Street parking overnight, close to park. Only need to worry about winter storm parking bans. Right next to park. Walking trails along Ottawa river close by. I have also camped in that area in a tent but it is a very popular area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/204096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
