  <desc>Great place for an overnight stay right on the ocean, spectacular views. Please be careful as it’s all gravel and few potholes along the way. For trailers it might be bit tough to make a turn.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/204545 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
