  <ele>388.4066275709879</ele>
  <time>2023-01-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street parking near park and industrial streets</name>
  <desc>Another option of safe street parking near Jack Brown park, also marked as a street parking in iOverlander. Stayed two nights and days in a row without moving, and nobody bothered us. A few passer-by walking their dogs or jogging, and very few cars, even on early working morning days. Do quiet! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/204575 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
