  <desc>Randy with his team is very helpful and looks after his customers with great friendliness and a lot of dedication to their job. We are so lucky that we met this mechanic.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/204885 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
