 <wpt lat="49.688183" lon="-116.002886">
  <ele>1233.860684379004</ele>
  <time>2023-01-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Upper ski resort parking</name>
  <desc>Winter overnight camper parking at Kimberly Alpine Resort. We stayed 2 nights midweek, incredibly chill. A few other vans/truck campers but we have a trailer and there was plenty of room. No amenities but good cell service and the ski hill is 2min walk for the lifts, coffee shop, cafeteria, etc. I have seen this place on a busy holiday weekend and it’s hard to find parking but there’s the usual 4PM empty parking lot if you’re patient. Ski bums, this spot is ideally for you. Passers-through could safely spend a chill night here if needed. &#xA;Directions: when approaching the resort, turn right at the big Kimberly Resort sign and then another right quickly after through a neighborhood of nice fancy houses. Follow that road down through the ski base and up into the upper lot, where the road dead ends. Keep snow removal procedures in mind when parking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/205180 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
