  <ele>660.2</ele>
  <time>2023-01-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canadian Tire Leduc Service Centre</name>
  <desc>Very friendly and helpful. They were able to fit us in between their appointments when our ambulance conversion broke down suddenly. They have a lift for up to a 26&#39; (Class C) RV sized vehicle. Actual bill ended up being less than the quoted us and vehicle was ready a day earlier than anticipated. Great experience considering the circumstances!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-01-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/206148 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
