  <ele>1445.2</ele>
  <time>2024-01-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Complex Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Parked up next to PetSmart. Spot felt pretty tucked away, around the left side of the building.&#xA;&#xA;It was for sure loud as you are directly next to the hwy but it felt a bit more private than the other parking lots suggested in the area.&#xA;&#xA;Free wifi from PetSmart and walked down to the cinema for the eve.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/206376 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
