  <desc>Nice spot for a hot shower. Initially paid $2 but when I left I got it back. I and they were not sure if it cost anything. I&#39;m sure the next time they will know. Maybe phone first. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/206605 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
