 <wpt lat="49.112270" lon="-121.627610">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Foley Creek FSR Creekside Site</name>
  <desc>A decent site for small to medium vans or campers. Would not recommend for tenting as the site is very rocky. Access via Foley Creek FSR is pretty rough and potholed. 4x4 with ground clearance recommended. We had to back in to the site and it was a tight squeeze for the Sprinter, but we were able to level the van on the site. No cellular coverage. There was a premade rock fire ring on the site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/206888 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
