  <ele>34.00482177734375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chattell Rd Pullout</name>
  <desc>Small pullout on Chattell Rd. Next to hwy 19 Exit to Parksville. Follow chattell rd to go check out Top Bridge Community Park. Stayed here for almost a week with no problem or warnings. No No Camping&#34; signs. Small walking trails nearby, used by locals.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/207022 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
