  <ele>26.539365825243294</ele>
  <time>2024-03-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull off Hwy 1</name>
  <desc>*Overnight camping/parking is NOT available at this location.&#xA;.....&#xA;Few spots on pull off along hwy 1z. Lots of road noise, shady and alongside beautiful creek with wooden pedestrian bridge across to trail.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/207587 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
