  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gooseberry Campground</name>
  <desc>Great little campground in Kananaskis country, not far from Bragg Creek. Has both tenting and RV sites. There is some noise from the highway especially at the Texas gate when cars cross. If you get a spot on the side near the river, you can&#39;t hear the noise. Cell coverage is hit and miss, depending on where your site is. Potable water and dump station is outside the campground across the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/212207 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
