  <ele>199.15817260742188</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Large empty lot</name>
  <desc>Large empty lot, single dirt road access near Chippewa river bridge (small hump in road before entrance). Partial asphalt/gravel/grass. Lot is extremely flat and plenty of trees provide privacy from highway. No signs of recent campers and no “no camping” or “private property” signs. Big enough for multiple rigs. Lot is roughly 1.5 acres. No amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/212496 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
