  <desc>We met friends for dinner here - good value steakhouse. We made reservations and stopped by earlier in the day to ask if we could stay overnight in the parking lot (small travel trailer). The server checked with the manager who said it was OK. We initially parked back in the far corner, and the server suggested moving closer to the building!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/213980 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
