 <wpt lat="49.894442" lon="-118.124113">
  <ele>584.0486107266094</ele>
  <time>2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whatshan Lake Rd</name>
  <desc>Nice parking area for 2 rigs right off Whatshan Lake Rd and only a short distance from the Needles Ferry terminal. Right beside a beautiful little river with a fire pit. Below the Hwy 6 bridge, so it can have some noise with ferry traffic, but it is very quiet at night. Please respect this place and take your garbage with you to keep places like this open. &#xA;Previously noted to have weak WiFi, I wasn&#39;t able to detect it. but I got weak cell service here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/215646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
