  <desc>Nice quiet place, you can stay on left of the road, near of trash. Not on grass&#xA;&#xA;Front of river, really beautiful.&#xA;&#xA;There is another place registered but we don&#39;t find it, too many snow, not open.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/215650 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
