  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-04-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Unnamed lake</name>
  <desc>No amenities, but a beautiful little lake. Very popular with OHV as there are powerlines and many well site roads. Several nice sites along the north side of the lake but somewhat off-road. The road itself is short but quite rough. Take your time. For larger rigs, there are open grassy areas across the road, and more open areas near the power lines farther East.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/215954 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
