  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>This small 14 site jewel is extremely beautiful as is situated along a small tributary to the Chilliwack River. The site is popular with hikers and has access to the Trans Canada, and other very popular local trails.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/216063 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
