  <ele>607.6837158203125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Overflow RV parking - Visitor Center </name>
  <desc>I was told by the woman working at the Visitor center that this is overflow RV parking, and it&#39;s good for 24 hrs as is the Visitor Center, but it&#39;s level here.  It is an empty parking lot beside China Wok (closed permanently) is marked with 24 hr RV parking signs, but one was still covered.  I am the only one here tonight, but it&#39;s only April. Walking distance to lots of stuff. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/216603 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
