  <desc>Large campsite with toilets, showers, and water. &#xA;Each camp has a bench and fire pit. $35 a night per party. Warden comes round to collect payment. Firewood for sale for $10.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/217656 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
