  <ele>984.554931640625</ele>
  <time>2023-04-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bench meadow</name>
  <desc>Easy to access spot with a roomy feel in an open meadow with a little creek surrounded by trees. Outhouse with missing door and a shower room, fire pit and a nice wooden bench. Not right at the river, but in earshot. Pretty quiet, just the drumming of the grouse as a sign of spring. No cell reception in the whole area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/217787 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
