  <ele>330.7013817485422</ele>
  <time>2023-04-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blind Bay Boat Launch (Informal)</name>
  <desc>Nice little spot for a night or two. Tight, steep but very short little access spur off Eagle Bay Rd. I’ve stayed here before with my VW Golf and tented on the beach and again in my 4X4 tiny truck house. Not much level ground but it’s solid and can easily be made to work. Some road noise in the afternoon but quiets down by evening. No signage whatsoever prohibiting use or overnight stays. Evidence of numerous fire rings and locals use the area for the occasional boat launch. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218054 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
