  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Monte Lake pull out</name>
  <desc>This is pull out does not have signs and is lakeside.  It’s 50m from the road and below it for a bit less road noise.  It’s a flat dirt parking lot and a nice quiet spot for the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218345 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
