  <ele>753.6312516955659</ele>
  <time>2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Morfee Lakes Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>16 sites with picnic tables and fire rings. 2 minute walk to the swimming area on the lake. Potable water and an outhouse. You could fit a schoolie in the sites if you really wanted to. Direct access to biking/hiking trails. First two nights are free as a tourist - then it is $10.50/night. Rules and payment info are posted on outhouse.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218402 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
