  <ele>500.1348876207255</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canada Games Aquatic Centre </name>
  <desc>A nice rec centre with pool, hot tub, steam room and sauna. Also nice hot private shower/changing rooms. Regular entry is $8.20. &#xA;&#xA;On Mon-Fri 6-7am is early bird swim and 11:30-12:30 is Liquid lunch. Cheaper at $4.25.&#xA;&#xA;No RV parking unfortunately.&#xA;&#xA;All in all, great for a shower on the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218452 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
