  <time>2023-04-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kilby Historic Site</name>
  <desc>41 camp spots along Fraser River. 7 are first come first served, all others can be reserved online. We paid $40 CAD for waterfront site. Nice sandy beach to enjoy and walks along the dikes and farm roads. Historic site and store nearby. Pit toilets and three water taps.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
