 <wpt lat="48.652899" lon="-94.186886">
  <ele>351.1477918147499</ele>
  <time>2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Morely Park</name>
  <desc>Small picnic area with picnic tables, benches and pit toilets. No potable water. it is public access to Rainy River. Lots of weeds at boat launch but a kayak could do it. Located at the end of a long road. Plenty of room to turn around. There are no signs with rules except those governing the boat launch. Very quiet and secluded right now ( Wednesday midday).  Peaceful camping unless you were worried about nobody being close. So nice to see some turtles.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/218745 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
