  <desc>I am the owner and I offer my driveway for overnight stays with a van or small trailer. The site is peaceful, has wifi, running water and electricity (120V15A).&#xA;Please communicate with me for availability. &#xA;It is located less than 1km from &#34;Sentiers du Moulin&#34;.&#xA;Feel free to communicate with me (french or english) with any question concerning the cost or amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219161 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
