  <name>Weiner Falls Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Access from Kimola Road. There is a flat gravel spot on the side of the road just before the bridge. We spent one quiet night here and no one bothered. No traffic, only heard a vehicule passing by around 8:30am. &#xA;&#xA;Nice spot to go see the Weiner Falls ! &#xA;Length : 40 minutes round trip (1.65 km)&#xA;Trailhead Coordinates: 49.28942, 124.98904 / 49°17&#39;21.9&#34;N 124°59&#39;20.5&#34;W&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219509 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
