  <ele>696.98779296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake view 250</name>
  <desc>Awesome spot with an incredible view over Kamloops Lake. Wind and sun exposed, but multiple options along Sabiston Creek Road. Fire ring, no other services. Good cell signal. Fairly good road coming in from the west.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
