 <wpt lat="48.812612" lon="-64.774378">
  <ele>46.20571517944336</ele>
  <time>2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forbes</name>
  <desc>Big gravel parking lot (for fishermen I guess) with grass on the sides. Entry direct from the main road, you can park up in the big place or drive down a small path for more privacy, a lot of space for tents too. No „no camping“ signs. Pit toilets and a picnic table, many fire places. A little hiking path to the river. We spend a quiet night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219626 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
