  <time>2023-04-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chalk River close to town</name>
  <desc>Good spot to camp out, a bit of traffic, but seems like everyone is cool. Easy access right off a used dirt road off of hwy 17 west, an RV fits here for sure with space to turn around. A couple of trucks drove by, and they didn&#39;t seem to care. People from town also camp out here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219645 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
