 <wpt lat="44.507539" lon="-77.479312">
  <ele>171.2288475036621</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whytok Park </name>
  <desc>This community area is not far off the highway and there are plenty of spots for parking… There are no &#39;no parking&#39; signs. We stayed here one night and had no issues. The next morning, the city workers came to empty the garbage bins and waved to us :)&#xA;&#xA;Madoc is a wonderful town to visit.  &#xA;&#xA;There is a community pool that was closed for the season - but may have showers and or water during the summer &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219647 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
