  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Palangio Lake</name>
  <desc>Nice spot, less than a km off the highway on a small lake.  Good road, some spots under water in spring.  Free dry camping up to 21 days.  No water, toilets, garbage cans etc.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219679 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
