  <ele>173.79443359375</ele>
  <time>2023-05-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Not Worth</name>
  <desc>If you take the long, winding back roads to get here, you will eventually come upon this Lake. It is a small lake surrounded by thick brush, you have to drive through many washed out roads and overgrown brush just to make it here and in the end the juice isn&#39;t worth the squeeze. However, if you&#39;re looking for absolute privacy this would be my pick&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219710 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
