  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cap La Ronde, next to the beach</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot, almost on the beach… place for one or two vehicles. Only accessible for little camper vans or 4x4 pickup truck campers. Lots of drift wood, so we made a campfire…&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219719 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
