  <time>2023-11-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Echo Aquatic Centre and Fitness Studio</name>
  <desc>showers are $3.25. I only went in for a shower so unsure what the day pass price is for the gym/pool. it&#39;s a nice and clean facility. the showers in the men&#39;s change area were communal, and the water pressure was good and it was a nice, warm temperature. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219777 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
