  <ele>927.74853515625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac du Bois Hills</name>
  <desc>Amazing, super quiet spot with several secluded or 360 view options. Best spot in the grasslands! It&#39;s along an off-road track, but until here only 2WD needed. Don&#39;t try with your RV though. Little ponds and lots of birds. Good cell reception. Nice evening hiking options. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219873 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
