  <ele>228.28398917987943</ele>
  <time>2024-04-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Upper Campbell Reservoir Campground</name>
  <desc>Very nice new (Feb 2021) year round campground with gravel pads, tables, waste receptacles, pit toilets beside a large reservoir with a good view of mountains - snow clad in late March.&#xA;Most sites suitable for up to 27’ trailer but there are a few very large sites. On Friday March 26, all but 4 of the 21 sites were full. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
