  <time>2023-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac De Roches Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Large paved rest area above a large lake on Hwy24. There are no camping restriction signs. Ice covered lake now (Apr 3), but very pretty in the summer. 1degree slope, right beside the road; but unlikely to have much nighttime traffic. One of the very few areas with cell service (3 bars Telus)on this highway. The price is right!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/219895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
