  <name>Off Highway 5</name>
  <desc>A small pulloff on the highway beside a small pond. Sign for turnoff merely states &#39;point of interest&#39;. Good size for car campers, but likely not suitable for anything bigger than a van. In clear view of the highway. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220044 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
