  <ele>1580.1180790547805</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Road off Hwy 3</name>
  <desc>Moderately flat campsite midway up a hill with a nice view overlooking the valley below and the mountain range in the distance. &#xA;&#xA;Has a really nice stone fire pit. No running water with two bars of cell reception &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220052 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
