 <wpt lat="46.264579" lon="-60.246786">
  <ele>5.131819344151912</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Florence Beach</name>
  <desc>Small gravel parking lot on the road down to Florence beach. Follow ‘beach’ signs to the right on the road, parking lot is on the right about half way down. Don’t drive all the way down to the beach as there is no room to turn around. Quiet spot with beautiful sandy beach. No ‘no parking’ signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220086 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
