 <wpt lat="44.521823" lon="-64.572224">
  <ele>86.54305746168096</ele>
  <time>2023-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crossroad Farm </name>
  <desc>Randy and Kenton welcomes iOverlander at the Crossroad Farm. You park at a gras ground and there is one 30amp connection available. WiFi is great and fast. Cell phone connection is weak. At there farm you can buy jams, eggs, season garden produce, cold drinks. Drinking water is just in container available. The place is quite during the night. You have to see the Action Figures Trail on the farm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220171 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
