  <ele>210.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canyon Alpine RV Park &amp; Campground </name>
  <desc>RV park and campground with 31 sites, surrounded by evergreens. Cable, internet access (unfortunately it did not work when we were there), picnic tables and fire pits. Toilets were closed because of maintenance.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220194 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
