  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mont Rigaud - Sanctuaire Trail Head</name>
  <desc>Grassy/gravely parking area just below road up to the sanctuaire. No &#34;no overnight parking&#34; sign. Stayed here in a camper van. In cellphone range and close to the town of Rigaud (great town). Great place to stop if you want to rock climb or hike on Mount Rigaud.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220198 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
