  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chem. William Tremblay</name>
  <desc>Small parking area on a rock with à beautiful view of the Saint-Laurent River.  For small vehicles only.  No services.  Can fit 2 véhicules side by side.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220424 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
