  <ele>692.8463961426169</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blueberry Road</name>
  <desc>A sweet spot for a camper van or RV conversion. &#xA;&#xA;Pass the eco depot and go up until you see the panel « do not proceed beyond this point ». Right there make a U turn and park yourself on the other side. The next morning you will have a nice view toward the glaciers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220561 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
