  <ele>252.4</ele>
  <time>2023-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>waiting for Fundy Trailway Park </name>
  <desc>waiting for the Trailway to open. coming from Fundy NP this is on the way. a dead end road with almost zero traffic in the whole area. just a plain dead end road..&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
