 <wpt lat="48.887210" lon="-124.261565">
  <ele>152.06058983793446</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 08:34:17 UTC</time>
  <name>Pine Point Campground</name>
  <desc>Beautiful rustic campground with several gravel sites right on the lake, small pebble beaches and a boat ramp. Some campsites are first-come first-served for 20 CAD/night and some can be booked for an extra 18 CAD fee. Pit toilets are clean. No water, no dumping, no phone signal (except a very weak zero-bar from Rogers Wireless in sites 40/41). Most sites are quite large, some in the woods are shaded and some by the lake get a lot of sunlight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 08:34:17 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220741 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
