 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="55.671905" lon="-120.032310">
  <ele>627.106689453125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pouce Coupé River</name>
  <desc>Great spot right at the shore of the river, many options before, along and even across, depending on the water level. &#xA;There&#39;s dirt biking and ATV traffic during the afternoon, but everyone had to be home for dinner. Access road gets bumpy at the end, but the first few sites are 2WD. Cell service even down at the river. Stopped at Brainard Lake before, but this is so much better for swimming and mosquitos. No train or road noise!&#xA;&#xA;** No cell service (2023/07/07)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220752 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
