  <name>Super Clean Laundromat</name>
  <desc>-Open from 5am to midnight, 365 days a year.&#xA;They have a wash and fold service 7 days a week.&#xA;-They offer dry cleaning.&#xA;-The machines are top-notch and well priced. Various size washers; all Electrolux professional machines. Load sizes go from 20lbs to 62lbs and even have quick wash cycles at discounted prices.&#xA;-There is a washroom, a change machine, and a soap dispenser, along with a snack machine and Wi-Fi.&#xA;-Clean&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220836 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
