 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.895476" lon="-125.146516">
  <ele>134.08151570939148</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oyster Bay Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Nice beach park and rest area. signs ask visitors not to exceed 8 hrs. Toilets and picnic tables. Lots of visitors Monday night including some harmless local bikers, Ford mustang meetup and a few other overnight visitors. a few rev&#39;d their engines and some highway noise but overall a very nice place to overnight. I would recommend BUT check out the gravel pull offs just north of here, only a few meters / could hundred feet for some beautiful Oceanside camping, some have signs others don&#39;t. I wish I had gone up a bit further. Cell signal was fine. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220865 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
