  <ele>390.0576301869005</ele>
  <time>2023-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Carrick Tract Trails</name>
  <desc>Trailhead parking lot. 1 bar Bell LTE. Could fit a big rig but not a lot of space. Quiet. Buggy. Good for a nights sleep. No “no overnight camping” signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220897 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
