  <ele>177.12351660057902</ele>
  <time>2023-05-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fort Erie Border. </name>
  <desc>It’s on the Niagara Pkwy in Fort Erie. You can face the water (Lake Erie) and enjoy the lights and reflections off the lake at night. It’s quiet and peaceful with garbage containers available. No running water or electricity. It’s just a parking lot that fits a 36ft motorhome no prob. They have a few of these lots along the parkway. This site is my fav for boondocking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/220984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
