  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: destroyed pig farm - may be private property. Camping may not be allowed.&#xA;&#xA;Super calm spot. !!4x4 Required with high ground clearance!! Could be muddy in some places and &#34;might be&#34; mosquito invested during summer.&#xA;There are different ways to get to this spot:&#xA;-Murray road near Rehau industries (short way mostly gravel)&#xA;-Melorse route (long, 1. asphalt 2. gravel 3. mud) but adventurous.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221016 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
