  <ele>21.76647979300469</ele>
  <time>2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Costangs Trail, Searston Entrance (North)</name>
  <desc>Area for parking at the north end of the Costangs Trail. Road in is one lane, dirt road. Trail is less than 1km past a flat area that looks like a turn around (another spot good for the night). Will fit rigs of all size, if you don’t mind country driving. Space for 2/3 average size rigs.&#xA;Please do not block the “driveway” beside the building, the space around the building or entrance to the trail. No camping on the trail.&#xA;There is no wifi but there is good data signal. Sufficient for calls and internet use.&#xA;Trail closed 05.19.2023 because of storm damage. Usually fixed up by mid-June.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
