  <name>Heppell covered bridge </name>
  <desc>Nice quiet spot next to Heppel covered bridge built in 1909. River seems a local favourite for salmon fishing.&#xA;Two large areas easily accessible for RVs etc. No toilets but nicely secluded. No signs prohibiting camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221366 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
