  <name>Murphy Lake West Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Nice Recreation Site next to Murphys Lake. Access via logging road in descent shape except of one sliding along the way. Needs some ground clearance.&#xA;Fits about 4 camper.&#xA;Has a toilet and tables.&#xA;No cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221405 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
