  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kaien Island</name>
  <desc>Immediately right after crossing the bridge to Kaien Island. Next to the road, but nice sea view and close to Prince Rupert. There’s a firepit. Spent one night here with our 26 ft truck camper without any trouble. Larger rigs might have trouble turning.&#xA;Good 5G/LTE signal with Bell/Telus and Rogers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221440 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
