  <ele>765.4420535899699</ele>
  <time>2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Willowbend</name>
  <desc>Very nice campground about 8 km of of the Trans Canada Highway in Maple Creek. $25 for unserviced site. The manager delivered us a fire pit. Wonderful free shower. Picnic table. Large site. There is a train nearby that makes some noise but we slept well here. Take highway 21 north off of Hwy 1.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221637 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
