  <desc>Farmhouse that can accommodate small and medium RVs for a short period, notify the owners when you arrive. Farm, domestic and wild animals on site. Fireplace, water and pit toilet available.&#xA;&#xA;1170, rang du Lac-Caché, Saint-Alexis-des-Monts. J0K 1V0&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-18 22:48:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221749 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
