  <desc>A well maintained, grassy, mostly open CG.  Water taps are scattered about the campground. Vault toilets. A gazebo, Dump station (fee if not a guest) and firewood (fee) are available.  Quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
