  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolf Lake</name>
  <desc>Reception is okay in a few spots. Used to be a really rough drive in but someone was nice enough to pour gravel the whole way in.  Can be quite busy in some sections but usually along the water you can squeeze in. Water is okay. Nothing super special but its local for us.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221774 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
