  <name>Boréal Régional Park parking</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking with no &#34;no parking sign&#34;. the park isn&#39;t maintained so it&#39;s kind of looking abandoned. some trails are nice and doable, some others aren&#39;t.&#xA;no toilets, no phone reception, but if you want to camp there before going for a hike, it&#39;s possible.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221801 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
