  <name>Montreal River</name>
  <desc>Very large space suitable for trailers. A large island in the middle offers good seclusion from the road. The place is connected to other campsites near the bridge. Fire pit shows activity. Very little reception for Bell. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221839 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
