  <name>old pearson college soccer field</name>
  <desc>Good for a stealthy overnighter. No one will bother you if you are just crashing overnight. The Pearson college formerly owned it, now its part of Mathison lake park&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/221842 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
