  <desc>2 camping sites with pit toilet, tables and fire rings. Maintained by local offroad club for the BC government. Sits at a bridge where 2 streams meet with several hiking trails in the area along with off-roading trails. Campsites are located at the bottom of a steep winding gravel logging road. Reachable with 2WD.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222198 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
