 <wpt lat="60.726840" lon="-135.062560">
  <ele>647.287324461484</ele>
  <time>2023-10-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Laundromat</name>
  <desc>There are two laundromats right near each other. This one looked to be the better of the two but they are both pretty dirty and old. This one has more machines. Most of them old but to be honest the old ones seem like they work better. $3.50 for small washers, $6 for larger ones. Dryers are .25 for 5 mins. There is a change machine. There&#39;s a soap dispenser machine. A bathroom that you have to be buzzed into by the front desk. A soda machine. RV parking in the rear. This is part of a hotel. It&#39;s a pretty decent sized laundromat. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222253 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Laundromat</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
