  <ele>722.3237720765173</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Co-op Truck Parking (Dirt)</name>
  <desc>A great spot for the night. Close to the highway and just across the dirt road from the Co-op pumps. &#xA;&#xA;Good Cell Coverage. &#xA;Nothing fancy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222269 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
