  <ele>1052.8057896948878</ele>
  <time>2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>America Creek Rec Site</name>
  <desc>free rec site, 4 established camps with picnic tables &amp; 1 pit toilet. spacious but not that private. 1 great lake spot, but lots of broken glass on the floor from a burnt down trailer so be careful. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222342 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
