  <ele>792.79443359375</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beta Lake</name>
  <desc>Yellowhead County campsite. $20/night. Nice little lake, quiet campground. 7 sites but overflow available. Easy access, about 1km of gravel road. Pit toilets, hand pump water. A small dock and boat launch nearby. Well maintained, clean, and quiet. Cellular service is intermittent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222456 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
