  <ele>347.66169941145927</ele>
  <time>2024-04-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Water tap at provincial park</name>
  <desc>There is a spigot in the day use area of the park. Threaded and easy access to fill up a vehicle tank. There isn’t a park entry gate so you can cruise right up and fill water jugs or tanks. Will likely be closed in the winter or below freezing months. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222512 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
