  <name>Laundromat&#39;s inside the Shell</name>
  <desc>A run down laundromat&#39;s is next to the gas station, half the machines are broken but they do the job.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222531 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
