 <wpt lat="60.271230" lon="-133.941972">
  <ele>705.3829345703125</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Mountain Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Turn off the highway where the sign says White Mountain. It&#39;s a short but narrow drive to the Trailhead. Wouldn&#39;t recommend larger RVs or trailers. Some views of lake and mountains. No facilities. Decent Telus cell service. Has a fire pit made from rocks. Some road noise during the day but not visible or too loud. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
