 <wpt lat="49.427592" lon="-106.832646">
  <ele>719.0670818500221</ele>
  <time>2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beside McCord Museum</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay one night between east and west block of &#34;Grasslands National Park&#34;. Very quiet in the village, but remember that nights even in summer can be really cold. &#xA;Bathrooms with toilets and sinks across the street in the hall (see picture). Please don&#39;t use the Pit toilets (they are part of the Museum).&#xA;Haven&#39;t seen any sign of payment but you can donate for the museum. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222576 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
