  <ele>236.22484712861478</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>There is a large parking lot. We stayed one night with no problems. There were two other RVs already there when we arrived.&#xA;&#xA;Grand stationnement. Sommes restés d’une nuit sans problème. Il y avait 2 autres VR à notre arrivée. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222589 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
