  <ele>1210.632568359375</ele>
  <time>2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>lots of open forest spaces </name>
  <desc>Very quiet place... Road a little bumpy but not too bad.&#xA;Plenty of room to park.&#xA;The farther away from the road the more trees and shade you&#39;ll find. &#xA;Found spot with firepit and some wood left there.. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222597 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
