 <wpt lat="49.418628" lon="-107.073076">
  <ele>742.5232562392558</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mankota Campground</name>
  <desc>Found this campground while going to Grasslands National Park East Block, but didn&#39;t stay. There is fees: 15$ unserviced and 20$ with electricity, you just have to put money in the box. The campground is near a playground. Good cell reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
