  <desc>Great gravel parking lot overlooking the bay.  Has two picnic tables and four chairs for lounging in with a coffee soaking up the ocean. No signage about no overnight parking. Garbage can as well. Can be a little windy due to being so close to the ocean and up on a hill. Enough space for big rigs to turn around (we did it with our 25&#39; RV and 12&#39; trailer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 17:02:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222669 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
