  <desc>Long layby with large spacious field surrounded by trees. Next to the road but quiet even during the day. Former Historic site but no buildings and no services. No signs saying &#39;no camping&#39;; lovely field views. Nice flat and level and good access but low trees. No bugs while we stayed today.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-19 16:37:55 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222773 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
