  <name>Woods Laundromat Atikokan</name>
  <desc>Several machines are out of order, but still very clean. Open daily from 6am to 8pm. Large capacity machines available as well. A spacious bathroom is available with a good size counter top. Good for a quick sponge bath! Get a good french fry from Chips-r-Us next door while you&#39;re waiting!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222814 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
