  <time>2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakewood Civic Center</name>
  <desc>Pool, gym, gymnasium center with nice, clean and hot showers. If you are shy, there&#39;s a Universal locker room with individual showers. It&#39;s quite expensive, 10,25$/person. There&#39;s a sauna and a spa. Slides for the kids. Open from 06h00 to 22h00 from Monday to Friday. Check for the weekend.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222826 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
