  <desc>Translation: Parking allowed for the night, there are several locations. Finally a place 100% authorized by the city!! at least 5 pitches, large spaces. no services. free.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;stationnement permis pour la nuit, il y a plusieurs emplacements. Enfin un endroit 100% autorisé par la ville!!  au moins 5 emplacements, grands espaces. aucun service. gratuit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222832 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
