 <wpt lat="52.305328" lon="-113.073529">
  <ele>726.276611328125</ele>
  <time>2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rivers Creek RV Park</name>
  <desc>We intended to stay at Tail Creek Campground across the highway - because they have unserviced sites for $28. Tent sites are $25. Serviced I think $30. But the gate was closed - had to call to get entry. The place looked a little untidy from outside the gate, so we decided to enquire here.&#xA;&#xA;Note we could see both places had sites right on the Red Deer River, many of them vacant.&#xA;&#xA;This place apparently only has fully serviced sites. The nice young man said $50 / night. I told him we didn&#39;t need any services, and it was half that across the highway. He suggested $25. Done.&#xA;&#xA;We have a very pleasant site right on the river bank. Services, but we&#39;re not using them. No neighbours, but there are lots of folks about - mostly long term seasonal campers. The toilets are heated and very clean. Coin operated showers and laundry. &#xA;&#xA;CBC at 740.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222842 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
