  <time>2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Everett Crowley Park Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot for local park, no houses so quite private, but next to a road that can get busy. You are not allowed to enter the park overnight, but no „no camping“ sign. Stayed for one night, because I die not feel comfortable at the „Riverside“-lot near this spot and wasn’t bothered by anyone.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222918 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
