  <ele>611.1579743120819</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Snowforest Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground at the bottom of the national park. Book through Parks Canada.&#xA;$29.25 per night + fire permit of around $10 per night. Also need a park pass to enter - can pay at campground. &#xA;Amazing showers, flush toilet, free firewood, drinking water. &#xA;Do need to be mindful of bears and other wildlife.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222974 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
