  <desc>there is a pass accessible by good 4x4 only. use Alsek Valley trailhead parking lot to enter. Road is rough, but you will have the best places you ever stayed. Plenty of spots to pick from. we stayed at open field. windy but no bugs. Views are the best you have ever seen!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/222986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
