  <ele>918.256591796875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Highway 811</name>
  <desc>Nice place for overnight stopping. There is a parking lot ( big-rig-friendly), a dogs leash-off-zone, a path to the riverbank and at the back, a path behind some trees and shrubs where we stayed one night. No signs, no bothering. Calm, no traffic, we heard the train only once. Please use the garbage bins and leave no trash, it&#39;s such a wonderful site outside of this loud town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223062 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
