  <name>Lois Point Rec Site</name>
  <desc>A bit further down from Lois Lake Rec Site. Logging road requires high clearance. 4x4 recommended. Small site with easy access to beautiful beach with high and low lake levelled sand shelves and verticals dead heads. Garbage and established beach structures here… clearly a party spot. I got lucky as it was quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223103 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
