  <ele>32.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gooseberry Cove </name>
  <desc>Great spot for a peaceful night of sleep. Went there with a 4x4 and a roof tent, but could make it w/ a x2 or VR. Some parts of the site are hidden from the wind with the trees. Fire pit. Amazing view of Gooseberry Cove.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223219 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
