  <desc>Municipal Park on the waterfront. No forbidding signs. Outhouse and garbage cans. Popular picnic spot for whale watching. Big enough to turn around with 27&#39; Trailer and back in. Could be tight if others were here. Level gravel area. Very nice!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223220 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
