 <wpt lat="53.895425" lon="-122.765977">
  <ele>574.1</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Treasure Cove Casino</name>
  <desc>Positioned between Hwy 97 and Hwy 16 is the Casino and its very large car park.  there are signs stating &#39;no overnight&#39; parking to the left. on the right, the signs say &#39;authorised parking only&#39;.  Security says that if you&#39;re only here for one night, it&#39;s fine.  Road noise is loud but a fan allowed us to sleep well without earplugs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223297 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
