 <wpt lat="55.134929" lon="-118.795382">
  <ele>653.6894849594682</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free Outdoor Shower </name>
  <desc>This is not a private shower stall. It’s a shower to rinse off after volleyball or a hike. Could be great in a pinch. Wear your bathing suit and you can get a nice, cold shower in. Next to the Bear Creek Park dump station. It’s the red building beside the volleyball courts. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223339 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
