 <wpt lat="49.067189" lon="-115.232857">
  <ele>765.9190569538623</ele>
  <time>2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gold Creek Bay Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Hidden gem in a beautiful spot right on Lake Koocanusa. Well maintained, some sites are right on the water. &#xA;&#xA;- $14/night&#xA;- First come first serve. No reservations. Pick a spot and an attendant will stop by at some point to collect payment. Cash or card is accepted.&#xA;- Limit of 14 consecutive days&#xA;- A few pit toilets&#xA;- No hook ups or water&#xA;- Picnic tables at each site&#xA;- Some sites have established fire rings (be aware of local fire bans)&#xA;- Good for tents, camper vans/trucks, smaller RV’s (probably not your full size RV’s)&#xA;&#xA;When the water is high enough (later in the summer) you might be able to access the water pretty easily but no beach here. Can easily walk down to water though.&#xA;&#xA;Nearby is Sandy Shores day use area with a great beach. Only a 10 minute drive. Very beautiful.&#xA;&#xA;Also up the road is sunshine marina and they do a tonne of water toy rentals (kayak, SUP, canoe, sports boat, etc)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223361 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
