  <desc>A large gravel car park one street behind Main St. Not level, but good enough for one night. Very quiet night, especially considering it was a Saturday night. Only sign states it’s public parking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223376 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
