  <desc>A large parking lot for RV’s to park. There are no hook ups but it’s as close to Quebec City you are going to get. A bike ride away from old Quebec. Great views of the harbor. $70 Canadian 24hr&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223385 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
