  <ele>814.94140625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>pull out next to highway at lake </name>
  <desc>nice spot behind some trees directly at the lake shore. highway is just a few meters away so you hear the cars passing by, but it is quite during the night. the campgrounds were full so staying there was a great alternative at the lake. space for several cars/RVs&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223422 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
