  <ele>74.1322288941592</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Municipal parking #209</name>
  <desc>Municipal parking 6 am to 12 am for 11 $. Free parking from 12 am to 6 am. Public washrooms available from 9 am to 10 pm. Suitable for Vans.&#xA;Stayed 3 nights without problems. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223452 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
