 <wpt lat="43.563689" lon="-79.558691">
  <ele>49.457275390625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 07:30:18 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakefront Promenade Park</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot, FREE, next to the lake, with space for a picnic, some benches facing the lake, a place to let boats down and some tables scattered around. Fits large RVs. I didn&#39;t spend the night, but there&#39;s no notice prohibiting staying overnight. Today, sunny Sunday, it was crowded in the afternoon.&#xA;___________________________________________&#xA;&#xA;Grande estacionamento,  GRÁTIS, ao lado do lago, com espaço para picnic, alguns bancos virados para o lago, local para descer barcos e algumas mesas espalhadas. Cabem RVs grandes. Não passei a noite, mas não tem nenhum aviso proibindo o pernoite. Hoje, domingo de sol, estava lotado a tarde.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 07:30:18 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223462 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
