 <wpt lat="61.184729" lon="-136.990861">
  <ele>939.601318359375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Swans &#39;n Eagles</name>
  <desc>Amazing spot on an embankment by the river well off the main road. Narrow, steep and bumpy access, high clearance  and 4x4 recommended, no big rigs. Quiet nature paradise with swans and bald eagles. No facilities, but an old cabin in the woods. No cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223468 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
