  <name>Valley view</name>
  <desc>Simple camp with a great view to the south. Fire ring, easy 2WD access, open feel. No cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
