  <ele>41.2226448059082</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 20:26:11 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild camping near river</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet place in the forest with a fire pit. There’s a river nearby but you need to climb down. &#xA;&#xA;! You need to take a gravel road to get here, however, nothing dramatic..we made it with Ford Freestar. ! &#xA;&#xA;Edit.: Bears in the area, please be respectful to wildlife and do not leave garbage around you. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 20:26:11 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223473 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
