 <wpt lat="51.082587" lon="-114.351613">
  <ele>1181.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Calaway Park Campsite</name>
  <desc>Well established campsite attached to Calaway Park Theme Park. Bear that in mind; it&#39;s a kids theme park. Though we had a quiet Sunday night with about 10% occupancy. Important Note. Check opening dates/days. &#xA;Nicely laid out, clean but dated shower block. $2 shower.  $41 with power, free dump and water or $10 charge if you&#39;re just passing thru.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223477 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
