 <wpt lat="46.002978" lon="-65.073081">
  <ele>6.781131754037673</ele>
  <time>2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverbend Wilderness Camping </name>
  <desc>Good drive through site with a variety of trees, electric and water. fire pit. owner is friendly and helpful. walking trails , lake and an abundance of wildlife.Hot showers, laundry , flush toilets and a small store rounded out this great stay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223504 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
