 <wpt lat="47.073999" lon="-55.858880">
  <ele>20.65740966796875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fortune Head Ecological Reserve</name>
  <desc>Stayed overnight in the middle of the turn around at the end of the road, next to the lighthouse. The lighthouse keeper said shouldn&#39;t be any problem. Just be sure to keep the driveway clear and allow others to turn around. Room for our 27&#39; trailer. The lighthouse light will flash all night (just close your curtains) and possible fog horn if foggy. Otherwise gorgeous view of the islands, the French island Miquelon, and very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223633 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
