 <wpt lat="49.331370" lon="-122.452035">
  <ele>150.3157958984375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Beach Campground</name>
  <desc>First come first serve campground. Vault toilets but they&#39;re clean. $23 CAD (cash only) per night. Rangers come around to collect the payment, max of 5 days at a time but they said you can do more at the end of the 5 days if you&#39;d like. Make sure to leave something in your site if you&#39;re going to be gone to show it&#39;s occupied.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
