 <wpt lat="43.067446" lon="-79.076492">
  <ele>136.55039563038733</ele>
  <time>2023-10-02 14:44:16 UTC</time>
  <name>Marineland, north pkg lot</name>
  <desc>Great location!! Drove into the main entrance of Marineland, off Portage Road. It was about 9pm, Marineland was closed. Drove past the bldg to the parking lot in the back. Bits of grass growing up thru the pavement, doesn&#39;t look like it&#39;s used much. There was another car there with rooftop tent. We were with friends; the two of us spent the night in our vans. Very quiet, no issues. Someone drove around at one point in their golf cart (security?) but didn&#39;t bother us. We left by 8am. &#xA;You can also get here via the entrance at these coordinates: 43.067446,-79.076492&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 14:44:16 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223816 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
