  <ele>38.6791187622682</ele>
  <time>2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Arts &amp; Culture Center Pool</name>
  <desc>The staff member at the front desk of the pool let us shower for free. He insisted that we not pay since we would not be using the pool. I recommend checking the pool schedule to pick a time when adult swims are happening. &#xA;&#xA;Note that the showers do not have individual stalls. It wasn’t busy when we were there. Facilities were clean and well maintained. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223930 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
