  <desc>Very nice manager said we were okay to stay the night. We are members we have used over 100 plus Anytime Fitness gyms across the United States and Canada.. &#xA;&#xA;Great place for a work out and shower… &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/223936 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
