  <desc>Popular camping/glancing and overland spot.  RC Flyers field 1 is also home to Busted Props R/C club&#39;s airstrip. (Fenced off) &#xA;There are also plenty of trails for both quads, SxS and offroad vehicles.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/224381 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
