  <desc>Steep boat launch with a nice flat campsite right next to it.  Road in is fairly short but on the rough side.  No need for 4x4 but go slow and you&#39;ll be fine.  1-2 bars of Bell wireless.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/224856 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
