  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel road/dead end</name>
  <desc>End of a gravel road. You can hear traffic from highway but it’s not too bad. You can’t see a road if you zoom in. Only a small clearing what used to be the start of that road. Follow 401 for maybe one Kilometer or even less. That’s your turn off. Nothing fancy but it’s a place to park for the night. Lots of room to maneuver if you drive it all the way to the end.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/224899 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
