  <desc>Several places to park. Before the dam a path leads to the other bank (rather for 4x4s)&#xA;after the dam a path on the left gives access to a car park, and two others are available at the top.&#xA;large vehicle stay up. small vehicle possible at the bottom.&#xA;some motocross passage.&#xA;great fishing spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225018 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
