  <ele>155.5863037109375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 17:51:35 UTC</time>
  <name>Cyprus lake amenity center</name>
  <desc>free showers. not passcode locked like the showers in the campsites. closed between 2pm and 3pm daily. individual shower stalls are properly sized but the dry changing area in each locked stall is on the small size. waters hot so i kept on hitting the button for more time, eventually it stops and won&#39;t let you keep going. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 17:51:35 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225046 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
