 <wpt lat="49.190974" lon="-122.997432">
  <ele>5.812498092651367</ele>
  <time>2023-12-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Burnaby Fraser Foreshore Park </name>
  <desc>Nice place along the Fraser river. Lots of street parking on the east and west legs.  Park is a strip between the street and the river.  West end opens into larger area for off leash.  Lots of trails to walk.  Many tables some covered.  Exercise loop, washrooms.  Very quiet at night as north side of street is industrial.  Can be busy during the day. East side seems to have more traffic during the day on weekdays.&#xA;&#xA;Bathrooms open during the day. Playground area for kids. Exercise trail. Commercial buildings on the opposite side of the street. The park parking is no overnight stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225068 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
