  <ele>119.5</ele>
  <time>2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old logging road</name>
  <desc>This unsigned, disused logging road is suitable for smaller vehicles and vans. Off of Coal Harbour road just past the gravel pit on the North side.  The road is a bit overgrown but a few minutes up there is a nice level spot just before a corner and there’s probably more if you go further. One bar on the phone. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225095 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
