  <time>2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baxters Corner Beach</name>
  <desc>Roadside parking along the beach of the lake. Spent one night. Super quiet. No sign of any kind. &#xA;&#xA;It is a community, and there is a house at the end of the street. Please be mindful and don’t litter. &#xA;&#xA;Gorgeous spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225157 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
