  <ele>3.5698451474308968</ele>
  <time>2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Crescent Beach Center</name>
  <desc>Just in front of the information center. &#xA;&#xA;Access to the beach, cold showers available between 10:00 and 16:30. Porta potty available 24/24 &#xA;Sleep with the sounds of the waves. &#xA;The beach is just beautiful. &#xA;Good cell coverage&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225260 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
