 <wpt lat="47.861616" lon="-53.086556">
  <ele>30.6859130859375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Diamonds Corner</name>
  <desc>We found this site while looking at a large iceberg in Adams Cove and decided to stay the night. Room for one big rig, we are a truck and 27&#39; Airstream trailer. Plenty of room for other cars to pass by, but there would be no traffic except for this week&#39;s iceberg viewing! Spoke to the friendly owner of a nearby house, and he said there was no problem with staying the night. Short walk (100 m) to the cove. Cell Service is average, No other services.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225274 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
