  <time>2023-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hunting Camp</name>
  <desc>The route to the cell towers was locked so I went down the gravel road opposite that road.&#xA;Going right takes you to a dead end or potentially good sprinter camping.&#xA;Go left takes you up a hill with a fire ring &amp; an old outhouse that looks like its used for hunting. &#xA;Great spot. &#xA;Telus cell would not work here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225435 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
