 <wpt lat="46.232876" lon="-63.121667">
  <ele>30.8</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 19:59:27 UTC</time>
  <name>Public Parking  - Charlottetown</name>
  <desc>There are no signs indicating that overnight parking is not allowed. One other RV and several cars were also there overnight. There is a pay kiosk, but it was not in service while we were there (stayed overnight Sunday - Monday.) Some cars and people noise throughout the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 19:59:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225652 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
