  <ele>436.310546875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Liard River Larger Site North</name>
  <desc>This is similar to the other nearby Liard River site, but is about 2-3 times the size.  We had a bit of difficulty turning around our 43&#39; truck/trailer rig at the other site, but no issues here.  It is a pretty site with little to no litter and sits above Liard River about 20 feet.  Very minor highway noise at 4pm, expect no issues at night in mid-June.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225663 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
