  <desc>Quiet spot close to the Inlet. &#xA;Gravel road, concealed from main road. Water is visible from site, looks like a great fishing spot.&#xA;Was able to fit our large Sprinter no issue, turnaround easy &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225665 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
