  <desc>Park with boat launch, picnic tables, benches and portapotti. Walking trail along river. No parking restriction sign.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225801 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
