  <ele>390.5</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside dirt road</name>
  <desc>Veer to the right under hwy 5 and drive under the bridge past where Swanson road and forestry road meet and then turns into a dirt road with a gate at the end along the North Thompson River.  Train tracks on other side of river, otherwise quiet, dark, and peaceful. Sign in Clearwater says  &#34;Bear activity&#34; so walk with bear spray. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225812 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
