  <ele>763.3942469805479</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Englishman Creek Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>$14 per night. Close to water, nice campground. &#xA;Pit toilets.&#xA;Close to water&#xA;Camp operator onsite. &#xA;56 sites which full up very quickly every weekend. &#xA;Also the option to go to Gold Bay a bit further south if this campground is full. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225825 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
