  <name>Petro Canada Parking lot </name>
  <desc>we stayed overnight at this Petro Canada. We asked the guy inside where we could park overnight and he said basically any of the streets along the main road (there are tons of truckers sleeping there too). But he ended up just saying we can park in the gas station lot overnight. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225946 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
