 <wpt lat="48.036927" lon="-65.198760">
  <ele>8.038842387497425</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pink beach</name>
  <desc>Beautiful place to take a break or to spend the night, right beside the beach. Clean dry toilet and picnic tables. There is an interdiction to set up a tent and to make a fire, but nothing else. I spent the night without any problems. Great view on the stars. &#xA;That&#39;s a place where locals go, but I still felt safe. Dogs needs to be on leash.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/225998 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
