 <wpt lat="51.148965" lon="-114.985505">
  <ele>1282.6623468399048</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 17:15:08 UTC</time>
  <name>Stoney Park Campground </name>
  <desc>Relatively new campground. Incredible views from many of the sites. Loop D has 15 amp power with two sites having 30 amp. No water or dump station on the grounds but there is a free dump station with water at Bow Valley Campground on highway 1x on the way in, about 15 km from Stoney Park Campground. Loops E and F can be quite windy but they have the best views. There are heated pay showers by the main office. Porta potties at the non-powered sites. No potties at the powered sites (Loop D). Not yet well known as we were here in June and there was only one other camper. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 17:15:08 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226083 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
