  <ele>559.0717321364209</ele>
  <time>2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>China Beach Lookout</name>
  <desc>5km of logging road that isn’t too bad I came up here in a Kia Optima without and troubles. What an amazing lil place the lookout is breathtaking. There are a few lil turnouts on the way up you could camp at anyone of these without any issues and there is fire pits at everyone of them too. Slow and steady and you’ll be sure to find Zen at its finest. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226121 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
