  <desc>On the south side of the deli/store is their business parking lot where we stayed with the owner’s permission five years ago. Arrived here late this time and took the liberty to park here overnight again. Nice and quiet. Spoke to the owner in the morning and he was fine with it. South of the lot is a short  street parallel to a side road, which is not connected to any business and several campervans and a truck parked there as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226422 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
