  <name>Browne Lake Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>This site is managed be BC Recreational sites and Trials. There are five campsites, two on the lake. Fire rings, Tables, Boat launch, Pit toilets. The road is is a bit rough but passable in 2WD. There is no fee to stay here. 14 days max.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226426 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
