  <desc>Mostly level gravel pulloffs in a grassy area next to the beach. This area is visited by locals and is clean and quiet. This place was suggested to us by a local and a few other locals spent the night here as well. We were told it is public land.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
