  <ele>202.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baseball field beside Liard River</name>
  <desc>This is a great place to stay right beside the Liard River!!  Its at the end of the road past the General Store in the town!!  &#xA;It  is quite a busy park area during the day and early evening!!  Lots of 4wheeler activity and locals swimming in the river!!  We went for a walk down a steep hill to the river front/ stone riverbed!!  A beautiful spot!!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
