 <wpt lat="45.785283" lon="-75.099899">
  <ele>194.94194872677326</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>town of Ripon, derriere l’eglise</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot Behind the church and in front of cemetery, access by rue Major into center of town. Be discreet and leave no trace! 21feet or less. There is also a rest area - boat lauch about 1km north from Ripon on rte 317.&#xA;À Ripon derriere l’eglise et en face du cimetiere, petit parking. Acces par la rue Major. Soyez discret, invisible. &#xA;Il y a aussi une halte routiere avec acces a la riviere sur la rte 317 environ 1km vers le nord.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226598 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
