  <ele>64.6</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kingston Mills (Parks Canada)</name>
  <desc>Parks Canada allows to pitch a tent anywhere, 5$/person, with access to a bathroom. Gps point put at the information building, which closes at 7pm. You can swim in the canal. Train passes really close to parking lot. We went by the lake, opposite side of the road (in a tent) to get farther from the train &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226601 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
