 <wpt lat="45.529502" lon="-73.598056">
  <ele>41.0</ele>
  <time>2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free street parking</name>
  <desc>Free street parking next to an office building. We stayed her two nights during the weekend and had no problems and felt safe. There are a lot of joggers and circlers. There is a train track next to the street, so it&#39;s something quite noisy. &#xA;To mile end and little Italy, which both districts have a lot of bars and restaurants, it&#39;s both just around 20 min walk.&#xA;check the photo with the parking hours!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
