  <ele>10.928383419290185</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinsman Prince Edward Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice campground on the outskirts of Corner Brook. Clean and well-maintained. Some traffic noise from highway. Laundry ($2 each washer/dryer), free showers (very hot!). Dump station. Good wifi. Serviced sites $40, unserviced sites $30. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226615 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
