  <desc>Large parking lot near the Cap-Egmont fishermen&#39;s wharf. Very quiet, beautiful view of the sea!&#xA;--&#xA;Grand stationnement près du quai des pêcheurs de Cap-Egmont. Très tranquille, belle vue sur la mer!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
