 <wpt lat="49.339239" lon="-68.120966">
  <ele>218.47899824380875</ele>
  <time>2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dirt road pull off</name>
  <desc>Need high clearance to get here. Just over the hill and there’s an extended circle in the road with a fire pit. Wide enough for a truck to be on one side to lower others pass. Not a soul came by over night. Established ring on site. Some kind of frogs were croaking at each other over night and into the morning.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226628 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
