  <name>owlhead</name>
  <desc>Found a nice place to pull off on a ridge with a bit of a view.  make sure you are well off because the occasional big truck comes by.  Otherwise quiet and peaceful&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226636 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
