 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.883310" lon="-120.042500">
  <ele>1719.2</ele>
  <time>2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brenda lake recreation site</name>
  <desc>nice spot by the lake, fire pits and picnic table. Enough room for several people. Around 15km away from the away and pretty close to Kelowna. The road can be  little narrow because of fallen trees here and there. It is a country side road so you need to be careful but I did it with a SUV and no 4x4 without any problems. Some access to cell communication but not always&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226657 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
