  <name>Bulkey Valley Regional Pool</name>
  <desc>You can get nice hot showers here. The Entrance is $3.50, &#xA;On Saturday from 5.30pm-7pm only $2 for the whole facility. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226699 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
