 <wpt lat="51.077295" lon="-119.770645">
  <ele>399.72625732421875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Skwaam Bay Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Officially 4 Spots, but there are many more spots. 3 Pit toilets and directly at the lake. The access road to the spots is steep and narrow, because of that only cars can access these spots. We have a 2wd and camped not at the spots directly at the lake, because the last part of the road is very steep. It is a beautiful place. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226705 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
