  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bob Quinn Lake Airport rest area</name>
  <desc>Stopped at two earlier rest stops on the way north but both were occupied with campers taking up a HUGE amount of space. Kept going and landed here. Pleasant enough, nice view, not much traffic. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226716 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
