 <wpt lat="54.316696" lon="-130.325043">
  <ele>37.9539794921875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>48 h public parking on waterfront </name>
  <desc>designated area for public parking (max 48 h) in dead end at waterfront. about 10 spots, no oversize possible, nice and flat, amazing view on ocean. No sign that overnight camping is not allowed. quiet at night, in the morning around 8 am it starts to get busier. awesome place to stay close to town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226739 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
