  <ele>742.902587890625</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>abandon place</name>
  <desc>we were trying to get to the lake view spot. this is where we ended up. BC parks seized an illegal built Cabin here. there&#39;s abandon truck, boats, tracker, skidoo. &#xA;&#xA;it is pretty rough coming to here. we have a 28Foot black series trailer&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226748 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
