 <wpt lat="44.000000" lon="75.000000">
  <ele>79.94388198852539</ele>
  <time>2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boat Ramp </name>
  <desc>*Please confirm the location. No roads seen on the map.&#xA;.....&#xA;At the end of Houseboat road, right next to the boat ramp. Very quiet, picnic table and trash can. Small marina. No sign prohibiting to spend the night. Really good.&#xA;.....&#xA;Au bout de House boat road, juste à côté de la rampe à bateau. Très tranquille, table de picnic et poubelle. Petite marina. Aucune enseigne d’interdiction de passer la nuit. Vraiment bien.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226788 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
