  <ele>780.7150514358655</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hays Town Campground</name>
  <desc>Cute little town with a small camping area. Numerous spots with electric, picnic tables and fire pits. Only $10/$15. Toilets here as well. We did not stay just passed through but wish we had known yesterday as we would have stayed here!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226796 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
