 <wpt lat="48.615125" lon="-93.356652">
  <ele>337.7279739379883</ele>
  <time>2023-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Seven Oaks Point Park</name>
  <desc>A popular park for dog walkers in Fort Francis. No services, but cooler place to park adjacent to shade trees and water within the city. Close to train tracks, therefore noise. No “No Overnight Parking” signs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226801 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
