  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>FRS Quartz road</name>
  <desc>Nice spot right by the forest road, in winter it is a snowmobile trail but in summer there’s nothing. Very quiet road, only 2 pickup passed by.&#xA;Ok for 2WD at the entry, a 4WD could go further up.&#xA;Just drive 2,5 km up Quartz creek road to find the spot&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226804 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
