 <wpt lat="55.798642" lon="-128.892521">
  <ele>206.534423828125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>open flat space</name>
  <desc>Please check-in there. Not a nice place, however, good for a night stopover. We wanted to camp at the Jigsaw Rec Area, but it was full. So found this spot. It’s a wide and flat gravel area, easy accessible also with big RVs or 5-wheelers. Trees give privacy from the Hwy, even if we can ear vehicles. Quite by night. It looks like an abandoned trailer camp or settlement with some relics with their stuff all around. However, all the stuff is on one side only and the overall site is clean and without garbage. No facilities and Verizon 0/5&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/226961 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
