 <wpt lat="60.648567" lon="-135.015914">
  <ele>734.12109375</ele>
  <time>2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>GoNorth RV repair</name>
  <desc>Located at 115 Mt Sima Rd, just to the south before you get into Whitehorse, on the west side of the hwy!  We had a loose trailer hitch and went to 2 other places along the highway, one wouldnt even look at it, because they were too busy, they said, the other was also too busy, but recommended Go North RV repair!  We went, and even though they were also busy and very booked up, they helped us out and it took only about 10 minutes of their time, but saved us from a possible disaster down the road!!  Super friendly and caring people!!! Also...they didnt charge us a thing!!  Awesome!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227149 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
