  <desc>BC Parks provincial campground, $18 per night.&#xA;basic facilities - pit toilets, bins, some water taps although not clear if potable.&#xA;Probably about 30 sites&#xA;Dirt road here is well graded and fine for any car.&#xA;Not right next to the lake - there is a little track down. there is another campground before by 2kms which is ~$40 a night and right next to the lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227296 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
