  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel shoulder</name>
  <desc>Gravel shoulder wide enough to fit a 10&#39; wide vehicle. Right next to the rails leading into the Pacific Central Station. Walking distance from Science World, Chinatown and the &#34;ferry&#34; sailing from The Village.&#xA;&#xA;The road is busy throughout the day, but gets very quiet during the night. However, people are working at the station all night long, so you want to park far enough down the road, that you&#39;re not right next to the warehouse. Otherwise, you will be in for a noisy night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227351 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
