  <desc>Provincial Park&#xA; Found on our canoe trip.&#xA; with cabin and several picnic tables, fire pits and restroom. ist nice&#xA;&#xA;Provincial Park&#xA;Bei unserer Kanutour gefunden.&#xA;mit Hütte und mehreren Picknicktische, Feuerstellen und Toilette.&#xA;total schön &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227353 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
