  <ele>635.3262458490208</ele>
  <time>2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Marconi School 1922-1950</name>
  <desc>Historical one room school house with attached teachage.  That is open to visit, has photos and information about the school. Open large level grass area surrounded by trees with, picnic tables and fire pit. There are usable original pit toilets for school.&#xA;No other amenities, no cell service but, of course starlink connection. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227366 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
