 <wpt lat="50.309723" lon="-122.573444">
  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Duffey Lake HWY road</name>
  <desc>Quick pull off on Duffey Lake Road. Highway noise, will need 4x4 and high clearance for this pull off. Even with that you will rub.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227550 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
