 <wpt lat="50.551279" lon="-126.934166">
  <ele>111.99175109062344</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside. Telegraph Cove</name>
  <desc>Quiet spot off a gravel road in logged forest. No one around. Small pull off on the gravel road.  About 1/2 mile off the road. Flat, but sloped down in back… about 25 feet of space for one van or two, if friendly.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227559 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
