 <wpt lat="43.127639" lon="-79.354937">
  <ele>142.85184721369296</ele>
  <time>2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shangri-La Niagara campground</name>
  <desc>Paid $56 for a site without services, one of few campgrounds without a 3 day minimum stay. Lots of seasonals. Hot showers and flush toilets included in fee. Bathroom is rustic and adequate. Wifi usable sporadically around play area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227619 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
