 <wpt lat="49.544592" lon="-124.865012">
  <ele>8.224550285376608</ele>
  <time>2023-04-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Highway Pullout </name>
  <desc>Just a little pullout on the highway that is cozy for 2 vehicles right along the ocean. It’s close to a rest stop but if you want a feeling of not being near other people it’s perfect. Highway isn’t so loud after 10pm &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227680 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
