  <ele>49.73651788383722</ele>
  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte Maritime</name>
  <desc>Small park and parking lot before the bridge. Good place for a few hours stop. We stayed overnight 11pm-7am no one bothered us.  Very loud due to traffic. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227789 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
