 <wpt lat="49.720656" lon="-125.124977">
  <ele>13.7</ele>
  <time>2023-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mount Washington Resort base parking lot</name>
  <desc>We pulled up looking for another iOverlander site and found this big parking lot. Security cameras in use, but we thought it was good enough to sleep at considering there were no signs saying we couldn’t camp. Some overhead lights. Away from the road so not noisy. It did the job &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227803 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
