  <ele>27.763949711399068</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wharf Beach Hiking Trl</name>
  <desc>A nice cliff with a great view on the bay of Fundy. The road is probably for 4x4.&#xA;BUT with a looooot of insects!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227816 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
