 <wpt lat="49.164829" lon="-104.584996">
  <ele>699.0784912109375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking behind the restaurant </name>
  <desc>A parking spot behind the restaurant. You can use their washroom during business hours.  Make sure you clean up  after yourself. You can ask the business for some drinking water. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227833 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
