 <wpt lat="46.343570" lon="-72.539050">
  <ele>-14.95745849609375</ele>
  <time>2023-05-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street parking downtown - free weekends </name>
  <desc>Nice and quiet part of downtown Trois-Rivières, walking distance from restaurants and bars, Museum Pop, and not too far from the waterfront. Several coffee shops all within walking distance as well. It&#39;s meters during the week and free during the weekend. Some parts of the street are flat, some perfectly level. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227839 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
