 <wpt lat="50.353088" lon="-115.624812">
  <ele>878.872314453125</ele>
  <time>2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kootenai River White River rec area</name>
  <desc>Lots of camp sites with fire rings along the rivers and in the trees. We have a one ton truck with camper and pulled a boat. No problem getting around. No cell service. Need to be self contained or pack it out. Great place to put in or take out raft or jet boat&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227844 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
