  <ele>39.13039784505963</ele>
  <time>2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Our Lady of the Rosary Catholic Church</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot from church. Very quiet at night. Open space for your solar power. Space for several RVs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227847 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
