 <wpt lat="46.205167" lon="-64.543483">
  <ele>14.4755859375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shediac Trail Head Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Outhouse and no “no parking” signs. Big enough lot to have 6 vans parked side by side in 2 rows. Relatively level with gravel so you shouldn’t sink in the rain. Chemical pit toilet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227852 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
