 <wpt lat="46.252540" lon="-63.134380">
  <ele>16.2</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking lot at the Charlottetown farmers market </name>
  <desc>Parking lot next to the Charlottetown farmer’s market. Please respect that the parking lot is for customers of the market when it’s open on Saturdays. It’s a good place to stay and it’s close to the university Ave in Charlottetown but the traffic is pretty quiet over night. There are a few picnic tables as well. Please take everything you’re bringing with you to keep the place clean :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227856 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
