 <wpt lat="55.475742" lon="-122.787584">
  <ele>789.5726099559485</ele>
  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nice spot next to gas pipeline</name>
  <desc>This is a beautiful spot next to a natural gas pipeline. It’s flat, quiet, and large enough for a big rig. Close to the highway, but due to the trees and embankment the level of noise is acceptable. At night it was very quiet. Beautiful view of the surrounding. No cell reception, just solitude.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
