  <time>2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small hill in next to railway</name>
  <desc>Quiet spot.  Great location at the top of a small hill.  Gravel road to get there, no problem with 2wd car with high clearance.  No traffic.  fire pit.  3 signal bars.  next to the railway but not disturbing.  some cows around :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227883 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
