  <time>2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Somerset Lions Campground</name>
  <desc>There is camper registration envalopes on the building maked $30 per night.&#xA;8 Total sites with firepits. some with picnic tables.&#xA;all sites have water and electrical hookup. 1-30A 2-15A.&#xA;Washrooms and shower in building.&#xA;garbage onsite.&#xA;splashpad and horseshoe pitch, concrete walking path around baseball diamonds.&#xA;&#xA;did not stay as i was moving on, but used the washroom which was pretty decently clean.&#xA;1 bar of LTE service on Bell&#xA;located next to highway&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227900 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
