  <desc>Flat rest area with garbage, tables and one toilet. Close to the road but not so noisy. Shadow and nice view. Sign says &#34;Please limit your stay to 8 hours&#34;, so I suppose we can spend one night. Weak 3G signal with Bell, but it works.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/227932 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
