  <desc>Water available here for a fee.  No other places found in town.  &#xA;&#xA;Also dump and overnights at the RV Park.&#xA;&#xA;Easy to access with medium or smaller RVs (if larger than 30’ contact the to be sure (my opinion not theirs) - one way paved in middle of park takes you right by dump station.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
