  <name>Canmore</name>
  <desc>Moderator note: See second comment by @benpecover before filling up here&#xA;&#xA;Diesel is significantly cheaper in Canmore than Banff. It was $1.80 in Banff but $1.27 here...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228151 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
