 <wpt lat="43.759230" lon="-65.323551">
  <ele>-13.362152099609375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dock parking lot</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot next door to marina with a government dock.  No signs concerning parking.  Public washrooms one block away near Dory museum.  Lots of locals will stop by here.  Nice view of the water&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228179 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
