 <wpt lat="44.215750" lon="-76.655730">
  <ele>42.8</ele>
  <time>2024-04-07 19:21:20 UTC</time>
  <name>Fairfield Historic Park</name>
  <desc>Lakeside parking lot for walking trails. No signs saying anything about parking overnight so I&#39;m going to try.  Lots of people coming and going to walk their dogs etc in the evening. there&#39;s a food trailer on site but it wasn&#39;t open while i was here.  pit toilets in the park. &#xA;Update: nobody bothered me.  quiet night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-07 19:21:20 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228191 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
