 <wpt lat="53.054906" lon="-121.412260">
  <ele>1155.0826300150636</ele>
  <time>2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet place next to river</name>
  <desc>Follow a gravel logging road for 8km, street is in good condition. A local told us, that some people use this place for overnight camping. &#xA;There is a nice hike (The Vinje Grind) if you continue the road until 1614. After that you turn right into a very small forest road. Follow the forest road for a few meters, park on the right and continue by foot. After 20 min&#39;s you will find the first sign (shortcut). The tail is very strenuous, but the view is incredible!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228243 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
