  <desc>small campsite in Rossland. The place has free shower and wifi. Full service costs 40CD and without service 30CD. You walk about 10 minutes to the city.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228280 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
