 <wpt lat="53.566767" lon="-113.284717">
  <ele>681.6</ele>
  <time>2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Emerald Hills Leisure Centre</name>
  <desc>We discovered this place when searching for free showers. This is a public indoor pool of the city of Edmonton and it offers an option to use their steam room, whirlpool and hot showers for only $3.50 for as long as you want. It’s a really clean and nice facility, usually there’s kids attending swim lessons so it’s not really quiet. Next door is a parking spot from the high school which we stayed on for two nights and had no troubles. The Walmart etc. is just across the street. Can only recommend! There’s also some other facilities of the City that offer the same, for example Kinsmen leisure center. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228418 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
