  <desc>Nice area with boat launch to Little Fox Lake! Great spot for fishing. Had luck. We didn’t stay overnight but an RV did without problems. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
