  <desc>Rest area with lots of space for RV’s. No signs prohibiting overnight camping. Pit toilets and Trash bins. Small path along signs to viewpoint. A little lower than highway and parking close to bushes can hide your vehicle &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
