  <desc>Large gravel pit, probably used for road construction, don’t know.&#xA;No sign. Just on the side of Belle isle strait. &#xA;Very quiet, far from the road and any houses.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228552 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
