 <wpt lat="45.489556" lon="-76.074668">
  <ele>58.2717170715332</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Constance Bay Beach - Street Parking</name>
  <desc>Street parking with beach access all along the several km beach.  Beach access is marked with blue sign with three white lines.  By-Law is that you can park overnight on the street and up to two hours between 7-7 on weekdays and 6 hrs on weekends. Gorgeous Sandy beach with miles of walking in either direction. This is a residential area and folks may not love vanlifers hanging around but so long as we follow the bylaws we have as much right to enjoy this &#39;one of a kind&#39; beach as anyone.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228623 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
