  <ele>69.42888053040951</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ottawa River</name>
  <desc>River access spot at the end of Dunrobin Road:  There is a small flat area on sand, if you’re confident you can get off it. Otherwise good spot for a dip in the river on a hot day.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228634 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
