  <ele>19.38527937967106</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Port Anson Park</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot on cliff overlooking bay.  Picnic tables, covered gazebo, lots of flat space beside quiet road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228635 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
