  <desc>Walmart parking lot.  Canadian Tire, Dominion, Harvey’s, Tim’s nearby. No signs prohibiting overnight parking. Stayed one night. Not as many RVs as the other Walmart on Kelsey Drive. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228667 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
