 <wpt lat="49.924813" lon="-118.121277">
  <ele>666.0244186520576</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whatshan Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>$25/night or $1200 per season. Nice rustic camping with lake views and nice swimming beach. Quiet and serene. Open only May to September. 3-4 km gravel road. Ok cell reception. Friendly host. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228727 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
