 <wpt lat="49.096647" lon="-122.043988">
  <ele>11.2</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Great Blue Heron Nature Reserve</name>
  <desc>Lot just outside Nature Reserve is quiet and peaceful with plenty of space for several van lifers. Good for an overnight stopover, next to lovely hike through Nature preserve and visitor center, not far from TransCanada Highway. Lot inside reserve closes at dusk. There are toilets and water at the nature center and on trails but only available dawn to dusk.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
