  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lac Limony</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet spot with access to the lake.&#xA;Some locals during the evening to take a dip into the lake but alone all night. Place for 2 camps.&#xA;Very enjoyable! Keep it clean!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228751 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
