  <desc>Parking where you can stay 24h max. Be careful during snow removal operation between november 1st - april 15th (11pm-6am). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228772 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
