  <ele>59.79092025756836</ele>
  <time>2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>MacLaggan Bridge </name>
  <desc>Overlooking the Nashwaak River. Three spots suitable for parking camper vans all in very close proximity to one another. Two sites are flat enough for tenting. Woods road follows the river upstream for an easy hike. Birds &amp; waterfowl to observe. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
