 <wpt lat="49.203092" lon="-111.306471">
  <ele>932.823974609375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel road side</name>
  <desc>Little stop by the gravel road. Cool view and cool spot to watch wild animals. &#xA;It looks like the entrance to a meadow but doesn’t look like it’s been used for a while. &#xA;Little traffic during the daytime and very little to none during the night. &#xA;&#xA;We had no issues at all. Some locals even stopped by to make sure we were ok and confirm that we could park here overnight. &#xA;Good stop before going to the Writing-On-Stone Park!! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
