 <wpt lat="43.218736" lon="-79.628096">
  <ele>50.5</ele>
  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fifty Point Conservation Area</name>
  <desc>Fifty Point Conservation Area on Lake Ontario, a magnificent 80-hectare park with superb marina facilities in Stoney Creek. It’s the place to be for a swim in Lake Ontario, family camping or a picnic for groups of any size.&#xA;&#xA;Visitors can also enjoy a fabulous lakefront view by walking our promenade or while relaxing at conveniently located benches and shaded areas.&#xA;&#xA;https://conservationhamilton.ca/conservation-areas/fifty-point-conservation-area/&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228911 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
