 <wpt lat="52.367520" lon="-126.810101">
  <ele>110.05714289670523</ele>
  <time>2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clayton Falls FSR pulloff</name>
  <desc>Big, relatively flat opening just barely up the FSR road.There is a small trench to go over to get to this spot, but should be fine for skilled big rig drivers. The road to this spot is steep. There are some houses just below, so we do not run our generator and make sure we do not make a lot of noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228913 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
