 <wpt lat="45.359071" lon="-65.532975">
  <ele>8.971573485061526</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whalecome &amp; Octopus Ice Cream Gravel Lot</name>
  <desc>Gravel lot for several small businesses and wharf area. No signs are posted that indicate “no parking”. Located on the west side of the new covered bridge.&#xA;&#xA;The lot is very crowded during business hours, and we arrived @ 9 pm and spent one night here with one other camper and departed early. Easy parking for small rigs and camper vans. Take care during lobster season, there are several vessels moored at the wharf here and likely to be more fishing related traffic during lobster season.&#xA;&#xA;AT&amp;T cell service slow. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228960 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
