  <ele>23.881805072538555</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Belvédère Havre-Saint-Pierre </name>
  <desc>Belvédère 5 min après Havre-Saint-Pierre direction est. Nous etions 6 petits rv hier. Belle plage juste en bas.&#xA;&#xA;Look out 5 min after Havre-Saint-Pierre east direction. We were 6 small rv. Nice beach just below. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/228967 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
