  <ele>271.43357907794416</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>FSR near Sechelt</name>
  <desc>FSR about 20 minutes from Sechelt. Gravel logging road with potholes but not bad. There are a number of secondary roads along the way but they are all blocked off with large concrete blocks. The pullout we chose is about 50 meters off the road so we don’t get dust from the road. Very quiet at night., no traffic. T-Mobile 2-3 bars LTE.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229018 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
