  <ele>2.880698492717743</ele>
  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bellevue - black road</name>
  <desc>Directly in front of the stoney beach. Two houses arround. One is occasional used the other permanent. At the end of a gravel road. Facing west with good chance of an amazing sunset. Absolutely quiet. Place for only one little campervan up to 17 feet&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229075 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
