  <ele>512.2431082893163</ele>
  <time>2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>SOS box 272</name>
  <desc>Nothing special, just a safe flat space to pull over on Trans Labrador highway. There is an sos phone box :)&#xA;Google says gas station is 45km ahead. Manic 5 60km behind. &#xA;Zero cell service, but starlink works :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
