  <ele>584.4296596497308</ele>
  <time>2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small clearing road side</name>
  <desc>Small clearing by the highway. Hidden from highway and was quiet at night.  Past kmpost 398 at top of hill. If going north, look for a road into the bush on the right. When you come in, there is a place on the right where you can park. Good for 1 maybe 2 campers. Quite level. 1 bar on cell network. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229396 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
