  <desc>A 24 hour gas station and truck stop with a large parking lot suitable for parking a vehicle overnight. Expensive showers are available, or free if you buy 300 liters of fuel&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229417 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
