  <ele>26.200000000000003</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Seldom - Cemetery</name>
  <desc>Foggy night so lighthouse foghorn was blaring.  Camped here and woke up to lovely view of the bay.  Really quiet ;).  It is a spot where locals come to chat in their vehicles so can&#39;t park sideways on.  Could take a large rv though.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229452 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
