  <ele>255.2032470703125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gargantua</name>
  <desc>Abandoned campground.&#xA;On one side of the road there is the hotel Gargantua that burned down in 2022, and on the other side of the road is the abandoned Gargantua campground. Many spots available. &#xA;From Percé, the road to get there is paved but very steep, maybe 20%.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229454 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
