 <wpt lat="49.682467" lon="-54.808253">
  <ele>15.697199497689617</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 06:12:26 UTC</time>
  <name>Sleepy Cove Cliffside - Twillingate</name>
  <desc>This is a superb spot right on the cliff edge with views over Sleepy Cove and the ocean.  Spectacular icebergs when we were here.  At the base of the hiking trail along the ridge.  Excellent cell service too.  The road up is rough and worth checking out prior to attempting.  Would not recommend a trailer - vans and truck campers only.  Two spots at cliffsides. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 06:12:26 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229457 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
