  <ele>53.69014798835656</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Indian Path Common</name>
  <desc>Trail Head for the Indian Path Common trail. Very secluded quiet boondocking. Not far from Hirtles Beach. Well protected alternative from the wind if the weather at Hirtles beach is blowing a gale! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229459 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
