 <wpt lat="49.516707" lon="-108.827434">
  <ele>916.6980587728322</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Eastend Town Campground</name>
  <desc>Lovely little municipal campground in the bow of the Frenchman River. Select your own site and then register online. Registration materials are also in the washrooms, along with the phone number. Shady and sunny spots, some no service ($15 CAD) most with power and water ($25), a few with sewer ($40). Our spot was a lovely, level site right by the water. Not far (driving) from the T-Rex Discovery Centre and the Wilkinson Memorial Observatory. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229478 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
