  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rapide Le Malin</name>
  <desc>I did not stayed here for the night but it is advertised that you can for 25$. See the joint pictures.&#xA;A lot of local comme here to swim, the river is gorgeous. It is 10$ per person.&#xA;I got here around 6pm and there was nobody at entrance so we didn&#39;t have to pay to take a dip.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229483 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
