  <ele>226.3</ele>
  <time>2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shadow Creek Road</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot on abandoned rail line next to small lake - we spotted a Cougar at dusk last night - fire ring - many great locations along the abandoned rail line. Simply exit on Shadow creek rd and just past the single lane bridge take a right onto the old rail line. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229501 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
