  <time>2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Labrador Pioneer trailhead - Capstan Island view</name>
  <desc>Trailhead parking spot with great overlook view of Capstan Island community.  &#xA;It was a tight turn around with a 19&#39; trailer,  would not want to even try if there were any other vehicles here,  but could fit 3-4 van campers. &#xA;Does not say &#34;No Parking&#34;, so we&#39;ll see. &#xA;Have 1-2 bars of Telus signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229542 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
