  <ele>236.9635264146836</ele>
  <time>2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spot by river </name>
  <desc>Perfect hidden access road to site off highway, nice views of wide river. Quiet at night. High clearance needed, 4x4 recommended. Turn around point halfway down - suggest reversing down to river to get out easier. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229545 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
