  <desc>Outdoor showers near the washroom of the beach in Osoyoos. There’s also an handicap indoor shower. The water is cold but not that cold, pretty warm actually.&#xA;Go have a swim before, the water is delightful.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229883 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
