  <ele>8.217905044555664</ele>
  <time>2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel lot next to bascule bridge, on a cove </name>
  <desc>No signs to keep out, no signs for no parking/camping. Just a large gravel lot on the south side of the bridge. Some road noise but nothing to keep us awake. Good cell reception.  No garbage cans, no pit toilets, no water.  Right on the water. I’m sure it’s beautiful but today lots of fog.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/229981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
