  <name>Dave’s Laundromat </name>
  <desc>Great little spot for laundry! Combined business of computer repair and tanning that also offers 2 top loading washers and 2 dryers for $2 each load. Very clean machines. We were greeted by Dave and his 2 dogs behind the counter when we arrived. He has change, detergent and dryer sheets. Easy parking in a gravel lot around back. Free Wi-Fi with use of laundry. Nice place to hang out inside with a couch and chair. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230200 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
