  <ele>237.90838181693107</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet spot (Accessible by boat)</name>
  <desc>Nice little spot to go for a swim, have a picnic, take a nap.&#xA;Might be able to sleep overnight in a tent. &#xA;&#xA;We parked our car at the boat launch in Astorville (you can find the spot on iOverlander) and canoed there.&#xA;The spot is accessible by any boats.&#xA;&#xA;No cottage near.&#xA;&#xA;Enjoy!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230339 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
