  <time>2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Echo Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>BC rec site at Echo Lake - beatiful spot very calm. ~ 3 sites for tenting with picnic tables and firepots, not drive in however about 4 vans could nicely fit in the parking still overlooking the lake.&#xA;1 pit toilet. you must pack out any garbage. No cell signal.&#xA;About 5km up the logging Road, it&#39;s pretty steep at places and not the most smooth so would recommend 4x4 however we got up in a 2wd ford van with offroad tires.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
