 <wpt lat="57.041635" lon="-122.854834">
  <ele>1509.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pink Mountain Road - 3.6 miles from top (per google).</name>
  <desc>So we are on our way up to the park....currently at a more open spot in the final switchbacks (about 3.6 miles from the top). It&#39;s beautiful up here. It has recently rained, and what stopped me was a huge puddle taking up the whole road. I am alone, dont have a winch, not from here, and it&#39;s getting darker.  I will attempt to check it out tomorrow on foot and see if I want to attempt it. If not, this spot is pretty sweet on its own. It was a beautiful drive up and will be a beautiful drive back down. I am adding some photos from this spot. Also, I have great service here!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
