  <ele>212.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Community Park Street Parking</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s a small, quiet street in a nice neighborhood. There is a small park where you can hang out. I can recommend &#34;the beer can&#34; which is just 5 min walk from here, and it&#39;s like an outdoor pub. They have great food and a good selection of beer. &#xA;At night there were a few cars on the street but not much, so it was pretty quiet. We also felt safe!&#xA;please ceep it clean!&#xA;parking hours:&#xA;Monday - Saturday 9 - 17.30 just one hour, after that and Sunday no regulation &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230683 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
