 <wpt lat="50.163558" lon="-115.844959">
  <ele>813.4596349457279</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside pull outs</name>
  <desc>There are a handful of pullouts down a short dirt road. Some of them are right on the lake. A few local fishermen drove by during the day but a quiet night. Distance road noise from the highway and right near the train tracks. Trains don’t blow their horn nearby so the sound isn’t too bad.&#xA;&#xA;Good cell service too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230861 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
