 <wpt lat="51.310739" lon="-55.639251">
  <ele>16.185966320229625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goose Cove</name>
  <desc>Quiet place right next to the bay. Bumpy road to get there with lots of potholes, but made it easily with my car and small trailer. &#xA;You have to turn left before the cemetery otherwise you will find yourself in someone’s driveway. &#xA;&#xA;There is an RV parked here, but no one was there. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230862 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
