  <ele>326.2816232284531</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McDonalds Store Groceries</name>
  <desc>Mid sized supermarket with fresh meat, vegetables, fruits too. All what you might expect is available. Open all day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230886 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
