 <wpt lat="50.992848" lon="-121.391112">
  <ele>816.8065397050428</ele>
  <time>2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Scottie Creek Meadow</name>
  <desc>Grassy field off the road. Rocky outcropping landmark on other side of road. Yes it did burn at some point, but the greenery is coming back and this is a really nice site. Saw 3 deer and many birds coming in. Good gravel dirt road to get here. No cell, but starlink works great!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
