 <wpt lat="54.464921" lon="-126.578112">
  <ele>793.5211052060471</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Summit Lake Rd</name>
  <desc>A quiet clean peaceful spot next to a big pile of logs and two small logging dirt roads. Lots of Alders and spring flowers. Can see power lines through the trees about 100 yd away. It doesn’t look like anyone has tent camped here, but it is possible with a little log and rock moving. Our truck camper fit fine and we could get it level. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230896 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
