  <desc>Nice campground with sites with service or no Service. Has sites on water and beach access. Place to clean your fish. Very quiet at nice. Price reasonable just like other campgrounds around. Nice owners. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/230928 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
