 <wpt lat="50.446624" lon="-101.313210">
  <ele>367.13330078125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-04 13:59:02 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc P&#39;tite Fourche</name>
  <desc>An historic site. Six designated electrical sites and an unserviced / picnic area beside the river. Pit toilets in dire need of cleaning.&#xA;&#xA;We couldn&#39;t see any information about payment and no one around. It would be a nice walk into the small town.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 940.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 13:59:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231340 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
