 <wpt lat="47.029957" lon="-84.779604">
  <ele>149.522216796875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Not a boat launch</name>
  <desc>A rocky spot next to the highway, it looks like a boat launch but isn&#39;t. You can park your vehicle surrounded by water on three sides. Not a great place for a tent. There were more mosquitoes than I expected, but the waves were nice when not interrupted by occasional passing highway traffic. Cell reception is fleeting.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231373 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
