  <name>McDonald sports park</name>
  <desc>Big parking lot. No no signs. Empty at night, no hassles. Dog walkers and kids camp during the day. A little bit of highway noise. 5 km of trails. Little swim spot by the lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231521 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
