  <ele>415.0595359802246</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Road next to highway </name>
  <desc>Amazing view of the lake and the mountains &#xA;Pretty noisy since it’s right next to the highway but it’s safe and we can camp here. Police came since there’s a fire ban in place but they were super nice. &#xA;Very windy &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231546 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
