  <ele>630.0267333984375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kal tire</name>
  <desc>Amazing spot! I came with a request of very simple tyre rotation, guys iffered I woukd say pretty fair price of 70CAD and had it quickly done. no need to reserve, just arrive. Very friendly boss, and I m sure they could perform a lot of other staff. i&#xA;If your car looks weird enough, you may get a discount!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231649 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
