  <ele>38.03057861328125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Exstew River Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>A beautiful rec site beside a gorgeous blue river.&#xA;The sites are open, gravel and or soft clean sand,  no mud or dirt and very large, a few trees here and there but lots of open sky surrounded by majestic peaks and mountains.&#xA;&#xA;The river is only steps away from the sites, note although you may see the odd boat, kayaker or paddle board on it - it is fast moving and you should be careful especially kids.&#xA;&#xA;There are firepits on some spots but no toilets or water other than the river. &#xA;Please packout what you pack in.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231658 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
