  <ele>639.1372467977926</ele>
  <time>2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>play grounds and dog park</name>
  <desc>Local park with lots of trees and shade. Close to the Hyw but very quiet. Lost of different little parking areas around the park. Get busy in the morning tho &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231670 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
