 <wpt lat="49.758762" lon="-116.910332">
  <ele>534.1120542790741</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Woodbury near Ainsworth off road beach</name>
  <desc>This is a little beach spot you can pull off of from the highway. You gotta really watch for the dirt road that goes down to the beach. While the forest does hide the road there is a lot of road noise. Not suitable for a camp trailer. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231672 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
