  <ele>1.513641357421875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Islands Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>Free hot shower, super spacious, very clean. I did ask the staff, it&#39;s free. It&#39;s outside of the campground gate, turn right to the picnic area when you drive in before the gate. There are several rooms, they are big shower rooms too, so no wait. Nicest shower I&#39;ve seen at a provincial park in the whole country&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231673 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
