 <wpt lat="51.811457" lon="-121.076643">
  <ele>864.3095703125</ele>
  <time>2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ruth Lake</name>
  <desc>Small gravel road on the right (east) side of Ruth Lake road just past some cattle guards.&#xA;&#xA;Could fit 4 iOverlander/ RTT, but water access is limited and you&#39;ll need to establish a facility.  Perfect for one or two vehicles.  Please bring shovels and leave no trace.&#xA;&#xA;Mosquitos are there so bring some repellant/ propane deterrent. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231740 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
