  <name>Leamington municipal marina</name>
  <desc>Parking for visitors just in front of the marina, with a park, piknik tables and washrooms. No interdiction for overnight. Perfect for a little camper.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231747 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
