  <desc>Nice place right next to Barr’d Island Trail. &#xA;&#xA;Locals were nice and friendly. A bit noisy and busy, there is a lot of picnic tables and benches so people like to come hang out here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231759 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
