  <ele>34.52877861391756</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>chute a blondeau</name>
  <desc>good place to stay for one night!! &#xA;if you&#39;re in tent then you can park at the road block and walk down to the water, beautiful sunset and pretty quiet. &#xA;right off the highway so i wouldn&#39;t suggest making any fires &#xA;&#xA;good for campervans too but not much privacy&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231782 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
