 <wpt lat="48.164438" lon="-53.990010">
  <ele>101.17907905578613</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tirecraft mechanic-Riverbend</name>
  <desc>If you need fixing or a shop to get towed to this is a great mechanic shop, super friendly staff. They accommodate big rigs RVs and more. They also offer towing and will tow you to their shop. We had a great experience here. &#xA;&#xA;We unfortunately had to stay here for three weeks waiting for a part but they let us sleep in our rig while waiting and use their washrooms, shower and laundry machines. &#xA;&#xA;Very friendly place! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231823 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
