 <wpt lat="67.243807" lon="-135.212034">
  <ele>424.03240966796875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Highway Hilltop Site</name>
  <desc>Hilltop site far enough off the highway so noise and dust are not a problem.   Good views to the north and east.  Room for a few good-sized rigs if dry, else maybe only one.  Room to turn around if dry.  Excellent Starlink location. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231929 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
