  <ele>911.565089060925</ele>
  <time>2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Microwave Tower</name>
  <desc>One spot only right before reaching the microwave tower. No big rigs or trailers unless it’s an off-road trailer like ours. :-) The view is unreal! It’s windy so definitely no mosquitoes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231967 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
