 <wpt lat="49.911472" lon="-97.325451">
  <ele>211.262451171875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paddock Rd Field</name>
  <desc>Flat field near powerlines and development, stayed in a tent for the night. spot with small amount of trees near by for privacy and shade. No sign or security around the area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/231979 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
