 <wpt lat="49.232507" lon="-90.959198">
  <ele>469.2520475750789</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>English Lake II</name>
  <desc>We tried the other spots around but they seemed pretty busy so we checked google maps and found another dirt road to a big clearing on the east side of English Lake. Sand and grass, any vehicle should be able to get in no problem. Room for plenty of vehicles on either side of the road. Tall grass and bugs kept us inside for most of the night, but it was nonetheless a great spot for a 1 night, quiet stay. 2 bars of LTE. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232003 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
