 <wpt lat="49.286623" lon="-123.132047">
  <ele>35.69295883178711</ele>
  <time>2024-04-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roedde House Museum </name>
  <desc>Street parking beside museum. Small gazebo and beautiful garden at your door step. Quiet spot in downtown Vancouver. Walking distance to so much. There are a few of these pay parking spots around. Only $1/ hr. Use the dial in pay system and you can renew your parking from anywhere after it expires. Set your alarm to be sure not to forget. Overnight is okay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232025 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
