  <ele>901.1031591463834</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hahas Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Lovely campsite right on the lakes edge. &#xA;Only a small amount of campsites, I would expect weekends to be completely full. &#xA;&#xA;$14.00 per night, pit toilets, picnic tables, fire rings, recycling bins, lots of shady sites as well as sunny sites. &#xA;First in, first served. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232064 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
