  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Branch Road Riverside parking</name>
  <desc>A gravel pull over lot. There is a fire hydrant pump house that pumps water from the river. Avoid parking near that. Otherwise, it&#39;s a quiet spot next to a beautiful river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232077 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
