  <name>Albertosaurus</name>
  <desc>Very fun place. We stayed one night in front of the statue of Albertosaurus, a dinosaure. There was a store before but now it&#39;s just abandoned. The road is not used much and at night there is no traffic at all. Was very calm, and the place is flat. Perfect spot to stay before or after Dinosaur Provincial Park.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232105 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
