 <wpt lat="44.364223" lon="-80.531510">
  <ele>306.21563720703125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaver Valley Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Official rest area right next to the highway. Flat gravel parking lot with several picnic tables on some grass and two porta potties. We only stayed for dinner, but there are no &#34;no overnight parking&#34; signs, so could be a good place to sleep of you don&#39;t mind the nearby highway traffic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
