  <ele>228.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc de la Gorge</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot at Gorge Park that can accomodate large Rigs. We stayed there one night. no signs that prohibit overnight parking. Park is busy until 2300hrs because of the Foresta Lumina show but afterwards, very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Water, toilets &amp; ice cream available at Foresta Lumina’s ticket office.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232195 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
