  <desc>Restroom super clean with drinking water for RV, walking trail,  place to swim (pond/small laie), picnic tables, bench, gazebo.  NO OVERNIGHT PARKING.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232206 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
