  <ele>599.525146484375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ginter&#39;s Meadows </name>
  <desc>Parking lot for Ginter&#39;s Meadows.  No signs posted about parking. Quiet spot where we stayed one night in front of a house in town. Cell signal was decent.  &#xA;&#xA;Ginter&#39;s is an off-leash dog park where people and pets come and go all day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232214 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
