 <wpt lat="52.269726" lon="-120.738003">
  <ele>324.2</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crooked Lake Recreation Site - South</name>
  <desc>A lovely rec site right on the beach of Crooked Lake with an incredible view!&#xA;There is limited space for camping, only two picnic tables and one pit toilet. (Access may be limited to vehicles with large tow-behind campers, as you are right on the beach.) The lake is a bit shallow until further out. Just a heads up, saw a couple of leeches, they were very easy to spot in the crystal clear water. &#xA;No cell service.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232216 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
