  <desc>A really nice park offering overnight camping, up to 48 hours.  Walking paths, basketball hoops and a children’s play area.  Next to a river.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 12:29:29 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232217 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
