  <desc>A truck stop at the side of the highway with a sign for campervan parking.  Sign is red and black. Parking is to the left when you enter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 07:45:31 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232254 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
