 <wpt lat="50.817965" lon="-116.429280">
  <ele>1153.323486328125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cartwright Lake Rec Site - north</name>
  <desc>Free BC parks rec site north of cartwright lake.&#xA;About 10-15 sites here and more in the south site although we didn&#39;t go there.&#xA;Pit toilets, no cell service, water from lake but no running water. Lake is lovely, some small fishing docks  - and not so buggy! &#xA;Access - we came in via Westside Rd from Spillimacheen. I would say all doable for a 2wd, the worst bit is the final 1km into the actual campsite. We managed with a 2wd van with high clearance and offroad tyres. &#xA;Lots of space for big rigs, some sites are huge. About 5 sites were free when we arrived midweek in July.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232263 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
