  <ele>79.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>AYR Motor centre</name>
  <desc>Showers at the recreational centre. Follow signs for the main entrance and ask to use the shower facilities at the front desk. $2 each for a hot shower in a stall with a door. Water pressure isn&#39;t amazing but does the job and is cheap!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232273 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
