  <desc>Self &amp; full service laundromat - free wifi&#xA;Hours: 7am - 10pm / 7 days a week&#xA;&#xA;Small machines are $3.00 &amp; take loonies or .25 cents - 30 minute cycle. &#xA;Dryers .25 cents per 4 minutes&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232274 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
