 <wpt lat="49.799899" lon="-123.177268">
  <ele>18.95745849609375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-06 12:29:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Squamish Valley Hideaway </name>
  <desc>A turnoff,dip to the south of Squamish Valley Rd, through a power line section, then a track goes off to the left, 100&#39;, through trees, then there&#39;s a circular clearing among trees.&#xA;...All dark and quiet,, with a great starview at night  &#xA;At first I thought it was a clearing for a build site, but it&#39;s been this way for quite some time.&#xA;... the very end of Internet reception, but I&#39;m able to watch a Instagram without problem.  ☺️&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 12:29:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232304 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
