  <ele>90.47137451171875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>ST-Louis-de-Blanford</name>
  <desc>Truck stop with restaurant &amp; convenient store. Had a quiet night with our class B along with one SUV. Lot of spot on paved lot. No sign that prohibits over night stay.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232361 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
