 <wpt lat="51.082141" lon="-115.343233">
  <ele>1390.7</ele>
  <time>2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cam Clark Ford</name>
  <desc>We suffered a loss of power in our European Ford Transit diesel (2.2 TDCI). After unsuccessfully trying several independent mechanics in town who refused to even look at it for 2 mins, we tried the main Ford dealer and they were absolutely amazing. Their diesel tech there has worked all over the world and was very knowledgeable about our Euro Transit. After spending a decent amount of time fixing the problem they didn&#39;t even charge us! Their Google reviews also state that they&#39;ve helped out people with non-fords too. Highly, highly recommended.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232362 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>shop_car_repair</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#9999ff</osmand:color>
