  <ele>418.1</ele>
  <time>2023-11-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hope Slide Rest</name>
  <desc>A big gravel space as a rest area and look out for the hope slide. Lots of space. Pit toilets. For more information see the comments under the neighboring place on iOverlander.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232415 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
