  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bi-Eau-Sante</name>
  <desc>A store front that allows to fill water containers. Signs say open 24hrs, but im not certain how that would work as far as security goes. other sign has operating hours and that may just mean staffed hours. i don&#39;t know my French is terrible! allow pictures to guide your judgment!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232422 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
