 <wpt lat="49.570981" lon="-54.404078">
  <ele>3.8609820008277893</ele>
  <time>2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ferry Landing leaving Change Island</name>
  <desc>A dock worker came over after we parked and asked if we missed the last ferry (to Fogo) - we did not, we were lining up for our morning trip to main island of Newfoundland - he said no problem - stay all night….&#xA;And move forward to catch the cool breeze - which we did&#xA;&#xA;A few locals cruised out to the landing and circled us and went back up the island(s)&#xA;&#xA;We gave the dock worker a nice beverage to take home - every bit of Newfoundland and it’s islands have been near perfect and so inviting.&#xA;&#xA;2 to 3 bars of LTE and decent access to cellular &#xA; &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232454 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="47.241412" lon="-53.968439">
  <ele>7.482564088888466</ele>
  <time>2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Collège of North Atlantic Placentia campus</name>
  <desc>Paved parking lot. We asked the people who work there if we could spend the night here since we were taking the ferry the next day and they said no problem. Just in front there is a boardwalk that runs along the beach.&#xA;&#xA;Stationnement asphalté. Nous avons demandé au gens qui y travaille si nous pouvions passer la nuit ici puisque nous prenions le traversier le lendemain et ils ont dit qu’il n’y avait pas de problème.  Juste devant il y a un boardwalk qui longe la plage. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232464 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
