  <ele>1072.6572265625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Horse Lodge </name>
  <desc>Nice place with lodges, RV sites and camp sites. Located 10 minutes walking from Greenlake BC.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232502 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
