 <wpt lat="49.732570" lon="-54.159059">
  <ele>2.6754820311366228</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Municipal park at Joe Batt trail head</name>
  <desc>Very nice family friendly park at the Joe Batts trail head. Parking for 4 camper vans. Two bars on Rogers cell. Free toilets, picnic tables, and garbage cans. Quiet by 10 pm. Lovely sunset. Hike the trail in the morning. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232525 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
