  <ele>351.7052280968055</ele>
  <time>2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Along Labrador Highway </name>
  <desc>Nice Overnight Place about 600m away from the Highway,  Firepit existing, a glimpse view of a small lake.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232554 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
