 <wpt lat="51.027315" lon="-116.543285">
  <ele>799.177626343444</ele>
  <time>2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quinn Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Quant little campground off the highway. They offer full service RV sites as well as no service sites. There is NOT a general dump station but they do offer sewer at some sites but if you do not have a sewer site I don’t believe there is a place to dump. Not much to do but it’s a safe place to stay for an affordable price. They offer wifi which runs at a reasonable speed for campground wifi. Bathrooms are clean and showers are hot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232579 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
