  <ele>36.0933837890625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old Highway </name>
  <desc>Old Highway. Gravel spots under the bridge which is still in use. Didn’t see anyone else. Lots of space.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232607 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
