 <wpt lat="46.516875" lon="-73.843505">
  <ele>490.971834550421</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Lac Sauvage ZEC Lavigne</name>
  <desc>Sites #1 and 2 are directly on the lake and are perfect for rooftop tents or campervans. A tiny beach gives access to the lake for a great swim. The water is beautiful. No motor boats. Picnic table, fire pit, water and dry toilet. Great spot overall. Worth the money. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232620 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
