 <wpt lat="51.222010" lon="-121.480513">
  <ele>1078.2325439453125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chasm View Point</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot near the Chasm Ecological Reserve View Point. It’s about 2.6 km from the 97 (Kariboo Highway) so no traffic noise. Can fit a large rig or several smaller rigs. Not many level spots though, but the view is stunning. Locals visit the place to walk their dog, but overall it’s very quiet. No ‘no overnight parking’ signs. Nice clean pit toilet on the premises.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232621 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
