  <ele>80.92623233404609</ele>
  <time>2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc de St-Jérome</name>
  <desc>Nice place for a picnic by the river. Bench and a picnic table. Dogs are allowed. Recycling bin and garbages. &#xA;We didn’t see any sign saying that we could not camp. &#xA;Very calm and residential area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232629 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
