 <wpt lat="59.868608" lon="-136.692336">
  <ele>937.4718118636621</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 19:56:53 UTC</time>
  <name>Rustic old cabin shelter</name>
  <desc>Its on maps me. Good protection for cooking. Probably great for tent campers and cyclists when it rains. Easy access for small vans and maybe even small rv. Swallows live in roof. Back storage has a sign that says a fox lives there but not sure. Couple of useful kitchen items. Generally well kept from passing travellers keep it that way&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 19:56:53 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232632 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
