 <wpt lat="48.360343" lon="-53.348035">
  <ele>30.403726634569466</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Fort Point</name>
  <desc>Very nice cliffs - several places, not level and not too bad either - not for big rigs - could have 4-5 people&#xA;&#xA;LTE and decent connection, but not fast &#xA;&#xA;Road in/out is not good in places. Ok with ground clearance - tenting even seems ok&#xA;&#xA;No services of any kind and totally awesome views, whales, locals will come visit, and the sunsets/rises are great too. &#xA;&#xA;Others have been here as much as 4 nights in the various sites&#xA;&#xA;Awe love this place - as ALWAYS, keep it clean and leave nothing but good karma!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232791 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
