  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="51.157203" lon="-103.485214">
  <ele>646.931396484375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ituna Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Campground. Swimming Pool. Ball Diamonds. Golf Course. Frisbee Golf Course. &#xA;&#xA;Nicely kept small town facility. Quite a walk into town, where you can get all you need. Friendly folks.&#xA;&#xA;$25 for an unserviced site - they are on the Frisbee Golf fairways. More for a serviced site.&#xA;&#xA;CBC at 540.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
