 <wpt lat="52.512090" lon="-125.343600">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Anahim Lake Resort &amp; RV Park</name>
  <desc>Extremely beautiful location on the Anahim Lake. Since 2022 there are very friendly new owners, who bring the property back in shape. There are a dozen sites all directly on the lake. Washroom very clean and homely like never seen bevor.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232811 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
