  <ele>16.435344519093633</ele>
  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Chalets Mer &amp; Montaigne inc</name>
  <desc>Small private campsite. 3 services- 120 V power- water and showers. On the Oceanside. Check in at the small bar at the top of the hill. $42 with tax&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232821 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
