 <wpt lat="48.722422" lon="-94.570175">
  <ele>286.8953857421875</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kregers Sales and Services auto mechanic</name>
  <desc>good business, fair prices, good work. I live locally for half the year so I am here a lot. they work on all types of vehicles and RVs.  They probably can&#39;t help you with your solar system but they know cars. They work on my ambulance RV when needed. often very busy so call ahead for appointment. Open Mon to Fri regular daytime hours. +1 807-852-2886.&#xA;They are local AAA/CAA.  &#xA;101 Atwood Ave, Rainy River, Ontario&#xA;P0W 1L0&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232828 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
