  <ele>18.09023957606405</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miner’s Museum Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot behind the Miner’s Museum, just up the hill from the beach, where public bathrooms are available. &#xA;Park behind the museum along the high brush for a secluded sleep spot. One other RV was parked here. Very quiet. No signs prohibiting overnight parking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232830 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
