  <name>Flying J</name>
  <desc>Very clean and spacious showers with hot water. Towels included in price (13 CAD) and you can share a shower if you&#39;d like. There is a sign saying the lounge area is for professional drivers only, but we asked the cashier and she let us in no problem.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232839 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
