  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking past Dunes Campground </name>
  <desc>This small parking lot is located just past Dunes Campground. It is right on the water with a beautiful view. No signs prohibiting overnight camping. It’s a relatively busy spot as people live to come for the view but most just come and go. It’s quiet after 10pm we were the only ones with no disturbances.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232954 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
