  <name>Saint Jacques</name>
  <desc>Park and walk to the shower, by the river.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232974 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
