 <wpt lat="63.224558" lon="-123.462844">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gas @ Wrigley </name>
  <desc>I am adding photos of the current gas situation at Wrigley. It is not open on Sunday, which I found out the hard way. Nothing is open on Sunday. I found out they have bingo on sat evenings, though. I am exploring and taking every road I can during the summer, however, knowing what I know now, I would not have used an entire tank of gas to go up there. Dont get me wrong, the people at the center were nice but that was all the positives. It is not set up for travelors, regardless of what you might read in a book at the Visitor Center (like I did). The &#34;campground&#34; is not a campground. The sign saying potable water, pit toilet, etc. is wrong, and it probably has been that way for years. If you have no business there, save yourself a lit of money/time and not go!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/232992 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Fuel Station</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>fuel</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
