  <name>Riverside Camping</name>
  <desc>Off the highway on the west side, no need for 4x4. Room for 2-4 rigs or 2 camping sites. Fly fishing allowed. Right off the river so very accessible water. Also right off the highway, lots of big trucks driving along it. Great for a night!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233037 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
