  <desc>large level area and river. rafting companies use as drop off, stay west of fenced area. Rough road in, not acceptable for any length pulled campers.&#xA;no amenities except quiet, disturbed by train now and then. this is NOT in the park property. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233052 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
