 <wpt lat="48.521980" lon="-64.245580">
  <ele>261.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rue du Failles Peak</name>
  <desc>Former campsite on top of rue des failles ( apparently camping du Gargantua). The main house burned down. It&#39;s very quite, no cars passed by just 2 motorbikes. Very. windy during night. Also suitable for big RVs. Normal road but it seemed to be used very rarely. No signs that camping is not allowed. beautiful view on the ocean and the forest. At the end of the road when you&#39;re in Percy there is free parking :) &#xA;No facilities, no bin. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
