  <ele>3.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Road to Miscou Island lighthouse </name>
  <desc>If you&#39;re coming from the lighthouse on the right hand side of the road. Access to the beach. During the day lots of people make a stop - at night no one. Stayed there for one night. In the morning some fishers arrived. No one bothered us. Beautiful sunset. &#xA;No facilities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233130 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
