  <name>Parking Lot of La Souche Micro-Brasserie</name>
  <desc>Very good microbrewery with a restaurant.  Dogs accepted on terrace.  24 feet max.  This is also a site for Terego members but owner accept non-members.  Very nice place for overnight. No service except a good restaurant. Almost flat on gravel parking.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233138 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
