  <desc>Hours on the door today, says open Monday- Friday1030a-6p and Saturday/Sunday 11a- 5p. It also says, &#34; bring your own shopping bag.&#34;  It also has gas (not as cheap as the snowshoe one and no card service like it either).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233174 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
