 <wpt lat="50.156217" lon="-117.655074">
  <ele>752.190496975556</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Summit Lake Provincial Campground </name>
  <desc>*Seasonal Closures.&#xA;.....&#xA;This is a great little campsite just off the highway. Quite a few spots here, around 40. Some can be reserved, some are first-come, first-serve. There are flushing toilets but no showers. The bathrooms were very well maintained also!! Right on the lake which is gorgeous but very rocky and not the nicest to swim in. Definitely recommend this little hidden gem&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233179 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
