  <ele>161.577392578125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kapuskasing riverside park</name>
  <desc>Flat gravel parking area overlooking bridge and river in central Kap. Walking trail, garbage containers and picnic tables close by. Accessed by first (narrow) paved entry that winds down to river after leaving the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233223 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
