 <wpt lat="53.860082" lon="-121.519651">
  <ele>718.3001040857006</ele>
  <time>2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hungry (Hungary) Creek FSR road pulloff</name>
  <desc>Signs say Hungry Creek, map books say Hungary Creek. There are plentiful spots along the road for camping, some smaller and some bigger. We camped about 600m off the highway, there was still some road noise. &#xA;&#xA;Nice, big, open meadow. Big rigs could fit in here and turn around.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233252 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
