 <wpt lat="49.628465" lon="-114.681943">
  <ele>1357.3466796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Island Lake Hwy</name>
  <desc>Nice views right on the island. Waterfront. No signs. Traffic noise and active open pit quarry on the mountain side but if it’s late and your tired, not a bad spot. You could even go for a swim. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233255 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
