 <wpt lat="53.262247" lon="-117.768204">
  <ele>1127.9856457992846</ele>
  <time>2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hwy 16 Pulloff</name>
  <desc>Road along highway 16 on the east side of Jasper National Park. You have to drive up the dirt road a way before you find a spot. We pulled off to the side where the road T&#39;s. More potential camp spots if you continue. A lot of road noise from the highway. Not ideal for big rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Cell reception is strong at this spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233265 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
