  <ele>706.474609375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Stop in front of Teslin Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>large parking area. room for several RVs. right in front of territorial campground. toilets. trash cans. some road noise, but not bad. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233273 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
