 <wpt lat="54.399954" lon="-129.057620">
  <ele>25.380497130565345</ele>
  <time>2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Exstew River jonction with skeena river</name>
  <desc>Really nice place near the road and the river. We sleep right next to the bridge. It’s a boat lauch so a lot of place for camper. We saw a fisherman and we asked him if it was ok and he said no problem. Road is calm in the night so it’s quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233301 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
