  <ele>794.7369585266953</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Congdon Creek. Alaska Highway </name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot overlooking Lake Kluane, facing east. If traveling east, it is just east of Congdon Creek. Room for one big RV or two smaller ones. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233304 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
