  <ele>78.37384033203125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Springdale Visitor Information </name>
  <desc>Right off TransCanada highway, just east of 390 turn off. Nice level area. Traffic quieted down in the evening. We stayed in a Class B Motorhome. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233384 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
