 <wpt lat="46.210209" lon="-81.659038">
  <ele>238.70001102735458</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pit of sand after pleasant lake</name>
  <desc>Big pit of sand next to the gravel road. &#xA;If you arrived until here and there no more space at the spot of pleasant lake it’s the solution for one night. There is a pit fire and enough space for a big RV or several tents, BUT you need to have a 4x4 or stay really near the road because the sand. &#xA;Quiet et peaceful, but a lot of bugs. No restrooms. It’s just a little sleepy spot to help. &#xA;The road in gravel to arrive to pleasant lake it’s disgusting, very destroy, Many bumps… not really pleasant … &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233417 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
