  <desc>Fresh water. Tap on side of building.  Free shaved ice in huge accessible bins.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233419 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
