  <ele>12.600000000000001</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lead Cove</name>
  <desc>Nice spot down by the ocean (an abandoned boat ramp).  There&#39;s a picnic table and firepit on the rocks.  Probably up to 30ft only because of turnaround but you can judge for yourself.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233421 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
