  <desc>Small boat launch beside highway,gravel. Also a wife spot on same short road suitable for another unit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233433 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
