  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="63.151220" lon="-117.253188">
  <ele>257.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Just before Whati, NWT</name>
  <desc>Small 2 track coming down to a small lake. It&#39;s just big enough for my truck camper! There are lots of bugs, but that is a goven in summer. I will be adding photos. I came during the fires, so it&#39;s pretty smoky here but still beautiful. There is full service too!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233435 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
