  <ele>38.83183742966503</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fox Cove Mortier Municipal Centre</name>
  <desc>Nice pond for swimming, chairs, picnic tables, gazebo, garbage bin, cell ok.  I asked locals for OVERNIGHT parking and they said yes because there is no camping around.  We had been to the  beach and lighthouse further but the road is very bad and nobody since 2019 had comment these spots so we found this one and it’s sounds good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233441 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
