  <desc>Great place for supplies in case something breaks.&#xA;We stopped in and they sold us a few things and gave us others that we also needed.  The people and staff are very helpful.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233539 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
