 <wpt lat="63.152004" lon="-117.274299">
  <ele>249.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whati Boat Launch </name>
  <desc>The locals at the store said I could stay here with my truck camper. It&#39;s beautiful, and the sunsets are right over the lake here. There are two trash bins and benches with a fire ring. My dog loved swimming here, too. Bugs are bad, but where are they not up here? There is full cell service here. Added photos. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
