  <time>2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cat Scales</name>
  <desc>Behind the Petro can by the Cat scales. A fairly quiet typical truck stop. not too many trucks coming and going in the night. 24hr washroom and pay showers available. Not good for tent campers but cars and big rigs okay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
