  <desc>Fairly flat gravel parking area off the highway, overlooking Mooring Rock Cove and Swift Current. Enough parking for 3-4 small rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233623 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
