  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>beach front parking</name>
  <desc>MD campground owner was very cool as their price changed they told me about this parking lot.&#xA;&#xA;it&#39;s literally in front of the beach, there is no signs about prohibited parkings or overnight and there is a pit toilet close by.&#xA;&#xA;However, this is very close to the locals home, no one told me anything but please if you stop here for the night be respectful of the neighborhood.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233625 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
