  <name>Public Dock of Tatamagouche</name>
  <desc>Parking at the public dock of tatamagouche, &#xA;Some tables,&#xA;A patch of grass, &#xA;By the water, &#xA;&#xA;There is a kayak rental shack on site, &#xA;The road is quite close might be a bit noisy during the day &#xA;&#xA;No sign “No camping” &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 07:53:15 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233667 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
