  <ele>415.47663167187636</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Aspen Grove Campground</name>
  <desc>large campground with hookups, firewood ($10), wifi ($7/24hr, not the best connection), laundry services (not sure how much they cost), free pool, free showers, decent washrooms. for a basic tent site it&#39;s $25. The main office is also a store which has a lot of food, beverages, and snacks. they also have lots of camping supplies. for entertainment, there is mini golf, chess, a park, walking trails, a basketball court, and more. there is also a bike library! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233705 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
