  <name>Gen 7 fuel </name>
  <desc>Gen 7 fuel stop at jocko point, always cheapest fuel around, 24/7 card lock you can use with you debit/credit. &#xA;On site 24 hour security&#xA;The best chip stand in this area, open year round&#xA;Parking is allowed in the back, just requested to stay away from the buildings. As always ask the security guy working where to park, as i work here and we will show you :).&#xA;Porta Johns and dog area on site as well.&#xA;Keep it clean, be respectful and mindful. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2022-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233895 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
