  <desc>Large, unused and mostly level gravel parking that can fit any type of rig. It has a lot of trash and is really not the prettiest place to camp but I was just looking for a place with no one else around to relax inside my van. Very easy access and the road noise is not too bad. Decent cellphone service and is somewhat private depending on where you park.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/233970 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
