  <ele>263.9872715524073</ele>
  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pine Point</name>
  <desc>Old Mining Town, buildings removed but streets remain. Camp anywhere, but stay away from any workers or active work sites you may encounter. if you explore the trails and haul roads use your GPS tracker. It&#39;s easy to get lost. Do not drink or swim in the water in the quarries. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234017 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
