 <wpt lat="50.540569" lon="-116.076837">
  <ele>888.6922578942031</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull out next to Wilmer Lake</name>
  <desc>Not much of a lake, but very calm other than some of the fire crews ripping by on their way to the nearby fire. I spoke to a local who was walking his dog and he confirmed that this spot is on public land. &#xA;&#xA;I got my 24 foot rig parked on a grassy spot next to the gravel road and lake. You could probably fit another rig across from my spot without blocking the dirt road that heads off into the forest.&#xA;&#xA;Very buggy at night, no issue during daylight &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234023 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
