  <desc>Quite spot by the road but with almost no traffic. It&#39;s close to the highway but with minimal noise. We stayed 1 night without any problem. Place for 1 car&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234024 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
