  <name>Home Depot</name>
  <desc>Went to both Walmarts in the city of Barrie and both places had signs stating no overnight parking. So I opted for the Home Depot just a hop skip, and a jump away from one of the Walmarts. No signs saying no overnight parking. No issues.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234044 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
