 <wpt lat="49.388547" lon="-115.606440">
  <ele>1244.404389354545</ele>
  <time>2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Murphys gold creek farm</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: Description provided by owner or manager.&#xA;&#xA;set in 25 acres of woodland there are only 10 pitches and only one with power. You can be as isolated as you like here. The pitches are large with fire pits and tables. The farm is totally of grid, there is a very good toilet with large shower big enough for two and plenty of hot water. You have a choice of water ether from the creek which is crystal clear and safe to drink or the owner can supply filtered water if you wish. Also free range eggs. its a fantastic place to chill out and relax.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234094 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
