  <ele>65.2</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trailhead.</name>
  <desc>This is great spot for stopping during the day and even sleeping 1 night. Well lit and right next to a nice 3km trail right in the middle of the city.  No no-parking signs whatsoever.  Traffic around but safe and very flat asphalt surface.  Few fast food restaurants within 2 minute walk.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
