  <name>Woolfry’s Pond Boardwalk (Playground) </name>
  <desc>Small parking lot near a playground with a table and garbage can. Close to lake and boardwalk which got fairly busy at sundown with walkers. No sign prohibiting camping but across the lake from an established campground. Good size for stealth campers in smaller vehicles. Stayed overnight in a minivan with no issues. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
