  <name>Bowle-Evans FSR Pulloff </name>
  <desc>Small, semi-open clearing just off the road.&#xA;It is bumpy and hard to get level. Can hear sounds from the golf course. Beautiful view of the mountains. Medium-sized rigs could fit here. Cell reception is minimal, just need patience.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234162 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
