  <ele>24.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Salmon Cove Sands</name>
  <desc>When we paid the beach fees (8$ for 2 adults and a rv), we asked the lady at the gate permission to stay over night. We stayed one night. It was quiet with picnic tables, pit toilets, non-potable water and a good LTE reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234208 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
