 <wpt lat="56.241614" lon="-120.850133">
  <ele>670.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ironwheel Mechanical &amp; Auto Repair</name>
  <desc>Based on recommendations, we went to Ironwheel for a flush-out of the cooling system and for a radiator exchange (we brought new radiator). Although our van is already 12 years old and European (Fiat Ducato), Dan, the owner, replaced the part professionally himself. He and his wife, Crystal, kept us well informed about work-in-progress and the few difficulties encountered thereby. We highly recommend Ironwheel Mechanical &amp; Auto Repair.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234244 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
