 <wpt lat="59.622131" lon="-136.446542">
  <ele>971.5524721993133</ele>
  <time>2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Arizona is that you? </name>
  <desc>Gravel pull off on the right side of the road as you come back from the border to Haines. (On the left if going towards Haines) Beautiful views. No signs saying that camping isn’t allowed. We are comfortable in our sprinter van but a bigger rig could fit as well. There is a gravel path that is a bit bumpy taking you further off the road and someone is already camping there. Easily accessible with 2wd. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234270 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
