 <wpt lat="62.435399" lon="-114.353744">
  <ele>157.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Con Mine</name>
  <desc>Do Not swim or let your dog in this water. There is arsenic in it. There are no signs, but if you ask the visitor center, they have information on it. I only knew because a local told me. This is a good place to overnight, nothing special but doable and nice view of lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234271 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
