  <ele>185.336818754673</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hidden Beach </name>
  <desc>Beatifull place, Flat grassy area with a little beach in front of the Lake, big enough for 10 cars &#xA;There are picnic tables and a place for a campfire &#xA;Nobody came during the night &#xA;Simple gravel road to get here &#xA;Keep clean &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234329 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
