 <wpt lat="44.871104" lon="-65.312704">
  <ele>175.14306640625</ele>
  <time>2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Valley View Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>I asked the staff and they said shower is for free, everyone can use the comfort station. It&#39;s located all the way up the hill pass the office. I did mention that I&#39;m not camping, just using the picnic park for the day. She said it&#39;s okay. And potable water is by the side of the office, no fee for that either. The shower room is very spacious and very clean, lots of hooks, chair for handicap, and electrical outlet for hair dryer. It&#39;s a nice park with a beautiful view of the valley. The picnic park is fairly small though. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234358 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_viewpoint</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>star</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#ffff80ff</osmand:color>
