  <desc>Free potable water at back of community center &#xA;Easy backup to tap for truck camper&#xA;Also fill up for water containers &#xA;Playground for kids to play at&#xA;Yummy Korean / Chicken across the street&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
