  <name>nice spot beside river</name>
  <desc>turn off across from Albert Canyon brake check. East bound traffic only. Follow road for approx 2 km, go under train track. It is on the right hand side before the bridge. Large site. it is a ways from the highway and tracks, and with the noise of the river it makes for a good sleep. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
