 <wpt lat="49.136500" lon="-116.417019">
  <ele>644.9957275390625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Goat River water front</name>
  <desc> A great spot for wild camping right beside the river.&#xA;There is enough room for a dozen campers and or tents, but obviously some spots are not as manicured as others.&#xA;&#xA;Some road noise and the river gurgles as well.&#xA;All in all we will be back - no signage or prohibitions for camping.&#xA;&#xA;The road down is a bit rough with a few Rollercoaster dips and could be difficult when muddy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234542 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
