  <ele>45.9</ele>
  <time>2024-03-16 13:32:37 UTC</time>
  <name>Miner&#39;s Marsh</name>
  <desc>Little park next to a beautiful marsh.  There&#39;s a site at the entrance before the bridge with grass and a table that I used to camp (access from the Kentville Justice Centre parking lot). No &#34;no camping&#34; sign ! There is a parking lot next to the entrance with a pit toilet too.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-16 13:32:37 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234572 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
