 <wpt lat="50.291038" lon="-107.818564">
  <ele>770.7072239592671</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 21:38:22 UTC</time>
  <name>Highland Coulee Trails</name>
  <desc>Trailhead for municipal trails network for mountain bikers &amp; hikers. There’s a small paved parking pad (3-4 vehicles tops) and a shipping container - grass is worn behind the container so I parked behind the container for a bit of reduced visibility from the road. Didn’t end up staying due to the heatwave, but there are no “no” signs posted. Across the street from a proper campground. Maybe 200m back from a main road but not that noisy. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 21:38:22 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234576 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
