 <wpt lat="45.128090" lon="-64.194766">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kempt Shore Ocean View Campground</name>
  <desc>20 acre site on the mouth of the Avon River at the Minas Basin. 40 water/electric sites 15 and 30amp. 500 non-serviced sites.  800 ft of beach frontage , free hot showers, flush toilets. Play ground. Stripped Bass fishing from the beach. Events happen the third weekend of July. August and September.&#xA;open June 1st to September 30th&#xA;non-serviced $30 + HST&#xA;water/ 15amp service $40 + HST&#xA;water/ 30 amp service  $50 + HST&#xA;Dump $20&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234593 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
