 <wpt lat="52.085281" lon="-116.416958">
  <ele>1332.8895478034392</ele>
  <time>2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Preachers Point South Rustic Camp Area</name>
  <desc>A Public Lands Camping Pass is required to camp here. &#xA;There is no Cellular service here.&#xA;Lovely area near the North Saskatchewan River. Beautiful views but winds can be fierce. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
