 <wpt lat="50.991890" lon="-115.378200">
  <ele>1094.5</ele>
  <time>2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spray Lakes West Campground</name>
  <desc>This is a first come first serve campsites. 12km down a dirt road in the conservation area. Have to pay to use road (can pay online) @ Kananaskis Alberta /pass. $15 . The campsite is $30 but includes firewood. was surprised to see no ban for fires when I visited this time of year. Many stops along the road for water (swim, kayak etc) access. The campsites are beside a nice lake and surrounded by mountains. active bears so be careful, but open grassy area around water so i felt safe. Not so busy and rolled in at 6pm on a Wed but may be on a weekend. Pretty quiet and peaceful. Best $30 I ever spent on a site! gave me exactly what I wanted from the mountains but without tourists! Check out time is 2pm:) enjoy!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234769 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
