  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: This place was added by the owner or manager. It has not been overlander verified.&#xA;&#xA;A peaceful setting located 10 mins between louisbourg ns and sydney ns. We do not provide power but water can be requested upon arrival aswell as small repairs. This site will accommidate any size rig or setup(campsite entrance is just before paved drive next to roadside plant stand) fee free to park anywhere near the maple tree and red bench. There&#39;s another site farther back if u prefer and also one on the far side by the apple tree.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234878 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
