  <desc>Two potable water taps - go through the gates and past the washrooms/showers (both for piblic).  Garbage cans, picnic tables, covered gazebos.  Nice spot for the day/evening.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
