  <name>Anytime Fitness Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Regina bylaw online says one can be parked anywhere for 24hours. There’s a coffee shop here too and they have food for sale during opening hours. I didn’t test wifi from the gym or coffee shop in the parking lot.  No hookups. Some road noise and light from the buildings all night but overall I was undisturbed. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234896 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
