 <wpt lat="54.209910" lon="-111.626697">
  <ele>626.3728803591803</ele>
  <time>2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside Municipal “garbage” collection site</name>
  <desc>Right next to the (Floating Stone Lake - mod) campground, this roadside municipal “garbage” collection site is very clean and surrounded by trees. It could be a new site. I have never left a campsite before because of noise but it was crazy loud with music, angry people and shouts… and we couldn’t sleep at all. Quiet hours were 11pm to 8am. Nope. And the host didn’t answer our calls as they were away from the phone till 8am. I recommend this collection site but not the campsite on weekends. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234916 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
