 <wpt lat="53.890000" lon="-119.157500">
  <ele>968.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Smokey River South Provincial Recreation Area Campground</name>
  <desc>Very pretty wooded campground near the Smokey River, 4.6km north of Grand Cache, AB. 22 campsites, first-come-first-served, $25.00 self register, pit toilets, hand pump non potable water, free firewood, any size RV (many deep sites, roads are good), picnic table and fire ring each site, garbage and recycling, no RV hookups or dump station&#xA;&#xA;Away from highway but still considerable noise during the day, quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;No sign on highway southbound but one coming from Grand Cache.&#xA;Turnoff is a dirt road just south of the bridge over the Smokey River.&#xA;&#xA;One bar AT&amp;T LTE, two bars with WeBoost cell booster. &#xA;&#xA;Mosquitoes not a big problem but they are here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/234929 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
