  <name>Long Island Lake Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>Municipal campground with 35 unserviced sites on one of the cleanest lakes in the province. Popular for swimming, fishing and boating activities. Boat launch is within the campground. Park office holds a small concession, with a variety of items for purchase including ice cream and firewood. Come see what Westlock County has to offer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235017 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
