  <ele>810.4868286286274</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cranberry Lake Pulloff</name>
  <desc>The road turns into a very dusty FSR. There are a few pulloffs down lower, so I imagine you higher there is more. There isn&#39;t a lot of room to turn around in this particular spot, but it was secluded and easy to get level. There are some faint noises from town (trains and dogs barking.) Cell reception is good here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235028 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
