  <ele>442.87823486328125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mosquito Lake</name>
  <desc>Great quiet place, swimmable lake. Toilet (compost).&#xA;At 9 a.m. several residents came to swim there. Access by Reid Street in van 2X4 otherwise 4x4 by Forest Road.&#xA;No space to perform a turn. Room for 3 vans if you squeeze in. 2 bars service with Roger’s not bad&#xA;.....&#xA;super place tranquille lac baignable. Toilette (composte). &#xA;jusqu a 9 h plusieurs résidents viennent s y baigner. Accès par la rue reid en van 2X4 sinon 4x4 par.la fsr road&#xA;pas de place pour effectuer u turn. petite place pour van ou auto seulement pas de.roulotte &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235029 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
