  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel pit east of dark water lake</name>
  <desc>Slightly overgrown gravel pit that is nicely off the Dempster, so that you don’t get dust or noise. Looks like it could be muddy during wet seasons but it is dry now. (July).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235033 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
