  <ele>716.6679700742457</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kettle Bench Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>BC recreation site on the Kettle River. Room for 4 campsites, 2 on the river and 2 within 100 feet. Pit toilet, but no other facilities. No mosquitoes, but we just maybe lucky. We camped at the southernmost site where the river runs through a rock bed and sounds fantastic. This site also has its own sandy beach. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235038 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
