 <wpt lat="48.543816" lon="-88.914115">
  <ele>191.35577392578125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crystal Beach Laundromat</name>
  <desc>Forget the idea to wash your clothes to Thunder Bay. You&#39;ll only find old and expensive machines and rude employees.&#xA;Rather go to this place : Crystal Beach Laundromat! The place is clean and smells very good. Machines are pretty news: on the website it&#39;s indicated they date from 2018.&#xA;3$ the washing machine for 30 minutes (I think it&#39;s a 2 loads)&#xA;2$ for 45 minutes of dryer. &#xA;Highly recommend it!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235041 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
