 <wpt lat="50.833812" lon="-116.405307">
  <ele>1141.2848509484902</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Topaz lake rec site</name>
  <desc>Very private BC rec site deep in the forest. Enough room for 5 vehicles. Has a picnic table and fire ring. Near a beautiful lake but not very swimmable. Continue on the right past kleeland lake to get here. The road is pretty rough but we got here in a rav4 and a VW Golf so you can too. No cell service or toilet. The fire warden does come check on you &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235221 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
