  <desc>The gas station is open everyday from 9am to 6pm. Price was competitive (1.80 today while it&#39;s probably 5c cheaper in Terrace)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235224 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
