  <ele>557.5663027376049</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Battle Creek FSR</name>
  <desc>Right off the highway is the FSR road with a couple immediate, smaller pull offs for small rigs. Up about 2ish km is a nice flat viewpoint that is great for camping and bigger rigs. No cell reception here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235254 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
