  <ele>654.799560546875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest Area</name>
  <desc>Highway rest area with pit toilets. Relatively quiet. Trucks park here overnight and so can other vehicles. You could set up a tent in the (mowed) tall grass but it&#39;s not likely to be a great experience.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235269 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
