 <wpt lat="52.614180" lon="-118.899120">
  <ele>759.0738957096354</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>With a View</name>
  <desc>Shaded spot with sweeping views of the lake. Massive private beach to yourself. Tons of trees and Shade. Totally secluded. Only 1-2 spots available. Direct lake access only with 4x4 (due to sandy dropoff) but better to camp in the trees/shade. Private beach and bay right beside. Once you arrive nobody else can come here as you need to block the road. No 4x4 required. No place to turn around. Not busy on a long weekend.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235272 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
