 <wpt lat="49.314198" lon="-53.657635">
  <ele>15.200000000000001</ele>
  <time>2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rocky Pond</name>
  <desc>Nice little spot just a bit further in from these coords. Tucked behind a small dune but you can still see the ocean. Fascinating rocks on the beach and Rocky Pond. Firepit.  Walk in first to check road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235332 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
