 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="43.870840" lon="-66.072810">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baileys Lick A Treat</name>
  <desc>You can stay there overnight, but ask just to be sure.  Park away from restaurant and lights should be away from your rig.  Go in and try some of their food.  Open 11 am to 7 pm, 7 days a week. Great restaurant with same menu as Bailey&#39;s in Dayton but without the bakery and with ice cream.  Great seafood at very reasonable prices.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235357 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
