 <wpt lat="51.494426" lon="-120.771700">
  <ele>1158.6531650256366</ele>
  <time>2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bridge lake ice caves car park </name>
  <desc>Mostly flat gravel car park with pit toilet for Bridge lake ice caves. Nice 2km ish loop to see the caves. Next to main road but little to no traffic at night and on a holiday weekend. &#xA;Spent one night a few cars came and went but was basically alone. Few picnic tables. No ‘no overnight parking signs’. &#xA;Part of a interlakes recreation area - be respectful of locals. &#xA;By midday on Saturday lot full of families and walkers doing the loop. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
