 <wpt lat="45.180168" lon="-66.340113">
  <ele>2.8040542602539062</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Musquash Estuary</name>
  <desc>Paved side road leading to a covered picnic table. Old bridge used to pass over the Musquash River here.  Recommend using the turn spot near the top of the road and backing in.  CAUTION small sink-hole at the edge of the road on one side.   Small falls below the bridge. Trail to hike down below the falls through the woods. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235378 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
