 <wpt lat="51.079226" lon="-118.172826">
  <ele>599.13623046875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>High lookout </name>
  <desc>Nice little place by the side of the road with a view giving over the dam. Can fit a small group, and there&#39;s not that much traffic at night.&#xA;&#xA;1-2 bar of 5G&#xA;&#xA;no access to water&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235384 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
