 <wpt lat="48.144943" lon="-53.955460">
  <ele>79.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 12:22:34 UTC</time>
  <name>Water Tap at Irving gas station</name>
  <desc>The water tap is located in front of the gas station, on the right. &#xA;&#xA;We asked an employee before filling our RV. Please be kind and do the same before using this water tap.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 12:22:34 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235393 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
