  <ele>26.227872363015173</ele>
  <time>2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Seaview Drive - side of road</name>
  <desc>Steep and rocky road leading up to a gate. No way to drive to the FSR that&#39;s on Google. A popular place for people to park to go hiking. There is a lot of road noise. Need a 4x4 to get up this short road. Not much room to turn around and will need to use some creativity to get level. We scoped this place out around 5pm, it was busy. Came back at 9pm and it was clear of vehicles. Decent cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235492 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
