 <wpt lat="52.573680" lon="-122.467335">
  <ele>150.5</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alexandria Town Hall</name>
  <desc>Large flat parking lot with a small forested area next to a metal sided building. On two separate occasions after a long drive I have parked overnight and slept in my tent. Once I slept in the mossy forested area, and a second time parked close to the trees and set my tent up there. Can be a little noisy with the highway quite close, but a calm, safe spot to sleep for a night.&#xA;&#xA;I believe there is an outhouse behind the building, though I have not looked at it on my most recent stop. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235593 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
