  <ele>258.5405073259026</ele>
  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel clearing off Highway</name>
  <desc>Easy to get into this large gravel area off the highway. There is a small lake (our GPS called it Little Lake). &#xA;There was cell service. Very little road noise because there is a berm between the highway and the camping area.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
