  <name>Maxi grocery parking lot</name>
  <desc>I asked the manager if we could overnight our 20&#39; trailer and he said yes. Large clean bulk grocery store. In town but quiet after dark, well lit parking lot which appears very safe. Toilet in store&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235653 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
