  <ele>466.6835601680574</ele>
  <time>2023-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Santa Rosa Road Pulloff</name>
  <desc>Pulloff on the side of the road. There is a parking lot at the trailhead on the turn above, but there are houses above and below, and we didn&#39;t want to disturb them with our generator. There are rocks around to help get level. Great spot for pulling over. Some cars will drive by throughout the night. Good cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;The parking lot would be a good place to camp for individuals using tents and/or no generators.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235656 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
