  <name>Doug&#39;s Recreation</name>
  <desc>RV sales, service and parts.&#xA;&#xA;ASAP service on the Tuesday following a long weekend (which i spent at Wal*Mart). Trailer hubs were loose both sides. Tightened them and retorqued the lug nuts first thing AM. Great and friendly service. Back on the road now and not spending another night at Wal*Mart.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
