  <ele>548.8831100514582</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stone Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>We camped at the lovely Stone Creek Campground on the Fraser River and got the last and best spot by the river. Rick and June are wonderful hosts. $30/night for an unserviced site. Noisy traffic during the day but quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Has a boat launch and you can swim in the creek. &#xA;&#xA;DO NOT attempt to cross the road to the campground if you have turned into theIoverlander spot acroos the highway which is make Private Property in any case. &#xA;&#xA;You cannot see the oncoming traffic. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235698 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
