  <desc>Had hot showers there for free, just ask the reception and you can use the showers in the change room (individual showers in women&#39;s change room but not in men&#39;s ones) Shower gel available in each shower&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
