  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pay Showers. Beban Park Recreation Center Pool</name>
  <desc>Pay Showers (hot showers) at the Beban Park pool. Tell the receptionist that you only want to shower and you won&#39;t have to pay full admission price. About $3.75 for a hot shower in the public change room. These are not private showers. Hairdryers, mirrors, sinks, lockers, flush toilets and benches for your convenience. Small restaurant in the lobby if you&#39;re hungry.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235751 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
