  <name>Pure Casino Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Was able to sleep here in the parking lot of the casino. The sercurity didn&#39;t bother. No sign up required. They have 2 lots. The smaller lot seems to have many rv and trailer spending overnight there. It is pretty big and spacious. Can fit around 20 RVs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235759 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
