  <name>Road to campsite</name>
  <desc>if there is no space by the boat launch area then this is an alternative spot to pull off the road.  no facilities but alright for an overnighter.  &#xA;&#xA;DO NOT park/camp by the Boat Launch area- which is right beside the Mendendhall River  (its a seperate road that leads to the water). And DO NOT Park at the other end of the parking lot - it is a put in and take out for people paddling the River.   &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
