  <time>2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beaverlodge Pioneer Campground</name>
  <desc>Small campground next to IGA right off Highway AB-43.&#xA;&#xA;$22.25/night for unserviced &#xA;&#xA;19 unserviced sites (field parking)&#xA;10 full service and power hook-ups sites&#xA;&#xA;free showers for campers ($5/unregistered guests)&#xA;free wifi&#xA;free firewood&#xA;full service sites avaliable &#xA;sani-dump on site &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
