  <name>Bridgenorth Water Spring</name>
  <desc>Southbound side of the road after the forested area, corner of Pinehill Rd on Chemong Rd. The kind owner of this house has a small pond at the road with a hose connected to a natural spring and offers free water filling, no contact needed. Locals use this spring to fill their water jugs and drink unfiltered. On a main road with traffic.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235891 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
