  <name>South Taylor Rest Area &amp; Brake Check </name>
  <desc>Large paved roadside pullout with restrooms, garbage bins and picnic tables.  Lots of highway traffic, mainly semis and travel trailers. Traffic doesn&#39;t appear to ever stop but it is a good place to stay for one night if you need too. Expect highway noise during your stay, consider earplugs as it is nearly constant.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235916 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
