  <desc>Typical Northern Store with a little bit of everything. prices seen to be cheaper than Hay River (which is interesting). If you are coming here after Hay River, you might want to wait to get food and gas. I should have. Gas today here was .10 cheaper per liter.&#xA;&#xA;Hours: &#xA;M-F 11-6&#xA;Sat 1-5 (inside it says closed sunday)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
