  <name>Mission Island Campground and 9 hole miniature golf course</name>
  <desc>A local told me about this place. I went over to check it out. I do not have the pricing of anything, but if you are interested, the band office would be a great place to ask. There are reg camp spots, little log cabins, playgrounds, and the 9 hole miniature gold course. Adding photos. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235983 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
