  <ele>7.041210202723283</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Glover’s Harbour Turnaround </name>
  <desc>Walking distance to the home/interpretation center of the famous Giant Squid. Oceanview. Very quiet. Relatively flat, and paved. Ample parking for a couple of big rigs! &#xA;Make sure to visit May’s Variety Store for your essentials and a delicious soft serve ice cream or milkshake! &#xA;Local friendly fishermen will also have fish for sale. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/235985 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
