  <desc>Very busy place, walking path and children’s park. No signs indicating overnight not allowed. Also a huge trailhead parking across the highway, behind the car wash. Building just south of this spot for water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236006 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
