  <desc>Nice camping along the waterfront, for tents and RVs. 28$ to camp in a tent for a night. Very nice person at the front desk. For tent campers, access to internet and electricity at the front desk.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236021 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
