 <wpt lat="51.888609" lon="-106.706132">
  <ele>484.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dakota Dunes Casino</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot with free electricity (15 amp).  Need to register for Players&#39;s card and register your RV.  We stayed 3 nights but I think you can stay 7 days. Very quiet at night.  10-12 sites with electricity.  Can park 5-6 other RVs without electricity.  Very friendly staff.  20 minutes from Saskatoon. Telus working fine here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236032 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
