  <desc>Campground with lots of trails and a couple beaches there are potable water fountains / taps all through out. Easiest access probably day use area gps coordinates are French falls parking and accessible beach which also have a fountain across way and to right (in front of cabin).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 07:19:51 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236043 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
