  <ele>594.8998152092099</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Northern Lights Aquatic Centre - Swimming Pool</name>
  <desc>$2 showers. When I called the gentleman giving me the price sounded a bit hesitant. So I don’t know if he made the price up on the spot or just does not get a lot of people asking to shower only and was surprised by my question.  1 private stall that does not work well. 3 open pool style showers. Lockers if you need them. Hot water showers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236064 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
