  <ele>1276.3177905166522</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stoney Campground</name>
  <desc>Beautiful big campground near Canmore and Banff. The village of Banff is a 40-50 minute drive away. Super quiet campsite as well, booked here on a Saturday during the day and plenty of room.&#xA;Places have firepits, wood available at the office.&#xA;Drive slowly though, roads are gravel and grass. &#xA;Honestly if I had to recommend a campsite close to Calgary and/or Banff, I’d recommend this one&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236080 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
