  <desc>Like 10 or more parking lots. The street to this place is a bit like a unpaved road, but it&#39;s worth it.&#xA;You have like 150 metre beach and it&#39;s very quiet. Another car with a roof tent was also here at the same night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236084 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
