  <ele>16.33181381225586</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>End of the road by Fargas Island sign </name>
  <desc>Very short paved parking spot at the end of the road. We just fit and are in a 19 ft van. &#xA;We asked the neighbor if it was okay and he said sure…people do it all the time.  A pit toilet about 200yds away on a hiking trail.  1bar of cell service. Beautiful view of the bay and of Fergas Island &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
