  <name>Okanagan Falls provincial park campground  </name>
  <desc>Really nice and quiet provincial campground right on the river and a short walk into the little town of Okanagan falls. Un-serviced but really clean flush toilets and super nice staff! &#xA;Would definitely prefer and choose over the RV parks in town. Highly recommend!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236267 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
