  <ele>977.740234375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>train bridge over the river </name>
  <desc>small quad trail that leads to a path to the river. It is a small trail off the main travel road and just below a CN site.  This would be for vehicles or vans only as there is limited space. There are a couple little fire pits and it is right by the water. It is right by the train bridge though and trains come and go all day and night so It can be very loud. It&#39;s a good spot if the others along the road are taken or if you want to go for a dip. You do get a couple bars of service here &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236316 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
