 <wpt lat="53.495852" lon="-113.411207">
  <ele>693.9298454997174</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>First Truck Centre</name>
  <desc>For diesel motorhomes only.  This is one of a chain of truck repair centers in Western Canada that are open seven days a week. There are two locations in Edmonton and one in Lloydminster and others in British Columbia. They are very professional and pleasant to work with. I talked to three locations before going to the one that could fit me in the soonest. Everyone was very nice and wanted to help. When I went in, the shop foreman spent time discussing the problem with me and then prepared a written estimate for the work - all with no charge.  In the end we elected to not do the work but to wait and see what happens as our problem was intermittent. Excellent experience. Highly recommended.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236384 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
  <extensions>
