  <name>Forest service road RV</name>
  <desc>Can fit an RV here with no issue getting leveled. I am in a 25ft class C. Not much of a view anywhere along this road. I think some of the photos added on locations further up are a mistake or from a long time ago. I drove the whole thing and this looked like the best spot for an RV at least. 2 bars LTE for service? &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236701 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
