 <wpt lat="51.255333" lon="-116.715522">
  <ele>1010.436080185632</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kicking force kayak launch</name>
  <desc>Multiple camping sites in large field and near river. Commercial rafting put in take out and busing activity at one portion. While we were here, several groups showed up to put in and kayak to golden. Beautiful views of surrounding mountains when clouds and smoke lifted. minimal to no cell phone connection. train activity subsided at night, but then work crew came out to make midnight repairs to the line straight across from where we’re camping. Glad to have a beautiful free spot but won’t be staying a second night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236756 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
