  <desc>Laundromat has good machines of many sizes.&#xA;Very clean.&#xA;Good prices.&#xA;Dryers are fast.&#xA;Wifi on site.&#xA;Washroom on site.&#xA;Help on site.&#xA;Coin Machine…&#xA;Drink Fridge…&#xA;Drop off Wash’n Fold available.&#xA;Large parking lot.&#xA;Open 8am to 7pm&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236757 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
