  <ele>1072.5302056790335</ele>
  <time>2024-06-24 08:05:02 UTC</time>
  <name>free. next to waitabit campground</name>
  <desc>Great spot for any size rig. Stayed a few days - alone most of the time and joined every few nights by another. Beautiful views, water taken from the creek was pretty clean. Pit toilets walking distance at main campground. Three or so times a day a water truck arrives to take water from the river but it’s not noisy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 08:05:02 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
