  <name>Captain Cook Historic Site</name>
  <desc>This is the nicest view in Corner Brook at the Captain James Cook Natinal Site There’s 13 cars places available, so ok for RV. During the day and at the sunset many people was here for the view. But after it’s very calm for the night. You need to pass the residential street and it’s high on the hill&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236876 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
