  <desc>Viewpoint (old) without a view.  Easier access while northbound.  Turnaround allows up to midsize RVs.  Room for 1-2.  Gravel, level and good for tents.  Private and off the road.  At the top of hill with both sun and shade.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236890 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
