 <wpt lat="53.641509" lon="-124.953533">
  <ele>770.3259699838236</ele>
  <time>2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Cheslatta River Campground </name>
  <desc>Free campsite next to an incredible raging river!  Short hike (1.2k each way) to a waterfall.  A few pit toilets, picnic tables and fire rings.  The Forest Service road was the best I’ve been on, although beware of local workers driving really fast!  Worth the detour from the highway!&#xA;&#xA;You might get a bigger trailer in here without problems if it’s empty like it was for me!  I’m in a van. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236928 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
