  <ele>1054.6029052734375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>rest area off hwy going east </name>
  <desc>large gravel lot for any size rig. during the night, we&#39;ve been with 3 large rigs (40ft +). road noise at night was ok. not perfect leveled, but ok. if you follow the paved road, it leads you to pit toilets and more parking. you can turn around with big rigs, but parking will be tight. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236935 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
