  <ele>6.055333990603685</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Willingdon Beach Campground </name>
  <desc>Great city campground right on the beach. I think it gets confused with Kent’s. Full and partial hookups, reasonable price, free wifi, token showers and laundry. If your unit is small, try to get near the beach!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/236951 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
