  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>U turn wide parking area</name>
  <desc>We missed the turn off for the Rest Area and followed the “UTurn” road which was the next exit. Found this spot by accident and did not track back to the rest area as we were not sure if overnight parking at the Rest Area was prohibited or not. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237020 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
