 <wpt lat="46.208700" lon="-82.065100">
  <ele>142.6159154362907</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Carlabert Street</name>
  <desc>About 5 minutes in from highway 17 towards Mouth Park. The Park has beautiful scenery area and bathrooms but no overnight camping.  there is a boat launch right across from the beautiful quiet boondocking spot. no noise great fishing and hiking in area. Right near Massey, Ontario. We ran our generator for a couple of hours and spoke to local kids fishing at the boat launch. So gorgeous.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237021 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
