 <wpt lat="49.018176" lon="-117.984931">
  <ele>898.5398203236982</ele>
  <time>2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Santa Rosa Forest Service Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Beautiful wee spot located just off the side of the Rossland-Cascade Rd. at 28km. Not much room but we managed to stuff our #tinytruckhouse in near the sturdy picnic bench adjacent the burbling Santa Rosa Cr. There is another spot located immediately in front of the clean/well constructed outhouse/pit toilet but the ground was too slopey for us. Nice tree cover with a fire pit. No views per se but should be a pleasant spot for us to spend the night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237055 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
