 <wpt lat="51.260798" lon="-115.088580">
  <ele>1566.4684547632933</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sunny wild camping among the mountains</name>
  <desc>Couldn’t tell ya how we ended up here. We got lost trying to find the spot on the river about 6km from here. It’s a wide open area perfect for solar and star link on the right hand side of a gravel road just before a dead end where some sort of industrial complex sits. It’s a longggg loud bump washboard ride to get here but anyone will be fine with a regular vehicle. 1-2 bars of spotty ATT. Fire ring. Level. No shade. Great views. No mesquites but lots of flys and buzzers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237058 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
