  <name>Jubilee Fishpond Camp Ground</name>
  <desc>Shaded campground by Fishpond recreation area southern entrance to Magrath. On the upper area pitches have 25$ with electric, lower sites without 15$ a night. Dump station north east outskirts of town. Small supermarket in town, nice trails from site.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237123 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
