 <wpt lat="48.655326" lon="-123.692921">
  <ele>137.9774284362793</ele>
  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kinsol Trestle Trail Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>This is a little gravel parking area off the road that services the Kinsol Trestle bike trail. There are about 5 spaces and one on the end that can fit a larger vehicle. We fit easily in our 25’ Sprinter. No “no overnight parking” signs or other parking restrictions. Minimal road noise in the evening. &#xA;&#xA;Beautiful forest. Open sky for Starlink. The trail was a bit monotonous for hiking but would be great for a bike. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237134 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
