 <wpt lat="48.782850" lon="-123.286490">
  <ele>38.49861694313586</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ohana Farms</name>
  <desc>Ohana Farms is a 46 acre produce and flower farm. 5 camping spots are available on an old grassy airstrip next to a beautiful pond. Each site has a picnic table and pit toilets and a spigot are available. Pets are allowed but do note that the owner has three small dogs and this is a working farm with pigs and chickens around. The air hanger often has events on weekends like comedy shows and live music. The farm is conveniently located just a few minute walk to the grocery store. The vineyard is 4km away and the pub is about 1km away. Access to camping is via a narrow dirt driveway which may not be great for large rigs. You will be driving on mowed grass to get to camping spot which is a bit bumpy. $35/night &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
