 <wpt lat="49.129479" lon="-125.419186">
  <ele>4.907980024814606</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wide pull off </name>
  <desc>Hwy 4 is a very windy road. We couldn’t find any place to stay in Tofino and we thought it was safer to find a place to stay along the Hwy than risk driving at night. This place is a wide pull off on the right side of the road heading towards Port Alberny with a steel barrier stopping you from parking too close to the creek beside.   It is long enough for an RV or a couple vans. It is flat and we didn’t have any issue staying the night but left very early as the traffic is busy in AM. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237249 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
