  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart - 2nd location in town, not the supercenter</name>
  <desc>Typical Walmart, but not a supercenter where parking can sometimes be restricted. Close to Hwy A40, but we found road noise pretty much died off by 10-11pm. Store closes at 9. Multiple RVs next to us and about 10 by morning. MacDonalds and Tim&#39;s across the street.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237276 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
