  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>forest road</name>
  <desc>500m before the bungee there is a short road into the forest, in your right if you&#39;re on the way to the bungee. full cellular reception, and very quiet place to stay.&#xA;one spot for big rigs, one for tent and one for small rig.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237293 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
