  <ele>812.7685546875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>huge gravel pit close to river</name>
  <desc>very huge gravel pit. super leveled. free. quiet during day and night. close to the river. stayed one night, no issues. any size rig. fits provable 100 RV... it&#39;s really huge. not beautiful but good for a night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
