 <wpt lat="47.900670" lon="-59.411653">
  <ele>-11.299999999999999</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cape Anguille Lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Pretty oceanside spot.  Go past the lighthouse and foghorn.  Nice walk along the coast.  Fabulous sunset.  Vans and truck campers ok.  There is space to park a larger camper but worth checking turning around (or you could back out).  It was completely calm when we were here, but worth checking out winds/fog prior to visiting. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237332 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
