 <wpt lat="48.635462" lon="-68.113926">
  <ele>22.78035545349121</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Motel Métis</name>
  <desc>Our campsite offers sites for trailers and motorhomes or a simple and refined option for tent campers. Our sites will be able to welcome you during your visit to Gaspésie with the type of location that suits you, either with or without service. Toilets and showers are available in the center of the field. And, as a bonus, a magnificent sunset every evening!!! Lunch Bread, jam &amp; creton, all made at home by Nadia and Simon $10 per person&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237345 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
