  <time>2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trains </name>
  <desc>This side pull off is right beside the train tracks, in a tiny town.  No apparent &#34;no camping signs&#34;  there is a dump station (free)  picnic tables, shelter   Great for picnic- the trains will rumble the ground but grass cut and nice   You get good data service,  convenience store across the road&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237405 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
