  <ele>-8.60650634765625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>boomtown 2</name>
  <desc>nice place can drive up closer to the edge with a nice view. not sure if we&#39;re aloud in this area since it&#39;s across the bridge from boomtown. but we only staying for couple hrs to rest and enjoy the peace and quite. could possibly stay for a night or 2 but keep it clean there&#39;s a sign saying &#34;smile you may be on film&#34; lol .. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
