  <ele>1199.8326998474076</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ghost River</name>
  <desc>Nice view of lake. Fireplace and picnic table. 3 bars Fido. Not for big rigs. Fits a couple of vehicles.&#xA;&#xA;After the two gates, take a left at the intersection&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237439 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
