 <wpt lat="49.374100" lon="-105.657390">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jean Louis Legare Regional Park</name>
  <desc>Established regional campground attached to a golf course. A lot of people seemed permanently camped there with large RVs, patios, etc. But there were a few sites people passing through as well. Sites seemed pretty close together and small.  Most people around us seemed to know each other and many people were tooling around in golf cars since the golf course is attached. Staff was very friendly! I would stay here again if passing through but this isn&#39;t someplace I would plan to spend more than one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237443 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
