  <name>Regatta boathouse</name>
  <desc>Small parking lot in front of the Lake. Spent one night there, there was no &#34;no-parking&#34; sign. Between the parking and the Lake There were runner in the morning and a bit of foot trafic late at night, but nothing too noisy. Single space parking lot so i dont recommend a big big here. its a 20 minutes walk to the quidi vidi village. 30 min walk to go downtown.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237480 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
