  <desc>South of Marsden.  Hidden Gem All size of RV and tents.   Showers, kitchen, un serviced and all service.  Dump and water, boat launch, beach on salt water lake.   Wide open grassed with trees around edges.  $20 night (no services)  very nice folks running it.  Plus self registration.  About 6 km south of main road- getting one bar of service &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237505 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
