  <desc>A small parking lot above the beach with no signage at all about parking. Other signage shows maps and other information. Vehicles park overnight to use camping spots on the local hiking trails.&#xA;&#xA;Angle parking and a few larger parallel spots, but none exactly level.&#xA;&#xA;Google maps has photos and reviews of the beach, but none of the parking (08/2023).&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
