  <desc>Next to a football field, its called a maintenance road. A bit of privacy, no signs „no camping“, not too visible from the road.&#xA;Gravel Road is a bit higher than the road.&#xA;We had a tent there, no problems with neighbors. No amanities or fire place!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
