 <wpt lat="45.996289" lon="-67.234524">
  <ele>18.2369384765625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lions Club / Nackawic Arena Parking</name>
  <desc>Confirmed with Lions Club member - 1 night only boondocking. Never more than 1 night.  Beautiful 180 Degree views from the Lions Club and Arena Parking lot. overlooking the Marina. Across the street is Ryans Pharmacy and the town&#39;s full Grocery store.  The Marina has a small ice cream supply and across the road is a little Ice Cream Stand.  The green space between parking and the river is a park setting. The parking lot is very flat with only a small bit of leveling needed if you like to be perfectly level. There are shade trees in the green space and it also looks over the Big Axe (statue) on other side of arena.  Very quiet and no signs saying no parking. Locals came and went to their boats and several RVs in the parking lot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237713 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
