  <ele>15.43389892578125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pappy&#39;s BBQ joint </name>
  <desc>Great BBQ joint with craft beer and extensive bbq menu.&#xA;Hans the owner opens up a super grassy spot for boondockers as long as you buy his succulent food. I feel that&#39;s a fair deal and it&#39;s real tasty, cheaper than a campsite, no cooking and no dishes&#xA;As bonus the sunset is awesome. See pictures.&#xA;Highly recommended and there are some GF and vegetarian options. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
