  <ele>806.5504837036133</ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Columbia River Paddle</name>
  <desc>We came to rent a kayak for next day and were given permission to stay the night after 7pm. &#xA;&#xA;Just down the hill after bridge upon entering Invermere - away from the highway. Turn left on Third St (near A&amp;W) just down the hill after the bridge and the first left and go down to the water. Next to a paved walking/ bike path and the water and pebble beach. &#xA;&#xA;Good cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237811 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
