 <wpt lat="44.626062" lon="-63.574238">
  <ele>34.34298324584961</ele>
  <time>2023-11-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Point Pleasant Park </name>
  <desc>This area is street parking in front of a neighborhood park called Point Pleasant Park. Part of the street has no “No Parking&#39; signs nor limited parking. It is across the street from residential homes so you must be respectful of the neighborhood. I stayed over one night and there was a large camper parked there for at least 2 nights. I wouldn’t make this a long term parking area but it is good for 1-2 nights in the heart of a big city - Halifax. There is a picnic table inside the park and a port-a-potty 50 or so yards (meters) away. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237860 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
