  <name>Z. FSR</name>
  <desc>Another spot along this road. I found a number of good spots, this is just one of them. This one is a bit farther from the highway, but there&#39;s still a little road noise. Open area about 15x25 meters. Flat (1 degree). AT&amp;T was good LTE here. Bugs weren&#39;t too annoying at sunset on a clear summer day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237880 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
