  <desc>This is a large gravel lot suitable for rigs of any size. We stayed here 4 nights with our 32&#39; fifth wheel and were the only ones here overnight.  It&#39;s within walking distance (less than 2 km) of a couple of restaurants.  It is on a hill overlooking the water with beautiful views and sunsets. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/237944 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
