  <name>Toronto West Campground</name>
  <desc>Lots of long term, but have several pull thru sites with full hookups including 50amp power, water and sewer.&#xA;&#xA;Sites are very long, plenty of room for 43&#39; towing jeep, plus more space. Some sites they back to back in the one pull thru site and there&#39;s still plenty of room.&#xA;&#xA;If you have a mounted Starlink , most sites have large trees on both sides, which is great for shade, but causes major interruptions to Starlink.&#xA;&#xA;Managers are very friendly and helpful!&#xA;&#xA;Pets are welcome.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238052 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
