  <name>eddies cove quarry pond</name>
  <desc>pull out into a quarry pond. first section across from pond has space for about 2 rigs. drive a bit further and it opens up to a large area. a shooting range is set up which indicates people come to shoot guns here, so be aware of that. there&#39;s a bunch of household and construction garbage that is dumped in the area which is unfortunate and unsightly. &#xA;&#xA;no one was around when we were though.&#xA;&#xA;2 bars of bell service at area across from pond. starlink service is excellent.&#xA;&#xA;traveling in 22&#39; ford transit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238092 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
