  <desc>Asked in the centre and the tap/faucet outside between the washrooms is potable water. We filled out 6 gallon jug easily here.&#xA;maybe not suitable for filling RV tanks but if you had a long enough hose it might be OK!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238371 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
