 <wpt lat="48.679060" lon="-53.094000">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dungeon PP</name>
  <desc>A little more away from the main road that drives through the provincial park so its relatively more secluded from visitors that drive through. Its fairly uneven here with a cliff that overlooks the ocean, but a few flat spots can be found.  There was some rotting fish carcasses on the rocks below so the odour wafted up occasionally and that sucked. be aware of that but hopefully will have disappeared by the time you arrive!&#xA;&#xA;Starlink services were excellent&#xA;&#xA;travelling in 22&#39; ford transit&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238374 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
