 <wpt lat="51.168913" lon="-114.010572">
  <ele>1080.7629019943997</ele>
  <time>2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Airport Views</name>
  <desc>Just a series of pullouts on a dirt road in the outskirts of the city. If you keep driving down the road road, fat the end is a cul de sac that’s flat. Great spot for a night, or for multiple undisturbed city nights. &#xA;&#xA;Slept here multiple times over the last few months. &#xA;&#xA;Dog walkers, local hang out spot, but very safe &#xA;&#xA;You can hear the highway near by and planes overhead but it isn’t bad. Plus seeing planes land and take off is cool. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238401 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
