  <ele>58.27288818359375</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Granby carpool</name>
  <desc>Large carpooling parking lot on rue Denison abt 2 min off A10. No signs about overnighting. A few cars parked all night. Reasonably flat. No lighting. Some highway noise. Nearby A&amp;W, Tim Hortons &amp; Esso. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
