 <wpt lat="49.461240" lon="-123.661622">
  <ele>243.11677366681397</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peaceful and quiet campground in the forest</name>
  <desc>A very peaceful and quiet campground in the middle of the forest near roberts creek, very clean, pleasant parking spots, plus a lovely garden with vegetables and great smelling flowers. Very nice hiking possibility in the nearby forest which are especially great for dogs (Pets welcome) and mountain biking. Very friendly and helpful owners. All the spots are very green with a separate platform for tents and have nice chairs. Most seem to have shade plus picnic tables. Big fire pit and separate kitchen area in the middle of the campground. Hot showers available for free. &#xA;Would definitely stay here again.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238437 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
