  <ele>540.5460205078125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>PIT DE SABLE 389 </name>
  <desc>sand pit. Large enough for any RV or trailer. Very calm. Please make sure you collect your trash before leaving.&#xA;&#xA;pit de sable. Assez grand pour n&#39;importe quel  vr ou roulotte. Très calme. Svp veiller ramassé vos vidanges avant de partir. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238446 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
