  <desc>Huge camp ground with tons of things for the kids to do. Can fit all different sizes of RV’s , Tenting, with tons of washrooms, and laundry facility. Restaurant on the camp grounds. Fire pit picnic bench on your site. Reasonably priced to stay here also. Large sites here also. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 17:56:43 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238512 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
