  <ele>132.666259765625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lowry Lake Recreation Site </name>
  <desc>Beautiful, cozy campground next to a clear lake with a small gravel beach. 6 sites with picnic tables and fire pits. There is also an outhouse. &#xA;&#xA;We were the only ones there in Mid August (not a weekend though). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238622 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
