 <wpt lat="56.711112" lon="-111.395242">
  <ele>224.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Down 4x4 (ATV) road </name>
  <desc>This takes you to a great spot by the river. No one would know you were down here. Its meant for ATVs, but if you can make it down here, why not. Local said there are a lot of bears down here and are trying to fatten up for winter, so be bear aware!! Do not leave anything out or behind. &#xA;Dont come down when it has or will be raining ... or if your vehicle is not capable. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238690 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
