  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc Cartier</name>
  <desc>This is a small campground. It is well maintained and the bathroom building is brand new. there are hot showers for free. price is dry camp for 15$ and water/electric for 25$.&#xA;cell network is good. if you have a starlink you want to set it up in the field behind the row of trees. booking is online only but there aren&#39;t many guest around so I&#39;d say come in, check it out, and then book the place that you are on.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238707 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
