  <name>J37 RV Park </name>
  <desc>Located at the SW corner of Hwys. 1 and 37.  This RV park clearly went out of business at least a couple of years ago, but there are still plenty of accessible spaces.  No water, electricity, washrooms or sewers, but it beats paying for a site at the nearby Baby Nugget RV Park.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238824 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
