 <wpt lat="47.429414" lon="-66.946937">
  <ele>228.0770263671875</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>parking lot at the gate </name>
  <desc>we arrived after 16H00 and the day use is good until 20H00. so we could pay for a camp site,  but when we asked if can sleep in the parking lot the Ranger almost laughed and said yes, and actually it is the best site because it has WiFi, toilet(in the building) and picnic tables on the grass. the only thing is no fire. so we slept here and will do some hiking today, and probably will sleep here again tonight.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238862 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
