  <ele>8.988645600124217</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Souris . Prince Edward Island</name>
  <desc>located between the lighthouse and the ward. large parking, flat view of the water.  no sign of &#39;no parking&#39;.  very quiet during the night&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238865 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
