 <wpt lat="44.083580" lon="-66.183318">
  <ele>4.311984537169337</ele>
  <time>2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bamboo Gardens Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Restaurant parking lot. We saw a sign for this restaurant on the highway that said “closed this summer”…the rv park was full and the motel office was closed when we got here so we opted to park here. View of Mavillette Beach, walking distance to the beach. Quiet, billions of stars. There is a big light in the lot and on the street but didn’t bother us. Big, flat, lots of turning space. There is a house(?) next to the restaurant and cars were there/lights were on, but nobody talked to us and there’s no signage of any kind in the parking lot (“private property” “customer parking only”, etc…) &#xA;Had one quiet night here, probably wouldn’t stay more just in case. Phone Service yes, no other services. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
