  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mary March Wilderness Park</name>
  <desc>Commercial RV park with electricity and pit toilets. Fee for showers, no dumping station. Water at sites is from drilled wells and should be ok. They can haul away sewage with a quad pulling a container.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238893 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
