 <wpt lat="49.734664" lon="-123.117378">
  <ele>24.0</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>DB auto</name>
  <desc>I called 13 garages for someone to fix me up and someone gave me this number. LIFESAVER. everyone was booked 2 to 4 weeks ahead, he took me the next day ! super nice guy. be aware... his garage door is only 10 foot high and can&#39;t go really higher inside.  even my savana 3500 i had to take off the bike rack in back because i was too long.  so small vehicules only ! &#xA;&#xA;J&#39;ai appelée 13 garages pour faire réparer ma van.. quelqu&#39;un ma donner ce numero. il m&#39;a sauvé la vie ! tout le monde était booker de 2 a 4 semaines.. il m&#39;a pris le lendemain ! super sympathique ! soyez avertis... sa porte de garage a juste 10 pieds de hauteur et c&#39;est pas bien bien plus hauta l&#39;intérieur.. il a même fallu j&#39;enlève mon rack a vélo parce que mon savana 3500 était trop long sinon. donc petit véhicule/van seulement !&#xA;&#xA;Darren&#xA;2003 Paco road &#xA;1 604 848 5653&#xA;https://www.facebook.com/MooresMotors?mibextid=ZbWKwL&#xA;&#xA;ps. tell him &#39;solo sur la route&#39; says hi !&#xA;dites lui que &#39;solo sur la route fait dire bonjour !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238920 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Mechanic and Parts</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>shop_car_repair</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#9999ff</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="46.881823" lon="-84.262834">
  <ele>232.7</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolf Lake Road Crown Land </name>
  <desc>once you get off 17. most of Wolf lake road is crown Land. drove till the road narrowed quite a bit and found a little spot that you can turn around. definitely out in the middle of nowhere. very quiet and secluded. slept in my rig. Toyota 4x4. very nice place.  My photos are drone shots.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238927 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
