  <ele>463.88360595703125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>rond point, Éolienne </name>
  <desc>magnificent place near the city, where you can sleep sound. The shy here is clear, the stars shine. Just beauty!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/238962 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
