  <desc>The beach has a parking lot, just next to the Rotary Playworld Spray Park, and the drinkable water is between the washrooms and a Mexican food stand.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239005 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
