 <wpt lat="53.676476" lon="-114.354725">
  <ele>721.620361328125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beachside Laundramat</name>
  <desc>Very clean, not busy at all, most machines work. Washers are $3, larger machine is $5 , smaller dryers are $2, larger dryers are $3 for up to 35 minutes. Change machine but no soap dispenser so bring your own soap and softener. &#xA;Room now to fold clothes.&#xA;Also a purified water dispenser up to 5 gallons.&#xA;under new ownership since 2024.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239011 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
