 <wpt lat="49.746186" lon="-123.977087">
  <ele>90.72485914081335</ele>
  <time>2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Logging Rd near North Lake Rd</name>
  <desc>This is as wild as it gets as far as camping goes in that there is absolutely nothing here. I pulled over on the side of a logging road that had a nice clearing and is very level so worked out really well in my jeep. This is an easy way to find a nice little campsite without having to go to the actual campsite nearby And especially if you pull in late like I did. Great location easily access to the fairies which is only 10 minutes away maximum and beautiful views of the forest and valley. I have two solid bars of Wi-Fi through Bell so your connection will be all right&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239045 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
