  <ele>794.727783203125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>bluff overlooking Kelowna </name>
  <desc>just a open site right off a small road, off chute lake road. right before a yellow gate, there&#39;s several fire pits, more glass and garbage than appropriate, but quiet and overlooking all of Kelowna. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239100 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
