 <wpt lat="64.041650" lon="-139.407260">
  <ele>328.4755562637001</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dawson City RV Park Gas and Tires</name>
  <desc>Tire shop, one of three in town. They have many tires in stock but it&#39;s the very cheapest ones (Ironman) at very high prices even for Dawson (one RV Class C Light Truck tire was 340 CAD plus 45 CAD labor to rim mount and balance). Napa Autoparts and Chief Isaac are minutes away with better quality tires at the same price. Napa and Chief Isaac are also full-service repair shops.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
