  <desc>Very cute wild and rustic camping site, very close to La Martre Lighthouse. The camp offers a dry toilet, solar shower, water for cleaning and cooking (non-drinking) wood burning stove...  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239145 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
