 <wpt lat="50.105483" lon="-122.981268">
  <ele>673.0</ele>
  <time>2024-03-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whistler Parking (overnight) </name>
  <desc>In Whistler it is notoriously difficult to find a parking space. But here you can park for free. Is not directly in the center, but good to reach by bus. In addition, right next to it is the beautiful Alta Lake. We also stood one night on the side of the road. Nobody has disturbed us. Little traffic. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239181 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
