  <ele>233.76009970344603</ele>
  <time>2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel area off highway</name>
  <desc>An easy place to pull off for the night. Large gravel area. One other van pulled in after us. Room for trucks pulling trailer. Lots of space. Quiet. No washrooms, must be self contained. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239222 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
