  <desc>big parking lot close to the parking lot and cultural centre. Slept here on night in my car. Some noise but slept quite sound. the was a sign of no over night parking close to the lumel studios. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239276 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
