 <wpt lat="51.244748" lon="-115.841711">
  <ele>1430.7585487449542</ele>
  <time>2028-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Johnston Canyon Campground </name>
  <desc>Established forest campground through Parks Canada. Book online as they were full every night. There are ~130 sites and I believe they are all dry. Can accommodate tents and RV. Hot showers, dumpsters, recycling, dump station, potable water, flush toilets, pets allowed. Right at the Johnston Canyon trailhead. Stayed two nights and it was fine. Nothing too exceptional, but it was very quiet (aside from the random trains that roll by). They still allowed campfires despite the wildfires throughout Canada. $29.25 CAD per night. Cell service was intermittent, between 1-2 bars LTE with ATT.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2028-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239279 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="53.242203" lon="-132.156295">
  <ele>17.535984449088573</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kagan Bay Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot right at the ocean. There are only six spots for RVs and they are very popular. Each site has a table and firepit, one pit toilet at the first spot.&#xA;&#xA;Free. At the end of a gravel road when you leave Daajing Giids, taking Honna Road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
