  <ele>614.1060791015625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Merritt Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>This is a designated stopping area opposite the Esso gas station. It contains space for 4 semis/RVs and over 10 cars. Picnic benches and trash cans are available, as well as a dog bag dispenser.&#xA;&#xA;It is directly alongside highway 5A so there is road noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239480 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
