 <wpt lat="58.687268" lon="-123.765651">
  <ele>1108.542446218431</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cell tower hill </name>
  <desc>Directly across from rest stop at KM536. Sign at bottom of the hill warns of unmaintained road, no other prohibited signs. ZERO SERVICES.&#xA;&#xA;Easy couple hundred yard climb to the top in my 30’ class C. Probably not a good fit for class A but all others will be fine. &#xA;&#xA;Good size open area for multiple rigs, 6,8,10 or so. Directly below cell towers, I’m roaming on Bell with 4 bars of LTE.  NO INTERNET EVEN WITH STARLINK.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239488 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
