  <ele>13.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stone Island Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Large trailhead parking area, at the end of the gravel road.  Very quiet and great views!  Main parking area is not level so will need leveling blocks.  Could probably get level by the road, but will miss the views.  Not recommended for wide rigs, the gravel road is narrow and you will be dragging through the trees.  3 bars cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239527 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
