  <desc>Beautiful small lake not far from highway 1. It&#39;s super quiet. You just hear the birds and fish in the water. The last two km of the road are pretty rough, though, but we could do it with our Ford Transit. No water, electricity, or toilets, just nature. &#xA;Please ceep it clean!!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239854 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
