  <name>Soapy Suds Coin Laundry</name>
  <desc>Small, but everything worked today. There are 4$, 6$, and 7$ washers and drier is .25 for 6m. There is an attendant where you can purchase laundry items and get change. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239969 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
