 <wpt lat="53.991539" lon="-111.271355">
  <ele>627.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Co Op parking lot</name>
  <desc>I have been stuck in this town, waiting on a part to come in, for a few days, and have been parked in the same spot here between Co Op and the main road. It is just down from the Sani-Dump/water site. I have had no issues with this spot. When I first got here, I parked in the back. The manager came out and told me to park on the side and not the back, so I did. I have some wifi here, co op free, which has been a plus. There is noise from vehicles constantly, but that really doesn&#39;t bother me. Sunday starting at 6 am, for about 2 hours, there were gun shots (hunting birds maybe?) that I was not fond of, but other than that, no issues. I still have a week to go here, so Im hoping they do t get tired of me here. I&#39;ll update it if they finally do.  Pretty much everyone I&#39;ve talked to jas been super nice and supportive, though. It&#39;s nice having the store here if needed as well. Everything else is within walking distance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239973 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
