  <ele>659.8895988106268</ele>
  <time>2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Beaver Dam</name>
  <desc>Great semi secluded spot. Take the exit for Tetsa River Provincial Park. Take the first left into the wide open area. Plenty of room for all sized vehicles. We stayed at the end of the turn around tucked between the trees and the river next to a beaver dam. Still hear road noise but your down below the road, not right on it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/239988 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
