  <time>2023-12-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Gravel</name>
  <desc>Gravel area off the road which leads to Ratter Lake Campground. There are two gravel tracks which lead to a larger gravel area. No signs to say that you cannot camp. It is clean so must not be used by campers so please keep it clean as it will no doubt get closed. You’ll only have yourselves to blame. No toilet, no nothing except quietness away from RVs and generators. Camping only. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240048 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
