  <ele>412.1527099609375</ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tantallon Campground</name>
  <desc>Beautiful, quiet, small, community owned campground with full services. Cleanest bathrooms and showers I have ever experienced. Trailers, vans and tents all work here. Level ground and next to Qu&#39;Appelle River (limited access to river due to bank). &#xA;Non-electric sites $15. Electric sites $25. Includes firewood. Someone comes around in the evening or morning to collect or pay at the local store / co-op. &#xA;While here, ask about the Hamona settlement near Town. Very interesting.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240197 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
