  <desc>Take the dirt road off the TCH, you will find a lot of spots, most of them are even. At the ones further back you will even see some lakes.&#xA;The highway is audible during the day, will probably quiet down overnight. No shade, but big rig accessible. &#xA;Not a lot of high grown greenery for privacy around, but if you’re alone it’s perfect. &#xA;4 bars of LTE (Rogers).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240438 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
