 <wpt lat="50.284292" lon="-65.509111">
  <ele>6.650101036540377</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paradise with traffic noise</name>
  <desc>Several well leveled spots on a beautiful sandy beach. You can hide behind some trees from the road. Fire pits and direct beach access.&#xA;The road is close by, so if you are sensitive to road noise pass by. At night quiet.&#xA;4x4 recommended because of some deep sand spots.&#xA;No cell phone.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240585 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
