  <desc>Wonderful spot adjacent to the Age of Sail museum in Port Greville Nova Scotia. Bathrooms open all night. Big rigs allowed. Permitted camping.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
