  <ele>32.62959927599877</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Christy’s Look-Off Ceilidh Coastal Trail</name>
  <desc>It’s a free lookout with a small roundabout, scenic view, camping table, no toilets, entrance to the trans Canadian trail. There is no any signs saying “no camping or overnight stay”. I’ve stayed in the night and till noon next day. There are curious locals come to meet strangers, they say you can stay for a night here. It was nice.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240611 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
