  <desc>On Google map there is no Laundry room. This place is small but open. $3 for each wash and dry. Machine in good condition, relatively new.&#xA;&#xA;Sur Google map il n&#39;y a pas de Buanderie.   Cette endroit est petit mais ouvert.  3$ pour chaque lavage et sechage.  Machine en bon état relativement neuve.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
