  <name>Tagish River Pullout</name>
  <desc>A small dirt pullout in the trees that looks out onto the Tagish River. We didn&#39;t spend the night here, but cooked some lunch here. I think any smaller van or suv sized vehicle could park here. Not suitable to larger sized RVs. No toilets or garbage bins. Carry out what you bring in as there is already some litter laying around. Good cell reception with Rogers and Koodoo. Access to the river down a steep bank.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240718 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
