  <desc>There is a faucet / spigot outside that is high enough to fill tall water totes (ie 7 gallon).  Push the green button and open faucet to get water.  I did not use a hose, but you may be able to hook one up.  Also a drinking fountain nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
