  <ele>47.60975847648773</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Brauwerk Hoffman</name>
  <desc>Brauwerk Hoffmann is a German brewery founded by the Hoffmann family in Campbell‘s Bay, Quebec, Canada&#xA;The brewery offers beer as well as German dishes with ingredients from their own garden.&#xA;Overnight accommodation on the premises is free after visiting the brewery.&#xA;The season runs from the beginning of May to the end of August and overnight stays are possible during this period.&#xA;We had a very nice conversation with Mr Hoffmann.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240878 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
