 <wpt lat="52.848203" lon="-119.223712">
  <ele>1510.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>My McKirdy lookout and trailheads</name>
  <desc>The end of Five Mile Road, there is an area with great views of the valley, an outhouse, and a picnic table. Many downhill biking trails start here as well as trails up the mountain.&#xA;&#xA;I had a quiet night to myself, with only the distant trains passing through town making any noise.&#xA;&#xA;There is no garbage so pack yours out. The gravel road is doable in a sedan, but isn&#39;t suitable for anything larger than a Sprinter.&#xA;&#xA;Cell signal is medium, but the internet cuts out from time to time for a few seconds.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240900 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
