  <name>Rue Saint Gregorie - Street Parking</name>
  <desc>One section of this road only has parking restrictions between 8 &amp; 9.30 Monday to Friday. It&#39;s near the corner of Mentana St and Rue Saint Gregorie. Maybe space for 5 cars, 3 spaces remaining when we arrived on Friday. Bathrooms open in Sir Wilfred Laurier Parc which is maybe 5 minutes away (they also have wifi). Bit of noise as there is constant traffic but fine for a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/240952 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
