  <name>Pull out beside Nicola Lake</name>
  <desc>Multiple large pull outs along the lake next to the rest area. Plenty of room for large Motorhomes. We were on our own for the night. No signs saying no camping, only not to litter or dump. Beautiful view of the lake. Road seems to be used by locals and lots of truck drivers. Noisey but quieter overnight. Multiple spots along the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241013 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
