 <wpt lat="63.990255" lon="-135.383420">
  <ele>673.1154980979327</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hansen lake</name>
  <desc>Super quiet spot by the lake. Access is through a boat launch, water is crystal clear. Ducks and other birds. Firepit, some benches. Take trash out. 2-3 bars LTE on Telus. Ground may need some levelling but rocks around&#xA;&#xA;Access is a bit bumpy and narrow but we did it with gmc safari. Would not recommend rvs or trailers as some turns are tight &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241015 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
