 <wpt lat="46.738993" lon="-53.238269">
  <ele>64.3802490234375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel lot near Mistaken Point</name>
  <desc>A large gravel lot on the west side of Southern Shore Highway 10, 3.5 km north of Information Center Mistaken Point Ecological Reserve.  There are some pot holes, but one can easily find a level spot.  Good cell signal and very quiet.&#xA;&#xA;We were on our way to Mistaken Point.  It was getting late and the fog was quite dense.  We slowed down and tried to find a safe pullout.  Luckily, we spot this large lot ont the right side of the road and found a level spot far from the road.  We felt safe to stay here for the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241032 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
