  <name>parc St-Laurent </name>
  <desc>In Repentigny, QC, informal car camping, VR, or van.  You have to be totally autonomous, wc next to parking, very clean  (see pics). Parking area reserved specifically for overnight.  Garbage &amp; recycling right on location.  Possibility of boat rides to tour the neighbouring islands or cross the St-Lawrence River&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241040 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
