  <desc>Gravel parking area with concrete pad where a garage previously existed. Semi level. Parking is right at the stoney beach. Fog horn sounds during daylight and early evening hours if foggy, stops late at night after dark. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241046 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
