  <ele>682.583251953125</ele>
  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>pull out with a cow chute</name>
  <desc>just a dirt pull out on chute lake road. there is a cattlr chute for the local land owner. nothing special, but was a nice quiet place to sleep. a sign that just states to pick up garbage and glass because its hard on cattle. keep the place clean and it seems like it&#39;ll stay available to those wondering. 1 bar 4G on verizon.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241099 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
