  <ele>21.433144865944662</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Where the River Bends</name>
  <desc>Follow the Old Rocky Brook Rd till the Cul-de-Sac. Crossover Tru the little mud hole to the side of the Brook and there&#39;s the Spot. fits 2 or 3 overland set-up no big rigs or RV&#39;s it&#39;s a little tight to pass. Had a beautiful night next to the Brook. Pretty nice spot to have a dip in the water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
