  <ele>981.0755615234375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Road to Phoenix Ski Lodge</name>
  <desc>We found a nice sleepover spot while traveling on hiway 3 in BC Canada. It is just a few hundred feet off the hiway. it appears to be a part of the old road system, old asphalt, yellow line still visible deadend with trees growing in it. Nice and flat, clean. No trun around, so no good for  big rigs. Room for several vehicles. Close to freeway so a bit noisy. worked out perfectly for us. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241143 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
