  <name>Arrowvale Campground</name>
  <desc>A campgroud located next to a farm. The owners of the farm run this place and are very sweet! &#34;I will always get you a spot&#34; Next to a river for a walk or a swim. In the morning you can go for a tour on the farm and cuddle goats! Awesome spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241160 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
