  <ele>178.6</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Forest road with clearing</name>
  <desc>Unmarked road off hwy 17 to the south. Great wide place with room for campers or tents. about 200 m off the hwy. Mosquitoes-yes, but still a great place for the night. We drove with our SUV and a small trailer. no need for high clearance although the road is overgrown with tall grass. Please keep it clean wherever you stop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241189 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
