  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Whispering Spruce Campground</name>
  <desc>Privately operated campground, hence rather expensive; we paid 55.65$ for a classic RV site (includes 30-Amp, Electricity, Fire Pit, Picnic Table, Water Hook-Up, Wi-Fi, Showers, Toilets); right next to the Hwy in Golden; laundromat available (4$ / washer &amp; 3$ / dryer); can easily be booked over website&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241221 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
