 <wpt lat="50.586111" lon="-126.922562">
  <ele>69.21482496522367</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alert Bay Campground</name>
  <desc>Campground operated by Village of Alert Bay. About 20 campsites with half along trees and half in open. Book campsite at letscamp.ca or call campground host Tim at 250-974-3744 (as of Sept 2023). Washroom house with sinks, flush toilets, hot showers ($1 per about 2 min - bring loonies as no change on site. Washer dryer too. Good for tents, vans, smaller trailers but a few bigger sites under construction. Water spigot and power at some sites. A bit ragged around the edges but nice enough and felt safe. We paid $10/night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241224 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
