 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="51.462320" lon="-112.708449">
  <ele>678.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free parking area - Drumheller </name>
  <desc>There are a few of these free parking areas in town. Some say no RVs. I chose this one because it&#39;s was the biggest, there was another RV last night, there is open wifi from the taproom across the street, and it is well lit. This is my second night (stayed sunday and now monday nights) here, and it has not been an issue. Since there are bars and a liquor store across the street, I dont know how the weekend would be here. But the week nights have been ok. It is within walking distance of a lot of things to see/do, and you can leave your rig here during the day, which is a huge plus. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
