 <wpt lat="46.730887" lon="-71.276361">
  <ele>37.560835684649646</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Home Depot Levis</name>
  <desc>We are in a car. Go inside and asked for permission to stay for one night. He said ok. Not sure for RV. No no-overnight sign posted. Road noises in the morning, quiet night. Strong guest wifi. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241263 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
