  <ele>695.7535057067871</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hwy 97.  Gravel Pit </name>
  <desc>Just off the road about 100 meters. We used this pit a couple years ago. And again 09/11/23. &#xA;It has a bit more garbage about but it is a large area that could accommodate about 6 big rigs &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241287 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
