 <wpt lat="44.659499" lon="-63.627311">
  <ele>1.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Good Life Fitness</name>
  <desc>&#34;Good Life Fitness&#34; Thought I&#39;d try. Asked &#34;If a traveler could grab a shower&#34; there. They looked at me like I had 2 horns on my head. They went to check, came back, gave me a towel, I offered to pay. It was free. Shampoo and soap in the shower. Bring your own lock. Not sure if they will keep doing this..... But Try!!! Picture and location taken in the back. Go in the front.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241291 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Showers</type>
