  <ele>181.36737060546875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>the lions linear trail park</name>
  <desc>MODERATOR NOTE: Municipal parkinglot - 2 hours between 8AM and 9PM only!&#xA;&#xA;beautiful back parking overnight spot no signs to not sleep. came here with 27 foot camper and Ford f150. walked around gorgeous spot dog on leash friendly and it&#39;s quite but right in town.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241299 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
