 <wpt lat="49.734850" lon="-84.308550">
  <ele>282.81479359511286</ele>
  <time>2024-04-30 20:32:33 UTC</time>
  <name>Rabbit Lake</name>
  <desc>Took a left off hwy 11 at unmarked road but appeared to go into gravel pit.  Pit to left via gated road and very large level, gravelled area to the right for private off the road camping.  If you continue down road, sign about crown land camping and limits, pass that and drive 3/4 mile further to beautiful small aquamarine lake, fire pit, older boat launch.  Awesome find.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-30 20:32:33 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241337 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
