 <wpt lat="50.005345" lon="-114.087158">
  <ele>1626.771484375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Porcupine Hills Ridge View East</name>
  <desc>Beautiful spot in the trees with stunning views. Road in was in good condition, no issues with a van. 5g cell service on Rogers. Campsite is not flat. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241362 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
