 <wpt lat="49.188291" lon="-57.424578">
  <ele>18.658057725057006</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving Big Stop</name>
  <desc>Large car and truck park. Near the marker there are a few spaces at the edge of the lot, it’s nice that they’re away from the big park so you can have some privacy and you don’t block the trucks. Also nice to have the showers in the gas station, which I didn’t had to pay for even though I didn’t fill up on gas. &#xA;The Wi-Fi is really great and reaches the entire lot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
