  <ele>11.413959626108408</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Georgetown - The Great trail parking</name>
  <desc>Parking paved and grass in front of kids playground. 150 meters from toilets and free showers. No signs of no overnight parking. Close to restaurant bar and art galeries.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241469 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
