  <ele>718.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel pit with beautifull view on the mountains. Keep right by the gate for the gravel pit. The road is going on. We didn&#39;t check where this gravel road is going to.  </name>
  <desc>Just a half mile off the road. Place for 2 big trucks. Turnaround no problem. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241485 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
