 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="45.676436" lon="-62.704233">
  <ele>24.75946044921875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pictou. Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Very large AND CLEAN parking lot next to a baseball field. Waterfront protected by a fence. Peaceful and quiet at night. No sign prohibiting sleeping there. Only a green parking sign. Slept here one night without any disturbance whatsoever.&#xA;&#xA;Please don&#39;t litter and pick up garbage if you see some. Before leaving, move forward your vehicle a bit and make sure you don&#39;t leave anything behind.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
