  <desc>A couple of good sites and a great lake. Picnic tables, fire pits, pit toilet and a boat ramp. Free&#xA;This is the north site. Make sure you have a look at the south site. It’s as good as it gets&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241642 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
