 <wpt lat="50.575710" lon="-111.895942">
  <ele>762.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Big Loads Laundromat</name>
  <desc>3 sizes of washers, with different amounts for cold-hot. Currently, the hot small is $5, the medium is $7, and the large is $9. I put a big load, blanket, and towel in medium and had some room still. The driers are $ 1.25 every 10 minutes. Everything looks new and clean. No broken machines. Open 24 hrs. Free wifi but no bathroom. There is a soap vending machine, but there is no cash machine. There is no need for cash since these run off of card or phone tap pay. You can drop off laundry, it says, but I did not use that. There is a park across the street to walk your dog.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241652 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
