  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Right Choice Auto Centre</name>
  <desc>This guy saved our trip! The gearbox of our Iveco broke down and Trevor was the only one in town willing to work on it. He did an amazing job and we were able to finish our trip to Alaska. We had to ship parts from Brazil and in the meantime they allowed us to stay in the van parked next to the shop. The whole team was great. Can&#39;t thank them enough.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/241801 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
