  <name>Public beach parking </name>
  <desc>Small spot, near the road, has a pit toilet too in the summer for the beach user.  no no-overnight signs&#xA;&#xA;There are two street light near, good light on the site! &#xA;&#xA;It’s okay for a van 20-25’ but I don’t recommend for bigger &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242090 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
