  <desc>beautiful on the lake park picnic area with garbage bins, porta potties, picnic tables swimming hiking sitting and enjoying the sunset or fish. huge Roof with picnic tables. no signs say no parking or over night camping. lots of tourist going through here&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242095 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
