  <desc>An pretty big laundromat. Clean and many different machine. Price quite reasonable. Big machine is 8$. than $5, and $3 for small one. Drying is 25¢ for 3min. Have a sink on each side to hand wash clothes. There is a washroom but not accessible.&#xA; There are also free parkings which is nice. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242147 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
