  <ele>145.77105712890625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near Margaree Centre</name>
  <desc>A decent sized pullout off a dirt road. A gentle slope, fairly even surface. Room for a few 4Runners with RTT. Quiet. I heard coyotes at 5:15 a.m. I had cell reception and could use the internet (Verizon).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242198 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
