  <ele>168.1968994140625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>gravel area near Pasadena, Newfoundland</name>
  <desc>This pullout is off a gravel road, which is in fairly good condition and wide. Ditto for this pullout. Pretty level. A bar or two for Verizon. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242199 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
