 <wpt lat="48.708410" lon="-54.385435">
  <ele>102.85870361328125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>North Pond</name>
  <desc>A beautiful, quiet site just off a gravel road. On a Saturday night in mid-August, I had it to myself. Only 2 vehicles went by on the gravel road but before around 9:00 p.m. and nothing til a truck passed at about 7:00 a.m. Nice pond view. Fairly level. Room for multiple vehicles and bigger rigs. No cell reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242200 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
