 <wpt lat="47.802534" lon="-53.193252">
  <ele>130.330078125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Middle Pond</name>
  <desc>The road here is narrow. I have a 4Runner with a rooftop tent. I recommend using a vehicle with a small footprint. Probably nothing bigger than a full-size pickup. No cell service; you will have to settle for listening to loons. I had this place to myself!&#xA;Photo of the pond from my rooftop tent.&#xA;The surface might be a bit rough and uneven for a ground tent. A fire ring is here.&#xA;Along the way, there are a few small pullouts.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242201 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
