  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cheyenne Campground/ Parc Cartier </name>
  <desc>Nice municipal campground with a few 2-services sites. Many new amenities, including free showers. Dump available.&#xA;15$ no service&#xA;25$ 15 amp with water&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242235 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
