  <name>Newman Sound Entrance Laundry Washroom Wifi Store </name>
  <desc>Building at entrance with laundry, washrooms and Wi-Fi. Also has a seasonal store for provisions that also looks to sell propane. 2.50 per use of washer or dryer. Only takes 2 loonies and 2 quarters. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
