  <ele>1159.345947265625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Loon lake road FSR turn off.</name>
  <desc>Roadside at a FSR turn off. large open area with a fire circle that someone has created. No trouble parking my class A and Toad.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242256 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
