 <wpt lat="60.174585" lon="-132.766298">
  <ele>692.903369750972</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Teslin Lake Viewpoint</name>
  <desc>Just before Teslin. Pit toilets and nice view of the lake. There’s one sign that, as of today, was blank. Nothing posted where it may be meant to say, no overnight parking. Since there’s nothing posted as of today, I stayed and had no issues. Roadside but quiet after 10.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242258 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
