  <ele>1185.731689453125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Ghost River</name>
  <desc>Great spot by the ghost river. There is another site with a fire pit just 50m from this one. Enterance is through a gate so it looks like you are on a private property but there is a turn on the left side just 100m from the main enterance. Good quite spot by the river. SUV or Truck needed. There is also an old boat launch here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242259 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
