  <name>High creek side</name>
  <desc>The fsr road on the uphill side of the first run away lane. A few wider pull out sections of the fsr good for overnights. The second one in has less road noise thx to the creek. Smooth gravel 2wd ok! Some mosquitos, road seems not used much, goes far so maybe other options.. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242300 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
