  <ele>71.437255859375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>By the river</name>
  <desc>Parked 20 foot C class. Along the river. Lots of parking (wont have any issues finding a spot). Can easily get bigger rigs in here. . Not alot of road noise after 10pm. From 9pm-10:30pm had 3 locals drive through as it looks to be a hang out area. If you drive your rig right to the river and go south along the river, there will be less road noise. (Walk the area before attempting)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242344 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
