  <ele>223.6</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chemin Ellmitt </name>
  <desc>Small clearing in the woods for parking vehicles and tents, no stream, just for spending a night in the forest. The forest rangers came by the next morning to ask if we were hunting, otherwise no problem to spend the night. It takes 5 to 10 minutes on the track to get there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242386 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
