  <ele>39.33978271484375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel road by river</name>
  <desc>Access road from the south on Dyke rd. about 400m in, the road gets larger, room for 1 or 2 vehicles on the left. Don&#39;t go further or you&#39;ll have to back up, no place to turn around further. Not good for big rigs or trailers, but a class B can turn around.&#xA;Locals use this place, make sure you leave enough room for them to be able to turn around.&#xA;No garbage, leave no trace.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242399 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
