  <ele>285.717088743113</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beautiful spot!!!</name>
  <desc>Beautiful, flat spot next to a lake, not far off the highway up a slight ramp. There is a long dirt road next to the lake but we backed up not knowing if there was a turnaround ahead. A great place to walk your pup. Not a lot of traffic noise at night. Just a beautiful spot by a pretty lake. Ok for Starlink. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242405 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
