  <ele>1111.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Equestrian Campground</name>
  <desc>20 CAN per night. Used mainly for people with horses, but it is not a requirement. There are trashcans and pit toilet restrooms. Each spot has a picnic table and grill. Full cell service here. Adding photos. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242449 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
