  <ele>803.8938791314224</ele>
  <time>2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Lake</name>
  <desc>pull off at the northern tip crown lake on the east side of the road. large enough for a couple of vans or moderate size motorhomes. it&#39;s right on the road, so it can be loud, however this is an area with very few options and this is a very good one. The traffic noise is actually pretty low through the night as it&#39;s not a very busy road until daytime.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242458 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
