  <desc>This is where you need to go to fill water tanks, big jugs, etc because you can pull up right next to the spigot. There&#39;s also sani-dump with non-potable water right next so make sure you use the correct spigot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242488 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
