  <ele>662.4608154296875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>72 hr roadside parking lot</name>
  <desc>Pull-off beside highway with 72 hour parking. Big rigs will fit. Across from grocery &amp; liquor store. Nice town with good services.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242490 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
