  <ele>695.360107421875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Edgerton Day Campground </name>
  <desc>Approx 20 sites - most are huge and well treed. All sites have power. Clean pit toilets. Picnic shelter. Trash bin. $25.00 non-power, $30.00 with power.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242491 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
