  <desc>Dryden does not allow overnight parking in the city limits however if you are a van or car, you are allowed to park at this 24 hour truck stop. It isn&#39;t pretty and is a busy truck stop but fine in a pinch. I have a van and backed into car parkIng parallel to the highway off to the side of the Husky House Restaurant where I am not blocking trucker spots. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
