  <desc>Trailhead parking for Wedge Mountain trailhead. Couple of big parking lots and pit toilet (byotp) at start of trail up to Wedge Lake Trail (6.8 km). Usually a number of cars for people who are camping in the back country. Not completely flat but ok, you could park by water tower to get more flat ground. &#xA;&#xA;Road up (2km) a little wash boardy but doable with 2 wd vehicles. Yo&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242617 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
