  <ele>15.8775634765625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Behind Convenience Store</name>
  <desc>A gravel parking space behind the convenience store. It is a large space next to the water.  I asked the waitress at the brew pub for a place to park and she suggested this spot. It was windy, but no travel noise. The lot was totally empty. We stayed in shoulder season so not sure how it would go in the middle of summer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242667 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
