  <desc>Nice and quiet street with no sign. It is a short street outside of townhouses with no through traffic.There were supposed to have construction at the end of the street but I couldn&#39;t hear anything that morning when I woke up. I parked overnight here for one night, super quiet.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242716 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
