  <ele>-1.161865234375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Vedder river campground</name>
  <desc>side by side sites. no privacy. full hook ups available. washrooms and dump station. quite when we were here. walking trails along the Fraser River.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242776 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
