 <wpt lat="43.092593" lon="-82.127351">
  <ele>185.175273232162</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Paradise Valley Camping</name>
  <desc>Large well laid out campground for anything from tents to fully serviced pull through sites for big rigs. Lots of amenities for kids including pool and several play areas. I travel with a class B rig and a fully serviced site including water, power, and sewer was $54 per night including taxes. Each site comes with a fire pit and new picnic table. Convenient location if you are exploring the Oil Springs/Petrolia area. Web booking was straightforward. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242868 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
