 <wpt lat="62.089724" lon="-136.282852">
  <ele>557.35400390625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Carmacks Hotel Laundromat/WC/Showers</name>
  <desc>Very nice and hot showers, friendly staff who offered us to use hotel&#39;s showers, just ask inside. &#xA;You&#39;ll need loonies, it&#39;s 2$ for 3 minutes, and 1$/min after&#xA;If you use 2$ 3 times, you can have a 9 minutes shower for 6$ ;) &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242884 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
