 <wpt lat="44.376252" lon="-64.324675">
  <ele>-12.76155925821513</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lunenburg Tim Hortons</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at Tim Hortons in Lunenburg. &#xA;There are no signs saying that you can&#39;t stay the night. Staff in restaurant say that it is okay to park here overnight. &#xA;Irving gas station is right next door for anyone needing the bathroom in the middle of the night (Tom Hortons closes interior at 10pm). &#xA;Possibility of big rigs parking in gravel lot behind Irving gas station, but not sure.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242891 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
