  <ele>1119.6972426120192</ele>
  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hogg Park</name>
  <desc>Nice campground near a river. Clean. 30$ via https://campreservations.ca&#xA;No cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242901 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
