 <wpt lat="53.763846" lon="-122.651983">
  <ele>656.5475539034232</ele>
  <time>2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>MamaYeh RV Park &amp; Campground </name>
  <desc>A beautiful Provincial Park-like, big rigs friendly, self contained, private RV Park is nestled in 145 acres forest setting!&#xA;&#xA;Eleven 100 feet long Pull-Through sites with 50/30 Amp Power, Water &amp; Sewer and thirteen large back-In sites with 30/20 Amp Power, Water &amp; Sewer.&#xA;&#xA;Each site is separated by extra large green buffers, very shady and best privacy!&#xA;&#xA;StarLink Satellite Internet is ready and available in park now!&#xA;&#xA;Very easy access to Highway 97 South and only 15-20 minutes drive to Prince George city center!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242911 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
