 <wpt lat="45.513679" lon="-75.403045">
  <ele>39.17388916015625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wilfred Murray Park</name>
  <desc>Kids campground with sections of grass where it is possible to pitch a tent. There are trees that provide shade and some tables. There is also a pit toilet. Big parking lot with no signs of &#34;no overnight stay&#34; or camping. I was bothered by the kids in the morning but that&#39;s it. Nice place if you&#39;re desperately looking for a spot to stay at night (like I was, since I could not check in a caravan park nearby).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242929 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
