  <ele>668.6</ele>
  <time>2023-10-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street Parking in Industrial Area</name>
  <desc>We parked up in our van on the street next to some big office buildings, right beside a park. &#xA;&#xA;No one bothered us. There are restaurants nearby. A solid place to spend the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242936 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
