  <time>2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bishop&#39;s Park</name>
  <desc>Nice view of the cove and sunset. Small place for 1 or 2 vans. Picnic tables. Even with cars passing by, the night was very quiet. No sign saying &#34;no overnight camping&#34;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242972 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
