  <ele>149.718</ele>
  <time>2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Golden Virgo field</name>
  <desc>It is an abandonned hay field on the side People driving by did not notice my presence even if I was only 15 feet in the entrance.  There is a apple tree that produce dwarf apple.  Enter the side where the road change to paved to gravel road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/242984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
