 <wpt lat="50.082708" lon="-123.057757">
  <ele>615.7412992464378</ele>
  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Train Wreck Pull Off</name>
  <desc>I hiked down to the train wreck using the mountain bike trail. It was getting late and I was looking for somewhere to stay. Since there were no signs posted I just stayed here. It’s a large lot and to the left you can pull behind the trees to be semi-blocked from the road. Decent Verizon service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243010 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
