 <wpt lat="53.267349" lon="-113.569303">
  <ele>728.7134284917265</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart Leduc</name>
  <desc>A Classic Walmart parking. &#xA;Very noisy because next to the main road (with a lot of dude from « fast and furious » movie…) and under a air traffic lane. &#xA;There are signs who said « 24hr parking », We stayed one night with no issue, We were 2 cars and 3 campers/RV. &#xA;If you are close to the canadian tire you can use the WIFI. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243012 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
