 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="46.821660" lon="-71.407900">
  <ele>85.72280502319336</ele>
  <time>2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping in Quebec City</name>
  <desc>This established campground wasn’t on the app so I decided to check it out. An unserviced tent site costs 34,49$, they only have 6 of those. &#xA;This is mostly a campground for long term / permanent campers, the washrooms are okay, but quite far away from the tent sites, but there is a toilet next the tent sites, which is pretty bad with broken pieces from a shattered mirror on the ground. Generally the place looks like no one really looks after it / takes care of it (overflowing trash bins, unclean washrooms, etc.). There are water outlets next to the tent sites and they have a pool. &#xA;Their WiFi didn’t reach all the way to my site (I had the last one of the 6), but at the entrance it was good. &#xA;Also there is no privacy between the tent sites, I would stick to the other campgrounds in Quebec. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243017 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
