 <wpt lat="46.813033" lon="-64.068196">
  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 22:06:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Alberton Library</name>
  <desc>Local Library. Old train station. Direct access to the Confederation Trail. Washrooms inside when opened. See photo for open hours. Air pump ans tools available inside. Welcomed to stay  overnight.  Outside water tab available when library opened. Irving gas station nearby for toilets. Grocery store across Irving. Saunders Variety great choices of clothing and shoes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 22:06:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243023 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
