  <ele>348.0924949645996</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Grand emplacement </name>
  <desc>Nice large place not far from the road. Quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243025 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
