 <wpt lat="50.611990" lon="-105.445430">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shady Lane Campground</name>
  <desc>Shady Lane is one of many campgrounds within Buffalo Pound Provincial Park. Site was just next to the river, with trees and ok space. Showers and flush toilets available.&#xA;Site #32 electrical only for 33$/night.&#xA;There is a park entry of 11$/day.&#xA;Had 5$ discount due to camping in September.&#xA;We had reception, although it seems like reception is not provided throughout the park.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243066 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
