  <desc>24h truck stop with a single shower.  Shower is cheap and clean, but tiny.&#xA;&#xA;Also a decent restaurant onsite.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243105 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
