 <wpt lat="47.161178" lon="-79.736180">
  <ele>312.2534303786233</ele>
  <time>2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Granite Lake Highway Camp</name>
  <desc>A quaint little camp site just off the highway 11. Lots of noise from the traffic but it is secluded from the highway. Nice view of the lake with enough room to park 2-3 trucks. Would be difficult to turn a large trailer around in this site. Some dead trees linger over the entrance and would be advised to pay attention at the overhanging trees.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243196 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
