  <name>HWY37 Pinetree Lake South</name>
  <desc>Wonderful spots on the river that provides space for 4-6 also larger vehicles But only 1 or 2 with direct river view. Entry right after a litter box pullout heading south.&#xA;Area seems to be used also by locals for fishing &amp; hunting and there are already 3 stone fire rings. &#xA;About 70-100m off the HWY and quietas there’s limited traffic. No network at all, like most of HWY 37&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243238 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
