  <desc>Legal and referred by the mountain as the place to overnight for free. Right at the base of the chairlift for downhill mountain biking&#xA;Gravel parking, very quiet after the last chair&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/243986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
