  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canadian Carburator Co Ltd</name>
  <desc>Darcy is one of only two in Canada who does carburetor rebuilds. My van is custom and we couldn&#39;t find a rebuilt kit for it Darcy took matters in hand. He is the recommended one by all local part distributors.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244011 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
