 <wpt lat="45.600326" lon="-75.065857">
  <ele>17.29803466796875</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping du parc de Plaisance</name>
  <desc>Campsite in the Sépaq-parc de Plaisance. Different offers of services etc. (check Website!)&#xA;Without any service prices &lt;40 CAD. If you don&#39;t have a Sépaq annual pass, you will also have to pay the parcs entry fees.&#xA;You can book online and go directly to your booked place, no checkin needed, no worries about closing times.&#xA;No WiFi, but 4G is fast here.&#xA;Stayed here for one night on our way to Ottawa.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244021 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
