 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="51.200333" lon="-113.991818">
  <ele>1081.3496538875625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel parking next to Cross Iron Mills </name>
  <desc>Big gravel parking between the two malls.&#xA;We looked for a spot in the parking « cross iron mall », but there sign everywhere saying « unothorized vehicle will be towed… »so i was a little bit insecure. &#xA;We saw Many trailers and RV on this side parallel parking, one of them seemed to be here since a long time (flat tires and on blocks). It’s not a glamourous spot, it just a spot to help for one night, but oddly very quiet when night is here and mall is closed. Just Many planes go on our head, but nothing after 11pm.  &#xA;Easy access to the mall for toilet, restaurants and shopping. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244036 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
