  <ele>1050.9222936509177</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Above Monroe Lake</name>
  <desc>Clearing off a Forrest service road, fairly flat, fire ring, quiet, no lake views.&#xA;To access, take Monroe lake road, then turn right on the road right after the dump road. Follow almost all the way up&#xA;High clearance vehicles preferably &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244054 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
