  <ele>1047.4</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Claresholm Aquatic Centre</name>
  <desc>3cad$ shower per person. We called them mentioning that we were traveling in our van and they told us that showers were available for 3$. Everything was clean and enjoyable. Hot showers, private for women and common for men. lockers, restrooms... &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244059 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
