 <wpt lat="46.247815" lon="-63.116551">
  <ele>8.387244921177626</ele>
  <time>2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Horse Racing &amp; Casino Parking</name>
  <desc>large parking. Quite level. We asked permission in Casino to boondock and they told us to park towards the horse barns at opposite end of lot fr Casino. The parking was ful during horseraces but emptied out after.  There was late night and early morning activity at the barns but we enjoyed watching the horses be exercised so any noise wasnt an issue.  The casino has a nice restaurant and we really enjoyed the races. All the locals were very welcoming and taught us how to bet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244108 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
