  <ele>744.5654161739068</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tumbler Ridge swimming pool </name>
  <desc>Small but well-equipped pool in town for just $4.50 pp, which includes a sauna, steam room, hot tub and hot private showers. Very friendly staff and clean amenities. Great stop after an autumn hike in the Geopark. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244111 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
