  <desc>Free water fountain and washrooms during the day. 9-9 during tourist season, 9-5 off peak season. Staffed visitor center &amp; RCMP station&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244155 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
