  <time>2023-12-11 15:33:46 UTC</time>
  <name>No. 7 Road pier Park</name>
  <desc>20 km from Downtown Vancouver a little parking place next to an Indusrial area. During the day buisy but at night very quiet facing the Fraser River. Suitable for max 1 or 2 campervans up to 20 ft as locals using this place also. No „no overnight“ signs. Garbage cans are also available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-11 15:33:46 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
