  <ele>173.92615971289234</ele>
  <time>2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lynn Canyon</name>
  <desc>Street parking next to a trail that goes to Lynn Canyon Suspension Bridge. 3hr parking 8am-6pm. Good for a quick night after hiking to the bridge. Some noise as there is a bus going by once in a while. Quiet at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244174 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
