  <ele>18.9268787154909</ele>
  <time>2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>crown land!</name>
  <desc>found this nice little parking lot on a dirt road. you can&#39;t get to it from the closest highway, but it is a pretty flat spot to throw a tent or park for the night. I was here on a Saturday morning and it was pretty busy in the morning.the area was  quiet for the night though.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244206 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
