 <wpt lat="44.350362" lon="-79.180971">
  <ele>211.20733642578125</ele>
  <time>2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Summerbreeze</name>
  <desc>This place is a beautiful little park, surrounded by nice nature, that is well kept by the owners. It&#39;s open from May long weekend to Thanksgiving weekend. There&#39;s a pool, kids&#39; playground, and public washrooms with showers. No laundrymat, but there&#39;s a nice one very close by, which is also posted on IOverlander. Tenting sites and 30amps hook up for trailers. Reasonable rates. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244222 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
