  <ele>4.405378745868802</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wharf and Boat yard beside FireFeast Chef Michael Smith&#39;s Restaurant</name>
  <desc>We stayed on Wharf after dining on Fire Feast at Chef Michael Smiths restaurant about .5km from Inn. The wharf is paved and as is outside Fishing season not busy.  We met a local man who was fishing with his rod on the wharf who told us we were fine staying here. It is a very pretty little marina. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244256 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
