  <ele>14.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc Charlie-O&#39;Brien</name>
  <desc>Municipal playground. NO signs of no overnight parking.Many facilities for kids. Flushed toilets. Non-potable water. Garage and recyclind containers. Dogs on leash in a restricted zone. Be discret park at the farthest end.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244270 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
