 <wpt lat="46.798581" lon="-83.746375">
  <ele>320.455322265625</ele>
  <time>2023-09-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Garden River Bridge</name>
  <desc>The road is right beside the Bridge. An established spot with a fire ring is just a 100 or so meters on the left. Room for a couple vehicles and tents.  Turn around at end of road  leading to gate and private camp.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244298 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
