  <ele>174.8348388671875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>parc des deux rivières </name>
  <desc>Parking in a pretty park with walking paths, playground, picnic table in the park. toilets and trash cans available. no prohibition signs. confirmation of the municipality it&#39;s ok.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244365 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
