  <ele>1062.834638661705</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Silver Lake Rec Site</name>
  <desc>Lovely little Rec site by a lake. FREE, 6 sites, tables, pit toilet and man made fire rings. One side of the lake has private cabins.&#xA;I imagine it’s quite busy in the summer&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244366 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
