  <desc>Public parking at the port of Miscou. No service, allowed to spend the night there. A bit of coming and going from fishermen, but quiet enough to sleep.&#xA;&#xA;stationnement public du port de Miscou. aucun service, permis d&#39;y passer la nuit. un peu de vas et viens des pêcheurs mais assez tranquille pour dormir.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244487 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
