  <ele>884.9216518998302</ele>
  <time>2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rest area swan lake</name>
  <desc>rest area, bathrooms, only bins, beautiful view on the mountains, ok leveled, no mention of overnight camping being prohibited. it&#39;s right by the side of the road but decently sized for a few vehicles. did a pretty solid job when catching z&#39;s was necessary.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244545 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
