  <time>2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bay of Rivière St-Paul</name>
  <desc>Great place to spend the night - beautiful view of the bay of Saint Paul and the whole surrounding. &#xA;Plenty of parking for rigs all sizes.&#xA;Entrance is a bit steep for big rvs.&#xA;Parking is made of big gravel.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
