  <desc>Backroad right off the highway lookout rd I believe it’s called, big enough area to turn a trailer around. Road is paved rough but paved. Short walk right to the bottom of the dam, also good fishing down there &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244612 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
