  <name>West Saint Peters Beach </name>
  <desc>Sandy seaside place. Great dunes, great beach. In my opinion a bit too close to the village, too close to private properties. Nobody bothered us. If you&#39;re early enough, you should look for something else.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244620 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
