  <name>Kinsmen Sportsplex</name>
  <desc>UPDATE : 8,50$ to cover the pool access&#xA;&#xA;Large rec centre with free showers. See staff at the desk (on left-hand side shortly after entering the centre) and ask for admission for a shower - no charge, they’ll just record your name &amp; phone number. They have a family shower locker room with at least 4 private shower/change rooms. Hot water, great pressure, push button but each push lasts at least 45 seconds. Please clean up after yourself so accessible facilities like this stay free &amp; open for all! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
