 <wpt lat="45.980963" lon="-81.925606">
  <ele>180.79702426493168</ele>
  <time>2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Current Public Docks</name>
  <desc>On the waterfront in Little Current, flat 24-hour parking spots (posted signs confirm) next to the PO/Municipal Building. I went into the building and asked just to reconfirm, then asked again to make certain that ALL spots are 24-hours, not just “angled” spots as the sign says (with the exception of two spots, which are posted as such). Water/harbor view, EV chargers, boardwalk with benches and garbage/recycling cans, and public bathroom that even had a shower with hot water! Stores nearby. Loco Beanz for coffee in the morning. Maybe even a water source near marina. Good for car or van - not big rigs. A happy and comfortable find. Friendly people - please be respectful of this gem of a spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244831 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
