  <desc>New campground june 2023. Very nice spot!! Owners are welcolming and the place is cool. The sanitary bloc is clean and beautiful. 3 places for tents, 5 for van. 3 types of cabin with differents settings. A commun spot to chill : outdoor cinema, bbq, bar and spa. Dogs are welcome with a dog’s park. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244906 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
