  <desc>Showers are $3.50. Go in the front entrance, straight all the way down the stairs, and ask at reception. Very friendly staff. Private showers are in the universal changeroom (the yellow one between the men and women&#39;s.) No private stalls in the other changerooms. Hot water and no time limit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/244945 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
