  <ele>257.327541410923</ele>
  <time>2023-10-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside + Dock</name>
  <desc>I kept down the road from the other scenic lake lookout spot as I could see another lake nearby - this spot takes you down right to the lake. &#xA;&#xA;There’s a boat launch &amp; dock, but the CLUPA states this land is General Use Area. &#xA;&#xA;Quite large gravel spot at the end of the road, largely unlevel but if you park nearest to the lake (or move after sundown into the boat launch strip) it’s good enough for sleeping. &#xA;&#xA;At present there’s a pickup with boat trailer, and a Subaru parked here - no one else was around last night or this morning so possibly abandoned or stored here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245071 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
