  <ele>366.0</ele>
  <time>2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Vinsulla</name>
  <desc>Random pull out location, not even marked as a rest stop. No light pollution, so you can see the stars at night. If you look to the other side of the road in the morning, you&#39;ll see a small river and a beautiful overlay of fog. Gorgeous spot in autumn. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245453 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
