 <wpt lat="53.716548" lon="-115.378151">
  <ele>882.3229551399127</ele>
  <time>2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild Country Gardens</name>
  <desc>Wonderful stop if you’re making it north or south… they sell sheepskin mukluks, homemade jelly and tea, among various of other goodies. &#xA;&#xA;They have over 800 fruit trees. Found them on Harvest Host. If you’re in need of jelly, perogys, fresh garlic or homemade soap, look no further. It’s nice to support local in northern Alberta!&#xA;&#xA;Quiet dead end road… a night could be possible. Ask them. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245478 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Shopping</type>
  <extensions>
