 <wpt lat="43.389250" lon="-80.077336">
  <ele>284.10516357421875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flamingo Valley Camping Resort</name>
  <desc>Camping Resort, pretty big, with many seasonal guests. My site and the ones in the vicinity were really uneven (tent sites, but some have power and water). There are some trees between those sites. &#xA;Washrooms were pretty far away, and shower cost 25ct for 4 minutes but were cold when I was there… &#xA;I think WiFi cost extra and is really slow, when it worked, at the sites but pretty good near the office. Main washrooms are pretty new and clean, showers are also good. &#xA;They also have a pool, hut tub and a pond, also some playgrounds for kids. &#xA;I paid 68$ for an unserviced site, overall quite disappointing. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
