  <ele>203.53696510847658</ele>
  <time>2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gateway church North Bay</name>
  <desc>A little bit out of the main city area  drive down Marshall avenue east&#xA;I have park in the back section of the church parking lot. &#xA;About 200’ further is dead end of the rd you could probably park there next to the hydro station &#xA;It’s very quiet here so far no issues &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245635 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
