  <desc>This is my private lot  by the river. &#xA;You&#39;re welcome to spend one night. &#xA;You need to call or  text to confirm if it’s available to use &#xA;613-769-3872&#xA;Please pick up after yourself.&#xA;And be quiet to respect my neighbours. &#xA;Cheers&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245637 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
