  <ele>209.17427901455468</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hanna Park</name>
  <desc>great place for the night. we were here in October. it was not busy. its probably verry full in high season. it&#39;s a sweet little town. so we don&#39;t know if it&#39;s possible to stay here in summer. but there&#39;s no &#34;no overnight&#34; sign or a park time limit.&#xA;There is a Farmers Market from July - August.&#xA;Washrooms were still open. keep it clean!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245710 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
