  <ele>5.94793701171875</ele>
  <time>2023-10-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fort Petrie Military Museum </name>
  <desc>Nice gravel parking lot. Stayed 1 night. Some visitors in the evening. Lot is fairly level. Great view of the mouth of Sydney harbor. Talked with curator in morning really nice guy. said he didn&#39;t mind us being there at all. toured museum. Amazing place. Toilets open during museum hours.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245838 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
