  <ele>1130.650912331037</ele>
  <time>2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kappan lake east recreation site</name>
  <desc>10km in, first 8 km good gravel last 2km bumpy narrow. Good for campervans not for RV. We came in on our GMC safari. Lots of shady spots, 4 picnic benches, pit toilets. Lovely sandy beach for two wheelers and tent campers. Clear water, some beavers and also small mice this season so careful not to leave doors open at night&#xA;&#xA;No cell reception&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245892 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
