  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Loop of old road</name>
  <desc>Very nice camping spot on loop of old road which is blocked by a small stream and concrete blocks. Could be accessed from both ends and could therefore accommodate 2 vehicles. Pretty level - first side is tarmac. Partially open views over meadows and trees. Very quiet. No mobile signal. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/245975 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
