  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Just off Highway- TRTrailhead</name>
  <desc>Nice road to TRtrailhead . Gate further down road was closed due to time of year I was here(MidOctober). But I was able to get off highway and stay on nice dirt road/turnaround behind trees. Some road noise but was able to sleep just fine. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/246026 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
