  <ele>-6.30462646484375</ele>
  <time>2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>parking lot behind the Esso </name>
  <desc>big parking lot behind the gas stop , suitable for most RVs. not sure if this is a private parking spot or public, but it didn&#39;t had any signs that it&#39;s not allowed to stay there. No &#34;no overnight parking&#34; signs anywhere. Dark (although kinda sketchy) and good enough leveled.&#xA;A toilet from the Esso gas station can be used. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/246081 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
