  <ele>142.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bari’s spot</name>
  <desc>Far from the road and really quiet. Easy to access with a regular car &#xA;Lots of room, for tent or RV&#xA;Fire pit and firewood all around &#xA;A little bit in altitude so amazing sunset &#xA;Really clean spot, let’s keep it that way !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/246134 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
