  <time>2023-10-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>MacIver&#39;s Motel &amp; Campground</name>
  <desc>Place was already closed for the season but owner let us stay on the campground. Paid 40$ for electrical site with our RV.&#xA;Can&#39;t say anything about the other amenities.&#xA;Free and rather fast wifi.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/246152 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
