  <name>Herman Microbrewery</name>
  <desc>Local microbrewery in Prevost, Quebec.  Open Thursday-Sunday.  We asked the owner if it would be possible to spend the night in the parking lot.  So, stop in for a good beer while you’re there!  &#xA;Many small businesses located in this strip of buildings.  Most are only open during the day.&#xA;&#xA;Also, a great place next door for a cappuccino, KOHI micro-roaster, which is open all week.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/246188 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
