  <desc>Grassy parking at the end of a gravel road. Could be muddy after rain. Big enough for a few small RV. Access to a small beach. Very quiet. Was alone and saw nobody. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247411 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
