  <ele>13.931071557104588</ele>
  <time>2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>ATV Trail Head</name>
  <desc>A gravel parking lot within the town of Oxford. It’s the trail head for an ATV trail. Could probably hold about 5 class A’s. There’s a picnic table with a small shelter over it and garbage cans.i There are no “No Parking” signs. Easy access&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
