 <wpt lat="51.652884" lon="-120.038822">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-04-29 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clearwater Valley Resort</name>
  <desc>Campground close to Wells Grey Provincial Park. Price was only $49.90 for 30 amp serviced site but they let us have two camper vans in one spot and they have a ton of amenities including unlimited showers. They aren’t the cleanest showers but they are hot. Half decent cell service and too treed for starlink. Facility has good wifi and cell service. We didn’t explore the other amenities as we were just staying overnight on the way to Wells Grey. Did run into a black bear driving in so be bear aware!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247614 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
