 <wpt lat="47.559820" lon="-70.529680">
  <ele>54.7</ele>
  <time>2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping ACVG</name>
  <desc>Designated free campground at the side of a relatively quiet road by a river. The sign welcomes campers including tents to stay for a night. There’s a well kept drop toilet with toilet roll and even a water fill up! The occasional car or truck passes by until 7pm when it’s gets quieter. The sign says there’s WiFi but I couldn’t find it. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247634 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
