  <ele>397.1878662109375</ele>
  <time>2023-10-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Upper parking lot of shopping center </name>
  <desc>Just a level parking lot of some shops and restaurants. There is no sign &#34;no overnight parking&#34; and we asked around and somebody suggested to stay in the upper parking lot to be a bit more discrete. We did and there was no problem. 24h restaurant with toilet across the street (where parking overnight parking  is not allowed).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247650 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
