  <time>2023-10-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little side road</name>
  <desc>Very nice spot in a dead end side road. There is a fire pit and enough wood around. Had a quiet night. No cell reception. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247680 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
