  <time>2023-10-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kittawa RV Resort</name>
  <desc>RV Resort with a lot of seasonal campers. Good for one or two nights especially for visiting Ottawa (park and ride and then taking the train).&#xA;Has all the amenities like showers, toilets for free and laundry (probably coin-operated, didn&#39;t use it).&#xA;Different types of site; we had full-hook up.&#xA;Sani damp available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247693 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
