  <ele></ele>
  <time>2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Park opposite campground</name>
  <desc>We tried to get into the Kitwanga Municipal Campground with our fifth wheel but thought it was a bit tight. We parked in the park directly opposite  - plenty of open space. Level gravel/grass surface. Stayed one night. There is no restrictive camping signage. It has a covered gazebo, picnic table and rubbish bins as well.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/247716 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
