 <wpt lat="44.266420" lon="-76.967703">
  <ele>78.83148193359375</ele>
  <time>2023-11-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Flying J</name>
  <desc>Clean showers available in the travel center 24/7.&#xA;Unlimited water and time for 14.69$. &#xA;Didn&#39;t seem to have a problem with the two of us sharing a shower. &#xA;1 Towel and foot mat is provided.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248346 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
