 <wpt lat="44.169442" lon="-79.726092">
  <ele>223.44550559484898</ele>
  <time>2023-10-31 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Spring in New Tecumseth</name>
  <desc>Cold Spring Water&#xA;&#xA;For Jugs Only &#xA;No hose for a water bandit&#xA;&#xA;Corner of 14th line and 20th side Rd&#xA;&#xA;Park on 20th side road. The walk is a few more feet, but no steep hill (ditch) and your feet won’t get wet. If you take the access from 14th line your feet are likely to get wet and the slope up the ditch is a bit sketchy, even if it’s just a few feet.&#xA;&#xA;There is a lawn chair between 2 trees just up from the spring to mark the site.&#xA;&#xA;Water is cold and tasty.&#xA;&#xA;Well maintained dirt road. &#xA;In the countryside.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-31 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248452 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Water</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>amenity_drinking_water</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
