 <wpt lat="44.609389" lon="-63.618111">
  <ele>32.80426025390625</ele>
  <time>2023-11-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Captain William Spry Community Recreation Centre</name>
  <desc>Swimming pool in a community centre. Gently asked for a shower only, they let us in for free.&#xA;Everything is old but clean and working. Non-private very hot showers. Can&#39;t adjust the temperature. There&#39;s also soap.&#xA;Bring your own lock for the lockers.&#xA;Separate for men, women and family.&#xA;Weekdays open 6:30am - 9pm&#xA;Weekend 8:30am - 8:30pm&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248589 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
