 <wpt lat="49.415831" lon="-115.423603">
  <ele>777.065225912258</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wardner Community Centre</name>
  <desc>Wardner has a community campsite for $10/night (no services, nice field) to be paid at the community centre (drop payment in lockbox) but it had recently snowed and was going to begin raining overnight so we didn’t want to chance getting stuck so we camped at the community centre parking lot. Flat. Gravel. Building has outdoor lights. Covered picnic area. This is a very small, quiet, friendly community. No amenities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248655 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
