  <time>2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Picnic Area - outside Cayuga</name>
  <desc>This picnic area is right off the highway. It had a few picnic tables and port-a-potty and garbage can. There are no signs prohibiting overnight camping posted. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248721 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
