 <wpt lat="52.824218" lon="-109.439163">
  <ele>649.94287109375</ele>
  <time>2023-11-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oil Field Road</name>
  <desc>This is a small gravel road, not very well-maintained road, in an oilfield, facilities nearby. I came in by car. but you have to drive slowly, not following the old tire track, otherwise you might scrap your car belly. potentially cause damage. no service. cell reception Telus 3 bars. decent internet speed. I came in late and left early. no one bothered. flat area. good enough for tent. please. please keep it clean. take away your trash.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248747 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
