  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Irving Big Stop</name>
  <desc>This place has a washer and a dryer for laundering their towels but the public can use it too. It is $2 for the washer (45 mins) and $2 for the dryer (45 mins). Bring your own detergent and dryer sheets. There is a lounge for use while you wait with wifi, tv, sockets.&#xA;Didn’t use shower but I enquired and was told it is $10+tax&#xA;I asked about staying overnight in the parking lot as I’m not a trucker and they said it was fine. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/248958 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
