  <desc>Large marina parking lot. Parking is free 24/7 on the sides of the square (up to 24ft vehicles), in the middle you have to pay (see photo). Public toilets, boat ramp and water dispenser for bottles available.&#xA;&#xA;There are also power sockets everywhere at the functional buildings, but I&#39;m not sure if their use is permitted.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/249218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
