 <wpt lat="45.604280" lon="-73.831470">
  <ele>24.266425917856395</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 19:55:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Cntr interpret nature Boisbriand</name>
  <desc>Water with regular tap thread.  Garbage and recycle bin. Dog park. Black water dump station. Gazebo.  Walking trail. Lots of parking spot. Internet good.  Maybe toilet in summer. No no parking signs.  Lots of benchs.  Located on the municipal garage.  Beautifull place.  Did not found any pic-nic table because it was winter, maybe.  Saw many locals come here to walk their dogs.  Very quiet.  Big rig friendly is you stay on the right side of the building.  Dog park close but parking seems open at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 19:55:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/251055 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
