 <wpt lat="48.805316" lon="-87.272719">
  <ele>295.3413708936423</ele>
  <time>2023-11-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Public parking</name>
  <desc>Tried to go to the Schreiber beach for the spot on IOverlander, but it is closed for the winter I guess. Stayed here instead since we could ask someone if it was okay and it is. It’s a public space. The only issue was the train tracks that are very close. If you have light sleep or a badly insulated vehicle, we don’t recommend.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/251131 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
