  <ele>181.05284504964948</ele>
  <time>2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown land  on old logging road</name>
  <desc>This is located on crown land/public lands. Beautiful view of some windmills. Very quite, just off old logging road driveway has lots of grass but easy to get in. Room for several vehicles close to Truro and has cell service. Very clean so lets keep it so!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/252308 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
