  <name>Gamble lake </name>
  <desc>This is a gravel parking lot past the entrance to gamble lake. Suitable for most vehicles and could fit 4-5 here. Little path across the road that goes to the lake, this is on crown land. Please keep this clean. Access only in late spring,summer fall maybe into the end of December. It’s not plowed in the winter &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/252310 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
