  <name>Smokey Bear Campground</name>
  <desc>RV campground on highway 1 open year-round with clean washrooms and 1$ showers. There are several big rigs on the site. We stayed in our small van in a plowed parking lot with no services. Wi-fi is available in certain parts of the campground and the owner is very helpful. Good spot for a one night stop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/253342 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
