  <desc>Free showers in the recreation center. &#xA;- Men&#39;s change room : 2 hot showers with water temperature control&#xA;- Women&#39;s change room : 1 shower, no water temperature control, water was not warm enough.&#xA;&#xA;Water fountain available in the Recreation Center.&#xA;A public library just in front of the Recreation Center.&#xA;&#xA;We even spent the night on the parking lot as we did not see any &#34;overnight parking&#34; sign. Nobody bothered us.&#xA;&#xA;Note : Only 5 spots available for high roof vehicles near the entrance, outside of the covered parking lot which has a height restriction.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-12-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/253382 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
