  <name>Near cowichan lake</name>
  <desc>Nice fairly secluded spot, easy to get to in a vehicle with high clearance. We cleaned up the broken glass around the fire pit :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/254907 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
