 <wpt lat="49.983281" lon="-125.414711">
  <ele>213.1558837890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near echo lake</name>
  <desc>Nice quiet spot close to echo lake.  Just off the side of a logging road.  Only a couple kms off the main rd.  Got into it in an older Toyota motorhome no problem.  Only space for one.  Went past a couple other spots along the way that would work but looked like dumping grounds for locals unfortunately… this spot was good and private and quiet :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/254908 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
