  <ele>17.165866318158805</ele>
  <time>2024-01-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>GoodLife Fitness</name>
  <desc>Big parking lot of a 24 hour gym. Parked with no issues. Pretty quiet area. Residential properties surrounding and walking distance to a grocery store. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255075 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
