 <wpt lat="49.246860" lon="-122.908070">
  <ele>19.40109449531883</ele>
  <time>2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sapperton bike path (no vehicle access)</name>
  <desc>Small spot. Along the path make a left into the brush by a small trail. You’ll be near a railroad. Walk left away from the railroad and there’s a flattish area for tents. Loud but safe.&#xA;&#xA;Bicycle and foot only - the campsite is next to a multiuse path that does not allow vehicles. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255209 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
