 <wpt lat="50.696647" lon="-120.362785">
  <ele>349.7642235374078</ele>
  <time>2024-01-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Renfrew Lane</name>
  <desc>Dirt parking spots by the library and holiday inn. Couple cars and work vehicles left overnight regularly. Little noisy with people cutting through the empty lot and walking dogs. Unhoused population around. Library is open 10-8 most days and a couple times I’ve spent the night here unbothered even though the library parking is patrolled. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
