 <wpt lat="49.271300" lon="-123.066361">
  <ele>47.92770102247596</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Victoria Park street parking</name>
  <desc>Nice little residential area with street parking surrounding a little square park. Washroom facilities here, unsure of open times. Was told by local friends that this is a pretty safe area to stealth camp! Probably not fit for bigger than campervans but is worth a look. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255418 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
