 <wpt lat="48.426915" lon="-80.241755">
  <ele>362.054</ele>
  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Abandonned mine, near cell tower</name>
  <desc>Many buildings, towers etc...&#xA;Road is not maintained during winter.&#xA;Located 500 feets further then the cell tower on Lava Mountain Road.&#xA;Lots of room for lots of big rigs.&#xA;Cell reception is perfect.&#xA;Stayed here many hours and I did not see nobody..No sign nowhere.&#xA;Remote and quiet. &#xA;You can go inside one building with your vehicle, there is a roof.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
