 <wpt lat="48.643007" lon="-89.588840">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Dog Beach</name>
  <desc>Stayed overnight in my RV. Plenty of space. Sign says no camping, no campfires.&#xA;Shielded from the road by trees. You can still hear some road noise, but traffic is very light. Quite pivate in September, arrived 5pm and was all alone until next morning when Park Rangers made a quick inspection round at 9 am (happily ignoring me). &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255488 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
