  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gelley Lake</name>
  <desc>Large camping area with a boat launch that doubles as a snowmobile path in winter. Plenty of space. I counted 6 different fire pits. But the ground is hilly and uneven - ok for an RV but probably not great for big trailers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/255489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
