 <wpt lat="43.956293" lon="-78.262602">
  <ele>81.05073928386724</ele>
  <time>2024-01-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Almost Perfect - Grocery Outlet</name>
  <desc>Overstock type store, focussed largely on grocery and snack items. &#xA;&#xA;Found vegan, keto, gluten-free, and kosher options. Also some self-care and household items.&#xA;&#xA;Hard to believe how much I got for under $25.&#xA;&#xA;Really great prices (some prices are hard to believe). Some items are near or slightly passed expiry date. &#xA;&#xA;Highly recommend a pit stop here for snacks if you’re on a road trip.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/256192 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
