  <ele>-16.4278564453125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>city park in Terence Bay</name>
  <desc>Terence Bay is near Halifax. On its waterfront is a city park which is not signed no overnight parking. It is quiet, dark, and has a portapotty and cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/256218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
