  <ele>586.5462646484375</ele>
  <time>2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Just off the road. Easy access.</name>
  <desc>Wide open spot of an old well head. Down a gravel track, and we&#39;ll hidden. Room foe any size unit. 1 bar with telus. it&#39;s clean so keep it that way. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-09-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/256420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
