  <time>2024-01-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wallace Farm</name>
  <desc>Park where you like. If you need water, fresh from well if needed. Check in at the farmhouse during daylight hours first. Check for fire hazard conditions-do not start any fire unless permitted by owners. Enjoy the prairie pasture and sound of coyotes at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/256906 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
