  <ele>-16.78533935546875</ele>
  <time>2024-01-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>street parking next to marina</name>
  <desc>Relatively quiet street for overnight stay. No signs indicating restrictions. But parking becomes a premium in the morning as workers in the morning fill in. Best to come after business hours and leave early in the morning...Otherwise, this will become another spot that will regretfully be shut down by local bylaw&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-01-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/259163 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
