 <wpt lat="45.603301" lon="-73.831489">
  <ele>9.533</ele>
  <time>2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>free drinking water</name>
  <desc>All year long, never closing. Regular standard garden hose threat tap for fresh drinking water.  Just go straight on Chauvin Avenue direction south.  Located just before the water traitment plan at the end of the street.  Also dumping hole in the ground.  Permited to sleep overnight, but you must move when the snow plow come to clean the snow. All free and accessible with big rig   Also dog park and walking trails. Thank you Boisbriand&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/260273 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
