  <name>Grassy area next to a lake</name>
  <desc>Amazing spot at the end of a gravel road on a nice patch of grass. Superb view over this little lake.&#xA;High clearance vehicle needed, the road leading there is full of bumps and puddles, 4x4 recommended. Road gets pretty narrow, so large vehicles are not recommended. If you don&#39;t want scratches on your rig this place might not be for you because there are a couple of bushes and branches on the way.&#xA;Phone reception is decent. &#xA;Please pack out what you pack in! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/261374 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
