  <name>Geoff’s Auto Repair</name>
  <desc>Very fast and honest mechanic, got my vibration problem solved on the dame day with a alignement and some parts change for a lower than expected price. The owner’s name is Mike, super friendly guy and he is super meticulous. I 100% recommend to everybody that need any kind of work on his car. Waiting room have wifi and free drinks for customers&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-11-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/262047 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
