 <wpt lat="48.804980" lon="-123.914910">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-02-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cut Block trees</name>
  <desc>Drive up the forest service road, past the big pullout with a fire pit and go to just past where the road splits, there is a cut block on the left side of the road with space to park in front of it. Walk down the right side of the cut about 50 meters&#xA;&#xA;Small site at the right side of the cut block. Perfect for hammock/tarp site. Ground may be tricky for tent with a larger footprint.  Small 3/4 fire pit established, lots of wood in the area.  Check for fire bans, this area is tinder in the summer and you&#39;ll burn the whole mountain down&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/262078 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
