 <wpt lat="50.423929" lon="-121.312950">
  <ele>272.1778902877122</ele>
  <time>2024-02-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Intersection or rivers - Nicola &amp; Thompson</name>
  <desc>Dirt road just off Nicola Hwy right after bridge crossing. Incline up to clearing, 2wd fine. Clean, private crown land. Stayed one night. No wind. Beautiful views of Spence’s Bridge valley &amp; river. The road is essentially the continuation of Kirkland Ranch rd. Great cell service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/263218 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
