  <name>Moresby Camp Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>This is a free campsite managed by the ministry of Forests. The site has a fire pits, picnic tables and outhouses. This area can get busy in the summer as there is a launch ramp for vessels heading south to Gwaii Haanas. A large parking area and covered gazebo are also on the site. No services of any sort, no water, no power and no cell reception.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/265967 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
