  <name>Nanaimo Ice Centre</name>
  <desc>Parking lot of the arena, nicely treed with walking path and picnic tables. Bathrooms in arena open well past midnight and by 7am. Open wifi. Some noise with people coming &amp; going for early and late ice times. Aquatic Centre across the street with paid showers, pool, hot tub, sauna, etc. Great spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/266589 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
