 <wpt lat="45.597276" lon="-64.951607">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fundy park Headquarters campground</name>
  <desc>Sanitary block at the entrance of the Headquarters campground (coordinates may not be super accurate though). There&#39;s a tap outside by the door where you can refill your jugs. The lady at the reception told us we could use it or the inside sinks (laundry section) that should be pretty deep. We were simply visiting the park and not staying at the campground. There are also indoor toilets and big garbage bins outside for your waste &amp; recyclables! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/267178 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
