  <ele>-12.154052734375</ele>
  <time>2024-03-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>My private home parking and backyard</name>
  <desc>Large parking available for overnight stay. &#xA;Tent in the backyard.&#xA;Two night stay maximum.&#xA;Shower available only when I am at home.&#xA;Near large park, with access to the river.&#xA;No fuss travelers only. What you read is what you get. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/267209 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
