 <wpt lat="45.789275" lon="-77.383510">
  <ele>167.73748779296875</ele>
  <time>2024-03-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land</name>
  <desc>A little clearing just off the McKay Creek Road.&#xA;enough room for a vehicle or two, or a trailer. The McKay Creek Road coming in is &#34;use at own risk&#34;. room for one vehicle, passing oncoming may require coordinating. Road is uneven, I drove fairly slow in an old Ambulance Diesel conversion. Stayed for one night. Very quiet. Looks to have been used or set up by someone. A weathered fire pit, a grill hanging on a tree and an old cabinet lays near by. Had no Cell Service(Telus). Water(Stream) is close but not in immediate area. Will drive past a few on the way in.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/267233 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
