  <name>After Bridge</name>
  <desc>Immediately after the Bridge, same side as Moose Two Creek Campground. Between MTCC and creek. The dirt road to the treed area. Level and private. You are near hwy, but it was quiet. Room for 3 to 4 vans or an RV or two. Mama black bear and cub ambled nearby. Keep pets close.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/268576 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
