 <wpt lat="50.968195" lon="-120.121817">
  <ele>1144.8248291015625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sullivan Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free rec site, 4ish campsites.  pit toilets, tables, fire pits, no trash cans.  a little tricky to get a big rig in here but no problem for vans and small campers/trailers.&#xA;we stayed here two nights and it was nice enough.  there was someone here who looks like they were living here permanently, but they didn&#39;t bother us.  pretty muddy this time of year (early April). no cell coverage.&#xA;&#xA;note: Google maps location is incorrect, the actual location is the coordinates listed here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/269006 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
