  <desc>Gym with wifi, showers and water. With a black card membership it&#39;s a solid place to go shower across Canada as there are so many, and you can just go in to any if you find one. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/269191 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
