  <ele>543.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>FSR vehicle parking area</name>
  <desc>this is a large, slightly sloped gravel parking area used by horse riders and hunters to offload before heading into the mountains.  Pit toilet on site. Quiet if no one else around.  I had it all to myself, and no hunters came in the morning. Access from Forest Service Road off the highway - less than 1 km up gravel road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/269755 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
