  <time>2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hidden gem</name>
  <desc>Campground was still (winter)closed &amp; all other places were occupied. This has a huge clear, open &amp; relatively flat area with space for many rigs of all sizes. Tucked in behind is a sweet, private site. Room for 2 (good friends) vans or tents nothing bigger.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/270581 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
