  <desc>Invited to stay by locals, but must stay off dunes as they are a conservation area. We parked off the end of the road where it turns left and had the entire place to ourselves. Gorgeous (albeit windy) spot! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/270678 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
