 <wpt lat="51.307592" lon="-116.970809">
  <ele>787.3222517063841</ele>
  <time>2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>RJames Truck &amp; Equipment Service</name>
  <desc>Best mechanic in town for big rigs. All other places will send you here. We had a blown wheel seal and they squeezed us in, and called around town for a seal. Advised if they couldn’t get one today then we could park out back for the night to save on a motel. Great people. Haven’t been billed yet, but google reviews say the prices are very fair.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271018 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
