 <wpt lat="49.920263" lon="-118.141839">
  <ele>626.0441055027768</ele>
  <time>2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hidden Bridge </name>
  <desc>Just off Barnes Road, down the gravel road behind the electrical station. Follow the road down and across the bridge. One spot big enough for one maybe two tents and a car. But I’m guessing there are more spots down the road.&#xA;Easy enough for any SUV or Truck. I’m not sure I would pull anything large down this road. Maybe a tent trailer.&#xA;It’s very clean here!!!&#xA;Please keep it this way.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271160 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
