 <wpt lat="51.298545" lon="-121.914895">
  <ele>1712.6419975282624</ele>
  <time>2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mountain Bike.</name>
  <desc>Almost made it to the top, where there is a forestry look out spot. That was our planned destination. We needed just 2 inch more lift on our car, for the wife to feel safe!!!&#xA;(See photo for car) anyways staying on a switch back close to the top. Great views. Had I known there is a mountain bike trail that starts from way up here, I would have brought my bike.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271162 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
