 <wpt lat="52.200350" lon="-122.275977">
  <ele>557.1243553869426</ele>
  <time>2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fraser valley view.</name>
  <desc>Only one way to describe this spot.&#xA;The View!!!!&#xA;If your lucky enough to travel out here. This spot is a must!!!!&#xA;Where going to spend two nights here and gold pan near the bridge.&#xA;But again the view can’t match the gold we find.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271163 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
