 <wpt lat="51.520592" lon="-122.283584">
  <ele>331.9278564453125</ele>
  <time>2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Churn Creek</name>
  <desc>Pure sand, another great find, right beside the Fraser River!!!!&#xA;Might be one of the cleanest sites we have ever found. (Walking around bare foot)&#xA;Gold panning and fishing right at our door step.&#xA;&#xA;All SUV can make it here. I’m guessing a tent trailer can make it down the hill but a trailer might be a tough one.&#xA;There is one switch back that might be ugly. &#xA;You should walk the road first. ( just saying)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271164 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
