  <ele>373.5562659529969</ele>
  <time>2024-03-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Vinsulia Rest Stop</name>
  <desc>Sign reads ”overnight parking from 7pm-7am”. Outhouse. It’s literally on the side of the highway so it’s loud, but well lit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-03-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271280 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
