 <wpt lat="54.469403" lon="-126.752521">
  <ele>795.6301822973173</ele>
  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dunalter Lake picnic area </name>
  <desc>Advertising as a picnic site but there’s an outhouse, beach access, full roundabout for easy maneuvering. Barely hear highway traffic at all. No signs saying any kind of time limit. Lake is stocked by fisheries. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271281 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
