 <wpt lat="46.352958" lon="-72.518165">
  <ele>6.00782964709278</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parc de l’île Saint-Quentin</name>
  <desc>The park on Saint Quentin island allows wild camping (according to Le Guide du Routard). It’s free during off season, and costs 7$/vehicle + 2$/person during the summer. &#xA;&#xA;The park is really nice, with sports activities available during the season. There are several parking lots in it, we parked in the last one, at the forefront of the island, before the marina. There were no « no overnight parking » on none of the parking lots, and posters « go van » sticked on the picnic tables next to the last parking lot. The view on the Saint Lawrence river was really nice ! Also a great plus is that really clean pit toilets were available when we were here (it was construction site toilets so I’m not sure they are to stay here permanently).&#xA;&#xA;Last thing to know is that even off season with no one in the park at night, they maintain a high level of public lightening, which can be a bit annoying if your setting is not fully protective against light.&#xA;&#xA;We had a great night !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271283 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.668908" lon="-120.353867">
  <ele>547.6</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sahali Mall Parking Lot </name>
  <desc>Overnight parking has been observed here for months. Park away from the mall on the West Side of the lot, along Columbia Street. Don’t park near the “Interior Health employee parking” area. Groceries, gas and fast food within walking distance.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271383 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
