 <wpt lat="50.761375" lon="-119.190757">
  <ele>586.3325168360025</ele>
  <time>2024-04-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Beautiful View Pull out </name>
  <desc>Little pull out of the road in the Forest. Nice view of lake and montain. The level is no good exempt if you have some thing for niveling. Nice place for one night or two. 8km from Salmon Arm. Quiet and no trafic here. Train is down the Hill next to the lake but train is everything where in this area. (Next to 1 road) It’s not for big rig. One camper is ok. no more but other place up the Hill but level is poor too. Cell 2-3 depend LTE or 5G . My rig is 29 feet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271418 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
