  <desc>Camping in the forest and by the pretty creek behind the brewery. Bookings done through hipcamp. Amenities include a brewery, an outdoor kitchen that runs seasonally, washroom and shower facilities and great spring water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-29 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271799 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
