  <ele>415.5316162109375</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pass Creek Campground </name>
  <desc>Nice, family oriented campground. $20.00 p/nt. Showers (inc in camping fee) &amp; flush toilets, pit toilets throughout campground. Fire pit (except #16 because it&#39;s well in the trees) &amp; picnic table at each site, some sites more private than others but well spaced. Playground, Creek, ball diamond nearby, hiking trail.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/271890 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
