 <wpt lat="50.838593" lon="-120.474569">
  <ele>956.3497314453125</ele>
  <time>2024-04-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pass Lake Recreation Site - Kamloops</name>
  <desc>Rec site in the hills north of kamloops.  beautiful lake, popular with boaters, 16 sites.  some shaded some sunny, some big some small.&#xA;This has been a paid site in the past as the entrance sign says $15/night, however the website currently says there are no fees required and there is no site operator.&#xA;This makes sense since some of the picnic tables are falling apart and the sites are a bit messy.&#xA;we stayed here for 3 nights and nobody came by to ask us to pay, and there were no other campers.&#xA;Might require payment later in the season but enjoy it for free now while you can!&#xA;no cell coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272009 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
