  <desc>Super easy pull off. Has pit toilets. Two bars on cell. Fantastic views and sunsets. As any rest stop there is road noise but it didn’t bother us once we turned in for the night. &#xA;No signs to warn of no camping. We cleaned the area up and it took a large leaf garbage bag to clear the trash. It’s clean for now. Pit toilets are surprisingly clean. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-04-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272194 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
