  <desc>Ontario power old service road. Established fire pit onsite. Good amount of space for one rig would be a challenge with a trailer but doable. &#xA;2-3 bars Bell&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272581 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
