 <wpt lat="47.257643" lon="-65.053725">
  <ele>2.1947189066559076</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside</name>
  <desc>I stayed here for my work day (remote). great cell signal, within 5km of the nearest cell tower. very quiet. beautiful view. parking sign shows it&#39;s allowed to park here. few people came by to park during the day for a few minutes and left. no prohibited signs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
