  <ele>5.362030029296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>shower &amp; bathroom next to lighthouse</name>
  <desc>Nice payable shower, shelter to eat and wash your dishes and bathrooms. you can also fillup your water tank with a hose behind the restaurant.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272621 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
