 <wpt lat="46.511417" lon="-64.110717">
  <ele>13.411199570841614</ele>
  <time>2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Harmony beach</name>
  <desc>Nice place to stay the night. 4x4 can drive further and park on the beach. plenty of space for tents. room for small and medium rig to turn around. nice place to walk on low tide and dig clams.  trash bin put there by locals.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272624 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
