  <ele>9.910029341466725</ele>
  <time>2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sackville visitor center </name>
  <desc>There’s “no overnight parking” signs in their actual parking lot, but there’s a level gravel area right before it. Parked overnight no problem. Highway noise, per usual…&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272646 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
