 <wpt lat="60.534098" lon="-114.567473">
  <ele>267.28680419921875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Small campground at Sandy Lake</name>
  <desc>Small campground just an hour and a half from Hay River. Lots of space for small vans and tents, larger rigs might not fit between the trees. Located at Sandy Lake and a smaller pond (which are both still frozen). There is a sign for the lake if you follow Hwy 5 from Hay River. There are pit toilets and benches. It’s a nice place, so please take your garbage with you :)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272722 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
