 <wpt lat="45.518548" lon="-73.596395">
  <ele>44.26048235184401</ele>
  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Street Parking</name>
  <desc>This neighborhood has lots of random parking available if you circle around. The spot we chose was outside of businesses that were closed early on Sunday. There are certain times you must pay for this spot but overnight is free. Pretty quiet after 10p on a Sunday and got loud around 7-8a on Monday. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
