  <desc>About 5km west from Highway 11 north of Temagami. Red Squirrel Road features many campsites and this is a fine campsite with rough toilet facilities and a fantastic lake view. Easily can fit several RV&#39;s or trailers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272786 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
