  <time>2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Elk Island Retreat</name>
  <desc>paid way more than other campspots (54$) and had to pay extra for showers. The nearest toilet was just a hole in the ground with a lid on top. &#xA;Everything is clean, but other places we visited were just as clean and way cheaper with free showers&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Warm&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/272793 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
