 <wpt lat="51.087220" lon="-114.480510">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Travellers way by</name>
  <desc>Easy parking, lots of space. Overnight truck stop, weigh scale. At the time of post, Apr 2024 there were no signs indicating overnight stays prohibited. Often used by a carbon protest rally, free coffee and chat, campfires burning 24/7. Very friendly inviting people and plenty of places to park up, hassle free overnight! Stop in for a good chat! A&amp;W, gas, showers and wifi access from the weigh scale just down the access road. Good cell phone coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273295 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
