  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Travel friendly truck stop, parking, overnight</name>
  <desc>Full bars on cell, overnight parking permitted. Coffee, breakfast, showers, toilets, lots of space for parking, especially bigger units. Tent space in the grass, garbage bins. Mostly quiet after 11pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273337 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
