 <wpt lat="53.205648" lon="-114.931814">
  <ele>718.6449640879463</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside Spot near Bridge</name>
  <desc>We were looking for a spot to let the dogs run and stop for the night. Spotted this as we were driving through. Two other locals letting their dogs run when we got here, and two trucks with trailers for boating/fishing. Plenty of room here to have a nice spot for overnight and beautiful river view. Entrance from the road is a little off camber and could be muddy depending on rain. it was fine and hard packed for us driving in with our short bus and 14ft trailer.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273395 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
