 <wpt lat="45.611928" lon="-63.561054">
  <ele>53.09854226087683</ele>
  <time>2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wentworth ski hill</name>
  <desc>It’s the Ski hill - huge parking lot. 4 - season, so there’s hiking/ mountain biking trails. People walking their dogs.. pretty chill place! Only downside is , of course, right at the highway.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273477 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
