 <wpt lat="50.584146" lon="-113.829939">
  <ele>1023.859619140625</ele>
  <time>2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>turnaround loop by RV storage yard</name>
  <desc>this is a large loop where you can pull a full size skoolie in one end and circle out the other end.  there is a grassy circle in the middle.  across from a residential subdivision area.  gravel turnaround loop off a paved road.  I get 4G on my phone with four bars easily. (I use ATT US service in Canada) you can hear noise from the highway and if you need a place to park one night this might suit the need.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
