  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Starry Skies Campground</name>
  <desc>Nestled amidst the tranquility of rural New Brunswick, Starry Skies Campground offers the perfect blend of outdoor adventure, historical exploration, artistic discovery, and delightful relaxation.  Just a 30-minute drive from the vibrant city of Moncton, our unserviced RV campground provides a quiet haven under a canopy of towering pines, poplars, and the occasional burst of sweetness from wild red raspberry bushes. I am the owner.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273527 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
