  <time>2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Inlet Creek Campground</name>
  <desc>Established campground, but from October to May 15 the campground has no services and is free for winter camping. The lake is gorgeous and on a beautiful weekend in May the campground is almost full and the sites are close together. Don’t miss the Lussier Hot Springs! Wonderful, rustic, natural hot spring that feels real. On the river, with three pools of different temperatures. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273591 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
