  <desc>free BC rec site right on the shores of Lake of the Trees.  2ish sites with room for another van or trailer.  picnic tables, fire pits, clean pit toilet.  pretty exposed right by the road but there&#39;s hardly any traffic.  road in is very good and any car will make it.  no cell coverage.&#xA;&#xA;note: we saw a cougar here our first evening but it ran off right away, be safe!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/273859 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
