  <name>Harrison Lake</name>
  <desc>Nice Place direct at the Harrison Lake. During the day (from 8am till 8pm) there are lots of local fishermen. It&#39;s a well known spot for trout fishing and gets pretty crowded. The place is also used as a boat ramp, so make sure you don&#39;t block it, or you come late and leave early! We stayed one night and no one bothered us.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274258 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
