  <ele>237.18854092992842</ele>
  <time>2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Old Logging road </name>
  <desc>Gates &#xA;Close 6pm - Open 6pm&#xA;&#xA;Many hidden spots to set up a private camp site.&#xA;Chunks of wood and kindling can be found scattered in the bushes.&#xA;&#xA;If you have a four wheeler, you can even bring that here as well and have some fun on the trails.&#xA;&#xA;I’m here right now on the top of the mountain doing car camping. I drove up from Ontario.&#xA;&#xA;-Make sure to bring all you need!-&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274332 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
