  <desc>informal camping spot at the back of the McDonald&#39;s. more suited for small gear seems very safe and calm. McDonald&#39;s is 24h as well as gas station so has food drinks and toilets available &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274414 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
