 <wpt lat="45.591585" lon="-61.565605">
  <ele>28.490234375</ele>
  <time>2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dave and Leeann&#39;s</name>
  <desc>We recently purchased 2.5 Acres near Monastery, NS.   We are minutes from the Canso Causeway,  and would like to offer a spot for the night to our European Friends.  We can offer a place to park, a fire pit, and our assistance on where to go and what to see.  We have non-potable water, some potable, and a dump station.  Hopefully power and potable water by fall.  We just ask to be contacted ahead of time.  250-254-6882, or email me at mwavesdave@hotmail.com.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274431 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
