  <ele>402.38014892395586</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Halte routière Joseph Alfred Fontaine</name>
  <desc>Municipal rest area. Dry bathroom very clean. Large gazebo. Picnic tables. Swings for kids. Nice level parking with room for at least 6 RV. Beautiful view of the surrounding mountains. Next to the road but very quiet. Non potable water next to the bathroom.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274486 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
