 <wpt lat="54.026924" lon="-126.037651">
  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Colleymount Pull out</name>
  <desc>This is a large pull out on Colleymount road. Right on lake with beautiful views. There are no trees so no shade but when the others on this road are full this is a great alternative. No bins, no toilets. Easy pull off, very quiet road, T mobile 5G was great.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274489 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
