  <name>Large paved lot</name>
  <desc>Large old paved lot beside the highway. After exiting the highway, turn right at the stop sign instead of left for the hunter creek rest stop. No amenities and right beside the highway, but lots of room for large rigs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274502 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
