  <name>Under Hydro Lines</name>
  <desc>huge flat area just off highway, worked for a quick overnight and a backup if other areas are full in area. I wouldn&#39;t have a fire here. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274510 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
