  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Microwave dead end</name>
  <desc>Hidden from the road wild camping. It used to be a forest road, but there are bushy dead end.&#xA;&#xA;Better backing up your car 30 meters, because there is no u-turn at the end.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274548 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
