  <desc>Not very clean. Expensive washers...front load regular size is 5 loonies. Dryers 25 cents for 5 minutes. Coin machine on site. Close to downtown Fenlon Falls.  Parking lot for aprox 6 cars. During my visit, one person was doing multiple businesses and camps laundry and was using most of the machines. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274597 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
