  <name>Esso/Husky truck stop</name>
  <desc>24hr gas station with showers and bathroom. Restaurant and convenience store as well. Possibly parking overnight but it is for semi trucks. Shower $7.35 without towel, $10 if you don’t have one. Clean facilities. There is a notice on the door that showers were temporarily reserved for professional truck drivers only to ensure they had access, but I wasn’t asked to show ID. Pay inside convenience store&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274625 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
