  <desc>A square on the river with a ring of fire. about 50m from the road.&#xA;&#xA;ein Platz direkt am Fluss mit Feuerring.&#xA;ca. 50m von der Straße entfernt.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274669 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
