  <name>Great Brehat</name>
  <desc>Come into town, bear left and follow road to where it ends by the cemetary. Flat gravel area with picnic table. Good for small camper or good at tight turns/backing up. Asked a local and he said it was fine to stay here overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274727 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
