  <name>Tuff City Skate Park</name>
  <desc>Water bottle fill station next to the basketball court, which is next to the skate park. NO HOSE ATTACHMENT. We used water bags to carry water from the fountain and pour into our water tank. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274797 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
