  <ele>551.2807109177786</ele>
  <time>2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boulder Mountain Truck Pullover</name>
  <desc>Large dirt truck pullover on Highway 1 near Revelstoke. Single garbage can. No other amenities. Cell service is decent. Quite noisy as it is directly adjacent to highway but decent enough if you want a free spot to spend the night / work remote during the day via cell service. Easy to miss going towards Revelstoke at speed as there&#39;s a bend first then it opens up, but impossible to miss coming the other way. No markings anywhere indicating it is an official stop.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/274809 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
