 <wpt lat="46.229150" lon="-73.070272">
  <ele>-32.9</ele>
  <time>2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Le Magasin général Le Brun- Salle de spectacles</name>
  <desc>An general store with picnic tables, gazebo, large manicured grass area and large gravel parking lot nearby. I stopped to visit the store during a bicycle tour. The owner, Richard told me I was welcomed to set up my tent and stay the night. I declined as I already had arrangements in Trois Riviere. Otherwise I would have definitely stayed! &#xA;Richard said he used to live the van-life himself and often had people stay overnight in their vans. A very nice man, a very nice store and a very nice place.&#xA;Although I did not stay there myself,  it seems to me that if you asked Richard he would gladly welcome you. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/275275 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
