  <time>2024-05-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Temilac Inc Campground</name>
  <desc>We spent a night there in our car (tent location) without service for $40 tax included. Clean and accessible showers, toilets, laundry room and swimming pool. The pitches are relatively small and dense but out of season we were just on the edge of the Lake. There is a pub restaurant right next door a little expensive but where we eat well.&#xA;&#xA;Nous y avons passé une nuit dans notre voiture (emplacement tente) sans service pour 40$ taxe comprises. Douches, toilettes, buanderie et piscine propres et accessibles. Les emplacements sont relativement petits et denses mais hors saison nous étions juste en bordure du Lac. Il y a un pub restaurant juste à côté un peu cher mais où on mange bien.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/275790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
