  <desc>Campground wasn&#39;t open so I just parked at the beach across the road. Large gravel lot, able to fit my Mercedes Sprinter van and a rental car with plenty of space to spare for other vehicles. Washrooms were open at the campsite but I&#39;m not sure if you could use them when the site is operational. No cell service at all, but there is in nearby Bonavista.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/275807 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
