  <desc>A tad bit farther than Taltzen Lake. At the Y, Taltzen is left and Kitsequecla lake up the hill to the right. Looks like 4 spots with picnic tables, fire rings and a pit toilet. Gorgeous views of a glacier across the lake. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276436 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
