  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Morrissey FSR Pullout</name>
  <desc>Pullout just over the south side of the bridge crossing the creek/river. Nice little quiet spot, enough space for a couple of vehicles. We got here fine in a 26ft class c, road has lots of potholes so took it slow. A few work vehicles and locals using the road in the early evening. Access Morrissey FSR from Morrissey Rd off the Hwy.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276533 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
