  <ele>53.6129037667122</ele>
  <time>2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Buanderie Carrefour Ste-Foy</name>
  <desc>Laundromat with a lot of washing machines and dryers. 2,75 $/washing machine. The dryers take only 25 Cent, but there is a changing machine, too. Parking lot directly in front of the laundromat. Restrooms and also free WIFI available. Opened every day from 6 am to 9:30 pm. Used by locals and good reviews on Google.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276539 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
