  <name>Chemin du Vide, Marieville</name>
  <desc>parking beside bycicle path: La route des Champs . No sign that says you can&#39;t stay overnight. We have a 21&#39; and I don&#39;t think anything over 24&#39; would fit. Johnny on the spot and 1 picnic table under a gazebo. No water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276623 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
