  <name>Glimpse Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Glimpse Lake has 25 campsites north and south of the lake.&#xA;The campsite cost $15 per site clean and well-maintained .&#xA;Paved Road all except for 1 km of gravel, sites are big enough for a motorhome up to C class .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276679 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
