  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Niagara Falls Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>$10 for 24 hours. We checked in at noon and our receipt shows we are good until noon the next day. Very quiet lot in May, when we are in Niagara. Close to everything we need so we can walk everywhere. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
