  <ele>13.971710626967251</ele>
  <time>2023-05-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside overnight parking</name>
  <desc>Gravel space on the side of the road in a quiet neighborhood. No houses on one side and not a lot of traffic on that street. We were in an SUV, arrived around 9 PM and left around 8 AM and weren’t bothered. You hear only the sound of birds and a water from a little creek beside. Good for van or car, not big RVs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-05-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276704 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
