  <ele>15.96772625297308</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Back street</name>
  <desc>Has access to public wifi rogers and Shaw. Trees for shade. Only available certain times, see pic. Great for Sunday all day overnight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276720 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
