 <wpt lat="52.377258" lon="-122.072724">
  <ele>870.3804931640625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tyee Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>very nice free BC rec site on Tyee Lake.&#xA;There&#39;s about a dozen campsites, half right beside the lake and the rest in the trees, so best of both worlds.  the sites aren&#39;t the most level but decent, and the whole campsite is quite well maintained.  Has the usual pit toilets, tables and fire pits.  Main road in is good and access road down is a little bumpy but was recently gravelled.&#xA;Most of the sites are smaller for cars, truck campers, small RVs etc. but the main turnaround by the lake has a spot for a large trailer.  Almost zero overflow so once it&#39;s full you&#39;re out of luck.&#xA;The lake is big and has some property near and a resort of some kind so it&#39;s not totally isolated.&#xA;No cell coverage.&#xA;Overall a very good free campsite, would definitely come back!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276724 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
