  <desc>Looped pullover on the side of the road. Right on the waterfront! Should be big enough to handle any rig size. Rock/pebbled pull-off. No “no parking, no camping” signs posted. Quiet road to a dead end little residential area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
