  <time>2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mirror, Alberta rest stop.</name>
  <desc>Just 30 meters off hwy, but nice little tree&#39;d area for travelers to spend the night. Truck stop/gas station 200 meters away. Not bothered by anyone. Local residents do use it as a pass thru, but all have been friendly. Here at the end of May, very few mosquitoes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276790 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
