  <name>Dirt lot</name>
  <desc>Larger dirt lot off HWY 138.  Also an abandoned cement lot next to it that is narrow to enter but level.  There is quite a bit of trash surrounding the area, but is secluded / reduced noise level from the road and worked well in a pinch.  Big rig would fit in dirt lot but would be right on the highway.   Narrow entry into cement lot so probably not conducive to big rig there.  Stayed one night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-02 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276811 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
