  <name>Bottrel Store and Campground </name>
  <desc>Small campground next to a lovely creek. $20 a night, paid at the general store. No amenities, only an outhouse. Very friendly folk. The store has gas/diesel, some food and a liquor section. Also has a book exchange section. I stayed for three nights. Very relaxing stay. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276962 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
