  <time>2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Three Sisters Creek Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Very private but difficult to get to recreation site. Sponsored by a local ATV club but it didn&#39;t look like many people stayed there. I drove a fwd car in but if it rained too much or I fell in the ruts it definitely would have gotten stuck, 4wd + high clearance recommended. Very nice spot by a creek with large open grass field, pit toilet, and rock fire pit. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/276989 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
