  <time>2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cartwright Rest Area</name>
  <desc>On the north side of the road is a long paved rest area including one picnic table and garbage can. Level and fairly quiet, plus open wifi from across the street at the highway depot. Cleaner than the dirt rest area 5 km east of here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277074 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
