  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Holdridge Lake</name>
  <desc>There are 3 campsites along this side of the lake. The first one could accommodate a &#34;pull through&#34; large trailer, however it&#39;s a dirt road in and is not maintained, but can be done to this point, but no further. The second one can also have a large trailer but it would be along the road, while you could get a large tent (or a rooftop tent) at the lakes edge. The 3rd spot could accommodate tents, with parking along the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277124 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
