 <wpt lat="52.385286" lon="-122.129239">
  <ele>1007.4537353515625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Howes Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free BC rec site on the shores of Howes Lake.&#xA;This is a bit of a unique location as most of the sites are isolated from each other along the shoreline.  There&#39;s about 6 individual sites along the road and 4 in a group as you enter the lake road.  Each site has its own characteristics, we stayed at the one with a dock.  Tables and fire rings provided and a couple pit toilets along the opposite side of the road.  Some sites are more level and private than others.&#xA;Minimal cell coverage, and road access is a little narrow and bumpy but should be no problem for any vehicle.&#xA;Excellent location, would come back!&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277195 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
