  <name>Lions District A5 Memorial Forest</name>
  <desc>Nice space which is a park with a baseball field and play equipment. &#xA;Didn&#39;t look to have available toilets at time of writing. Possibly closed for winter and haven&#39;t been opened.&#xA;It&#39;s a level parking lot which is off the highway, quiet and could park 5th wheels. &#xA;It&#39;s a clean site with locals passing through, so keep it clean and tidy. Not much car activity after 9:30pm. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277268 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
