  <desc>This is a little hidden spot beside a river, you have to take a little route on the side of the road to get there. We had a car and a tent and some people riding VTT passed by us and didn’t seemed to mind us being there. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277821 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
