  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>beside the river</name>
  <desc>Large parking fairely level near the route 138 and close to a small River.  Passe Moisi river toward est.  Good for small and medium rv&#39;s.  Quiet at night.  No signal, no facilities.  Very clean spot.  Please keep it that way.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277826 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
