  <time>2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Nice forest near river</name>
  <desc>We were heading to the spot near the river but it starts raining so we were not confident to stay near the flow.&#xA;We decided to back up a few meters to stay in a primitive camp in the forest. There is a fire pit and place for a few campers. Trail not accessible with big rigs (lots of trees and bush)&#xA;Very nice place, we are just gonna have a night here but definitely could have stayed longer !!&#xA;1-2 bars of cell signal &#xA;Place now clean, please take you trash with you &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277906 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
