 <wpt lat="50.612030" lon="-95.456570">
  <ele>274.3199912217603</ele>
  <time>2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cat Lake</name>
  <desc>There are a couple of other spots driving around this lake that might work for overnighting in your vehicle, but this was my favorite. It is right off the road, but if it&#39;s not too muddy, you could get back in a bit. I did not have a kayak, but I sure wish I had. This area is beautiful. The mosquitos are fierce... make sure you come prepared. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277953 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
