  <name>Old Grist Mill Heritage Site</name>
  <desc>12 campsites with power and water, no dump station. Part of the Old Grist Mill Heritage Site. Small store and coffee shop on site. Wifi avail. Can book online. Cell good signal. Nice Creek runs behind the camp spots. Heritage site is very cool!  They have a Webpage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/277976 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
