  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Norbury lake campground </name>
  <desc>Really nice and tidy with flat camping areas for vans and tents (can&#39;t tent on grass) with nice little walks along the lakes. &#xA;&#xA;$20 a night, with a free option just down the road at horseshoe lake &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278158 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
