 <wpt lat="47.568669" lon="-61.640955">
  <ele>-11.0050048828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Near to the dunes and the sea</name>
  <desc>Great spot, no &#34;No overnight camping&#34; sign. In gravel parking, near the road but very quiet at night. In front of the eolian site, not noisy at all.&#xA;Please leave it clean and be careful of the dunes, they are fragile.&#xA;We were here with a Dodge Grand Caravan, ok VR.&#xA;&#xA;Super petit spot sur un parking de gravier, proche de la route mais vraiment calme la nuit ! Pas de panneaux interdisant le camping, le spot est juste en face du site éolien qui n&#39;émet absolument aucun bruit.&#xA;S&#39;il vous-plaît, laissez la place propre à votre départ et faites attention aux dunes, elles sont fragiles.&#xA;Nous étions là avec notre Dodge Grand Caravan mais la place est également adaptée pour VR.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278167 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="50.597692" lon="-105.415674">
  <ele>517.3209057515487</ele>
  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Buffalo Pound Provincial Park</name>
  <desc>There are several campgrounds within this park. Most have electric ($33/night), but there is one without (Lower Chalet - $20/night). I was lucky enough to get a prime spot in the Lakeside campground and because arrived without a reservation and space was available, I got a $5 discount so site was only $28/night with electricity. Gorgeous spot, super quiet with the odd boat going by. Free firewood, flush toilets and free showers. Cell service ok but not great here, but enough open sky to use my Starlink. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278168 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
