  <ele>3.156739673577249</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cooks Harbour gazebo picnic area </name>
  <desc>Gravel track leading out of town to large undeveloped area of what appears to be town land. The only signs here warn of no dumping. Just before the gazebo there is good size flat area of gravel. Found this area by following Google directions to the other site marked in this town, possibly one and the same. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278172 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
