 <wpt lat="51.833490" lon="-113.009564">
  <ele>692.2914282309537</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tolman Bridge Campground (East &amp; West)</name>
  <desc>FCFS 80 or so secluded unserviced sites along the river with fire pits and picnic tables. Boat launches available on both sides. The campsite is situated in Badlands, the views are awesome. Running water (boil advisory at the moment) and firewood available. $25 a night, self registration. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278333 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
