 <wpt lat="51.051670" lon="-114.159240">
  <ele>1224.8692408041843</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Thomas Percival parking lot (Edworthy Park)</name>
  <desc>Small car park located outside of Thomas Percival park. The park itself is lovely had dinner here, it was lively with locals passing through and had a great sunset by the train looking at the city. No water unfortunately and the toilets are being renovated, however there are portaloos. The park closes at 11pm so this spot at the main entrance gates was quiet and overlooking the highway where you wouldn’t be locked in or moved on. Nice spot for a place to crash and move on. Near a church and the neighbours were out gardening on a Thursday morning. Felt safe no dodgy people about. &#xA;&#xA;Coordinates (51.0516690, -114.1592380)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278338 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
