 <wpt lat="51.638289" lon="-124.389785">
  <ele>836.82470703125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tatlayoko Lake Northeast Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Gorgeous free rec site on Tatlayoko Lake.  Put toilets, picnic tables, fire rings.&#xA;no cell service.&#xA;road access is good.&#xA;all sites are in the trees but offer spectacular views of the mountains and lake.&#xA;no room for large rigs, small RVs and under only.&#xA;this is truely a hidden gem and well worth the drive.&#xA;11/10 would love to come back.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278355 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
