  <ele>772.045654296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wildcamping in the forest</name>
  <desc>Along forest road, good space along the road, a bit further from the highway than the other listed spot on this road. Road is bumpy and contains holes. 2WD is fine. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278400 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
