 <wpt lat="49.896504" lon="-120.503004">
  <ele>1163.5531997364014</ele>
  <time>2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Loon Lake Rd. </name>
  <desc>This open site is just off Loon Lake Road. There is enough space for a dozen of campers. I wouldn’t drive down (left) to the gravel pit as there is plenty of space available straight ahead on the upper section. The ground is level and a mix of sand and small sized gravel and there are several rock fire pits scattered in the area. Starlink works flawlessly since there are no tall trees but I only got one bar on cell phone. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278403 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
