  <name>Meadow West off 940</name>
  <desc>Large meadow / pasture far enough from 940 that traffic is not noticeable and close enough to the creek for water.  Room for numerous rigs.  Great view of the Rocky Mountains to the east.  Not much in the way of firewood. Woke up to wild turkeys.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278509 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
