 <wpt lat="49.556620" lon="-117.666680">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Valhalla Pines Campground</name>
  <desc>Valhalla Pines is a 6 acre campground in a forested rural-residential area surrounded by beautiful mountains and rivers. There are tent and RV sites (trailers &lt;26 ft), and private huts. Shared amenities include a community building with a full kitchen, WiFi, free hot showers, flush toilets, rain-sheltered picnic tables, a sheltered barbecue area, fire pits and hammocks. Stay at Valhalla Pines as a base for outdoor adventure, to reconnect with the forests and rivers, or just to relax. Get recommendations from locals. Everywhere around here is beautiful.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278529 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
