  <name>Peace River turnoff overlook</name>
  <desc>The road has had major construction work the last couple of years preparing to raise the river.   This spot has room for five vans  or 2-3 larger rigs.  Trash receptacle.  No other amenities but the wide view of the river.  Road is quiet towards evening, very peaceful on Peace River!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
