  <name>Mountain Shadows Campground Sparwood</name>
  <desc>Nice campground, near lots of trails, roomy sites with privacy.  Free firewood and free hot showers. Wifi OK. Full hookups including tax $47.25 per night. Sani-dump available.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278692 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
