  <desc>There is space for one camper pickup or a small haul.  The space is squeezed between the road and the Bras d’Or lake.  Very close to the road, but there is very few traffic. Went for a dip in the lake.   &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278735 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
