  <ele>607.0038019204512</ele>
  <time>2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Kasio River Trail rest area</name>
  <desc>A small rest area at the beginning of trail, close to road and river. On the map are from the parking spot marked toilets but we arrived late evening and due to active beats around just parked and went to sleep. Totally calm and nice place with tables and information boards, no no overnight signs. Edit : pit toilet is approx.6 minutes by walk on opposite side of the bridge&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278752 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
