  <name>By the river </name>
  <desc>We found this after visiting the hot springs. it&#39;s only a couple minutes from there. You are by the road but like 5 meters away and close to the river. The view is beatiful with the mountains! Sleep was quiet. Almost no traffic on the road from 11pm to 8am. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278857 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
