  <ele>690.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Le massif de charlevoix</name>
  <desc>Hugh parking lot of the Ski Station at 700m.&#xA;Graveled, slightly leveled&#xA;Toilettes and wast bins at the Station open during day. &#xA;A lot trails to walk or bike.&#xA;No &#39;no overnight&#39; signs. We were recognized  with our truck by staff, but nobody bothered us.&#xA;Very low cell connection with rogers.&#xA;Access over good gravelroad from 138.&#xA;A bit windy when we were there.&#xA;Restaurant was closed.&#xA;Keep it clean.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278933 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
