  <desc>Beautiful large parking area at the top of a steep hill with amazing views of the water. Max 35 ft rig. Flush toilet, picnic tables, gazebo, recycle and garbage bins. A lot of rules, though. Sign says no slide- outs, no outside cooking, etc. Did not see any fresh drinking water. $22/ night + taxes. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278946 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
