  <desc>Norgetown Laundry &amp; Dry Cleaners&#xA;&#xA;The attendant assigns you a machine and when ready she will turn it on for you.  You then give her the cash (cash only).&#xA;&#xA;For the dryers you buy coins from the attendant.  She will refund coins not used&#xA;&#xA;It sounds a bit complicated but it works well&#xA;&#xA;Plenty of parking space &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/278981 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
