 <wpt lat="48.209550" lon="-70.066970">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Petit-Saguenay</name>
  <desc>Stay one night or two at the foot of a rocky slope, in the heart of the village of Petit-Saguenay. The municipality of Petit-Saguenay is happy to offer you this RV stop for free, in exchange, encourage our business and artisans ! Grocery store across the street. WiFi available during the day at the tourist information office.&#xA;&#xA;• Location description: parking - no service&#xA;• Water points: Yes&#xA;• Number of spaces available: 10&#xA;• Max. length. RV: 25 feet&#xA;• Where to park: Respect the signage of the space dedicated to RVs (gravel parking). Transverse and staggered parking only.&#xA;• Accessibility: May to November, 7 days a week, 24 hours a day&#xA;• Arrival and departure time: 24 hours a day&#xA;• Maximum length of stay: 48 hours&#xA;• Price: Free&#xA;&#xA;Emptying stations nearby (5 to 15min by car)&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279102 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
