 <wpt lat="48.189350" lon="-70.054430">
  <ele>188.4</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping de Petit-Saguenay</name>
  <desc>Winner in the “Camping” category in Saguenay-Lac-St-Jean at the 2001 Grands Prix du Tourisme Québécois, the Rivière Petit-Saguenay campsite invites you for a pleasant stay in harmony with nature.&#xA;&#xA;We have twenty-eight (28) sites with (16) or without electricity (12) at advantageous prices very close to the superb Petit-Saguenay River. A central sanitary block with toilets and showers (hot water) is at your disposal. A central dump station is available for trailers when you leave.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279104 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
