  <time>2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mcbride rd</name>
  <desc>Down a quiet rd near the water and not far from Charlottetown and the national parks. it is quiet and near the water with no signs. enough for about 3 vans. if there has been heavy rain it might not be suitable for smaller cars because of the muddy clay but it&#39;s an easy rd to drive down and check out. the ground to camp on is solid and semi even, I think it would definitely be tent worthy in a few places also. no rubbish bins or facilities close but definitely a good find!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279116 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
