  <ele>697.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Great Whitehorse Overlook</name>
  <desc>Great spot. There were two other vehicles parked in one spot and we used the other. lots of room for more than a couple of rigs. The road is sandy so not bad in the rain, however it is small so I wouldn&#39;t want to take a trailer in here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279195 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
