  <ele>6.463841438293457</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bottle Cove Rd. Newfoundland</name>
  <desc>Bottle Cove area right on the water. This is off the roadway where there is a small clearing for a couple small RV’s. Gravel lot fairly even with spectacular view of mountains and sunset. No one bothered us here at all. No signs posted. Locals and tourists come to the area where you can walk trails and watch the sunset. Was busy prior to sunset but really nice. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279223 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
