  <name>Maple creek Community arena</name>
  <desc>Parked near the baseball field behind the golf course club house&#xA;Golf course manager said I could stay there,he let the outdoor toilets open for me&#xA;Very quiet,probably a lot more busy when school is finished in the summer time&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279236 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
