 <wpt lat="48.549171" lon="-58.750992">
  <ele>46.31573894806206</ele>
  <time>2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Port aux Port West 5 minutes from Hwy 460</name>
  <desc>Great spot for a stop, sleep and BBQ away from the road. Just off Father Joy’s Rd at the old ball field and what looks like a water pumping station. Take the gravel road which leads towards the back. Looks like ATV’s go through here but super private and quiet. No wind and surprisingly no bugs.  Level place but some soft spots. Can bring in large rig but beware of sandy spots. No signs posted. Great spot!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279292 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
