 <wpt lat="46.239604" lon="-64.527533">
  <ele>4.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pointe-du-Chêne wharf</name>
  <desc>Not for big rig or trailer.  Right after the gate behind the blue building you will find a strip of storage sheds.  The hose is on the furthest shed from the Beer Garden.  The person in charge of the parking told me the water is tested each year and portable.  You have to pay 4$ to get on the wharf.  Go there to encourage restaurants and bars.  We had a good time and food was good.  Most of staff speak English &amp; French &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279296 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
