  <name>Road Side /. Lake Side </name>
  <desc>A stop on the side of the road on a beautiful lake side. Nice size for large rigs or RV. There’s a picnic table and spot for tent camping tucked down by the lake just south a few meters from the parking area &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279333 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
