  <ele>711.474853515625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McClure Pit Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Really nice. Gravel Place, Easy to Drive On. Right on the Lake. Several picnic tables and fire pits. Toilets are too. The road is close, but not much traffic really nice. Gravel place, easy to drive on. Right on the lake. Flat entrance also suitable for bathing. several picnic tables and fire pits. Toilets are too. The road is close, but not much traffic&#xA;&#xA;wirklich schön. &#xA;Schotterplatz, gut zu befahren.&#xA;direkt am See. flacher Einstieg auch zum baden geeignet.&#xA;mehrerer Picknicktische und Feuerstellen. Toiletten sind auch.&#xA;die Straße ist nah, aber nicht viel Verkehr.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279356 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
