 <wpt lat="45.617340" lon="-76.534500">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Little Red Wagon Winery</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in Pontiac, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. When you arrive, please announce yourself at the entrance. As the owners live on the site, you are welcome to stay for one night only (check-out before 1 p.m.), as they need access to the space for maintenance. On site, you can take a tour of the vineyard, enjoy exhibitions in the art gallery and enjoy live music almost every weekend during the summer. &#xA;&#xA;This family-run vineyard offers three parking spaces for vans Class B  motorized (21 feet or less). Come for a meal, a tasting, a visit to the wine cellar and local art gallery, or a live music performance. &#xA;Dog on leash, water, toilet, 3 parking spaces.&#xA;&#xA;http://www.littleredwagonwinery.com/home-1&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279425 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
