 <wpt lat="45.952420" lon="-77.269620">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hotel Pontiac</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in Pontiac, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. &#xA;This resto-bar has been drawing crowds for over 150 years. People come here for the many live music shows, but also to enjoy the beach, one of the most beautiful in the country. And what about the sunsets? You can spend the night in cabins, buy gasoline and moor your boat at one of the nearby municipal docks. For Class B motorized vehicles (under 21 feet), a preferential rate is available for parking without service for $20. Please confirm your reservation at the reception desk. Campsites are available on an as-needed basis.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279430 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
