 <wpt lat="45.719190" lon="-76.475920">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Herboristerie la fée des bois</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in the Pontiac region, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. &#xA;&#xA;This sanctuary of medicinal plants is located on a superb piece of land surrounded by an ancestral forest with two small streams running through it. There are large gardens, greenhouses and a boutique selling natural products processed on site. The owner offers workshops on wild plants. To find out more about upcoming events or store opening hours, visit the website. The owner can open the boutique by appointment (12h minimum notice). Water is available in the bathroom at the entrance to the boutique, but we can give you access to another water point.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279444 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
