 <wpt lat="45.525160" lon="-76.456510">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pine Lodge</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in the Pontiac region, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. &#xA;&#xA;This charming inn, built in the 1930s, offers an enchanting setting for guests staying in one of its ten rooms. Gastronomic restaurant, beach, bike and boat rentals with 90 full-service lots - a night&#39;s stay at an RV Stop is $50 in high season and $25 in low season. For reservations, call 24 hours in advance.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279445 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
