  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Plage du Pont Blanc</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in the Pontiac region, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. &#xA;&#xA;A public beach along the Coulonge River in Mansfield-et-Pontefract, where swimming is permitted and watercraft (kayaks, SUPs, canoes) can be rented. You can also discover your interbucheron at the axe-throwing center. Access to water, toilet, shower, beach, 15A electricity and firepit.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279446 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
