  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Aventure Rivière Sauvage</name>
  <desc>This area is part of the Route 148 circuit in Pontiac, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. This must-see outdoor company specializes in canoe rentals for the Noire and Coulonge rivers. Shuttle service, campsites and popular starting point for tubing (no tubing rentals).&#xA;&#xA;Please reserve in advance by calling or e-mailing, preferably 24 hours in advance, to avoid disappointment.&#xA;&#xA;Dog on leash, water, toilet, 2 parking spaces for RVs up to 21 feet (Class B Motorised).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279457 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
