 <wpt lat="45.680840" lon="-76.613070">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rafting Momentum</name>
  <desc>space is part of the Route 148 circuit in Pontiac, which includes some twenty RV stops, some of which are free. This business immerses us in the world of rafting with one- or two-day whitewater packages on the Rivière des Outaoaouis, one of the most beautiful in Quebec. Meals included when rafting. &#xA;&#xA;Dog on leash, toilet, 2 parking spaces for RVs 21 feet or less. Tents and Tent trailers accepted.  &#xA;&#xA;17$ / Person Per Night Without Rafting Package. Free if rafting&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279466 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
