  <desc>Next to ice machine on the right side.  Good pressure. Like usual ask permission and buy something &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279484 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
