 <wpt lat="50.705701" lon="-121.923518">
  <ele>238.389404296875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lillooet Brewery</name>
  <desc>This is a wonderful brewery on the edge of Lillooet with plenty of parking overlooking the beautiful Fraser Valley. My wife and I asked if we could stay in their car park if we drank their beer and they said yes. The brewery closes at 8pm and the gates close then and there are no toilets, but that&#39;s fine for our self-contained RV. The beer is wonderful with pizza and other food options if you are hungry too. The brewery has fast free wifi, a lovely patio with sun shade and a beautiful indoor area if the weather gets chilly. Please don&#39;t leave a mess and make sure you buy some beer from them so as not to spoil it for others. Its a really great spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279504 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
