 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="47.482063" lon="-61.724512">
  <ele>-11.3</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roundabout</name>
  <desc>Parallel double track to the official road that leads to an end of the road roundabout. Spot was quiet when we stayed but had obvious signs of use (broken glass, shotgun shells, cigarette butts, etc.) Pretty scenic otherwise. Room for one or two smaller vehicles&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
