 <wpt lat="45.231726" lon="-66.107591">
  <ele>29.685543060302734</ele>
  <time>2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside pullout</name>
  <desc>As we found out we could not overnight at Irving Nature park, we saw a few pull outs on side of road that  didn’t have any kind of signs. We were planning on an early ferry from Saint Johns to Digby NS , so it worked out fine. Across the street is a Children’s Forest . Also an Irving park but it also exhibits the new No Camping or Overnight parking. Be respectful please .&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279508 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
