 <wpt lat="49.690308" lon="-121.397058">
  <ele>231.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name> Old Alexandra Bridge Road</name>
  <desc>Big area, probably used as a turnaround for logging trucks. At the side is enough space for maybe 5-6 rigs. Firespot is already been there. The FSR up here needs high clearance, but no 4x4.&#xA;Very calm, we stayed here for a night and just 3-4 cars passed by, we heard the trains horn in the distance. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279519 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
