  <time>2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Campsite right off Alaska Highway </name>
  <desc>Small, basic site right off the highway, by the river with a fire ring. It&#39;s literally right off the road so there is some road noise, but it&#39;s a very convenient spot.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279536 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
