  <name>Petro-Canada</name>
  <desc>This is a stop trucker petro pass and gas station petro-canada.  You can take your shower over there.  Free wifi laundry washrooms.  Open 6-9 Monday to thursday and 10-5 Saturday and Sunday. About 12$ and if you are 2 you can pay just for one.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279555 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
