  <name>Esso gas station </name>
  <desc>Hot showers for 7$ add more if you need towels.  You can pay one shower for 2 people.  Very great place not too far from Niagara Falls and wine route.  Big gas station with very great employees.  Very clean place.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-10-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279556 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
