  <ele>659.1677450638111</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside </name>
  <desc>This place is 1/2 mile down the road and over the bridge North of  French Creek Recreation Site and is right on the river.  A bit exposed to sun. There are a couple of spots further back with trees for shade. No facilities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279599 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
