  <desc>One of the only two places officially accepted by the city of Baie-Comeau for temporary accommodation&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279618 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
