  <ele>-13.710115076679118</ele>
  <time>2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>tap at left side of store</name>
  <desc>I asked inside if I could fill up my water jug, they said the tap is available.  probably gets turned off in the summer&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279667 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
