 <wpt lat="45.514970" lon="-73.430880">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hotel De Ville</name>
  <desc>Large asphalt public parking behind the Hotel De Ville allowing 24h parking. It is between an airport and a residential area, but very very quiet. No large planes use this airport and no planes fly at night, or barely any. Half  the parking spot is reserved for Police vehicles so very safe spot. At night there are a few cars from residents, one can easily blend in. Slept there many nights and never had any problems. Also walking distance is a Marché selling various foods with a couple restaurants and public rest rooms.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279677 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
