 <wpt lat="47.145794" lon="-79.753698">
  <ele>320.3</ele>
  <time>2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Happy Holidays Campground &amp; Cottages</name>
  <desc>7727 Hwy 11 North, Temagami, Ontario.  it’s beautiful. Lakeside, quiet and just off the highway. Water and electricity. Can dump sewer but for extra charge. There is a train track running right by but no trains were heard until morning around 10:00. Owners/hosts were excellent and even set up a tv outside under cover for the Stanley cup game between Edmonton and Florida. It was awesome!!  Lake has a swimming area with lake toys and a boat dock as well. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
