 <wpt lat="51.611947" lon="-119.923766">
  <ele>413.78311640862375</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet river bank</name>
  <desc>Pull off next to a small local road next to an amazing beautiful riverside. No cars after 8 pm and no noise from the main road. No one bother us. Take a dip in the freezing river, very fresh on a warm day. Care to the current&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Cold&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279763 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
