 <wpt lat="50.971460" lon="-118.242830">
  <ele>687.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tantrum FSR pullout</name>
  <desc>Flat pull off from the Trantrum Forestry Service Road near Revelstoke. Follow the fire road up from the main road at the bottom. Tantrum FSR is shown on AllTrails - easily accessible but may need 4WD for some steep parts. Flat spot with no one else around, and access to bike/hike trails. Full phone service with Verizon.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279839 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
