  <ele>250.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>LILLOET. Industrial area</name>
  <desc>Parking area just in front of TIM DR Mart and a mechanical workshop. Places to overnight is just in front. Six places for vehicles up to 6 m. We were talking with a local living in the workshop at explained that there is no problem to overnight here. Very calm place as few cars are passing through the road. Tim Hortons a 100 m.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279841 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
