  <name>Duncan, BC</name>
  <desc>Quite out of the way spot. Good cell service. We ended up here on a security guards recommendation after being kicked out of the Walmart and Canadian Tires parking lots. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279901 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
