  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>hwy 289 pulloff</name>
  <desc>Big open area with a picnic table. Spot is directly off the highway but not visible to drivers except for the driveway ramp. No fire pit but lots of rocks with which to make one. No indications of being private property. No cell service. Some garbage strewn about.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279931 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
