  <ele>798.8050203407183</ele>
  <time>2024-02-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Anselmo Campground </name>
  <desc>Just outside of Mayerthorpe, AB. My daughter brought me here in winter to a great outdoor rink but I noticed the boondocks sites so checked the website. Site has a picnic table, fire ring, and gravel pads. The campground is rustic, and rural but only 15 minutes off the highway. There’s outhouses and a communal fire pit in the middle and canteen run on the ball diamond side of the playground next to the sites.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-02-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279932 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
