  <desc>By far the least expensive fuel I found in Fairbanks. At the time it is $3.49 a gallon compared to $3.99 a gallon for many other stations in the area.&#xA;&#xA;809 Cushman St, Fairbanks AK&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279947 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
