 <wpt lat="49.211256" lon="-122.928870">
  <ele>-0.3</ele>
  <time>2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moody Park - free street parking </name>
  <desc>Good parking spots on 10th Avenue along Moody Park, for stealth/self-contained camping or just street parking. Completely free, no parking restrictions, when we visited. The only signs we saw were to warn car owners of possible flying balls from the nearby baseball fields :)&#xA;&#xA;This spot is close to the park washrooms (open during the day, closing at 9pm).&#xA;We liked it for an easy quick night before heading to the airport, esp because there are angled parking spots, so you don&#39;t feel close to the road and traffic. Relatively quiet at night, felt safe, another camper stayed there as well.&#xA;&#xA;Good for an emergency stop, when the iOverlander general services spot is not available :D&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
