  <ele>392.97235107421875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lake side spot</name>
  <desc>Nice place near Manic-5, right on the edge of a lake, with our own boat ramp. Road in is nice and hard, managed to get out 30ft big truck in and turn it around at the end, but be careful before coming in with anything big. really nice spot for a single vehicle.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279986 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
