  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Riverside spot</name>
  <desc>Small hidden old sandpit with access to the river. Fire rings, quite a few nice camping spots dotted around. much nicer than the trailhead on the other side of the road. You can swing in practically anything from the road, we got our 30ft truck in without any issues.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/279988 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
