  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Moque Head Trailhead parking</name>
  <desc>Entrance of Moque Head Trailhead (Parking).&#xA;End of &#34;Main à dieu&#34; road. Nice view on all the docks and sea. Good place to Park 2 vans/pick-up with camper, easy access and cellular coverage is good.&#xA;&#xA;NO Facilities, there is houses around so be respectful and all should be good. Some locals was passing and no-one asked us to leave.&#xA;Some cars and noise from the docks time to time but was a quiet night overall !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280231 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
