  <name>Mouth Park</name>
  <desc>Car park at a park with a beach. Directly at the confluence of two streams. Visited by locals during the day. Very quiet in the evening. &#xA;Camping prohibited in the park, but not prohibited in the car park. &#xA;Picnic tables available. Toilet and rubbish bin available. &#xA;Access suitable for all vehicles. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280263 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
