  <time>2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Twin Falls Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Free Recreation Site with 4 large spots with fire pits and tables, small parking lot on the side, bathroom and places for tents. &#xA;Short walk for the water falls. &#xA;&#xA;Portuguese:&#xA;Quando o lugar é nomeado de Recreation site ou Rec site, é grátis. &#xA;Este local tem 4 vagas grandes para motorhome com mesinha e local para fogo. Tem um pequeno estacionamento, banheiro e local para barracas. &#xA;Pequena caminhada para as cachoeiras. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280277 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
