  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sportchek parkinglot</name>
  <desc>Huge parkinglot with spirtchek, marks and canadian tire. On the hwy side of the sportchek side there are no signs that you cannot park. Quiet at the lot during the night. Some hwy noise. Good for a night. Clean. Canadian tire is ioen til 9pm . They have washrooms&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280413 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
