  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>College Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>There is a College parking lot that informally allows people to park for free overnight. Location is great. Right on the river and beside a beautiful walking and biking path. Picnic table area in the college garden area.&#xA;Bike and skateboard park across the street for kids. Public outdoor pool down the road from the College (open during summer only).&#xA;From September to April, Must arrive after 5pm and leave by 7:30am so as not to interrupt with daytime college classes, they are pretty chill from May to August when school is out. Don’t park near the Seniors building (on opposite side of parking lot).&#xA;This place has a double entrance so a big rig could drive in one driveway and out the other easily.&#xA;There is a grass area (by the river path) if you are car or bike camping and want to put a tent up for a couple nights.&#xA;You may be able to pick up the free college public wifi too if you park closer to the building.&#xA;There is a large garbage bin and cardboard recycling bin. If you have a pet please pick up the poop!! &#xA;Please leave no trace so that the college continues to allow boondockers.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280511 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Informal Campsite</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#79d279</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
