 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="58.107531" lon="-122.718762">
  <ele>531.0764455772855</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Off Alaska Highway</name>
  <desc>Beautiful glen, about 1/4 mile off of the highway. Room for several big rigs and no signs. There are a couple of fire pits and signs of use. Traffic noise is minimal. Lots of mosquitoes.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280518 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
