 <wpt lat="67.175512" lon="-135.828874">
  <ele>793.3862176062539</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel area off Dempster with creek</name>
  <desc>Short road leading south off of the Dempster Hwy to a gravel and culvert staging area. Far enough from road to barely see a small portion and not to get dusted. Open enough for the breeze to keep mosquitos away (mostly).  Nice level spots and room for a couple big rigs. Small creek running by. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280520 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
