 <wpt lat="49.415106" lon="-53.876570">
  <ele>3.1271687150001526</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Banting municipal Park RV</name>
  <desc>Beautiful municipal campsite with several spaces with drinking water and electricity or without service. About forty sites mainly grassed. The ocean is on the edge and a beautiful little lake facing several sites. Showers and toilets are good and clean. There is a dump station. $35/nights + taxes with service and $30 with water.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280553 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
