 <wpt lat="66.163732" lon="-137.115194">
  <ele>630.5513916015625</ele>
  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Large, open lot</name>
  <desc>lots of room here.  not perfectly flat, but enough area to find or make your rig level.  most importantly - far enough from the road to keep SOME of the dust down.  site itself still has plenty of dust, but not nearly as bad as the road.  mosquitoes greeted us by the dozens, even though we have a high, territorial view with no water sources seen.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280583 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
