 <wpt lat="54.109514" lon="-104.643555">
  <ele>568.0535545349121</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Baldy Lake</name>
  <desc>An amazing little 12 site campground in Narrow Hills Provincial Park. Can be reserved and paid for online, but note that if you do FCFS or have to pay in person, you have to go to the park office which is several kms away at Upper Fishing Lake. Sites here are huge and quite private. Super quiet, awesome people, free firewood. There are other small campgrounds in the area as well as the main one at Upper Fishing Lake which has electricity and other services. $18/night - pit toilets, no power, no showers, no sani dump. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280604 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
