  <ele>506.20086669921875</ele>
  <time>2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Roadside pullout</name>
  <desc>Small pullout just next to a logging road. Easy 2wd access. Level enough for a couple tents - im solo and it worked fine. Good quick &amp; easy spot for a night. No fire pit, good phone signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-05-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280608 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
