  <time>2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Chip Lake Ravine Community Association </name>
  <desc>Beautiful campground right at the Chip Lake in the nature. All spots are with a fire pit and tables. Wood for free. No electricity nor water. Simple toilets. Very peaceful and quiet. Keep this place clean please. CAD 25 / night / spot. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-26 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280654 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
