 <wpt lat="50.685738" lon="-119.365146">
  <ele>562.9874245617539</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Fly hill FSR</name>
  <desc>Dirt pull out where snowmobilers meet in winter. The FSR was pretty gnarly for my 3” lifted RWD more so steep but a little bumpy too. So I turned around but I’m sure there are spots further up the dirt road if you’re game and nice views. Basic flat clearing only stayed for one night. Quiet a few trucks going past for a rip at all hours, must be a a local spot, made for a jumpy nights sleep. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280679 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
