 <wpt lat="49.066042" lon="-123.872987">
  <ele>0.9040744906607634</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>spot by the river</name>
  <desc>tried to get up to the 4x4 spots further up but the gate was closed so I happened upon this lovely spot. feels like a place people come to walk their dogs. nice little pool right in front with crystal clear water. definitely worth a visit, just keep it clean or I bet the dog walkers will petition for a gate or something - really funny sign on the way in telling the crack heads to bot dump stuff &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280688 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
