 <wpt lat="59.937983" lon="-136.776400">
  <ele>2681.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Epic View</name>
  <desc>(Gaia coordinates: 59.56279, -136.46584) Stunning view of the Tatshenshini Provincial Park across the road. This spot is just a few km from the US border, and it&#39;s just across the road from a large more established pull-out where you cannot camp. For this spot, look across the road from the aforementioned pull-out. You&#39;ll see another gravel area where you could pull off with a large hill right behind it. There is a dirt two-track path going up the hill. Take this up and take your first right. It&#39;s a nice, flat, hidden spot, and the view is insane. Road noise is nearly zero as it&#39;s fairly remote, and the border crossing closes at midnight. Room for multiple rigs, but definitely not getting anything RV sized up the hill. Enjoy!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280731 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
