  <ele>-1.0</ele>
  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sa Mor Overland</name>
  <desc>This is a great overland outlet run by Morgan. We found him very helpful and easy to deal with when we visited looking for equipment.  Has a good stock of roof tents,  tents and  accessories that you may need if overlanding. Also has great local knowledge of off-roading. Closed Sunday &amp; Monday. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280769 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
