  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shell gas station with dump station</name>
  <desc>This shell gas station has an area for RVs to fuel up and its attached to a dump and water station all in one place, so you can fuel up and dump/fill up your water tanks at the same time. Water is free but the dump station cap is locked so may need to pay or get has attendant to open.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280792 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
