  <name>Matsqui Village Park</name>
  <desc>There&#39;s a spigot on the wall of the picnic shelter.  Slept beside steam and school next door with legal parking signs that someone else posted.  Pulled next door to make coffee in the morning and discovered a nice clean restroom and potable water.  Pretty little park if you&#39;re traveling with little ones or a dog. Best for jerry cans, jugs, and personal drinking bottles... not a hose to fill your camper tank.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/280835 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
