 <wpt lat="45.912590" lon="-60.653550">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Castle Bay Beach</name>
  <desc>Lots of room to park on the beach and stay the night. A dozen or so campers holed up and one tent. No signage, decent cell service, no amenities. Very quiet and dark and rarely did anyone else drive by, only the sounds of the wind and waves all night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281059 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
