 <wpt lat="61.083492" lon="-138.535676">
  <ele>801.4314411273226</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lakeside View w/creek</name>
  <desc>Small ramp extends down about 500ft  from ALCAN into a spot near the riverside. You can still hear road noise and wind at night. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281081 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
