 <wpt lat="51.226409" lon="-120.266859">
  <ele>1167.338623046875</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gorman Lake Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Small free rec site on a small lake.  3 sites, right by the road.  nothing special, just a quiet spot to come fish.  road access is rocky and single lane for a bunch of it, 4x4 isn&#39;t needed, but would make most people feel better.  the mozzies were INSANE. no cell coverage.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281113 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
