  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet spot by fishery</name>
  <desc>Large spot. Easily fit 19&#39; van. Full cell reception. Quiet, local traffic only. Pull off beside entrance to fishery. View of ocean blocked by trees, but a path down to beach right beside parking. Spent a night, no one bothered us. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281127 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
