  <desc>Highway pullout with no amenities. Views are great. Room for several big rigs. Area is flat and there is road noise. Great for a night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281138 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
