  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Boat launch</name>
  <desc>This is a boat launch / rest stop. Large, sufficient space for a handful of RVs, flat. Some action from boaters early evening. Noise from highway but reducing overnight. Pit toilets and bearproof garbage disposal. Cellular network connectivity is good.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281205 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
