  <ele>671.1387521460559</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart</name>
  <desc>Worker at Walmart said overnight parking is no problem. Large paved parking Lot, that is very level and quiet. We spent the night in our 39 foot trailer here without any issues. only 1 other RV in the lot. Washrooms avail inside Walmart.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281297 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
