  <ele>-10.756988525390625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>grassy area - waterfront next to park</name>
  <desc>there is a little grassy area next to a park with enough room for 1-2 big rigs or a few small rigs. No prohibition signs. be careful if you head towards the beach there is a nesting area - keep your pets on leash :). there are 2 picnic tables and a balançoire. this is next to the road and there are houses around, keep it quiet :).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281402 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
