 <wpt lat="50.868390" lon="-120.227520">
  <ele>53.919118274588214</ele>
  <time>2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Dick Hart Memorial Park </name>
  <desc>Nice open clearing in the car park. Stayed two nights, whilst working on my van. Lots of disc golfers who were up for a chat during the day. Nice drop toilets and a base ball field further down. No water. Typical Kamloops terrain, dry, dusty and lots of sun/heat. Little road noise heading up to sunpeaks and one local on an atv but they were all harmless. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-01 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281420 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
