  <desc>parking lot for St Mathieu Centre, very remote, no services but looks pretty private and quiet and out of the way. Haven&#39;t asked for permission but no hassle. tried to add photos but app won&#39;t open my camera or allow to pick media from my files...sorry! big enough for many campers. Sign says reserved parking for St Mathieu Centre only but no one here.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281611 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
