  <desc>P4 Free Parking, Mont Tremblant ski resort, has lots of activities so visit their website before heading over. Might be busy or they might charge for parking.&#xA;Large Parking lot with proximity to nature trails &#xA;Lots of room for Class B campers and vehicles. Not a place for long stays. Please keep it clean. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281659 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
