 <wpt lat="49.716764" lon="-123.076750">
  <ele>236.1192932734266</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Big lot with fire pits down a gravel road</name>
  <desc>Large spot with 2 fire pits and a trail that leads down to a beautiful, secluded waterfall. Lots of dry wood to burn here, too. Down a dirt pull off that is quite bumpy. Definitely would not recommend driving down here with a trailer or rv. Suv or truck should make it down pretty easy. Large space, the trail down to the river is somewhat steep and not very clear, but it’s not too bad. Overall great spot, not super level, definitely at a slight angle but we aligned it with heads up and slept great. Not very many bugs at all when i was here. Got 2 bars ATT service. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281754 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
