  <ele>432.16375732421875</ele>
  <time>2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>old highway section</name>
  <desc>short driveway off the Alaska hwy (south bound west side) 9km south of Smith River crossing, leads to a huge open area with a few sand and gravel piles used for winter maintenance.  it is buffered off the highway with many trees. if you don&#39;t like the spot it has a very large turn around area without backing up. grassy areas suitable for tenting. no water or waste facilities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-04-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/281802 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
