  <desc>The signs says no camping, however, all the locals told us that it was fine for us to spend the night. We did, and no issues. This spot was recommended to us by the lady at the Algonquin park information center at east gate.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282156 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
