  <name>Lac Schwatka</name>
  <desc>A beautiful, peacefull place.&#xA;Great view on the lake &#xA;2 spots.&#xA;1 in the entry near the road and an another one more &#34;private&#34; at the end of the path&#xA;We spend a very good night there.&#xA;While we were there, there is no mosquitoes, good cellular reception &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282161 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
