  <ele>1037.5807655423926</ele>
  <time>2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>River crossing snowmobile</name>
  <desc>Great large gravel parking spot with an open sky for starlink. Seems to be a river crossing for snowmobile trails. Some traffic on the road. Also. it seems like locals have burned pallets here and left the nails, so park with caution. Stayed here 2 days. Great spot&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-28 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282166 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
