  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Quiet lakeside parking near the main road on Fogo</name>
  <desc>Large parking area on the side of the road that was built partially in the lake.  Really far from any houses.  A sign says « use at your risk » and there is a flotation buoy near the sign.  The water is probably deep near the parking.&#xA;&#xA;As the picture shows, the is room for maybe 5 small Rv’s or a few large RV’s&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-04 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282184 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
