 <wpt lat="47.029459" lon="-65.472337">
  <ele>8.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Miramichi Tourist Info</name>
  <desc>Miramichi Tourist Info. We parked here and had a BBQ dinner. The gal at the tourist info centre said it was ok to spend the night, she said lots of people do so. Flush toilets in the tourist centre. Superstore right across the street. Nice view of the bridge, which may be noisy at night....?&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282210 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
