 <wpt lat="46.258667" lon="-60.552197">
  <ele>-5.418670654296875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-25 12:17:41 UTC</time>
  <name>Waterfront and Museum Giant MacAskill</name>
  <desc>On the other of the road from the museum, a big gravel lot overlooking the Big Bras d&#39;Or. No sign forbidding overnight camping. Beside a secondary road. A little bit of traffic but it calms down at night. There is a spot behind the trees that gives total privacy.  Great sunset ! Great spot !&#xA;De l&#39;autre côté de la route, en face du musée, grand terrain de gravier avec vue sur l&#39;eau et le coucher de soleil. Un peu de circulation sur cette route secondaire mais ça se calme la nuit. Nous avons reculé derrière les arbres et nous étions hors de vue. &#xA;Beau coucher de soleil et beau spot !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-25 12:17:41 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282215 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
