 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.108658" lon="-121.919700">
  <ele>100.69999999999999</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Jinckerson Rd Chilliwack</name>
  <desc>Jinckerson Rd in Chilliwack, close to Jinckerson Park. We parked under the trees, not in front of a house. Just before the bus stop (we h1d one bus at 10 pm, but maybe it is because it is holiday). park with playground for children, picknick tables, restroom and drinking fountains. quiet street. perfect for our RV 24 feet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282220 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
