 <wpt lat="49.165210" lon="-115.071380">
  <ele>701.0399775667207</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camp Freedom</name>
  <desc>Come relax at Camp Freedom. Space offers up to 7 sites on 5 acres on private land, minutes away from beautiful pocket lakes, the famous Elk River and Lake Koocanusa. You will have direct access to trails ideal for dirt biking and mountain biking. On site you have access to trampoline, soccer net and lawn games. Owners live on site, very easy going and friendly &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282230 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
