 <wpt lat="49.284193" lon="-125.228757">
  <ele>36.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sproat Creek </name>
  <desc>Another pull off. This one can fit two vans/cars. Not for 5th wheelers as not big enough. We are in a 24&#39; RV and no problem. One fire pit and trees for shade. People have used this for a toilet! Disgusting behaviour. No mobile phone service. We did see one black bear in the area so they are around. Long road in and bumpy and dusty but for a late Friday afternoon we were just happy to find somewhere. Gets VERY busy on weekends.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282348 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
