 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.593400" lon="-119.536733">
  <ele>992.1</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Arawana, further out</name>
  <desc>Nice big open area further out on Arawana Forest Road. There’s a short dirt track off of the road to it. Wouldn’t be good for a trailer but high clearance isn’t necessary. There are two or three places where there have been campfires. There are several shotgun shell casings lying around from people target practicing. We saw no bears last night or this morning, nor heard or saw anyone else. 3 bars of LTE cell service, not sure phone company (I’m on a short term eSIM card).&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282375 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
