  <ele>-6.0</ele>
  <time>2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>old part of road along pei road 2</name>
  <desc>hidden from the road behind a row of three. Good for one vehicule dont try with an rv camper. not suitable for a tent.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282377 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
