  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking près de sentiers de randonnée</name>
  <desc>Parking no sign indicating that you cannot stay overnight.  Very quiet, out of sight&#xA;--&#xA;Parking pas de panneau indiquant qu&#39;on ne peut passer la nuit. Très tranquille, a l&#39;abri des regards&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282428 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
