 <wpt lat="59.284594" lon="-129.819881">
  <ele>1109.9079005979002</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cassiar, BC</name>
  <desc>Small clearing with 360 degree mountain view. Spot is large enough for easily 2-3 rigs of any size. Mosquitoes were plentiful (as they always are in this part of the world at this time of year). Lots of bear scat around, so take this into consideration. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282429 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
