  <ele>808.7789306640625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>river pulloff</name>
  <desc>great spot with pulloffs on both sides of river. Some decent fishing in the river. there is some highway noise.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282432 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
