  <ele>7.753064411692321</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Le Squatters spot</name>
  <desc>Beautiful place to camp for free among some locals that have their campers set up for the season amazing quiet beach &#xA;------&#xA;Salut c’est moi Guloo on the road &#xA;Les local dit que les squatteurs s’installe ici &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282493 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
