 <wpt lat="43.879399" lon="-78.881904">
  <ele>75.09344482421875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart parking lot</name>
  <desc>I asked customer service, and they said overnight is good at back of parking lot, not on the side street, but not too many consecutive nights. No squatters wanted.&#xA;&#xA;Asked about the neighborhood, and they said, as long as you lock your doors, all should be good. But they are not responsible. &#xA;&#xA;I asked if security would kick us out. they said no.&#xA;&#xA;They have a McDonald&#39;s inside the store.&#xA;Lowes across the street had a trailer camping out as well.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282495 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
