  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mistaken Point Interpretive centre</name>
  <desc>Interpretive center for Mistaken point.  Large parking lot no issues parking or across the road on a flat observation point or just down the road on the beach.  Tours are available but book in advance if you can. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282538 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
