  <ele>77.88792204923777</ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Husky House Restaurant Truck Stop</name>
  <desc>Restaurant/truck stop/gas. They have laundary here, and I think showers too. Suitable for big RVs, you can stay the night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Unknown&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Unknown&#xA;Showers: Unknown&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Unknown&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282549 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
