  <name>Morrissey Bridge</name>
  <desc>At the boat ramp on both sides of the street. At the actual ramp parking is not allowed but I guess it doesn’t matter at night. Short walk to the river beyond the bridge to the left&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282581 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
