 <wpt lat="51.587797" lon="-55.498494">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Stationnement de la trail</name>
  <desc>Parking of the trail. Space for 3 vehicles but close to the road. Very close to the cove in the Meadows and still quiet at night. Several hares nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282595 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
