 <wpt lat="65.110085" lon="-138.350328">
  <ele>848.5033951569349</ele>
  <time>2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Clearing in the trees</name>
  <desc>Nice small clearing in the trees beside the hwy. you can get back in far enough to not be seen from the road, or you can be in the larger area with a fire ring, but seen from the road only as people are passing the entrance. Enough room for 2-3 vans if you don’t mind being cozy.  It might be hard to turn around in something bigger than 25’, but I’m not that long, so I can’t say for sure. It’s fairly level with a gravel &amp; weeds surface. Definitely hwy noise, but the trees help with the noise &amp; pretty much eliminate the dust. Also, it’s REALLY windy today, &amp; this spot is nicely sheltered from the wind. No cell service. No services of any kind. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-03 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282599 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
   <osmand:amenity_subtype>user_defined_other_postcode</osmand:amenity_subtype>
   <osmand:amenity_type>user_defined_other</osmand:amenity_type>
  </extensions>
 </wpt>
 <wpt lat="49.272354" lon="-73.889524">
  <ele>385.41201400756836</ele>
  <time>2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Between Rivière Boisvert and Poisson Blanc</name>
  <desc>35 km south of Rivière Boisvert. 58 km north of Poisson Blanc. 3 kms off 167 hwy. &#xA;Probably a logging road that brings you out to an opening close to a river (Boisvert?). Very quiet. You go over a bridge and you are on a little island. There is a rock ring where you could build a fire. There were mosquitoes. Another car stopped close by. Quite flat and even for a trailer. You can pitch a tent by the river. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282601 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
