 <wpt lat="49.157656" lon="-68.187430">
  <ele>5.017836422659457</ele>
  <time>2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Plage Chouinard</name>
  <desc>Nice spot for one RV and a few parking spots a few metres away for a few cars or vans. Picnic tables. 2 public porta-potties close to the public parking. Nice view of the St. Lawrence Seaway. Bicycle parking to lock bicycles. Sandy Beach. No signs that forbid overnight parking. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-25 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282602 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
