  <desc>Very clean. Top and front load washers in a variety of sizes including very large. Reasonable prices.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282608 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
