 <wpt lat="50.786442" lon="-104.946707">
  <ele>484.27549110005907</ele>
  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Buena vista Beach </name>
  <desc>Several spaces in the parking lot or young people were until 10 p.m. There is access to a fixed toilet and sink as well as a small corner with tables.&#xA;&#xA;Very quiet place, more nature than staying in Regina but requires 40 km more to get there.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282610 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
