  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Esso with Laundromat and Car Wash</name>
  <desc>Esso gas station with a clean laundromat as well as a car wash. Laundry is $5 to wash, $0.25 for 4 minutes to dry. Clerk said $2 or $3 should be enough to dry - doing the wash now. Detergent and dryer sheets available for $1.10. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282694 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
