  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Parking Regina Beach </name>
  <desc>Small parking lot of about ten places a little above the beach where there is a large parking space where it is indicated that you cannot stay there at night.&#xA;&#xA;Here no problem to report, no signs, access to the beach 2 minutes away and toilets too.&#xA;&#xA;Another large parking lot is not far away and should be possible.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282715 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
