  <desc>Potable water.  The valve is near the spectator stands.  There is no threaded on the valve so you must use a adapter like « Water bandit » from camco.  Easily accessible.  Flat surface.  Better than the other valve in the volleyball field close by on IOverlander that is hard to reach.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282730 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
