 <wpt lat="48.838510" lon="-87.442100">
  <ele>189.4</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Mini falls</name>
  <desc>Spot down a lil dirt road. 4x4 cars suv can drive down with a round about at the end. There are spots past here that I believe people meant to put here. &#xA;&#xA;The turn is right before rainbow falls camp ground and shares a beach with it that’s separated by a lil creek. About 3 lil pull off spots. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282786 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
