  <name>Enclosure Campground </name>
  <desc>506-622-8638&#xA;Cell service&#xA;8 Enclosure Rd, Derby Junction, New Brunswick  E1V 5B2&#xA;enclosurecampground92@gmail.com&#xA;camping season runs May 1st  to October 14th &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Fast&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282816 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
