  <ele>794.1791270142421</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cottonwood RV Park</name>
  <desc>Apparently was closed for Covid but has reopened in a somewhat limited version. No hookups but plenty of pull through sites. Hot showers (cost extra) and proper toilets. Beautiful lakeside sites. The hosts are extremely friendly. No WiFi and cel service was sketchy at best. Cash only, pack out your trash.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282861 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
