  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Virginia River</name>
  <desc>Flat at the top. Walking trails all over. Right next to the river. &#xA;Great for a van or something self contained. Not allot of turn around space for a camper&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282865 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
