  <name>Rose Blanche rest area</name>
  <desc>A small parking lot at the entrance of Rose Blanche. View of the lighthouse when not foggy. 2 picnic tables and garbage cans. Right next to the road. Space for few cars. No cell signal. No « no overnight » sign. Quiet at night.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282897 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
