  <time>2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camp Freedom - TEXT 250-946-5395 for bookings</name>
  <desc>Come relax at Camp Freedom!! Space offers up to 7 sites available on 5 acres on private property minutes away from beautiful pocket lakes, the famous Elk River and Lake Koocanusa.&#xA;There is direct access to trails ideal for dirt biking and mountain biking.  Trampoline, soccer net and lawn games are all available to you during your stay. Owners lives on site, very easygoing and friendly&#xA;Text. 250-946-5395 for bookings&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-08 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Bucket&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282919 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
