 <wpt lat="44.074927" lon="-80.083642">
  <ele>429.8208780091722</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Splitrock Narrows Trail</name>
  <desc>Came here for a hike and ended up staying the evening. Small gravel parking lot at the start of the Splitrock trail. Sloped parking lot but flat at the bottom, a good size for car camping or vans. Trail is super nice, if you don&#39;t spend the night at least give the hike a go. Oh there looks to be a nice spot for tents too just as you enter the trail. And a porta potty ✌️&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282928 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
