  <ele>423.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>grassy campsite</name>
  <desc>short, not too rough, road down where Duncan river enters Duncan lake (depending on water level). nice. lots of space to camp big enough to turn around a rig.&#xA;early morning blackflies.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282931 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
