 <wpt lat="55.198341" lon="-118.792059">
  <ele>683.1539306640625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Top Gear Cycles</name>
  <desc>Motorcycle mechanics. These gals and guys are fantastic and totally understand the traveller thing. I rocked up needing a new front tire and an oil change. They had me on the stand right away. They have a good selection of tires to choose from. They have an excellent professional attitude and know their stuff. Check them out. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/282955 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
