 <wpt lat="51.698275" lon="-120.912184">
  <ele>1058.18603515625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Drewry Lake West Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>gorgeous free rec site.  roughly 5 sites, all with tables and fire pits.  good mixture of sun and shade with some lakeside sites.&#xA;last 10km of road in is quite rutted so not good access after a lot of rain.&#xA;the short access road down to the sites is very rocky and pretty steep, especially to the lakeside sites.  high clearance definitely required.&#xA;note that there are two roads quite close together that appear to go down to the site, the first one goes along the Lakeshore to cottages and there is almost no turnaround space.  the 2nd road with the rec site sign is the one you want.&#xA;this place is quite good but just be warned of the access issues and plan accordingly as there isn&#39;t a ton of space and it&#39;s a long drive out to be disappointed.&#xA;no cell coverage, but most of the road in has good connection.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283002 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
