  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Froggy308</name>
  <desc>We are on private property which is located along the Desert River. Please contact us by text only at 819 230-3740 to check availability. The cellular signal is weak and varies depending on the company, so it is impossible to access the internet if you do not have an amplifier. The land can accommodate a large motorhome or tent without problem.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;NO PETS.&#xA;&#xA;Quiet People, quiet place!&#xA;&#xA;Bienvenue a vous voyageurs de Christian et Gina&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283035 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
