  <ele>624.892343012616</ele>
  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wolf Lake Campground</name>
  <desc>Established campground with 40 plus sites. Pit toilets. Reservations can be made. Nice fishing lake catch and release only. Boat launch. 30 km of gravel road to get to lake but well maintained. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283058 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
