 <wpt lat="49.509585" lon="-119.293634">
  <ele>1424.3439802349126</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Idleback lake rec site</name>
  <desc>Big BC rec site next to a lake. Lots of spots that can accommodate bigger rigs. Lake is swimmable and fishing is permitted. Many pit toilets spread out across the site. Beautiful spot, very calm (during week days at least). Dirt road to here is smooth and well maintained, though the steep climb up from Penticton was tough on our short bus. Bring mosquito repellent! &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283060 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
