  <ele>17.8273275597021</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Holiday Haven Campground</name>
  <desc>Wonderfully established campground right in the water. Swimming pool, store, laundry and lots of activities. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: Yes&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283068 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
