 <wpt lat="45.675054" lon="-62.708029">
  <ele>5.7442856058478355</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Free Street parking by the boardwalk</name>
  <desc>We stayed there for a whole afternoon plus the night, directly in front of the boardwalk. It was during the annual music festival here in Pictou. People are super nice and there is no No Overnight parking sign. This is also a free parking spot all along the street. There is also a public bathroom with running water and outside water tap just outside of the toilets building down the street next to the music festival.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283129 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
