  <ele>340.63356328196824</ele>
  <time>2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lyons Lake Family Fishing</name>
  <desc>Gravel parking lot close to the lake. No „no“-signs. Not too far from the highway, thus some traffic noise. Trailhead for hiking. Picknick tables, pit toilet, waste baskets. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-10 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283144 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
