 <wpt lat="52.973334" lon="-118.956628">
  <ele>1020.9514691591557</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Close to lake</name>
  <desc>Don&#39;t know if it&#39;s legal to spend the night here, but if it is, it&#39;s a superb option, with very private access to lake, along the railway. Relatively protected from the highway noise, I don&#39;t know if trains use this line and with whic frequency, if they do, the railway noise would definitely be a major concern...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283162 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
