  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Centre magasinage Les Rivières (econofitness)</name>
  <desc>Large parking lot for all kind of vehicles. Very quiet place. Various fast-food (McDonald’s, Tim Horton’s, Starbuck, IGA, Maxi, etc.) groceries stores and the best is Econofitness Gym (with platine membership you have access 24/7 to showers and toilets. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283187 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
