  <time>2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Safeway D&#39;Arcy Crossing</name>
  <desc>Shopping complex parking lot. Stayed for one night in my Transit, obviously a conversion, parked between Safeway and Dollarama. New shopping complex, no parking lot signage about overnight parking so assume it&#39;s allowed. Try to find a flat spot. Lovely sunset to the west and quiet. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283213 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
