  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blaeberry River Falls</name>
  <desc>A few miles up the logging road past the Thompson Trail parking lot is this fantastic camping location. The first spot was big enough for our 29 foot Earthroamer, great river access.  at the third parking spot you come out to the top of the Thompson Falls Trail. No cell phone service. Need four-wheel-drive high clearance vehicles to get to the spots. ￼￼&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283280 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
