 <wpt lat="46.192231" lon="-59.941756">
  <ele>13.827807136811316</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cape Breton Miners Museum</name>
  <desc>This is a location I booked through Harvest Host, however when I was pursuing the museum website it actually welcomes campers, see this link: https://www.minersmuseum.com/contact/&#xA;&#xA;“Welcome to the Cape Breton Miners Museum! We invite all visitors to park and stay overnight. Please park at the back of the parking lot by the trees and ensure you clean up after yourselves.” &#xA;&#xA;Flat parking lot. Ocean view. Great museum, take a mine tour, and definitely see a Men of the Deep concert… amazing. Eat at the Miners Village Restaurant or a place in town, grocery stores in town as well. Cell service but weak at times (we have Bell). Bathroom in the museum but I assume no access after they close. Two other campers in the parking lot tonight.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283392 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
