  <ele>528.7485420396551</ele>
  <time>2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Murray Point Campground</name>
  <desc>Large, established campground with powered and non-powered sites, free showers, free firewood, lovely beach (no dog beach though), sani-dump, and lovely walking trail.  There is a reservation fee of $11.50 and you must pay the park fee to camp here. Sites vary; some are large, some smaller, some shaded and very private, while others are wide open. There is also a small grocery store and restaurant close by. &#xA;The North Murray Point Campground is a bit more private and quiet, but doesn’t have showers. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-11 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283412 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
