  <desc>This garage is specialized in heavy vehicles such as trucks. They have a special lift that is solid enough for big/heavy rigs.&#xA;&#xA;They&#39;re the only ones I found near Shawinigan who could replace my 24&#39; bus&#39; massive fuel tank.&#xA;&#xA;Their hourly rate is 100 CAD.&#xA;&#xA;*it&#39;s taken 5 weeks due to delays obtaining parts from the local Ford dealership but that&#39;s not their fault.&#xA;&#xA;I believe they can also come to you for some repairs.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283482 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
