  <desc>Wide paved pulloff a few kilometers outside the eastern entrance to Fundy Trail Parkway. Staff person at parkway said no one would bother us here. Surrounded by forest. Lightly traveled road. Space for several vehicles including big rigs. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-09 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283633 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
