 <wpt lat="50.159543" lon="-115.794643">
  <ele>902.2333829989657</ele>
  <time>2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Open spot off kootney forest government road</name>
  <desc>Little road off the forest road. Made it easily with my suburu. Spent a night on my way to golden. No signs saying no overnight parking. I didn’t go down very far so It’s a pretty open and exposed spot and people going down the logging road could see me really easily. But I’m sure something with some more clearance could continue down to some more hidden spots. Good service too! I’d recommend just looking at a map with the satellite layer on to find it easier&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-13 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283654 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
