  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Frederickton Boat Launch (The Point)</name>
  <desc>Overnight dry parking is available here. It is not a campsite but the there is a picnic table and space to put chairs. Please park in respect of the locals and their use of the boat launch. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283712 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
