  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravelled roadside parking opposite Goats on a Roof</name>
  <desc>Packed during the day but at night, this gravelled parking area only has one or two cars. No parking restriction signs of any kind. Not much traffic going past at night so it’s quiet. I arrived about 10:30pm, left at 7:30am. I was car camping, there would be space for RVs but the roadside is slightly sloped. &#xA;2 bars of LTE on Freedom. No facilities but I felt safe.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283727 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
