 <wpt lat="46.334383" lon="-79.332756">
  <ele>0.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Trout Lake</name>
  <desc>The square is located directly on the lake, is very quiet and is used to let the boats or water jets into the water for a jaunt. It is also used by locals for bathing, and dogs are allowed into the water.&#xA;&#xA;There is no prohibition sign to stay overnight. We stood here for 2 nights and no one said or did anything about it. The locals were very friendly.&#xA;&#xA;The square is not paved. The view of the lake is interrupted by high bushes.&#xA;&#xA;No disposal or disposal or the same. There is also a sign &#34;No Dumping.&#34; Please also keep in mind that many can still enjoy the place!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283736 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Wild Camping</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#00ff00</osmand:color>
