 <wpt lat="48.832290" lon="-124.033316">
  <ele>158.96826171875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>large pull out next to quiet road</name>
  <desc>I tried the river pull out below but it was full and the ground was too narrow and sloped nearby. But on Shore road just above it there&#39;s a large pull out. There are residences across the road high on a bluff with much overgrowth at the road so you&#39;re not visible to houses and there is very little traffic even on a beautiful summer Saturday. The pullout is huge and safe and provided a quiet night&#39;s sleep. Not for big RVs but okay for a quick sleep in a campervan.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283738 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
