  <ele>291.86053466796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Lower Gravel Pit </name>
  <desc>This place looks to be an old gravel pit. 2 established fire pits. 2 large areas for rv&#39;s, motorhomes, etc. this place is large enough for any size rig when there&#39;s no one here.   some larger stones but basically a gravel entrance. there&#39;s a bit of an incline into the lower bowl but it should be suitable for any vehicle towing a trailer or motorhome regardless of weather. there are alot of deer flies here currently July 14 2024. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283775 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
