 <wpt lat="46.772466" lon="-66.340951">
  <ele>271.093017578125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Hidden Patch</name>
  <desc>a small hidden patch following a very narrow unserviced street. not suitable for large RVs. No &#34;no parking &#34; signs, or any signs for that matter. Very secluded due to the nature of the highway. We spent the night here (a Saturday) and it was very quiet. The patch is tapped enough for a small RV or a mini-van but not bigger. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283808 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
