  <time>2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Walmart St. Catharines</name>
  <desc>Walmart parking lot. Staff said overnight parking is allowed. Not too noisy at night. Bathrooms available inside from 7am-10pm.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-07 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283812 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
