 <wpt lat="45.044410" lon="-66.807640">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blacks Harbour Ferry Terminal</name>
  <desc>At the ferry terminal there is a section for truck parking and a section for RVs. Easy to pull in, several spots available. We had called the terminal prior to arriving and they mentioned we could stay overnight.   It is also located right beside a beach that is loaded with beach glass and a hiking trail right next to that.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283833 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
