 <wpt lat="62.238534" lon="-133.352743">
  <ele>775.9097290039062</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Faro Aboretum Trail Head</name>
  <desc>Asked at visitor information where we could park our van and sleep for the night.  She said anywhere, then suggested this trailhead parking lot.  Large dirt area, has picnic table, pit toilets, large enough for a trailer.  Nice walk on the trail in the morning.  Very quiet.  Bear trash bins. 5 bars AT&amp;T&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283845 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
