 <wpt lat="48.762713" lon="-58.796964">
  <ele>19.79950076341629</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Pull-off before Blue Beach Village</name>
  <desc>Pull-off right next to the road before the Blue Beach Village. Space for one van, two if you are together because it’s got to be one behind the other. View of the ocean and mountains. We didn’t find an access to the shore. Noise from the road (ATV,Cars) but quiet at night except the frogs. Weak cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283863 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
