 <wpt lat="46.079122" lon="-60.818767">
  <ele>14.063899993896484</ele>
  <time>2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bras d’Or Lakes Campground</name>
  <desc>Nice established campground on the Trans Canada highway just outside of Baddeck, Nova Scotia. &#xA;&#xA;Fairly good amenities including full service, pool, showers, washroom, laundry, a little store and lake front.  Close to your neighbour for sure. &#xA;&#xA;Were advised when we arrived that their well water was deemed to have too many minerals/elements in it to consume but they didn’t supply any potable water for us, you had to purchase it.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-14 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Non-Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283911 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
