 <wpt lat="44.279785" lon="-66.325828">
  <ele>42.05971908569336</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 17:38:45 UTC</time>
  <name>Whale of a time . Camping and Cottages </name>
  <desc>Family run campground. Pet friendly. Beautiful views of Bay of Fundy . Sites are located on the water or water view. &#xA;Sites are not served , however there is drive up potable water hose and a sewer dump. &#xA;You can walk to a small grocery store, local crafts etc. We walked to the ferry to Brier Island.. approximately 1 km . Take the ferry and there is a liquor store and pub . &#xA;We really enjoyed our time and highly recommend. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 17:38:45 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283948 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
