 <wpt lat="50.757730" lon="-112.092090">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rosemary Municipal Campground</name>
  <desc>It&#39;s a small plot of land with about 10 RV spots, and I think a few tent spots along the side.  There are 2 bathrooms with codes for entry that had showers and seemed relatively clean.  The RV spot we got had 30 amp and water, but no sewer.  It was convenient for us on our way between Calgary and the Dinosaur Park.   There were 3 RV&#39;s which seemed permanent, and one other van pulled in beside us that night.  It seemed unmanned, and all of our arrangements were made online.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-06 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Yes&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283962 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
