 <wpt lat="48.543684" lon="-58.586583">
  <ele>18.79880439265787</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>School yard old basketball court</name>
  <desc>this spot is beside/behind an elementary school in Stephenville. It is a paved lot which used to be a basketball court, but it appears that it is no longer used. Not sure if there would be any more traffic during the school year or not. The beach is down below, you can hear the waves; other than that there was no noise at all. There is also a huge parking lot at a church next door to the school which I think would also be a good spot. &#xA;Sorry no photos, I can&#39;t  seem to figure out why I am unable to post photos in the app.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283982 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
