  <name>Danbrook Park</name>
  <desc>Parking lot next to small park and dog park. No signs prohibiting camping. Coffee, Restaurants and laundry facility nearby.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283984 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
