  <desc>An old abandoned highway works area that&#39;s perfectly level. Lots of space for any size rig. There&#39;s some road noise during the day but there&#39;s almost no traffic at night. Good gravel base. No garbage. No amenities.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/283995 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
