 <wpt lat="52.070919" lon="-106.813757">
  <ele>490.2928466796875</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bone Trail</name>
  <desc>Bone trail landmark. Circular drive through for rv or small trailer, flat, level. No signs of no camping. Nice open rural prairie setting. Some road noise from secondary road. Good for a night, dont stay too long, keep it clean.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284002 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
