 <wpt lat="60.005822" lon="-128.552593">
  <ele>667.1624046348738</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Watson Lake rest area</name>
  <desc>Decent overnight spot to snooze. On the road, but very quiet when traffic stops. Tractor trailers stop here, so no big rig issues. Clean bathrooms, not much for cell service. Lots of bears around, so heads up.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284011 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
