  <ele>1088.659423828125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Next to cell tower</name>
  <desc>Flat dirt area next to cell tower. No signs prohibiting camping. Quiet and dark, no one disturbed me.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284039 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
