 <wpt lat="49.726329" lon="-112.851544">
  <ele>816.0943603515625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Peenaquim Dog Park Parking Lot</name>
  <desc>Spent the night here on this quiet loop just outside of Lethbridge suburbs. A few other businesses along this road (like the softball complex) indicate no camping, but did not see a sign at this dog park lot. A few dog owners will start to arrive in the morning. Lethbridge city workers came to empty garbages around 11 am and did not say anything. Decent spot, decent scenery (some stars but lots of light pollution). The parking lot is long but not very wide, rigs bigger than 20 ft might be frowned upon for blocking access. No wifi but decent LTE. Keep it clean and respectful!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284132 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
