 <wpt lat="49.070597" lon="-106.528992">
  <ele>829.1793212890625</ele>
  <time>2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tap at Grasslands Nat. Park East Block</name>
  <desc>Water tap just inside the entrance to East Block of Grasslands National Park. If you are visiting any portion at all of the park, you should register for a day pass (6.50$ adult i believe?). I&#39;m sure if you are in a pickle and just really need water and get out, it wouldn&#39;t cause a problem...but who do I look like, the boss or something??&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2023-08-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284133 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
