 <wpt lat="48.013904" lon="-69.045466">
  <ele>123.1319506016687</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping Chanel Rousseau Site</name>
  <desc>This is a small campsite with EHU, 2 x Showers, 2 x Toilets and a dump station behind an art installation house made from cans. $35 CAD per night for our 7m motorhome with electric and water. All on grass pitches. Mid-July and we were the only campers here for 4 days. Absolute bliss.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Unknown&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284137 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
