  <ele>5.004302978515625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>road side oull out</name>
  <desc>Road side pull out with lots of space. Path down to river.&#xA;&#xA;Close to road so little no privacy and road noise. Sure beats $75 from the Campground down the road. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284140 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
