 <wpt lat="51.090776" lon="-68.359814">
  <ele>422.321337759062</ele>
  <time>2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Close to Highway</name>
  <desc>Close to Highway, but a few trees for some privacy.  Only 50 to 100 ft from road, so some noise, but not much traffic until about 6:00am.  Bugs not as bad as previous sites down the road to the south.  Firm sand and several level spots.  Next to small creek. No cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284141 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
