  <desc>Tap at the entrance of the free campground of Pelly Crossing &#xA;&#xA;There are two taps on both side of the little cabin of the free campground entrance.&#xA;You can fill up your tank and your jug. Just need a hose. &#xA;Easy, Instead to fill up on a spot camp and disturb the campers :) &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-16 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284150 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
