 <wpt lat="51.107180" lon="-114.041950">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Canadian Tire, store parking ground.</name>
  <desc>910 57th Avenue, northeast,  Calgary,  AB, Canada. This is Canadian Tire parking ground.  Calgary city hall allows overnight parking in Canadian Tire stores. This store is with Walmart in the same open mall. I asked the Walmart first,  they gave me city hall number to collect overnight parking restrictions. Then the city told me that Canadian Tire stores are allowed in Calgary.  City hall numis 403 333 8274.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Yes&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284211 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
