  <ele>291.0196533203125</ele>
  <time>2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Minden Offroad Park</name>
  <desc>Amazing place for all travelers. &#xA;Keeping in mind this is a OFFROAD PARK so there is trails in the back park so there always lots of cool rigs going buy.&#xA;The owners are amazing and the sites are accommodating for most if not all.&#xA;Bathrooms on site with showers ( very clean I might add)&#xA;pool on site as well with play ground.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-30 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: Unknown&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284228 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
