 <wpt lat="48.503236" lon="-64.219891">
  <ele>50.22978380508721</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Camping du Phare à Percé</name>
  <desc>Came here for 2 nights. The location is excellent, on a cliff and close to the town. &#xA;Lots of room for trailers and an excellent area just for tents. &#xA;The cost was about $60 per night, with 3 services. Not too much privacy at the site, I thought. &#xA;Laundry is good, clean but, could improve. They don’t have a coin vending machines. &#xA;Each load is $2. &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284241 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
