 <wpt lat="53.069034" lon="-66.459943">
  <ele>530.9730771615724</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sand &amp; Gravel Pit Overlooking Lake</name>
  <desc>This is an absolutely huge flat area which seems to be a pit that stills sees occasional use.  Locals come up with ATVs and run through some sections in the evening.  Good evening breeze keeps the hoards of flys and mosquitos away that seem to be almost everywhere during this time of year.  Great view of small lake, beautiful sunrises and sunsets.  Loons on the lake and moose tracks in the sand.&#xA;&#xA;No cell signal, very small road noise.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284262 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
