  <ele>113.9</ele>
  <time>2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shipwreck site</name>
  <desc>Small spot for a small pull behind or van. In front of the shipwreck. Busy during the day has a picnic table that has a fire ring. No signs say no parking or overnight stays &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Unknown&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284273 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
