  <ele>36.26757564849408</ele>
  <time>2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>by the antena </name>
  <desc>good for small vans, smooth gravel path leading to the Telecom antenna. dead end in front of the gate where you can park.&#xA;not much place to turn around so maybe stop by the dome thing below and walk up to look at the place. there&#39;s another spot by the side of the path there.&#xA;a bit noisy with the civilisation roar but somewhat secluded...&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-17 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284392 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
