  <desc>Rec site by blue lake. Very basic but does the job. &#xA;No water source other than the lake or a stream further up. The outhouse has been damaged due to the last bush fire. &#xA;Cute and quiet. Forest fire was just last year so looks a bit dramatic. &#xA;Phone service and 4g !&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284403 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
