  <name>Village of Boyle Millview Campground</name>
  <desc>Wide open space to legally camp with an RV or van.  There is no specific area for tents. 30 amp power, BBQ grills, outdoor toilets, gazebo, dumpster, and a great place for dogs. This is right in the village and 1 block away from a car/rv wash.  There is a potable water hookup, but you have to pay.  I have no idea how much, tho.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: No&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284507 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
