  <ele>751.8535527316853</ele>
  <time>2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Bridge Boat Dock</name>
  <desc>Just after the bridge at France’s Lake turn left toward campground. Then another quick left down a dirt road.  Informal boat dock and a large parking overnight area.  No, no camping signs.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-15 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284512 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
