  <desc>Grass field between a train track and the road.&#xA;Lots of place, grass is long so you might need to drive on it to flatten it a bit, but no so bad&#xA;&#xA;No train at night, a bit of traffic at night and a bit more in the morning. Earplug recommended &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-05 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284516 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
