  <desc>RV service centre with a shop selling common RV parts .  You can also store your vehicle here with seasonal and monthly rates.  We only used the service centre , which was quick and efficient and fixed the problem with our Dometic fridge. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284570 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
