 <wpt lat="49.060724" lon="-58.231205">
  <ele>29.075903920456767</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blow Me Down Brook Trailhead</name>
  <desc>Parking lot at the trailhead. No «no overnight» sign. Busy in daytime. Noise from the road but quiet at night.  Trail to the Blow me down Brook. The trail continue after the brook not well indicated if not at all. There are 3 faded signs and 2 orange ribbons. Be prepared to walk in the water. If you have maps.me you can follow the trail. It’s getting at a view point near an other brook. We tried the mountain but couldn’t make it to the top. Weak cell signal.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Unknown&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284707 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
