  <ele>56.0</ele>
  <time>2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Gravel road</name>
  <desc>Small gravel parking space on the road down to the old cemetery. A couple of locals confirmed we were ok to park. Very quiet with enough space for a single vehicle. The ground is level and the area somewhat sheltered from the wind that we experienced at the other nearby campspots. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-18 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284740 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
