  <ele>1448.1056383773685</ele>
  <time>2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>McLeod River Overlook</name>
  <desc>Great location for wild camping. Fire pits already in place. Several places to park or set up tents. It is a little bit rocky at the entrance, but doable for most vehicles. Great overlook for the McLeod River. There is a hiking trailhead on the other side of the road.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284762 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
