  <name>Bay View</name>
  <desc>Level parking for 1 large/ 2 small vehicle off of a very quiet dead end road. The spot overlooks the sea and bay below. There was a gabbage can next to it and portable toilet at the lighthouse 50m down the road. Beautiful spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-12 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284771 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
