  <ele>240.05202861166833</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Rte533 N of Mattawa </name>
  <desc>Large open area surrounded by trees. May have been an old hunting camp. Lots of space for multiple RVs. Some grass for tents. No cell service. No amenities and there are no signs prohibiting use or access. Off the beaten track kind of stop. It&#39;s a long tree lined road with nothing to see but trees. Found a couple more similar along the route.  Didn&#39;t stay, just checking in for future reference. Some garbage at back. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284792 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
