  <time>2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Yukon River View</name>
  <desc>Small gravel pull off at the Highway - but still quite as the traffic is very calm.&#xA;&#xA;Beautiful view on the Yukon River and the surrounding landscape. &#xA;Space for 2 cars/vans or 1 RV. &#xA;&#xA;Sadly some people dumped their trash here, otherwise a clean spot.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-06-27 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284828 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
