 <wpt lat="55.857000" lon="-120.396610">
  <ele></ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Farmington Fairways Golf and RV Resort</name>
  <desc>With over 60 total sites, we have something for everyone:  our property features 11 full service sites (30A power/water/sewer), 22 pull through sites (30A power/water),  and 26 dry camping sites in our beautiful, tree-lined campground.  We also have 3 large group camping areas, capable of handling anywhere from 5- 25 units, which makes this property ideal for large gatherings.  OPEN APRIL – OCTOBER annually.&#xA;Campground was ok, $40 for full service, $38 for w/e, $26 for dry camping. Only one bathroom with one toilet and 2 (free) showers, all in the same room, although you can use the clubhouse when it is open (8am - 8pm). Pit toilets in the dry camping area. Clean, right off the Alaska Highway, so some road noise. About 10  min north of Dawson Creek. I wouldn&#39;t stay here if I didn&#39;t play golf.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - At Sites&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Average&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284840 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
