  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Sawpit Bay</name>
  <desc>Beautiful lakeside spot with room for about 8 vehicles. Sites are separated from each other and quite private. Access is a dirt road directly across from the motel. It’s a 1bar cell area. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284879 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
