  <ele>159.17462158203125</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Alona Beach/Batchawana Bay</name>
  <desc>Amazing beach site. GPS coordinates for the turnoff: 46.9675373,-84.7497328 (across the street from the Sawpit Bay Motel &amp; Cabins). Flat area for RV, tents, or several Vans.  Walk down a small hill for sandy beach.  No facilities. Fair internet signal. Lots of local visitors enjoying the beach during the day. Only two vans overnight, and two tents on the beach.  Noise from road, but it&#39;s a small inconvenience for such a beautiful spot.  &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: Yes - Slow&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284899 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
