 <wpt lat="62.722861" lon="-136.699736">
  <ele>614.465913714841</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Tthe Ndu Lake</name>
  <desc>1-2 spots to park for the night next to a lake. There appears to be an area to launch a boat next to the first spot, take care not to block access to it for others. Fire pits, but no other amenities. Short dirt access road to the lake with enough room to turn a travel trailer around if needed. Starlink works from here, but there are some tree obstructions. Lots of bugs&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284920 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
