  <name>Mountain Views on Logging Road</name>
  <desc>Pullout further up the logging road from the other sites listed. PHENOMENAL mountain views.&#xA;&#xA;The site is a pullout off the road, no fire ring, could fit a couple larger rigs (if you feel comfortable bringing a big rig up the road, pretty narrow and winding). Decently level spot for our truck.&#xA;&#xA;3 bars of service with Bell, 2 bars Rogers.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284970 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
