  <name>Centennial Pool Complex</name>
  <desc>Simple push button showers. 4.00 or if senior its less.&#xA;Male side is group style with lockers in change area (Lockers not working at time of review)&#xA;&#xA;Female side is semi private with a curtain.&#xA;Both are limited only by how many times you push the button.&#xA;&#xA;I found the showers were hot enough and the place seemed clean enough.&#xA;&#xA;Easy check in and they take cash or cards.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-19 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/284971 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
