  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Blood Indian Park</name>
  <desc>Official campground, with or without services (self-registration: tent 20$, service 30 or 35$), see picture for more details. We arrived late and the campground was almost empty. Hot shower 1$ for 5 minutes, chemicals toilets at various places on the campground. Tent site are all around the lac with firepit and table (not very cler on the map but we asked people in the service section). Service sites have some trees, tent site do not. It was so quiet, nice spot for one night. No WiFi but Roger 4 bars &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: Yes - Not at Sites&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: Hot&#xA;Water: Potable&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;Sanitation dump station: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285087 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
  <type>Established Campground</type>
  <extensions>
   <osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon>
   <osmand:background>circle</osmand:background>
   <osmand:color>#339933</osmand:color>
