 <wpt lat="54.407287" lon="-110.202186">
  <ele>544.1795037174597</ele>
  <time>2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Cold Lake Walmart</name>
  <desc>Asked permission just to be sure and was told we are welcome to stay. Several other rigs were parked overnight. Can’t really speak to how quiet it was because I had multiple fans blowing all night to beat the heat. Typical Walmart parking lot - no trouble, no complaints. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: Yes&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Running Water&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285096 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
