  <ele>462.0682195723057</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Wild Camping near Kash River</name>
  <desc>A small unidentified turn off from highway 11 that lead to a large and flat patch of sand/gravel near the train track. I have seen no indication saying camping was forbiden nor any « no tresspassing » signs. Kash river is very close, it is possible to get water from it if you are equiped with a water filter.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285262 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
