  <ele>553.1546675593996</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Shakedown Recreation Site</name>
  <desc>Large gravel parking lot down a good FSR. space for many vans. Very quiet overnight. Car park used to access &#39;Shakedown&#39; climbing crag. Pit toilet. No cell reception. &#xA;&#xA;Take logging road for 250m, turn left over bridge then take the right branch after 350m. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285284 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
