  <ele>215.3902587890625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Crown Land</name>
  <desc>This is on crown land. There&#39;s 2 decent spots just off Little Salmon River road. It&#39;s a rocky gravel road but you could get here 2wd no problem. A bit of cell/data service. Enough room for several vehicles, however I was alone. Abundant with raspberry bushes. You can hear the highway but it&#39;s quiet at night. If you follow the road further down there are other spots you could stay that are probably quieter- check out google maps. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285292 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
