 <wpt lat="50.591627" lon="-122.094742">
  <ele>696.7</ele>
  <time>2024-07-22 00:13:20 UTC</time>
  <name>Pullout on River</name>
  <desc>Informal spot on river. Space for small campers and several tents. Uneven for rigs, level enough for tents. Access to river/riverfront. &#xA;Super gorgeous 😍 Not completely hidden from road, but since everyone is camping round here, I don&#39;t think it matters. River drowns out most road noise and road will be quiet at night.&#xA;No cell reception at all.&#xA;River water refreshingly and good for a splash around. Clear, up to you, if you&#39;re willing to drink it.&#xA;No mozzies, but peksy flies. They don&#39;t bite, just annoying 🙄 &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-22 00:13:20 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Natural Source&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: No&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285337 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
