  <desc>Nearly all of George Hills Way offers longer term street parking passes available at two kiosks (one in the middle of this stretch). Campers tend to the west end closer to Cow Bay Marina. $5 per day. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 18:44:27 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285352 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
