  <ele>1136.7066650390625</ele>
  <time>2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>river access tucked off the road </name>
  <desc>large gravel flat area off the bend not far from other overlander spot. this requires an incline to access but it&#39;s nothing crazy! our truck and camper made it easily! down here your tucked away from the road and have a little noise from the river. once down here there&#39;s room for a few cars/vans/campers. trailers may have an issue with the incline.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-20 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Unknown&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285357 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
