  <time>2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>White Lake</name>
  <desc>There are a few spots by this little lake, it&#39;s fairly open.  There are a couple of fire pits, so it&#39;s been used before. Very quiet road. No amenities. 1-2 bars if service. Not sure if the lake water is good to use for anything, we saw nearby lakes that were pretty alkaline or something.&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-24 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Unknown&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285379 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
