  <ele>15.139317362569273</ele>
  <time>2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC</time>
  <name>Oyster River Nature Park</name>
  <desc>This is the car park of Oyster River Nature Park. Quiet and easy access to the river. We camped here one night with no issues. There is bin, pit toilet. Not for tents, however you can stay in your van. The place is spacious with approximately 15 spots - it gets emptied at night. Would recommend. &#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-23 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: No&#xA;Toilets: Pit Toilets&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: No&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285380 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
