  <desc>so it&#39;s service road that has a massive spot to turn around once you hit the end. it&#39;s popular among the locals. great spot during the evening to set up camp. there&#39;s an actule campsite and few look out points to the river if you turn left at the T instead of right. there&#39;s a train trestles over looking the north sask walking trails boat launch... okay canoe launch. it&#39;s free and the ppl that come out here are usually pretty awsome!&#xA;&#xA;Date verified: 2024-07-21 00:00:00 UTC&#xA;Open: Yes&#xA;Electricity: No&#xA;Wifi: No&#xA;Kitchen: No&#xA;Restaurant: No&#xA;Showers: No&#xA;Water: Yes&#xA;Toilets: No&#xA;Big rig friendly: Yes&#xA;Tent friendly: Yes&#xA;Pet friendly: Yes&#xA;&#xA;https://ioverlander.com/places/285410 (network required)&#xA;</desc>
